best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">more details</a></li></ul>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":8},{\"age\":9},{\"age\":9},{\"age\":10},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul><li>Return Flight Ticket Ex –&nbsp;Ranchi</li><li>Cost based on&nbsp;Minimum full paying 08 adults and 06CHD travelling. (05 DBL rooms)</li><li>&nbsp;Accommodation on Double / Twin Sharing Basis</li><li>&nbsp;Meal (Breakfast &amp; Dinner) Serve in Hotel as per hotel fix menu basis. (No En Route meal)</li><li>&nbsp;Exclusive Vehicle for transfers &amp; sightseeing.&nbsp;<b>Vehicle will be available as per itinerary only.</b></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><b><u>VEHICLE USED:</u></b>&nbsp;</p><p>03 Nos. Xylo / Innova / Scorpio / similar as per itinerary not at disposal point to point basis (AC only provide at plane area when pick up from airport and AC will not operate&nbsp;in hill areas)</p><p>Supplement cost for Nathula pass 5500@/- approx. per vehicle net payable to us subject to availability of the permit, clear weather and good road condition. (Closed on Monday &amp; Tuesday)</p>', '<ul><li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li><li><p>Personal Expenses (Room Heater, Laundry, Telephone, Tips, Mineral water, Soft drinks, Hard drinks, Extra Rafting, Cable car Raid, Boating &amp; Toy Train, Rope Way Tickets, etc.)</p></li><li><p>Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in Above itinerary.</p></li><li><p>Camera Fees, Guide &amp; Entree Fees.</p></li><li><p>&nbsp;<b>Nathula Pass, Zero Point, Rope Way Tickets.</b></p></li><li><p><strong>If any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances, etc. (to be borne by the client, which is directly payable on the spot).</strong></p></li><li><p>Any increase in fuel price, Taxes package cost will be increase, which may come into effect prior to departure.</p></li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Note&nbsp;:</strong></p><p>No room holding for this booking. The above said hotels will be confirmed as per the availability we will confirm similar category hotel if room is not available on same hotels. Buffet Meal Serve in Hotel as per hotel fixes Menu Basis.</p><p>Please carry 04 copy of passport size photograph; original photo ID card (Like Passport, Voter ID, Driving License Etc.) with 04 photocopies the entire passenger.</p><p>PAN Card Not Allowed, All Sightseeing depends on whether &amp; road condition.</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"256136\",\"land_cost\":\"124200\"},\"cost_price\":380336,\"selling_price\":425976.3200000000069849193096160888671875,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 48040.32\"}', 'MZQ/026/082018', 426800, 32500, 27800, '2018-08-31 13:04:43', '2018-08-31 13:29:28', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(30, 'Mr. Vivek Kumar x 04', NULL, '9771296215', 'vivekunion@gmail.com', 'KARNATAKA', '2018-10-16', 6, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782116\\/ywc9sdz3kaxmn4mlv8xb.jpg\",\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT BANGALORE\",\"date\":\"16-10-2018 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive and transfer to hotel, afternoon half day city tour of Bull Temple, Mysore Arts & Crafts Centre,Commercial Street, Lal Bagh. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782117\\/e2xajtv3swst8hplrnee.jpg\",\"caption\":\"BANGALORE TO OOTY (277 Kms Approx - 06 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"17-10-2018 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast, Checkout from the hotel and proceed to Ooty. The rest of the evening is at leisure.\\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782119\\/megqusz9vfeiqhnrvsf5.jpg\",\"caption\":\"OOTY\",\"date\":\"18-10-2018 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast, full day free for sightseeing at Ooty. visit Coonoor Tea Gardens, Lambs rock, Dolphin Nose at Coonoor and then proceed to Ooty. On arrival at proceed for sightseeing at Ooty. Visit Doddabetta, a highest point in Ooty. Botanical Gardens, Ooty lake, Rose Garden, etc and then return to hotel and overnight Stay at Hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782121\\/l5sykmpneyai1dmqrxy0.jpg\",\"caption\":\"OOTY TO MYSORE  (125 kms Approx - 03 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"19-10-2018 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast proceed to Mysore. In the afternoon visit Chamundi hills, the adobe of Godess Chamundeshwari, then visit Mysore Zoo, St. Philomenas Church, World famous Mysore Palace and evening visit Brindavan Gardens which is famous for musical Color Fountain, return to the hotel and overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782123\\/rt1apppr992joyuqgqgn.jpg\",\"caption\":\"MYSORE TO COORG (106 Kms Approx - 03 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"20-10-2018 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast, check out the hotel and drive to Coorg. Enroute, visit to Bylukuppe Tibettian Settlement (Golden Temple), a largest Tibetan settlement in India located near Kushalanagar in Kodagu district. The settlement set up in 1960 holds a several monasteries and temples of all major Vajrayana (Indo-Tibetan Buddhist) lineages. On arrival at Coorg, check in to the hotel. Enjoy the rest of the day at Leisure.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782125\\/yvmeox0e87mwsmtlekga.jpg\",\"caption\":\"COORG TO BANGALORE (267 Kms Approx - 06 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"21-10-2018 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast, Checkout from the hotel and proceed to Bangalore. The rest of the evening is at leisure.\\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":\"http:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/multizonetravels-com\\/image\\/upload\\/v1535782127\\/xdm3cecpuoibtwireyeb.jpg\",\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM BANGALORE\",\"date\":\"22-10-2018 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast, Checkout from the hotel and visit Vidhana Soudha than proceed to airport for your return journey to Ranchi.\"}]', '[{\"id\":0,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"1622\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Oct 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Oct 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":19800},{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"106\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Oct 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Oct 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 PM\",\"fare\":26840