 traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[]', '<ul><li>Return Economy Class Airfare <strong>Ex –&nbsp;Ranchi.</strong></li><li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair and Havelock with breakfast and all taxes on 1 Double sharing basis, 01 child with an extra mattress.</li><li>Meet and greet service at airport.</li><li>All sightseeing by 1 Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li><li>All side Ferry Tickets Included 2 Side Cruise to havelock.</li><li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li><li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges.</li><li>Breakfast at respective hotels.</li><li>Parking charges.</li><li>Travel assistance by Experience Andamans Travel Experts in all the islands.</li></ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li><li>Other meals not mentioned laundry, telephone calls, and incidentals.</li><li>Any personal expenses. Room service and special orders. Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages.</li><li>Camera Tickets are NOT INCLUDED in the mentioned cost of Sightseeing &amp; Transfers.</li><li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from suggested tour itinerary.</li><li>Lunch and dinner not included.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":66459,\"hotel_cost\":5000,\"land_cost\":\"80355\"},\"cost_price\":151814,\"selling_price\":174586.10000000000582076609134674072265625,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22772.1\"}', 'MZQ/033/092018', 175500, 58500, 0, '2018-09-15 07:26:02', '2018-09-15 07:58:52', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
