ame shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[]', '<ul type=\"square\"><li>03 Nights Accomodation in Hotel&nbsp;Hilton Phuket Arcadia Resort &amp; Spa Phuket.</li><li>02&nbsp;Nights Accomodation in&nbsp;Ramada Dma Bangkok.</li><li>All Breakfast at Hotel.</li><li>Phi Phi Island By Big Boat with Lunch.</li><li>Phuket Fanta Sea Show.</li><li>Phuket City Tour.</li><li>Transfer HKT Airport----------Phuket Hotel Pvt.</li><li>Transfer Phuket Hotel---------HKT Airport Pvt.</li><li>Safari World with Marine Park with Lunch.</li><li>Chaophraya Cruise Dinner Bangkok</li><li>Transfer BKK Airport----------Bangkok Hotel Pvt.</li><li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel-------BKK Airport Pvt.</li><li>All Sightseeing’s Transfers on PVT basis.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"24\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"94260\",\"visa_cost\":null},\"cost_price\":94260,\"selling_price\":116882.39999999999417923390865325927734375,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22622.4\"}', 'MZQ/042/0102018', 110700, 36900, 0, '2018-10-29 17:58:45', '2019-05-06 14:30:21', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(46, 'MR SOOSMEET KUMAR BOSE', NULL, '9572547474', 'soosmeet.bose@gmail.com', 'VIETNAM', '2018-12-01', 6, 0, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI\",\"date\":\"01-12-2018 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival in Hanoi. We welcome you at the airport and transfer you to hotel. It\\u2019s your leisure time after check-in at the hotel.\\nOvernight at hotel in Hanoi.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALONG\",\"date\":\"02-12-2018 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Morning, enjoy breakfast at hotel. We leave Hanoi for Halong bay around 8.00am. Upon arrival in Halong, embark and have delicous lunch onboard. We cruise through thousand amazing islands and islets during the lunch. After lunch, take a refresh in your room before visiting Surprising Cave, kayaking, swimming\\u2026 Go back to the boat, get a drink and enjoy a sunset scenery in the bay.\\nOvernight on boat in Halong bay.[ B, L. D ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA\",\"date\":\"03-12-2018 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Early morning, join a Tai Chi session on the sundeck. Enjoy delicous breakfast onboard.\\nCruise back to the pier. Pass by Halong Pearl Farm. Relax and have lunch on boat and say goodbye to the crew. Back to Hanoi. Transfer to airport for flight to Ho Chi Minh.\\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh. [ B, L ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HO CHI MINH\",\"date\":\"04-12-2018 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Morning, enjoy breakfast at hotel. After that, take a city tour. Places to visit: The Re-Unification Palace, the Notre Dame Cathedral & the War Remnants Museum.\\nAfternoon, leave the city for Cu Chi. Explore the Cu Chi Tunnel.\\nReturn the city.\\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh.\\nOvernight on train back to Hanoi. [ B, L ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MEKONG DELTA\",\"date\":\"05-12-2018 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast at hotel, leave Ho Chi Minh for Ben Tre. Take a boat trip on Mekong river to a family business which epitomizes the idyllic rural lifestyle, walking through the fruit plantation village.\\nOvernight in Can Tho. [ B, L ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MEKONG DELTA\",\"date\":\"06-12-2018 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Around 6.30am, we pick you up to visit the Cai Rang floating market which is wholesale market of fruit and vegetable at its busiest at this time of the day. Keep cruising through the small channels system and visit a rice noodle making village. Experience the \\u201cMonkey Bridge\\u201d in the Delta.\\nBreak for lunch then return to Ho Chi Minh.\\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh. [ B, L ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HO CHI MINH\",\"date\":\"07-12-2018 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Enjoy breakfast at hotel.\\nSpend your leisure time in the city until we transfer you to the airport for departure flight. [ B ]\"}]', '[{\"id\":0,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"314\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 AM\",\"fare\":15032},{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"560\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"fare\":15442},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"557\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Dec 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Dec 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 PM\",\"fare\":28631},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"313\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Dec 2018\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Dec 2018\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case o