(50, 'Mr Pravin Kumar, Gaya', NULL, '7250808000', 'kumarpravin0105@gmail.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2019-03-12', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"12-03-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.\\n\\nLater proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"13-03-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Experience Andamans only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach.\\nExplore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"14-03-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Day at leisure.How, about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving and Sea Walk can be done on this day.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"date\":\"15-03-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset.\\n \\nNote: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.\\nFerry Timing from Havelock to Port Blair is around 10:00 AM.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"16-03-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"In the morning we return back board a ferry to Port Blair. Upon reaching our representative will attend you and will take you to the hotel for check-in. Evening Shopping Tour to purchase gifts for friends and family.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"17-03-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.\"}]', '[{\"id\":0,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"461\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"fare\":15723},{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"293\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"296\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"fare\":17619},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"231\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"07:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:35 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/03\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/03\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Velocity\\/ Western Park \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/03\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/03\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"RadhaKrishna Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/03\\/2019\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/03\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Deep Sea Resorts \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"16\\/03\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/03\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Tango Waves \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1}]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[]', '<ul><li>Flight Tickets <strong>Ex- Mumbai.</strong></li><li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair, Havelock and Neil with breakfast and all taxes on Double and triple sharing basis.</li><li>Meet and greet service at airport.</li><li>All sightseeing by Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li><li>All side Ferry Tickets Included 3 Side Cruise to Havelock and Neil.</li><li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li><li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges.</li><li>Breakfast at respective hotels.</li><li>Parking charges.</li><li>Travel assistance by Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;in all the islands.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Vehicle will not be at disposal in any of the islands.</li><li>Other meals not mentioned laundry, telephone calls, and incidentals.</li><li>Any personal expenses.Room service and special orders. Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages</li><li>Camera Tickets are NOT INCLUDED in the mentioned cost of Sightseeing &amp; Transfers.</li><li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from suggested tour itinerary.</li><li>Lunch and dinner not included.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":33342,\"land_cost\":\"38712\"},\"cost_price\":72054,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12969.72\",\"selling_price\":85023.72000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/047/0112018', 86400, 28800, 0, '2018-11-21 19:17:44', '2018-11-21 19:17:44', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(52, 'Ms. SWATI PANDEY', 'FRANKY', '7033626199', 'holidays@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2019-01-30', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"30-01-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.Post completion of this trip; we drop you back to your hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"31-01-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Experience Andamans only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"01-02-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Day at leisure.How, about relaxing in the lap of nature?Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving and Sea Walk can be done on this day.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"02-02-2019 Saturday\",