(54, 'DR UMA SHANKAR', 'MATSON PHARMA', '9835443554', 'pkjhaohc@gmail.com', 'GOA', '2018-12-27', 3, 2, 4, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"GOA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CALANGUTE TOWERS\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/12\\/2018\",\"rate\":\"45000\"}]', '<ul><li>Child&nbsp;below&nbsp;6&nbsp;years&nbsp;is&nbsp;complimentary&nbsp;to&nbsp;share&nbsp;parent’s&nbsp;room&nbsp;with&nbsp;no&nbsp;extra&nbsp;mattres</li><li>Child&nbsp;between&nbsp;6&nbsp;years&nbsp;to&nbsp;12&nbsp;years&nbsp;is&nbsp;chargeable&nbsp;@&nbsp;30%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;package&nbsp;and&nbsp;Extra&nbsp;adult@&nbsp;40%&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;package.</li><li>Early&nbsp;Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;before&nbsp;8&nbsp;am&nbsp;will&nbsp;attract&nbsp;a&nbsp;full&nbsp;charge&nbsp;of&nbsp;previous&nbsp;night.&nbsp;Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;between&nbsp;8&nbsp;am&nbsp;to&nbsp;1&nbsp;pm&nbsp;will&nbsp;attract&nbsp;a&nbsp;charge&nbsp;of&nbsp;1500/-&nbsp;on&nbsp;room&nbsp;only&nbsp;basis&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to availability.</li><li>Late&nbsp;check&nbsp;out&nbsp;between&nbsp;1&nbsp;pm&nbsp;to&nbsp;6&nbsp;pm&nbsp;will&nbsp;attract&nbsp;a&nbsp;charge&nbsp;of&nbsp;1500/-&nbsp;on&nbsp;room&nbsp;only basis&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability.&nbsp;Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;after&nbsp;6&nbsp;pm&nbsp;will&nbsp;attract&nbsp;a&nbsp;full&nbsp;day&nbsp;charge subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability.</li><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[{\"age\":2},{\"age\":4}]', '<ul><li>Goa Airport Pick-up &amp; drop.</li><li>Refreshing&nbsp;“Goan”&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;drink&nbsp;on&nbsp;arrival&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;Resort.</li><li>Well&nbsp;appointed&nbsp;air&nbsp;conditioned&nbsp;rooms&nbsp;with&nbsp;Television,&nbsp;Mini&nbsp;Bar,&nbsp;Electronic&nbsp;Room&nbsp;safe&nbsp;and</li><li>Hair&nbsp;dryer.</li><li>Usage&nbsp;of&nbsp;Free&nbsp;Wi-Fi&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;property.</li><li>Meals&nbsp;at&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;food&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;beverage&nbsp;outlet.</li><li>Buffet&nbsp;Break&nbsp;Fast&nbsp;and&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;in&nbsp;one&nbsp;of&nbsp;our&nbsp;Food&nbsp;and&nbsp;Beverage&nbsp;Outlets.</li><li>One&nbsp;full&nbsp;day&nbsp;Sightseeing&nbsp;covering&nbsp;Fort&nbsp;Aguada,&nbsp;Anjuna&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Vagator&nbsp;Beach&nbsp;in&nbsp; the&nbsp;morning&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Miramar&nbsp;Beach,&nbsp;Panjim&nbsp;shopping&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Old&nbsp;Goa&nbsp;Church&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;evening on sharing&nbsp;basis.</li><li>Happy&nbsp;Hours&nbsp;@&nbsp;Curry&nbsp;Leaf&nbsp;starting&nbsp;from&nbsp;16th&nbsp;Oct&nbsp;2018&nbsp;till&nbsp;31st&nbsp;March&nbsp;2019&nbsp;for&nbsp;2&nbsp;hours&nbsp;(06.00 pm&nbsp;to&nbsp;08.00&nbsp;pm.)&nbsp;with&nbsp;Unlimited&nbsp;House&nbsp;Brand&nbsp;Drinks&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;it&nbsp;will also&nbsp;be&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;on&nbsp;25th&nbsp;Dec 2018&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;31st&nbsp;Dec&nbsp;2018&nbsp;from&nbsp;08.00&nbsp;pm&nbsp;to&nbsp;10.00&nbsp;pm.</li><li>Packaged&nbsp;drinking&nbsp;water&nbsp;every&nbsp;day&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;room.</li><li>Bottle&nbsp;of&nbsp;Goan&nbsp;wine&nbsp;in&nbsp;your&nbsp;room&nbsp;on&nbsp;arrival.</li><li>Shuttle&nbsp;service&nbsp;to&nbsp;Calangute&nbsp;beach&nbsp;from&nbsp;9&nbsp;am&nbsp;to&nbsp;5&nbsp;pm.</li><li>Usage&nbsp;of&nbsp;Tea/Coffee&nbsp;maker&nbsp;machine&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;room&nbsp;replenished&nbsp;once&nbsp;a&nbsp;day.</li><li>Use&nbsp;of&nbsp;swimming&nbsp;pool&nbsp;with&nbsp;proper&nbsp;swimming&nbsp;costumes.</li><li>Check&nbsp;in&nbsp;time&nbsp;2.00&nbsp;pm&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Check&nbsp;out&nbsp;time&nbsp;11.00&nbsp;am.</li><li>All applicable&nbsp;taxes.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"30\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":45000},\"cost_price\":45000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13500\",\"selling_price\":58500}', 'MZQ/051/0122018', 57932, 14483, 0, '2018-12-07 11:17:10', '2019-05-06 14:30:25', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(55, 'MR BINOD KUMAR', NULL, '9431114831', 'kbinod205@gmail.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2018-12-25', 7, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KOLKATA\",\"date\":\"25-12-2018 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive Kolkata and check-in to hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR | CELLULAR JAIL LIGHT AND SOUND SHOW\",\"date\":\"26-12-2018 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Morning have breakfast and check-out and depart for Port Blair.\\n\\nArrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.\\n\\nLater proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR | BARATANG TRIP TO LIME STONE CAVE\",\"date\":\"27-12-2018 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Depart to Baratang Island by road through the dense tropical forest and Jarawa Tribal reserve in a convoy. Often you might see a member of the Jarawa Tribe while passing through the tribal reserve. At the end of this forest journey you would reach Baratang jetty. Launch service is available to cross the sea bay. Enjoy the breathtaking fiber boat ride through a fascinating Mangrove drive, which leads to the start point of the trek to Lime stone caves. Trek through dense forest to reach the Limestone Cave. Made up of the mineral calcite (calcium carbonate) the cave contains beautiful cave formation. Return back for overnight stay at respective hotel at Port Blair by the same route.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO NEIL ISLAND | LAKSHMANPUR BEACH AND BHARATPUR BEACH\",\"date\":\"28-12-2018 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset.\\n\\nNote: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.\\n\\nFerry Timing from Port Blair - Neil Island is around 11:15 AM.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND TO HAVELOCK | RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"29-12-2018 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry.  Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Multi Zone Travels only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.\\n\\nFerry Timing from Neil Island - Havelock  is around 01:00 PM.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK | ELEPHANT BEACH+SNORKELING TRIP\",\"date\":\"30-12-2018 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"In the morning hours proceed for a half day tour to visit ELEPHANTA BEACH for coral viewing by snorkeling.\\n\\nOvernight stay in Havelock Island.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO PORT BLAIR | DAY FREE FOR LEISURE & SHOPPING\",\"date\":\"31-12-2018 Monday\",\"todo\":\"In the morning we return back board a ferry to Port Blair. Upon reaching our representative will attend you and will take you to the hotel for check-in. \\nDay is free on own for Shopping.\\n\\nFerry Timing from Havelock - Port Blair  is around 09:15 AM.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"01-01-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories from this exotic destination, the Andaman Island.\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"KOLKATA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL O2 OXYGEN\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2018\",\"rate\":\"4954\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHOMPEN\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/12\\/2018\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"28\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOLIDAY INN BEACH RESORT\",\"room_type\":\"CRANE SEA VILLA\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/12\\/2018\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"OCEAN PEARL BEACH RESORT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE HUT\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/12\\/2018\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"31\\/12\\/2018\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHOMPEN\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/01\\/2019\"}]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[]', '<ul><li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair, Havelock and Neil with breakfast and all taxes on&nbsp; triple sharing basis.</li><li>Meet and greet services at airport.</li><li>All sightseeing by 1 Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li><li>All side Ferry Tickets Included 3 Side Cruise to Havelock and Neil.</li><li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li><li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges.</li><li>Breakfast at respective hotels.</li><li>Parking charges.</li><li>Travel assistance by Multi Zone Travels Experts in all the islands.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li><li>Other meals not mentioned laundry, telephone calls, and incidentals