rly check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[]', '<ul><li>Return Economy Class Flight Tickets <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>BALI INCLUSIONS:</strong></p><ul><li>03 Nights&nbsp;Accommodation in BALI&nbsp;at Hotel Park Regis&nbsp;with daily breakfast (Except on arrival day)</li><li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on PVT</li><li>Sunset dinner cruise with transfer on SIC</li><li>FD Kintamani Volcano View &amp; Ubud Village tour followed by Set menu dinner @ Indian Restaurant (Food +&nbsp; water) with transfer on PVT</li><li>Water sport activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with transfer on SIC</li><li>120 minutes spa treatment with transfer on SIC</li><li>English speaking guide assistance on tour</li><li>Entrance fee</li><li>Mineral water upon arrival and tour</li></ul><p><strong>KUALA LUMPUR INCLUSIONS:</strong></p><ul><li>03 Nights&nbsp;&nbsp;Accommodation in KUALA LUMPUR&nbsp;at Hotel Hilton Garden Inn with daily breakfast (Except on arrival day)</li><li>Full Day Sun Way Lagoon Theme Park on SIC Basis.</li><li>City Tour of Kuala Lumpur by night including KL Tower&nbsp;on SIC Basis.</li><li>Return airport transfer&nbsp;on PVT Basis.</li><li>Malaysia Visa Charges.</li></ul>', '<ul><li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li><li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":126568,\"land_cost\":\"98550\",\"visa_cost\":\"6000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"10000\"},\"cost_price\":241118,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24111.8\",\"selling_price\":265229.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/062/012019', 265200, 88400, 0, '2019-01-14 18:06:08', '2019-05-06 14:30:30', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(66, 'IHAT, Lucknow', 'Mr Biswajit Das', '7544006056', 'biswajit.das@ihat.in', 'GANGTOK', '2019-02-14', 4, 3, 34, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BAGDOGRA AIRPORT - GANGTOK (130 Kms \\/ 4.5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"14-02-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"On arrival at Bagdogra Airport, (IXB) (413 Ft \\/ 126 Mts) you will be met by our office Executive who will assist you to board your vehicle to Gangtok\\n(5412 Ft \\/ 1650 Mts,). \\nOver night at Hotel. [Dinner]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK\",\"date\":\"15-02-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Full day conference with amenities including Projector & AV System with 02 Nos. Codeless Mike,\\u00a0Flipchart \\/Whiteboard, writing pads, pens, candies & Mineral water with 02 times Tea \\/ Coffee with Cookies \\/ Snacks.\\nNo Vehicle Services.\\nOver night at Hotel. [ Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK\",\"date\":\"16-02-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Half day conference with amenities including Projector & AV System with 02 Nos. Codeless Mike,\\u00a0Flipchart \\/Whiteboard, writing pads, pens, candies & Mineral water with 02 times Tea \\/ Coffee with Cookies \\/ Snacks. \\nEvening Gala Dinner including 02 Veg & 02 Non-Veg Starters with DJ.\\nNo Vehicle Services.\\nOver night at Hotel. [ Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK \\u2013 TSHANGU LAKE AND BABA MANDIR EXCURSION\",\"date\":\"17-02-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast, in the morning, start for excursion to Tshangu Lake (12400 Ft \\/ 3780 Mts \\/ 43 Kms in 03 Hrs one way from Gangtok) & Baba Mandir (13100 Ft \\/ 3994 Mts \\/ 16 Kms in 01 Hrs one way from Tshangu Lake. Situated at a height of 12400 Ft \\/ 3780 Mts \\/ 43 Kms in 03 Hrs one way, with an average depth of 50 ft. The cool water of the Lake is perfectly attuned with the scenic beauty around. Back to Gangtok.\\nOver night at Hotel. [ Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner ]\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK - BAGDOGRA AIRPORT (130 Kms \\/ 4.5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"18-02-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast transfer to Bagdogra Airport  (IXB) (413 Ft \\/ 126 Mts, ) for your onward journey to Lucknow.\\nEn-route Lunch at Indian Restaurant.\\n[ Breakfast + Lunch ]\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Lucknow (LKO)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"634\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Feb 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Feb 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"197099\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"433\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Feb 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Feb 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6132\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Feb 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Feb 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"238465\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Lucknow (LKO)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"856\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Feb 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Feb 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/02\\/2019\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL LEMON TREE\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"18\\/02\\/2019\",\"rooms\":17},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/02\\/2019\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL LEMON TREE\",\"room_type\":\"SINGLE SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"18\\/02\\/2019\",\"rooms\":3}]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\">here</a></li></ul>', '[{\"age\":12},{\"age\":12},{\"age\":12}]', '<ul><li>Return Airfare to Bagdogra&nbsp;<b>Ex- Lucknow.</b></li><li>Accomodation on Twin Sharing&nbsp;<b>(17 Double Rooms) </b>&amp; Single Sharing <b>(03 Single Rooms).</b></li><li>Meet &amp; Greet upon arrival at Airport.</li><li>Welcome drink on arrival (nonalcoholic)</li><li>Accommodation in Superior/Deluxe&nbsp;rooms</li><li>Complimentary standard <strong>Wi-Fi</strong> in Bedrooms</li><li>Buffet 04 Breakfast, 04 Lunch &amp; 04 Dinner (<strong>Mix Veg &amp; Non-Veg Menu </strong>).</li><li><strong>01</strong> <strong>Gala Dinner</strong> including <strong>02 Veg</strong> &amp; <strong>02 Non-Veg </strong>Starters with <strong>DJ</strong>.&nbsp;</li><li><strong>One &amp; Half day Conference Hall</strong> with amenities including Projector &amp; AV System with 02 Nos. Codeless Mike,&nbsp;Flipchart /Whiteboard, writing pads, pens, candies &amp; Mineral water with 02 times Tea / Coffee with Cookies / Snacks.</li><li>02 bottles of packaged drinking water in the room.</li><li>Tea/ Coffee makers in the room.</li><li>Free Use of recreational facilities.</li><li><strong>01 Dedicated Tour Manager</strong> Ex- Bagdogra Airport for the entire <strong>05 Days</strong>.</li><li>All Transfer &amp; Sightseeing by&nbsp; <strong>07 Nos.&nbsp;</strong><b>AC Luxury Vehicle (Innova/Xylo/Similar)</b></li><li>All applicable Transfers &amp; Sightseeing by Specified vehicle which will&nbsp;<u>not be at disposal and will be exclusively used for the guest as per the itinerary only (on point to point basis). This vehicle will also change sector wise.</u></li></ul>', '<ul><li>Cost for supplementary service, optional Tours, Up-gradation Charges, Guide, Sightseeing entrance fees.</li><li>Cost for Airfare, Train fare, Insurance Premiums, Rafting Charges.</li><li>Cost for service provided on a personal request.</li><li>Cost for personal expenses such as laundry, bottled water, soft drinks, incidentals, porter charges, tips etc.</li><li>Difference in cost arising due to extra usage of vehicle, other than scheduled &amp; mentioned in the itinerary.</li><li>Difference in cost arising due to mishaps, political unrest, natural calamities like - landslides, road blockage, etc. In such case extra will have to be paid on the spot by the guest directly.</li><li><b>5% GST.</b></li></ul><p><b><u>SUPPLEMENT / ADDITIONAL CHARGES:</u></b></p><ul><li><b><i><u>Nathula Pass visit is an optional</u></i></b><i><u>&nbsp;tour</u></i>&nbsp;for which there will be a supplement cost of&nbsp;<b><i>INR 4500.00 + 05% GST</i></b>&nbsp;per vehicle including permit charges. Please note that Nathula Pass visit&nbsp;<u>(subjected to permit availability)</u>. For more details kindly refer the detailed itinerary given below.</li><li>Regional dance performance Charges: <strong>INR 25000 AI</strong> including all charges.</li></ul><p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p><ul><li>DJ Music will be allowed till <strong>10 pm only</strong>.</li><li>Food and liquor will be served till <strong>10:30 pm only</strong>.</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":435564,\"hotel_cost\":\"549600\",\"transport_cost\":\"79000\",\"land_cost\":\"140000\",\"visa_cost\":\"14000\"},\"cost_price\":1218164,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 158361.32\",\"selling_price\":1376525.32000000006519258022308349609375}', 'MZQ/063/012019', 1400000, 38000, 36000, '2019-01-19 13:21:23', '2019-01-19 14:00:20', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
