ion claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Tickets&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>02 NTS Accommodation at Hotel Aqueen Little India with daily breakfast at Hotel. (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>City Tour (Drive thru our Business District + Visit the icon of Singapore, the Merlion + Visit Thian Hock Keng temple, one of the oldest and most important Hokkien temples)</li>\n	<li>Sentosa&nbsp; (cable Car + Wings Of Time 8.40pm) (Cable Car + Wings Of Time (2nd Show))+&nbsp;Madame Tussauds + Images Of Singapore Live+&nbsp;Trickeye Museum.</li>\n	<li>Gardens By The Bay. (Cloud Forest + Flower Dome)</li>\n	<li>Universal Studios Singapore.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeing on SIC Basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Singapore Visa Charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel Insurance.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Cruise Inclusions :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;03 NTS&nbsp;Accommodation in Two twin beds that convert to Queen, private balcony, sitting area with sofa bed and private bathroom.</li>\n	<li>Ocean transportation per Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All Meals. (Breakfast+ Lunch+ Dinner)</li>\n	<li>24-hours Room Service.</li>\n	<li>Unlimited free access to almost all public areas on board the ship.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":54210,\"land_cost\":\"35510\",\"hotel_cost\":\"62028\",\"visa_cost\":\"8500\"},\"cost_price\":160248,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12819.84\",\"selling_price\":173067.83999999999650754034519195556640625,\"extra\":[]}', 'MZQ/066/012019', 181000, 90500, 0, '2019-01-28 10:54:12', '2019-05-09 18:23:15', 1, 1, NULL, 1, 0),
(71, 'MR ANIL KUMAR YADAV', NULL, '7992435986', NULL, 'DARJEELING & GANGTOK', '2019-04-14', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BAGDOGRA AIRPORT - DARJEELING (90 Kms \\/ 03 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"14-04-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"On arrival at IXB airport welcome to our representative & transfer to Darjeeling. Check-in to your hotel & rest of the day free at leisure. Night halt at Darjeeling.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DARJEELING\",\"date\":\"15-04-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Early Morning at 4.00 am visit Tiger hill (sunrise point over Mt. Khanchendzongna), on the way back visit Ghoom Monastery & Batasia Loop. After breakfast half day city tour covering Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (closed on Thursday) Tenzing Rock, Tea Garden (outer view), Pace Pagoda, Japanese Temple & Rope Way (Ticket Guest Own). Afternoon back to hotel & enjoy shopping in famous mall road by walk. \\nNight halt at Darjeeling.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DARJEELING - GANGTOK (115 Kms \\/ 04 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"16-04-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast drive to Gangtok. Check-in to your hotel. Afternoon visit Bonjhakri water Falls, Flower show, Handicraft Centre, Dro-Dul Chorten And Institute of Tibetology (Sunday Closed). Evening back to hotel & Rest of the day free at leisure.\\nNight halt at Gangtok.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK\",\"date\":\"17-04-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"This Morning start for a half day trip to Tsomgo lake (12400ft), which is only 32kms from Gangtok City, the lake is almost about 1Km long & 15 mtrs deep. The lake is considered sacred by the local people; further 12Kms visit the Baba Harvajan Singh Mandir (New). Afternoon back to the hotel.\\nNight halt at Gangtok.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GANGTOK - BAGDOGRA AIRPORT (125 Kms \\/ 04 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"18-04-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast Check out from hotel and transfer to  IXB airport for your onward journey. \\nHAPPY TOUR END~~~~\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"3219\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Apr 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Apr 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"fare\":4830},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"534\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Apr 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Apr 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":5088}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"STERLING KHUSH ALAYA RESORTS & HOTELS\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/04\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"TASHILING RESIDENCY HOTEL & SPA\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/04\\/2019\"}]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, 