(75, 'MR LALAN KR MALLICK', NULL, '6204154006', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2019-05-22', 6, 0, 9, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI TO SHIMLA  (342 Kms \\/ 07 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"22-05-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"On arrival at Delhi airport \\/ railway station and you will be met, assisted and drive to Shimla. Shimla also called \\nthe \\u201cQueen of Hill Stations\\\". It is one of the most popular and biggest hill stations surrounded by pine, deodar, oak and rhododendron forests. Arrive Shimla and check in at the hotel. \\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"23-05-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast proceed to sightseeing Shimla, visit KUFRI, India\'s one of the best holiday paradise Kufri in Shimla is beautifully tucked on an altitude of 2,622 meter. The place is a tourist hotspot for its awesome scenic and sports activities. Evening\\nfree to stroll in the famous shopping place of Shimla town \\u2013 \\u201cTHE MALL & THE RIDGE\\u201d This large open space in the heart of town presents excellent views of the mountain ranges. Shimla\'s landmarks - the neo- gothic structure of Christ Church and the \\nneo -Tudor library building - are worth seeing.\\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (246 Kms \\/ 07 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"24-05-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Today after early breakfast and check out from the hotel you will proceed towards to Manali. Enjoy on the way Sightseeing visit Sunder Nagar Lake, Mandi, Pandoh Dam,Hanogi Mata Temple & Kullu Shawal Factory .Take an optional rafting trip in river Beas at Kullu (subject to weather condition and on direct payment basis) On arrive in Manali check into the hotel. \\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI (SOLANG VALLEY SIGHTSEEING)\",\"date\":\"25-05-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after early breakfast proceed to Solang Valley which simply offers panoramic view of mountains rising far above the clouds & which are breathtaking. Visit most beautiful Solang Valley (Adventure Valley) where numbers of Adventure activities is\\nconducted. After full day sightseeing return back to hotel. \\nOvernight stay at hotel.\\n\\nNote: Rohtang Pass sight seen is subject to matter of NGT order & followed by Manali taxi Union policy & cost. Rohtang Pass not included in the package because The NGT in its order has restricted the number of vehicles passing through Rohtang Pass for tourism. Vehicle for Rohtang pass can be hired directly from Manali by own cost.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"26-05-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast at hotel start full day sightseeing of Manali which includes Hadimba Temple, Manu Temple, Tibetan Monastery, Club House and Van Vihar. Evening is free to explore the local market of Manali and you can also enjoy a nature walk on The\\nMall Road of Manali. Later return back to hotel. \\nOvernight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO DELHI  (531 Kms \\/ 11 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"27-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast check out from the hotel, you will proceed towards Delhi.\\nOn arrival check in to the hotel. \\nAnd overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI\",\"date\":\"28-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast check out from the hotel and depart for your return journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"NEW DELHI (NDLS)\",\"name\":\"GARIB RATH\",\"fno\":\"12877\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"10000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"NEW DELHI (NDLS)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"name\":\"GARIB RATH\",\"fno\":\"12878\",\"dep_date\":\"28 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"29 May 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"10000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HARI PALACE\",\"room_type\":\"CLASSIC ROOM + B\\/F\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/05\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"7441\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MEADOWS\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"27\\/05\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"19114\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DELHI\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE TRIPLE ROOM\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HARI PIORKO\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/05\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"7197\"}]', '<ul><li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restri