(81, 'Mr KRISHNA LAKRA', NULL, '8210394118', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2019-05-23', 6, 7, 15, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR || CELLULAR JAIL & LIGHT SHOW\",\"date\":\"23-05-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK || RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"24-05-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Multi Zone Travels only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK || ELEPHANTA BEACH\",\"date\":\"25-05-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"In the morning hours proceed for a half day tour to visit ELEPHANTA BEACH for coral viewing by snorkeling.\\nOvernight stay in Havelock Island.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK || DAY AT LEISURE\",\"date\":\"26-05-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Day at leisure. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO NEIL ISLAND || NEIL BEACHES\",\"date\":\"27-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset. Note: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL TO PORT BLAIR || ROSS ISLAND\",\"date\":\"28-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today after breakfast board ferry to Port Blair. Upon arrival at Port Blair Check-in to hotel. Afternoon proceed for Ross island Sound & Light Show. Once the administrative headquarters of the British and capital of these Islands, the island is now under the Indian Navy. It stands now as a ruin of the bygone days with the old structures almost in debris. There is a small museum named Smritika, it holds photographs and the other antiques of the Britishers relevant to these islands. The island is famous for friendly flocks of Deer and lush green walking trails.Return to the hotel. Overnight at the Hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR || DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"29-05-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.\"}]', '[{\"from\":\"RNC\",\"to\":\"HWH\",\"name\":\"KRIYA YOGA EXP\",\"fno\":\"18616\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 May 2019