perts in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>One session for snorkeling is complimentary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li>\n	<li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from suggested tour itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Lunch not included.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":273379,\"land_cost\":\"378998\"},\"cost_price\":652377,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 130475.4\",\"selling_price\":782852.400000000023283064365386962890625,\"profit_figure\":\"127623\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"19.00%\",\"extra\":[]}', 'MZQ/078/032019', 780010, 37394, 31300, '2019-03-27 13:29:29', '2019-05-24 19:14:46', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
