</li>\n	<li><b>02 Nights </b>accommodation on DBL sharing with CNB&nbsp;at 3* Hotel + Breakfast in<b> Melbourne.</b></li>\n	<li><b>03 Nights</b> accommodation on DBL sharing with CNB&nbsp;at 3*&nbsp;Hotel + Breakfast in<b> Gold Coast.</b></li>\n	<li>Sydney City tour.</li>\n	<li>Blue Mountains and&nbsp;Australian Wildlife.</li>\n	<li>Melbourne City tour.</li>\n	<li>Phillip Island - Penguins, Kangaroos &amp; Koalas.</li>\n	<li>Full Day Movie World.</li>\n	<li>Full Day Sea World.</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfers are on SIC basis in Sydney.</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfers are on SIC basis in Melbourne.</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfers are on SIC basis in Gold&nbsp;Coast.</li>\n	<li>Australia&nbsp;Visa Charges.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Note: <strong>Air Asia Flights is included with 20 Kgs Baggage Allowance Per Pax.</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":214082,\"land_cost\":\"153500\",\"visa_cost\":\"30000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":397582,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 47709.84\",\"selling_price\":445291.839999999967403709888458251953125}', 'MZQ/082/042019', 445500, 159000, 127500, '2019-04-11 19:26:28', '2019-04-12 11:08:29', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
