(86, 'Mr SALKHAN HEMBRAM', NULL, '9631046292', 'anantkho8400@gmail.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2019-04-18', 10, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"18-04-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Chandigarh then check-in to hotel.\\nOvernight at Chandigarh hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CHANDIGARH TO SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"19-04-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Early morning after breakfast check out from hotel then drive to Shimla en-route Kufri which is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri, after lunch sight seeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in(1830), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theatre- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. \\nOvernight at Shimla hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"20-04-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from Shimla hotel and transfer to Manali than visit places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. \\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"21-04-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley  and back to Hotel.\\n\\nOR\\n\\nExcursion to Rohtang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. (Closed on Tuesday)\\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\\n\\nNote: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"22-04-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Manali Local Sightseeing.\\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI  TO DHARAMSHALA (218 KMS 07 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"23-04-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from Manali hotel and transfer to Dharamshala en-route stopping at Baijnath known for its Shiva Temple and further at Palampur famous For Tea Garden. Dharamhsala is a hill-station lying on the spur of the Dhauladhar Mountains about 18 kms north-east of Kangra, It is known for its scenic beauty set amidst high pine and oak trees. Since 1960, when it became the temporary headquarters of His Holiness The Dalai Lama, Dharamshala has risen to international repute as \\u201cThe Little Lhasa in India\\u201d. \\nOvernight at Dharamshala hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DHARAMSHALA\",\"date\":\"24-04-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast visit Local sightseeing, including holiness Dalai lama residence at Mc Leodgunj, War memorial, Bhagsunath temple and \\nDal Lake. \\nOvernight at Dharamshala hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DHARAMSHALA  TO DALHOUSIE (121 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"25-04-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast checkout from hotel and drive to Dalhouise.\\nOvernight at Dalhousie hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DALHOUSIE\",\"date\":\"26-04-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast visit local sightseeing including Dalhousie includes visit to Panjipula, Subhash Baoli and excursion to Khajjiar 24 km fro Dalhousie surrounded by thick Deodar forest. Drive from Dalhousie to Khajjiar is awesome. \\nOvernight at Dalhousie hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DALHOUSIE TO AMRITSAR (198 KMS 05 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"27-04-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from hotel and drive to Amritsar and visit Waga Border.\\nOvernight at Amritsar hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM AMRITSAR\",\"date\":\"28-04-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from hotel then drop to Amritsar Airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PALMDALE\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL WOODRINA\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL A STAR REGENCY\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"23\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DHARAMSHALA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL BOBS N BARLEY\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DALHOUSIE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL S1\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2019\",\"city\":\"AMRITSAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GRAND HRIDEY\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/04\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>​​​​​<span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">Transportation by Innova for the entire tour.</span></span></span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&qu