(87, 'Mr ANAND KUMAR', NULL, '9304047149', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2019-05-20', 8, 0, 11, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI TO SHIMLA (342 KMS 07 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"20-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Pick up from Delhi Airport then drive to Shimla. Check-in and overnight at Shimla hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"21-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri which is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri, after lunch sight seeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in(1830), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theatre- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. \\nOvernight at Shimla hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"22-05-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from Shimla hotel and transfer to Manali  en-route take a hault at Pandoh Dam, Sundernagar Lake, Kullu.\\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"23-05-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. \\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"24-05-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley  and back to Hotel.\\n\\nOR\\n\\nExcursion to Rohtang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. (Closed on Tuesday)\\nOvernight at Manali hotel.\\n\\nNote: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"25-05-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from Manali hotel then drive to Chandigarh.\\nOvernight at Chandigarh hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CHANDIGARH TO DELHI (244 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"26-05-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from hotel in Chandigarh then visit : Rose Garden, Rock Garden, Sukhna Lake than drive back to Delhi. \\nOvernight at Delhi hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI - AGRA - DELHI (233 KMS 04 HOURS Approx) )\",\"date\":\"27-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Morning drive to Agra and visit Taj Mahal, Agra Fort. Later come back to Delhi.\\nOvernight at Delhi hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM DELHI\",\"date\":\"28-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from hotel in Delhi then visit Red Fort, Lotus Temple, India Gate then evening Drop Delhi Airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"20 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"20 May 2019\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"49687\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi(IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6097\",\"dep_date\":\"28 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"45155\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SNOW LOTUS\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SNOW PEAK RETREAT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"25\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL VELVET CLARK\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"26\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DELHI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL REGENT INTER CONTINENTAL\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/05\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>​​​​​Transportation by <b>A/C Tempo Traveler (12 Seater)&nbsp;</b> for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li><strong>05 Rooms</strong> on DBL Sharing and <strong>01</strong> Extra Bed.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Mentioned or similar hotels on as per the <strong>MAP</strong> Plan.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Guide Charges.</li>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass till snow point.</li>\n	<li>Any up gradation in Airline class or hotel room category.</li>\n	<li>Cost of Insurance.</li>\n	<li>Any extra expense such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any services or activity charges other than those included in the tour itinerary/ Holiday Package Offer.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>5% GST.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":94842,\"land_cost\":\"240870\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":335712,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 60428.16\",\"selling_price\":396140.160000000032596290111541748046875}', 'MZQ/084/042019', 397100, 36100, 0, '2019-04-16 16:11:32', '2019-04-16 18:21:25', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(88, 'Mr R N SAHAY', NULL, '9810571445', 'ratnesh.sahay@rediffmail.com', 'EUROPE', '2019-06-28', 14, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVE ZAGREB\",\"date\":\"28-06-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Zagreb \\u2013 capital and largest city of Croatia situated along the banks of the Sava River. On arrival you will be transferred to the hotel for check in. Evening is free on your own. \\nOvernight in Zagreb.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ZAGREB\",\"date\":\"29-06-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast proceed for Zagreb  Walking Tour and learn about its famous historical sights and monuments. Visit the unique Museum of Broken Relationships, continue to see the Stone gate, St. Mark\\u2019s church, Lotr\\u0161\\u010dak tower etc.\\nOvernight in Zagreb.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ZAGREB TO SPLIT BY COACH\",\"date\":\"30-06-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out and transfer to coach station to board your coach for Split. After arrival in Split day is on your own.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SPLIT\",\"date\":\"01-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"On your own.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SPLIT\",\"date\":\"02-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"On your own.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SPLIT TO PARIS BY FLIGHT\",\"date\":\"03-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Transfer to Split airport for your flight to Paris. Arrive Paris and transfer to your hotel. Evening is free on your own. \\nOver night stay in Paris.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PARIS\",\"date\":\"04-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Today discover the historical landmarks and admire the beautiful architecture of Paris on a Hop-On Hop-Off Tour. Later you have the option of visiting the Montparnasse Observatory to enjoy a fabulous view of the city, or you can choose to spend a memorable evening at the Lido by taking an optional tour. \\nOvernight stay  in Paris.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PARIS\",\"date\":\"05-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast proceed to visit Disneyland. \\nOver night stay in Paris.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PARIS TO VENICE BY FLIGHT\",\"date\":\"06-07-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out and transfer to airport for your flight to Venice. Arrive and transfer to your hotel. \\nOver night stay in Venice.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VENICE\",\"date\":\"07-07-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast  enjoy Gondola Ride,  stroll around Venice \\u2013 a city situated across 118 small islands that are separated by canals and linked by bridges. Later in the afternoon, visit the Islands of Murano, Burano & Torcello. The islands of Murano is known worldwide for exquisite glass work, Burano for lace and Torcello for Venice\\u2019s first cathedral. \\nOver night stay in Venice.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VENICE TO FLORENCE BY TRAIN\",\"date\":\"08-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Today board your train to Florence which is home to many masterpieces of Renaissance art and architecture. Later proceed to see many of the city\\u2019s most famous monuments on a Hop-On Hop- off Tour. \\nOvernight in Florence.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FLORENCE\",\"date\":\"09-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today enjoy a trip to Pisa, home of the famous Leaning Tower of Pisa. Enjoy a splendid excursion through the fertile and picturesque Tuscan countryside towards the historic university city of Pisa, famous for its architectural beauty. \\nOvernight in Florence.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FLORENCE TO ROME BY TRAIN\",\"date\":\"10-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out and take your train to Rome. Today enjoy one of the world\\u2019s most romantic and inspiring cities, known as \\u2018the eternal city\\u2019. Take a closer look at the city\\u2019s history, art and architecture on a Hop-On Hop-Off Tour. \\nOvernight in Rome.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":14,\"index\":13,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ROME\",\"date\":\"11-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Today proceed to visit the world renowned Vatican Museum including the Sistine Chapel. See \\u2018The Last Judgement\\u2019, painted on the altar by Michelangelo. Later visit the St. Peter\\u2019s Basilica, the world\\u2019s largest Cathedral. \\nOvernight in Rome.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":15,\"index\":14,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM ROME\",\"date\":\"12-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out and transfer to airport for your return flight for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"DOHA(DOH)\",\"name\":\"Qatar Airways\",\"fno\":\"579\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jun 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"04:55 AM\"},{\"id\":2,\"to\":\"ZAGREB(ZAG)\",\"from\":\"DOHA(DOH)\",\"name\":\"Qatar Airways\",\"fno\":\"217\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:10 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jun 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"SPLIT(SPU)\",\"to\":\"PARIS(CDG)\",\"name\":\"Easy Jet\",\"fno\":\"3848\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jul 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"05:30 PM\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"PARIS(CDG)\",\"to\":\"VENICE(VCE)\",\"name\":\"Air France\",\"fno\":\"1526\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jul 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"07:35 PM\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Rome(FCO)\",\"to\":\"DOHA(DOH)\",\"name\":\"Qatar Airways\",\"fno\":\"132\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jul 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 PM\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"DOHA(DOH)\",\"name\":\"Qatar Airways\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"fno\":\"570\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Jul 2019\",\"arv_time\":\"08:40 AM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"ZAGREB\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CENTRAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/06\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SPLIT\",\"hotel_name\":\"ON YOUR OWN\",\"room_type\":\"ON YOUR OWN\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"03\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PARIS\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL BELTA\\/ BEST WESTERN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"06\\/07\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"VENICE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL BISANZIO \\/ PRINCIPE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"08\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"FLORENCE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL STROZZO \\/ EMBASSY \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"10\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"ROME\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MONTECARLO \\/ GIOLLI NAZIONALE \\/  SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"12\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at 