</li>\n	<li>Visa Fee.</li>\n	<li>Travel Insurance.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tour start from a city center point, to &amp; from transfer from your hotel is not included.</li>\n	<li>Station - Hotel - Station transfer in Italy (It will be around 10-15 min walking distance).</li>\n	<li>Meals other than those specified (if any).</li>\n	<li>City tax if any.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<div><strong>Please Note:-&nbsp;</strong></div>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>No any services on hold the same will be subjected to availability at the time of actual booking.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Up on confirmation of this itinerary&nbsp; we will share the detail for other 2 person who will join the tour in Paris.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"304000\",\"visa_cost\":\"9000\",\"travel_insurance\":\"9000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":322000}', 'MZQ/085/042019', 504000, 252000, 0, '2019-04-22 13:37:20', '2019-04-22 17:08:20', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(89, 'Mr SUMAN', 'R N SAHAY', '7070092700', 'nksuman2@rediffmail.com', 'SINGAPORE & HONG KONG', '2019-06-07', 6, 0, 4, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo (30 Kgs)\",\"fno\":\"342\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\",\"fare\":41944},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo (30 Kgs)\",\"fno\":\"41\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"name\":\"Tiger Airways (20 Kgs)\",\"fno\":\"980\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"33492\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo (20 Kgs)\",\"fno\":\"1774\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":44188}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL BOSS \\/SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM + B\\/F\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"11\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"11\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HONG KONG\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL REGAL ORIENTAL \\/SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM + B\\/F\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Airfare as mentioned above.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>SINGAPORE :</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>04 Nights Accomodation at above mentioned hotel with breakfast.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Night Safari (Admission + Animal Show + Tram Ride)</li>\n	<li>City Tour (Drive thru our Business District + Visit the icon of Singapore, the Merlion)</li>\n	<li>Sentosa Sic (cable Car + Wings Of Time 8.40pm) (Cable Car + Wings Of Time (2nd Show))</li>\n	<li>4D Magix</li>\n	<li>Airport Transfers on PVT basis.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on SIC basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore Visa Charges.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2><strong>HONGKONG :</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>03 Nights Accomodation at above mentioned hotel with breakfast.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Night tour of Hong Kong with Victoria Peak, Sky Terrace, Maddame Tussad &amp; 1 way Star Ferry Ride.</li>\n	<li>Ocean Park tour with entrance ticket &amp; return transfer.</li>\n	<li>Disneyland tour with entrance ticket &amp; return transfer.</li>\n	<li>Transfers Hong Kong – (Airport-Hotel-Airport).</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers&nbsp;<b>on SIC Basis.</b></li>\n	<li><b>Online Pre- Arrival Registration.</b></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Note:- Additional Baggage Cost will be applicable as per below:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Singapore to Hong Kong for extra 10 Kgs <strong>Rs 1000 </strong>Per Pax will be charged extra.</li>\n	<li>Hong Kong to Bangalore for extra 10 Kgs <strong>Rs 5000</strong> Per Pax will be charged extra.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"27\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":119624,\"land_cost\":\"168710\",\"visa_cost\":\"8500\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remmitance Fee\",\"amount\":\"4000\"}],\"cost_price\":300834,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 81225.18\",\"selling_price\":382059.1799999999930150806903839111328125}', 'MZQ/086/042019', 380000, 95000, 0, '2019-04-22 14:37:52', '2019-06-21 20:34:45', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
(90, 'MR SHIVRAM KACHHAP', NULL, '9430330599', 'shivramkachhap087@gmail.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2019-05-15', 6, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"15-05-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. \\nOvernight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"16-05-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. \\nOvernight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"17-05-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple , Kullu Valley.\\nOvernight Stay in Manali\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"18-05-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. \\nOvernight Stay in Manali.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"19-05-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley.\\n                                                     OR\\nExcursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. \\nOvernight Stay in Manali.\\n(Closed on Tuesday)\\n\\nNote: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"20-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Checkout from Manali hotel and drive to Chandigarh.\\nOvernight Stay in Chandigarh.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"21-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_date\":\"15 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"15 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":41555},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"937\",\"dep_date\":\"15 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"15 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"376\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"21 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"fare\":26075},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"997\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"21 May 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SUKHSAGAR REGENCY \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MANALI GRAND \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"20\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PALMDALE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong> Ex- Ranchi</strong></li>\n	<li>Accomodation in mentioned hotel or Similar.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meals (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>Transportation by A/C Innova for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary</li>\n	<li>02 Rooms on DBL+01 CNB</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass. (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit)</li>\n	<li>Any extra expense such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"27\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":67630,\"land_cost\":\"76875\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":144505,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39016.35\",\"selling_price\":183521.35000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/087/052019', 175000, 37800, 23800, '2019-05-01 14:32:17', '2019-06-21 11:05:03', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
