(93, 'Mr Vikas Mishra', NULL, '9431148445', 'vikasmishra22@gmail.com', 'KASHMIR', '2019-06-14', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"14-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"Upon arrival, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel.Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which one of the most famous road in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.\\nOvernight stay in Hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR-SONMARG-SRINAGAR (96 KMS\\/ 3.30 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"15-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast leave with full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is at a distance of  96 Kms from Srinagar is also called as \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.\\n\\nDrive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR-PAHALGAM (85 kms \\/ 2.30 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"16-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam \\u201cValley of Shepherds\\u201d. On arrival check in Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings. a best place for Honeymoon Couple\\u2019s surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of the India. You can go for trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way. enjoy your full day in Pahalgam, One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also & is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.\\n\\nOvernight stay in Hotel\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PAHALGAM-GULMARG (140 KMS \\/ 3.30 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"17-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on your own).\\n\\nOvernight stay in Hotel\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GULMARG -SRINAGAR (56 KMS \\/ 2.00 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"18-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast, drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens\\nCheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d\\nShalimar \\u201cGarden of Love\\u201d\\nNishat Garden \\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d\\nShankaracharya Temple.\\nEnjoy 01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal Lake.\\nOn return visit a local Handicrafts Showroom for hand-knotted specialty silken carpets, shawls, jewelry ornaments.\\nOvernight stay in HouseBoat\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"19-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the Srinagar airport to board your scheduled flight for onward destination..\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"146\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"70000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"337\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2554\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6325\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ROYAL BATOO \\/HOTEL REGAL PALACE \\/  SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SPARROW \\/ HOTEL FOREST HILL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/06\\/2019\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GULMARG HOUSE \\/ HOTEL PINE PALACE \\/  SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOMS\",\"rooms\":5,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/06\\/2019\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"18\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"DELUXE HOUSE BOAT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE HOUSE BOAT\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/06\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":2},{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arr / Dep by Multi Zone Travels Representative.</li>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01 Dbl Room </strong>on MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Below 05 years Child is&nbsp;Complimentary.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Arrival &amp; Departure Srinagar Airport / Railway Station.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;01 Swift Desire Or Similar for transfers as per Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Day trip to Sonmarg.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;SS Mughal Gardens , Shankara Achariya Temple.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>The Optional Cost :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Cable&nbsp;Car(Gondola ride )in Gulmarg Ist Phase :Rs 850/-Per Person &amp; 2nd&nbsp;Phase 900/-Per Person</li>\n	<li>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari, betaab valley in Pahalgam&nbsp; Private Cab@2500/- for 06 Persons. and 100 rs per person for entrance.</li>\n	<li>Entry fees for any Garden 50- 100 Per Person (approx)</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included.</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival / Departure.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Expenses of personal Nature such as tips, laundry, telephone, table drinks, beverages etc.</li>\n	<li>Cable Car Ride (Gondola) in Gulmarg. Pony&nbsp;ride in Gulmarg / Pahalgam.</li>\n	<li>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari, betaab valley in Pahalgam &amp; Thajwas Glacier in Sonmarg as it &nbsp;&nbsp;is done by local taxi .</li>\n	<li>Services of a Guide, Entry tickets &amp; other Misc. Charges.</li>\n	<li>Any other services not in the programme.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":70000,\"land_cost\":\"37000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":107000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16050\",\"selling_price\":123050}', 'MZQ/090/052019', 122500, 41750, 19500, '2019-05-20 18:45:05', '2019-06-07 15:27:29', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(94, 'Mr SANTOSH', NULL, '7004169686', 'santoshrehla00@gmail.com', 'CHARDHAM YATRA', '2019-05-26', 10, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI-HARIDWAR (205 KMS \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"26-05-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival to Delhi pickup from Airport \\/ Railway Station proceeds to Haridwar. On arrival check in to hotel, later on visit Mansadevi \\u2013 Chandidevi temples by ropeway. Evening assemble at Har ki Pauri for Ganga \\/ Arti \\/ Darshan. After the visit over comeback to hotel, after dinner overnight stay in Haridwar.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HARIDWAR - BARKOT (180 KMS \\/ 08 HRS)\",\"date\":\"27-05-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Today after breakfast checkout from hotel and drive to Barkot, on the way visit Kempty Fall near Mussoorie (By Pass Only). Evening arrival to Barkot check in to hotel.\\nAfter dinner overnight stay in Barkot.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BARKOT - JANKI CHATTI - YAMUNOTRI - BARKOT  (40 KMS DRIVE \\/ 06 KMS TREKKING \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"28-05-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today early morning starts from Barkot to Janki Chatti to visit Yamunotri Temple (Breakfast Packed). On arrival to Janki Chatti the base point of Ymunotri, booked Pony & Palki from here. If you are fit enough you can do trekking also, quite a stiff trek. Arrival to Yamunotri visit the holy temple of Goddess Yamunotri (3120 m), present temple was built by Maharani of Jaipur Gularia Devi in 19th century. Natural hot water springs around the temple are main attraction for pilgrims. After the pooja \\/ darshan return journey to Barkot \\nOvernight stay in Barkot.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BARKOT - UTTARKASHI (100 KMS \\/ 05 HRS)\",\"date\":\"29-05-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Today after breakfast checkout from hotel proceed to Uttarkashi, on the way visit Prakateshwar - Mahadev temple \\/cave near Brhamkhal. On arrival to Uttarkashi (1158m) check in to hotel, in evening visit Kashi -Vishwanath Temple.\\nOvernight stay in Uttarkashi.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"UTTARKASHI - GANGOTRI - HARSIL - UTTARKASHI (200 KMS \\/ 11 HRS)\",\"date\":\"30-05-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Early Morning 5 am proceed to visit Gangotri Temple. Along with Bhagirathi River the journey of Gangotri becomes a wonderful journey. Beautiful valleys, small rivers, waterfalls local villages, worth to visit over here.  On arrival to Gangotri Temple (3050m) visit the holy temple of Goddess Ganga, pooja \\/ darshan.  The present temple of Gangotri was built in 18th century by Gurkha commander Amar Singh Thapa. After the visit comeback to Uttarkashi.\\nOvernight stay in Uttarkashi.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"UTTARKASHI - GUPTKASHI - SITAPUR (250 KMS \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"31-05-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Today after early morning breakfast check out from hotel and proceed to Sitapur. Evening arrival to Sitapur transfer to hotel, after dinner overnight stay in Sitapur.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SITAPUR - KEDARNATH - SITAPUR (12 KMS DRIVE \\/ 16 KMS TREKKING \\/ 12 HRS)\",\"date\":\"01-06-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Early morning 4:am drive to Sonprayag the reservation counter for booking Pony & Palki next 5 Kms  journey by local taxi to Gaurikund, Kedarnath trek starts from here (Pony & Palki services available from here only), best to do it otherwise trekking is not possible in same day. A very hard trekking rout for reaching Kedarnath temple. On arrival to Kedarnath (3585m) visit the ancient holy temple of Lord Shiva amongst the 12th Jyotirlings of Lord Shiva 11th is situated here. After the pooja \\/ darshan return journey to Sitapur overnight stay.\\n\\nFor Helicopter Visit: Early morning 5:am drive to helipad- Sitapur \\/ Guptkashi to board the helicopter for Kedarnath. On arrival to Kedarnath helipad walk able distance about 500m upto Kedarnath temple (3585m). Visit over hrere \\/ Pooja \\/ Abhishek \\/ Darshan. After the visit over return journey by helicopter to Sitapur \\/ Guptkashi helipad, pickup & transfer to hotel overnight stay\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SITAPUR - BADRINATH (250 KMS \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"02-06-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Today after early morning breakfast proceed to Badrinath, en route visit Narsingh Swami Temple at Joshimath.  In evening arrival to Badrinath (3400m), transfer to hotel next visit Badrinath Temple for evening Arti \\/ Darshan. After the visit over comeback to hotel, dinner overnight stay in Badrinath.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BADRINATH - JOSHIMATH - PIPALKOTI (85 KMS \\/ 04 HRS)\",\"date\":\"03-06-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Early morning 4 am today visit Badrinath Temple for Abhishek\\/ Alankar darshan.  The present holy temple of Badrinarayana was built by Adi Guru Shankaracharya during 7th century. The main idol of Lord Vishnu is built of black stone known as \\u201cSalegram\\u201d. Before the visit of main temple one must take a holy dip inside \\u201cTaptkund\\u201d a natural hot water spring situated outside Badrinath temple.  After the darshan also perform the pooja \\/ tarpan outside the temple near Brhamkapal.  After lunch checkout from hotel drive to Mana the last village of India on Tibet- Border visit over here. Later on proceed to Pipalkoti on the way visit Shankaracharaya Math at Joshimath.  In evening arrival to Pipalkoti (1260m) overnight stay in Pipalkoti hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"JOSHIMATH - PIPALKOTI - HARIDWAR (250 KMS \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"04-06-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast proceed to Haridwar, en route visit Rishikesh sightseeing including Laxman Jhula \\/ Ram Jhula \\/ Swarga- Ashram. In evening arrival to Haridwar check in to hotel overnight stay in Haridwar.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"-HARIDWAR-DELHI (205 KMS \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"05-06-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast leave Haridwar and proceed to Delhi, on arrival drop to Airport \\/ Railway Station \\/ Hotel.  Journey concludes with everlasting memories of Chardham\\u2026.!!!!\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HARIDWAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL KHANNA PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BARKOT\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ADITYA PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"UTTARKASHI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MANDAKINI \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"31\\/05\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SITAPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JPG PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"02\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BADRINATH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL DWARIKESH \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PIPALKOTI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ALKANANDA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"04\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HARIDWAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL KHANNA PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/06\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation as mention above.</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan as mentioned above <strong>MAP.</strong>(Breakfast+Dinner)</li>\n	<li>A/C Vehicle&nbsp;<strong>Swift Dzire.</strong></li>\n	<li>State Tax, Toll Tax, Driver DA, Parking.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing &amp; transfers as per itinerary only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Air Fare/Train fare.</li>\n	<li>Auto / Ropeway / Pony / Palki / Helicopter / Rafting / Bungee Jumping &amp; other not mention adventure activities.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fees &amp; Guide charges.</li>\n	<li>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, which is directly payable on the spot).</li>\n	<li>Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation &amp; land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Service Tax.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>Supplementary cost : Pay by Guest Directly</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Helicopter Charges For Kedarnath Visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 9500/-Per Pax&nbsp;&nbsp;Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Pony Cost For&nbsp;Yamunotri visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 2000/-Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Palki Cost For Yamunotri visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 5000/- Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Pony Cost For&nbsp;&nbsp;Kedarnath visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 4000/-Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Palki Cost For Kedarnath visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 8000/- Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Special Darshan Slip to Kedarnath Temple&nbsp;<b>@ 1500/-Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"85785\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":85785,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9436.35\",\"selling_price\":95221.35000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/091/052019', 95200, 47600, 0, '2019-05-24 13:32:06', '2019-05-24 13:46:05', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(95, 'Mr SHISHIR ROY', NULL, '7979043261', 'royipm@gmail.com', 'AMARNATH YATRA', '2019-07-07', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"JAMMU -PAHALGAM(240 KMS \\/ 07 HOURS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"07-07-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive Jammu upon arrival you will be meet our representative and drive to Pahalgam via patnitop banihal  . Pahalgam\\u201cValley of Shepherds\\u201d. On arrival check in in Hotel On arrival check in Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings. a best place for Honeymoon Couple\\u2019s surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of the India. You can go for trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way. \\n\\nOvernight stay in Hotel\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PAHALGAM - PANCHTARNI - AMARNATH CAVE\",\"date\":\"08-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"This morning, start your trek to Panchtarni from Sheshnag (3657 meters). The trek covers a+walk through Mahagunas Pass (3200 meters), and then gradually reaching to Panchtarni. On reaching Panchtarni, trek to Amarnath Cave which is located at a distance of 6 kilometers.After reaching, take a bath in Amarnath stream that flows outside the cave. The cave has an air of tranquility where the three massive Lingmas stand symbolizing Lord Shiva, Parvati and Ganesh. Later, start trekking back to Panchtarni. Have your dinner and stay overnight in your deluxe tents which come with complete bedding and hot water bottles.\\nOvernight stay in SELF.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PANCHTARNI - THE HOLY AMARNATH CAVE\",\"date\":\"09-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"The Holy Cave of Shri Amarnath is only 6 kms from Panchtarni. As there is no place to stay hence the pilgrims start in the  early hours of the morning after their stay at Panchtarni. On the way to The Holy Cave one comes  across  the Sangam of Amravati and Panchtarni. Some pilgrims take bath at Amravati near holy cave  to become pious before going for Darshan. Near the cave is found white soil known as Bhasam. It is the most beloved soil of Shiv ji . The pilgrims apply this Holy soil to their body and then go for Shivlingam Darshan. There are two smaller Shivlings one of Maa Parvati and other of Shri Ganesh. It may be noted that after having  early Darshan of the Shivlinga at Holy Cave one can return to Panchtarni well in time the same day . Some pilgrims camp at Panchtarni while others continue their journey and reach back Sheshnag by the same  evening.\\nOvernight stay in SELF.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PANCHTARNI - AMARNATH CAVE 06 KMS - BALTAL(4 HOURS TREK)\",\"date\":\"10-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Start after breakfast steep ascent towards Amarnath Holy Cave where you can see ICE LINGAM. This is the holy cave for Hindus & thousands of people visit the place during full Moon day. From Amarnath steep descend towards Baltal 3-4 hrs walk. Overnight in Tents.\\nOvernight stay in SELF.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BALTAL- SONMARG- SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"11-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"From Baltal it is 15 Kms drive to Sonamrg. Sonmarg (2690 Mtrs) which is the most beautiful spot of Kashmir valley. Sonmarg is known as Gateway of Ladakh. Continue drive to Srinagar which takes 3 Hrs from Sonmarg. \\nOvernight at Srinagar Houseboat.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"12-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast, drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens\\nCheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d, Shalimar \\u201cGarden of Love\\u201d, Nishat Garden \\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d, Shankaracharya Temple.\\nEnjoy 01 hour shikara ride in dal lake.\\nOn return visit a local Handicrafts Showroom for hand-knotted specialty silken carpets, shawls, jewelry ornaments.  \\nOvernight stay in Srinagar.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"13-07-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to  airport  to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL TAJ MAHAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PANCHTARNI\",\"hotel_name\":\"SELF\",\"room_type\":\"SELF\",\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/07\\/2019\",\"rooms\":2},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SONMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"SELF\",\"room_type\":\"SELF\",\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/07\\/2019\",\"rooms\":2},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"DELUXE HOUSE BOAT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE HOUSE\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"12\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HOLIDAY VILLA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early