al\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"background-size:initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b><u><span style=\"background:#d9ead3\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, serif\">The Optional Cost ;</span></span></u></b></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Cable&nbsp;Car(Gondola ride )in Gulmarg Ist Phase :<strong>Rs 850/-&nbsp;</strong>Per Person &amp; 2nd&nbsp;Phase <strong>900/-&nbsp;</strong>Per Person</li>\n	<li>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari,betaab valley in Pahalgam&nbsp; Private Cab@<strong>2500/-</strong> for 06 Persons.&nbsp;and <strong>100</strong> Rs per person for entrance.</li>\n	<li>Entry fees for any Garden Rs&nbsp;<strong>50- 100</strong> Per Person (approx)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Expenses of personal Nature such as tips, laundry, telephone, table drinks, beverages etc.</li>\n	<li>Cable Car Ride (Gondola) in Gulmarg. Pony&nbsp;ride in Gulmarg / Pahalgam.</li>\n	<li>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari, betaab valley in Pahalgam &amp; Thajwas Glacier in Sonmarg as it is done by local taxi .</li>\n	<li>Services of a Guide, Entry tickets &amp; other Misc. Charges</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"43\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":28000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12040\",\"selling_price\":40040}', 'MZQ/092/052019', 40000, 10000, 0, '2019-05-24 17:04:11', '2019-05-25 10:12:53', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(96, 'Mr TANVIR ANSARI', NULL, '8340255903', NULL, 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2019-06-08', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"08-06-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"09-06-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall.\\nOvernight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"10-06-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple , Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"11-06-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"12-06-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley. OR Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. Overnight Stay in Manali. (Closed on Tuesday)\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"13-06-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Checkout from the hotel in Manali and drive to Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.  Evening  visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rose Garden and Sukhna Lake is subject to time availability.\\nOvernight Stay in Chandigarh.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"14-06-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"983\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":32463},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"830\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"842\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":27462},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6097\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong>&nbsp;Ex- Ranchi</strong></li>\n	<li>Accomodation in mentioned hotel or Similar.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room </str