(97, 'Dr PRIYANKA JHA', 'MATSON PHARMA', '9835443554', NULL, 'THAILAND', '2019-06-23', 7, 1, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"77\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"84\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 AM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"IBIS PATTAYA\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"27\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"LE FENIX SUKHUMVIT\",\"room_type\":\"TWIN STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/06\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation