(98, 'MR DINDAYAL', NULL, '9431118668', 'dindayalranchi@gmail.com', 'Dodham Yatra', '2019-06-22', 7, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI-HARIDWAR (205 KMS \\/ 07 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"22-06-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival to Delhi pickup from Airport \\/ Railway station proceed to Haridwar, on arrival check in to hotel, later on visit Haridwar sightseeing, including Mansadevi - Chandidevi temples by ropeway, evening assemble at Har-ki-Pauri for Ganga Arti Darshan.  After the visit over comeback to hotel.\\nOvernight stay in Haridwar.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HARIDWAR - GUPTKASHI - SITAPUR(250 KMS \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"23-06-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Today after breakfast drive to Sitapur on the way visit Devprayag & Rudraprayag (by pass only).  At Guptakashi visit ancient Lord Shiva temple\\n pooja \\/ darshan, evening arrival to Sitapur transfer to hotel after dinner.\\nOvernight stay in Sitapur.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SITAPUR - GAURIKUND -  KEDARNATH (06 KMS DRIVE \\/ 16 KMS TREKKING \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After early morning breakfast checkout from hotel proceeds to Sonprayag the base point of Kedarnath journey.  Booked Pony & Palaki from Sonprayag, next drive to Gaurikund 5km journey by local jeeps. 16 kms trek leads from Gaurikund to Kedarnath along with Mandakini River. On arrival to Kedarnath check in to hotel, in evening visit the temple for Alankar- Darshan and Kedarnath ji Arati.  \\nOvernight stay in Kedarnath.\\n\\nFor Helicopter Visit:\\n\\nEarly morning 5:am drive to helipad- Sitapur \\/ Guptkashi to board the helicopter for Kedarnath. On arrival to Kedarnath helipad walk able distance about 500m up to Kedarnath temple (3585m). Check into hotel evening visit Kedarnath temple, Arti \\/ Darshan. After the visit overnight stay in Kedarnath. Next day after the visit of Kedarnath Temple return journey by helicopter to Sitapur \\/ Guptkashi helipad, pickup and transfer to hotel overnight stay.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KEDARNATH - GAURIKUND - SITAPUR  (06 KMS DRIVE \\/ 16 KMS TREKKING \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"25-06-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"Today 5: am early morning visit Kedarnath temple for pooja \\/ darshan \\/ avishaikh. After breakfast checkout from hotel trek down to Gaurikund.  On arrival to Gaurikund, drive to Sonprayag 5km drive pickup and transfer to hotel.\\nOvernight stay in Sitapur.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SITAPUR - BADRINATH (250 KMS \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"26-06-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"After early morning breakfast proceed to Badrinath on the way visit Narsingh Swami Temple at Joshimath.  Evening arrival to Badrinath check in to hotel, visit Badrinath Temple for evening arti \\/ darshan, after the visit comeback to hotel.\\nOvernight stay in Badrinath.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BADRINATH - MANA - JOSHIMATH - PIPALKOTI (90 KMS \\/ 05 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"27-06-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"Today early morning 4: am proceed to Badrinath Temple for Abhishek - Darshan of Badrinarayan. Before entering in to main temple one has to take holy deep inside the \\u201cTaptakunda\\u201d the natural hot water springs situated just front of the temple. Later on after the visit of temple time to perform the Pooja \\/ Tarpan at Brham-Kapal.  After lunch checkout from hotel drive to Mana the last village of India situated on Tibet Border visit Ganesh Gufa, Vyas Gufa, Sarswati River and Bhimpul. Later on proceed to Pipalkoti, on the way visit old Shankaracharya Math at Joshimath. Evening arrival to Pipalkoti transfer to hotel.\\nOvernight stay in Pipalkoti.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PIPALKOTI - HARIDWAR (250 KMS \\/ 09 HRS)\",\"date\":\"28-06-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After early morning breakfast drive to Haridwar, en route visit Rishikesh sightseeing including Laxman Jhula \\/ Ram Jhula Swargasharm \\/ Geetabhawan.  Evening arrival to Haridwar transfer to hotel.\\nOvernight stay in Haridwar.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HARIDWAR-DELHI (205 KMS \\/ 08 HRS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"29-06-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"Today morning after breakfast leave Haridwar drive to Delhi. On arrival drop to Airport \\/ Railway Station \\/ Hotel.  Journey concludes with happy memories\\u2026!!!!\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HARIDWAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL KHANNA PALACE \\/ SIMILA\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SITAPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JPG PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KEDARNATH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL BAHEL ASHARM \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"25\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SITAPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JPG PALACE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"26\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BADRINATH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL NANDADEVI \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"27\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PIPALKOTI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ALKANANDA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/06\\/2019\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"28\\/06\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HARIDWAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL KHANNA PALACE \\/ SIMILA\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/06\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation as mention above.</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan as mentioned above&nbsp;<strong>MAP.</strong>(Breakfast+Dinner)</li>\n	<li>A/C Vehicle,<strong> Innova</strong>.</li>\n	<li>State Tax, Toll Tax, Driver DA, Parking.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing &amp; transfers as per itinerary only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Air Fare/Train fare.</li>\n	<li>Auto / Ropeway / Pony / Palki / Helicopter / Rafting / Bungee Jumping &amp; other not mention adventure activities.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fees &amp; Guide charges.</li>\n	<li>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, which is directly payable on the spot).</li>\n	<li>Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to increase in cost on surface transportation &amp; land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Service Tax.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>Supplementary cost : Pay by Guest Directly</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Helicopter Charges For Kedarnath Visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 9500/-Per Pax&nbsp;&nbsp;Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Pony Cost For&nbsp;&nbsp;Kedarnath visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 4000/-Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Palki Cost For Kedarnath visit Both Side&nbsp;<b>@ 8000/- Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n	<li>Special Darshan Slip to Kedarnath Temple&nbsp;<b>@ 1500/-Per Pax Approx. Extra</b></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"160650\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":160650,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12852\",\"selling_price\":173502}', 'MZQ/095/062019', 173400, 28900, 0, '2019-06-06 16:09:13', '2019-06-06 16:31:21', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(99, 'Mr Vikas Mishra', NULL, '9431148445', 'vikasmishra22@gmail.com', 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2019-06-14', 6, 2, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"14-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"15-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall.\\nOvernight Stay in Shimla\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"16-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple , Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"17-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"18-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley. OR Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. Overnight Stay in Manali. (Closed on Tuesday)\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"19-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"Checkout from the hotel in Manali and drive to Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.  Evening  visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rose Garden and Sukhna Lake is subject to time availability.\\nOvernight Stay in Chandigarh.\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"20-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"60000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"937\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"842\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jun 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jun 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01: