>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"4\">\n			<p>Snowmobile ride, Sleigh ride to reindeer farm, meet Santa at Santa Claus Village and cross Arctic Circle with Lappish lunch</p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"4\" nowrap=\"nowrap\">\n			<p>Paris Panoramic tour + 2nd level of Eiffel tower, River seine cruise –CITY CENTRE PICK UP</p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"4\" nowrap=\"nowrap\">\n			<p>Disney tour with 2 parks and city centre pick up</p>\n			</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>* </strong>City/Tourist tax is extra and payable locally at the hotel by clients.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Kindly note:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Hotels, ferry and Train tickets are always subject to availability and confirmation at time of booking</li>\n	<li>No bookings have been made and rates are subjected to availability and confirmation at the time of booking.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":348111,\"land_cost\":\"646866\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":994977,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 159196.32\",\"selling_price\":1154173.32000000006519258022308349609375}', 'MZQ/097/062019', 1154400, 217800, 141600, '2019-06-11 10:52:18', '2019-06-11 10:57:39', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(101, 'Mr RISHA KERKETTA', NULL, '9334713774', 'sunil@multizonetravels.com', 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2019-06-24', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla.\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"25-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall.\\nOvernight Stay in Shimla.\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"26-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple , Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali.\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI LOCAL\",\"date\":\"27-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"28-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley and back to Hotel. Overnight Stay in Manali.\\n                                                     OR\\nExcursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point  (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment & Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. O\\/N Hotel  (Closed on Tuesday)\\n\\nNote: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"29-06-2019\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast Checkout from Manali hotel & drives to Chandigarh.\\nOvernight Stay in Chandigarh.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"30-06-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast checkout from hotel and drop at Airport for your onward journey.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"983\",\"dep_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"arv_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":29676},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"830\",\"dep_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"arv_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"dep_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"455\",\"dep_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"arv_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"dep_time\":\"07:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"fare\":31492},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"509\",\"dep_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"arv_date\":\"Invalid Date\",\"dep_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"Invalid Date\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SNOW LOTUS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"Invalid Date\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"Invalid Date\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ROHTANG HEIGHTS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"Invalid Date\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"Invalid Date\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL VELVET CLARK \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"Invalid Date\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong>&nbsp;Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accomodation in mentioned hotel or Similar.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms&nbsp;</strong>on Double Sharing<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li>Meals (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>Transportation by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Innova</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass. (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit)</li>\n	<li>Any extra expense such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":61168,\"land_cost\":\"75000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":136168,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 6896.4\",\"selling_price\":180408,\"profit_figure\":\"44240\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"32.00%\"}', 'MZQ/098/062019', 169680, 42420, 0, '2019-06-11 11:35:13', '2019-07-02 13:49:47', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
