(106, 'Dr AMAR KUMAR', NULL, '7979929708', 'dramarhazaribagh@gmail.com', 'DUBAI', '2019-10-06', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN DUBAI\",\"date\":\"06-10-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive Dubai and Transfer to Hotel. Overnight stay at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI || DUBAI CITY TOUR || BURJ KALIFA 124TH FLOOR\",\"date\":\"07-10-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast proceeds for <strong>Half Day City Tour<\\/strong> journey going back in time. A tour focusing on Dubai\\u2019s carefully preserved history and past heritage at its best! The tour highlights include the following: Photo stop outside one of the world\\u2019s most luxurious all-suite hotel \\u2013 Burj Al Arab, renowned for its superlative luxury! Drive down the stretch of Palm Jumeirah (no stops) &amp; drive around Dubai Marina (no stops). Proceed next to Dubai museum, housed in the Al Fahidi Fort. Small in size yet big in content \\u2013 a museum like no other! Opened as recently as 1971, it presents traditional way of Emirati life and many artifacts from discoveries as old as 3000 B.C. We then proceed past the Spice souk, once the center for allspice trading in the country! Finally, we reach the famous and most visited area- the Gold Souq, famous for its hundreds of Gold retail shops. Return to hotel Lunch at Hotel. Arrive at Dubai Mall and free time.&nbsp;View of Fountain show at Dubai Mall.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Visit Burj Khalifa<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We offer you a chance to join us on a trip to the viewing platform of the tallest building in the world - Burj Khalifa, located on the 124th floor. From the height of 650 meters, you will experience a fantastic view of Dubai, the World Islands, the Palm Islands, and even adjacent Emirates. Based on the vision by the architects of the entire complex, the super skyscraper is meant to become a gravitational point of the new Dubai downtown where the largest shopping mall in the world; Dubai Mall, office blocks, various private apartment buildings, and Souk Al Bahar; a shopping mall with an emphasize on tradition and culture items, i.e.: art and souvenirs. The inspiration behind the design of the building for Chicago based architect Adrian Smith was a desert flower. Depart from Dubai Mall and transfer to local Indian Restaurant Dinner at a local Indian Restaurant. Return to hotel &amp; Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST, LUNCH &amp; DINNER)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI || DESERT SAFARI\",\"date\":\"08-10-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast morning is free or you may take optional sightseeing as per your choice.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Depart for the Dune Dinner Safari.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Desert Safari<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Full of fun adventure and excitement where you experience the thrill of a roller coaster ride on the sand dunes. We stop on the highest sand dune to view the beautiful sunset for some breathtaking photographs and refresh your selves with mineral water. We then continue our journey to our Bedouin Campsite located in the heart of the Desert, where soft drink, water, tea or coffees are available for you to choose from. Camel rides wait for you. Trial of local smoking called Shisha or Hubbly Bubbly on different flavors. While you relax and recline in the tents or tables with carpet and pillows a delicious BBQ is being prepared under the starlit sky. Adding to the atmosphere of the night, an enchanting belly dancer shows a fascinating dance to a rhythm of an Arabic music, thereafter BBQ buffet dinner will be served.&nbsp;Return to hotel after the safari.&nbsp;Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST &amp; DINNER)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI TO ABU DHABI (139 KMS 02 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"09-10-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p><strong>Abu Dhabi City Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Abu Dhabi is the Federal capital and the largest among the seven members of the United Arab Emirates. It has a beautiful corniche and is a very well spread out city which has been growing steadily and has a clear future vision of its own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>During a half-day orientation tour, we try to explore the main attractions of city in a comprehensive way! In approximately an hour and a half out of Dubai, witnessing the magnificent desert landscapes en route, we reach Abu Dhabi. On arrival, we visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, which is one the world\\u2019s largest mosque with a capacity of approximate 40,000 worshippers and features 82 domes, over 1,000 columns, 24-carat gold gilded chandeliers and the world\'s largest hand-knotted carpet (IMP: Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque has strict dress code policy). The Tour also covers a drive via the charming and picturesque stretch of greenery and coastline called the Corniche, a photo stop outside the Emirates Palace Hotel and a drive through Yas Island.&nbsp;Lunch at a local Indian Restaurant.Arrive at Ferrari World Abu Dhabi and free time<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Ferrari World<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>The Ferrari World at Abu Dhabi features a host of rides and attractions to create an unforgettable experience for every member of the family. Guests of all ages experience every facet of the Ferrari story. Go behind the scenes, live the triumphs, feel the passion and surround yourself in the beauty of Italy. There is a world just for kids where the Ferrari magic comes to life. Junior Pilots get behind the wheel, learn to drive and cruise through mini streets in Ferrari cars just their size. Cruising in Dubai Creek + Dinner on board the Dhow.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dhow Dinner Cruise<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Experience the genuine Arabian hospitality, relaxing atmosphere, and traditional dhow trip \\u2013 try our nightly cruises onboard the biggest dhow. What could be more romantic than dinner on the cruise. Enjoy the soft breeze and gentle lapping waves as we glide gently pass through the illuminated mosques, palaces, Heritage Village that are reminiscent of the days gone by, and buildings that displays today\\u2019s modern architecture. A delightful &amp; diverse international buffet cuisine awaits the guests. Dinner is served with complimentary soft drinks and mineral water.&nbsp;Return to pier &amp; Transfer to hotel Arrive at Hotel &amp; Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST, LUNCH &amp; DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM DUBAI\",\"date\":\"10-10-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast check out (12 pm), free time for shopping at your own. At 06:00 pm transfer to the airport for your departure flight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"21\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"22\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"10\\/10\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"hotel_name\":\"GULF COURT HOTEL, BUSINESS BAY  \\/ SIMILAR\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>4*</strong> Hotel in Dubai.</li>\n	<li>Meals as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Half Day Dubai Guided City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Desert Safari tour with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance, Tanura Show.</li>\n	<li>Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner.</li>\n	<li>Burj Khalifa<strong> (124th Floor).</strong></li>\n	<li>Visit to Dubai Mall &amp; Fountain Show.</li>\n	<li>Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque with Ferrari World.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeings on PVT basis.</li>\n	<li>Tour Co-ordinator <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Visa fee &amp; OTB.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any increase in the Visa fees, Airfare / Taxes charged by the airlines on your air ticket.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee. <strong>(15 Dirham per room per night)</strong></li>\n	<li>Anything not specifically mentioned in the Package Tour Price includes box.</li>\n	<li>Cost of extension of the validity or deviation from the route of your air ticket.</li>\n	<li>Late checkout. (Normal check-out time is 12 PM)</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"0\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"62857\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":62857,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":62857}', 'MZQ/0103/062019', 172380, 62857, 46666, '2019-06-19 10:56:57', '2019-08-29 15:26:49', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(108, 'Mr AYUSH KUMAR x 04', NULL, '9304461139', 'abhayrichand323@gmail.com', 'BALI & KUALA LUMPUR', '2019-07-05', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BALI\",\"date\":\"05-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, Denpasar, Bali. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for your refreshment. Evening is free. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF-DAY WATER SPORTS ACTIVITY | 120 MINUTES SPA\",\"date\":\"06-07-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast at hotel, Proceed to Tanjung Benoa Beach for Water Sports (optional water sports include parasailing, jet ski, flying fish, snorkeling, sky tube, sea walker, etc ). Return back to the hotel and relax for some time. Rest of the day is free for you to explore on your own. After breakfast at the hotel and spend some time relaxing or exploring the nearby places on your own. In the evening, 120 minutes Spa. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY AT LEASURE\",\"date\":\"07-07-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Complete day at leisure on own.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY KINTAMANI + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR + DTUAKD ADVENTURE PARK\",\"date\":\"08-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for a full-day tour of Ubud and Kintamani. With the smoky Agung Volcano in the backdrop, Mount and Lake Batur will keep you mesmerized. Take a stop to watch the famous Barong and Keris dance performance (optional if selected) at Singapadu Village. Visit Celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarvings, Ubud the center of Balinese paintings, Goa Gajah (elephant cave) and the holy springs of Tirta Empul at Tampaksiring with Dtuakd Adventure Park. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BALI TO KUALA LUMPUR\",\"date\":\"09-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After a hearty breakfast, you are transferred in time to the airport to board your flight to Kuala Lumpur. Upon arrival at Kuala Lumpur Airport, meet and greet with our driver. You will be transferred to your hotel for check-in. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY SUN WAY LAGOON\",\"date\":\"10-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Enjoy the morning breakfast at the hotel. Then transfer to Sunway Lagoon. It is Malaysia\'s Premier Theme Park and has become the most visited tourist destination in the country. Sunway Lagoon is separated into 5 major themed lands - Water Park, Amusement Park, Wildlife Park, Extreme Park & Scream Park, each boasting their own exciting attractions. Find entertainment, adventure, and excitement all in place. Later in the evening, back to the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM KUALA LUMPUR  |  CITY TOUR KUALA LUMPUR\",\"date\":\"11-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from the hotel. You can keep your bags in the cloakroom and proceed for the city tour of Kuala Lumpur. This Tour offers you an insight into the old & new Kuala Lumpur Tower, one of the tallest in the world - 421m, here you can observe the awesome skyline of the KL city. After that, transfer to Twin Tower in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia was the world\'s tallest twin building in the world. Later transfer back to the hotel.spend some time shopping in Kuala Lumpur. Later you will be transferred to the airport to catch your flight back home.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"62\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"87560\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"376\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"178\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"24984\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"63\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"31717\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"JAMBULUWUK OCEANO SEMINYAK \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"09\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KUALA LUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL FURAMA BUKIT BINTANG \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"11\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata</strong> with <strong>25 Kgs</strong>&nbsp;Check-in Baggage each Pax.</li>\n	<li>All tours on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Airport pick up &amp; drop on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>BALI INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>120 minutes&nbsp;spa treatment&nbsp;<b>and&nbsp;</b>Water sport activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>FD Kintamani Volcano View &amp; Ubud Village tour with A+ Dtuakd Adventure Park Entry and Lunch (Indonesian Buffet) - Part Area, Swimming Pool and Waterfall access - with transfer on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>English speaking guide assistance on tour</li>\n	<li>Entrance fee</li>\n	<li>Mineral water upon arrival and tour</li>\n	<li>Govt taxes</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>KUALA LUMPUR INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights </strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in KUALA LUMPUR with daily breakfast (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Full Day Sun Way Lagoon Theme Park on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>City Tour of Kuala Lumpur by night including KL Tower on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>Malaysia Visa Charges.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":144261,\"land_cost\":\"71000\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"8000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":2000}],\"cost_price\":225261,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 47304.81\",\"selling_price\":272565.8099999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0105/062019', 311760, 77940, 0, '2019-06-24 13:44:49', '2019-07-16 11:44:54', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
