ing of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> accommodation in Pattaya with breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;accommodation in Bangkok with breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Alcazar Show.</li>\n	<li>Half Day Coral Island with Lunch.</li>\n	<li>Half Day Bangkok City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Full day Safari World &amp; Marine Park with Lunch.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC basis</strong>. (Seat in Coach)</li>\n	<li>Bangkok Airport to Pattaya Hotel transfer <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>Pattaya Hotel to Bangkok Hotel transfer <strong>PVT</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Bangkok Hotel to Bangkok Airport transfer<strong> PVT.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":27664,\"land_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":55664,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 8349.6\",\"selling_price\":64013.5999999999985448084771633148193359375}', 'MZQ/0107/062019', 64600, 32300, 0, '2019-06-27 13:14:38', '2019-06-27 13:15:28', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(111, 'FRIEND OF Mr SAMBHAV JAIN', NULL, '9709199111', 'abhayrichand323@gmail.com', 'BALI & KUALA LUMPUR', '2019-07-05', 6, 0, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BALI\",\"date\":\"05-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, Denpasar, Bali. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for your refreshment. Evening is free. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF-DAY WATER SPORTS ACTIVITY | 120 MINUTES SPA\",\"date\":\"06-07-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast at hotel, Proceed to Tanjung Benoa Beach for Water Sports (optional water sports include parasailing, jet ski, flying fish, snorkeling, sky tube, sea walker, etc ). Return back to the hotel and relax for some time. Rest of the day is free for you to explore on your own. After breakfast at the hotel and spend some time relaxing or exploring the nearby places on your own. In the evening, 120 minutes Spa. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY AT LEASURE\",\"date\":\"07-07-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"Complete day at leisure on own.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY KINTAMANI + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR + TUAKD ADVENTURE PARK\",\"date\":\"08-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for a full-day tour of Ubud and Kintamani. With the smoky Agung Volcano in the backdrop, Mount and Lake Batur will keep you mesmerized. Take a stop to watch the famous Barong and Keris dance performance (optional if selected) at Singapadu Village. Visit Celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarvings, Ubud the center of Balinese paintings, Goa Gajah (elephant cave) and the holy springs of Tirta Empul at Tampaksiring with Tuakd Adventure Park. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BALI TO KUALA LUMPUR\",\"date\":\"09-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After a hearty breakfast, you are transferred in time to the airport to board your flight to Kuala Lumpur. Upon arrival at Kuala Lumpur Airport, meet and greet with our driver. You will be transferred to your hotel for check-in. Overnight stay at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY SUN WAY LAGOON\",\"date\":\"10-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Enjoy the morning breakfast at the hotel. Then transfer to Sunway Lagoon. It is Malaysia\'s Premier Theme Park and has become the most visited tourist destination in the country. Sunway Lagoon is separated into 5 major themed lands - Water Park, Amusement Park, Wildlife Park, Extreme Park & Scream Park, each boasting their own exciting attractions. Find entertainment, adventure, and excitement all in place. Later in the evening, back to the hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM KUALA LUMPUR  |  CITY TOUR KUALA LUMPUR\",\"date\":\"11-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from the hotel. You can keep your bags in the cloakroom and proceed for the city tour of Kuala Lumpur. This Tour offers you an insight into the old & new Kuala Lumpur Tower, one of the tallest in the world - 421m, here you can observe the awesome skyline of the KL city. After that, transfer to Twin Tower in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia was the world\'s tallest twin building in the world. Later transfer back to the hotel.spend some time shopping in Kuala Lumpur. Later you will be transferred to the airport to catch your flight back home.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"62\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"25890\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"376\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"178\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"8311\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"63\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"8929\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"JAMBULUWUK OCEANO SEMINYAK \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"EXTRA BED\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"09\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KUALA LUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL FURAMA BUKIT BINTANG \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"EXTRA BED\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"11\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata</strong> with <strong>25 Kgs</strong>&nbsp;Check-in Baggage each Pax.</li>\n	<li>All tours on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Airport pick up &amp; drop on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>BALI INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>120 minutes&nbsp;spa treatment&nbsp;<b>and&nbsp;</b>Water sport activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>FD Kintamani Volcano View &amp; Ubud Village tour with A+Tuakd Adventure Park Entry and Lunch (Indonesian Buffet) - Part Area, Swimming Pool and Waterfall access - with transfer on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>English speaking guide assistance on tour</li>\n	<li>Entrance fee</li>\n	<li>Mineral water upon arrival and tour</li>\n	<li>Govt taxes</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>KUALA LUMPUR INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights </strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in KUALA LUMPUR with daily breakfast (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Full Day Sun Way Lagoon Theme Park on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>City Tour of Kuala Lumpur by night including KL Tower on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>Malaysia Visa Charges.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"26\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":43130,\"land_cost\":\"25662\",\"visa_cost\":\"2000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":70792,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18405.92\",\"selling_price\":89197.919999999998253770172595977783203125}', 'MZQ/0108/062019', 84762, 84762, 0, '2019-06-27 13:31:17', '2019-06-27 13:47:26', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(112, 'Ms PARUL BEHL', NULL, '7857965803', 'parulbehl9@gmail.com', 'SRI LANKA', '2019-07-17', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"17-07-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"Arrival in Colombo Airport, warmly welcomed by our company representative. Overnight at hotel.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO TO KANDY (135 KMS \\/ 04 HOURS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"18-07-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast \\u2013 Proceed to Kandy en-route visiting Pinnawala elephant Orphanage & Mawanella spice garden. Overnight stay in Kandy.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY\",\"date\":\"19-07-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast Visit Royal Botanical Garden\\/ Temple of Tooth Relic\\/ Gem Museum\\/ Cultural Show. Overnight stay in Kandy.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY TO BENTOTA (177 KMS \\/ 05 HOURS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"20-07-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"After Breakfast check-out from hotel & drive to Bentota. Evening visit Bentota Beach. Overnight stay in Bentota.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"21-07-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast visit Galle sightseeing, Fort, Colonial buildings, Lighthouse, Ahungalla, turtle hatchery. Overnight stay in Bentota.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA TO COLOMBO (82 KMS \\/ 02 HOURS APPROX)\",\"date\":\"22-07-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from hotel and drive to colombo. After check-in hotel in Colombo, City tour with Shopping. Overnight stay in Colombo.\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"23-07-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"After breakfast check-out from the hotel and drop to the airport.\\nTour Ends with Happy Memories.\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"fare\":21388},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1205\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1202\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":24140},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"183\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"997\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL FAIRVIEW \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SERENE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BENTOTA\",\"hotel_name\":\"COCO ROYAL BEACH \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL FAIRVIEW \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><b>02 Nights </b>accommodation in 3* hotel in Colombo with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><b>02 Nights</b> accommodation in 3* hotel in Kandy with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><b>02 Nights </b>accommodation in 3* hotel in Bentota with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Transport by air conditioned Car with the service of an English Speaking Driving guide on Private Basis.</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp;&nbsp;Transfers on Private Basis.</li>\n	<li>Sri Lanka Visa Charges.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;Entrance fees.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Optional Entrance Fee</strong> (Per person, per entry in USD)<strong>:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Pinnawela Elephant Orphanage at Pinnawela – <strong>USD 6</strong></li>\n	<li>Temple of the tooth relic at Kandy – <strong>USD 8</strong></li>\n	<li>Cultural Dance show at Kandy – Ticket has to be collected from the Gem shop on free of charge once the client visit the shop</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Boat Ride at Bentota – <strong>USD 18</strong> per Boat&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Turtle Hatchery at Ahungalla –&nbsp; <strong>USD 3</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":45528,\"hotel_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"37630\",\"visa_cost\":\"3400\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":1775}],\"cost_price\":88333,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11483.29\",\"selling_price\":99816.29000000000814907252788543701171875}', 'MZQ/0109/072019', 99800, 49900, 0, '2019-07-02 13:14:11', '2019-07-02 13:36:25', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(114, 'Ms PARUL BEHL', NULL, '7857965803', 'parulbehl9@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2019-07-22', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN PHUKET | FANTASEA SHOW\",\"date\":\"22-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our local tour coordinator who will meet and greet you at the specified area and transfer you to the hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening proceed for watching the Fantasea Show. Phuket FantaSea Show, or Fantasy of a Kingdom, is a Las Vegas-style Thai cultural show infused with cutting edge technology and state-of-the-art show elements. See nine exciting shows featuring Thai culture,<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>magic illusion, acrobatics, animal performance, pyrotechnics, stunts, aerial performance, 4-D effects, special effects. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay. ( DINNER)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHUKET | PHI PHI ISLAND\",\"date\":\"23-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will start for the Phi Phi Island Tour. Phi Phi Islands comprise of six islands, of which the prominent ones are Phi Phi Don, which house the Bohemian Town and the Phi Phi Leh with Maya Bay. These islands are visited by hundreds of tourists for their limestone cliffs that rise out of the emerald green waters, white sand beaches and its beautiful coral reefs. Please note it takes about 2 hours one way to reach Phi Phi Island by Big Boat and 1 hour by a Speed boat. You can opt to do snorkeling (by paying National Park Fees) once you reach Phi Phi Island. Enjoy the beach and relax with a local lunch. Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay. (BREAKFAST + LUNCH)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHUKET TO KRABI\",\"date\":\"24-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Take your fill at breakfast early this morning, pack your bags and check out from the hotel. Today we bid goodbye to Phuket and further our vacation to a much more exotic and beautiful destination- Krabi. On arrival at Krabi, check in to your hotel (Standard Check in time: 1400 - 1500 hours) and relax. Rest of the day is free at your own leisure. In the evening you can go out and get acquainted to your nearby areas and relish some freshly made cuisines at local seaside restaurants. Later return to the hotel and sleep relaxed. (BREAKFAST)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KRABI TO BANGKOK | CHAOPHRAYA DINNER CRUISE\",\"date\":\"25-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to the airport to catch your flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival at Bangkok, you will be met by our representative and transferred the hotel. Check-in and relax. In the evening proceed for cruise on Chaophraya river. A Bangkok river cruise is a luxurious way to view main attractions \\u2014 including the Grand Palace and Wat Arun (Temple of Dawn) \\u2014 illuminated at night. During your Chao Phraya River dinner cruise, feast on a buffet of authentic Thai dishes while watching the lit-up city skyline pass by. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay. (BREAKFAST + DINNER)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAFARI WORLD AND MARINE PARK\",\"date\":\"26-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for a full day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions, and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows. (BREAKFAST + LUNCH)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CITY TOUR & DEPARTURE FROM BANGKOK\",\"date\":\"27-07-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will get an opportunity to explore the magnificent temples of Bangkok with the City and Temple Tour of Bangkok. Visit the famous temples of Bangkok like Wat Traimit, the temple of 5.5 tons Golden Buddha and Wat Benchamabophit, the marble temple. Your tour will come to an end at Gems Gallery, the largest jewellery store in the world. Evening transferred to the airport to catch your return flight back home. (BREAKFAST)<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2046\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":21810},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1763\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"5400\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3230\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":4255},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"120\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 AM\",\"fare\":10625},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"9727\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Jul 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jul 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":5668}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"SEA SUN RESORT & SPA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL AREETARA RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/07\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/07\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL THE ECOTEL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/07\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> accommodation in <strong>4*</strong> hotel in Phuket&nbsp;with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> hotel in Krabi&nbsp;with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights </strong>accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> hotel in Bangkok with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>05 Breakfast 02 Lunch &amp; 02 Dinner.</strong></li>\n	<li>FantaSea Show with Dinner on <strong>SIC</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Phi Phi Island Tour With Lunch - By Big Boat&nbsp;on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Dinner Cruise On Chaophraya&nbsp;on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Full Day Safari World And Marine Park with Lunch&nbsp;on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Half Day Bangkok City Tour&nbsp;on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC</strong> basis. (Seat in Coach)</li>\n	<li>All Airport to Hotel &amp; Hotel to Airport Transfers on <strong>PVT</strong> basis. (Private)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>25 Kgs of&nbsp;</strong>Check-in Baggage each Pax in Air Asia Flight.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":47758,\"land_cost\":\"46643\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":94401,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12272.13\",\"selling_price\":106673.130000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0111/072019', 107000, 53500, 0, '2019-07-03 14:38:21', '2019-07-05 19:12:39', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(115, 'Mr ROHAN KUMAR x 04', NULL, '9709027191', 'princesahu00651@gmail.com', 'BALI & KUALA LUMPUR', '2019-12-02', 4, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BALI\",\"date\":\"02-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, Denpasar, Bali. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for your refreshment. Evening is free. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF-DAY WATER SPORTS ACTIVITY | 120 MINUTES SPA\",\"date\":\"03-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast at hotel, Proceed to Tanjung Benoa Beach for Water Sports (optional water sports include parasailing, jet ski, flying fish, snorkeling, sky tube, sea walker, etc ). Return back to the hotel and relax for some time. Rest of the day is free for you to explore on your own. After breakfast at the hotel and spend some time relaxing or exploring the nearby places on your own. In the evening, 120 minutes Spa. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY AT LEASURE\",\"date\":\"04-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Complete day at leisure on own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY KINTAMANI + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR + DTUAKD ADVENTURE PARK\",\"date\":\"05-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for a full-day tour of Ubud and Kintamani. With the smoky Agung Volcano in the backdrop, Mount and Lake Batur will keep you mesmerized. Take a stop to watch the famous Barong and Keris dance performance (optional if selected) at Singapadu Village. Visit Celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarvings, Ubud the center of Balinese paintings, Goa Gajah (elephant cave) and the holy springs of Tirta Empul at Tampaksiring with Dtuakd Adventure Park. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BALI TO KUALA LUMPUR\",\"date\":\"06-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After a hearty breakfast, you are transferred in time to the airport to board your flight to KOLKATA.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"62\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:35 AM\",\"fare\":150534},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia X Airways\",\"fno\":\"798\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Indonesia Airways\",\"fno\":\"556\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"63\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"JAMBULUWUK OCEANO SEMINYAK \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"06\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata</strong> with <strong>20 Kgs</strong>&nbsp;Check-in Baggage each Pax.</li>\n	<li>All tours on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Airport pick up &amp; drop on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>BALI INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>120 minutes&nbsp;spa treatment&nbsp;<b>and&nbsp;</b>Water sport activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>FD Kintamani Volcano View &amp; Ubud Village tour with A+ <strong>Dtuakd Adventure Park </strong>Entry and Lunch (Indonesian Buffet) - Part Area, Swimming Pool and Waterfall access - with transfer on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>English speaking guide assistance on tour.</li>\n	<li>Entrance fee</li>\n	<li>Mineral water upon arrival and tour</li>\n	<li>Govt taxes</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":150534,\"land_cost\":\"102000\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":null}],\"cost_price\":252534,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 40405.44\",\"selling_price\":292939.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0112/072019', 292800, 48800, 0, '2019-07-16 13:16:41', '2019-10-18 16:43:53', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(116, 'Mr ROHAN KUMAR x 06', NULL, '9709027191', 'princesahu00651@gmail.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2019-12-02', 3, 0, 6, '[]', '[{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"41\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"fare\":143172},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"42\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL AQUEEN LAVENDER\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"05\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Fare <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>City Tour of Singapore with English Speaking Guide - <strong>SIC</strong> Basis</li>\n	<li>Night Safari Ticket with Return Transfer - <strong>SIC</strong> Basis</li>\n	<li>Sentosa Package (One way cable car + Madame Tussauds + Boat Ride + 4D Marvel + IOS + WOT -2nd show) with return transfer - <strong>SIC</strong> Basis</li>\n	<li>Universal Studios and Trick Eye Museum Combo ticket with return transfer - <strong>SIC</strong> Basis</li>\n	<li>Airport Transfer on <strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>Singapore Visa Charges.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":143172,\"land_cost\":\"141017\",\"visa_cost\":\"13200\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":1560}],\"cost_price\":298949,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35873.88\",\"selling_price\":334822.880000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0113/072019', 335994, 55999, 0, '2019-07-18 15:07:18', '2019-07-18 15:36:05', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(117, 'Dr S K SINGH', NULL, '9431337472', 'ikdr51@gmail.com', 'RUSSIA', '2019-09-08', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"WELCOME TO MOSCOW\",\"date\":\"08-09-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>The Tour Manager \\/ Station Manager \\/ Local representative will meet you outside the airport. Enjoy Indian dinner. Proceed to the hotel and check-in. Overnight in Moscow.&nbsp;<strong>(D)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GUIDED CITY TOUR OF MOSCOW \\u2013 FREE TIME\",\"date\":\"09-09-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Guided tour of Moscow: Visit Red Square, see the St. Basil\\u2019s Cathedral, the White House and Christ the Saviour Cathedral. &nbsp;Later you have some free time to explore the city by yourself. Overnight in Moscow.<strong> (B, D)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VISIT KREMLIN \\u2013 ONTO ST. PETERSBURG\",\"date\":\"10-09-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed to Kremlin: Visit the Kremlin. See the fascinating Cathedral Square and the Grand Kremlin. Later board your train onto St. Petersburg. Overnight in St. Petersburg.&nbsp;<strong>(B, D)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GUIDED TOUR OF ST. PETERSBURG \\u2013 CRUISE ON THE RIVER NEVA\",\"date\":\"11-09-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Guided tour of St. Petersburg: See the Peter and Paul fortress, the famous dome of St. Isaac\\u2019s Cathedral and drive past the Palace square with its dominant Alexander Column, the Bronze Horseman \\u2013 dedicated to the founder of St. Petersburg, Peter the Great and many such interesting sites. Next, enjoy a cruise on the river Neva. Overnight in St. Petersburg. <strong>(B, D)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VISIT THE HERMITAGE MUSEUM \\u2013 TRAIN TO MOSCOW\",\"date\":\"12-09-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the Hermitage Museum. Next, board a train and return back to Moscow. Overnight in Moscow <strong>(B, D)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FLY BACK HOME WITH PLEASANT MEMORIES\",\"date\":\"13-09-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed to the airport for your flight back home.&nbsp;Arrive home with pleasant memories of your&nbsp;tour, which we are sure you will treasure for a lifetime.<strong> (B)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Sharjah (SHJ)\",\"name\":\"Air Arabia\",\"fno\":\"464\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Sep 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Sep 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Sharjah (SHJ)\",\"to\":\"Moscow (DME)\",\"name\":\"Air Arabia\",\"fno\":\"955\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Sep 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Sep 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Moscow (DME)\",\"to\":\"Sharjah (SHJ)\",\"name\":\"Air Arabia\",\"fno\":\"956\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Sep 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Sep 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Sharjah (SHJ)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air Arabia\",\"fno\":\"463\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Sep 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Sep 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/09\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"4* HOTEL VEGA IZMAILOVO\",\"city\":\"MOSCOW\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"10\\/09\\/2019\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/09\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"4* HOTEL KARELIA\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"12\\/09\\/2019\",\"city\":\"ST. PETERSBERG\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/09\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MOSCOW\",\"hotel_name\":\"4* HOTEL VEGA IZMAILOVO\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/09\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket - <strong>Ex Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accommodation&nbsp;in Moscow.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in St. Petersburg.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Moscow.</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet Breakfast (Breakfast includes bread, butter, jam, cereals, fruit juice, milk, tea, coffee, hot eggs, and cut fruits).</li>\n	<li>05 Indian Jain / vegetarian / non-vegetarian dinners.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Sightseeing and accommodation as per the above mentioned itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Moscow Guided city tour.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>See Kremlin and cathedrals.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>St. Petersburg Guided city tour.</li>\n	<li>Boat ride on River Neva.</li>\n	<li>Visit the famous Hermitage Museum.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Single Entry Russian Visa.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Cost of Visa and Medical Insurance for the duration of the tour.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;NOTE :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Cost of ticket taxes, visa fees, and medical insurance is included in your tour price.</li>\n	<li>As a 3rd person in a triple room, most hotels use rollaway beds and room size may be the same as the double room.</li>\n	<li>A person 12 years and below is considered a child and above 12 years, an adult.</li>\n	<li>For prices and departure dates from your hub city please contact our local sales offices/travel agents.</li>\n	<li>On certain departures, we may sometimes amend / reverse the itinerary, however, all the services / inclusions will remain the same.</li>\n	<li>All transfers and extensive excursions with entrance fees (as specified in the itinerary) by a deluxe air conditioned coach.</li>\n	<li>Services of a professional, friendly and multilingual Tour Manager or a local Representative.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>On some occasions, you may have to join another group in case the group does not have adequate members.</li>\n	<li>A local representative or a driver may only be there to assist you during your initial part of the tour.</li>\n	<li>Due to international events and trade fairs all throughout Europe such as Air Show, music festivals, ice skating championships etc.&nbsp;you may have to stay in hotels further away from the city.</li>\n	<li>Functioning of Air cooling/Air conditioning in hotels is subject to official declaration of summer by the local authority.</li>\n	<li>Security alerts and random closures might affect the itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<br />\n<strong>MEDICAL INSURANCE:</strong> Normal insurance charges for the duration of the tour are included in the tour price. However, any passenger above the age of 60 years and those who wish to extend their stay will be required to pay additional charges.&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;The tour cost does not include POE charges and passport charges.</li>\n	<li>No porterage included.</li>\n	<li>Taxes as applicable.</li>\n	<li>Any expenses of personal nature such as porterage, laundry expenses, wines, mineral water, food and drink not in the regular menu provided by us, minibar, and telephone calls etc.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 USD</strong> per person, including infants, per day tips for drivers, guides and other service providers.</li>\n	<li>Meals other than that what is mentioned in your itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Note:</strong></p>\n\n<p><em>This is a group escorted tour and the tickets are issued once the group is formed. So to confirm the Hotel or Airline currently is slightly difficult. But as per past experince, I am just sharing the past detail of Hotel and airline. But it is not necessary to have the same airline or hotel for the future tour as well. </em></p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"242970\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":242970,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":254970,\"profit_figure\":\"12000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"4.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0114/072019', 254918, 127459, 0, '2019-07-22 11:50:11', '2019-09-17 12:01:32', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(118, 'DR R K MISHRA', 'MR PAWAN', '9304598005', 'linctuspharma@gmail.com', 'NEPAL', '2019-10-05', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KATHMANDU\",\"date\":\"05-10-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Meeting at the airport upon arrival by Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;Personnel. Transfer to hotel. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After a short relaxation, &nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">you will be taken for a visit to the Hindu culture in Nepal, <b>Pashupatinath.<\\/b>&nbsp; This is the place where holy saddhus pray. <span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">The&nbsp;<b>Pashupatinath Temple<\\/b>&nbsp;is a famous, sacred&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"background:white\\\">Hindu temple&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">dedicated to&nbsp;<\\/span>Pashupatinath&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">and is located on the banks of the&nbsp;<\\/span>Bagmati River&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">5 kilometers north-east of&nbsp;<\\/span>Kathmandu Valley&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">in the eastern city of<\\/span><\\/span> Kathmandu&nbsp;<span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">the&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"background:white\\\">capital&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">of&nbsp;<\\/span>Nepal<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">. This temple is considered one of the sacred temples of the&nbsp;<\\/span>Hindu&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">faith. The temple serves as the seat of the national deity, Lord <b>Pashupatinath<\\/b>. This temple complex is on&nbsp;<\\/span>UNESCO World Heritage Sites\'<span style=\\\"color:#252525\\\">&nbsp;list Since 1979.&nbsp;This \\\"extensive Hindu temple precinct\\\" is a \\\"sprawling collection of temples, ashrams, images, and inscriptions raised over the centuries along the banks of the sacred Bagmati river\\\". <\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\">We then continue to the holiest shrine for the Buddhist culture in Nepal, <b>Bouddhanath<\\/b>, with its large stupa, this is the place where all devout Buddhists come for a pilgrimage. <\\/span>( The above sightseeing is for a maximum of 06 hours after the vehicle reports at the hotel )<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KATHMANDU - POKHARA\",\"date\":\"06-10-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Fly to Pokhara. Pokhara is 30 mins by flight from Kathmandu. From Pokhara town (2,352 feet) in good weather, there are splendid views right from the hotel. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Assistance upon arrival by hotel coach in Pokhara and then transfer to Hotel. Evening free to stroll around the lakeside. Overnight at the hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"POKHARA\",\"date\":\"07-10-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\">This afternoon you will visit <b>Bindebasini Temple<\\/b>. This is one of the oldest temples in Pokhara was a part of Kaski Kingdom, the main deity of the temple, Goddess Durga, was brought from India. Apart from the peace and tranquility that can be felt in this region, the premises of the temple offers a good view of the Himalaya on a clear day. The temple is in the area of the bazaar, hence, a journey of the old bazaar can be combined with a visit to the temple. Sightseeing to <b>Devi\\u2019s fall<\\/b>, also known as Patale Chango is an awesome waterfall lying 2 km southwest of Pokhara. During the summer and rainy season, the waterfall takes its real form, with gushing water splashing and making its way through the rocks. Just opposite of Devi\\u2019s fall, on the other side of the road, there is <b>Gupteshwor Cave<\\/b>. This cave is popular for the different natural forms made from limestone deposits. Photography is strictly prohibited inside the cave. Overnight at the hotel.&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">( The above sightseeing is for a maximum of 03 hours after the vehicle reports at the hotel )<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"POKHARA\",\"date\":\"08-10-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">This morning you will go for an excursion trip to&nbsp;<strong><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Sarangkot<\\/span><\\/strong>. Sarangkot is the most popular tourist destination from where the tourist can enjoy the great view of the Pokhara Valley and the magnificent view of the mountains. Sarangkot is only 13 km&nbsp;from Lake Side, Pokhara. Sarangkot is the highest view in point for a sunrise and it is just 1592m high. Sarangkot is&nbsp;cooler than Pokhara. Sarangkot can be reached easily by 45 to 60 minutes by a car ride to the top from Pokhara. Many tourists come to Sarangkot for sunrise view and go back. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">From Sarangkot, in&nbsp;the northern direction, we can see Dhaulagiri in the far west. Annapurna range is visible when the weather is clear on the same side. On the southern direction, the village overlooks the city of Pokhara and its lake on the north-western outskirts of the city. ( The above sightseeing is for a maximum of 03 hours after the vehicle reports at the hotel )<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"POKHARA - KATHMANDU\",\"date\":\"09-10-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Fly back to Kathmandu and transfer to Hotel. Rest day at leisure. One can indulge in shopping or visit the casinos trying their lady luck on your own. Overnight at the&nbsp;hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KATHMANDU\",\"date\":\"10-10-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"section1\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">This morning your tour will take you for a visit to <b>Patan. <\\/b>Also known as&nbsp; <b>Lalitpur<\\/b>, the city of beauty is separated from Kathmandu only by the Bagmati River and is the second largest town in the valley. Lalitpur is fragmented from other cities due to its substantive architectural ancient masterpieces. Patan\'s central Durbar Square is absolutely packed with temples: Its an architectural center point with a far greater concentration of temples per sq. meter than in Kathamandu or Bhaktapur. <span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\">Within&nbsp;the city also lies the Tibetan refugee center, home to most of the valley\'s Tibetan population.&nbsp; While technically refugees, the Tibetans are some of the wealthiest people in the valley because of the carpet industry they operate.&nbsp; For those looking to bring home a fine Tibetan carpet, this is the place to shop. You will then go to <b>Sway<\\/b><\\/span><b>ambhunath <\\/b>the golden spire of the 5th-century Swayambhu stupa is adorned with a colorful fluttering of prayer flags; it crowns a hill overlooking the Kathmandu Valley and offers fantastic views over the city of Kathmandu. Swayambhunath is one of the most recognizable symbols in Nepal and the painted eyes of Buddha watch all who ascend the worn stone steps. <\\/span><\\/span><span lang=\\\"X-NONE\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">( The above sightseeing is for a maximum of 03 hours after the vehicle reports at the hotel )<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"section1\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-AU\\\" style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\\\">Later, you will be transferred to the airport in time to board your flight for onward journey.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kathmandu (KTM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"247\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"116712\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kathmandu (KTM)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"248\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:15 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KATHMANDU\",\"hotel_name\":\"4* Hotel Tibet International\\/ Grand\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/10\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":1,\"hotel_name\":\"4* Hotel Da Yatra Court Yard\",\"city\":\"POKHARA\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"09\\/10\\/2019\",\"check_in\":\"06\\/10\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KATHMANDU\",\"hotel_name\":\"4* Hotel Tibet International\\/ Grand\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/10\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> accommodation in Kathmandu with <strong>Breakfast &nbsp;and Dinner (MAP)</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> accommodation in Pokhara with<strong> Breakfast and Dinner (MAP)</strong></li>\n	<li>02 International Airport transfer by&nbsp;an A/c vehicle</li>\n	<li>Sightseeing as per the itinerary in Kathmandu and Pokhara by an A/c vehicle exclusively.</li>\n	<li>Airfare Kathmandu / Pokhara / Kathmandu</li>\n	<li>Domestic airport tax while taking the Kathmandu / Pokhara / Kathmandu flight</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Domestic</strong> airport transfers in Kathmandu by an A/c vehicle exclusively</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Domestic</strong> airport transfers in Pokhara</li>\n	<li>Presently applicable hotel taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Vehicle allocation:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>01 Scorpio / Innova</strong>&nbsp;having 04 – 06 seats</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Entrance fee at the monumental sites during the sightseeing.</li>\n	<li>Guide during the sightseeing.</li>\n	<li>Any expenses of personal nature such as drinks, laundry, telephone/fax calls.</li>\n	<li>Any expenses caused by reasons beyond our control such as flight delays, rescheduling or cancellations, any accidents, medical evacuations, riots, strikes, etc.</li>\n	<li>Any tips to drivers, hotel staff, any meals apart from the ones mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>Any other tax or service charge that could be enforced during this period will be extra &amp; need to borne by you.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong><em>Hand-phone SIM card:</em></strong></p>\n\n<p>Upon arrival in Kathmandu at the International Airport better known as</p>\n\n<p>“Tribhuwan International Airport”. After collecting your baggage there are Two Telephone companies known as “NCell &amp; NTC&nbsp; ( Nepal Telecommunication). They have a Stall each. One Passport size photo and a copy of the passport will be required. One can purchase a Sim. Activation time is 10 mins on an average. Cost is <strong>INR 150</strong> per Sim which can be topped off as per requirement. It will be a 3G card.</p>\n\n<p>We are not in a position to take out the Sim in advance. Above is subject to change as per the Telecommunication Regulations</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>Please note :</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>Do not treat this quotation mail as a confirmation of booking, as we are not holding any booking at the time of quotation. Price and services can be&nbsp;changed at the time of confirmation. Confirmation of booking is only based on written communication.</p>\n\n<p>The vehicle will not be at disposal but will perform its respective duties as per the itinerary&nbsp;only.&nbsp; Point to point.</p>\n\n<p>The above rates are valid for Indian National only.</p>\n\n<p>Hotel Check-in Time:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong> 1500 hrs</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hotel Check-out Time:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>1100 hrs</strong></p>\n\n<p>A valid Indian&nbsp;passport or an election Id is the only valid document for adults ( 18 yrs &amp; above)for travel to Kathmandu by air. For children below the age of 18 years, the school or college id suffices. The id should clearly reflect the traveler’s picture, school or college name, date of birth as well as the class in which the student is studying. Request that this be checked with Indian Immigration authorities at your end too. This information stands good while writing this mail. Do update yourself for any changes. This information is correct as of today and cannot be held liable just in case anyone is not allowed to board or the Govt of India changes the regulations.</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>ADHAR CARD/ PAN CARD / DRIVING LICENSE IS NOT A VALID DOCUMENT TRAVEL TO NEPAL BY AIR.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>The New Indian notes of INR&nbsp; 200, 500 as well as the 2000 denominations are not a valid tender currency in Nepal. Or in fact, any denomination above INR 100 notes are not valid in Nepal (Inr 100 notes and below are accepted). &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"104152\",\"land_cost\":\"99900\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":204052,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46931.96\",\"selling_price\":251196,\"profit_figure\":\"47144\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"23.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0115/072019', 251196, 62799, 0, '2019-07-22 18:27:08', '2019-08-13 09:55:01', 1, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(119, 'Mr ASHISH', NULL, '9334062925', 'ashishkumartomarindia@gmail.com', 'BALI', '2019-08-15', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BALI\",\"date\":\"15-08-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, Denpasar, Bali. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for your refreshment. Evening is free. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF-DAY WATER SPORTS ACTIVITY | 120 MINUTES SPA\",\"date\":\"16-08-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast at hotel, Proceed to Tanjung Benoa Beach for Water Sports (optional water sports include parasailing, jet ski, flying fish, snorkeling, sky tube, sea walker, etc ). Return back to the hotel and relax for some time. Rest of the day is free for you to explore on your own. After breakfast at the hotel and spend some time relaxing or exploring the nearby places on your own. In the evening, 120 minutes Spa. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY AT LEASURE\",\"date\":\"17-08-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Complete day at leisure on own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY KINTAMANI + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR + DTUAKD ADVENTURE PARK\",\"date\":\"18-08-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for a full-day tour of Ubud and Kintamani. With the smoky Agung Volcano in the backdrop, Mount and Lake Batur will keep you mesmerized. Take a stop to watch the famous Barong and Keris dance performance (optional if selected) at Singapadu Village. Visit Celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarvings, Ubud the center of Balinese paintings, Goa Gajah (elephant cave) and the holy springs of Tirta Empul at Tampaksiring with Dtuakd Adventure Park. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM BALI\",\"date\":\"19-08-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After a hearty breakfast, than transfer&nbsp;to the airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"282\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:45 AM\",\"fare\":66980},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"306\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"158\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"281\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/08\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"JAMBULUWUK OCEANO SEMINYAK \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"19\\/08\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>120 minutes</strong>&nbsp;spa treatment on <strong>PVT</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Water Sports activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>FD Kintamani Volcano View &amp; Ubud Village tour on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>D Tuakd</strong> Adventure Park Entry and Lunch (Indonesian Buffet) - Part Area, Swimming Pool and Waterfall access - with transfer on&nbsp;<b>PVT.</b></li>\n	<li>English speaking guide assistance on tour.</li>\n	<li>Entrance fee.</li>\n	<li>Mineral water upon arrival and tour.</li>\n	<li>All tours on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Airport pick up &amp; drop on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>Govt taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":66980,\"land_cost\":\"39050\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":106030,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10603\",\"selling_price\":116633}', 'MZQ/0116/082019', 116600, 58300, 0, '2019-08-01 17:48:38', '2019-08-01 17:58:29', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(120, 'Dr SANJAY GUPTA', 'Mr PALASH BOSE (LUPIN)', '9160016274', 'palashkbose@lupin.com', 'USA', '2020-05-20', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN NEW JERSEY\",\"date\":\"20-05-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to New York. On arrival transfer from the airport to the hotel&nbsp;and Check-in. (Check-in time is after 3.00 pm). <strong>Overnight in New Jersey.<\\/strong> <strong>(DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEW YORK\",\"date\":\"21-05-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we drive to Battery Park and take a ferry to Liberty Island to see the famous icon of American freedom - <strong>The Statue of Liberty<\\/strong>. We then proceed on a guided tour of New York City - viewing famous sights, such as 5th Avenue, Rockefeller Center, the United Nations Building, Central Park and much more. Enroute, at the 9\\/11 Memorial Museum, earlier the World Trade Centre, we pay homage to the hundreds of innocent lives lost in the September 11, 2001 attacks and the World Trade Center bombing of 1993. We visit \'One World Observatory\', on levels 100, 101 and 102 of the main building of the rebuilt World Trade Center Complex in Lower Manhattan - the tallest building in the Western Hemisphere, from where we get panoramic views of New York City. <strong>Overnight in New Jersey. (BREAKFAST, DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEW YORK - WASHINGTON DC\",\"date\":\"22-05-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we drive to Washington DC, Capital of the United States for a guided tour of the city. We visit the National Air and Space Museum and view aircraft models and displays, such as the Wright Brothers\' first aircraft and Lindberg\'s \'Spirit of St Louis\'. Later, we see the Lincoln Memorial, the Korean Memorial, and Capitol Hill. We also view the White House, home of the US President. (Due to security reasons permission to enter or go near the White House is not given).&nbsp;<strong>Overnight in Washington DC.<\\/strong> <strong>(BREAKFAST, DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"WASHINGTON DC - HERSHEY AND BUFFALO - NIAGARA\",\"date\":\"23-05-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, our first stop is at Hershey\'s Chocolate World, in Hershey, where we watch in fascination as cocoa beans are turned into delicious chocolate and we see Hershey\'s product characters come to life in a 3D animated musical adventure titled \'Hershey\'s Chocolate Tour\', which includes a free sample of Hershey\'s chocolate. Later, we drive to Buffalo for Niagara Falls to get a view of the splendorous, Niagara Falls - transformed into an incredible, water and light masterpiece as they are lit up in a rainbow of colored lights - a fascinating sight indeed.<strong> Overnight in Niagara.<\\/strong> <strong>(BREAKFAST, DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VISIT NIAGARA & RETURN HOME\",\"date\":\"24-05-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we check-out and drive to Niagara Falls and get the experience of the exhilarating force of these mighty Falls. We take the \'Maid of the Mist\' boat ride into the heart of the mighty Horseshoe Falls. This is truly a fantastic journey through crashing waters, surrounded by massive rock formations. Later transfer to the airport&nbsp;for your flight home. It\'s time to say goodbye to all the new friends you have made. We hope you take back many wonderful memories of your holiday.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Newark (EWR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"191\",\"dep_date\":\"20 May 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"20 May 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:15 AM\",\"fare\":161278},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Newark (EWR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"144\",\"dep_date\":\"24 May 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"25 May 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2020\",\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"COURTYARD BY MARRIOTT SECAUCUS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"city\":\"NEW JERSEY\",\"room_type\":\"DBL ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2020\",\"city\":\"WASHINGTON DC\",\"hotel_name\":\"WYNDHAM GARDEN MANASSAS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DBL ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2020\",\"city\":\"NIAGARA \\/ BUFFALO\",\"hotel_name\":\"RADISSON HOTEL NIAGARA FALLS GRAND ISLAND \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DBL ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/05\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Mumbai.</strong></li>\n	<li>Any increase in the airfare, fuel surcharge and taxes charged by the airlines on your air ticket.</li>\n	<li>Cost of the Visas needed to participate in the tour.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation at the hotels mentioned or similar.</li>\n	<li>Meals, Coach Tours, Transfers, Entrance Fees, Sightseeing And Surface Transportation as mentioned in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Services of our Tour Manager or Local Representatives. <strong>(Subject to minimum 20 full-paying passengers traveling together).</strong></li>\n	<li>Handling fees charged by the airlines for travel within USA and Canada - 1 check-in baggage per person.</li>\n	<li>Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in all land arrangement which may come into effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Cost of Overseas Travel Insurance policy valid for the tour. <strong>(Passengers above 60 years of age will have to pay the actual difference of the insurance premium)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Visa Requirements: You must be in possession of a Multiple Entry Visa for the USA. The cost of this Visa is included in your tour price. Consulate may request a personal interview. You will have to attend this interview at your own cost.</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Mandatory tips of <strong>USD 3</strong> per person per day for Coach drivers, Guides, etc.</li>\n	<li>Any increase in the rate of exchange leading to an increase in all land arrangement which may come in to effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Cost of extension of the validity or deviation from route of your air ticket.</li>\n	<li>Cost of the Suggested Excursions.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Porterage of 1 bag per person at all the hotel for Value and Cost Saver tours only</li>\n	<li>Tips, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Airport taxes as per the routing of the tour.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"0\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":161278,\"land_cost\":\"202000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Airport Transfers\",\"amount\":14200}],\"cost_price\":377478,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":377478}', 'MZQ/0117/082019', 359800, 179900, 0, '2019-08-06 13:21:51', '2019-08-06 14:22:14', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(121, 'Mr SAMIR', NULL, '7004153501', 'rkrishnasamir@gmail.com', 'GREECE & ITALY', '2020-07-01', 8, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT ATHENS\",\"date\":\"01-07-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival to&nbsp;<strong>Athens<\\/strong>. At night we provide and&nbsp;evening transfer&nbsp;to&nbsp;<strong>PLAKA&nbsp;<\\/strong>area. This neighborhood is full of small Greek taverns where you can enjoy the rich folklore of this country.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ATHENS CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"02-07-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning, we will enjoy a panoramic tour of the city with a local guide which includes the Presidential Palace, the Panathinaikos stadium where the first modern Olympic games were held, the national library, the bustling squares of the center; the new neighborhoods that emerged after the 2004 Olympic games. The tour will end at the Acropolis site (entry not included). Free time during the day to walk around and discover unforgettable places.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ATHENS - CORINTH - EPIDAURUS - NAFPLIO - OLYMPIA\",\"date\":\"03-07-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>We will depart for the Peloponnese region in the morning.&nbsp; We will stop at the <strong>CORINTH CANAL<\\/strong>. Afterward, we will arrive in <strong>EPIDAURUS<\\/strong> enjoying the view of gorgeous landscapes. We will visit the magnificent Ancient Theatre which is surrounded by a unique landscape. We will later journey to <strong>NAFPLIO<\\/strong>, a town by the Aegean Sea. We will visit its historic center, its lovely marina, and its medieval castle. Lunch break and free time to stroll around.&nbsp; We will resume our journey to <strong>OLYMPIA<\\/strong> at mid-afternoon.<strong> (LUNCH + DINNER)<\\/strong> included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"OLYMPIA - PATRAS - AMFILOCHIA - ARTA - IGOUMENITSA (Boarding).\",\"date\":\"04-07-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>We will visit OLYMPIA archaeological site with a local guide. You will have a chance to visit its museum and archaeological site (guided tour, ticket to the park not included) which the cradle of the Olympic games in ancient times. We will get back on route to PATRAS, Greece\\u2019s third-largest city. We will visit its active, lively centre. Afterwards, we will travel to Northern Greece, AMFILOCHIA. Shortstop in this quiet coastal town; ARTA, a city in the Epirus region that has a Roman bridge. Arrival in IGOUMENITSA. Suppertime and boarding to cross the Ionian Sea. Night on board, overnight accommodation in double cabins with private bathroom (we recommend bringing a handbag along to spend the night on board. Breakfast on the boat Sunday morning is not included). <strong>(BREAKFAST)<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note:<\\/strong> The ferry used, which is the only one available, leaves at one in the morning, but boarding is not usually possible until after midnight. Sometimes due to late arrival, the ferry might be delayed. It is a simple ferry (double cabins with private bathroom). Occasionally, due to weather conditions, vessel inspection or schedule changes, strikes, fully booked ferryboats or other reasons, we are forced to adapt the schedules of the following day itinerary according to the berthing time of the ship or fly from Athens to Rome, in which case the visits to Amfilochia and Arta are cancelled and a Sunday visit to Naples and Pompeii is included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BRINDISI - TRANI - NAPLES - ROME\",\"date\":\"05-07-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival in <strong>BRINDISI <\\/strong>early in the morning. We will follow the Adriatic coastline in Southern Italy. We will visit <strong>TRANI<\\/strong>, a picturesque little town by the sea, and its fishing port, its old cathedral and its lively streets. Lunchtime. We will resume our trip to <strong>NAPLES<\\/strong>, where we will arrive in the afternoon. Short sightseeing tour in its historic center before resuming our journey to ROME.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ROME\",\"date\":\"06-07-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>City tour of Rome. Roman Coliseum (admission price included) and Vatican City. In the morning, we have a scenic tour of the city, which will be a great introduction to \\u201cThe Eternal city\\u201d. We enter the tiny state of the Vatican. The Vatican City is a principal centre of Christianity in the world. You will be able to visit St. Peter\\u2019s Basilica. And we have also included admission to the Roman Coliseum, the principal symbol of Rome. This impressive construction dates back 2,000 years and will transport us in time so that we can learn about ancient society in the Roman Empire. In the evening we provide transport to the Via Cavour area, where you will find restaurants serving Italian, Indian, Chinese and international food. Return to hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ROME - FLORENCE\",\"date\":\"07-07-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour with a local expert from Florence. View from Piazzale Michelangelo. We will leave Rome, heading north. This route is graced with beautiful landscapes. Upon arrival in FLORENCE, we head straight to Piazzale Michelangelo, an impressive site in the city. In the evening we provide a tour with a local expert, and walk through the historic center, taking in places such as the Ponte Vecchio, the Duomo, and Piazza Della Signoria. This city is truly an outdoor museum. Free time to explore. In the evening, you can dine at your favorite restaurant. In this district, you can find restaurants serving Italian, Indian, Chinese and international food.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FLORENCE - VENICE\",\"date\":\"08-07-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Vaporetto boat on Venice\\u2019s Grand Canal. Visit and admission to St Mark\\u00b4s Basilica. Admire the technique of crafting Murano Glass. Today we enjoy stunning mountain landscapes while crossing the Apennine Mountains. Arriving in VENICE, we will board a Vapporetto to travel around on the canals in the historic centre. With a local guide, we will visit the marvellous St Marck\\u00b4s and enter the marvellous basilica (entry cost included). Afterwards, we shall be able to visit the Murano glass factory. It is marvellous to see the technique of how this ancient glass is made. Free time. At the end of the afternoon, you will have the chance to eat dinner in the Mestre area, where you can choose the type of restaurant that you prefer (Indian, Oriental, Italian, etc.).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"VENICE\",\"date\":\"09-07-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Airport for your onward journey.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/07\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"NOVOTEL ATHENES \\/ SIMILAR\",\"city\":\"ATHENS\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/07\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/07\\/2020\",\"city\":\"OLYMPIA\",\"hotel_name\":\"OLYMPIC VILLAGE HOTEL RESORT & SPA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/07\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"04\\/07\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"FERRY\",\"room_type\":\"FERRY\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/07\\/2020\",\"city\":\"OLYMPIA - ROME\",\"meal\":\"cp\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"05\\/07\\/2020\",\"city\":\"ROME\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CRISTOFORO COLOMBO \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/07\\/2020\",\"meal\":\"ep\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"07\\/07\\/2020\",\"city\":\"FLORENCE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CONFERENCE FLORENTIA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/07\\/2020\",\"meal\":\"ep\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"08\\/07\\/2020\",\"city\":\"VENICE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ALBATROS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/07\\/2020\",\"meal\":\"ep\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;in Athens.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;in Olympia.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> in Ferry. <strong>(Igoumenitsa - Brindisi) &nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> in Rome.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Nigh</strong> in Florence.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;in Venice.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Includes arrival transfer.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Boat: Vaporetto in Venice. &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>City tour in&nbsp;<strong>Olympia, Rome, Florence, Venice.</strong></li>\n	<li>Evening Transfer: Via Cavour in Rome. &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Transfer: Piazzale Michelangelo in Florence. &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Ticket admission: Coliseum of Rome, Saint Mark´s Basilica and Murano Glass Factory in Venice. &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>1 Lunch or Dinner Included in&nbsp;Olympia. &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Travel by bus with English speaking guide, basic travel insurance, and breakfast buffet.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Additional Day/s (they will be charged depending on what is added) &nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"0\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"704000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":704000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":704000}', 'MZQ/0118/082019', 704000, 88000, 0, '2019-08-10 17:50:19', '2019-08-24 15:14:13', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(122, 'Col. V K Sinha', NULL, '8877300774', 'vksinha9199@gmail.com', 'KARNATAKA', '2019-11-16', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVE BANGALORE & TRANSFER TO COORG  (248 KMS 06 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"16-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Bangalore Airport \\/ Railway station and later proceed to Coorg. Enroute visit Tibetian Golden Temple &amp; NisargaDhama. On arrival at Coorg, Check- in to your hotel. Evening visit Raja\'s Seat. Overnight stay at Coorg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COORG - LOCAL\",\"date\":\"17-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning post breakfast enjoy coorg local sightseeing. Visit Talacauveri, Bhagamandala, Omkareshwara Temple &amp; Abbey Falls. Overnight stay at Coorg.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COORG - MYSORE (117 KMS 03 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"18-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check- out and proceed to Mysore. Check- in&nbsp;to the hotel on arrival then proceeds to visit Maharaja\'s Palace, Chamundi Hill &amp; Big Bull. Evening visit Brindavan Garden. Overnight stay at Mysore.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MYSORE - OOTY (125 KMS 03 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"19-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check- out and proceed to Ooty. Check- in to hotel on arrival then proceeds to visit Ooty Lake &amp; Botanical Garden. Overnight stay at Ooty.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"OOTY - COONOOR EXCURSION\",\"date\":\"20-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed to Coonoor. Visit Sim\'s Park, Lam\'s Rock, Dolphin Nose, Tea Factory &amp; Tea Garden &amp; Doddabetta. Overnight stay at Ooty.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"OOTY - BANGALORE & DEPARTURE (273 KMS 06 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"21-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check- out and proceed to Bangalore to board your train or flight for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/11\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"PALM ERA RESORT\\/ SIMILAR\",\"city\":\"COORG\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MYSORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SAMUDRA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"OOTY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MAJESTIC CROWN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/11\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would no