(123, 'BALAJI SPRAYER, RANCHI', 'Mr MANOJ KUMAR', '9263630448', 'balajeesprayers@gmail.com', 'DIGHA', '2019-08-27', 1, 0, 56, '[]', '[{\"from\":\"RNC\",\"to\":\"HWH\",\"name\":\"KRIYA YOGA EXP\",\"fno\":\"18616\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"39200\",\"id\":1},{\"from\":\"HWH\",\"to\":\"RNC\",\"name\":\"KRIYA YOGA EXP\",\"fno\":\"18615\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Aug 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Aug 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"39200\",\"id\":2}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/08\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DIGHA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PARK PRIME\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":28,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/08\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return <strong>3 AC</strong> Class Railway Tickets <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>AC Accommodation in the above mentioned Hotel on Twin Sharing basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>Welcome drinks</strong> on arrival.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Buffet&nbsp;Breakfast</strong> on <strong>Day 01</strong> &amp; <strong>Day 02</strong>.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Buffet Lunches</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Day 01 </strong>&amp; <strong>Day 02</strong> (03 Veg + 02 Dessert&nbsp;).</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Buffet</strong> <strong>Gala Dinner</strong>&nbsp;on<strong> Day 01</strong>&nbsp;(&nbsp;03 Veg + 02 Dessert&nbsp;)</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Tea /&nbsp;Coffee</strong> with Cookies&nbsp;in the evening during Conference on <strong>Day 01</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Amenities of conference hall like <strong>01 Inauguration Lamp,</strong>&nbsp;<strong>01 screens</strong>, <strong>01 Projector</strong>, <strong>01 PA System</strong>, <strong>02 Cordless Mikes</strong>.</li>\n	<li><b>Free flow of 03 Veg&nbsp;Cocktail Snacks with Liquors (100 Pipers / Teachers / Beer) and Soft Drinks for 90 min.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>01 AC Bus 56 Seater</strong> throughout the tour <strong>HWH Station - Digha Hotel - HWH Station</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Liquor / Event Licence Fee</strong> included for <strong>01 Day.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>DJ Night with&nbsp;Console, Lights, Sounds and Professional Dancers on Day 01.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Main&nbsp;Restaurant</strong> (Maximum 60 pax in theatre style) &nbsp;from <strong>4 pm to 10.45 pm </strong>maximum for conference/event purpose only on <strong>Day 01</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Usage of a swimming pool with proper swimming costume.</li>\n	<li>All Toll / Parking / Driver Allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Optional Cost:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>We can offer you a <strong>Tour Manager</strong> Ex- Ranchi @ <strong>Rs. 10000/- </strong>additional<strong>&nbsp;</strong>who will be joining&nbsp;you from Ranchi and will be taking care of the Group throughout the Tour for a hassle-free &amp; a memorable Trip.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>50%</strong> as an advance&nbsp;to reconfirm your booking.</li>\n	<li>Remaining<strong> 50%</strong> before commencement of the Tour.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78400,\"hotel_cost\":\"100800\",\"transport_cost\":\"30000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"CONFERENCE HALL WITH PA SYSTEM\",\"amount\":6000},{\"name\":\"EXTRA 01 B\\/F + 01 LUNCH (250 + 500)\",\"amount\":\"42000\"},{\"name\":\"LIQUOR + EVENT LICENCE\",\"amount\":10000},{\"name\":\"LIQUOR (100 PIPERS + BEER) @ 2200 X 20 BOTTLES\",\"amount\":44000},{\"name\":\"DJ + DANCER\",\"amount\":40000},{\"name\":\"Cocktail Snacks 03 Veg\",\"amount\":19600},{\"name\":\"Corkage Charges @ 300 Per Botte\",\"amount\":4500},{\"name\":\"Soda + Soft Drinks\",\"amount\":1500},{\"name\":\"Miscellaneous Expenses\",\"amount\":5000}],\"cost_price\":381800,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 57270\",\"selling_price\":439070}', 'MZQ/0120/082019', 439600, 7850, 0, '2019-08-19 19:03:39', '2019-08-19 20:09:06', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(124, 'Dr AMAR KUMAR', NULL, '7979929708', 'dramarhazaribagh@gmail.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2019-10-04', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR | CELLULAR JAIL & LIGHT SHOW\",\"date\":\"04-10-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.<br \\/>\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK | RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"05-10-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Multi Zone Travels only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK | ELEPHANTA BEACH\",\"date\":\"06-10-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning hours proceed for a half day tour to visit ELEPHANTA BEACH for coral viewing by snorkeling. Overnight stay in Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"07-10-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the Kalapathar beach and spend rest of the day at leisure enjoying white sand beaches.&nbsp; In the evening catch the afternoon ferry and return to Port Blair. Our representative will meet you at Port Blair and drop you to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: <\\/strong>Do note that many hotels in Andaman Islands have early check-out timing around 8:00 AM. You may avail activities such as boat ride, snorkeling trip, scuba diving or sea walk or you can discuss with our island expert about any necessary suggestion that you may require.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR | DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"08-10-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"272\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"fare\":35439},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":27762}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"check_out\":\"05\\/10\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHOMPEN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HAYWIZZ HAVELOCK ISLAND RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/10\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"07\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHOMPEN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/10\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair and Havelock with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service at airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side Ferry Tickets Included 2 Side Cruise to Havelock.</li>\n	<li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance by Multi Zone Travel Experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li>\n	<li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from suggested tour itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Lunch &amp; Dinner not included.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":63201,\"land_cost\":\"37955\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":101156,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10115.6\",\"selling_price\":111271.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0121/082019', 111300, 42800, 25700, '2019-08-20 12:27:41', '2019-08-20 12:32:46', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(125, 'Mr ROHAN KUMAR', NULL, '9709027191', 'princesahu00651@gmail.com', 'BALI & KUALA LUMPUR', '2019-11-08', 5, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BALI | PHOTO SHOOT IN TANAH LOT TEMPLE\",\"date\":\"08-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Ngurah Rai Airport, Denpasar, Bali. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for your refreshment. Evening&nbsp;photoshoot in Tanah Lot Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SUNSET DINNER CRUISE | SPA\",\"date\":\"09-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the evening, get ready to feel the romance on board with our Bali Sunset Dinner Cruise. Witness a Balinese sunset while cruising around the harbor. Watch the magical night sky takeover, as you enjoy the sights and sounds of live entertainment onboard your Dinner Cruise. Try some delicious international cuisines (buffet) and dance to the beats of the DJ at the disco. You can also watch an authentic live cabaret show here &amp; Spa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY KINTAMANI + UBUD VILLAGE TOUR\",\"date\":\"10-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel and proceed for a full-day tour of Ubud and Kintamani. With the smoky Agung Volcano in the backdrop, Mount and Lake Batur will keep you mesmerized. Take a stop to watch the famous Barong and Keris dance performance at Singapadu Village. Visit Celuk the center of gold and silver works, Mas the center of woodcarvings, Ubud the center of Balinese paintings, Goa Gajah (elephant cave) and the holy springs of Tirta Empul at Tampaksiring. Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"TANAH LOT TEMPLE SUNSET TOUR\",\"date\":\"11-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit a spectacular Tanah Lot Temple which stands proudly on the rock inside the ocean. Shopping time is available on this visit for any kind of Balinese handicraft products good for souvenirs and or for collection.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After completion of Tour, you will directly be transferred to Airport for your onward flight to Kuala Lumpur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL KUALA LUMPUR | TWIN TOWERS\",\"date\":\"12-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at KL&nbsp;Airport, Malaysia. Our representative will meet and welcome you at the airport. Afterward, proceed to the hotel for Check-in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the Evening Visit Twin Towers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY KL CITY TOUR | AIRPORT DROP\",\"date\":\"13-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today in the morning after having the Breakfast, Check-out from Hotel &amp; keep the luggage in the Reception &amp; move for KL City Tour + KL Tower.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening get transferred to Airport to catch your Return Flight to Kolkata.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"62\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:35 AM\",\"fare\":65095},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia X Airways\",\"fno\":\"798\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"375\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:50 AM\",\"fare\":24498},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Malindo Air\",\"fno\":\"281\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:25 PM\",\"fare\":25775}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JAMBULUWUK OCEANO\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"11\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/11\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"TRIPLE  ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"11\\/11\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JAMBULUWUK OCEANO\",\"city\":\"BALI\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"11\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KUALA LUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL REGAL PARK \\/ STAR POINTS\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KUALA LUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL REGAL PARK \\/ STAR POINTS\",\"room_type\":\"TRIPLE  ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/11\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Return </strong>Economy Class <strong>Flight Tickets</strong> Ex- Kolkata with Hand Baggage (<strong>07 Kgs</strong>).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>BALI&nbsp; INCLUSIONS:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation with <strong>Breakfast </strong>at mentioned Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Return Airport transfers on&nbsp;PVT.</li>\n	<li>Arrival and <strong>Photo Shoot </strong>in Tanah Lot Temple.</li>\n	<li><strong>Tanah Lot Temple</strong> Sunset Tour.</li>\n	<li><strong>Kintamani Volcano&nbsp;View </strong>&amp;&nbsp;<strong>Ubud Village</strong> with Lunch.</li>\n	<li><strong>Sunset Dinner Cruise</strong> and <strong>Spa</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>MALAYSIA INCLUSIONS:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Return Airport transfers on&nbsp;<strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation with <strong>Breakfast </strong>at mentioned Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day KL City Tour + KL Tower on PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Twin Tower&nbsp;</strong>Entrance Only.</li>\n	<li><strong>Malaysia Visa Charges</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_per