top only)</strong>, <strong>2 Ways Cable Car</strong> with <strong>Lunch</strong> on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Sunway Lagoon Theme Park</strong> <strong>(Water Park, Amusement Park, Wildlife Park, Extreme Park, Scream Park, Nickelodeon Park)</strong> on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Malaysia Visa Charges.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"9\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":62412,\"land_cost\":\"152137\",\"visa_cost\":\"16000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":230549,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20749.41\",\"selling_price\":251298.41000000000349245965480804443359375}', 'MZQ/0123/082019', 239500, 65900, 41800, '2019-08-28 13:09:01', '2019-08-28 13:35:21', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
