liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket -&nbsp;<strong>Ex Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> in 3* Deluxe Hotel at Pattaya.</li>\n	<li>All Breakfast &amp; Dinner.</li>\n	<li>En-Route&nbsp; Sriracha Tigar Zoo.</li>\n	<li>Half Day Coral Island Tour.</li>\n	<li>Nong Noch Village.</li>\n	<li>Safari World with Marine Park.</li>\n	<li>Bangkok City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Visa on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Tour Co-Ordinator Ex- Kolkata.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeings on PVT basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"0\",\"hotel_cost\":\"252000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":252000}', 'MZQ/0124/082019', 240002, 34286, 0, '2019-08-30 17:18:07', '2019-09-05 16:33:06', 1, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(128, 'Dr Brij Bhushan', NULL, '6202155593', 'holidays@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2019-10-06', 4, 0, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN DUBAI\",\"date\":\"06-10-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive Dubai and Transfer to Hotel. Overnight stay at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI || DUBAI CITY TOUR || BURJ KALIFA 124TH FLOOR\",\"date\":\"07-10-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast proceeds for <strong>Half Day City Tour<\\/strong> journey going back in time. A tour focusing on Dubai\\u2019s carefully preserved history and past heritage at its best! The tour highlights include the following: Photo stop outside one of the world\\u2019s most luxurious all-suite hotel \\u2013 Burj Al Arab, renowned for its superlative luxury! Drive down the stretch of Palm Jumeirah (no stops) &amp; drive around Dubai Marina (no stops). Proceed next to Dubai museum, housed in the Al Fahidi Fort. Small in size yet big in content \\u2013 a museum like no other! Opened as recently as 1971, it presents traditional way of Emirati life and many artifacts from discoveries as old as 3000 B.C. We then proceed past the Spice souk, once the center for allspice trading in the country! Finally, we reach the famous and most visited area- the Gold Souq, famous for its hundreds of Gold retail shops. Return to hotel Lunch at Hotel. Arrive at Dubai Mall and free time.&nbsp;View of Fountain show at Dubai Mall.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Visit Burj Khalifa<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We offer you a chance to join us on a trip to the viewing platform of the tallest building in the world - Burj Khalifa, located on the 124th floor. From the height of 650 meters, you will experience a fantastic view of Dubai, the World Islands, the Palm Islands, and even adjacent Emirates. Based on the vision by the architects of the entire complex, the super skyscraper is meant to become a gravitational point of the new Dubai downtown where the largest shopping mall in the world; Dubai Mall, office blocks, various private apartment buildings, and Souk Al Bahar; a shopping mall with an emphasize on tradition and culture items, i.e.: art and souvenirs. The inspiration behind the design of the building for Chicago based architect Adrian Smith was a desert flower. Depart from Dubai Mall and transfer to local Indian Restaurant Dinner at a local Indian Restaurant. Return to hotel &amp; Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST, LUNCH &amp; DINNER)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI || DESERT SAFARI\",\"date\":\"08-10-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast morning is free or you may take optional sightseeing as per your choice.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Depart for the Dune Dinner Safari.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Desert Safari<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Full of fun adventure and excitement where you experience the thrill of a roller coaster ride on the sand dunes. We stop on the highest sand dune to view the beautiful sunset for some breathtaking photographs and refresh your selves with mineral water. We then continue our journey to our Bedouin Campsite located in the heart of the Desert, where soft drink, water, tea or coffees are available for you to choose from. Camel rides wait for you. Trial of local smoking called Shisha or Hubbly Bubbly on different flavors. While you relax and recline in the tents or tables with carpet and pillows a delicious BBQ is being prepared under the starlit sky. Adding to the atmosphere of the night, an enchanting belly dancer shows a fascinating dance to a rhythm of an Arabic music, thereafter BBQ buffet dinner will be served.&nbsp;Return to hotel after the safari.&nbsp;Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST &amp; DINNER)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DUBAI TO ABU DHABI (139 KMS 02 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"09-10-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p><strong>Abu Dhabi City Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Abu Dhabi is the Federal capital and the largest among the seven members of the United Arab Emirates. It has a beautiful corniche and is a very well spread out city which has been growing steadily and has a clear future vision of its own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>During a half-day orientation tour, we try to explore the main attractions of city in a comprehensive way! In approximately an hour and a half out of Dubai, witnessing the magnificent desert landscapes en route, we reach Abu Dhabi. On arrival, we visit Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, which is one the world\\u2019s largest mosque with a capacity of approximate 40,000 worshippers and features 82 domes, over 1,000 columns, 24-carat gold gilded chandeliers and the world\'s largest hand-knotted carpet (IMP: Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque has strict dress code policy). The Tour also covers a drive via the charming and picturesque stretch of greenery and coastline called the Corniche, a photo stop outside the Emirates Palace Hotel and a drive through Yas Island.&nbsp;Lunch at a local Indian Restaurant.Arrive at Ferrari World Abu Dhabi and free time<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Ferrari World<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>The Ferrari World at Abu Dhabi features a host of rides and attractions to create an unforgettable experience for every member of the family. Guests of all ages experience every facet of the Ferrari story. Go behind the scenes, live the triumphs, feel the passion and surround yourself in the beauty of Italy. There is a world just for kids where the Ferrari magic comes to life. Junior Pilots get behind the wheel, learn to drive and cruise through mini streets in Ferrari cars just their size. Cruising in Dubai Creek + Dinner on board the Dhow.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dhow Dinner Cruise<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Experience the genuine Arabian hospitality, relaxing atmosphere, and traditional dhow trip \\u2013 try our nightly cruises onboard the biggest dhow. What could be more romantic than dinner on the cruise. Enjoy the soft breeze and gentle lapping waves as we glide gently pass through the illuminated mosques, palaces, Heritage Village that are reminiscent of the days gone by, and buildings that displays today\\u2019s modern architecture. A delightful &amp; diverse international buffet cuisine awaits the guests. Dinner is served with complimentary soft drinks and mineral water.&nbsp;Return to pier &amp; Transfer to hotel Arrive at Hotel &amp; Overnight at Hotel.&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST, LUNCH &amp; DINNER)<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM DUBAI\",\"date\":\"10-10-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast check out (12 pm), free time for shopping at your own. At 06:00 pm transfer to the airport for your departure flight.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>(BREAKFAST)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"21\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"22\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"10\\/10\\/2019\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"hotel_name\":\"GULF COURT HOTEL, BUSINESS BAY  \\/ SIMILAR\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>4*</strong> Hotel in Dubai.</li>\n	<li>Meals as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Half Day Dubai Guided City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Desert Safari tour with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance, Tanura Show.</li>\n	<li>Dhow Cruise with Buffet Dinner.</li>\n	<li>Burj Khalifa<strong> (124th Floor).</strong></li>\n	<li>Visit to Dubai Mall &amp; Fountain Show.</li>\n	<li>Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque with Ferrari World.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeings on PVT basis.</li>\n	<li>Tour Co-ordinator <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Visa fee &amp; OTB.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any increase in the Visa fees, Airfare / Taxes charged by the airlines on your air ticket.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee. <strong>(15 Dirham per room per night)</strong></li>\n	<li>Anything not specifically mentioned in the Package Tour Price includes box.</li>\n	<li>Cost of extension of the validity or deviation from the route of your air ticket.</li>\n	<li>Late checkout. (Normal check-out time is 12 PM)</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"0\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"62857\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":62857,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":62857}', 'MZQ/0125/092019', 62857, 62857, 46666, '2019-09-03 12:25:12', '2019-10-14 17:10:44', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(129, 'Mr RITESH KUMAR', NULL, '9931781783', NULL, 'ANDAMAN', '2019-12-14', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR | CELLULAR JAIL & LIGHT SHOW\",\"date\":\"14-12-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.<br \\/>\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK | RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"15-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Multi Zone Travels only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK | DAY AT LEISURE\",\"date\":\"16-12-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>How about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving and Sea Walk can be done on this day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"17-12-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the Kalapathar beach and spend rest of the day at leisure enjoying white sand beaches.&nbsp; In the evening catch the afternoon ferry and return to Port Blair. Our representative will meet you at Port Blair and drop you to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: <\\/strong>Do note that many hotels in Andaman Islands have early check-out timing around 8:00 AM. You may avail activities such as boat ride, snorkeling trip, scuba diving or sea walk or you can discuss with our island expert about any necessary suggestion that you may require.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR | DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"18-12-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"272\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":35492},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"fare\":33232}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"NK INTERNATIONAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"15\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"15\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"RADHAKRISHNA  RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"NK INTERNATIONAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair and Havelock with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service at the airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>Private AC Vehicle</strong> at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side Ferry Tickets Included <strong>2 Side Cruise</strong> to Havelock.</li>\n	<li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance by Multi Zone Travel Experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li>\n	<li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from the suggested tour itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Lunch &amp; Dinner not included.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":68724,\"hotel_cost\":\"61600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":130324,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13032.4\",\"selling_price\":143356.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0126/092019', 143200, 35800, 0, '2019-09-10 09:53:03', '2019-09-10 09:55:34', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(130, 'Mr RUPESH KUMAR', NULL, '8294727527', 'rupesh3004@gmail.com', 'MALDIVES', '2019-10-04', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN MALDIVES\",\"date\":\"04-10-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome To Maldives! From the Maldives International airport speed boat transfer will be ready to reach the Paradise Island Resort. Without the hustle-bustle of distracting tourists, here you can truly enjoy not just the flawless beauty of nature but also each others undisturbed company especially on a romantic honeymoon. Check in to your Resort and Overnight stay at Resort.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"EXPLORE THE ISLAND\",\"date\":\"05-10-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have an entire day at leisure, so Explore and Enjoy. Spend your days relaxing only a few feet above the blue waters of the Indian Ocean, soaking up the sun from your private chaise while getting pampered by our attentive staff. Overnight stay at resort.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"A DAY TO EXPERIENCE ADVENTURE\",\"date\":\"06-10-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>You can enjoy various water sports activities here at your own cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Paradise Island is not just a place for relaxation - Its also a place for unparalleled adventure! Against the backdrop of an endless horizon, enjoy this Maldives resorts many water activities Catamaran Sailing -What\'s a better way of relaxing and enjoying the sun and the crystal blues of Maldives than to sail a catamaran. Experience the speed and thrill of sailing a catamaran. Windsurfing -Do you enjoy the sun, water, and exercise? Then come and try windsurfing! Never tried windsurfing? No problem, our instructors can teach you. With a reasonable breeze throughout the year that makes for perfect windsurfing conditions. It is a lot of fun to slide the waves. Canoeing -Get kitted and ready to paddle! These non-motorized crafts are for those who seek tranquility, nature and a bit of workout Jet Skiing -If waterskiing is not for you or you would like to try something a little different, try out our jet scooters. Ride the waves on our most popular watercraft. Operation and safety instructions are provided and life jackets are mandatory. Parasailing-you are never too old to experience something new. not very often in life does an opportunity present itself to fly without wings and have a bird\'s eye view of an island as beautiful as paradise. safety is our priority, and our new technology allows you to launch and return right to the dry platform with a smile that stretches from ear to ear.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"A RELAX DAY TO ENJOY\",\"date\":\"07-10-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have an entire day at leisure, so Explore and Enjoy at your own. Go and take Spa treatment with your love. In a quiet corner of the island, the Araamu Spa is a precious retreat within the resort. Put yourself into the sensitive hands of our experienced therapists and enjoy the sensual pleasure of a great massage. And there no need to be selfish about it, The Araamu Spa tucked away in a secluded corner of the island features 17 treatment rooms for massages, body treatments, and facials, of which 04 rooms are exclusively for Ayurvedic treatment and 01 room for hydrotherapy treatment. Each of the private treatment room features an outdoor courtyard, shower and flower bath making it the perfect choice. Any treatment here will make you feel like your in a heavenly sanctuary.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM MALDIVES | DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"08-10-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post Breakfast departure to the airport for your onward journey.&nbsp;Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5316\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":16563},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1784\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"fare\":70140},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1785\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"483\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":21351}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/10\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MALDIVES\",\"hotel_name\":\"PARADISE ISLAND RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR BEACH BUNGALOW\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"08\\/10\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights </strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;rooms as given at hotels in Maldives.</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan - Half Board.&nbsp;<strong>(Breakfast and Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>Airport Transfer by Speedboat.</li>\n	<li>Assistance at the airport by Hotel representatives.</li>\n	<li>Welcome drinks on arrival.</li>\n	<li>A Bottle of Water 500ml per person per day to be placed in the room.</li>\n	<li>Tea /Coffee making facilities (1 set of Tea/Coffee per room per day)</li>\n	<li>Free WIFI in all rooms Gymnasium (excluding personal trainer)</li>\n	<li>Land sports include&nbsp;Badminton, Snooker/ Billiards, Table Tennis, Beach Volleyball, Squash, Sauna, Steam bath, Daylight Tennis, Basketball, Jacuzzi (excluding coach and instructors) Windsurfing and canoeing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;Any boating charges (motor boat/pedal boat).</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Any additional expenses incurred due to any flight delay or cancellation, weather conditions, political closures, technical faults, etc.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":108054,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"82000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":190054,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19005.4\",\"selling_price\":209059.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0127/092019', 209300, 76200, 56900, '2019-09-10 17:47:16', '2019-09-12 18:45:28', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(131, 'Mr ROHIT ORAON', NULL, '8210677785', 'rohit.oraon@savethechildren.in', 'ANDAMAN', '2020-02-22', 4, 3, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR | CELLULAR JAIL & LIGHT SHOW\",\"date\":\"22-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.<br \\/>\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK | RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"23-02-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Multi Zone Travels only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK | DAY AT LEISURE\",\"date\":\"24-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>How about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving and Sea Walk can be done on this day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"25-02-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the Kalapathar beach and spend rest of the day at leisure enjoying white sand beaches.&nbsp; In the evening catch the afternoon ferry and return to Port Blair. Our representative will meet you at Port Blair and drop you to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: <\\/strong>Do note that many hotels in Andaman Islands have early check-out timing around 8:00 AM. You may avail activities such as boat ride, snorkeling trip, scuba diving or sea walk or you can discuss with our island expert about any necessary suggestion that you may require.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR | DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"26-02-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"fare\":13675},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"272\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":41752},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6616\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"fare\":27336},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"549\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"fare\":14025}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"NK INTERNATIONAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/02\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"RADHAKRISHNA  RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/02\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"NK INTERNATIONAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/02\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additiona