ation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Train ticket from BWN to NJP in <strong>3AC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Flight Ticket from <strong>Bagdogra</strong> to&nbsp;<strong>Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on DBL Sharing Basis in the mentioned Hotels above.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive Luxury Vehicle for all transfers &amp; sightseeing.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><b>Vehicle will be available as per itinerary only.</b></li>\n	<li>All hotel taxes etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":25590,\"hotel_cost\":40800,\"transport_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":94390,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13214.6\",\"selling_price\":107604.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0131/092019', 107500, 25500, 5500, '2019-09-18 13:53:11', '2019-09-18 13:54:37', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(135, 'Mr RAJAT BEHL', NULL, '9905132408', 'rajat@stmichaelsranchi.com', 'SRI LANKA', '2019-11-30', 8, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"30-11-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Sri Lanka. You will be met by Multi Zone Travels representatives and transferred to COLOMBO. (Travel time approx: 1 hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel Colombo.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO-KANDY\",\"date\":\"01-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed to Kandy.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Proceed to *Kandy Visit *Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic - ever since 4th Century A.D, when the Buddha\'s Tooth was brought to Sri Lanka hidden from sacrilegious hands in an Orissan princess\' hair, the Relic has grown in repute and holiness in Sri Lanka and throughout the Buddhist world. It is considered Sri Lanka\'s most prized possession. *Gem Gallery visit The world\'s best gems are available in Sri Lanka such as Blue and Yellow Sapphire, Star Ruby and Star Sapphire, Chrysoberyl Cat\'s Eye, Alexandrite, Topaz, Amethyst, Quartz, Garnet, Aquamarine, Moonstone, Tourmaline When comparing with other countries you will be lucky to buy pure and valuable gems at Sri Lanka for a competitive price. You can get the education about gems, making jewelry and other requests with them. You can buy gold, white gold and silver jewelry at your choice. You can even get them Tailor Made as per your preference. *Evening witness the Cultural Dance Show featuring various dancing types of Sri Lanka.&nbsp;Overnight stay at the Hotel, Kandy.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY-NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"02-12-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed to Nuwara Eliya.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Nuwara Eliya.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"03-12-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel. En-route visit Ramboda Hanumanji Temple, Tea Plantation &amp; Ramboda Falls Continue to Nuwara Eliya &amp; enjoy the scenic beauty of hill country *Nuwara Eliya - The \'Little England\' of Sri Lanka, is set against beautiful backdrops of Mountains, Valleys, Waterfalls, and Tea Plantations. It is supposed to be one of the coolest places in the Island, but it is really just like an English spring day, although the temperature does drop at night. All around Nuwara Eliya you will see evidence of the British influence, houses like country cottages or Queen Ann style mansions. The Victoria Park, in the middle of the town, is a lovely place for a stroll or a picnic and is also good for Birding as you get some rare birds in this Park. Seasons may be absent elsewhere in Sri Lanka, but here you can read them by the flowers, which bloom in the spring (March to May) and the fall (August and September). These are the \\\"seasons\\\" when low-country folk flock to Nuwara Eliya to escape the sea level heat and humidity. *Seetha Amman Temple &amp; Asoka Vatika visit in the evening<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Nuwara Eliya.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA- UNAWATUNA\",\"date\":\"04-12-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds to Unawatuna.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Unawatuna.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"UNAWATUNA\",\"date\":\"05-12-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel. Unawatuna City Tours.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Unawatuna.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"UNAWATUNA-BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"06-12-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds to Bentota.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Commence a city tour &amp; sightseeing at Bentota - *Maadu River Ride \\/ Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery \\/ Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride &amp; Tube Ride) Bentota lies at the finishing end of the \\\"Golden Mile\\\" which is an hour\'s drive from Colombo. Famous for its prime beaches Bentota is today one of Sri Lanka\'s most sought after tourist destinations. The town of Bentota actually, sits on an estuary, where the river and the sea meet. This makes the area quite famous for water sports like windsurfing, scuba diving &amp; snorkeling.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Bentota.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA-COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"07-12-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds to Colombo.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to Colombo for City &amp; Shopping Tour *Colombo - a drive through the city taking you to the busy commercial areas as well as the tree-lined residential, Cinnamon Gardens. Visit Fort, the former British administrative center and military garrison, Sea Street - the Goldsmith\'s quarters in the heart of Pettah, the Bazaar area, where is also a Hindu Temple with elaborate stone carvings, and the Dutch Church of Wolfendhal dating back to 1749. Also, visit the BMICH, see the replica of Avukana Buddha &amp; the Independence Square. *Shopping in Colombo.......visit *ODEL Unlimited provides ample opportunity indulge, not only in shopping for designer wear apparel for the whole family, but also take taste buds on a voyage of discovery.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Colombo.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"08-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out and proceed to Airport for your departure flight accordingly. Have a safe flight!!!<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":43736},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1205\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1202\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"183\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"997\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL OZO\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"room_type\":\"SLEEP ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL EARLS REGENCY\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"02\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"NUWARA ELIYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GOLDEN RIDGE\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"04\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"04\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"UNAWATUNA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CANTALOUPE LEVELS\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"06\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BENTOTA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CENTARA CEYSANDS\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR RIVER VIEW ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"07\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL OZO\",\"room_type\":\"SLEEP ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>EX- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>8 nights\' accommodation at the above mentioned Hotels or Similar</li>\n	<li><b>8 Breakfast&nbsp;+ 5 Dinners at hotels &amp; 2 Dinners at an outside restaurant.</b></li>\n	<li>Gem Gallery Visit</li>\n	<li>Kandy Cultural Show - Gem Gallery visit is a must to obtain the complimentary coupon for Kandy Cultural Show</li>\n	<li>Spice Garden visit</li>\n	<li>Transportation in A/C vehicle on PVT Basis</li>\n	<li>Services of English-Speaking Chauffer Guide</li>\n	<li>Arrival &amp; Departure Assistance at the Airport</li>\n	<li>City Tour &amp; Shopping</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Value additions by Multi Zone&nbsp;Travels:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>500ml X 02 Mineral Water Bottles - per person per day throughout the tour</li>\n	<li>5% worth of discount voucher for ODEL</li>\n	<li>BUY LKR 6000 worth CASINO Coupons and get a Discount of LKR 1000 - INCLUDING Lunch/Dinner and extra snacks/drinks while playing @ Bally\'s Casino</li>\n	<li>Complimentary SIM card on arrival with zero balance</li>\n	<li>Wheelchair for differently-abled&nbsp;people - This should be notified prior to the arrival</li>\n	<li>Complimentary cut fruits @ Mawanella Spice Garden</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tips &amp; Portage</li>\n	<li>Meals Other than Mentioned Above</li>\n	<li>Camera &amp; Video Permits</li>\n	<li>Early check-in &amp; Late check-out.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fee mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Supplement costs:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride, Tube Ride) - USD 10 per person</li>\n	<li>Gangaramaya Floating Temple in Colombo - USD 02 per person</li>\n	<li>Temple of the Tooth Relic - USD 08 per person</li>\n	<li>Peradeniya Royal Botanical Garden - USD 09 per person</li>\n	<li>Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage - USD 07 per person</li>\n	<li>Maadu River Ride - USD 07 per person</li>\n	<li>Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery - USD 03 per person</li>\n	<li>Hakgala Garden - USD 12 per person</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Special Remarks</strong></p>\n\n<p>Clothing -</p>\n\n<p>General&nbsp;- Sri Lanka is a tropical country, hence light-weighted clothing is recommended other than for specific regions</p>\n\n<p>UpCountry / Nuwara Eliya areas&nbsp;- Light warm clothing recommended</p>\n\n<p>Hiking/water sport/swimming&nbsp;- Appropriate clothing and shoes are a must</p>\n\n<p>Places of Worship&nbsp;- As a mark of respect, both genders should cover shoulders and knees when entering a place of worship in Sri Lanka. No sleeveless and shorts are allowed. You are also required to remove shoes and caps/hats</p>\n\n<p><strong>Kindly note -</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Check-in time 1400/Check out 1200.</li>\n	<li>Surcharges and supplements maybe applicable during certain periods.</li>\n	<li>Kindly note that once the hotels get confirmed and thereafter if an amendment or cancellation occurs for any reason, a penalty will be applicable in all cases which will depend on what our overseas supplier charges to us. This cannot be waived off and has to be borne by the client.</li>\n	<li>The above special rates may be withdrawn without prior notice.</li>\n	<li>Transportation does not include transfers for dinner or any other meal or any other sight other than mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Booking must be guaranteed to go ahead with the reservation</li>\n	<li>If group size / no of nights reduce the rates will be renegotiated.</li>\n	<li>If the number of nights reduces or increases the rates have to be renegotiated.</li>\n	<li>Please note the above rates are current and subject to currency fluctuations and change without prior notice.</li>\n	<li>No reservation has been generated. Hotel availability subject to change at the time of reservation.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":43736,\"land_cost\":\"92160\",\"visa_cost\":\"3600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":139496,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19529.44\",\"selling_price\":159025.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0132/092019', 159600, 79800, 0, '2019-09-18 19:30:03', '2019-09-19 11:08:59', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(136, 'Ms SHALINI SINGH', NULL, '9430303432', '1202shalini@gmail.com', 'BALI', '2019-12-23', 5, 0, 4, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"62\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:35 AM\",\"fare\":145444},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Indonesia Airways\",\"fno\":\"551\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Indonesia Airways\",\"fno\":\"554\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"63\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BALI\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"28\\/12\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PARK REGIS\",\"room_type\":\"REGIS ROOM\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex - Kolkata with 07 Kgs Hand Baggage only.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights</strong> Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel. (Except on arrival day)</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide assistance on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Bounty Evening Cruises</strong>&nbsp;incl. International Buffet Dinner<strong> </strong>with a transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Full-Day Kintamani &amp; Ubud Tour</strong> incl. Barong Dance and Local Lunch with a transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Water Sports&nbsp;Activities</strong> including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with a transfer on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>120 Minutes </strong>Traditional Balinese Massage with a transfer on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Tanah Lot Sunset Tour&nbsp;</strong>with a transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Checking Baggage of <strong>20 Kgs</strong> will be additional <strong>@5000 Per Pax.</strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":145444,\"land_cost\":\"63869\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":209313,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20931.3\",\"selling_price\":230244.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0133/092019', 230400, 57600, 0, '2019-09-19 18:42:02', '2019-09-20 11:18:45', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
