this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation in 3* Hotel with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Burj Khalifa- 124th Floor with Return Transfer - SIC Basis</li>\n	<li>City tour of Dubai with English Speaking Guide - SIC Basis</li>\n	<li>Desert Safari tour with Barbecue dinner &amp; Belly Dance with return transfer - SIC Basis</li>\n	<li>Dhow Cruise including buffet dinner with return transfer on SIC - SIC Basis</li>\n	<li>Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque and Ferrari World&nbsp;With return Transfer - PVT Basis.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":103732,\"land_cost\":\"116720\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":220452,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22045.2\",\"selling_price\":242497.2000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0134/092019', 242000, 60500, 0, '2019-09-26 19:13:22', '2019-09-26 19:13:22', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
