ur including Local Lunch at Kintamani&nbsp;with a transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Water sports</strong>&nbsp;activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with a transfer on <strong>SIC</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>120 minutes</strong>&nbsp;of spa treatment with a transfer on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":54902,\"land_cost\":\"28819\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"25 KGS LUGGAGE FOR 01 PAX EACH SECTOR\",\"amount\":6595}],\"cost_price\":90316,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18966.36\",\"selling_price\":109282.360000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0141/0102019', 109800, 54900, 0, '2019-10-19 18:28:19', '2019-12-10 14:09:01', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
