 of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation in the mentioned hotel with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Desert Safari tour with Barbecue dinner &amp; Belly Dance on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>Burj Khalifa ticket- <strong>124th Floor</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>Dhow Cruise including buffet dinner&nbsp;on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>City tour of Abu Dhabi with English Speaking Guide&nbsp;on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>Abu Dhabi Grand Mosque and Ferrari World&nbsp;on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>U.A.E Tourist Visa.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Sightseeings on <strong>SIC Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;Transfers&nbsp;on <strong>PVT Basis.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"9\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":126700,\"land_cost\":\"160784\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":287484,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25873.56\",\"selling_price\":313357.5599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0142/0102019', 313200, 78300, 0, '2019-10-26 09:47:07', '2019-10-26 09:47:07', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(146, 'Mr ARUP GHOSH', NULL, '9661164775', 'arupghoshsafari@gmail.com', 'MALDIVES', '2019-12-18', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival In Mumbai\",\"date\":\"18-12-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival &amp; Check-in to hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & transfer to Varu by Atmosphere\",\"date\":\"19-12-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Check-out from the hotel and depart to the Airport for your onward travel to the Maldives.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enter the magical island country of Maldives. As you arrive at the Male International Airport, an agency&nbsp;representative will receive you and escort you and your family to the resort.<br \\/>\\nComplete the check-in formalities and enjoy your arrival at your Beach Villa with welcome drinks. Your day is at leisure and you can relax at the beach or in your grand room. Proceed for the daily evening entertainment show, later in the day. Enjoy a hearty dinner buffet in the main restaurant at the resort and retreat to your room for a peaceful night\'s&nbsp;sleep.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Enjoy Leisure Day at the Island\",\"date\":\"20-12-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have the entire day at leisure. Explore the Island and VARU by Atmosphere resort at your own. Varu is a term in the Native Maldivian language of Dhivehi with connotations of strength, resilience, and life in abundance.The 5-star resort will offer a truly Maldivian experience by incorporating aspects of local traditions and cultures, structural design - fused together with bursts of chic tropical vibes.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"A Day  suggested for Water Activities\",\"date\":\"21-12-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In this Tour Package, you can enjoy various water sports activities complimentary like Windsurf board &amp; sail, Catamaran, Canoe, Standup paddleboard Hang on for dear life. Laughter and shrieks of excitement fill the air. A rainbow spray of water. Cutting throug h the waves, free as a bird. Paddle across the atoll in a kayak. Ride a strong gust on a clear morning.<br \\/>\\nThe balance on a catamaran. Parasailing, wakeboarding, jet skiing Snorkelling. An array of water sports activities and facilities to indulge in. So many ways to soar. Overnight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Maldives to Mumbai\",\"date\":\"22-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast transfer to the Male Airport with happy memories of the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive Mumbai &amp; Check-in to hotel.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mumbai | Day Free on Own\",\"date\":\"23-12-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today day is free on own for shopping &amp; city tour.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mumbai to Ranchi\",\"date\":\"24-12-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Check-out from the hotel and depart to the Airport for your return travel to Ranchi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After reaching home do share the pics from your trip with us so that we can create a video souvenir of your trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"787\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":9896},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"23\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":53962},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"24\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"2502\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":11230}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL THE LALIT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/12\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"9452\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MALDIVES\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL VARU BY ATMOSPHERE\",\"room_type\":\"WATER VILLAS WITH POOL\",\"check_out\":\"22\\/12\\/2019\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":3,\"rate\":\"0\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"22\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HILTON\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"14652\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel The Lalit, Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Varu By Atmosphere, Maldives</strong>&nbsp;with All Meals.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Hilton, Mumbai</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Transfers by Speedboat on <strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner served at the All-Day Dining our main restaurant; the combination of a sumptuous buffet, live cooking stations, theme nights &amp; grill.</li>\n	<li>Selection of snacks daily from 16:00-18:00 HRS at the Main Pool Bar Premium brands of spirits, beer, liqueur available at Main Pool Bar and All-Day Dining &nbsp;Unlimited cocktails &amp; Mocktails, signature drinks, various juices, soft drinks, mineral water,&nbsp;selection of tea &amp;amp; coffee available from the VARU Plan Cocktails, Spirits &amp; Beer Menu&nbsp;Wide selection of Premium wines from world-over &amp; bubbles from the VARU Plan.</li>\n	<li>In Villa minibar stocked with beer/wines/soft beverages &amp;amp; selection of snacks &nbsp;replenished TWICE DAILY</li>\n	<li>20% discount on first TWO regular dives per guest. (Guest Must hold a PADI certified, discounts applicable on dive only)</li>\n	<li>Access to the Sports &amp; Recreation Centre; fully equipped gymnasium, outdoor &amp;amp; indoor recreational activities.</li>\n	<li>An array of daily organized activities for Children &amp; Young Adults Various other activities on a weekly &amp; seasonal basis.</li>\n	<li>Visa on arrival free of cost.</li>\n	<li>Green tax included.</li>\n	<li>All luxury taxes, Service Charges.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":75088,\"land_cost\":\"186480\",\"hotel_cost\":24104},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":285672,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 59991.12\",\"selling_price\":345663.119999999995343387126922607421875}', 'MZQ/0143/0102019', 345800, 172900, 0, '2019-10-26 12:55:57', '2019-10-26 15:26:34', 0, 0, '\"<p>FAQ\'s<br \\/>\\n<strong>What is the currency of Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nThe official currency of the Maldives is Rufiyaa and Laare. Although, USD is widely accepted throughout the island. The major restaurants and hotels accept USD as a payment method.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>Is Maldives a good destination for the honeymoon?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nYes, Maldives is famous for its luxurious beach resorts and private villas. It is known for its tranquillity and romantic spots which makes it a great destination for a luxurious honeymoon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>How many days are required to travel all around Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nAs Maldives is a group of islands, there is nothing as such to see around Maldives. It is known for its luxurious resort life. Hence, it depends on how many days you want to relax at the beach resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>Where can I get my money exchanged?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nIt is not necessary for you to exchange your currency in Rufiyaa. Most of the people prefer USD and hence you need to carry USD to Maldives to make the payments. Also, Rufiyaa will not be accepted\\/ exchanged at the airport, so make sure you spend MVR on the islands before your departure. Traveller\'s cheque and credit\\/debit cards are widely accepted in Maldives so payment is not a problem here.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>What is the procedure to apply for the visa?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nYou do not need to acquire a visa to the Maldives beforehand. The Maldives government issue visa on arrival to most of the countries provided that your passport has a minimum validity of 6 months.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What is the process to get a visa on arrival for the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nIndians can get a visa on arrival for 30 days in the Maldives. Travellers are required to carry all the necessary documents- travel vouchers, stay and hotel information and a valid passport. Visitors who do not have a hotel reservation need to carry $30 with them while acquiring a visa on arrival.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What is the fee of visa to the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nThere is no visa fee for Indians to obtain a visa to the Maldives. You need to show valid travel documents and an amount of $100 per day, per person to obtain the visa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What type of clothes are best suited for the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nLight summer clothes and beachwear are preferred in Maldives. Make sure you carry sunscreen, hats to protect yourself from sun.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What are the languages spoken in the Maldives? Are Hindi and English prevalent in the country?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nThe official language is an Indo-European language called Dhivehi (or Maldivian); Arabic, Hindi, and English are also spoken on the island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What is the mode of transport in the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nAs the country is the cluster of many islands, you will first arrive in Male. From Male, you are required to take a to your desired destination (if it is not in Male). There is only one mode of transportation i.e by sea. You can either take a dhoni (sailboats), seaplane or cruise ships to travel around.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>Are seaplanes available all day and what is the baggage limit for it?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nNo, seaplanes operate only during the daytime from 6 AM- 4 PM. If your arrival timings fall beyond this, you need to stay in Male before taking the seaplane to your destination. Secondly, the seaplane transfer resort baggage should be 15 kg per person only.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What is the best time to visit the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nYou can visit the Maldives all around the year as the island country is pleasant all around the year.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>What type of food will I find on the island?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMaldives is a tourist destination with a mix of different cultures and traditions. You will find the cuisine of different parts of the world. Seafood is the speciality of the island.<br \\/>\\nVegetarian food is also available here. There is a separate section in the menu for the vegetarian dishes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>What are the best souvenirs to buy in the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMaldives is famous for its virgin coconut oils, Lacquer pens, Huvan art products and sea shells products.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(147, 'MR AMAN', NULL, '8210738526', 'Kumaramansingh123@gmail.com', 'KERALA', '2019-11-02', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Cochin\",\"date\":\"02-11-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Cochin International airport and then transfer to the hotel <strong>on your own<\\/strong>.&nbsp;Over night at the hotel.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin - Munnar (127 Kms Approx 04 Hours)\",\"date\":\"03-11-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning departs for Munnar enjoying the scenic beauty &amp; the marvelous waterfalls, high mountains with the low flying clouds passing by. On arrival at Munnar and check-in at your resort. In the evening you can go for sightseeing of Munnar and witness tea gardens spread like a green carpet over hundreds of kilometers, lush green hills, a place so difficult to describe. Overnight stay in the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar\",\"date\":\"04-11-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Following breakfast, you can start the full day sightseeing in Munnar. Visit - Mattupetty Lake &amp; Dam, Echo Point, Kundale Lake, Blossom Garden, Rajamalai, Eravikulam Wildlife sanctuary a top peak of Munnar where you can see Neelgiril Thar (mountain goats), tea gardens and tea factory. Overnight stay in the hotel.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar -Thekkady (91 Kms Approx 03 Hours)\",\"date\":\"05-11-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Following breakfast, you can start the journey to Thekkady drive through panoramic western that hills covered with spice plantations and occasional view of waterfalls and streams Visit the sightseeing points in and around Thekkady which includes boating through Periyar lake - South India\\u2019s most popular wildlife sanctuary, its home to bison, wild elephant, boar, languor, the great Indian tiger and more. Then you can visit spice villages, and Elephant ride, etc. Overnight stay in the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey ( Houseboat)  (137 Kms Approx 04 Hours)\",\"date\":\"06-11-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning after breakfast Proceed to Alleppey. On arrival check in to the hotel. Overnight stay in the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"07-11-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After morning breakfast departs to Cochin Airport for your return journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"COCHIN\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL THE BLOOMS\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/11\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"2128\",\"room_type\":\"BLOOM ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RANGERS\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIER ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/11\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"4438\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"05\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"THEKKADY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL STERLING\",\"room_type\":\"CLASSIC ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/11\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"2557\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPEY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CAMELOT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/11\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"3379\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in the mentioned hotel in <strong>Cochin</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accommodation in the mentioned hotel in <strong>Munnar</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in the mentioned hotel in <strong>Thekkady</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in the mentioned hotel in <strong>Alleppey</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Swift Dzire</strong> from <strong>Day 02 to Day 06.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Toll, Parking &amp; Driver Allowance.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":12502,\"transport_cost\":\"16500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":29002,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5800.4\",\"selling_price\":34802.4000000000014551915228366851806640625}', 'MZQ/0144/0102019', 33176, 16588, 0, '2019-10-29 19:22:09', '2019-10-29 19:25:13', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(148, 'Mr ARUP GHOSH', NULL, '9661164775', 'arupghoshsafari@gmail.com', 'SEYCHELLES', '2019-12-18', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival In Mumbai\",\"date\":\"18-12-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Mumbai Airport &amp; Check-in to hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Seychelles Arrival & transfer to Hotel\",\"date\":\"19-12-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after Breakfast Check-out from Hotel &amp; transfer to Mumbai&nbsp;Airport for your onward travel to Seychelles.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrival at Seychelles &amp; transfer to Hotel Banyan Tree.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>(Breakfast&nbsp;&amp; Dinner)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Enjoy Leisure Day at the Island\",\"date\":\"20-12-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have the entire day at leisure. Explore the Island and <strong>Banyan Tree <\\/strong>resort on your own.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>(Breakfast&nbsp;&amp; Dinner)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Enjoy Leisure Day at the Island\",\"date\":\"21-12-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have the entire day at leisure. Explore the Island and <strong>Banyan Tree <\\/strong>resort on your own.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>(Breakfast&nbsp;&amp; Dinner)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Enjoy Leisure Day at the Island\",\"date\":\"22-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have the entire day at leisure. Explore the Island and <strong>Banyan Tree <\\/strong>resort on your own.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>(Breakfast&nbsp;&amp; Dinner)<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Seychelles To Mumbai\",\"date\":\"23-12-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after Breakfast Check-out from Hotel &amp; transfer to the Seychelles Airport for your onward travel to Mumbai with&nbsp;happy memories of the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After arrival at Mumbai, Check-in to Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>(Breakfast )<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mumbai to Ranchi\",\"date\":\"24-12-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Check-out from the hotel, Today\'s day is free on own for shopping &amp; city tour. Later on, depart for Mumbai Airport for your return travel to Ranchi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After reaching home do share the pics from your trip with us so that we can create a video souvenir of your trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5316\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":10158},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Mahe-island (SEZ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"7077\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 AM\",\"fare\":47912},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Mahe-island (SEZ)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"706\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 PM\",\"fare\":50430},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"508\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:35 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"483\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":12132}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL THE LALIT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/12\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"8500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SEYCHELLES\",\"hotel_name\":\"BANYAN TREE , MAHE ISLAND\",\"room_type\":\"OCEAN VIEW POOL VILLA\",\"check_out\":\"23\\/12\\/2019\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"197572\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HILTON\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2019\",\"rate\":\"9000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel The Lalit, Mumbai&nbsp;</strong>with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Banyan Tree, Seychelles</strong>&nbsp;with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Hilton, Mumbai</strong> with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Seychelles Airport Transfers&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>All Breakfast &amp; Dinners.</li>\n	<li>Visa on arrival free of cost.</li>\n	<li>All luxury taxes, Service Charges.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong><em>NOTE:</em></strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><b><i>All the hotels mentioned above are 100% Non-Refundable once CONFIRMED.</i></b></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"27\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":120632,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":215072},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":335704,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 90640.08\",\"selling_price\":426344.0800000000162981450557708740234375}', 'MZQ/0145/0102019', 426400, 213200, 0, '2019-10-31 17:57:35', '2019-11-18 13:22:47', 1, 0, '\"<h2><strong>Frequently Asked Questions - before you travel<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\n\\n<h3><strong>Passports &amp; Visas<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>A full passport is required for entry into Seychelles, valid for at least 2 months beyond your return date. Visas are not required for entry. On arrival in Seychelles each passenger will be required to produce a valid full passport, completed immigration card (distributed on the aircraft before arrival) and your valid return ticket.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3><strong>Health &amp; Vaccinations<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Seychelles is currently free from any tropical diseases and no vaccinations certificates are required for clients entering Seychelles, other than if you are entering Seychelles from or have passed through a Yellow Fever infected country a certificate of immunization is required. Malaria protection is not required. However, it is the client\'s responsibility to consult their own doctor on personal health matters prior to traveling.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We advise you to take with you adequate high UV sun cream protection and insect repellent. Deet based repellents work well. Protection against sunburn, especially on the first few days, must be remembered. If you are sailing or cruising with us, do remember that you can easily sunburn even on a cloudy day due to the reflection from the surface of the sea.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3><strong>What to pack?<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Packing for a holiday - always difficult to know what to take. What will the weather do? What will I need? Here\'s some tips on what to take, bearing in mind that the general accepted style is \\\"smart casual\\\" and avoid tight-fitting clothes during the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Take lightweight loose-fitting clothing preferably made from natural fibers.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Once in Seychelles, you will not require jumpers, pullovers, cardigans, jackets or coats.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Lightweight shoes and sandals are ideal.&nbsp; For reef walking, take a pair of lightweight sports shoes or jellies.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Sun hats and a long-sleeved top to prevent sunburn.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Gents normally wear lightweight trousers for the evenings. However, talk to one of our specialists if this is a problem.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Sun cream and insect repellent.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h2><strong>Climate<\\/strong><\\/h2>\\n\\n<p>The weather in Seychelles is generally warm and comfortable both night and day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>The islands have an all-year-round tropical climate with day and night temperatures between 26oC and 32oC. Seasons are controlled by trade winds. Seychelles does not experience extreme weather conditions such as hurricanes and cyclones.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>From December to April - North West Trades<br \\/>\\nGenerally, this time of year has more rainfall than the other months, but still just as pleasant for a trip to Seychelles. The humidity is generally higher and the sea breezes are generally moderate.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>From Mid May to November - South East trades<br \\/>\\nDuring this time, temperatures are generally cooler, down to 28C and there is less rainfall. During July &amp; August the winds can make the seas choppy, so please be aware of this should you have to make a sea crossing. For example, when crossing between Mah\\u00e9 to Praslin you have a choice of either by high-speed sea ferry or by light aircraft.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3><strong>Currency<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>The local currency is the Seychelles Rupee (SCR). 1 SCR = 100 cents. Note denominations are SCR100, SCR50, SCR25, SCR10. Coin denominations are SCR5, SCR1 and 50 cents. Exchange rates can be obtained from your own bank, but a guide rate is Rs17= \\u00a31.00.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>There are banks on all three main islands with ATMs. Bank opening hours are 8.30 am to 2.00 pm Monday to Friday, 08.30 am to 11.00 am Saturdays. Closed on Public holidays. ATMs only give local currency (Seychelles rupee). Our concierge representatives in Seychelles (Masons Travel) will be able to assist you. Should you have unused rupees at the end of your holiday, providing you have a receipt for when you purchased the rupees, be it from an ATM or direct from a bank, the bank will purchase back the rupees at the current exchange rate.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3><strong>Paying your way in Seychelles&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>The majority of your spending at your hotel can be charged to your room for settlement before departure. Credit cards&nbsp;(Visa and Mastercard) are widely accepted&nbsp;by most hotels, restaurants and related services such as car hire, excursions, etc.&nbsp;Should you wish to take cash&nbsp;with you, Euros are the preferred currency.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3><strong>Car Hire, Taxis &amp; Public Transport<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>Car hire and taxis are available on Mah\\u00e9 &amp; Praslin Islands.&nbsp; Your hotel or our concierge representatives (Masons Travel) will normally arrange this for you. Soft-top car hire is very popular but do&nbsp;remember to remove any valuables when you leave the car unattended. Public transport is well developed and very economical both on Mah\\u00e9 &amp; Praslin. There is a central bus depot in Victoria. Your concierge representative will assist you with bus timetables and advice on the various routes.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0);
