(149, 'MR UMANG', NULL, '8092572025', 'umangtainwala32@gmail.com', 'MALDIVES & SRI LANKA', '2020-01-25', 9, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"RANCHI - BANGALORE\",\"date\":\"25-01-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Bangalore then proceed to Hotel &amp; Check-in to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Bangalore.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><i>&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/i><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANGALORE - MALDIVES\",\"date\":\"26-01-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Check-out from the hotel and depart to the Airport for your onward travel to the Maldives.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enter the magical island country of Maldives. As you arrive at the Male International Airport, an agency&nbsp;representative will receive you and escort you and your family to the resort.<br \\/>\\nComplete the check-in formalities and enjoy your arrival at your Beach Villa with welcome drinks. Your day is at leisure and you can relax at the beach or in your grand room. Proceed for the daily evening entertainment show, later in the day. Enjoy a hearty dinner buffet in the main restaurant at the resort and retreat to your room for a peaceful night\'s&nbsp;sleep.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Maldives.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>&nbsp;Airport-MALDIVES HOTEL&nbsp;<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>&nbsp;Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Enjoy Leisure Day at the Island\",\"date\":\"27-01-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today you have the entire day at leisure. Explore the Island and VARU by Atmosphere resort on your own. Varu is a term in the Native Maldivian language of Dhivehi with connotations of strength, resilience, and life in abundance. The 5-star resort will offer a truly Maldivian experience by incorporating aspects of local traditions and cultures, structural design - fused together with bursts of chic tropical vibes.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Maldives.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>&nbsp;Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"A Day suggested for Water Activities\",\"date\":\"28-01-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In this Tour Package, you can enjoy various water sports activities complimentary like Windsurf board &amp; sail, Catamaran, Canoe, Standup paddleboard Hang on for dear life. Laughter and shrieks of excitement fill the air. A rainbow spray of water. Cutting through the waves, free as a bird. Paddle across the atoll in a kayak. Ride a strong gust on a clear morning.<br \\/>\\nThe balance on a catamaran. Parasailing, wakeboarding, jet skiing Snorkelling. An array of water sports activities and facilities to indulge in. So many ways to soar. Overnight stay at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Maldives.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><em>&nbsp;Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner<\\/em><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MALDIVES - COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"29-01-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;After breakfast proceed to MALE Airport for your Onward journey to SRI LANKA.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive in Sri Lanka. You will be met by representatives of Multi Zone&nbsp;Travels and transferred to COLOMBO. (Travel time approx: 1 hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Colombo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Airport-Colombo (Approximate distance 85 kms.)<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO-PINNAWALA-KANDY-KANDY-RAMBODA-NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"30-01-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;After breakfast proceed to Nuwara Eliya.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;En-route visit *Pinnawela Elephant Orphanage - App. 55 miles from Colombo, off the Colombo - Kandy road is Pinnawela, where an orphanage was started in 1975 to house the abandoned and the wounded elephants. The number of elephants has increased to more than 65 now; including Baby Elephants brought from various parts, as well as the 23 babies born, as a result of the captive breeding program. The best time to visit is the feeding time from 0930-1000 hrs and 1330-1400 hrs and the bathing time from 1000-1030 hrs and 1400-1430 hrs when all the elephants are taken to the river close by.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Visit Hanuman Temple in Ramboda and Ramboda waterfall. Visiting a tea plantation &amp; a factory.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Nuwara Eliya.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Colombo-Pinnawala-Kandy-Kandy-Ramboda-Nuwara Eliya (Approximate distance 221 kms.)<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><em>Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/em><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"31-01-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Today enjoy the scenic beauty of hill country *Nuwara Eliya - The \'Little England\' of Sri Lanka, is set against beautiful backdrops of Mountains, Valleys, Waterfalls and Tea Plantations. It is supposed to be one of the coolest places in the Island, but it is really just like an English spring day, although the temperature does drop at night. All around Nuwara Eliya you will see evidence of the British influence, houses like country cottages or Queen Ann style mansions. The Victoria Park, in the middle of the town, is a lovely place for a stroll or a picnic and is also good for Birding as you get some rare birds in this Park. Seasons may be absent elsewhere in Sri Lanka, but here you can read them by the flowers, which bloom in the spring (March to May) and the fall (August and September). These are the \\\"seasons\\\" when low-country folk flock to Nuwara Eliya to escape the sea level heat and humidity. *Seetha Amman Temple &amp; Asoka Vatika visit in the evening<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Nuwara Eliya.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Nuwara Eliya Local<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><em>&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/em><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA-KANDY-PERADENIYA-PERADENIYA-KANDY\",\"date\":\"01-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast proceed to Kandy.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to *Kandy Visit *Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic - ever since 4th Century A.D, when the Buddha\'s Tooth was brought to Sri Lanka hidden from sacrilegious hands in an Orissan princess\' hair, the Relic has grown in repute and holiness in Sri Lanka and throughout the Buddhist world. It is considered Sri Lanka\'s most prized possession. *Gem Gallery visit The world\'s best gems are available in Sri Lanka such as Blue and Yellow Sapphire, Star Ruby and Star Sapphire, Chrysoberyl Cat\'s Eye, Alexandrite, Topaz, Amethyst, Quartz, Garnet, Aquamarine, Moonstone, Tourmaline When comparing with other countries you will be lucky to buy pure and valuable gems at Sri Lanka for a competitive price. You can get an education about gems, making pieces of jewelry and other requests with them. You can buy gold, white gold and silver jewelry at your choice. You can even get them Tailor Made as per your preference. *Evening witness the Cultural Dance Show featuring various dancing types of Sri Lanka.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Peradeniya Royal Botanical Gardens - 147 acres in extent; Started in 1374 as a pleasure garden of the Kings of Gampola and Kandy. There are more than 4,000 species of trees, plants and creepers. Some rare and endemic as well as flora from the tropical world are found in the gardens. Spice Garden and Orchid House are popular with tourists. There are 5 Palm Avenues beautifying the gardens, the earliest and tallest Palm Avenue (Royal Palm Avenue) was planted in 1905 and the Double Coconuts from the Seashells Island, with the largest seed of all plants in the world is one such avenue.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Overnight stay at the Hotel, Kandy.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Nuwara Eliya-Kandy-Peradeniya-Peradeniya-Kandy (Approximate distance 124 kms.)<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY- COLOMBO - COLOMBO AIRPORT\",\"date\":\"02-02-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;After breakfast Proceed to Colombo for City &amp; Shopping Tour *Colombo - a drive through the city taking you to the busy commercial areas as well as the tree-lined residential, Cinnamon Gardens. Visit Fort, the former British administrative center and military garrison, Sea Street - the Goldsmith\'s quarters in the heart of Pettah, the Bazaar area, where is also a Hindu Temple with elaborate stone carvings, and the Dutch Church of Wolfendhal dating back to 1749. Also, visit the BMICH, see the replica of Avukana Buddha &amp; the Independence Square. *Shopping in Colombo.......visit *ODEL Unlimited provides ample opportunity indulge, not only in shopping for designer wear apparel for the whole family, but also take taste buds on a voyage of discovery.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Later proceed to Airport for your departure flight accordingly. Have a safe flight!!!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Transfer <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Kandy - Colombo - Colombo Airport(Approximate distance 124 kms.)<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>Meals <\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><em>&nbsp;Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO - BANGALORE\",\"date\":\"03-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Board your return flight for Bangalore with sweet memories of the Tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>After reaching home do share the pics from your trip with us so that we can create a video souvenir of your trip.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"997\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"8431\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"43\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"15903\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"SriLankan\",\"fno\":\"116\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"SriLankan\",\"fno\":\"173\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"05:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"7872\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"BANGALORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL TAJ BANGALORE\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/01\\/2020\",\"rate\":\"11000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"26\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"MALDIVES\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"29\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HARD ROCK MALDIVES\",\"room_type\":\"PLATINUM OVER WATER POOL VILLA\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CINNAMON LAKESIDE\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"30\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"NUWARAELIYA\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"01\\/02\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GOLDEN RIDGE\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"01\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/02\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GRAND KANDYAN\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>​​​​​​<strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel TAJ, Bangalore&nbsp;</strong>with Breakfast.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>MALDIVES Inclusions :</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel HARD ROCK, Maldives</strong>&nbsp;with B/F &amp; Dinner.</li>\n	<li>Transfers by Speedboat on a&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>Breakfast &amp; Dinner served at our main restaurant.</li>\n	<li>Visa on arrival free of cost.</li>\n	<li>Green tax included.</li>\n	<li>All luxury taxes, Service Charges.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>SRI LANKA Inclusions :</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights </strong>Accommodation in above mentioned Hotels or Similar.</li>\n	<li>04 Breakfasts + 04 Dinners at hotels.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Gem Gallery Visit</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Kandy Cultural Show - Gem Gallery visit is a must to obtain the complimentary coupon for Kandy Cultural Show</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Spice Garden visit</li>\n	<li>Transportation in A/C Car on PVT Basis</li>\n	<li>Visa Cost</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><em>Value additions in Sri Lanka by Multi Zone Travels</em></strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>500ml X 02 Mineral Water Bottles - per person per day throughout the tour</li>\n	<li>5% worth of discount voucher for ODEL</li>\n	<li>BUY LKR 6000 worth CASINO Coupons and get a Discount of LKR 1000 - INCLUDING Lunch/Dinner and extra snacks/drinks while playing @ Bally\'s Casino</li>\n	<li>Complimentary SIM card on arrival with zero balance</li>\n	<li>Wheelchair for differently-abled people - This should be notified prior to the arrival</li>\n	<li>Complimentary cut fruits @ Mawanella Spice Garden</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<h3>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi</strong> as mentioned above will be <strong>Rs. 36500 Per Pax.</strong></h3>\n	</li>\n	<li>Any Expenses of a Personal Nature</li>\n	<li>Tips &amp; Portage</li>\n	<li>Meals Other than Mentioned Above</li>\n	<li>Camera &amp; Video Permits</li>\n	<li>Early check-in &amp; Late check-out.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fee mentioned above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>\n\n<p><em><strong>Supplement for the entrance fee which isn\'t included in the above-mentioned Cost:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Gangaramaya Floating Temple in Colombo - USD 02 per person</li>\n	<li>Temple of the Tooth Relic - USD 06 per person</li>\n	<li>Peradeniya Royal Botanical Garden - USD 12 per person</li>\n	<li>Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage - USD 05 per person</li>\n	<li>Hakgala Botanical Garden – USD 12 per person</li>\n	<li>Gregory Lake Entrance Fees – USD 02 per person</li>\n	<li>Gregory Lake Boat Ride – USD 25 per boat</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":72206,\"hotel_cost\":\"11000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance\",\"amount\":3600},{\"name\":\"Maldives land\",\"amount\":\"216956\"},{\"name\":\"Sri Lanka Land\",\"amount\":\"52852\"}],\"cost_price\":356614,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 53492.1\",\"selling_price\":410106.099999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0146/0112019', 410000, 205000, 0, '2019-11-06 14:46:06', '2019-11-28 17:04:13', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(151, 'Mr UMA SHANKAR SINGH', NULL, '8809157895', 'umashankar040@gmail.com', 'KERALA', '2019-12-29', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN COCHIN\",\"date\":\"29-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at Cochin, our representative will cordially receive you from Cochin Airport. Our driver will transfer you to the Hotel. Check into Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Cochin.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COCHIN TO MUNNAR (126 Kms 04 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"30-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed to Munnar, on arrival check into the hotel later spend the day with local sightseeing. Situated at the confluence of three mountain streams - Mudrapuzha, Nallathanni and Kundale, Munnar is 1600 Meter above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Munnar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUNNAR LOCAL\",\"date\":\"31-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast spends the day with local sightseeing. Situated at the confluence of three mountain streams - Mudrapuzha, Nallathanni and Kundale, Munnar is 1600 Meter above sea level. This majestic hill station was once the summer resort of the British government in South India. Local sightseeing of Munnar includes a visit to Mattupetty Dam, Kundale Lake, and Echo point. Afternoon proceed to Rajamalai were the rarest species of mountain goat, \\\"Nilgiri Thars\\\", can be spotted.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Munnar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUNNAR - THEKKADY (91Kms 03 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel and drive to Thekkady on arrival check in to the hotel. Proceed for the sightseeing tour of Thekkady - one of the world\'s most fascinating wildlife reserves. The Periyar wildlife sanctuary in Thekkady is spread across 777 sq km of which 360 sq km is a thick evergreen forest. Noted for its geomorphology, diversity of wildlife and scenic beauty, the sanctuary was declared a Tiger Reserve in 1978. Optional activities like Boating at Periyar Lake, Spice Plantation visit and Elephant Ride can be done at an extra cost.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Thekkady.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"THEKKADY  - ALLEPPEY (127 Kms 04 Hours Approx)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel and drive to Alleppey. Set out on an enchanting overnight backwater cruise in traditionally decorated houseboats. Check-in time is 01:00 PM and cruise starts with lunch. While cruising, let your eyes settle for the bowed-down paddy fields, local inhabitants, rustic homes, ancient churches\\/temples and swaying coconut groves. Food will be served onboard.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at houseboat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ALLEPPEY - COCHIN (53 Kms 01 Hour Approx)\",\"date\":\"03-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the House Boat \\/ Hotel and drive to Cochin.&nbsp;On arrival check in to the hotel and evening is free for shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Cochin.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM COCHIN\",\"date\":\"04-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast transfer to Airport to catch your return flight to Ranchi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour Ends with Happy Memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":38916},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6926\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"537\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"08:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"fare\":39656},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"997\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"COCHIN\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/12\\/2019\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL IMPERIAL REGENCY \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"6000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"01\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MISTY MOUNTAIN RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rate\":\"21000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"01\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"THEKKADY\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL THE MOUNTAIN COURTYARD \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"TAMARIND ROOM\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"18000\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"02\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPEY\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOUSE BOAT\",\"room_type\":\"LUXURY ROOM\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"rate\":\"20000\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"03\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"COCHIN\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL COURTYARD BY MARRIOTT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"12500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> Hotel at Cochin with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>4*</strong> Hotel at Munnar with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in <strong>4*</strong> Hotel at Thekkady with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in <b>Deluxe Houseboat</b>&nbsp;at Alleppey with&nbsp;All Meals.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> Hotel at Cochin with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>All transfers and sightseeing by&nbsp;<strong>AC Innova.</strong></li>\n	<li>All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><em><strong>Mandatory&nbsp;Gala Dinner Charges will&nbsp;be applicable on 31st Dec by the hotel which can be collected directly at the hotel.</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78572,\"hotel_cost\":77500,\"transport_cost\":\"23000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":179072,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21488.64\",\"selling_price\":200560.640000000013969838619232177734375}', 'MZQ/0148/0112019', 199200, 49800, 0, '2019-11-09 12:49:42', '2019-11-11 10:54:41', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(152, 'Mr SUBOJIT', NULL, '9534165266', NULL, 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2019-11-28', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"28-11-2019 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"29-11-2019 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built-in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built-in (1885), Christ Church built-in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. Overnight Stay in Shimla<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"30-11-2019 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple, Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"01-12-2019 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"02-12-2019 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OR<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point&nbsp; (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 meters above sea level and 51 km outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendor. At the top of the pass, the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. Overnight Stay in Manali.&nbsp;(Closed on Tuesday)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"03-12-2019 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Checkout from Manali hotel and drive to Chandigarh. Overnight Stay in Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.&nbsp; Evening visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rock Garden, and Sukhna Lake is <strong>subject to time availability.&nbsp;<\\/strong>Overnight Stay in Chandigarh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"04-12-2019 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":8862},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"706\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"755\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":8094},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"535\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SUKHSAGAR REGENCY \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MANALI GRAND \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"03\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PALMDALE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong> Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> hotel in Shimla on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> hotel in Manali on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in <strong>3*</strong> hotel in Chandigarh on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meals.&nbsp;<strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>Transportation by <strong>A/C Indigo / Similar</strong> for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass. <strong>(Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit)</strong></li>\n	<li>Any extra expenses such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced Majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":16956,\"land_cost\":\"30500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":47456,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9491.2\",\"selling_price\":56947.199999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0149/0112019', 57000, 28500, 0, '2019-11-11 10:17:09', '2019-11-11 10:28:45', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(153, 'Mr MAHTAB', NULL, '9709100140', NULL, 'ANDAMAN', '2019-11-26', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT PORT BLAIR | CELLULAR JAIL & LIGHT SHOW\",\"date\":\"26-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Port Blair in the morning by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip.<br \\/>\\nPost completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR TO HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"27-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island in a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Experience Andamans only share beach side resorts for exquisite experiences. Later we begin our journey to one among Asia\'s best beach, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"date\":\"28-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Day at leisure.How, about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving and Sea Walk can be done on this day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"date\":\"29-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Ferry Timing from Havelock to Port Blair is around 10:00 AM.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND TO PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"30-11-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning we return back board a ferry to Port Blair. Upon reaching our representative will attend you and will take you to the hotel for check-in. Evening Shopping Tour to purchase gifts for friends and family.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"01-12-2019\",\"todo\":\"<p>Drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"747\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Nov 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Nov 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":14490},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"102\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"fare\":12850}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GRAND PARADISE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RADHAKRISHNA RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL TANGO BEACH RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/11\\/2019\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL N K INTERNATIONAL \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"PREMIUM ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil with breakfast&nbsp;on Double&nbsp;sharing basis.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service at the airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side Ferry Tickets Included 3 Side Cruise to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</li>\n	<li>Breakfast at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance by Multi Zone Travel Experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;Vehicle will not be at disposal in any of the islands.</li>\n	<li>Other meals not mentioned laundry, telephone calls, and incidentals.</li>\n	<li>Any personal expenses.Room service and special orders. Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages</li>\n	<li>Camera Tickets are NOT INCLUDED in the mentioned cost of Sightseeing &amp; Transfers.</li>\n	<li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from the suggested tour itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Lunch and dinner not included.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":27340,\"land_cost\":\"34964\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":62304,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9345.6\",\"selling_price\":71649.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0150/0112019', 71600, 35800, 0, '2019-11-20 13:06:54', '2019-11-20 13:06:54', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
