05 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>4* </strong>hotel with breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Sentosa Token Fun Pass - <strong>120 Tokens.</strong></li>\n	<li>Sea Aquarium.</li>\n	<li>Garden By The Bay + Skypark @ Marina Bay Sands.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>City Tour (Drive- through our Business District + Visit the icon of Singapore, The Merlion)</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Universal Studios Singapore</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC </strong>basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on <strong>PVT </strong>basis.</li>\n	<li>Singapore Visa.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":79500,\"visa_cost\":\"4500\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":1600}],\"cost_price\":85600,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15408\",\"selling_price\":101008}', 'MZQ/0153/0112019', 101000, 50500, 0, '2019-11-27 15:28:18', '2019-11-27 16:43:58', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(157, 'MR BASHANT KACHHAP', NULL, '8789746448', 'bashantkachhap24@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2019-12-16', 4, 0, 3, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7269\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":10143},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"121\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:40 AM\",\"fare\":38589},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"120\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Dec 2019\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Dec 2019\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":10707}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL IBIS PATTAYA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/12\\/2019\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/12\\/2019\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL LE FENIX SUKHUMVIT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/12\\/2019\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy class flight&nbsp;<strong>Ex- RANCHI&nbsp;</strong>with<strong>&nbsp;20 Kgs Check-in Luggage for&nbsp;02 Pax&nbsp;in CCU-DMK-CCU sectors.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Pattaya with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Bangkok with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Alcazar Show on SIC basis.</li>\n	<li>Coral Island Tour by Speedboat with Lunch on <strong>SIC</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>Half-Day Bangkok City Tour on&nbsp;<strong>SIC</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Safari World &amp; Marine Park with Lunch on&nbsp;<strong>SIC</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Transfer <b>DMK&nbsp;</b>Airport----------<strong>PATTAYA</strong>&nbsp;Hotel Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>PATTAYA</strong>&nbsp;Hotel----------<strong>BANGKOK</strong>&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>BANGKOK&nbsp;</strong>Hotel-------<strong>DMK&nbsp;</strong>Airport Pvt.</li>\n	<li>All Sightseeing On&nbsp;<strong>Seat In Coach</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59439,\"land_cost\":\"53677\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"CCU-DMK-CCU - LUGGAGE (20 KGS x 02 PAX = 40 KGS)\",\"amount\":5500}],\"cost_price\":118616,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11861.6\",\"selling_price\":130477.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0154/0122019', 130500, 43500, 0, '2019-12-03 17:16:59', '2019-12-03 17:16:59', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(158, 'Mr RUPESH KUMAR', NULL, '829727527', 'rupesh3004@gmail.com', 'VIETNAM', '2020-01-02', 6, 1, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN HANOI\",\"date\":\"02-01-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Be welcomed at the airport by our Multi Zone&nbsp;Travel\'s tour guide and transfer to your hotel in the city center.<br \\/>\\nCheck-in at your hotel (after 14:00pm). Overnight in Hanoi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI \\u2013 HALONG BAY \\u2013 OVERNIGHT ON CRUISE  (BREAKFAST + LUNCH + DINNER)\",\"date\":\"03-01-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>07.45 \\u2013 8:30: Our limousine bus will pick you up from your hotel in Hanoi and start our trip to explore the most amazing bay in the North of Vietnam. On the way, we will have a quick stop in the middle of the way to rest. This also lets you have a glance at Hai Duong Province and taste their traditional \\u201cGreen bean cake\\u201d.<br \\/>\\n12.30: Arrive in our office at Hon Gai Pier, you will have a bit of time to relax and enjoy a cup of tea\\/coffee. Wait for our captain to finish the registration and transfer by tender to our boat.<br \\/>\\n12.45: Enjoy a welcome drink and spend a couple of minutes to briefing about safety on boat and activities included then we check in our cabin.<br \\/>\\n13.30: Delicious Vietnamese set menu will be served while leisurely cruising further into Bai Tu Long Bay.<br \\/>\\n15.00: Arrive in kayaking area \\u2013 that is Cap La Island. Enjoy kayaking through the karst and breathtaking nature, swimming and relaxing.<br \\/>\\n17.30: Get back to the boat and enjoys our Sunset party while our cruise sailing to the overnight anchorage.<br \\/>\\n19.00: Sumptuous set-dinner on Renea Cruise.<br \\/>\\n20.30: Free time to challenge yourself in Vietnamese puzzle games, or gathers your group\\/family for a board game; try your luck with squid fishing or simply have a cocktail and enjoy the quiet night on the bay.<br \\/>\\n<strong>Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALONG BAY - HANOI (BREAKFAST + BRUNCH)\",\"date\":\"04-01-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>06.30: Start early Tai Chi demonstration on sundeck.<br \\/>\\n07.30: Breakfast will be served in Western style and furthermore with Vietnamese traditional food.<br \\/>\\n08.00: Explore the well-hidden Thien Canh Son Cave and enjoy a white sandy beach at Hon Co Island. Our tour guide will provide some interesting stories of Ha Long Bay and this Cave, made by Mother Nature.<br \\/>\\n09.00: Back to the boat to pack and check out of your cabin. Prepare to join in our traditional cooking demonstration.<br \\/>\\n10.30: Vietnamese cooking demonstration on boat.<br \\/>\\n11.00: Enjoy a traditional Vietnamese lunch.<br \\/>\\n12.00: Disembark in Hon Gai pier<br \\/>\\n12.30: Farewell Halong Bay then returns to Hanoi by cruise bus.<br \\/>\\n17.00: End of service.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI CITY TOUR \\u2013 FLY TO PHU QUOC (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"05-01-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we discover the wonders of the capital of Vietnam, filled with timeless charm. Discover the Ho Chi Minh complex including the Presidential Palace, Ho Chi Minh\'s House on stilts and the fish pond. For those who are interested in visiting the Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum, it is only open in the morning and closed every Monday and Friday. Sometimes it is necessary to queue for a couple of hours to go inside the mausoleum.<br \\/>\\nTransfer to the old quarter to visit Hoan Kiem lake (Restored Sword Lake) and Ngoc Son temple in the middle of the lake. Then transfer directly to the airport for flight to Phu Quoc.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meet our driver at the airport and transfer to the hotel. Dinner on your own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC - FREE AT LEISURE  (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"06-01-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at your hotel. Free at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC \\u2013 FLY TO HO CHI MINH CITY (SAI GON) (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"07-01-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at the beach or be lazy at your hotel till the afternoon, transfer to the airport for a short flight to Saigon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\nMeet our tour guide and driver for the city tour.<br \\/>\\nVisit the Reunification palace (or the war memorials Museum), Notre Dame Cathedral and the Central Post Office inspired by Orsay Station in Paris. Take a walk in the city center visiting sites like the former Catinat streets, the Opera house, City Hall as well as Ben Thanh market. Overnight in Saigon.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CU CHI TUNNEL \\u2013 DEPARTURE FROM HO CHI MINH CITY  (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"08-01-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Depart to discover one of the most striking places in the history of the Vietnam War: Cu Chi Tunnel and Ben Duoc temple, just a little far but less touristic. Cu Chi is a real underground city with 250 km of network tunnels where Viet Cong conducted the war of resistance against American troops. All&nbsp;the tunnel networks have been dug by hand with pickaxes and shovels for twenty years without any architects.<br \\/>\\nEnjoy your last minute in Saigon the biggest city of Vietnam before transfer to the airport for your flight to the next destination or flight home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1396\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Phu Quoc Island (PQC)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"455\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jan 2020\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 PM\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Phu Quoc Island (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh City (SGN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"324\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jan 2020\",\"arv_time\":\"07:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"47482\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1364\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HANOI BOUTIQUE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HALONG BAY\",\"hotel_name\":\"RENEA CRUISE\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"04\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HANOI BOUTIQUE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"05\\/01\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"SEA STAR RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"07\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HO CHI MINH CITY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ELIOS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SENIOR SUPERIOR\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/01\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights</strong> Accommodation with Breakfast in <strong>3* Hotel</strong> with <strong>01 SINGLE ROOM</strong>&nbsp;and <strong>01 DOUBLE ROOM</strong>&nbsp;with Child No Bed.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in Cruise with all Meals.(BREAKFAST + LUNCH + DINNER)</li>\n	<li>All Tours on Private basis &amp;&nbsp;Hanoi – Halong Bay - Hanoi on SIC basis.</li>\n	<li>All entrance fees.</li>\n	<li>English speaking guide.</li>\n	<li>Vietnam Visa Charges.</li>\n	<li>Private cabin on a cruise.</li>\n	<li>All airport transfers on a PVT basis.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Tipping and gratuities for guide and driver <strong>(It is not compulsory. However, if you are happy with the services, we recommend 7-15 USD/day for the guide and less for the driver)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":127482,\"land_cost\":\"112712\",\"visa_cost\":\"12000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":252194,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 30263.28\",\"selling_price\":282457.28000000002793967723846435546875}', 'MZQ/0155/0122019', 283400, 79250, 45650, '2019-12-05 18:26:44', '2019-12-05 18:35:06', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(159, 'Mr RUPESH KUMAR', NULL, '829727527', 'rupesh3004@gmail.com', 'VIETNAM', '2020-01-02', 6, 1, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN HANOI\",\"date\":\"02-01-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Be welcomed at the airport by our Multi Zone&nbsp;Travel\'s tour guide and transfer to your hotel in the city center.<br \\/>\\nCheck-in at your hotel (after 14:00pm). Overnight in Hanoi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI CITY TOUR  (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"03-01-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we discover deeply the capital of Vietnam, filled with timeless charms. Start to visit the Van Mieu (Temple of Literature) the first University of Vietnam built from the 11th century by Emperor Ly Thanh Tong. Continue to visit Chua Ha (Ha Pagoda) known as a sacred place to pray for the luck in love, especially for the future spouse. After that, transfer to Ethnology Museum (closed every Monday) which offers a deep insight into our Vietnam cultures through traditional costumes, tools, music instruments and real typical traditional houses of many minority ethnic groups.<br \\/>\\nIn the afternoon, discover the Ho Chi Minh complex included: Presidential Palace, Ho Chi Minh House on stilts, fish pond. For those who are interested in visit Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum: it is opened only in the morning and closed every Monday and Friday. We have to queue up sometimes to a couple of hours to go inside the mausoleum. Transfer to the old quarter to visit the Hoan Kiem lake (Restored Sword Lake) and Ngoc Son temples in the middle of the lake.<br \\/>\\nEnjoy a special water puppet show at the theater. Dinner on your own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI - HON GAI PIER \\u2013 BAI TU LONG BAY \\u2013 CONG DO \\u2013 CAP LA ISLAND (BREAKFAST + LUNCH + DINNER)\",\"date\":\"04-01-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>07.45 \\u2013 8:30: Our luxury limousine or shuttle bus will pick you up from your hotel in Hanoi and start our trip to explore the most amazing bay in the North of Vietnam. On the way, we will have a quick stop in the middle of the way to rest.<br \\/>\\n12.30: Arrive in our office at Hon Gai Pier, you will have a bit of time to relax and enjoy a cup of tea\\/coffee. Wait for our captain to finish the registration and transfer by tender to our boat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>12.45: Enjoy a welcome drink and spend a couple of minutes to briefing about safety on boat and activities included then we check in our cabin.<br \\/>\\n13.30: Delicious Vietnamese set menu will be served while leisurely cruising further into Bai Tu Long Bay.<br \\/>\\n15.00: Arrive in kayaking area \\u2013 that is Cap La Island. Enjoy kayaking through the karst and breathtaking nature, swimming and relaxing.<br \\/>\\n17.30: Get back to the boat and enjoys our Sunset party while our cruise sailing to the overnight anchorage.<br \\/>\\n19.00: Sumptuous set-dinner on board.<br \\/>\\n20.30: Free time to challenge yourself in Vietnamese puzzle games, or gathers your group\\/family for a board game; try your luck with squid fishing or simply has a cocktail and enjoy the quiet night on the bay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"THIEN CANH SON CAVE - HANOI \\u2013 FLY TO HO CHI MINH (BREAKFAST- BRUNCH)\",\"date\":\"05-01-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>06.00: Start your day with a Tai Chi routine on sundeck or catch a morning view of the stunning bay\\u2019s landscape with a cup of tea or coffee.<br \\/>\\n07.00: Breakfast will be served in Western style, familiar to you to fulfill your strength and ready for another exploring day.<br \\/>\\n08.00: Explore the well-hidden Thien Canh Son Cave.<br \\/>\\n09.00: Upon return to the boat you will have about 30 minutes to freshen up and finish packing.<br \\/>\\n10.00: Attend in a Vietnamese cooking demonstration. You can quickly learn a simple but delicious Vietnamese dish that Gordon Ramsey (a 2 Michelin Star Chef) used to guide \\u2013 Nem Cuon or challenge yourself in fruit and vegetables carving.<br \\/>\\n11.00: Enjoy a traditional Vietnamese lunch on the boat.<br \\/>\\n12.00: Back to the harbor and disembark in Hon Gai pier.<br \\/>\\n12.30: Our shuttle bus or limousine will take you back to Hanoi.<br \\/>\\n17.00: End of service.<br \\/>\\n<strong>Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeet our private car with&nbsp;driver and transfer to the airport for a short flight to Ho Chi Minh city. On arrival, pick up by our driver, transfer to Ho Chi Minh. Overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CU CHI TUNNEL - SAIGON CITY TOUR (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"06-01-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>08:30, Depart to discover one of the most striking places in the history of the Vietnam War: Cu Chi Tunnel and Ben Duoc temple, just a little far but less touristic. Cu Chi is a real underground city with 250 km of network tunnels where Viet Cong conducted the war of resistance against American troops. All the tunnel networks have been dug by hand with pickaxes and shovels for twenty years without any architects.<br \\/>\\nVisit the War Memorials Museum, the Notre Dame Cathedral (outside) and the Central Post Office inspired by the Orsay Station in Paris. If time permits, visit Ho Thi ky flower market where open 24\\/7. Back to the hotel and overnight in Saigon.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY BEN TRE  (BREAKFAST - LUNCH)\",\"date\":\"07-01-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning, our guide and driver meet you at your hotel for transfer to Ben Tre \\u2013 a beautiful region in the Mekong Delta River, famous for making coconut candy.<br \\/>\\nArrive in Hung Vuong pier; get on a boat trip on the Ben Tre River to discover the daily local life. Stop to visit the brick kiln of Mr. Tu Lo and discover the craft methods of making bricks. Continue our boat trip on a canal to Nhon Thanh Village. This will be an opportunity to taste fresh fruits. Take a bike ride (or Tuk-tuk) on a small path through the villages; enjoy watching the coconut ranges, rice fields, and vegetable gardens. Lunch is served in the village with Elephant fish ear. A short walk will help you to discover the local life in depth. Followed by a boat ride on the small canal shaded by the wild palm trees.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>FREE OPTION: For those who wish to ride a bike: ride a bike to Mr. Sau Khanh\\u2019s house to admire his ancient object\'s collections then continue through the rice fields. Meet the peasants and you could join in their works. Transfer back to Saigon in the late afternoon. Overnight in Saigon.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM HO CHI MINH CITY  (BREAKFAST)\",\"date\":\"08-01-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your last minutes in Hanoi, meet our driver for a transfer to the airport. Take your flight to the next destination or flight home. Tour ends.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1396\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"Jetstar Pacific Airlines\",\"fno\":\"777\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"30753\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1364\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HANOI BOUTIQUE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"04\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HALONG BAY\",\"hotel_name\":\"RENEA CRUISE\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"05\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"HO CHI MINH CITY\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ELIOS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"SENIOR SUPERIOR\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"08\\/01\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights</strong> Accommodation with Breakfast in <strong>3* Hotel</strong> with <strong>01 SINGLE ROOM</strong>&nbsp;and <strong>01 DOUBLE ROOM</strong>&nbsp;with Child No Bed.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in Cruise with all Meals.(BREAKFAST + LUNCH + DINNER)</li>\n	<li>All Tours on Private basis &amp;&nbsp;Hanoi – Halong Bay - Hanoi on SIC basis.</li>\n	<li>All entrance fees.</li>\n	<li>English speaking guide.</li>\n	<li>Vietnam Visa Charges.</li>\n	<li>Private cabin on a cruise.</li>\n	<li>Private boat trips.</li>\n	<li>All airport transfers on a PVT basis.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Tipping and gratuities for guide and driver <strong>(It is not compulsory. However, if you are happy with the services, we recommend 7-15 USD/day for the guide and less for the driver)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":110753,\"land_cost\":\"120304\",\"visa_cost\":\"12000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":243057,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 36458.55\",\"sell