 Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59126,\"land_cost\":\"31600\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"25 KGS LUGGAGE FOR 01 PAX EACH SECTOR\",\"amount\":\"6818\"}],\"cost_price\":97544,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9754.4\",\"selling_price\":107298.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0160/0122019', 107400, 53700, 0, '2019-12-18 19:25:07', '2019-12-18 19:29:04', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(164, 'Mr MANISH KUKREJA', NULL, '9304882138', 'mkkukreja84@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-03-05', 4, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANGKOK\",\"date\":\"05-03-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p><strong>Hotel only for Early Check-In.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BANGKOK & CHAO PHRAYA DINNER CRUISE\",\"date\":\"06-03-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in Bangkok, meet our representative at the airport. You will be transferred to your hotel in Bangkok. In the evening proceed for a cruise on Chaophraya River. A Bangkok river cruise is a luxurious way to view main attractions \\u2014 including the Grand Palace and Wat Arun (Temple of Dawn) \\u2014 illuminated at night. During your Chao Phraya River dinner cruise, feast on a buffet of authentic Thai dishes while watching the lit-up city skyline pass by. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY DREAM WORLD WITH SNOW TOWN\",\"date\":\"07-03-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, proceed for a full-day tour to Dream World. Spend a day at Bangkok\'s Dream World with 4 different zones\\u2014Dream World Plaza, Dream Gardens, Fantasy Land, and Adventure Land. Enjoy over 40 different imported rides and family attractions. Visit the Haunted Mansion, Space Mountain, or experience an arctic winter in Snow Town. Get your thrills at the Haunted Mansion or Space Mountain, ride the cable car or train to see the sights and explore the 7 wonders of the world in Dream Gardens. Check out the parades and a variety of shows, including the Hollywood Action show and the Animals show.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY SAFARI WORLD AND MARINE PARK\",\"date\":\"08-03-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a full-day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions, and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows. Lunch and transport are included on this full-day excursion. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM BANGKOK + SRI RACHA TIGER ZOO\",\"date\":\"09-03-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up and head to Sri Racha Tiger Zoo. Discover the world\\u2019s largest collection of Bengal tigers, and watch how they spend their day in natural settings. Experience the chance of a lifetime to feed and pet a tiger cub during your visit. And don\\u2019t forget to capture these great moments on your camera. Continue your exploration in the park, and interact with other animals, such as camels, elephants, and kangaroos. Don\\u2019t miss out on the great live shows, including the thrilling crocodile wrestling show or be amazed by the circus show as you watch tigers jump through rings of fire. The evening is free for you to enjoy Bangkok on your own.&nbsp;Later you will be transferred to the Airport to catch your return flight back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7269\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":8840},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"83\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:10 AM\",\"fare\":30360},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"120\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 AM\",\"fare\":24356},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":10300}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/03\\/2020\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMAMDA DMA\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"09\\/03\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3},{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>25 KGS</strong> BAGGAGE FOR <strong>02 PAX.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with <strong>Breakfast</strong> in Bangkok.</li>\n	<li>Safari World and Marine Park with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Full-day&nbsp;Dream World + Snow Town with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Chao Phraya<strong> Dinner Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li>Sri Racha Tiger Zoo.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on <strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":73856,\"land_cost\":\"41966\",\"hotel_cost\":0},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"25 KGS BAGGAGE FOR 02 PAX\",\"amount\":\"2600\"}],\"cost_price\":118422,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14210.64\",\"selling_price\":132632.640000000013969838619232177734375}', 'MZQ/0161/0122019', 126580, 33450, 29840, '2019-12-24 17:44:34', '2020-02-04 17:45:30', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(165, 'Mr MOHIT', NULL, '8963938899', 'mohit.mm11@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-03-17', 7, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN PHUKET - FANTASEA SHOW\",\"date\":\"17-03-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our local tour coordinator who will meet and greet you at the specified area and transfer you to the hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening proceed for watching the Fantasea Show. Phuket FantaSea Show, or Fantasy of a Kingdom, is a Las Vegas-style Thai cultural show infused with cutting edge technology and state-of-the-art show elements. See nine exciting shows featuring Thai culture, magic illusion, acrobatics, animal performance, pyrotechnics, stunts, aerial performance, 4-D effects, special effects. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY PHI PHI ISLAND TOUR\",\"date\":\"18-03-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will start for the Phi Phi Island Tour. Phi Phi Islands comprise of six islands, of which the prominent ones are Phi Phi Don, which house the Bohemian Town and the Phi Phi Leh with Maya Bay. These islands are visited by hundreds of tourists for their limestone cliffs that rise out of the emerald green waters, white-sand beaches, and its beautiful coral reefs. Please note it takes about 2 hours one way to reach Phi Phi Island by Big Boat and 1 hour by a Speed boat. You can opt to do snorkeling (at an extra cost by paying National Park Fees) once you reach Phi Phi Island. The national park fees are mandatory if going by speed boat. Enjoy the beach and relax with local lunch. Return back to the hotel in the evening for an overnight stay at Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHUKET TO PATTAYA - ALCAZAR SHOW\",\"date\":\"19-03-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, checkout from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to the airport to catch your flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival in Bangkok, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Pattaya. Check-in and relax. In the evening you will visit the Alcazar Cabaret Show. As the curtain rises, \\u201cThe Wondrous World\\u201d begins. Glittering costumes, flashing lights, and vibrant backdrops catch your eye as you settle in for this exhilarating show. You\\u2019ll find yourself clapping your hands and tapping your toes along with the beat during this hour-and-a-half-long show. As the show comes to an end, take the opportunity to snap some pictures with the performers before you make your way back to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY CORAL ISLAND TOUR\",\"date\":\"20-03-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up and head to Pattaya Beach where the speedboat takes you over to the beautiful Koh Larn Coral Island. As you arrive, be amazed by its vast white-sand beaches and crystal-clear blue water. Plan your stay how you like it\\u2014either relax on the beach, snooze in the sun, swim in the ocean, or try out some water sports, including waterskiing, parasailing, and windsurfing (for an additional fee and subject to availability). After working up an appetite, enjoy a delicious lunch of Thai dishes at a basic, yet pleasant, open-air restaurant right next to the beach. After an action-packed or relaxed day, the speedboat brings you back to Pattaya Beach, where your shuttle bus returns you to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY NONG NOOCH VILLAGE\",\"date\":\"21-03-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the renowned adventure park Nong Nooch Tropical Garden, famous for its vast botanical gardens and impressive elephant and Thai cultural shows. Be welcomed by lush green scenery consisting of 14 different tropical gardens. One of them features a staggering variety of skyward-reaching palms, along with an impressive collection of richly hued, elegant orchids. Witness the Intelligent Elephant Show. This performance takes pride in displaying elephants playing football and basketball, and if you are lucky they might even play with you. Continue your experience by surrounding yourself with the Thai culture. Admire traditional dances, and be fascinated by Thai martial art and religious ceremonies. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PATTAYA TO BANGKOK - CITY TOUR + DINNER CRUISE\",\"date\":\"22-03-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, check-out from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to Bangkok. Upon reaching Bangkok proceed for city tour which takes you to some of Bangkok\'s most distinguished Buddhist temples locally known as Wats. Visit Wat Traimit, Temple of the Golden Buddha which is home to a 5.5-ton statue of the holy Buddha made from solid gold and is a fine example of Sukhothai art. In the evening proceed for a cruise on Chaophraya River. A Bangkok river cruise is a luxurious way to view main attractions \\u2014 including the Grand Palace and Wat Arun (Temple of Dawn) \\u2014 illuminated at night. During your Chao Phraya River dinner cruise, feast on a buffet of authentic Thai dishes while watching the lit-up city skyline pass by. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY SAFARI WORLD AND MARINE PARK\",\"date\":\"23-03-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for a full-day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows. Lunch and transport are included on this full-day excursion.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM BANGKOK + MADAME TUSSAUDS\",\"date\":\"24-03-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, check-out from your hotel then proceed to Madame Tussauds. At Madame Tussauds in Bangkok you will have the chance to come up close to celebrities, world leaders and sporting heroes. Divided into sections like history, leaders, arts and science, sports, music, film, TV and Red Carpet is a collection of wax statues from famous people from across the world plus a number of Thai celebrities. If your flight is in the evening you can spend the day doing some shopping at Pratunam or visiting one of the popular malls like Platinum Fashion Mall or MBK Center. Later you will be transferred to the Airport to catch your return flight back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"31\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:05 AM\",\"fare\":33336},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3030\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":10505},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"94\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":27392}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/03\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMADA PATONG\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE AC\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/03\\/2020\",\"rate\":\"15864\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2020\",\"