=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>20 KGS Luggage&nbsp;</strong>is included in <strong>HKT- DMK </strong>Flight.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Phuket.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Pattaya.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Bangkok.</li>\n	<li>FantaSea Show with <strong>Dinner.</strong></li>\n	<li>Phi Phi Island Tour With <strong>Lunch (Gold Seat).</strong></li>\n	<li>Alcazar Show <strong>(VIP Seat).</strong></li>\n	<li>Half-Day Coral Island with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Nong Nooch Garden Shows with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Safari World and Marine Park with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Chao Phraya <strong>Dinner Cruise</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Half-Day City Tour of Bangkok.</li>\n	<li>Madame Tussauds.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on&nbsp;<strong>SIC</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on <strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":71233,\"land_cost\":\"98000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"45000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"20 KGS BAGGAGE FOR 04 PAX IN HKT-DMK FLIGHT\",\"amount\":3600}],\"cost_price\":217833,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21783.3\",\"selling_price\":239616.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0162/0122019', 228800, 57200, 0, '2019-12-24 18:25:28', '2019-12-25 19:01:05', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
