 camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Tickets&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>25 Kgs Check-in Baggage </strong>for<strong> 01</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Pax from CCU-DPS-CCU.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at Hotel selection and daily breakfast at Hotel.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Return airport transfer with English speaking guide cum driver on <strong>PVT</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Water sports</strong>&nbsp;activities including one round banana boat, jet ski, parasailing with a transfer on <strong>SIC</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>FD Kintamani Volcano&nbsp;</strong>View &amp; U<strong>bud Village</strong>&nbsp;tour including Local Lunch at Kintamani&nbsp;with a transfer on <strong>PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Sunset dinner cruise</strong>&nbsp;with a transfer on <strong>PVT</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>120 minutes</strong>&nbsp;of spa treatment with a transfer on <strong>SIC.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":69280,\"land_cost\":\"31400\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"25 KGS BAGGAGE FOR CCU-DPS-CCU FLIGHT\",\"amount\":5700}],\"cost_price\":106380,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10638\",\"selling_price\":117018}', 'MZQ/0163/012020', 112600, 56300, 0, '2020-01-04 13:35:13', '2020-01-04 13:59:16', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
