(167, 'MR KAMAL x 05', NULL, '9334717901', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-01-13', 7, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket - Fantasea Show\",\"date\":\"13-01-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our local tour coordinator who will meet and greet you at the specified area and transfer you to the hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening proceed for watching the Fantasea Show. Phuket FantaSea Show, or Fantasy of a Kingdom, is a Las Vegas-style Thai cultural show infused with cutting edge technology and state-of-the-art show elements. See nine exciting shows featuring Thai culture, magic illusion, acrobatics, animal performance, pyrotechnics, stunts, aerial performance, 4-D effects, special effects.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Phi Phi Island Tour\",\"date\":\"14-01-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will start for the Phi Phi Island Tour. Phi Phi Islands comprise of six islands, of which the prominent ones are Phi Phi Don, which house the Bohemian Town and the Phi Phi Leh with Maya Bay. These islands are visited by hundreds of tourists for their limestone cliffs that rise out of the emerald green waters, white sand beaches, and its beautiful coral reefs. Please note it takes about 2 hours one way to reach Phi Phi Island by Big Boat and 1 hour by a Speed boat. You can opt to do snorkeling (at an extra cost by paying National Park Fees) once you reach Phi Phi Island. The national park fees are mandatory if going by speed boat. Enjoy the beach and relax with local lunch.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"15-01-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today is free for you to explore Phuket on your own. You may choose to go for optional excursions like the James Bond Island. Alternatively spend time relaxing at one of Phuket\'s beaches.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket to Pattaya via Bangkok\",\"date\":\"16-01-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, checkout from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to the airport to catch your flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival in Bangkok, you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel in Pattaya. Check-in and relax. The rest of the day is free for you to explore Pattaya\'s beaches or nightlife.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half Day Coral Island Tour\",\"date\":\"17-01-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up and head to Pattaya Beach where the speedboat takes you over to the beautiful Koh Larn Coral Island. As you arrive, be amazed by its vast white-sand beaches and crystal-clear blue water. Plan your stay how you like it\\u2014either relax on the beach, snooze in the sun, swim in the ocean, or try out some water sports, including waterskiing, parasailing, and windsurfing (for an additional fee and subject to availability). After working up an appetite, enjoy a delicious lunch of Thai dishes at a basic, yet pleasant, open-air restaurant right next to the beach. After an action-packed or relaxed day, the speedboat brings you back to Pattaya Beach, where your shuttle bus returns you to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Sri Racha Tiger Zoo + Alcazar Show\",\"date\":\"18-01-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up and head to Sri Racha Tiger Zoo. Discover the world\\u2019s largest collection of Bengal tigers, and watch how they spend their day in natural settings. Experience the chance of a lifetime to feed and pet a tiger cub during your visit. And don\\u2019t forget to capture these great moments on your camera. Continue your exploration in the park, and interact with other animals, such as camels, elephants, and kangaroos. Don\\u2019t miss out on the great live shows, including the thrilling crocodile wrestling show or be amazed by the circus show as you watch tigers jump through rings of fire. In the evening you will visit the Alcazar Cabaret Show. As the curtain rises, \\u201cThe Wondrous World\\u201d begins. Glittering costumes, flashing lights, and vibrant backdrops catch your eye as you settle in for this exhilarating show. You\\u2019ll find yourself clapping your hands and tapping your toes along with the beat during this hour-and-a-half-long show. As the show comes to an end, take the opportunity to snap some pictures with the performers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer from Pattaya to Bangkok - City and Temple Tour\",\"date\":\"19-01-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, check-out from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to Bangkok. Upon reaching Bangkok proceed for a city tour that takes you to some of Bangkok\'s most distinguished Buddhist temples locally known as Wats. Visit Wat Traimit, Temple of the Golden Buddha which is home to a 5.5-ton statue of the holy Buddha made from solid gold and is a fine example of Sukhothai art.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later check-in to your hotel in Bangkok.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Safari World and Marine Park + Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"20-01-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, check-out from the hotel &amp; proceed for a full-day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions, and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the Night, get&nbsp;transferred to the Airport to catch your return flight back home.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2046\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"61500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1763\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:15 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3092\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":21537},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"78\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"44000\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL IBIS\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"16\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GRAND BELLA\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"19\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMADA D\'MA\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/01\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Ticket&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>20 KGS Luggage&nbsp;</strong>is included in <strong>HKT- DMK </strong>Flight.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Phuket.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Pattaya.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;mentioned&nbsp;Hotel with Breakfast in Bangkok.</li>\n	<li>FantaSea Show with <strong>Dinner.</strong></li>\n	<li>Phi Phi Island Tour With <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Alcazar Show<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li>Half-Day Coral Island with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Full-Day Sriracha Tiger Zoo<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li>Safari World and Marine Park with <strong>Lunch.</strong></li>\n	<li>Half-Day City Tour of Bangkok.</li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;Tours &amp; Transfers on a&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":127037,\"land_cost\":\"178267\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"20 KGS BAGGAGE FOR CCU-KUL-HKT-BKK\",\"amount\":\"4500\"}],\"cost_price\":309804,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 37176.48\",\"selling_price\":346980.4799999999813735485076904296875}', 'MZQ/0164/012020', 335000, 67000, 0, '2020-01-04 17:26:09', '2020-01-04 17:32:44', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(168, 'Mr R K SAMIR', NULL, '7004153501', 'rkrishnasamir@gmail.com', 'DUBAI', '2020-03-19', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival At Dubai - Evening Dhow Cruise\",\"date\":\"19-03-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Dubai International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel and check-in (Normal Check-in time is at 14:00 hrs \\u2013 Early check-in is subject to availability and may cost extra). In evening pick up from hotel around 6:30 pm and proceed to enjoy Dhow Cruise. Cruising down Dubai creek is a novel experience, one which you cannot miss when in Dubai. Dividing the charming \'city of lights\' into two commercial districts, Dubai Creek epitomizes the city\'s personality. The view of the city is intertwining with the traditional and modern architect and culture. On dhow cruise; international buffet dinner will be served with soft drinks in the silence along Dubai Creek. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Abu Dhabi Tour With Ferrari World\",\"date\":\"20-03-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for a full-day tour of Abu Dhabi with Ferrari Theme Park. We start our Abu Dhabi City tour in the morning and our journey will start from Dubai will take you past the Jebel Ali Port, the largest man-made port in the entire world on the road to Abu Dhabi. On arrival at Abu Dhabi head to the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, to admire the white marble courtyards and prayer rooms of this vast, modern masterpiece. Please ensure proper dress code while visiting. In the afternoon visit Ferrari World. Ferrari World is Situated on the Yas island, FWAD has a surface area of 200,000 square meters, all undercover, which makes it the biggest indoor park in the world. There are over 20 attractions for visitors to enjoy, from the most futuristic such as Formula Rossa, the world\'s fastest rollercoaster, which can accelerate its cars from 0 to 240 km in the same time as a Formula 1 car, to the four-dimensional Speed of Magic. Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Morning Half Day City Tour -Dubai Mall And Top Of Burj Khalifa\",\"date\":\"21-03-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds for a panoramic half-day city tour of Dubai. The tour includes a visit to Dubai Museum (entry ticket not included) that is housed within the 18th century, Al Fahidi Fort. It has on display arts and artifacts reflecting the ancient history and lifestyle of traditional Arabs. For a peep into the glitzy side of Dubai, our itinerary further comprises a tour to such phenomenal attractions of the city as Burj Al Arab Hotel \\u2013 the world\\u2019s only seven-star hotel that is especially noted for its distinctive silhouette resembling a billowing sail, the Palm Island \\u2013 the crescent-shaped man-made island with the magnificent Atlantis Hotel at its crown. The journey ends with a drive through Sheik Zayed Road that has imposing skyscrapers lined on its either side and shopping at one of the city\\u2019s prominent shopping malls.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After Lunch visits Dubai Mall, one of the largest malls in the world and home to over 1200 stores. Later proceed to the Top of Burj Khalifa, World\'s Tallest Tower. You will be taken to the 124th Floor Observation Deck at Burj Khalifa from where you can admire panoramic views entire Dubai. Spend half an hour at the top and then come down, and at 7 pm watch the Dubai Fountains come alive. There is a 10-minute show every 20 minutes and it\'s lovely to watch the largest fountain in the world.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Evening Desert Safari With Dinner\",\"date\":\"22-03-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast you are free to enjoy first half of the day on your own. In the evening take a thrilling ride through the deserts. Relish authentic Arabic cuisine. Be spellbound by the enthralling performances by exotic dancers. Watch the stars blinking at you in the wildness of the desert. All this and more for the tourist. Trip to the desert is full of Fun and adventure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"23-03-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast transfer to the airport in order for you to catch your flight back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"141\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"fare\":48160},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"142\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2020\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL JACOBS GARDEN\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"23\\/03\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":11}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Tickets <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong> Accommodation with B/F in Dubai.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Half-Day Dubai City Tour.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Dhow Cruise with Dinner.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Burj Khalifa. (124th&nbsp;Floor)</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner &amp; Belly Dance show.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Abu Dhabi Tour With Ferrari World.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Visa Fee &amp; OTB.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;All Tours on SIC basis.</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;All Transfers on PVT basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":48160,\"land_cost\":\"81614\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"REMITANCE\",\"amount\":2400}],\"cost_price\":132174,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18504.36\",\"selling_price\":150678.359999999986030161380767822265625}', 'MZQ/0165/012020', 151080, 52590, 45900, '2020-01-06 19:17:43', '2020-01-07 19:27:03', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(169, 'Mr SANDEEP KUMAR MUNDA', NULL, '7367816582', 'holidays@multizonetravels.com', 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2020-01-21', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"21-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"22-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built-in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built-in (1885), Christ Church built-in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. Overnight Stay in Shimla.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"23-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple, Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"24-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"25-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OR<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point&nbsp; (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 meters above sea level and 51 km outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendor. At the top of the pass, the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. Overnight Stay in Manali.&nbsp;(Closed on Tuesday)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"26-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>Checkout from Manali hotel and drive to Chandigarh. Overnight Stay in Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.&nbsp; Evening visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rock Garden, and Sukhna Lake is <strong>subject to time availability.&nbsp;<\\/strong>Overnight Stay in Chandigarh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"27-01-2020\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":12298},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"706\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":7,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"707\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":6372},{\"id\":8,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jan 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jan 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL WOODRINA \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"UTOPIA RESORTS \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"26\\/01\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/01\\/2020\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHAGUN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/01\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong>&nbsp;Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Shimla on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Manali on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Chandigarh on MAP basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meals.&nbsp;<strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>Transportation by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Indigo / Similar</strong>&nbsp;for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass.&nbsp;<strong>(Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit)</strong></li>\n	<li>Any extra expenses such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced Majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":18670,\"land_cost\":\"32000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":50670,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 6080.4\",\"selling_price\":56750.4000000000014551915228366851806640625}', 'MZQ/0166/012020', 56300, 28150, 0, '2020-01-07 10:56:26', '2020-01-29 14:20:04', 1, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(170, 'Mr Vimhya Prakash', NULL, '9334487642', NULL, 'DUBAI', '2020-02-10', 4, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival At Dubai\",\"date\":\"10-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Dubai International Airport, you will be transferred to the hotel and check-in. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Abu Dhabi Tour With Ferrari World\",\"date\":\"11-02-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds for&nbsp;a full-day tour of Abu Dhabi with Ferrari Theme Park. We start our Abu Dhabi City tour in the morning and our journey will start from Dubai will take you past the Jebel Ali Port, the largest man-made port in the entire world on the road to Abu Dhabi. On arrival at Abu Dhabi head to the Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque, to admire the white marble courtyards and prayer rooms of this vast, modern masterpiece. Please ensure proper dress code while visiting. In the afternoon visit Ferrari World. Ferrari World is Situated on the Yas island, FWAD has a surface area of 200,000 square meters, all undercover, which makes it the biggest indoor park in the world. There are over 20 attractions for visitors to enjoy, from the most futuristic such as Formula Rossa, the world\'s fastest rollercoaster, which can accelerate its cars from 0 to 240 km in the same time as a Formula 1 car, to the four-dimensional Speed of Magic. Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Burj Khalifa & Dubai Mall, Evening Dhow Cruise\",\"date\":\"12-02-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Lunch visits Dubai Mall, one of the largest malls in the world and home to over 1200 stores. Later proceed to the Top of Burj Khalifa, World\'s Tallest Tower. You will be taken to the 124th Floor Observation Deck at Burj Khalifa from where you can admire panoramic views entire Dubai. Spend half an hour at the top and then come down, and at 7 pm watch the Dubai Fountains come alive. There is a 10-minute show every 20 minutes and it\'s lovely to watch the largest fountain in the world.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Morning Dubai City Tour & Evening Desert Safari With Dinner\",\"date\":\"13-02-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceeds for a panoramic half-day city tour of Dubai. The tour includes a visit to Dubai Museum (entry ticket not included) that is housed within the 18th century, Al Fahidi Fort. It has on display arts and artifacts reflecting the ancient history and lifestyle of traditional Arabs. For a peep into the glitzy side of Dubai, our itinerary further comprises a tour to such phenomenal attractions of the city as Burj Al Arab Hotel \\u2013 the world\\u2019s only seven-star hotel that is especially noted for its distinctive silhouette resembling a billowing sail, the Palm Island \\u2013 the crescent-shaped man-made island with the magnificent Atlantis Hotel at its crown. The journey ends with a drive through Sheik Zayed Road that has imposing skyscrapers lined on its either side and shopping at one of the city\\u2019s prominent shopping malls.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening take a thrilling ride through the deserts. Relish authentic Arabic cuisine. Be spellbound by the enthralling performances by exotic dancers. Watch the stars blinking at you in the wildness of the desert. All this and more for the tourist. Trip to the desert is full of fun and adventure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"14-02-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Evening transfer to the airport in order for you to catch your flight back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5316\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"72000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"61\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Feb 2020\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"22\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"421\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"07:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMADA BY WHYNDHAM JUMEIRAH\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"14\\/02\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Economy Class Flight Tickets&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation with Breakfast in<strong> 5* Hotel</strong> in Dubai.</li>\n	<li>Half-Day Dubai City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Dhow Cruise with <strong>Dinner</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Burj Khalifa. <strong>(124th&nbsp;Floor)</strong></li>\n	<li>Desert Safari with <strong>BBQ Dinner</strong> &amp; Belly Dance show.</li>\n	<li>Abu Dhabi Tour With Ferrari World.</li>\n	<li>Visa Fee &amp; OTB.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC</strong> basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on <strong>PVT</strong> basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":72000,\"land_cost\":\"101835\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Remittance Charges\",\"amount\":2200}],\"cost_price\":176035,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 17603.5\",\"selling_price\":193638.5}', 'MZQ/0167/012020', 193500, 64500, 0, '2020-01-11 14:51:22', '2020-01-11 15:41:47', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(171, 'Dr AMAR KUMAR', NULL, '7979929708', 'dramarhazaribagh@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-02-17', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket\",\"date\":\"17-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our local tour coordinator who will meet and greet you at the specified area and transfer you to the hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Phi Phi Island Tour\",\"date\":\"18-02-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will start for the Phi Phi Island Tour. Phi Phi Islands comprise of six islands, of which the prominent ones are Phi Phi Don, which house the Bohemian Town and the Phi Phi Leh with Maya Bay. These islands are visited by hundreds of tourists for their limestone cliffs that rise out of the emerald green waters, white-sand beaches, and its beautiful coral reefs. Please note it takes about 2 hours one way to reach Phi Phi Island by Big Boat and 1 hour by a Speed boat. You can opt to do snorkeling (at an extra cost by paying National Park Fees) once you reach Phi Phi Island. The national park fees is mandatory if going by speed boat. Enjoy the beach and relax with local lunch. Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Fantasea Show\",\"date\":\"19-02-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the evening proceed for watching the Fantasea Show. Phuket FantaSea Show, or Fantasy of a Kingdom, is a Las Vegas-style Thai cultural show infused with cutting edge technology and state-of-the-art show elements. See nine exciting shows featuring Thai culture, magic illusion, acrobatics, animal performance, pyrotechnics, stunts, aerial performance, 4-D effects, special effects. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer from Phuket to Bangkok\",\"date\":\"20-02-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, checkout from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to the airport to catch your flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival in Bangkok, you will be met by our representative and transferred to the hotel. Check-in and relax. The rest of the day is free for you to explore Bangkok\'s vibrant markets or nightlife.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Safari World and Marine Park\",\"date\":\"21-02-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for a full-day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions, and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows. Lunch and transport are included on this full-day excursion.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"22-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast, check-out from your hotel. If your flight is in the evening you can spend the day doing some shopping at Pratunam or visiting one of the popular malls like Platinum Fashion Mall or MBK Center. Later you will be transferred to the Airport to catch your return flight back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"822\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"37000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1761\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:55 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3030\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"9500\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"78\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"28500\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"344\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL HYATT PLACE PATONG\",\"room_type\":\"POOL VIEW ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"20\\/02\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMADA D\'MA\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/02\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy class flight&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>20 Kgs&nbsp;</strong>Baggage for<strong>&nbsp;02 Pax in HKT-DMK&nbsp;sectors.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Phuket with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Bangkok with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Full-day Phi Phi Island by Big Boat with Lunch on&nbsp;<strong>SIC&nbsp;</strong>basis.</li>\n	<li>Fantasea Show with Dinner on&nbsp;<strong>SIC&nbsp;</strong>basis.</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Safari World &amp; Marine Park with Lunch on&nbsp;<strong>SIC</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>HKT</strong>&nbsp;Airport----------<strong>PHUKET</strong>&nbsp;Hotel Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>PHUKET</strong>&nbsp;Hotel----------<strong>HKT</strong>&nbsp;Airport Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>DMK</strong>&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;----------<strong>BANGKOK</strong>&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>BANGKOK&nbsp;</strong>Hotel-------<strong>BKK&nbsp;</strong>Airport Pvt.</li>\n	<li>All Sightseeing on&nbsp;<strong>Seat In Coach</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":75000,\"land_cost\":\"60883\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"20 KGS OF BAGGAGE IN HKT-DMK SECTOR FOR 02 PAX\",\"amount\":1800}],\"cost_price\":137683,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13768.3\",\"selling_price\":151451.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0168/012020', 151400, 55900, 39600, '2020-01-13 18:35:31', '2020-01-13 18:58:12', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(172, 'Mr KANCHAN KUMAR', NULL, '9334319547', 'mvpranchi2013@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-04-07', 3, 0, 10, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL IN BANGKOK\",\"date\":\"07-04-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in Bangkok, meet our representative at the airport. You will be transferred to your hotel in Pattaya. Check-in and relax for some time. Later proceed to Sri Racha Tiger Zoo. Discover the world\\u2019s largest collection of Bengal tigers, and watch how they spend their day in natural settings. Experience the chance of a lifetime to feed and pet a tiger cub during your visit. And don\\u2019t forget to capture these great moments on your camera. Continue your exploration in the park, and interact with other animals, such as camels, elephants, and kangaroos. Don\\u2019t miss out on the great live shows, including the thrilling crocodile wrestling show or be amazed by the circus show as you watch tigers jump through rings of fire. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY CORAL ISLAND WITH LUNCH + RUSSIAN DANCE SHOW\",\"date\":\"08-04-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up and head to Pattaya Beach where the speedboat takes you over to the beautiful Koh Larn Coral Island. As you arrive, be amazed by its vast white-sand beaches and crystal-clear blue water. Plan your stay how you like it\\u2014either relax on the beach, snooze in the sun, swim in the ocean, or try out some water sports, including waterskiing, parasailing, and windsurfing (for an additional fee and subject to availability). After working up an appetite, enjoy a delicious lunch of Thai dishes at a basic, yet pleasant, open-air restaurant right next to the beach. After an action-packed or relaxed day, the speedboat brings you back to Pattaya Beach, where your shuttle bus returns you to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening proceed to Russian Show - The show is meant for adults only - the participants perform incredible tricks on the stage. This is real extreme! The extraordinary non-standard performance will take your breath away and make your heart pound furiously. Only in Pattaya, you have a magnificent opportunity to see unbelievable tricks presented in a unique sex-show. You will see a performance of men playing the drums without using the drumsticks. An actress is capable of shooting the balloons with darts flying out of her... Duck your heads! You can also witness a deadly stunt - an actress takes out a several meters long chain of garlands spattered with blades.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BIG EYE SHOW\",\"date\":\"09-04-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the evening proceed to BIG EYE Show - The show is meant for adults only - the participants perform incredible tricks on the stage. This is real extreme! The extraordinary non-standard performance will take your breath away and make your heart pound furiously. Only in Pattaya, you have a magnificent opportunity to see unbelievable tricks presented in a unique sex-show. You will see a performance of men playing the drums without using the drumsticks. An actress is capable of shooting the balloons with darts flying out of her... Duck your heads! You can also witness a deadly stunt - an actress takes out a several meters long chain of garlands spattered with blades.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"TRANSFER FROM PATTAYA TO BANGKOK - CITY  & TEMPLE TOUR + DEPARTURE FROM BANGKOK\",\"date\":\"10-04-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning check-out from your hotel. You will be transferred to Bangkok. Upon reaching Bangkok proceed for the city tour which takes you to some of Bangkok\'s most distinguished Buddhist temples locally known as Wats. Visit the famous temples of Bangkok like Wat Traimit, the temple of 5.5 tons Golden Buddha, Mahaputram Temple, and reclining buddha. After the city tour spend some time shopping. Later you will be transferred to the airport to catch your return flight.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"121\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Apr 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Apr 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"107970\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"120\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Apr 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Apr 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/04\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GOLDEN BEACH\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"10\\/04\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy class flight&nbsp;<strong>Ex- KOLKATA</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Pattaya with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Sri Racha Tiger Zoo&nbsp;with Lunch on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Coral Island Tour by Speedboat with Lunch on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Russian Show&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Big Eye Show&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li>Bangkok City Tour&nbsp;on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Lunches</strong>&nbsp;&amp; <strong>03 Dinners</strong> in Pattaya in an Indian restaurant.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Lunch</strong>&nbsp;&amp; <strong>01 Dinner</strong>&nbsp;in Bangkok in an Indian restaurant.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<b>DMK&nbsp;</b>Airport----------<strong>PATTAYA</strong>&nbsp;Hotel Pvt.</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;<strong>PATTAYA</strong>&nbsp;Hotel----------<strong>DMK&nbsp;</strong>Airport Pvt.</li>\n	<li>All Sightseeing on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on&nbsp;<strong>PVT</strong>&nbsp;Basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Optional Cost:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>20 KGS</strong> LUGGAGE IN <strong>CCU-DMK-CCU</strong> SECTOR <strong>@ 2692 PER PAX.</strong></li>\n	<li>ALCAZAR SHOW @ <strong>1175</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":107970,\"land_cost\":\"135500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":243470,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24347\",\"selling_price\":267817}', 'MZQ/0169/012020', 267800, 26780, 0, '2020-01-18 15:13:09', '2020-01-18 15:17:02', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(173, 'MR TUN TUN SONI', NULL, '9386269616', NULL, 'SHIMLA & MANALI', '2020-02-26', 6, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL AT CHANDIGARH - SHIMLA (113 KMS 04 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"26-02-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Chandigarh Airport and drive to Shimla. Overnight Stay in Shimla.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA (KUFRI SIGHTSEEING )\",\"date\":\"27-02-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri. After lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built-in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built-in (1885), Christ Church built-in (1844), The Gaiety Theater- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. Overnight Stay in Shimla.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHIMLA TO MANALI (248 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"28-02-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 248 km 8 hrs. En-route visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple, Kullu Valley. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"29-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. Overnight Stay in Manali.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI\",\"date\":\"01-03-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; OR<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Excursion to Rohtang Pass till snow point&nbsp; (Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit). Situated at an altitude of 3979 meters above sea level and 51 km outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendor. At the top of the pass, the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure. Overnight Stay in Manali.&nbsp;(Closed on Tuesday)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI TO CHANDIGARH (305 KMS 08 HOURS Approx)\",\"date\":\"02-03-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Checkout from Manali hotel and drive to Chandigarh. Overnight Stay in Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.&nbsp; Evening visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rock Garden, and Sukhna Lake is <strong>subject to time availability.&nbsp;<\\/strong>Overnight Stay in Chandigarh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM CHANDIGARH\",\"date\":\"03-03-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout from Chandigarh hotel and transfer to airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"10:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"fare\":22150},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"706\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"707\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":23455},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Mar 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Mar 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SILVER INN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/02\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL ROYAL PARK RESORT \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"02\\/03\\/2020\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"02\\/03\\/2020\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SHAGUN \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/03\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":11}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket<strong>&nbsp;Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Shimla on <strong>MAP</strong> basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Manali on <strong>MAP</strong> basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>3*</strong>&nbsp;hotel in Chandigarh on <strong>MAP</strong> basis.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meals.&nbsp;<strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>Transportation by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Innova / Similar</strong>&nbsp;for the entire tour.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing and excursions as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Heater Charges.</li>\n	<li>Unforeseen Expenses because of the weather conditions.</li>\n	<li>Excursion to Rohtang Pass.&nbsp;<strong>(Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit)</strong></li>\n	<li>Any extra expenses such as route change, Date change, Accommodation facilities, etc incurred due to the unforeseen, unavoidable forced Majeure&nbsp;circumstances during the tour.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":45605,\"land_cost\":\"61800\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":107405,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16110.75\",\"selling_price\":123515.75}', 'MZQ/0170/012020', 123700, 26200, 18900, '2020-01-21 19:02:49', '2020-01-22 09:54:26', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(174, 'MR VIVEK', 'MANISH KUKREJA', '9955994171', 'tc08050@pidilite.in', 'DARJEELING & GANGTOK', '2020-02-13', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport \\u2013 Darjeeling (75 kms \\/ 3 hrs)\",\"date\":\"13-02-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet &amp; Greet on arrival at NJP Railway Station \\/ IXB Airport &amp; transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 ft.). On arrival Check-in to hotel &amp; rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Sightseeing \\u2013 Gangtok (100 kms \\/ 4 hrs)\",\"date\":\"14-02-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) back to the hotel. After breakfast start at 8.30 AM visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple, Ghoom Monastery, Batasia Loop. After that proceed to picturesque drive to Gangtok (5,500 ft.). On arrival Check-in to your hotel. Rest of the day free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir\",\"date\":\"15-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft.) &amp; Baba Mandir (13,200 ft.) which is 55 kms one way from Gangtok city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>#<\\/strong>(In case of Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provide alternate sightseeing.)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"16-02-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start for a Full day city tour covering Tashi view point, Ganesh Tok, Hanuman Tok, Flower show, Cottage Industry, and Handicraft Centre, Institute of Tibetology, Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery &amp; Banjakhri Falls (maximum 6 hours).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok \\u2013 NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport (120 kms \\/ 5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"17-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Check-out from hotel in time and take the departure transfer to NJP Railway Station \\/ IXB Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/02\\/2020\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SILVER STAR BOUTIQUE \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"A\\/C DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/02\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/02\\/2020\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SIKKIM DELIGHT \\/ SIMILARSikkim Delight\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"room_type\":\"A\\/C DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"17\\/02\\/2020\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation on twin/Double Sharing Basis.</li>\n	<li>All the room are based category</li>\n	<li>All Day Breakfast at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>Private 01 AC Scorpio / Xylo</strong> as per itinerary on point to point basis only (Ac will not run in Hill area).&nbsp;<strong>The vehicle will not be at disposal &amp; it will be available as per itinerary only (point to point basis).</strong></li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Air Fare / Train fare.</li>\n	<li>Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips &amp; gratuity, mineral water, soft &amp; hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage.</li>\n	<li>Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fees &amp; Guide charges.</li>\n	<li>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like landslides, road&nbsp;blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot).</li>\n	<li>Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to an increase in cost on surface transportation &amp; land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Room Heater Charges</li>\n	<li>Insurance.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"41600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":41600,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 6240\",\"selling_price\":47840}', 'MZQ/0171/012020', 50200, 12550, 0, '2020-01-23 12:18:42', '2020-01-23 12:27:07', 0, 0, '\"<p>Supplement Cost for Nathula Pass @ <strong>Rs.4,500.00 <\\/strong>per car will be charged extra (Monday &amp; Tuesday closed).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like landslides, road blockage, political disturbances, etc.&nbsp; (To be borne by the client, this is directly payable on the spot).<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Normally we are not suggestible double service in this winter season, as the day time is shorter than the summertime. If the guest will do double service and all the spots will not be completed due to time shortage of time, we are not responsible for that. Every sightseeing place is maintaining timing for closing. So this is our suggestion not to avail double services in a single day or to start early morning.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>We need Guest Name &amp; Arrival \\/ Departure details to process your booking.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Baba Mandir is a new baba mandir.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Permit require for Tsomgo Lake. It is mandatory that guests should carry 02 copies of passport size photograph, original photo ID proof with photo copy (identity card \\u2013 Voter ID card \\/ Passport \\/ Driving License) for processing the permit. Aadhar Card \\/ PAN Card - not acceptable for issuance of the Permit.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>Innova is a low chassis car and not ideal to Tsomgo Lake \\u2013 Baba Mandir. The alternative in a Luxury vehicle like Scorpio \\/ Xylo will be provided<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(175, 'Mr Anil Kumar Yadav', NULL, '7992435986', 'anilyadav347@gmail.com', 'THAILAND', '2020-06-07', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket\",\"date\":\"07-06-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our local tour coordinator who will meet and greet you at the specified area and transfer you to the hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Phi Phi Island Tour\",\"date\":\"08-06-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you will start for the Phi Phi Island Tour. Phi Phi Islands comprise of six islands, of which the prominent ones are Phi Phi Don, which house the Bohemian Town and the Phi Phi Leh with Maya Bay. These islands are visited by hundreds of tourists for their limestone cliffs that rise out of the emerald green waters, white sand beaches and its beautiful coral reefs. Please note it takes about 2 hours one way to reach Phi Phi Island by Big Boat and 1 hour by a Speed boat. You can opt to do snorkeling (at extra cost by paying National Park Fees) once you reach Phi Phi Island. The national park fees is mandatory if going by speed boat. Enjoy the beach and relax with a local lunch. Return back to the hotel in the evening for overnight stay<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"09-06-2020 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today is free for you to explore Phuket on your own. You may choose to go for optional excursions like the James Bond Island. Alternatively spend time relaxing at one of Phuket\'s beaches.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer from Phuket to Bangkok\",\"date\":\"10-06-2020 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, checkout from your hotel. You will be picked up and transferred to the airport to catch your flight to Bangkok. Upon arrival in Bangkok, you will be met by our representative and transferred to the hotel. Check-in and relax. The rest of the day is free for you to explore Bangkok\'s vibrant markets or nightlife.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Madame Tussauds\",\"date\":\"11-06-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed to Madame Tussauds. At Madame Tussauds in Bangkok you will have the chance to come up close to celebrities, world leaders and sporting heroes. Divided into sections as history, leaders, arts and science, sports, music, film, TV and Red Carpet is a collection of wax statues from famous people from across the world plus a number of Thai celebrities.&nbsp;Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok City and Temple Tour and Chao Phraya Cruise\",\"date\":\"12-06-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, you will get an opportunity to explore the magnificent temples of Bangkok with the City and Temple Tour of Bangkok. Visit the famous temples of Bangkok like Wat Traimit, the temple of 5.5 tons Golden Buddha, Mahaputram Temple (Small Reclining Buddha - only included in sharing tour), and reclining buddha (only included in Private tour). Your tour will come to an end at Gems Gallery, the largest jewellery store in the world. In the evening enjoy a cruise on Chaophraya river. A Bangkok river cruise is a luxurious way to view main attractions \\u2014 including the Grand Palace and Wat Arun (Temple of Dawn) \\u2014 illuminated at night. During your Chao Phraya River dinner cruise, feast on a buffet of authentic Thai dishes while watching the lit-up city skyline pass by. Return back to your hotel for overnight stay.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Safari World and Marine Park + Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"13-06-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for a full-day tour to Safari World and Marine Park. Enjoy the services of a guide who introduces you to Safari World\\u2019s two main attractions \\u2014 the Safari Park and Marine Park. Observe lions and zebras from your vehicle during a safari tour through African-inspired landscapes; go in search of crocodiles and gorillas on a jungle cruise; and view dolphins, sea lions, and orangutans on exhibit and at entertaining animal shows. Lunch and transport are included on this full-day excursion.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>If your flight is in the evening you can spend the day doing some shopping at Pratunam or visiting one of the popular malls like Platinum Fashion Mall or MBK Center. Later you will be transferred to the Airport to catch your return flight back home.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"121\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 AM\",\"fare\":21594},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3037\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"fare\":8713},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"3008\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Jun 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Jun 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"120\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2020\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2020\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL AMATA PATONG\",\"room_type\":\"STANDARD ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"10\\/06\\/2020\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/06\\/2020\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL RAMADA D\'MA\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERI