kfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>4* Hotel</strong> in Bangkok with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Phi Phi Island Tour with Lunch.</li>\n	<li>Madame Tussauds.</li>\n	<li>Bangkok City Tour.</li>\n	<li>Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise.</li>\n	<li>Full-Day Safari world with Marine Park + Lunch.</li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC </strong>basis.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers on <strong>PVT </strong>basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":30307,\"land_cost\":\"53000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"baggage 20kgs CCU-BKK-HKT-BKK-CCU@ 3602+ 5248\",\"amount\":8850}],\"cost_price\":92157,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5529.42\",\"selling_price\":98157,\"profit_figure\":\"6000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"6.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0172/012020', 93200, 46600, 0, '2020-01-24 19:25:13', '2020-01-25 15:09:54', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
