(177, 'Ms AYUSHI AGARWALLA', NULL, '7304901292', NULL, 'GOA', '2020-02-20', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Goa and transfer to Hotel\",\"date\":\"20-02-2020 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Goa Airport &amp; get transferred to your pre-booked hotel at North Goa on a private Vehicle basis. Overnight at the respective hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North Goa Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"21-02-2020 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today get ready to explore North Goa. Reach to the nearest pick-up point to board your coach for North Goa sightseeing on SIC basis as arranged by your hotel. Places Covered: (i) Fort Aguada (ii) Sinquerim Beach (iii) Calangute Beach (iv) Baga Beach (v) Anjuna (vi) Vagator Beach (vii) Chapora Fort *Important Note: Pick up point should be from Sinquerim, Candolim, Calangute, Saligao, Arpora, Baga &amp; Panjim. It is tried to cover the maximum number of places with the time in hand.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"22-02-2020 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Full day free for leisure. Enjoy the amenities at&nbsp;Hotel. Overnight at Goa.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"23-02-2020 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Full day free for leisure. Enjoy the amenities at Hotel. Overnight at Goa.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to Goa Airport\",\"date\":\"24-02-2020 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today check out from hotel and get transferred to Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour Ends.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"HYDERABAD (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"542\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Feb 2020\",\"dep_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Feb 2020\",\"arv_time\":