(180, 'DEVENDRA KUMAR', 'MONU, BASTI', '8052704000', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MUMBAI + GOA', '2021-02-08', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUMBAI ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"08-02-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in Mumbai get transfer on your OWN to Hotel Taj Mahal Palace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUMBAI - GOA\",\"date\":\"09-02-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check-out from Hotel &amp; reach&nbsp;Mumbai Airport on your own &amp; start your onward travel to GOA.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive at Goa Airport\\/Railway Station\\/Bus Stand\\/Marmugao Port &amp; get transferred to your pre-booked Hotel at North Goa on a private Vehicle basis.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at the respective Hotel.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NORTH GOA SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"10-02-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today get ready to board your vehicle for your North Goa Sightseeing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Place covered will be : Fort Aguada, Sinquerim Beach, Calangute Beach, Baga Beach, Anjuna, Vagator Beach, Chapora Fort, Dolphin Trip - Extra Cost, Water Sports - Extra Own cost ( Timing 10 am - 5 pm ). (Dolphin Trip, Water Sports &amp; Chapora Fort open from October - May only)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In Evening Boat Cruise Ride on Mandovi River.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY DUDHSAGAR\",\"date\":\"11-02-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast you will proceed to visit Dudhsagar Fall. Dudhsagar Falls literally Sea of Milk is a four-tiered waterfall located on the Mandovi River in the Indian state of Goa. The area is surrounded by a deciduous forests with a rich biodiversity. The falls are not particularly spectacular during the dry season but during the monsoon season however, the falls are fed by rains and form a huge force of water.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SOUTH GOA SIGHTSEEING & AIRPORT DROP\",\"date\":\"12-02-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today check out from hotel and board your vehicle for South Goa Sightseeing &amp;&nbsp;later in the evening get drop to Airport.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Places covered will be : Shree Mangueshi Temple, Old Goa Churches, Dona Paula, Miramar Beach, Shopping at Panjim, Spice Plantation.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour Ends with Sweet Memories.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Lucknow (LKO)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"685\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"11518\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Goa (GOI)\",\"name\":\"GoAir\",\"fno\":\"371\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"5926\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Goa (GOI)\",\"to\":\"Lucknow (LKO)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"589\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 PM\",\"fare\":10748}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/02\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL TAJ MAHAL PALACE\",\"room_type\":\"LUXURY ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/02\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"17567\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/02\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GOA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL CALANGUTE TOWER\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/02\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"21000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Tickets Ex- Lucknow.</li>\n	<li>01 Night&nbsp;stay in Hotel Taj Mahal Palace. Mumbai on AP basis(B/F + Lunch + Dinner).</li>\n	<li>03 Nights stay in Hotel Calangute Tower. Goa on MAP basis(B/F&nbsp;+ Dinner).</li>\n	<li>All sightseeings in Goa as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>01 Exclusive Sedan Car in Goa as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Kindly NOTE: </strong>We are not giving any vehicle for Airport Transfers.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"34\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":28192,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":38567},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":66759,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22698.06\",\"selling_price\":89457.0599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0177/0112020', 89000, 44500, 0, '2020-11-04 11:58:59', '2021-02-19 17:44:14', 1, 1, NULL, 1, 1),
