efunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Ticket Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>02 Nights Accomodation in above mentioned hotel.</li>\n	<li>Buffet Breakfast.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":17028,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":5300},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":22328,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 2679.36\",\"selling_price\":25007.360000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0184/012021', 25100, 12550, 0, '2021-01-15 16:01:53', '2021-01-15 16:01:53', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(188, 'MR MOHIT X 06', 'GAUTAM KATHPAL', '9572818025', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2021-01-24', 6, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Andaman - Cellular Jail + Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"24-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the&nbsp;<u>morning\\/afternoon<\\/u>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<u>flight<\\/u>&nbsp;and transfer to&nbsp;<u>Hotel.<\\/u>&nbsp;After some rest visit the famous&nbsp;<b>C<u>ellular Jail&nbsp;<\\/u><\\/b><u>(Entry closes @ 1545 hrs)<\\/u>, Cellular Jail, also known as Kalapani is an old colonial prison situated in Port Blair, the capital of Andaman and Nicobar Islands. Constructed by the Britishers during their colonial rule in India, Cellular Jail was used particularly to exile political prisoners where they were subjected to many atrocities at the hands of the British. The jail complex is now maintained by the Government of India and it is recognized as the national memorial monument that showcases the life of prisoners during the British era and then attends the enthralling&nbsp;<b><u>Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;- where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. The sound and light show at Cellular Jail are showcased as a conversation between an Atma (Spirit) and a Pipal Tree in the legendary actor Om Puri\'s Voice. The show is approximately 45 - 50 minutes. Later drop back to Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - Havelock - Afternoon visit to Beach No 7\",\"date\":\"25-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Departure by morning\\/ afternoon Private\\/Govt ferry (PB HL) from&nbsp;<b><u>Port Blair \\u2013 Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)<\\/u><\\/b>. The ferry takes 1.5-2.5 Hrs to reach Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)<i>(Proceed inside the jetty with your own luggage as our staff is not allowed inside the jetty and once you enter the jetty proceed to the ferry counter and show the printout of your ticket and get the boarding stamped and then wait for the boarding announcement and then proceed with your luggage towards the ferry and any big luggage is to be handed over to the ferry staff and hand luggage to be carried on board and once you reach the destination collect your luggage outside the ferry and proceed towards the exit of the terminal)<\\/i>. Our person will be waiting at the exit of the gate with Guest Name on a Placard. Proceed to selected Hotel and between around 1430 hrs - 1530 hrs proceed to<u>&nbsp;<b>Beach No 7* (Radhanagar Beach)<\\/b><\\/u>&nbsp;rated as the \\u2018Best Beach in Asia\\u2019 by Time Magazine and unwind and relax and enjoy the pristine white sand beach.&nbsp;<b><i>To get the best view of Radhanagar Beach, we would recommend you to go in the water until Hip Level. Once there, turn around and you will see the Clean Blue Waters + the mystic white sand, and the magical green trees, and this is the best view one can have of Radhanagar Beach<\\/i><\\/b>. There are some local shops where guests purchase some snacks and refreshments. Evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock  - Elephant Beach\\/ Lighthouse\",\"date\":\"26-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Embark on the most memorable excursion to&nbsp;<b><u>Elephant Beach or Light House<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;by sharing boat&nbsp;<i>(Elephant Beach was called so as it was an Elephant Training Camp run by the Forest Department in the 1990s. The same is not operational now and there are no Elephants at Elephant Beach)<\\/i>. The journey time is 30-45 mins and spend some time on the breathtaking white sands of Elephant Beach and you can enjoy a variety of Fruit Chats, Coconut Water, Samosa chat and Jalmuri, etc on direct payment basis and also you can also go for some water sports activities like Snorkeling, Sea Walk, Jet Ski, Glass bottom Boat, Banana Boat Ride, Sofa boat ride, Parasailing, etc on Direct payment. It\\u2019s also a great place to just spend the day lying on the beach and relaxing. The beach is very scenic with fallen trees and white sand giving the photographer some interesting shots. The reef here starts very close to shore at a depth of about 1 meter. The large reef is mostly made up of hard coral and has plenty of marine life. Return back after 3 hrs in the same sharing boat back to Beach No 1. Our tour manager will meet and greet and assist with car transfers to proceed to Hotel. Evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock - Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"27-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Relax and unwind on the world-famous beaches of&nbsp;<b><u>Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;or guests can&nbsp;<b>rent a two Wheeler&nbsp;<\\/b>and drive around the Island. Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) can be covered in one day as the total motorable road distance is only 30 km (Approx) or you could book yourself for a&nbsp;<b>Diving Experience for Rs 4200<\\/b>&nbsp;with a certified Dive Shop. We highly recommend that guests visit&nbsp;<b>Something Different \\u2013 A Beach Side Caf\\u00e9 #1 Restaurant<\\/b>&nbsp;on Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) as per TripAdvisor reviews and the only Beach Side Caf\\u00e9 which offers a multiple-choice from India\\/ Chinese\\/ Continental. (All activities on this day are on extra payment and not included)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock- Neil\",\"date\":\"28-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out and return from<u>&nbsp;<b>Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) to Neil (Shaheed Dweep)<\\/b><\\/u><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>by Morning or afternoon Private\\/Govt ferry (HL NL) The ferry takes 1 hr to reach and once you reach the destination collect your luggage outside the ferry and proceed towards the exit of the terminal where our person will be waiting with your guest name on the Placard and transfer to Hotel in Neil (Shaheed Dweep) Island. Enjoy a comfortable overnight stay at Hotel in Neil (Shaheed Dweep) Island.&nbsp; Evening leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep)- 3 Beach Visit - Port Blair\",\"date\":\"29-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Wake up to the quaint and mesmerizing Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) also called the Vegetable bowl of Andaman\\u2019s. Check Out and then proceed for the&nbsp;<b><u>three beach visit<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;covering&nbsp;<b><i><u>Bharatpur<\\/u>&nbsp;(famous for Water Sports including Glass Bottom Boat Ride, Jet Ski, Snorkeling, Scuba Diving, Speed Boat Ride, etc on Direct Payment Basis),&nbsp;<u>Laxmanpur beach<\\/u>&nbsp;(famous for its views as one can see Havelock Island on 01 sides and Port Blair on the other on a clear day) and&nbsp;<u>Natural Bridg<\\/u>e (also known as Howrah Bridge by the locals - this can be accessed only during the Low Tide)<\\/i><\\/b>. Return back to Port Blair by afternoon Private\\/Govt Ferry (NL PB) from<b>&nbsp;<u>Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) to Port Blai<\\/u>r<\\/b>. Our person will be waiting at the exit of the harbor and provide a meet and greet and then and drop you at PORTBLAIR&nbsp;Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair Airport\",\"date\":\"30-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from&nbsp;<u>PB Hotel<\\/u>&nbsp;as per check-out time after which we will take you straight to the&nbsp;<u>Airport<\\/u>&nbsp;to board&nbsp;<u>your departure flight<\\/u>. Depart with sweet memories of these stunning Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TSG Grand \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"AC Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/01\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TSG Blue \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"AC Cluster\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"28\\/01\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"28\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TSG Aura \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"AC Beach Villa\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/01\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"29\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TSG Grand \\/ SIMILAR\",\"room_type\":\"AC Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/01\\/2021\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>0<b>2</b>&nbsp;<b>Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Port Blair</b>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<b>3&nbsp;Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Havelock</b>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<b>1</b>&nbsp;<b>Night</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Neil Island</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Daily <strong>B</strong><b><strong>r</strong>eakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</b>on a set menu or buffet basis, as indicated in the meal plan. (Except breakfast on the day of arrival)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Entry tickets, and ferry tickets to all sightseeing places.&nbsp;<b>Port Blair - Havelock&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Havelock - Neil&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Neil - Port Blair by&nbsp;Govt Ferry.</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>All transfers by&nbsp;<b>1 Ac car</b>&nbsp;in Port Blair/ Havelock/ Neil&nbsp;<b><i>(We provide AC Xylos / Ertiga at Port Blair and Havelock)</i></b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Excursion to Elephant Beach or Light House subject to weather conditions</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"131000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":131000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19650\",\"selling_price\":150650}', 'MZQ/0185/012021', 150600, 25100, 0, '2021-01-15 18:31:50', '2021-01-16 17:17:53', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>IMPORTANT POINTS TO NOTE:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>PLEASE NOTE OPERATIONS OF THE FERRY IS COMPLETELY SUBJECT TO THE LOAD FACTOR AND WE WOULD REQUEST FOR YOUR SUPPORT AND UNDERSTANDING IN CASE OF ANY LAST MINUTE CANCELLATIONS FROM THEIR END<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>ALL BOAT TRIPS ARE SUBJECT TO OPERATION AND IN CASE OF ANY CANCELLATIONS WE SHALL PROVIDE ALTERNATIVE SIGHTSEEING IN THE SAME COST<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>COMPLIMENTARY FACE MASK PER PERSON AND HAND SANITIZER PER FAMILY WILL BE GIVEN ON ARRIVAL<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>THERE ARE NO STAR CATEGORY OF HOTELS IN ANDAMAN ISLANDS AND HOTELS IN ANDAMAN ARE CATEGORIZED BY STANDARD\\/DELUXE\\/LUXURY1\\/LUXURY COMBO 1\\/LUXURY 2 AS PER OUR REQUEST WE HAVE QUOTED AS PER DELUXE HOTELS<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
