(190, 'MR SANCHIT AGARWAL x 08', 'BNI', '9905528848', 'sanchit.rnc@gmail.com', 'KERALA', '2021-02-15', 6, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COCHIN TO MUNNAR\",\"date\":\"15-02-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Munnar -The so called \\\"tea garden hill station of kerala\\\". On the way visit vallara and cheeyappara waterfalls and Blossom Garden. Evening, enjoy the beauty of tea garden. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUNNAR SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"16-02-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Sightseeing of Munnar. Visit the Top Station. Visit Tea Museum (03Km) and the Tea factory (Closed on Mondays and Good Friday) , Mattupetty Dam (13km) and Kundala Lake (28km). Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: For visit to &nbsp;Eravikulam National Park, advance ticket reservation &nbsp;is available at Wild Life Division office, Near Panchayat office, Munnar Town &nbsp;- Contact 04865 231587. Working Time 9am to 3pm<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"THEKKADY\",\"date\":\"17-02-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Thekkady is a pleasant heaven on earth for those who love nature in its wild manifestations. Spices are found in abundance in Periyar. Get ready for a spice tour to view the plantations of a wide variety of spices like cardamom, pepper, tea, coffee, cloves, ginger, turmeric, cumin seed, etc. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Own arrangement for Boating : Please book online in advance&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/ktdc-boating.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">http:\\/\\/ktdc-boating.com<\\/a>&nbsp;booking to avoid rush<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ALLEPPEY\",\"date\":\"18-02-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>The \\\"Venice of India\\\" noted for its winding waterways and canals. It is an important commercial and business town, manufacturing and exporting coir products and black pepper. Explore the natural beauty of Kerala, the paddy fields, narrow canals, coir villages, etc. Overnight stay at the hotel\\/ Houseboat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KOVALAM\",\"date\":\"19-02-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Kovalam - breathtakingly beautiful - a haven of peace and tranquillity - the idyllic tourist destination in God\'s own country. Kovalam offers an excellent diversity with Kovalam beach to suit all desires and occasions. Visit light house beach and Hawah beach. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KOVALAM - TRIVANDRUM - KOVALAM\",\"date\":\"20-02-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for sightseeing at Trivandrum. Visit Sree Padmanabhaswamy temple (16 km) which is a 16th-century temple dedicated to Lord Vishnu is the most impressive landmark of the city. Visit Trivandrum Zoo, Sree Chitra Art Gallery, Napier Museum -(16km) (Closed on&nbsp;Mondays,&nbsp;Wednesday, Govt Holidays, Visiting time:1.00 PM to 4.45 PM), Science and technology museum (Closed on&nbsp;Mondays), etc. Enjoy the sunset in the evening relaxing on the beach. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Distance mentioned in KM is from the City Centre to the sightseeing spot<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Water sport activities can be available on Extra Cost<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Activity<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Rate per person<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Duration<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Scuba Diving (Introduction to Scuba Diving)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>4500<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2.5 Hours<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Scuba Diving (Discover Scuba Diving)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>6000<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>4 Hours<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Snorkeling<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2500<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>1 Hour<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Kayaking (Double Seater)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2000<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>1 Hour<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE TRANSFER\",\"date\":\"21-02-2021 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Transfer to Airport \\/ Railway station. Back to home with sweet memories of your tour.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/02\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fragrant Nature\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"room_type\":\"Tropic Green\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/02\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/02\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Spice Village\",\"city\":\"THEKKADY\",\"room_type\":\"Spice Garden Cottage\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/02\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/02\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Exotica Lavender Cruises\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPEY\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Rooms\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/02\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/02\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Niraamaya Retreats Surya Samudra\",\"city\":\"KOVALAM\",\"room_type\":\"Rock Garden Classic\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/02\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation on twin/double sharing basis on food plan stated above.</li>\n	<li>All transfers and sightseeing arrangements by&nbsp;<i><u><b>Traveller 12 seat A/C</b></u></i>&nbsp;as per itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Vehicle at your disposal as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Services of the well-experienced driver.</li>\n	<li>Driver Allowance, toll, parking fee, Night halt charges, inter-state permit, and govt. applicable service tax.</li>\n	<li>Child below 5 years on a Complimentary basis.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li><b>Houseboat (Applicable, if included in the itinerary).</b>\n	<ul>\n		<li>Check-in 12.30 PM and Check out Time at 09.00 AM at Houseboat.</li>\n		<li>One night accommodation with Lunch, Evening Tea Snacks, Dinner, and Breakfast; only Traditional Kerala Food will be Served On Houseboat.</li>\n		<li>As per Government Regulation cruising will not be permitted after 06.00 PM.</li>\n		<li>A/c will be provided from Check-In till Check Out.</li>\n		<li>In Houseboat Air condition will be available only on bedrooms, in all category.</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"237000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":237000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35550\",\"selling_price\":272550}', 'MZQ/0187/012021', 271200, 33900, 0, '2021-01-18 19:47:16', '2021-01-19 11:24:45', 0, 1, '\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Given quote is valid for minimum 8 (8 adults) paying persons only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Confirmations of hotels are subject to availability.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Slight alterations in the accommodation may become unavoidable due to the unavailability of rooms in the mentioned hotels, but the accommodation so provided will be of the same class.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Check-in time 1400 Hrs and Check out time 1200 Hrs for all Hotels<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>This quote is valid for 7 days only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Rooms mentioned in Munnar and Thekkady are Non A\\/C.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Vehicle at disposable from 8 AM to 8 PM as per the above itinerary.<b>&nbsp;Any additional sightseeing will be charged extra<\\/b>.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Hotels will provide either extra Mattress or extra bed as per the Hotel Policy and availability, in case applicable in the package.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>The food service at respective hotels depends on hotel occupancy. In case of low occupancy a Set Menu for a fixed price will be provided by the hotel as per your chosen food plan.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Please provide your GST no and billing details at the time of booking. Changes of GST details will not be entertained later.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><b>Kindly note that if agent does not provided GST number at the time of confirmation the final invoice will be treated as unregistered dealer.<\\/b><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(192, 'MR MANGAL SINGH RATHORE X 03', 'NISHU', '9937034101', 'rathore.mangalsingh@gmail.com', 'KERALA', '2021-01-29', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar\",\"date\":\"29-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Munnar -The so called \\\"tea garden hill station of kerala\\\". On the way visit vallara and cheeyappara waterfalls and Blossom Garden. Evening, enjoy the beauty of tea garden. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar SightSeeing\",\"date\":\"30-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Sightseeing of Munnar. Visit Eravikulam National Park (15 km) to view endangered wild goat \' Nilgiri Tahr\'<b>.(National Park is Closed From 21st Jan to 15th Apr during breeding season)<\\/b>. Visit Tea Museum (03Km) and the Tea factory (Closed on Mondays and Good Friday) , Mattupetty Dam (13km) and Kundala Lake (28km).Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: For visit to &nbsp;Eravikulam National Park, advance ticket reservation &nbsp;is available at Wild Life Division office, Near Panchayat office, Munnar Town &nbsp;- Contact 04865 231587. Working Time 9am to 3pm<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alappuzha\",\"date\":\"31-01-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>The \\\"Venice of India\\\" noted for its winding waterways and canals. It is an important commercial and business town, manufacturing and exporting coir products and black pepper. Explore the natural beauty of Kerala, the paddy fields, narrow canals, coir villages etc. Overnight stay at the hotel\\/ House boat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Varkala Sight Seeing - Kovalam\",\"date\":\"01-02-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>On the way to Kovalam, Visit the Varkala Beach. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kanyakumari Sightseeing - Kovalam\",\"date\":\"02-02-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed to Kanniyakumari, the southern tip of peninsular India, it offers a unique experience of sunrise &amp; sunset. Visit rock memorial dedicated to Swami Vivekananda, the Gandhi Memorial, Suchidram Temple with exquisite sculpture &amp; musical pillars dedicated to Brahma, Vishnu &amp; Shiva.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam SightSeeing\",\"date\":\"03-02-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Proceed for sightseeing at Trivandrum. Visit Sree Padmanabhaswamy temple (16 km) which is 16th century temple dedicated to Lord Vishnu is the most impressive landmark of the city. Visit Trivandrum Zoo, Sree Chitra Art Gallery, Napier Museum -(16km) (Closed on Mondays, Wednesday, Govt Holidays, Visiting time :1.00 PM to 4.45 PM), Science and technology museum (Closed on Mondays) etc. Enjoy sun set in the evening relaxing on the beach.Overnight stay at the hotel.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nNote: Distance mentioned in KM is from the City Centre to the sight seeing spot<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Water sport activities can be available on Extra Cost<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Activity<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Rate Per person<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Duration<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Scuba Diving (Introduction to Scuba Diving)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>4500<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2.5 Hours<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Scuba Diving (Discover Scuba Diving)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>6000<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>4 Hours<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Snorkeling<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2500<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>1 Hour<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>Kayaking (Double Seater)<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>2000<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td><b>1 Hour<\\/b><\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure transfer\",\"date\":\"04-02-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Transfer to Airport \\/ Railway station. Back to home with sweet memories of your tour.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"1622\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Jan 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Jan 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"08:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"27594\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"1983\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Jan 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Jan 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Trivandrum (TRV)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"644\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"10056\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Jaipur (JAI)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"998\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Trivandrum (TRV)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"896\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"9203\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Blanket Hotel & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Blanket Valley Premier\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/01\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"31\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"Alappuzha\",\"hotel_name\":\"LUXURY Cruises\",\"room_type\":\"01 Bedroom\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/02\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"01\\/02\\/2021\",\"city\":\"Kovalam\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Leela Kovalam\",\"room_type\":\"Beach View Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"04\\/02\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Flight Tickets <strong>Ex-Ranchi </s