(199, 'NITIN SARAWGI', 'BNI', '6200638259', 'nitinsarawgis@gmail.com', 'DARJEELING', '2021-04-05', 4, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SILIGURI - DARJEELING TRANSFER\",\"date\":\"05-04-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Our representative will be there to receive the Guest at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB)&nbsp; \\u2013 He will be assisting for the transfer - Darjeeling - Nearly 105 kilometers 3 \\u00bd - 4 hours drive \\u2013 At an height of 2123 meters \\/ 70001 feet lies the land of breathtaking beauty, sloping tea gardens with spectacular views of the Mount Everest is the Queen of the hills - Check into hotel \\u2013 Evening free to roam around Mall or local Shopping center - Over Night stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DARJEELING SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"06-04-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early Morning breakfast \\u2013 After breakfast \\u2013 Full day city tour includes visit to the following places of interest namely Padmaja Naidu Zoological Park, Himalayan Mountaineering Institute (Closed on Thursday), Ropeway, Tenzing - Gombu Rock, Tibetan Refugee Self Help Centre (Closed on Sunday), Beautiful Tea Estate, Lebong Race Course, Japanese Temple \\u2013 Other places of visit are Peace Pagoda, Lal kothi, Dhirdham Temple, Ava Art Gallery, Natural History Museum (Sunday Closed) \\u2013 Back to hotel \\u2013 Evening free to stroll around the around Mall or the Local market area - Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MIRIK SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"07-04-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast full day excursion trip to Mirik Lake (4,900 ft.) via Indo-Nepal Border (Extra vehicle charges will be applicable for Nepal Border to Pasupati Market). Mirik is famous for its man-made Sumendu Lake, Cardamom plantations and Tea Estates. (One can do Boating on direct payment basis in lake). In evening return to the hotel. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DARJEELING SIGHTSEEING (Half Day)\",\"date\":\"08-04-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning at around 3:45 AM drive to 8000 feet \\/ 2440 meters through primitive forests of oak, magnolia to Tiger Hill to view sunrise over Kanchendzonga Peak (subject to clear weather) \\u2013 On the way back visit Ghoom Monastery, Peace memorial &amp; Batasia Loop \\u2013 On the way back visit Ghoom Monastery, Peace memorial &amp; Batasia Loop \\u2013 Back to hotel for breakfast - After breakfast rest for half an hour After breakfast next round of sightseeing - Half Day city tour includes Padmaja Naidu Zoological Park, Himalayan Mountaineering Institute (Closed on Thursday), Ropeway, Tensing Gumpo Rock, Tibetan Refugee Self Help Center (Closed on Sunday), Tea Estate, Natural History Museum (Sunday Closed), Peace Pagoda \\u2013 Back to hotel \\u2013 Evening free to stroll around the area - Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DARJEELING - SILIGURI TRANSFER\",\"date\":\"09-04-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel and drive to New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB) Tenzing Norgay Bus Stand (Junction) Nearly 105 kilometers 3 \\u00bd - 4 hours drive . Tour ends with sweet memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/04\\/2021\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"MAYFAIR HILL RESORT\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/04\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"42490\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/04\\/2021\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"rate\":\"33800\",\"hotel_name\":\"STERLING RESORT\",\"room_type\":\"CLASSIC ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/04\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":11}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation in Well appointed room in the above mentioned Hotels.</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker.(replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 XYLO / SCORPIO / INNOVA&nbsp;</strong>for Entire Tour.</li>\n	<li>All Toll / Parking / Driver Allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle will not be on disposal basis.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":76290,\"transport_cost\":\"25000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":101290,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10129\",\"selling_price\":111419}', 'MZQ/0195/022021', 112800, 25200, 12000, '2021-02-11 18:55:38', '2021-02-12 11:57:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(200, 'AMIT KUMAR', 'GUPTA UNCLE', '9892616944', 'connect.amit15@gmail.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2021-03-12', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"RANCHI - KOLKATA\",\"date\":\"12-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Kolkata &amp; proceed to Hotel for Night Stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"AIRPORT PICK UP + CELLULAR JAIL LIGHT AND SOUND SHOW\",\"date\":\"13-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"Default\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Arrival at Port Blair in the&nbsp;<u>morning<\\/u>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<u>flight<\\/u>&nbsp;and transfer to&nbsp;<u>Hotel.<\\/u>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"Default\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">After some rest visit the famous&nbsp;<b>C<u>ellular Jail&nbsp;<\\/u><\\/b><u>(Entry closes @ 1545 hrs),&nbsp;<\\/u>Cellular Jail, also known as Kalapani is an old colonial prison situated in Port Blair, the capital of Andaman and Nicobar Islands. Constructed by the Britishers during their colonial rule in India, Cellular Jail was used particularly to exile political prisoners where they were subjected to many atrocities at the hands of the British. The jail complex is now maintained by the Government of India and it is recognized as the national memorial monument that showcases the life of prisoners during the British era and then attend the enthralling&nbsp;<b><u>Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;- where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. The sound and light show at Cellular Jail is showcased as a conversation between a Atma (Spirit) and a Pipal Tree in the legendary actor Om Puri\'s Voice. The show is approximately for 45 - 50 minutes. Later drop back to Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p class=\\\"Default\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR - HAVELOCK  + RADHANAGAR BEACH\",\"date\":\"14-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Departure by&nbsp;<b>Private \\/ Government<\\/b>&nbsp;<b>Ferry<\\/b>&nbsp;(PB HL) from&nbsp;<b><u>Port Blair \\u2013 Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)<\\/u><\\/b>. The ferry takes 1.5-2.5 Hrs to reach Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)&nbsp;<i>(Proceed inside jetty with your own luggage as out staff is not allowed inside the jetty and once you enter the jetty proceed to the ferry counter and show the printout of your ticket and get the boarding stamped and then wait for the boarding announcement and then proceed with your luggage towards the ferry and any big luggage is to be handed over to the ferry staff and hand luggage to be carried on board and once you reach the destination collect your luggage outside the ferry and proceed towards the exit of terminal)<\\/i>. Our person will be waiting at the exit of the gate with Guest Name on a Placard. Proceed to selected Hotel and between around 1430 hrs - 1530 hrs proceed to<u>&nbsp;<b>Beach No 7* (Radhanagar Beach)<\\/b><\\/u>&nbsp;rated as the \\u2018Best Beach in Asia\\u2019 by Time Magazine and unwind and relax and enjoy the pristine white sand beach.&nbsp;<b><i>To get the best view of Radhanagar Beach, we would recommend you to go in the water until Hip Level. Once there, turn around and you will see the Clean Blue Waters + the mystic white sand and the magical green trees, and this is the best view once can have of the Radhanagar Beach<\\/i><\\/b>. There are some local shops where guest purchase some snacks and refreshments. Evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ELEPHANT BEACH WITH SNORKELING TRIP\",\"date\":\"15-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Embark on the most memorable excursion to&nbsp;<b><u>Elephant Beach or Light House<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;by sharing boat&nbsp;<i>(Elephant Beach was called so as it was an Elephant Training Camp run by the Forest Department in the 1990\'s. The same is not operational now and there are no Elephants at Elephant Beach)<\\/i>. The journey time is 30-45 mins and spend some time on the breathtaking white sands of Elephant Beach and you can enjoy variety of Fruit Chats, Coconut Water, Samosa chat and Jalmuri etc on direct payment basis and also you can also go for some water sports activities like Snorkeling, Sea Walk, Jet Ski, Glass bottom Boat, Banana Boat Ride, Sofa boat ride, Parasailing etc on Direct payment. It\\u2019s also a great place to just spend the day lying on the beach and relaxing. The beach is very scenic with fallen trees and white sand giving the photographer some interesting shots. The reef here starts very close to shore at a depth of about 1 metre. The large reef is mostly made up of hard coral and has plenty of marine life. Return back after 3 hrs in the same sharing boat back to the Beach No 1. Our tour manager will meet and greet and assist with car transfers to proceed to Hotel. Evening at Leisure.<span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"> <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY AT LEISURE\",\"date\":\"16-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>FULL DAY AT LEISURE.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK ISLAND - PORT BLAIR\",\"date\":\"17-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Return to Port Blair in the morning.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the afternoon start for a tour of places in and around Port Blair \\u2013 covering the&nbsp;<strong>CELLULAR JAIL<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>ANTHROPOLOGICAL MUSEUM<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>NAVAL MARINE MUSEUM<\\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>COTTAGE INDUSTRIES EMPORIUM<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"18-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from&nbsp;<u>PB Hotel<\\/u>&nbsp;as per check out time after which we will take you straight to the&nbsp;<u>Airport<\\/u>&nbsp;to board&nbsp;<u>your departure flight<\\/u>. Depart with sweet memories of these stunning Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"from\":\"RNC\",\"to\":\"HWH\",\"name\":\"RNC HWH SPL\",\"fno\":\"02020\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"1607\",\"id\":1},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"747\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"15500\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"802\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"11608\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"641\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"KOLKATA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL GALLERY 67\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/03\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"2711\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"SEA SHELL\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/03\\/2021\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"14\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"SEA SHELL\",\"room_type\":\"Cabana\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"17\\/03\\/2021\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"17\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"rate\":null,\"hotel_name\":\"SEA SHELL\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/03\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>0<b>2</b>&nbsp;<b>Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Port Blair</b>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<b>3&nbsp;Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Havelock</b>&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Daily&nbsp;<b>breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</b>on a set menu or buffet basis, as indicated in the meal plan. (Except breakfast on the day of arrival)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Entry tickets, and ferry tickets to all sightseeing places.&nbsp;<b>Port Blair - Havelock&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Havelock </b><b>- Port Blair .</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>All transfers by&nbsp;<b>1 Ac car</b>&nbsp;in Port Blair/ Havelock/ Neil&nbsp;<b><i>(We provide AC Xylos / Ertiga at Port Blair and Havelock)</i></b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Excursion to Elephant Beach or Light House subject to weather conditions</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle given will be only for sightseeings &amp; transfers only.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":28715,\"land_cost\":\"86090\",\"hotel_cost\":\"2711\",\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":117516,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14101.92\",\"selling_price\":131617.92000000001280568540096282958984375}', 'MZQ/0196/022021', 131900, 65950, 21100, '2021-02-15 16:10:21', '2021-03-03 18:03:57', 1, 1, '\"<p><strong>IMPORTANT POINTS TO NOTE:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>PLEASE NOTE OPERATIONS OF THE FERRY IS COMPLETELY SUBJECT TO THE LOAD FACTOR AND WE WOULD REQUEST FOR YOUR SUPPORT AND UNDERSTANDING IN CASE OF ANY LAST MINUTE CANCELLATIONS FROM THEIR END<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>ALL BOAT TRIPS ARE SUBJECT TO OPERATION AND IN CASE OF ANY CANCELLATIONS WE SHALL PROVIDE ALTERNATIVE SIGHTSEEING IN THE SAME COST<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>COMPLIMENTARY FACE MASK PER PERSON AND HAND SANITIZER PER FAMILY WILL BE GIVEN ON ARRIVAL<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>THERE ARE NO STAR CATEGORY OF HOTELS IN ANDAMAN ISLANDS AND HOTELS IN ANDAMAN ARE CATEGORIZED BY STANDARD\\/DELUXE\\/LUXURY1\\/LUXURY COMBO 1\\/LUXURY 2 AS PER OUR REQUEST WE HAVE QUOTED AS PER DELUXE HOTELS<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(201, 'MR RAMCHANDRA RANA', 'YATRA', '9835140338', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GANGTOK + DARJEELING', '2021-03-08', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport - Gangtok\",\"date\":\"08-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Gangtok (5412 Ft \\/ 1650Mts, 130 Kms \\/ 04 to 05 Hrs Drive)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">On arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB) (413 Ft \\/ 126 Mts), you will&nbsp;be met by our&nbsp;local representative, who will assist you to board the vehicle to Gangtok. On reaching Gangtok. Check in and Overnight at hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok \\u2013 Excursion to Tshangu Lake & New Baba Mandir\",\"date\":\"09-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Tshangu Lake (12400Ft \\/ 3780 Mts \\/ 43 Kms \\/ 02 Hrs Drive one way) &amp; New Baba Mandir (13100 Ft \\/ 3994 Mts \\/ 18 Kms \\/ 01 Hrs further drive from Tshangu Lake)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Today after breakfast, start for full day excursion to Tshangu Lake &amp; New Baba Mandir. Return back to Gangtok. Overnight at hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Note: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Documents for Tshangu Lake &amp; New Baba Mandir \\u2013 02 <\\/span><\\/i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Passport Size Photo along with Photo Copy of Photo ID Proof (Passport or Driving License or Voter ID (<i><u>Pan Card &amp; Adhaar Card is not accepted<\\/u><\\/i>). For Children below 18 years, School Id \\/ College Id are a must. Original to be brought with self while travelling.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Incase visit to Tshangu Lake is not possible, due to landslide or any other unforeseen reasons, alternative sightseeing will be provide.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Process for Foreigner, OCI &amp; PIO Card holder are completely different, kindly inform us well in advance to plan out the itinerary accordingly.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Optional: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Nathula Pass (14137 Ft \\/ 4310 Mts) <\\/span><\\/b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Indo China Border, visit is limited to Indian nationals only, <u>allowed on the basis of advance permit<\\/u> &amp; <u>on extra cost<\\/u>. F<i>or rate, kindly refer to Supplement &amp; Optional Cost Column, given below the main package cost.<\\/i> <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok\",\"date\":\"10-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Gangtok (5412 Ft \\/ 1650 Mts)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Go for a full day sightseeing of Gangtok covering <b>Tashi View Point, Ganesh Tok,<\\/b> <b>Jhakri Water Fall,&nbsp;&nbsp; Research Institute of Tibetology<\\/b> (Closed on Saturday &amp; Sunday, Local Festival and State &amp; National Govt. holidays), <b>Directorate of Handicraft &amp; Handloom<\\/b> (Closed on Saturday &amp; Sunday, Local Festival and State &amp; National Govt. holidays) <b>and Flower Show<\\/b> (Closed on Saturday &amp; Sunday, Local Festival and State &amp; National Govt. holidays). Back to hotel &amp; overnight at hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Note: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Alternative sightseeing of <b>Bakthang Waterfalls &amp; Nam Nang View Point <\\/b>will be provided in place of <i><u>Research Institute of Tibetology &amp; Directorate of Handicraft &amp; Handloom<\\/u><\\/i>.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok \\u2013 Darjeeling\",\"date\":\"11-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Darjeeling (6710 Ft \\/ 2046 Mts,110 Kms \\/ 04 to 05 Hrs drive)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">-&nbsp; After breakfast, checkout &amp; then transfer to Darjeeling. On reaching Darjeeling, check in and Overnight at hotel. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Optional: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Teesta River Rafting at Melli <\\/span><\\/b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">(<i>for rate, kindly refer to Supplement &amp; Optional Cost Column, given below the main package cost<\\/i>)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Detour for Namchi Chardham (4314<span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\"> Ft \\/ 1315 Mts).<\\/span><\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">For rate, kindly refer to Supplement &amp; Optional Cost Column, given below the main package cost.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling\",\"date\":\"12-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Darjeeling (6710 Ft \\/ 2046 Mts)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">- *Early morning at around 0400 am (subject to clear weather) for visit to <b>Tiger Hills<\\/b> (8482 Ft \\/ 2586 Mts) to view the sunrise over mighty Kanchendzonga Peak (Third highest peak in the world). Back to hotel for breakfast. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">- After breakfast go for a half-day sightseeing of local Darjeeling covering <b>Japanese Temple &amp; Peace Pagoda<\\/b>, <b>Padmaja Naidu Himalayan Zoological Park &amp; Himalayan Mountaineering Institute<\\/b> (Closed on Thursday, Local Festival and State &amp; National Govt. holidays), <b>Tenzing &amp; Gombu Rock<\\/b>. <b>Panoramic tour of Tea Estate.<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">- Back to Hotel, Overnight at hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Note: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">* Tiger Hill visit is subjected to availability of coupons, as only 600 vehicles are allowed in the morning. In case of non availability of coupons we will provide the Tiger Hill visit after breakfast.<\\/span><\\/i><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\\n<ol>\\n<\\/ol>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Bagdogra\",\"date\":\"13-03-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB) (413 Ft \\/ 126 Mts, 100 Kms \\/ 03 to 04 Hrs drive)<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">- After breakfast transfer to New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB)<b>,<\\/b> for onwards connection. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><i><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Optional: <\\/span><\\/i><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<ol>\\n\\t<li><span style=\\\"font-size:12pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">Detour, <\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN-NZ\\\" style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\">drive via *Mirik Lake <\\/span><\\/span><b><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\">(4905 Ft \\/ 1495Mts<\\/span><\\/b><span lang=\\\"EN-NZ\\\" style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"layout-grid-mode:line\\\">.)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bokaro (BKSC)\",\"to\":\"Howrah (HWH)\",\"name\":\"BKSC HWH Spl\",\"fno\":\"08014\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 :00 Pm\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Mar 2021\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 Am\",\"fare\":\"1994\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Pakyong (PYG)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"2989\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"9480\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6444\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"13200\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"641\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Mar 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Cygnett La Masion\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":null,\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"11\\/03\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"11\\/03\\/2021\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Jai\",\"room_type\":\"Second Flush Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/03\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned room.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker.(replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p align=\"justify\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-indent:-18pt; margin-left:48px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\"><span style=\"orphans:2\"><span style=\"text-transform:none\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"widows:2\"><span style=\"word-spacing:0px\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Wingdings\"><font style=\"font-size:10pt\">v</font></font><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font style=\"font-size:7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></font></span><b>03 Adult / 01 Double Room + 01 Extra Person</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></spa