sfers by Private Sanitized AC Vehicle</li>\n	<li>07 Nights Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room</li>\n	<li>All transfers &amp; sightseeings by <strong>Innova</strong> on PVT basis.</li>\n	<li>All taxes &amp; toll.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":32924,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":25856,\"transport_cost\":\"32000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":90780,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18156\",\"selling_price\":108936}', 'MZQ/0201/032021', 105000, 26250, 0, '2021-03-15 20:27:01', '2021-03-17 12:03:57', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(206, 'PAWAN JHA', 'LINCTUS PHARMA', '9304538005', 'linctuspharma@gmail.com', 'MANALI', '2021-05-16', 5, 2, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi-Manali (580kms)\",\"date\":\"16-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning received by our representative in Delhi . Drive to Manali.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On Arrival Manali check-in to your Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Rohtang Pass(100 Kms Round Tour)\",\"date\":\"17-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, full day excursion to Rohtang Pass and Solang Nulla (Valley). Visit the 450 years old temple dedicated to Hadimba Devi (which has some exceptional woodcarvings which includes carefully carved wooden doors and a 24 meters tall wooden tower).The drive to Rohtang Pass is a 51km drive up to 13,400ft. But once up there the stunning views of the snow peaks &amp; glaciers would be an exhilarating experience. A great spot for the adventure lovers; this picnic spot offers challenging activities like, Horse ride, Zorbing, Paragliding and Skiing.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kullu-Manikaran\",\"date\":\"18-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning excursion to Kullu Valley And Manikarn enjoy rafting in the beas river, enroute visit kullu market, Kullu shawl factories and sale outlets, Angora farm, Vaishno mata temple. Dinner and over night stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local sight seeing\",\"date\":\"19-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning excursion Hadimba Devi temple, Vashishth Bath and local Manali visit.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali-Delhi\",\"date\":\"20-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning Back to Delhi. Check-in to Hotel @ Delhi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"21-05-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check-out from Hotel &amp; depart for Airport.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8886\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":26072},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"553\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"21 May 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"fare\":22188}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rohtang Heights\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"20\\/05\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"43200\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2021\",\"city\":\"DELHI\",\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Red Fox\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"7000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare as mentioned above in the itinerary<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned room.</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Manali &amp; Breakfast at Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker.(replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova&nbsp;</strong>for Entire Tour.&nbsp;(Vehicle not at disposal).</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":48260,\"hotel_cost\":50200,\"transport_cost\":\"29000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":127460,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19119\",\"selling_price\":146579}', 'MZQ/0202/042021', 146800, 26100, 21200, '2021-04-05 14:58:35', '2021-04-05 14:58:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(207, 'MR ANIMESH', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '7004219813', 'animeshnikhil3@gmail.com', 'LEH', '2021-07-02', 9, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"RANCHI - NEW DELHI BY TRAIN\",\"date\":\"02-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Depart Ranchi for a mesmerizing Tour for Leh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"03-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Delhi &amp; stay on your Own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI - LEH\",\"date\":\"04-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by a Multi Zone&nbsp;representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LEH \\u2013 LOCAL SIGHTSEEING (EXCURSION TO MONASTERIES)\",\"date\":\"05-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we visit&nbsp;<b>Spituk Monastery<\\/b>, Built in 15th century during the reign of Grags \\u2018bum-lde, these new Gelug-pa monastery was built like fortress on the summit of crags and also visit&nbsp;<b>Hall Of Fame<\\/b>&nbsp;near Leh is worth a visit for every citizen. It is a glorious museum constructed by Indian army.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Post lunch we take a sightseeing tour visiting&nbsp;<b>Sankar Gompa<\\/b>, located at a distance of approximately 3 km from the town of Leh,&nbsp;<b>Leh Palace<\\/b>&nbsp;is one of the most captivating architectural ruins that attract the attention of the tourists almost immediately with its majestic setting at the edge of the Namgyal hill and overlooking the town and at once looks like a reminiscent of Lhasa\'s Potala Palace.&nbsp;Evening visit to&nbsp;<b>Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market<\\/b>. Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LEH TO KARGIL (220 KMS \\/ 6-8 HRS)\",\"date\":\"06-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast you drive downstream along the River Indus on&nbsp;Leh&nbsp;\\u2013&nbsp;Kargil&nbsp;Highway. Enroute visiting&nbsp;<b>Gurudwara Patthar Sahib&nbsp;<\\/b>Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us&nbsp;to&nbsp;<b>Magnetic Hill<\\/b>&nbsp;which defies the law of gravity &amp; further Driving through a picturesque landscape we reached the&nbsp;<b>Confluence Of The Indus And Zanskar River<\\/b>, Just before Saspul a road&nbsp;to&nbsp;the right takes you for your visit&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;<b>Likir Monastery<\\/b>, Likir is one of the most active monasteries in the region. As you drive up&nbsp;to&nbsp;the monastery a recently installed colossal gilded image of the Maitreya out in the open is one of the most impressive sights in Ladakh.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After visiting the Monastery you continue your drive towards&nbsp;Kargil&nbsp;enroute visiting the 11th century&nbsp;<b>Lamayuru Monastery<\\/b>&nbsp;enroute visiting the mesmerizing Moon Landscapes (you will believe why the name of this area is Moonland. Exactly the same formations of Land are visible as on the moon), Later Drive&nbsp;to&nbsp;KARGIL&nbsp;over Fatu-la (13,489 ft) which is the highest pass on Srinagar \\u2013&nbsp;Leh&nbsp;road. Upon arrival in&nbsp;<b>Kargil<\\/b>&nbsp;we check in at our Hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KARGIL TO LEH (VIA LAMAYURU)\",\"date\":\"07-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast &nbsp;We will visit&nbsp;<b>Drass Village<\\/b>&nbsp;(2nd Coldest inhabitate in the world) and have a magnificient view of Kargil War famous peaks (Tiger &amp; Tololing) Later drive back to leh enroute visiting&nbsp;<b>Mulbekh, Lamayuru<\\/b>, Belongs to Dripung Kagyu (Red Hat). Then we drive and cross the River Indus and reach&nbsp;<b>Alchi<\\/b>, Ladakh\'s most loved monastery. Upon arrival in Leh we check in at our pre-arranged hotel .&nbsp;Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LEH\\u2013NUBRA VALLEY VIA KHARDUNG LA 18,390 FT. (120 KMS \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 HRS)\",\"date\":\"08-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over&nbsp;<b>Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft<\\/b>, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to&nbsp;<b>Hunder<\\/b>&nbsp;where you have opportunity to ride on a bacterian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at&nbsp;<b>Diskit<\\/b>&nbsp;which is the headquarter town of Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight at Sumoor village, Nubra Valley.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUBRA VALLEY TO PANGONG LAKE (170 KMS \\/ 7 HRS)\",\"date\":\"09-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast&nbsp; we drive towards&nbsp;<b>Pangong Tso<\\/b>via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through few small villages of Changthang and finally you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival we check in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PANGONG LAKE TO LEH VIA CHANGLA (140 KMS \\/ 6 HRS)\",\"date\":\"10-07-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of lake and later we drive back to Leh via&nbsp;<b>Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs<\\/b>&nbsp;enroute visiting&nbsp;<b>Thiksey<\\/b>&nbsp;an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to&nbsp;<b>Shey Palace<\\/b>, The ancient capital of Ladakh &amp;<b>3 Idiots Rancho School<\\/b>.&nbsp; Drive further to Leh and check in at our hotel for Overnight<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPART LEH (FLY OUT)\",\"date\":\"11-07-2021 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour concludes.&nbsp;We thank you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"New Delhi (NDLS)\",\"name\":\"RNC NDLS SPL\",\"fno\":\"02847\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jul 2021\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"4800\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"INDIGO\",\"fno\":\"6613\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"15940\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"220\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"26780\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"167\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/07\\/2021\",\"check_out\":\"06\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"THE GRAND DRAGON\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"KARGIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"HIGHLAND MOUNTAIN RESORT & SPA\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"07\\/07\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"THE GRAND DRAGON\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"08\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NUBRA VALLEY\",\"hotel_name\":\"NUBRA ETHNIC CAMP\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE TENT\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"09\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PANGONG LAKE\",\"hotel_name\":\"NATURE NEST CAMP\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"10\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"THE ABDUZ\",\"room_type\":\"EXECUTIVE CLUB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/07\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &n