=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Oxygen Cylinder Charges: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 700 Per Day (approximately)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">SPECIAL NOTE<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">NOTE: Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 96 hours prior to arrival date.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">Once you land in Leh Kindly wear jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">Hotels: We have been using the hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS are being attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">Traveller: Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travellers as well and kindly share the same with the traveller as well.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"background-size:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri, sans-serif\\\"><b><span style=\\\"font-family:Cambria, serif\\\">Itinerary:&nbsp; Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strictly as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteriies and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.<\\/span><\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"', 1, 0);
