(208, 'MS SHALINI SHARMA', 'PRABHAKAR', '9873171167', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2021-06-27', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar + Srinagar Local (Viz. Moughal Garden\'s)\",\"date\":\"27-06-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><samp style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">You will be met by our representative at the&nbsp;Srinagar&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;&nbsp;He will assist and transfer you to the&nbsp;Hotel in Srinagar,after fresh up proceed to Srinagar Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Moughal Gardens,Viz. Nishat Garden,Shalimar Garden,Tulip Garden,Cheshmashahi,&nbsp;Shankar Acharya Temple at Srinagar,Dinner &amp; overnight stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/samp><strong><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">(Hotel Four points By Sheraton)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Gulmarg N\\/S:\",\"date\":\"28-06-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast Proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level. The distance of 96 kms will be covered in about 2-3 hours. Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes. If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region,&amp; also enjoy&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#222222\\\">cable car (Gondola at &nbsp;your own cost) for mountain ride up to khilanmarg,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">Dinner &amp;&nbsp;<b>Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg.(Hotel Khyber Himalayan Resort &amp; Spa)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg  - Srinagar  N\\/S :\",\"date\":\"29-06-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:normal\\\">After breakfast, proceed to Srinagar &amp; reach Srinagar within 2 hr,&nbsp;after reaching Srinagar u can enjoy at the&nbsp;Hotel vivanta by Taj&nbsp;&amp; also u can do some local sightseeing .Dinner and&nbsp;overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><strong><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"> (Hotel Vivanta By Taj)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam- Srinagar N\\/S :\",\"date\":\"30-06-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast Proceed to Pahalgam,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 96 kms, will be covered in about 3-4 hours. En-route, visit the saffron fields of pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), and enjoy the beautiful countryside. Drive through the pine forests. Arrive at Pahalgam and enjoy Lidder stream. Later walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains,&amp; also enjoy&nbsp;Aru,Chandanwadi,&amp; Betab Valley,(at your own cost),famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam,Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<b>(Hotel Four points By Sheraton)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg  - Srinagar  N\\/s\",\"date\":\"01-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#222222\\\">After breakfast proceed to&nbsp; Sonmarg,which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar. Sonmarg also called Meadows of Gold is located at a height of 2692 meters. You may take a pony ride (at your own cost) to Thajiwas Glacier where snow remains round the year, &amp;&nbsp; reach Srinagar in Late evening,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#500050\\\">Dinner &amp;&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<b>(Hotel Four points By Sheraton)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Srinagar\",\"date\":\"02-07-2021\",\"todo\":\"<div style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"x_-2090443842gmail-im\\\">\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast, get transferred to&nbsp;<b>Srinagar&nbsp;Airport<\\/b>&nbsp;for the flight to your destination. Tour Concludes with some wonderful long lasting memories.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/06\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Four points By Sheraton\",\"room_type\":\"Traditional King Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/06\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/06\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Khyber Himalayan Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Balcony Room-GV\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/06\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/06\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vivanta By Taj\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Delight Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/06\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"30\\/06\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Four points By Sheraton\",\"room_type\":\"Traditional King Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/07\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accomodation on above-mentioned Hotels&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Daily breakfast &amp; Dinner</li>\n	<li>Shikara Ride</li>\n	<li>All surface traveling by&nbsp;Etios&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All presently applicable taxes as of&nbsp;date.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"92680\",\"land_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":92680,\"profit_figure\":\"17820\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"19.00%\",\"selling_price\":110500}', 'MZQ/0204/062021', 110500, 55250, 0, '2021-06-17 20:23:12', '2021-07-01 10:49:14', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(209, 'DR ANURAG PRATYUSH', 'AKASH BNI', '8050907798', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LEH', '2021-07-26', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"26-07-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear Day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival you will met by MT representative and transfer to Hotel for Check in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Evening visit to&nbsp;<b>Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market<\\/b>.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh - Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"27-07-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with&nbsp;<b>Hall Of Fame<\\/b>&nbsp;(Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to&nbsp;<b>Gurudwara Patthar Sahib<\\/b>&nbsp;at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 Kms from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous&nbsp;<b>Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River<\\/b>&nbsp;coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"28-07-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over&nbsp;Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to&nbsp;Hunder&nbsp;where you have opportunity to ride on a bacterian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at&nbsp;Diskit&nbsp;which is the headquarter town of Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"29-07-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast&nbsp; we drive towards&nbsp;Pangong Tso&nbsp;via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through few small villages of Changthang and finally you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival we check in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"30-07-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of lake and later we drive back to Leh via&nbsp;<b>Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs<\\/b>&nbsp;enroute visiting&nbsp;<b>Thiksey<\\/b>&nbsp;an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to&nbsp;<b>Shey Palace<\\/b>, The ancient capital of Ladakh &amp;<b>3 Idiots Rancho School<\\/b>.&nbsp; Drive further to Leh and check in at our hotel for Overnight<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"31-07-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour concludes. Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"07:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"fare\":17778},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2079\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2423\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"12:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":16414},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2033\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jul 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jul 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Abduz\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room with balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"28\\/07\\/2021\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/07\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Lchang Nang Retreat\",\"city\":\"Nubra Valley\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/07\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Nature Nest Camp\",\"city\":\"Pangong Lake\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/07\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"30\\/07\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Abduz\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room with balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>· Return AirFare Ex-Ranchi.</p>\n\n<p>. Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</p>\n\n<p>·Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</p>\n\n<p>·03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</p>\n\n<p>·01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</p>\n\n<p>·01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>·Meal Plan - MAPAI (B/F &amp; Dinner)</p>\n\n<p>·Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</p>\n\n<p>·Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Innova</p>\n\n<p>·Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<p>·Reservation amount has to be paid upfront for us to start confirming your package (50% of total Billing amount)</p>\n\n<p>·Remaining 50 % Payment 15 days prior to departure date.</p>\n\n<p>·For travel in less than 15 days from booking, complete payment must be received within 24 hours of booking.</p>\n\n<p>·You can pay using credit cards, debit cards, net banking, PayPal, NEFT, IMPS, RTGS, SWIFT or Cash</p>\n\n<p>·If the above-mentioned payment terms are not followed, we will not be held responsible for any change made in the package itinerary due to non-availability of flights, Hotels, Camps etc.</p>', NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":34192,\"land_cost\":\"77800\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":111992,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16798.8\",\"selling_price\":128790.800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0205/072021', 128800, 64400, 0, '2021-07-09 11:32:28', '2021-07-09 11:32:28', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Professional Tourist Guide: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 2500 Per Day &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 2000 Per Person approx.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Motorbike hire for full day: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs.1,800.00 Per Bike + Fuel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Pedal down the highest motorable road on a cycle: &nbsp;&nbsp; Rs.1,500 per Pax including transport (min 4 pax)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Cultural Dance Program: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 8,000 Per Program<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Oxygen Cylinder Charges: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 700 Per Day (approximately)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>SPECIAL NOTE<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>NOTE: Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 72 hours prior to arrival date.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Once you land in Leh Kindly wear jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Transport: As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding the commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last minute confusion.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Hotels: We have been using the hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS are being attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Traveller: Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travellers as well and kindly share the same with the traveller as well.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Itinerary:&nbsp; Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strictly as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteriies and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(210, 'MS RUBY', 'AFTAB FOOD PLAZA', '9334589819', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'PURI', '2021-08-16', 2, 0, 50, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL PURI\",\"date\":\"16-08-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Puri &amp; Checkin at Hotel Swimming.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>CONFERENCE HALL FOR DAY USE<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>BREAKFAST&nbsp;+ LUNCH&nbsp;+ DINNER<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PURI\",\"date\":\"17-08-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>CONFERENCE HALL FOR DAY USE<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>BREAKFAST&nbsp;+ LUNCH&nbsp;+ DINNER<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE PURI\",\"date\":\"18-08-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning Check-out &amp; depart with sweet memories.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>CONFERENCE HALL till 01:00 Pm<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>BREAKFAST&nbsp;+ LUNCH&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PURI\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL SWIMMING 4*\",\"room_type\":\"TRIPLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":17,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/08\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Welcome Drinks (Non-Alcoholic )&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Accommodations For 02 Nights @ 03 Breakfast, 03 Lunch &amp; 02 Dinner(As per the Menu)</li>\n	<li>Conference Hall For 3 Days(10 AM - 6 PM) with 2 Times Tea, Coffee &amp; Biscuit</li>\n	<li>Hotel Check-in Time 10 AM &amp; Check-Out Time 8 AM.</li>\n	<li>Id Proof</li>\n	<li>02 DOSES of Covid-19 VACCINE Certificate.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>01 LCD Projector with Screen &amp; 1 Cordless Mike with Sound System @ <strong>Rs.7,500/-&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":\"175000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":175000,\"profit_figure\":\"20000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"11.00%\",\"selling_price\":195000}', 'MZQ/0206/072021', 195000, 3900, 0, '2021-07-22 15:56:09', '2021-07-22 15:56:54', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(211, 'MR GAURAV', NULL, '7250500441', 'gaurav.coefficient@gmail.com', 'LEH', '2021-08-02', 5, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"02-08-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by our&nbsp;representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"03-08-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 km from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"04-08-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a Bactrian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarter town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"05-08-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"06-08-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs en-route visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp; 3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check-in at our hotel for an Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"07-08-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNoSpacing\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Tour concludes. <strong>Multi Zone Travels<\\/strong> thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination. <v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" id=\\\"Picture_x0020_10\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"><\\/v:shape><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute; left:0; text-align:left; margin-left:711px; margin-top:70px; width:41.25pt; height:41.25pt; z-index:-251639808\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"> <v:fill o:detectmouseclick=\\\"t\\\"> <\\/v:fill><\\/v:shape><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"04\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ladakh Paradise \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"01 TPL + 01 DBL\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NUBRA VALLEY\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Camp Silver Sand \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"01 TPL + 01 DBL\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"05\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PANGONG\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"World Attic Camp \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"01 TPL + 01 DBL\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ladakh Paradise \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"01 TPL + 01 DBL\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</li>\n	<li>Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</li>\n	<li>03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</li>\n	<li>Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Vehicle as per the option selected</li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"35\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"78071\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":78071,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27324.85\",\"selling_price\":105395.85000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0207/072021', 105000, 21000, 0, '2021-07-28 11:27:14', '2021-07-28 11:31:34', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
