(212, 'DR NAVIN', 'RITESH FOTO ME', '7477352400', 'navin15kb@gmail.com', 'LEH', '2021-08-11', 5, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"11-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by our&nbsp;representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"12-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 km from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"13-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a Bactrian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarter town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"14-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"15-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs en-route visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp; 3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check-in at our hotel for an Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"16-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNoSpacing\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Tour concludes. <strong>Multi Zone Travels<\\/strong> thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination. <v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" id=\\\"Picture_x0020_10\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"><\\/v:shape><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute; left:0; text-align:left; margin-left:711px; margin-top:70px; width:41.25pt; height:41.25pt; z-index:-251639808\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"> <v:fill o:detectmouseclick=\\\"t\\\"> <\\/v:fill><\\/v:shape><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2387\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Aug 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Aug 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"38074\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6935\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Aug 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Aug 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6936\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Aug 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Aug 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"42184\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6683\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Aug 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Aug 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"11\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sinnge Palace  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"02 DBL\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NUBRA VALLEY\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Desert Himalaya  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"02 DBL\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"14\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PANGONG\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"15\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Nature Nest  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"02 DBL\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"15\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Shangrila \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"02 DBL\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</li>\n	<li>Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</li>\n	<li>03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</li>\n	<li>Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Vehicle as per the option selected</li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>SPECIAL NOTE</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 72 hours prior to arrival date.</p>\n\n<p>To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.</p>\n\n<p>Once you land in Leh Kindly wear a jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Transport:</strong> As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last-minute confusion.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hotels:</strong> We have been using hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS is being attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Traveller:</strong> Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travellers as well and kindly share the same with the traveller as well.</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Itinerary:&nbsp;</strong> Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strict as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteries and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non-operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":80258,\"land_cost\":\"104154\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":184412,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":219412,\"profit_figure\":\"35000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"18.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0208/082021', 219500, 49900, 19900, '2021-08-06 10:53:48', '2021-08-06 16:03:34', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-<\\/strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Professional Tourist Guide:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rs. 2500 Per Day &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rs. 2000 Per Person approx.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Motorbike hire for full day:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Rs.1,800.00 Per Bike+Fuel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pedal down the highest motorable road on a cycle: Rs.1,500 per Pax including&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; transport (min 4 pax)<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Cultural Dance Program:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rs. 8,000 Per Program<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Oxygen Cylinder Charges:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 700 Per Day(approximately)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(213, 'MR SANDEEP', 'ROHIT, PRAMOD', '9431316599', 'iamrohit1@gmail.com', 'LEH', '2021-08-23', 5, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"23-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by our&nbsp;representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"24-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 km from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"25-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a Bactrian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarter town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"26-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"27-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs en-route visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp; 3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check-in at our hotel for an Overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"28-08-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNoSpacing\\\" style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">Tour concludes. <strong>Multi Zone Travels<\\/strong> thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination. <v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" id=\\\"Picture_x0020_10\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"><\\/v:shape><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><v:shape href=\\\"#_LADAKH_SUMMER_PACKAGES\\\" o:button=\\\"t\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute; left:0; text-align:left; margin-left:711px; margin-top:70px; width:41.25pt; height:41.25pt; z-index:-251639808\\\" type=\\\"#_x0000_t75\\\"> <v:fill o:detectmouseclick=\\\"t\\\"> <\\/v:fill><\\/v:shape><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sinnge Palace  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NUBRA VALLEY\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Nubra Ethnic Camp  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PANGONG\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Verda Resort   \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"27\\/08\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/08\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Spic N Span \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</li>\n	<li>Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</li>\n	<li>03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</li>\n	<li>Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac Vehicle as per the option selected</li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>SPECIAL NOTE</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report of 72 hours prior to arrival date.</p>\n\n<p>To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.</p>\n\n<p>Once you land in Leh Kindly wear a jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Transport:</strong> As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last-minute confusion.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hotels:</strong> We have been using hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS is being attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Traveller:</strong> Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travellers as well and kindly share the same with the traveller as well.</p>\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Itinerary:&nbsp;</strong> Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strict as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteries and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non-operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"164300\",\"land_cost\":\"141036\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":305336,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":340336,\"profit_figure\":\"35000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"11.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0209/082021', 332000, 41500, 19900, '2021-08-16 18:25:48', '2021-08-16 18:25:48', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-<\\/strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Professional Tourist Guide:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rs. 2500 Per Day &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rs. 2000 Per Person approx.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Motorbike hire for full day:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Rs.1,800.00 Per Bike+Fuel&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pedal down the highest motorable road on a cycle: Rs.1,500 per Pax including&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; transport (min 4 pax)<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Cultural Dance Program:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rs. 8,000 Per Program<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Oxygen Cylinder Charges:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 700 Per Day(approximately)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(215, 'MR ASHISH SAHU', 'SHALINI & BHARAT', '8683034125', 'ashishsahu33@gmail.com', 'KASHMIR', '2021-10-01', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar + Srinagar Local (Viz. Moughal Garden\'s)\",\"date\":\"01-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><samp style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">You will be met by our representative at the&nbsp;Srinagar&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;&nbsp;He will assist and transfer you to the&nbsp;Hotel in Srinagar,after fresh up proceed to Srinagar Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Moughal Gardens,Viz. Nishat Garden,Shalimar Garden,Tulip Garden,Cheshmashahi,&nbsp;Shankar Acharya Temple at Srinagar,Dinner &amp; overnight stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/samp><strong><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">(Hotel Four points By Sheraton)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg  - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"02-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#222222\\\">After breakfast proceed to&nbsp; Sonmarg,which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar. Sonmarg also called Meadows of Gold is located at a height of 2692 meters. You may take a pony ride (at your own cost) to Thajiwas Glacier where snow remains round the year, &amp;&nbsp; reach Srinagar in Late evening,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#500050\\\">Dinner &amp;&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<b>(Hotel Four points By Sheraton)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"03-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast Proceed to Pahalgam,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 96 kms, will be covered in about 3-4 hours. En-route, visit the saffron fields of pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), and enjoy the beautiful countryside. Drive through the pine forests. Arrive at Pahalgam and enjoy Lidder stream. Later walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains,&amp; also enjoy&nbsp;Aru,Chandanwadi,&amp; Betab Valley,(at your own cost),famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam,Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"04-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast Proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level. The distance of 96 kms will be covered in about 2-3 hours. Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes. If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region,&amp; also enjoy&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#222222\\\">cable car (Gondola at &nbsp;your own cost) for mountain ride up to khilanmarg,<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">Dinner &amp;&nbsp;<b>Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg.(Hotel Khyber Himalayan Resort &amp; Spa)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg  - Srinagar  N\\/S :\",\"date\":\"05-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:normal\\\">After breakfast, proceed to Srinagar &amp; ,&nbsp;after reaching Srinagar u can enjoy at the&nbsp;Houseboat&nbsp;&amp; also u can do some local sightseeing .Dinner and&nbsp;overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><strong><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"> (Merlin Group of Houseboats)<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Srinagar\",\"date\":\"06-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<div style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"x_-2090443842gmail-im\\\">\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:12.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"background:white\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"color:black\\\">After breakfast, get transferred to&nbsp;<b>Srinagar&nbsp;Airport<\\/b>&nbsp;for the flight to your destination. Tour Concludes with some wonderful long lasting memories.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Solomon Heights\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"03\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Chinar Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Balcony Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"04\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Khyber Himalayan Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Balcony Room-GV\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"05\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Merlin Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/10\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accomodation on above-mentioned Hotels&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Daily breakfast &amp; Dinner</li>\n	<li>Shikara Ride</li>\n	<li>All surface traveling by&nbsp;Etios&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All presently applicable taxes as of&nbsp;date.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"67630\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":67630,\"profit_figure\":\"17820\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"26.00%\",\"selling_price\":81156,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13526\"}', 'MZQ/0211/092021', 80400, 40200, 0, '2021-09-06 17:13:47', '2021-09-06 17:13:47', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(216, 'RINKU CHOUDHARY x 04', 'BNI', '7549178555', 'rinku.killa@gmail.com', 'NORTH INDIA TOUR', '2021-09-16', 8, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL DELHI - SALASAR\",\"date\":\"16-09-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at New Delhi Airport and transfer to the hotel at Salasar.<br \\/>\\nOvernight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SALASAR - JEENMATA - SALASAR\",\"date\":\"17-09-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Salasar Balaji or Salasar Dham located in Churu. Dedicated to Balaji, another name for Hanuman, is now considered as a shakti sthal (place of power), a place where all wishes come true. The temple is constructed in white marble stone.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Further continue to visit Jeenmata a village of religious importance in Sikar district. Temple is an ancient temple dedicated to Jeenmata, the Goddess of Power.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening drive to Khatu Shyamji an important religious destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SALASAR - DELHI - SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"18-09-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning visit Khatushyamji Temple built out of the famous Makrana marble and is worshiped as Khatushyamji and is considered as the God of Kaliyuga.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later travel back to Delhi to catch your flight towards onward destination.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nOn arrival at Srinagar airport our representative heartily greets you and assists you to transfer you to Hotel.<br \\/>\\nThe Sun-set view from the Hotel will engulf your heart and leave your spell bound. Later enjoy the welcome dinner and overnight stay in the Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR - GULMARG\",\"date\":\"19-09-2021 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning Check Out from Hotel and proceed to Gulmarg driving past willow trees, fast flowing streams and lush green meadows. Gulmarg - the meadow of flowers is an apt term for this idyllic flower-laden meadow offering a spectacular view of towering snow-capped peaks covered with dense forests of tall conifers and gigantic fir and pine trees. Stroll leisurely or take pony rides (by your own payment) across the green meadow to one of the world\'s highest Golf Course. A must is a fun-filled ride in the Gondola lift (by your own payment).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GULMARG - SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"20-09-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After an early breakfast, transfer from Gulmarg to Srinagar. After Lunch drive to visit the famous Mughal gardens in Srinagar which are Nishat Bagh (the garden of Pleasure), Shankarcharya Temple, Hazratbal Shrine and Shalimar Bagh (abode of love). These gardens are situated on the banks of Dal lake. Nishat Bagh is the larger of the two gardens and has an impressive plantation of Chinar trees on its highest terrace. Both the gardens are built on a symmetrical plan of central waterways with fountains dividing a series of gardened terraces.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Night stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR - PAHALGAM - SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"21-09-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early in the morning leave for Pahalgam the \'valley of shepherds\' which is situated at the confluence of the streams flowing from river Lidder and Sheeshnag lake. En route visit the Awantipura ruins, an 1100 year old temple dedicated to Lord Vishnu and built by King Awantivarman. On arrival into Pahalgam enjoy the surrounding beauty or walk to Baisaren, which is about 2 km from Pahalgam. A small village set in pine and fir forest is pleasing and offers good view.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In Evening we drive back to Srinagar for night stay at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR - JAMMU - KATRA\",\"date\":\"22-09-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast transfer to Srinagar Airport to board your&nbsp;onward flight with memorable experiences of&nbsp; Multi Zone Travels.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Pick up from Jammu Airport and transfer to Katra (50 Kms\\/1.5 Hours). Spend rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Katra.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KATRA - MATA VAISHNO DEVI BHAWAN - KATRA\",\"date\":\"23-09-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning after breakfast, proceed for Mata Vaishno Devi Bhawan- one of the most popular pilgrimages of India situated in the lap of Trikuta mountains across Katra town at an altitude of around 5200 feet. Yatra involves a trek of nearly 12 Kms from base camp at Katra known as Ban Ganga. Alternate way to perform darshans is by Ponies\\/Palkis\\/ Helicopter. If time permits, visit Bhairo Temple &amp; return back to Katra in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Katra.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KATRA - JAMMU - RANCHI\",\"date\":\"24-09-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel &amp; proceed for Jammu to drop at Airport for your onward journey with sweet memories of the tour.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"745\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"11365\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5081\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:00 PM\",\"fare\":17100},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Jammu (IXJ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2013\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"fare\":14984},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Jammu (IXJ)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2368\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":30108},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2033\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SALASAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Anand Bagh Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"18\\/09\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"13070\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Batoo \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/09\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Khaleel Palace \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"20\\/09\\/2021\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"20\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Batoo \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"22\\/09\\/2021\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"22\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"KATRA\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel lemon tree\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"check_out\":\"24\\/09\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"10300\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9},{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>RAJASTHAN:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Accomodation on above-mentioned Hotels&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All surface traveling by A/C INNOVA.</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All presently applicable taxes as of&nbsp;date</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>KASHMIR:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Accomodation on above-mentioned Hotels&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Daily breakfast &amp; Dinner</li>\n	<li>All surface traveling by A/C INNOVA.</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All presently applicable taxes as of&nbsp;date.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>JAMMU:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Accomodation on above-mentioned Hotels</li>\n	<li>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All Transfers by A/C INNOVA.</li>\n	<li>Arrangement of Yatra Slip for darshans</li>\n	<li>Pick &amp; drop facility for Ban Ganga by a Private Cab&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All Taxes, Toll, Fuel, Parking, Driver Allowance.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":73557,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":\"23370\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"KASHMIR LAND\",\"amount\":32160},{\"name\":\"DEL-SAL-JEEN-DEL\",\"amount\":15000},{\"name\":\"JAMMU TRANSPORT\",\"amount\":6000}],\"cost_price\":150087,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27015.66\",\"selling_price\":177102.66000000000349245965480804443359375}', 'MZQ/0212/092021', 177000, 47000, 41500, '2021-09-07 13:40:00', '2021-09-07 13:41:13', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(217, 'UJJWAL DUBEY', 'FRANKY', '9709155949', 'INFO@MULTIZONETRAVELS.COM', 'KASHMIR', '2021-10-19', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVE SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"19-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Warm welcome and arrival assistance by our representative at Srinagar airport at an altitude of 1730 mtrs and transfer to Hotel. Srinagar known as Paradise on Earth and The Venice of Asia.&nbsp;Visit the local crafts market and shop for unique Papier and Walnut Wood items.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg  - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"20-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Sonamarg for a full-day excursion ( 9000fts ), The Golden Meadow. Sonamarg is the beginning of the enchanted journey into a natural wonderland. Surrounded by mountains up to 5300 meters high the valley is divided by a spur of the Thajwas Range. Baltal the base camp for Amarnath Piligrim lies 15 kms north of Sonamarg. This little valley lies at the foothill of Zojila. On arrival visit a Snow-covered mountain throughout the year known as Thajiwas Glacier at self. Evening return back.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR - PAHALGAM\",\"date\":\"21-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">After breakfast drive for a 01-night&nbsp;tour of Pahalgam 7200fts (village of shepherds) en-route visiting the world-famous saffron growing fields, Awantipura temple ruins (9th century), and Martand Temple ( sun temple). On arrival in Pahalgam transfer to Hotel. Afternoon visits famous sights from Indian film industry ( Bollywood), Baisaran view point, Aru village, and Chandanwari by horses or car at self. Pahalgam is also famous for trekking routes and base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage. Enjoy the natural beauty and river Lidder by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">Overnight stay at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PAHALGAM - GULMARG\",\"date\":\"22-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>The morning after breakfast leave Pahalgam to Gulmarg by-passing Srinagar at&nbsp; 8700 ft know as meadow of flowers, famous for Golf course during summer with 18 holes highest Golf course in the World and ski resort in Winter. Enjoy Horse riding&nbsp;snow sled and a Gondola ride to Khilanmarg, Kongdoori. You may also enjoy playing Golf.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gulmarg.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GULMARG - SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"23-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning after breakfast leave Gulmarg to Srinagar, at arrival transfer to Hotel. Evening Shikara tour of the Lake.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight Stay at Houseboat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"24-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a yummy breakfast and transfer to Srinagar Airport. Proceed for your onward journey to Ranchi.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Amritsar (ATQ)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"477\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"fare\":7742},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2122\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"fare\":11912},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2033\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose petal\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wangnoo Heritage Luxury Group of HouseBoats\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"21\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Eden Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Wood\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Solomon Heights\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"check_out\":\"24\\/10\\/2021\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Amritsar.</li>\n	<li>Hotels on Double sharing Basis&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan:MAPAI Basis (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>All surface travelling by&nbsp;Etios</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All present applicable taxes as on date.</li>\n</ul>', '<div>\n<p>Rafting.Glacier visit,Pony Ride,Gondola,Aru,Chandanwadi &amp; Betab Valley</p>\n\n<p>Entrance fees to monuments,Meals other than mentioned above.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Airfare, Tips, gratuities,Shikara Ride,(If You Need to GST Bill then Add Extra 5%GST)</p>\n\n<p>Alcohol, soft drinks, bottled water, beverages, etc.</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Any costs arising out of unforeseen circumstances like landslides, road<br />\nblocks, bad weather,Political Strike etc.<br />\nAny charges for carrying still/video cameras etc</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":19654,\"land_cost\":\"38000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":57654,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12683.88\",\"selling_price\":70337.880000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0213/092021', 70400, 35200, 0, '2021-09-09 18:17:55', '2021-10-28 19:24:18', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
