hargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Kolkata.</li>\n	<li>Return Airport transfers by speedboat.</li>\n	<li>All Breakfast</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>RT-PCR Test required at Maldives @ <strong>USD&nbsp;120</strong> per Pax.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78264,\"land_cost\":\"172462\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":250726,\"profit_figure\":\"15000\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"5.00%\",\"selling_price\":265726}', 'MZQ/0214/092021', 266700, 88900, 0, '2021-09-09 18:23:12', '2021-09-10 17:16:13', 0, 0, '\"<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">Please Note:&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">We would like to share with you the following details to be completed please 24 hours prior to your guests\\u2019 arrival.<\\/div>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">Moreover, changes being made to general entry requirements to Maldives due to Coronavirus (Covid-19), effective from 16th July 2020. In accordance with health requirements, all travellers travelling to Maldives are required to submit an online Self declarative Health Declaration via&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv<\\/a>&nbsp;within 24 hours prior their departure TO and FROM Maldives.<\\/div>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>Compulsory SELF ATTESTED PAN CARD&nbsp; &amp; PASSPORT copy is required for all guests.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Rates are subject to USD fluctuation at the time of booking &amp; payment.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(219, 'MR SANJEEV CHITLANGIA', 'BNI SHIVAM', '9334700023', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2021-11-07', 6, 0, 16, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Arrival\",\"date\":\"07-11-2021 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and take a transfer to the hotel\\/houseboat. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy a 1 hr shikara ride in Dal Lake at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"08-11-2021 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 60 kms will be covered in about 2 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on your own).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px; text-align:justify\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:14px\\\"><span style=\\\"color:#000000\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Lato 2&quot;, sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-style:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-variant-caps:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight:400\\\"><span style=\\\"letter-spacing:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"orphans:2\\\"><span style=\\\"text-transform:none\\\"><span style=\\\"white-space:normal\\\"><span style=\\\"widows:2\\\"><span style=\\\"word-spacing:0px\\\"><span style=\\\"background-color:#ffffff\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-style:initial\\\"><span style=\\\"text-decoration-color:initial\\\"><font face=\\\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\"><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/font><\\/font><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg  - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"09-11-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam \\u201cValley of Shepherds\\u201d. On arrival check in at Hotel In Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings. One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"10-11-2021 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Pahalgam is a best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"11-11-2021 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Garden.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On return visit a local Handicrafts Showroom for hand-knotted specialty silken carpets, shawls, jewelry ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"12-11-2021 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is at a distance of 84 Kms from Srinagar is also called as \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d. Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Departure\",\"date\":\"13-11-2021 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the Srinagar airport to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The kabo luxury\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":8,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"08\\/11\\/2021\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Highland Park\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":8,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/11\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":8,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"11\\/11\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snowland & Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":8,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/11\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Hotel accommodation on 08 Dbl Rooms on MAP &amp; CP&nbsp;basis</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>02 Tempo Traveler Or Similar for transfers as per Itinerary.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Day trip to Sonmarg.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>SS Mughal Gardens , Shankara Achariya Temple.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>All applicable taxes.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arr / Dep by&nbsp;Multi Zone Travels.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>Rafting.Glacier visit,Pony Ride,Gondola,Aru,Chandanwadi &amp; Betab Valley</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees to monuments,Meals other than mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>In case our cab is not allowed to Tangmarg .You will pay at your own cost.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>30 days or more before the date of departure: 30% of the total cost.</li>\n	<li>Remaining balance before 15 days of the Tour.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Reservation cancelled before 15&nbsp;days from the date of arrival will attract 30% cancellation charges of the Package cost&nbsp;.</li>\n	<li>Reservations cancelled between 15 Days to 07 days from the date of arrival will incur a fee equivalent to 50% of the package cost.</li>\n	<li>Reservations cancelled within 07 days from the date of arrival will incur a cancellation fee equivalent to 100% of the package cost.</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"472000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":472000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 61360\",\"selling_price\":533360}', 'MZQ/0215/092021', 533328, 33333, 0, '2021-09-17 14:49:14', '2021-10-28 19:23:45', 1, 1, '\"<p>Please Note :<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The vehicle provided will not be at&nbsp;disposal basis.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>There are certain aspects of the tour which, we as travel agents, do not have any control. Hence we are making you aware of such areas so you too can enlighten your clients. One such aspect is shopping. Lots of sellers will come to the hotels &amp; houseboats to sell their goods. We take no responsibility whatsoever for the rates and quality. Second such aspect is pony rides in Sonmarg, Gulmarg &amp; Pahalgam. We take no responsibility for services and charges of pony wallas. Though for tourists convenience the Union rates are displayed at most of the places. The third aspect is power cuts. These are regular and sometimes for long durations. Some Hotels &amp; houseboats have generator back-up but only up to 12 a.m. at night after which the generators are switched off due to noise disturbance. The clients are provided with candles.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Transfers by Shikara from Shikara ghat to houseboat and back are provided free of cost, however occasionally during the season, you may have to wait for 5-10 minutes for the shikara to come and pick you up as each houseboat has one attached shikhara.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Please note that in case of heavy snow, clients have to take 4X4 Snow Jeep from Tangmarg (a place 12 Kms. before Gulmarg - in case of a trip to Gulmarg). The supplement charges for the same are INR 1, 450\\/- approx Per Jeep for To &amp;Fro transfers. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like landslides, roadblocks etc (to be borne by the clients directly on the spot)&nbsp;Personal expenses such as laundry, telephone calls, tips, liquor, boating, and Gondola\\/joy rides &nbsp;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>At resorts like Gulmarg, Pahalgam &amp; Sonmarg there are places like ARU Valley, Chandanwari, Betab Valley Thajwas Glacier, Gulmarg Locals, &nbsp;Pahalgam locals, &amp; Sonmarg Locals you need to hire local transport of your own which cost approx Rs.1000 approx to &amp; fro per destination. &nbsp;(Local Transport includes Cabs, Gondola Ride, Pony Rides, &amp; Cart Rides)&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(220, 'MR GAURAV GUPTA', 'BNI', '9431335577', 'priyaagrico@rediffmail.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2021-10-18', 7, 0, 10, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Port Blair - Cellular Jail + Sound & Light Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"18-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you relax and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After some rest, visit the famous&nbsp;<b><u>Cellular Jail<\\/u><\\/b>, (entry closes at 1545hrs), an old colonial prison situated in Port Blair also known as \'Kalapani\'. Later, attend the enthralling&nbsp;<b><u>Sound &amp; Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive and then drop back to the hotel.<br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - North Bay Island + Ross Island\",\"date\":\"19-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Let\'s get back in time to visit the first Administrative settlement of the Britishers in the Andaman Islands, Ross Island. Earlier, said as the Paris of the past. This island&nbsp;today&nbsp;has ruins of all the luxury the Britishers had during that time.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit this amazing destination and move forward on a boat to visit the Coral Island of Port Blair, North Bay Island. Infringe with rich marine life this island is the other most visited destination in Andaman. Scuba Diving, Sea Walk, Snorkeling and Glass boat rides can be done here at an additional cost.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORT BLAIR - Baratang Island + Limestone Cave\",\"date\":\"20-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Depart to Baratang Island by road through the dense tropical forest and Jarawa Tribal reserve in a convoy. Often you might see a member of the Jarawa Tribe while passing through the tribal reserve. At the end of this forest journey you would reach Baratang jetty. Launch service is available to cross the sea bay. Enjoy the breathtaking fiber boat ride through a fascinating Mangrove drive, which leads to the start point of the trek to Lime stone caves. Trek through dense forest to reach the Limestone Cave. Made up of the mineral calcite (calcium carbonate) the cave contains beautiful cave formation. Return back for overnight stay at respective hotel at Port Blair by the same route.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PORTBLAIR - HAVELOCK - Radhanagar Beach\",\"date\":\"21-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;we depart to the Andaman Islands\' most amazing destination, Havelock Island. The destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Rest and Relax in a beachside resort. We at Experience Andamans only share beachside resorts for&nbsp;exquisite experiences.&nbsp;Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<b>&nbsp;<\\/b>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. Post this we drop you back at your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK - Elephanta Beach\",\"date\":\"22-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one of the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. where you explore the amazing reef in Elephant beach. Later we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HAVELOCK ISLAND - NEIL ISLAND  - Neil Beaches\",\"date\":\"23-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NEIL ISLAND - PORTBLAIR - Cellular jail + Shopping\",\"date\":\"24-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the morning we return back to board a ferry to Port Blair. Upon reaching our representative will attend you and will take you to the hotel for check-in.&nbsp;Post lunch rest and later proceed to one among the most visited attraction in Andaman Islands, Cellular Jail. This jail before India\'s Independence hosted the most ferocious prisoners in the Andaman Islands.&nbsp;Today&nbsp;this jail stands as a national memorial. Visit these historic attractions and know about the rich history of the Andaman Islands. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair Airport\",\"date\":\"25-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and check-out from the Port Blair hotel as per the hotel\'s allocated time. Head&nbsp;straight to the airport&nbsp;to board the departure flight. Have a safe trip home taking back fond memories of these stunning islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u2022&nbsp;Do note that all Port Blair hotels have an early morning check-out time and late check-out is provided at the discretion of the hotel management and subject to availability.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u2022 Port Blair airport has a small single runway and usually with a heavy rush of tourists. Request all guests to report at least 1.5hrs before departure flight timing.<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"345\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"76440\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"804\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"109330\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6931\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Scapes\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/10\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel White Coral Beach Resort\",\"city\":\"Havelock\",\"room_type\":\"Cottage\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"Neil\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pearl Park Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Cottage (Garden View)\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"24\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Scapes\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/10\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Kolkata.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in rooms as given at hotels in Port Blair, Havelock and Neil on 02 Double and 02 triple sharing basis.</li>\n	<li>All Breakfast &amp; Dinners.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service at the airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by 2 Private AC Vehicle at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>Transfer to Havelock Island/Neil Island in GREEN OCEAN</li>\n	<li>Full day tour with all transfers including airport pick up and drop.</li>\n	<li>All entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</li>\n	<li>Personal Tour Coordinators for one Point of Contact.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance by field executive at all the major entry exit points (Airport/Jetty/Jail/Water sports complex, Havelock / Neil etc).</li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Scorpio, Xylo , Ertiga , Tavera, Swift Desire ) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n</ul>', '<p>1)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Vehicle at disposal</p>\n\n<p>2)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any personal expenses. Room service and special orders Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages</p>\n\n<p>3)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Any extra excursions or sightseeing apart from the suggested tour itinerary.</p>\n\n<p>4)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Porter Charges, Guide Charges including Cellular Jail &amp; Ross Island and Camera Ticket charges.</p>\n\n<p>5)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Other meals not mentioned laundry, telephone calls, and incidentals.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":185770,\"land_cost\":\"279460\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":465230,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46523\",\"selling_price\":511753}', 'MZQ/0216/092021', 512000, 51200, 0, '2021-09-20 18:44:55', '2021-09-24 16:53:21', 0, 1, '\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>PLEASE NOTE NO ROOMS HAVE&nbsp;BEEN&nbsp;BLOCKED&nbsp;AND&nbsp;WILL&nbsp;BE DONE&nbsp;ON CONFIRMATION OF THE ABOVE SUBJECT TO ROOM AVAILABILITY AT THE TIME OF CONFIRMATION<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>IMPORTANT POINTS TO NOTE DUE TO COVID RESTRICTIONS<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;All incoming passengers into Port Blair will need to&nbsp;carry&nbsp;RT-PCR Negative Test report&nbsp;issued from an&nbsp;ICMR Recognized lab.&nbsp;The test should have been taken&nbsp;within 48 Hrs. to the commencement of the journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Further, everyone arriving will have to take a compulsory&nbsp;RT-PCR Test on arrival at Port Blair Airport, which is free of cost (this is in addition to the RT-PCR Negative report, which the guests will have to carry from their hometown) and the guests will have to be in the hotel room until the test results are out and&nbsp;hence, we suggest to keep&nbsp;Day 1 at leisure&nbsp;and keep the 2nd&nbsp;day also at Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Currently Private ferries are not operating and all Inter-Island transfers will be by&nbsp;Govt Ferry.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Guest above the age of 65 years will not be permitted on public beaches.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(221, 'MR O P TULSIYAN', 'FRANKY', '9304444621', 'INFO@MULTIZONETRAVELS.COM', 'KASHMIR', '2021-10-14', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVE SRINAGAR\",\"date\":\"14-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Warm welcome and arrival assistance by our representative at Srinagar airport at an altitude of 1730 mtrs and transfer to Hotel. Srinagar known as Paradise on Earth and The Venice of Asia.&nbsp;Visit the local crafts market and shop for unique Papier and Walnut Wood items.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg  - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"15-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Sonamarg for a full-day excursion ( 9000fts ), The Golden Meadow. Sonamarg is the beginning of the enchanted journey into a natural wonderland. Surrounded by mountains up to 5300 meters high the valley is divided by a spur of the Thajwas Range. Baltal the base camp for Amarnath Piligrim lies 15 kms north of Sonamarg. This little valley lies at the foothill of Zojila. On arrival visit a Snow-covered mountain throughout the year known as Thajiwas Glacier at self. Evening return back.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR LOCAL & HOUSEBOAT STAY\",\"date\":\"16-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the famous Mughal Gardens Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Also visit a local Handicrafts Showroom for hand-knotted specialty silken carpets, shawls, jewelry ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Houseboat<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SRINAGAR - PAHALGAM\",\"date\":\"17-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive for a 01-night&nbsp;tour of Pahalgam 7200fts (village of shepherds) en-route visiting the world famous saffron growing fields, Awantipura temple ruins (9th century), and Martand Temple ( sun temple). On arrival in Pahalgam transfer to Hotel. Afternoon visits famous sights from Indian film industry ( Bollywood), Baisaran viewpoint, Aru village, and Chandanwari by horses or car at self. Pahalgam is also famous for trekking routes and base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage. Enjoy the natural beauty and river Lidder by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PAHALGAM - GULMARG\",\"date\":\"18-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>The morning after breakfast leave Pahalgam to Gulmarg by-passing Srinagar at&nbsp; 8700 ft know as meadow of flowers, famous for Golf course during summer with 18 holes highest Golf course in the World and ski resort in Winter. Enjoy Horse riding&nbsp;snow sled and a Gondola ride to Khilanmarg, Kongdoori. You may also enjoy playing Golf.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gulmarg.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"GULMARG - SRINAGAR & DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"19-10-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a yummy breakfast and transfer to Srinagar Airport. Proceed for your onward journey to Ranchi.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"08 :55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":39976},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"643\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"fare\":36784},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snowland\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wangnoo Sheraton Houseboats\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Eden Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Premier Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"18\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rosewood\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/10\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Amritsar.</li>\n	<li>Hotels on Double sharing Basis&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan:MAPAI Basis (Breakfast + Dinner)</li>\n	<li>All surface travelling by A/C Innova.</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All present applicable taxes as on date.</li>\n</ul>', '<div>\n<p>Rafting.Glacier visit,Pony Ride,Gondola,Aru,Chandanwadi &amp; Betab Valley</p>\n\n<p>Entrance fees to monuments,Meals other than mentioned above.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Airfare, Tips, gratuities,Shikara Ride,(If You Need to GST Bill then Add Extra 5%GST)</p>\n\n<p>Alcohol, soft drinks, bottled water, beverages, etc.</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Any costs arising out of unforeseen circumstances like landslides, road<br />\nblocks, bad weather,Political Strike etc.<br />\nAny charges for carrying still/video cameras etc</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"24\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"57686\",\"land_cost\":\"83500\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":141186,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 33884.64\",\"selling_price\":175070.640000000013969838619232177734375}', 'MZQ/0217/092021', 175400, 43850, 0, '2021-09-22 18:20:45', '2021-09-30 17:28:04', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(222, 'MR SUNNY', 'WALKIN', '9905335522', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MALDIVES', '2021-10-05', 4, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"718\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"08:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":47540},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"8108\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Male (MLE)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"8115\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"05:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"924\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"09:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MALDIVES\",\"hotel_name\":\"Centara Grand Island Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Beach Suite\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MALDIVES\",\"hotel_name\":\"Centara Grand Island Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe water Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/10\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/10\\/2021\",\"city\":\"CHENNAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"ITC Grand Chola\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Club\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/10\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"5436\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>RoundTrip Sea Plane transfers.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet at Male International Airport and assistance with domestic transfer and international flights.</li>\n	<li>Stylish check-in with a glass of bubbly or soft drink of your choice.</li>\n	<li>Daily champagne breakfasts with an extensive selection through mid-morning at the Reef Restaurant (Champagne only during breakfast)</li>\n	<li>Lunch and dinner featuring international cuisine at Reef Restaurant our main dining outlet.</li>\n	<li>Choice of another three different venues for lunch and dinner featuring international cuisine.</li>\n	<li>The showmanship of Teppanyaki at the Reef, Thai fare at Suan Bua, Italian cuisine at Azzuri Mare (Reservations required)</li>\n	<li>Afternoon tea with cakes, scones and petit sandwiches served at our Coral Bar and Library.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>The resort operates two bars. Standard beverages – house pouring served daily from 11:00 to 23:00. Includes house wines (red, white, sparkling, and rose) served by the glass only, beer, spirits, cocktails, soft drinks, tea, coffee and canned or bottled juices&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Private minibar replenished once a day with Standard Set Up&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Standard Beverages - House pouring from Dining outlet dispense Bars during meals Other Inclusions:&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Water sports&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Non-motorised water sports&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Snorkelling equipment for use throughout the stay&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Snorkelling Lesson (Especially for non-swimmers and non-snorkellers)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Windsurf and Catamaran Lesson (Only for experienced sailors)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Fitness centre&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Tennis and Volleyball court&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Kids Club&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Dreams Cinema&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Wireless internet access available throughout the resort For Centara Grand Island Resort &amp; Spa: 1</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":47540,\"land_cost\":\"201891\",\"hotel_cost\":\"5361\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":254792,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 38218.8\",\"selling_price\":293010.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0218/092021', 293200, 146600, 0, '2021-09-24 19:13:18', '2021-09-24 19:13:18', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>HOTEL DETAILS&nbsp;<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>HeadLine :<\\/strong> Near Maafushivaru Island Beach<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Location :<\\/strong> With a stay at Centara Grand Island Resort &amp; Spa Maldives in Machchafushi you ll be convenient to Maafushivaru Island Beach and Maafushivaru Island Jetty. This 5-star resort is within the vicinity of Vakarufalhi Island Beach and Dhangethi Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Rooms : <\\/strong>Make yourself at home in one of the 112 air-conditioned rooms featuring refrigerators and minibars (stocked with some free items). Rooms have private balconies. Flat-screen televisions with cable programming provide entertainment while complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dining :<\\/strong> All-inclusive rates are available at this resort. Meals and beverages at onsite dining establishments are included in all-inclusive rates. Charges may be applied for dining at some restaurants special dinners and dishes some beverages and other amenities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy international cuisine at Reef Restaurant one of the resort s 4 restaurants or stay in and take advantage of the 24-hour room service. Need to unwind? Take a break with a tasty beverage at one of the 2 bars\\/lounges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Check-In Instructions : <\\/strong>Extra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy Government-issued photo identification and a credit card debit card or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges Special requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed No onsite parking is available This property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted Safety features at this property include a fire extinguisher a smoke detector a security system and a first aid kit Please note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Special Instructions :<\\/strong> Front desk staff will greet guests on arrival. For more details please contact the property using the information on the booking confirmation. Guests must arrange transfers (surcharge) from Male International Airport to the property which is\\u00c2&nbsp;25 minutes\\u00c2&nbsp;away via seaplane. To guarantee transfers guests must contact the property with their flight details at least\\u00c2&nbsp;04 days before their expected arrival. \\u00c2&nbsp;Daily transfer service is offered between 06:00 AM and 15:45 PM. Guests arriving or departing outside of these hours are advised to book a local hotel room in Male or Hulhumale.\\u00c2&nbsp;Luggage in excess of 20 kg\\/person may incur a fee payable to the seaplane company during flight check-in. Guests must pay the seaplane fee at check-out. Guests must arrange transfers (surcharge) from Male International Airport to the property which is\\u00c2&nbsp;30 Minutes\\u00c2&nbsp;via a flight. To guarantee transfers guests must contact the property with their flight details at least\\u00c2&nbsp;4 days\\u00c2&nbsp;before their expected arrival. Daily transfer service is offered by Maldivian Airways\\/FlyMe before 10:30 PM. Guests arriving outside of these hours are advised to book a hotel room in Male or Hulhumale until services resume.\\u00c2&nbsp;Guests must pay the domestic flight fee and the speedboat fee at check-out.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n<b>Disclaimer notification: Amenities are subject to availability and may be chargeable as per the hotel policy.<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(223, 'MR UMA SHANKAR', 'IAS', '8809157895', NULL, 'MUMBAI + LONAVALA', '2021-09-29', 3, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"341\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Sep 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Sep 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":9378},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"146\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Oct 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Oct 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"fare\":11886}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"check_out\":\"30\\/09\\/2021\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOLIDAY INN\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"4100\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/09\\/2021\",\"city\":\"LONAVALA\",\"hotel_name\":\"DELLA RESORTS & VILLAS\",\"room_type\":\"GARDEN VILLA ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/10\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"24065\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at Mumbai.</li>\n	<li>02&nbsp;Nights Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at Lonavala.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests</li>\n	<li>Mumbai Airport - Mumbai Hotel - Lonavala Hotel - Mumbai Airport&nbsp;by Private Sanitized <strong>AC Innova Crysta.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle will not be on disposal basis.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"30\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":21264,\"hotel_cost\":28165,\"land_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":64429,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19328.7\",\"selling_price\":83757.699999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0219/092021', 83600, 41800, 0, '2021-09-28 15:13:38', '2021-09-28 17:17:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(224, 'MR PRIYAL CHAUBEY', 'UBI NITISH', '9631802809', 'priyal.chaubey@gmail.com', 'KASHMIR', '2021-11-15', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"15-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy 01-hour shikara ride in dal Lake at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg - Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"16-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full-day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called as \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d.Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg  (56 Kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"17-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 56 kms will be covered in about 2:00 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visit the local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek up to Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Pahalgam (140 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"18-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam \\u201cValley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds\\u201d.&nbsp;On arrival check-in Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;the&nbsp;best place for Honeymoon Couples\\u2019s surrounded by snow-clad mountains with dense forest of pine and deodar trees, vast meadows, and a Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station in India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"19-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your full day in Pahalgam,&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct-hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath&nbsp;Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"20-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of&nbsp; Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand-knotted especially silken shawls, carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in HouseBoat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Departure\",\"date\":\"21-11-2021 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy&nbsp;the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport&nbsp;to board your scheduled flight for your onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Nov 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Nov 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:55 AM\",\"fare\":19972},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2124\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Nov 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Nov 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6099\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Nov 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Nov 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"fare\":15020},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2033\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Nov 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Nov 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snowland\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/11\\/2021\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rosewood\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/11\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Eden Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/11\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"20\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wangnoo Sheraton Houseboats\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/11\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>Hotels on Double sharing Basis&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan:MAPAI Basis <strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>All surface travelling by A/C Etios/ Dzire.</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All present applicable taxes as on date.</li>\n</ul>', '<div>\n<p>Rafting.Glacier visit,Pony Ride,Gondola,Aru,Chandanwadi &amp; Betab Valley</p>\n\n<p>Entrance fees to monuments,Meals other than mentioned above.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Airfare, Tips, gratuities,Shikara Ride,(If You Need to GST Bill then Add Extra 5%GST)</p>\n\n<p>Alcohol, soft drinks, bottled water, beverages, etc.</p>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Any costs arising out of unforeseen circumstances like landslides, road<br />\nblocks, bad weather,Political Strike etc.<br />\nAny charges for carrying still/video cameras etc</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":34992,\"land_cost\":\"62000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":96992,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14548.8\",\"selling_price\":111540.800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0220/092021', 107000, 53500, 0, '2021-09-29 20:08:40', '2021-10-29 11:36:22', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
