erves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</li>\n	<li>04 Nights Accomodation at the mentioned&nbsp;Hotel</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet Breakfast at the Hotel</li>\n	<li>All Applicable Taxes&nbsp;<b><u>(TOURISM DIRHAM FEE NOT INCLUDED)</u></b></li>\n	<li>Return&nbsp;<b>Dubai&nbsp;</b>Airport transfers&nbsp;<b>(<u>UPGRADED TO PRIVATE BASIS AT THE SAME COST OF SIC)</u></b></li>\n	<li>Half-Day Dubai City Tour + Dubai Mall (inclusive in the tour) + Burj Khalifa 124<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor with Entrance Tickets (Included in Dubai city tour if booked)</li>\n	<li>Desert Safari Tour with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show, and other camp activities.</li>\n	<li>Marina Cruise with Buffet Dinner.</li>\n	<li>All other Sightseeing and Tours and Transfers on&nbsp;<b><u>SIC</u></b>&nbsp;basis<a name=\"m_8999274216918661008__GoBack\"></a>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai</strong>&nbsp;<b>Visa + Basic Covid Insurance.</b></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\