expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"139860\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":139860,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22377.6\",\"selling_price\":162237.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0225/0102021', 162105, 32421, 0, '2021-10-16 18:44:57', '2021-11-05 14:29:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
