el at&nbsp;<b>Havelock</b>&nbsp;+</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Daily&nbsp;<b>breakfast&nbsp;</b>on a set menu or buffet basis, as indicated in the meal plan. (Except breakfast on the day of arrival)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Entry tickets, and ferry tickets to all sightseeing places.&nbsp;<b>Port Blair - Havelock&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Havelock </b><b>- Port Blair.</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>All transfers by&nbsp;<b>1 Ac Car</b>&nbsp;in Port Blair/ Havelock/ Neil&nbsp;<b><i>(We provide AC Xylos / Ertiga at Port Blair and Havelock)</i></b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Excursion to Elephant Beach or Light House subject to weather conditions.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"23\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":35314,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":125882,\"transport_cost\":\"16642\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":177838,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 40902.74\",\"selling_price\":218740.73999999999068677425384521484375}', 'MZQ/0228/0102021', 218600, 109300, 19800, '2021-10-20 16:50:58', '2021-11-15 18:50:56', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(233, 'MR SUMIL', 'BNI ANIMESH', '8407804255', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2021-11-30', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later visit Cellular Jail and Light and Sound Show\",\"date\":\"30-11-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you check-in. Post lunch we proceed to one of the most visited attractions in the Andaman Islands, Cellular Jail. This jail before India\'s Independence hosted Indian freedom fighters as prisoners in the Andaman Islands. Today, this jail stands as a national memorial. Visit to this historic attraction and know about the rich history of the Andaman Islands. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"01-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"02-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure. Kept free to enjoy the beach side property and Water activities\",\"date\":\"03-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>How, about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving, Kayaking, Glass bottom boat ride and Sea Walk can be done at an additional cost on this day. Note: Our team at Havelock Or Neil Island will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"04-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\'s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island. Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and the Experience Andamans team will update you in case of such changes<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bharatapur Beach and Natural Rock Formation. Later Neil To Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop + Shopping trip\",\"date\":\"05-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you at the hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"06-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination. Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HHH\",\"date\":\"07-12-2021 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>HHH<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"from\":\"RNC\",\"to\":\"HWH\",\"name\":\"RNC HWH SPL\",\"fno\":\"02020\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Nov 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Nov 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"1700\",\"id\":1},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"972\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"05:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 AM\",\"fare\":17388}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fortune Resort Bay Island\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/12\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"01\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Munjoh Ocean Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Ocean Suite\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"04\\/12\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"04\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Silver Sand Neil Island\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Panorama\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/12\\/2021\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"05\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fortune Resort Bay Island\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/12\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In cas