6875}', 'MZQ/0231/0102021', 330890, 165445, 0, '2021-10-30 11:37:58', '2021-12-01 12:48:08', 0, 1, '\"<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">\\n<p><em><strong>Note: <\\/strong>For above hotel it is compulsory&nbsp;to buy insurance.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>What is the entry requirement of all travellers to the Maldives?<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Every traveller entering the Maldives, must have a valid negative PCR test result for<br \\/>\\nCovid19, issued by a lab duly registered by the competent authority in the country of<br \\/>\\norigin.<br \\/>\\nThe sample must be taken not more than 72 hours prior to the scheduled time of<br \\/>\\ndeparture from the first port embarkation en route to the Maldives.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\nThis test, requested by the Maldivian authorities, is mandatory and applies to all tourists<br \\/>\\nand short term visitors of all ages, except infants 0-12 months of age.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 <strong>Maldives Immigration introduces<\\/strong> \\u201cTraveller Health Self-Declaration\\u201d to fast-track the<br \\/>\\nprocess of pre-arrival and pre-departure health information in accordance with the health<br \\/>\\nrequirements of the Maldives. All travellers are required to submit an online health<br \\/>\\ndeclaration within 24 hours prior to their departure to and from Maldives via this link:<br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv\\/<\\/a><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 The government of Maldives recommends the below affordable COVID-19 insurance<br \\/>\\npackages which should be purchased before the guests arrive to the Maldives.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>Package summary:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/myallied.mv\\/type\\/inbound-allied\\/new\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/myallied.mv\\/type\\/inbound-allied\\/new<\\/a><br \\/>\\nFAQs<br \\/>\\n<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/allied.mv\\/insurance-plan\\/allied-inbound\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/allied.mv\\/insurance-plan\\/allied-inbound\\/<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Please Note:&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">We would like to share with you the following details to be completed&nbsp;24 hours prior to your arrival.<\\/div>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">Moreover,&nbsp;changes being made to general entry requirements to Maldives due to Coronavirus (Covid-19), effective from 16th July 2020. In accordance to health requirements all travellers travelling to Maldives are required to submit an online Self declarative Health Declaration via&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/imuga.immigration.gov.mv<\\/a>&nbsp;within 24 hours prior their departure TO and FROM Maldives.<\\/div>\\n\\n<div dir=\\\"auto\\\">&nbsp;<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>Compulsory SELF ATTESTED PAN CARD&nbsp; &amp; PASSPORT copy is required for all guests.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p># Rates are subject to change on the basis of USD fluctuation at the time of booking &amp; payment.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
