ng of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":7},{\"age\":9}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>04&nbsp;Nights Accommodation in Well-appointed Air-Conditioned Room.</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker.</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;Waterfront Terrace &amp; Bar.</li>\n	<li>2 cocktails daily at Pool Side.</li>\n	<li>Fun Activity coupon.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>Return Airport Transfers by Private Sanitized AC Vehicle.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"9\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":121737,\"land_cost\":\"258016\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":379753,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 34177.77\",\"selling_price\":413930.7700000000186264514923095703125}', 'MZQ/0235/0112021', 413600, 89900, 18000, '2021-11-19 16:49:16', '2021-11-19 16:56:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(240, 'AZHAR', 'PARASTOLI', '7482871146', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MANALI', '2021-12-26', 3, 0, 28, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI - MANALI (575 kms 09-10 Hrs) Dinner\",\"date\":\"26-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at Delhi Airport\\/railway station at from there you will meet and assist by our representative and now you will ready to manali (575 km, 09 - 10 hour journey). Travelling to manali is very exciting as it covers a few popular travel destinations on the way on arrival at Manali this will be your over night journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the way sightseeing :-<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Pandoh dam<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Vaishno Devi Temple<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Kullu<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Sunder Nager lake<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI LOCAL SIGHTSEEING (Breakfast & Dinner)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning reach in manali drive to hotel check in to the hotel, after fresh up start half day sightseeing of Manali which includes Hadimba Temple, Manu Temple, Tibetan Monastery, Club House and Van Vihar. Evening is free to explore the local market of Manali and you can also enjoy a nature walk on The Mall Road of Manali. Later return back to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing of the Day: -<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Hadimba Temple<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Manu Temple<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Tibetan Monastery<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Club House<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Van Vihar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\uf0d8 Vashisht Temple<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI - Solang Valley Day Trip\",\"date\":\"28-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast at the hotel drive to towards Solang Valley and enjoy Paragliding. Dinner &amp; Overnight stay in Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Solang Valley:-<\\/strong> Solang Valley drives its name from combination of words Solang (Nearby village) and Nullah (water stream). It is a side valley at the top of the Kullu Valley in Himachal Pradesh, India 14 km northwest of the resort town Manali on the way to Rohtang Pass, and is known for its summer and winter sport conditions. The sport\\u2019s most commonly offered are parachuting, paragliding, skating and zorbing. Snow melts during the summer months starting May and skiing is then replaced by zorbing (a giant ball with room for 2 people which is rolled down a 200 meter hill), paragliding, parachuting and horse riding (cost extra). A ropeway was recently opened. Going to the summit can be possible by ATVs, Ropeway or Climbing (Trekking).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MANALI - DELHI\",\"date\":\"29-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning after breakfast check out from the hotel, after that proceed&nbsp;Delhi drop at railway station \\/ airport Hotel categories :-<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"THE ROYAL GRAND\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":9,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/12\\/2021\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>02&nbsp;nights’ accommodation in 09 room +10 extra bed (08rooms triple sharing 01 room quad sharing )</li>\n	<li>Welcome drink on arrival in hotel.</li>\n	<li>All breakfast &amp; dinners in hotel.</li>\n	<li>02 Tempo Traveller (&nbsp;13&nbsp;seater +&nbsp;17&nbsp;seater&nbsp;) Cab for Transfers &amp; sightseeing as per Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Fuel, Taxes, Driver Night Halt all inclusive.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"156800\",\"land_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":156800,\"profit_figure\":\"11200\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"7.00%\",\"selling_price\":168000}', 'MZQ/0236/0112021', 168000, 6000, 0, '2021-11-25 20:16:24', '2021-11-30 12:58:00', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
