blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Economy Class Flight Tickets <strong>Ex- Lucknow</strong>.</li>\n	<li>03 Nights stay in <strong>Hotel AMARA GRAND INN </strong>at&nbsp;Goa on MAP basis(B/F&nbsp;+ Dinner).</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing in Goa as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>01 <strong>Exclusive Sedan Car</strong> in Goa as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Kindly NOTE: </strong>We are not giving any vehicle for Airport Transfers.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":33748,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":13800,\"transport_cost\":\"10500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":58048,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9287.68\",\"selling_price\":67335.6799999999930150806903839111328125}', 'MZQ/0238/0112021', 67800, 33900, 0, '2021-11-29 20:12:41', '2021-11-30 18:27:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(243, 'SUMIT', 'CHETAN | BNI CELEB', '8093672470', 'INFO@MULTIZONETRAVELS.COM', 'KASHMIR', '2021-12-22', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"22-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous road in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy 01 hour shikara ride in dal Lake at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in HouseBoat<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonamarg  - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"23-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d.Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. <\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Local Sightseening\",\"date\":\"24-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand-knotted especially silken shawls, carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"25-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``The Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds\'\'.&nbsp;On arrival check-in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;the&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple is surrounded by snow-clad mountains with dense forest of pine and deodar trees, vast meadows, and a Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station in India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct-hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath&nbsp;Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"26-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course in the world with 18 holes. Later visit the local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek up to Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as a Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately) Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"27-12-2021\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Gulmarg and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for your onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Dec 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Dec 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"18412\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"643\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Dec 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Dec 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Dec 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"14291\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"550\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2021\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Dec 2021\",\"dep_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wangnoo Heritage Luxury Group of HouseBoats\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/12\\/2021\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Petal\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2021\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2021\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Eden Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"DELUXE ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2021\"