 held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ahmedabad.</strong></li>\n	<li>04&nbsp;Nights Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>Airport Transfers by Private Sanitized AC Vehicle.</li>\n	<li>One Full Day South Goa Sightseeing with Boat Cruise on River Mandoovi on PVT basis.</li>\n	<li>One Full Day North Goa Sightseeing&nbsp;on PVT basis.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":24004,\"land_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"9500\",\"hotel_cost\":21812},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":55316,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 8297.4\",\"selling_price\":63613.4000000000014551915228366851806640625}', 'MZQ/0240/0122021', 63800, 31900, 0, '2021-12-01 10:52:43', '2021-12-01 10:52:43', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(245, 'MR RAJESH GOYAL', 'VIBHOR BNI', '8210975430', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GOA', '2021-01-25', 5, 1, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Goa (GOI)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6345\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"fare\":7566},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Goa (GOI)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"1784\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Jan 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Jan 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:50 PM\",\"fare\":8400}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/01\\/2021\",\"city\":\"NORTH GOA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL PARK REGIS\",\"check_out\":\"28\\/01\\/2021\",\"rate\":\"26000\",\"room_type\":\"SUPERIOR ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"28\\/01\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SOUTH GOA\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOLIDAY INN RESORT\",\"room_type\":\"PLAZA GARDEN VIEW ROOM\",\"check_out\":\"30\\/01\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"26000\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Bangalore.</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned room.</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker.(replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi for&nbsp;all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>03&nbsp;Transfers Airport Pickup + Inter HotelTransfer&nbsp;+ Airport Drop by PVT Vehicle.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":15966,\"hotel_cost\":52000,\"land_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"5000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":72966,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10944.9\",\"selling_price\":83910.89999999999417923390865325927734375,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"4.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0241/0122021', 84700, 34200, 16300, '2021-12-28 12:23:52', '2021-12-28 12:23:52', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(246, 'MR ANIL GARODIA', 'BNI SHIVAM', '9709100140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2022-02-16', 7, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"16-02-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which one of the most famous road in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy 01 hour shikara ride in dal Lake at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"17-02-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam \\u201cValley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds\\u201d.&nbsp;On arrival check in Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for Honeymoon Couple\\u2019s surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of the India. You can go for trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"18-02-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your full day in Pahalgam,&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"19-02-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"20-02-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy a full day in Gulmarg .&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"21-02-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of&nbsp; Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"22-02-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called as \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar\",\"date\":\"23-02-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Feb 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Feb 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":45160},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"643\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Feb 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Feb 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"710\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Feb 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Feb 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"09:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":43656},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Feb 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Feb 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/02\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vivanta By Taj\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Delight Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/02\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/02\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine n Peak\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/02\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/02\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Khyber Himalayan Resorts and Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/02\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"21\\/02\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lalit Grand Palace\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/02\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accomodation on Double sharing Basis + 01 Extra Bed.</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan: CPAI<strong>(Breakfast)&nbsp;</strong>/ MAPAI Basis <strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>All surface traveling by <strong>12 seater Luxury Tempo Traveller</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Arrival/Departure transfer as mentioned in Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All presently applicable taxes as of&nbsp;date.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Expenses of personal Nature such as tips, laundry, telephone, table drinks,&nbsp; &nbsp;beverages etc.</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Cable Car Ride (Gondola) in Gulmarg. Pony&nbsp;ride in Gulmarg / Pahalgam.</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari, betaab valley in Pahalgam.&nbsp;</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Trip to Thajwas Glacier in Sonmarg as it &nbsp;&nbsp;is done by local taxi .</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Services of a Guide, Entry tickets &amp; other Misc. Charges.</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Any other services not in the programme.</p>\n\n	<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; Airfare.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":88816,\"land_cost\":\"778040\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":866856,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 69348.48\",\"selling_price\":936204.4799999999813735485076904296875}', 'MZQ/0242/0122021', 936800, 117100, 0, '2021-12-29 12:56:56', '2022-02-01 17:41:38', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(247, 'MR ABHINEET JAIN', 'BNI ABHISHEK JAIN', '9734353581', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2022-01-02', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"02-01-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"03-01-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"04-01-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel. Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"05-01-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\'s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island. Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bharatapur Beach and Natural Rock Formation. Later Neil To Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop\",\"date\":\"06-01-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you at the hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"07-01-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"101\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"18752\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jan 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jan 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"12400\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/01\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sand Heaven\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/01\\/2022\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Havelock Holiday Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Studio Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/01\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"05\\/01\\/2022\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Tango Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"06\\/01\\/2022\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/01\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sand Heaven\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"07\\/01\\/2022\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p>Return Airfare Ex-Kolkata.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>0<b>2</b>&nbsp;<b>Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Port Blair</b>&nbsp;+ 0<b>2&nbsp;Nights</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Havelock</b>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<b>1</b>&nbsp;<b>Night</b>&nbsp;stay at selected category of the hotel at&nbsp;<b>Neil Island</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Daily&nbsp;<b>breakfast&nbsp;</b>on a set menu or buffet basis, as indicated in the meal plan. (Except breakfast on the day of arrival)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Entry tickets, and ferry tickets to all sightseeing places.&nbsp;<b>Port Blair - Havelock&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Havelock - Neil&nbsp;</b>+&nbsp;<b>Neil - Port Blair .</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>All transfers by&nbsp;<b>1 Ac car</b>&nbsp;in Port Blair/ Havelock/ Neil&nbsp;<b><i>(We provide AC Xylos / Ertiga at Port Blair and Havelock)</i></b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>Excursion to Elephant Beach or Light House is subject to weather conditions.</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":31152,\"land_cost\":\"48000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":79152,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":99200,\"profit_figure\":\"20048\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"25.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0243/0122021', 99200, 49600, 0, '2021-12-31 12:52:11', '2021-12-31 17:11:40', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(248, 'MS TANISHA', 'TANNU BILASPUR', '6263661919', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MANALI', '2022-03-07', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh to Manali\",\"date\":\"07-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Chandigarh airport and transfer to Manali 10 hours drive. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local\",\"date\":\"08-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"09-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley&nbsp;and back to Hotel O\\/N Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;OR<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point&nbsp;&nbsp;(Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit).&nbsp;Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure.&nbsp;O\\/N Hotel&nbsp; (Closed on&nbsp;Tuesday)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Rohtang Pass Closed from Nov to May Month due to snow<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali - Shimla\",\"date\":\"10-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Checkout &amp; proceed to Shimla.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla\",\"date\":\"11-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri, after lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theatre- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali to Chandigarh Drop\",\"date\":\"12-03-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast proceed for Chandigarh to catch your return flight.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/03\\/2022\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rohtang Heights Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"10\\/03\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"10141\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/03\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Valley Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"12\\/03\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"10544\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel poli