ather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>02&nbsp;Nights Accommodation at Coorg&nbsp;in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room.</li>\n	<li>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;Accommodation at Mysore in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room.</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeing by PVT AC Swift Dezire.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":23883,\"hotel_cost\":16936,\"transport_cost\":\"13500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":54319,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":70000,\"profit_figure\":\"15681\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"28.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0251/022022', 70000, 35000, 0, '2022-02-20 20:25:38', '2022-02-21 16:05:05', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
