s, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Assistance on Arrival / Departure.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on twin Sharing Basis with 01 Extra Bed</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan <strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>All transfer and sightseeing by <strong>01 AC Innova</strong> / Similar as per itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>A <strong>24x7 </strong>Help Line No. for Guest during the tour for any assistance.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"112500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":112500,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13500\",\"selling_price\":126000}', 'MZQ/0254/022022', 126800, 25900, 11600, '2022-02-28 13:28:58', '2022-02-28 13:28:58', 0, 0, '\"<p><strong>&nbsp;Vehicle: 01 AC Innova \\/ Similar<\\/strong> as per itinerary &amp; timing only. Price May change if any hike in diesel price<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>(AC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicle will be on Point to Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place , that will be on your own by walk or local transportation and Big size vehicle like Tempo and Coaches are allowed upto a ceratin place at few sightseeing points that will be on your own walk or local transport like rikshaw or tempo &nbsp;on additional cost )<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Speed Limit \\u2013-Maximum Speed limit will be <strong>80 km\\/hr<\\/strong>&nbsp;in Rajasthan State Highway<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>About Hotel:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;Check-in time at 14:00 hrs. &amp; Check-out time will be 11:00 hrs. (Always vary from hotel to Hotel )<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;Category of Rooms in the packages normally remains to base category of rooms.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;A valid photo ID proof for all guests staying at the hotel is mandatory.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;For Extra adult in the room we will provide an extra bed (wherever possible), but most of the hotels only provide extra mattress or roll away bed.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;Operator reserves the right to re-arrange itinerary to suit hotel availability without changing the total number of days in each destination and without compromising with any services.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Important Facts for Traveller\\u2019s:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Please carry original ID proof (Voter ID card\\/Pass-port\\/Driving License etc.) for security purpose &amp; hotel policy.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;High season surcharge will be applicable for every booking from during Durga Puja &amp; Diwali,&nbsp;20th Dec&nbsp;\\u2013 5th Jan during X-Mass, New Year &amp; Holi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;In high season, no refund will be applicable within 30 days of the tours start date. (Normal cancellation policy will not be applicable on those dates.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;For high season booking, 50% payment must be done in the time of confirmation &amp; rest of the amount must be cleared before 30 days of the tour start date.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;The guest should always keep cool with the drivers as they are not tourism educated and come from different remote villages.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Room Heater available with an extra cost borne by the guest directly (Generally required in Jaisalmer &amp; Mount Abu)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;The duration mentioned in the itinerary may not be precise; it is the time that can be expected when strictly driving, depending on the present road conditions. Otherwise, the journey is conducted in such a way that we always stop midway for visiting villages, markets, photography, major landmarks of importance depending on the client\\u2019s interest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Please note that some of the sightseeing\\/itinerary may change due to time limit, weather, national holidays, and special events. We maintain the rights to alter the itinerary since tours are made in advance and unforeseen circumstances that mandate change may arise. Itinerary changes are made to improve your overall travel experience.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
