(261, 'MR O P TULSIYAN', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '7667224924', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'RAJASTHAN', '2022-03-17', 6, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi - Jhunjhunu\",\"date\":\"17-03-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Travel on your OWN. We will provide the Vehicle.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jhunjhunu - Salasar\\/Khatu\",\"date\":\"18-03-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Travel on your OWN. We will provide the Vehicle.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Salasar \\/ Jhunjhunu \\u2013 Ranthambore National Park (350  Km \\/ 6 hrs)\",\"date\":\"19-03-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and greet at Salasar or Jhunjhunu then transfer &nbsp;to Ranthambore. On arrival check-in to your hotel. Afternoon visit Ranthambore Fort built in 994 A.D. atop high creek 200 meters above sea level. Overnight stay at Ranthambore.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ranthambore National Park (Jeep Safari \\/ Canter Safari)  -Udaipur ( 450 Km \\/ 07 hrs )\",\"date\":\"20-03-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning jungle safari in Ranthambore National Park by Jeep \\/ Canter (At your own cost). drive for Udaipur (Beautiful Lake City of Rajasthan).. On arrival at Udaipur check-in at your hotel. In the evening take a breathtaking boat tour over the picturesque Lake Pichola (at your own cost) to admire the royal buildings around the Lake and enjoy the scenic sunset view. From the lake you have a wonderful view of the City Palace stretching along the east bank, while the south bank has pleasant gardens running down to the waterside. Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"21-03-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for Udaipur city tour. Visiting Fateh Sagar, Maharana Pratap Memorial, take a photo stop at Nehru Garden, Sehelion-KI-Bari \\u2013 Queen\\u2019s resort for their friends, Sukhadia Circle (Drive Pass), Bhartiya Lok kala Museum \\u2013 a museum of folk and art, it displays a rich collection of folk dresses, ornaments, puppets, masks, dolls. After that visit City Palace \\u2013 The largest palace complex of Rajasthan, Jagdish Temple \\u2013 built by Maharana Jagat Singh and is dedicated to Lord Vishnu &amp; Gulab Bagh. Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Nathdwara \\/Eklingji\",\"date\":\"22-03-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for full day excursion Nathdwara Shrinath Ji Temple and Eklingji Temple. Evening return back to the hotel. Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hotel \\u2013 Udaipur Airport\",\"date\":\"23-03-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from hotel and transfer to Udaipur Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Udaipur (UDR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5346\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"fare\":33204},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"363\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Ranthambore\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ranthambhore National Resort \\/ Tiger Machan\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/03\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/03\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Udaipur\",\"hotel_name\":\"Tree House Atulya Niwas \\/ Crimson Park\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"23\\/03\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline s