bsp;&nbsp;Please carry original ID proof (Voter ID card\\/Pass-port\\/Driving License etc.) for security purpose &amp; hotel policy.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;High season surcharge will be applicable for every booking from during Durga Puja &amp; Diwali,&nbsp;20th Dec&nbsp;\\u2013 5th Jan during X-Mass, New Year &amp; Holi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;In high season, no refund will be applicable within 30 days of the tours start date. (Normal cancellation policy will not be applicable on those dates.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;For high season booking, 50% payment must be done in the time of confirmation &amp; rest of the amount must be cleared before 30 days of the tour start date.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;The guest should always keep cool with the drivers as they are not tourism educated and come from different remote villages.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Room Heater available with an extra cost borne by the guest directly (Generally required in Jaisalmer &amp; Mount Abu)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;The duration mentioned in the itinerary may not be precise; it is the time that can be expected when strictly driving, depending on the present road conditions. Otherwise, the journey is conducted in such a way that we always stop midway for visiting villages, markets, photography, major landmarks of importance depending on the client\\u2019s interest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Please note that some of the sightseeing\\/itinerary may change due to time limit, weather, national holidays, and special events. We maintain the rights to alter the itinerary since tours are made in advance and unforeseen circumstances that mandate change may arise. Itinerary changes are made to improve your overall travel experience.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Rate Plans are dynamic in nature and are subject to change at the time of confirmation<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Rate will vary with increase or decrease of persons.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>NOTE:<\\/strong>&nbsp;The above mentioned hotels will be confirmed as per the room availability. Otherwise we will confirm similar category hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Vehicle: <strong>01 AC Innova \\/ Similar <\\/strong>as per itinerary &amp; timing only. Price May change if any hike in diesel price.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>(AC will not work in Hill Area and Vehicle will be on Point to Point basis in Mountain, Some hotels may be little far from the Parking or Drop place , that will be on your own by walk or local transportation and Big size vehicle like Tempo and Coaches are allowed upto a ceratin place at few sightseeing points that will be on your own walk or local transport like rikshaw or tempo &nbsp;on additional cost )<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Speed Limit \\u2013-Maximum Speed limit will be 80 kms in Rajasthan State Highway<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(262, 'MR SUNDEEP KHANNA', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '9835527233', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2022-03-18', 6, 2, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"560\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"26736\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ras Al Khaimah (RKT)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"9030\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:30 AM\",\"fare\":\"94572\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"736\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"148\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Mar 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"05:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":18360}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/03\\/2022\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"5*Canvas Hotel Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"24\\/03\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex- Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06 Nights</strong> Accomodation on <strong>Double Occupancy + 01 Extra Bed</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Return&nbsp;Dubai<b>&nbsp;</b><strong>Airport transfers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half Day Dubai City Tour + Burj Khalifa 124<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor</strong>&nbsp;with Entrance Tickets &amp; Transfer</li>\n	<li><strong>Desert Safari Tour</strong> with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show and other camp activities.</li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Dhow Cruise</strong> with Buffet Dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ain Dubai </strong>with Entrance&nbsp;Tickets and Transfers</li>\n	<li><strong>Museum of the Future</strong>&nbsp;with Entrance&nbsp;Tickets and Transfers</li>\n	<li><strong>Abu Dhabi with Ferrari World Theme Park</strong> with Entrance Ticket with visit to Grand Mosque – (To enter Abu Dhabi, 02 doses of WHO approved vaccines and a PCR test with a validity of 48 Hour is mandatory)</li>\n	<li><strong>One Day Visit to Expo 2020</strong> with Tickets &amp; Transfers (Visitors ages 18 and above must present proof of any vaccine recognized by their national government or a negative PCR test taken within the previous 72 hours)</li>\n	<li><b>Dubai Visa + Insurance</b></li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;Sightseeing and Tours and Transfers on&nbsp;<b><u>PRIVATE</u></b>&nbsp;Basis<a name=\"m_8999274216918661008__GoBack\"></a></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>TCS Extra</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Tourism Dirham Fee Extra to be paid at Hotel while Check-in.</strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":139668,\"land_cost\":\"218880\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":358548,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35854.8\",\"selling_price\":394402.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0258/032022', 394600, 111200, 86100, '2022-03-04 13:04:43', '2022-03-08 20:28:45', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
