(263, 'MR ANIMESH NIKHIL', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '9665043610', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DARJEELING & GANGTOK', '2022-04-20', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"RANCHI - NEW JALPAIGURI BY TRAIN\",\"date\":\"20-04-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>OverNight in Train<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival - Transfer - Darjeeling stay\",\"date\":\"21-04-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Our representative will be there to receive the Guest at Nepal \\u2013 India border Kakarbhitta \\/ Bhadrapur Airport (BDP) Nepal \\/ New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP) \\/ Bagdogra Airport (IXB) \\/ Tenzing Norgay Bus Stand (Junction) \\/\\u2013 transfer - Darjeeling - Nearly 105 kilometers 2 \\u00bd - 3 hours drive from siliguri &amp; Nearly 139 kilometers 3 \\u00bd - 4 hours drive from&nbsp; Nepal border Kakarbhitta \\u2013 At an height of 2123 meters \\/ 70001 feet lies the land of breathtaking beauty, sloping tea gardens with spectacular views of the Mount&nbsp;<em>Kanchendzonga<\\/em>&nbsp; is the Queen of the hills \\u2013 It is &nbsp;also home to the famous World Heritage train (UNESCO) \\u2013 The Darjeeling Himalayan Railway (DHR) Toy Train -<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Check into hotel \\u2013 Evening free to roam around Mall or local Shopping center -<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Over night stay at Darjeeling<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Local Sightseeing (Full Day) - Darjeeling stay\",\"date\":\"22-04-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early Morning breakfast \\u2013 full day sightseeing&nbsp; tour includes -&nbsp;Padmaja Naidu Zoological Park, Himalayan Mountaineering Institute (Closed on Thursday),&nbsp; Ropeway, Tenzing - Gombu&nbsp; Rock, Tibetan&nbsp; Refugee Self&nbsp; Help Centre (Closed on Sunday), Beautiful Tea Estate (Garden), Lebong Race Course, Japanese Temple&nbsp;-&nbsp;other places of visit are&nbsp;Peace Pagoda, Lal kothi, Dhirdham Temple, Ava Art&nbsp; Gallery,&nbsp; Natural History Museum (Sunday&nbsp; Closed)&nbsp;&nbsp;- back&nbsp;to hotel - evening free to visit around Mall or the Local market&nbsp; area -&nbsp; overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer - Gangtok - Gangtok Local Sightseeing - Gangtok stay\",\"date\":\"23-04-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning breakfast \\u2013 Transfer to&nbsp;Gangtok&nbsp;\\u2013 Nearly 135 Kilometers 3 \\u2013 3 \\u00bd hours drive -&nbsp; The capital land of the 22<sup>nd<\\/sup>&nbsp;State of India, Sikkim is one of the most beautiful hill station with varied options for tourist \\u2013 it is known for the Monastery, Orchids, High altitude Lake and Butterflies - hotel check in - sightseeing to&nbsp;Directorate of Handicrafts &amp; Handloom, Research Institute of Tibetology, Do Drul Chorten (Stupa),&nbsp;Enchey Monastery,&nbsp;White&nbsp;Hall, Flower Show, Rumtek Monastery,&nbsp;one of the finest monastery where His holy Dalai Lama stayed for some time, Various View Point, Botanical Garden, etc - back to hotel - evening free - over night stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir (Full Day) - Gangtok Stay\",\"date\":\"24-04-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning breakfast at hotel -&nbsp; excursion to&nbsp;Tsomgo Lake &amp; Baba Mandir&nbsp;nearly 40 kilometers ( 2 hours drive)&nbsp;along the&nbsp;Kyongnosla Alpine Sanctuary, the home to the red Panda and the Blood Pheasant with Rhododendron and other alpine trees&nbsp;- Situated at an elevation of 3753 meters \\/ 12310 feet - The Lake is oval shaped lake&nbsp; nearly 50 feet deep - generally covered in snow for most of the year&nbsp; \\u2013 This lake is home to the Brahmini Ducks &amp; many migratory Birds \\u2013 nearby is the sacred&nbsp;Baba Mandir&nbsp;known to be a very holy site for all -&nbsp;&nbsp;Nathu - La Pass&nbsp;to Republic of China is nearly 20 kilometers and is optional tour -back to Gangtok -evening free to roam around M G Road (Mall) or local Shopping center - overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"25-04-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast - transfer to Pakyong&nbsp;Airport (PYG) - for onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"NEW JALPAIGURI (NJP)\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Apr 2022\",\"arv_time\":\"12:50 PM\",\"fno\":\"15661\",\"name\":\"RNC KYQ EXP\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Pakyong (PYG)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"3758\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"fare\":26400},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"fare\":7082}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/04\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Mayfair Hill Resort\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/04\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Mayfair Spa Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Train/Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on twin/double sharing basis.</li>\n	<li>All the room are base category</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan <strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></li>\n	<li>Exclusive Non a/c vehicle for transfers &amp; sightseeing. It will be available to guest as per itinerary only (point to point basis).</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for&nbsp;INDIAN NATIONALS&nbsp;only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":33482,\"land_cost\":\"98000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":131482,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19722.3\",\"selling_price\":151204.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0259/032022', 151000, 75500, 0, '2022-03-07 19:12:44', '2022-03-07 19:12:44', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>Supplement cost :<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Nathula pass (Monday&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Tuesday&nbsp;closed): Rs.5500.00 per car It can be done on the same day with Tsomgo Lake \\u2013 Baba Mandir.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Toy Train&nbsp; Joy Ride (Darjeeling) : Rs.1800\\/- (Ticket Price + Service charge + GST) Per Person on the day of&nbsp; Darjeeling local sightseeing + Rs.1500\\/- per vehicle car halting charges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Vehicle:<\\/strong>&nbsp;01 Xylo \\/Innova \\/Scorpio \\/ Similar as per itinerary on point to point basis only (Ac will not run in Hill area).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Accommodation:<\\/strong>&nbsp;01 Double Bed Room<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp; Any cost arising due to natural calamities like, landslides, road blockage, political disturbances, etc.&nbsp; (To be borne by the client, this is directly payable on the spot).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Before entering in Sikkim Travel Card need to issue which is mandatory due to Covid.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Baba Mandir is new baba mandir.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;Permit require for Tsomgo Lake\\/ New Baba Mandir. It is mandatory that guest should carry 02 copies of passport size photograph, original photo ID proof with photo copy (identity card \\u2013 Voter ID card \\/ Pass-port \\/ Driving License) for processing the permit.&nbsp;Aadhar Card \\/&nbsp;PAN Card - not acceptable for issuance of the Permit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00d8&nbsp;&nbsp;As Innova is low chassis car and not ideal to travel Tsomgo Lake \\u2013 Baba Mandir \\/ Lachen &amp; Lachung . Alternative in Luxury vehicle like Scorpio \\/ Xylo will be provided.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(264, 'MR ANIMESH NIKHIL', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '9431101780', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SRILANKA', '2022-04-20', 5, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"597\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"fare\":8748},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"SriLankan\",\"fno\":\"122\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:25 AM\",\"fare\":30640},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"SriLankan\",\"fno\":\"121\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"07:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:50 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"253\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":7984}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"CHENNAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Le Royal Meridien\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room with Bathtub\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/04\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"4500\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"21\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mahaweli Reach\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/04\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"BENTOTA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Palms\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"check_out\":\"26\\/04\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Movenpick\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>DAY WISE ITINERARY:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Day 01 – Airport to&nbsp;Kandy – Arrive in Sri Lanka | You will be met by representatives of Red Apple Travel | Proceed to&nbsp;Kandy via Pinnawala – Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage – Over Night Stay in Kandy</li>\n	<li>Day 02 – Temple of Tooth, Peradeniya Garden and Gem Gallery – Over Night Stay in Kandy</li>\n	<li>Day 03 –&nbsp;Kandy to Bentota – Leisure at Hotel – Over Night Stay in Bentota</li>\n	<l