ice, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3},{\"age\":10},{\"age\":12},{\"age\":10},{\"age\":10},{\"age\":10},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":271422,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":274000,\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":545422,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 70904.86\",\"selling_price\":616326.859999999986030161380767822265625}', 'MZQ/0268/042022', 616900, 39500, 31700, '2022-04-08 19:50:53', '2022-05-27 14:08:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(273, 'MR SANDEEP', 'BNI SANCHIT', '9431354643', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LEH', '2022-06-24', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"24-06-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum, and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet an MT representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh - Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"25-06-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with the Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by Indian Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 Kms from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev Ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from Zanskar Valley (right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"26-06-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a Bactrian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes beside the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarters town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"27-06-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards the Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic! &nbsp;Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through a few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running on the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and the environment and the scenery is unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"28-06-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs enroute visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh &nbsp;&amp;3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check-in at our hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"29-06-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour concludes. MULTI ZONE TRAVELS thank you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight to your onward Destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2797\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Jun 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Jun 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"fare\":22976},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"206\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Jun 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Jun 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 AM\",\"fare\":43128},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"237\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Jun 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Jun 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"12:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/06\\/2022\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Northern Sinnge \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/06\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"26\\/06\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Camp Silver Sand \\/ Similar\",\"city\":\"NUBRA\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/06\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/06\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PANGONG\",\"hotel_name\":\"High Lake Camp \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/06\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"28\\/06\\/2022\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Spic N Span \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/06\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":66104,\"land_cost\":\"78147\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":144251,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21637.65\",\"selling_price\":165888.64999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0269/042022', 166000, 41500, 0, '2022-04-12 15:41:15', '2022-04-12 15:41:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(274, 'DR R K MAROO', 'BNI CHITLANGIA', '9234640525', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR + LEH', '2022-05-24', 10, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar\",\"date\":\"24-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at Srinagar, you will be met by our representative at the airport and later transferred to your hotel. The afternoon will be free for personal exploration. Overnight at Srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"25-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed towards Gulmarg. Enroute you will get to see the beautiful Tangmarg town and drive ahead on a scenic drive of 14 kilometers to Gulmarg. Arrive Gulmarg early afternoon and check in at your hotel. Later begin a short tour boarding the Gondola cable car system (the 08 minutes ropeway, at your own cost). Descend back to Gulmarg after an hour and later one can indulge in some horse-riding at own cost. Dinner and overnight stay in Gulmarg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"26-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to Pahalgam via Pampore, Avantipura and the village of Bijbehara which remains famous as the bread basket of Kashmir. We switch from the national highway 1A at Khanabal and drive through the second largest city of Anantnag. From here the road turns scenic as we drive parallel to the Lidder river flowing from the opposite direction. In Pahalgam, check in at the hotel. Later visit Aru, Betab Valley,and Chandanvari on your own cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar Houseboat stay\",\"date\":\"27-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>The morning after breakfast checkout From the hotel and Drive to&nbsp;Srinagar, Check-in Houseboat &amp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Afternoon Leave for local sightseeing of Srinagar City. Visit: - Shankrayacharya Mandir, Mughal Gardens, Chesmashahi (Mughal Spring), Nishat Bagh(The Garden Of Bliss), Shalimar Bagh(The Abode Of Love) &amp; Tulip Garden during the season (i.e.till April ).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar to Kargil (Via Sonmarg) \\u2013 204 Kms \\/ 6 To 7 Hour One Way\",\"date\":\"28-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>The morning after breakfast Checkout from the houseboat and Drive Kargil via Sonmarg also known as Meadow of Gold, In smart one can take a pony ride (at additional cost) to Thajiwas Glacier where snow remains round the year. Further, we drive towards&nbsp;Kargil&nbsp;Enroute crossing Drass Village (2nd Coldest inhabitants in the world) and have a magnificent view of&nbsp;Kargil&nbsp;War\'s famous Peaks (Tiger &amp; Tololing), and pay tribute to Vijay Smarak (The War Memorial) located right on Highway at the base of tooling. After reaching&nbsp;Kargil&nbsp;we checked in at our hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kargil to Leh (Via Lamayuru)\",\"date\":\"29-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<div>Post breakfast we drive to Sham Valley enroute visiting 11th Century Lamayuru Monastery enroute visiting the mesmerizing Moon Landscapes (you will believe why the name of this area is Moonland. Exactly the same formations of Land are visible as on the moon), Lamayuru is spectacularly located along the valley plain and surrounded by mountains on all sides. Later we proceed further to&nbsp;Leh&nbsp;en-route stopping to sight the Confluence of The Indus And Zanskar River just after 4 from Nimmu and further to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. It has been noticed that when a vehicle is parked on neutral gear on this metallic road the vehicle slides up and Gurudwara Pathar Sahib Nestled deep in the Himalayas, which was built by the Lamas of&nbsp;Leh&nbsp;in 1517 to commemorate the visit of Guru Nanak Dev. Upon arrival in&nbsp;Leh, you will meet our representative and check-in at our hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\",\"date\":\"30-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with&nbsp;<b>Hall Of Fame<\\/b>&nbsp;(Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to&nbsp;<b>Gurudwara Patthar Sahib<\\/b>&nbsp;at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 Kms from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to&nbsp;<b>Magnetic Hill<\\/b>&nbsp;which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous&nbsp;<b>Confluence Of Two Rivers<\\/b>&nbsp;Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to&nbsp;<b>Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market<\\/b>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"31-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a Bactrian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes beside the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarters town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 9\",\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"01-06-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through a few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running on the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and the environment and the scenery are unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 10\",\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"02-06-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs enroute visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp; 3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check-in at our hotel for an Overnight Stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh\",\"date\":\"03-06-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour concludes. Multi Zone Travels thank you for your patronage and ensure a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight to your onward Destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"745\",\"dep_date\":\"24 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"24 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"31584\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"741\",\"dep_date\":\"24 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"24 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"602\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jun 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"09:20 Am\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jun 2022\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 Am\",\"fare\":\"32000\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jun 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jun 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"16942\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/05\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Batra (Pure Veg)\",\"room_type\":\"Double\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine Spring\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"27\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"hotel_name\":\"Houseboat Mughal Palace\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"28\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"city\":\"KARGIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Barula\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"29\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Sipa Ladakh\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"30\\/05\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Charu Palace\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2022\"},{\"id\":7,\"check_in\":\"31\\/05\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Camp Silver Sand\",\"city\":\"NUBRA VALLEY\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/06\\/2022\"},{\"id\":8,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PANGONG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wanderland Camp\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/06\\/2022\"},{\"id\":9,\"check_in\":\"02\\/06\\/2022\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Shangrila\",\"room_type\":\"Double\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>10 Nights</strong> Accommodation on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan - <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner.</strong></li>\n	<li>Day trip to <strong>Sonmarg.</strong></li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple.</li>\n	<li><strong>Shikara Ride </strong>in Dal lake.</li>\n	<li>Sightseeing of <strong>Badamwari Garden</strong> in Srinagar.</li>\n	<li>Pickup Srinagar &amp; Drop Leh.</li>\n	<li>All Transfer &amp; sightseeing by <strong>Toyota&nbsp;Innova</strong> as per Itinerary (Ac Vehicle in Kashmir &amp; Non AC Vehicle in Leh)</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included.</li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered</li>\n	<li>Anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.</li>\n	<li>The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure&nbsp;days&nbsp;&amp; after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>Guide fee, Camera fee &amp; any monument &nbsp;Entrances</li>\n	<li>Medical &amp; Travel insurance</li>\n	<li>Any changes you may choose to make during your tour</li>\n	<li>Additional costs due to flight cancellation, roadblocks, etc.</li>\n	<li>Gondola Ticket, Pony/Sledge riding at Gulmarg / Pahalgam / SonmargEntrance fee, Local Guide, Shikara Ride</li>\n	<li>Trip to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero point in Sonamarg,</li>\n	<li>Trip to Chandanwari, Aru, Betaab valley, etc.</li>\n	<li>Any Loss/expenses incurred by unforeseen circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown strikes, etc</li>\n	<li>Chained Vehicles From tangmarg to Gulmarg &amp; Gulmarg to Tangmarg in case of Snow</li>\n	<li>Chained vehicles in Sonmarg in case of Snow.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>Date of booking to 31 days before travel the cancellation charges will be 25% of the tour cost</li>\n	<li>30 to 16 days before travel - cancellation charges will be 50% of the tour cost</li>\n	<li>15 to 8 days before travel - cancellation charges will be 75% of the tour cost</li>\n	<li>0 to 7 days before travel - cancellation charges will be 100% of the tour cost. No refund shall be given</li>\n	<li>Please Note:&nbsp;Cancellation policy is subject to change. It depends on the hotel policy.</li>\n	<li>In peak season (example: long weekends, festival season, summer vacation, etc.) most of the hotels charge 100% cancellation.</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":80526,\"land_cost\":\"199820\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":280346,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39248.44\",\"selling_price\":319594.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0270/042022', 319600, 79900, 0, '2022-04-15 15:53:41', '2022-06-06 13:05:40', 1, 1, '\"<p><em><strong>SUPPLEMENTS FOR OTHER OPTIONS:-<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Professional Tourist Guide: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 2500 Per Day<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7River Rafting on Indus | Zanskar:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 2000 Per Person approx<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Transport Till Rafting Point from Sangam&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rs. 1,000.00 (One Way)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Motorbike hire for full day:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs.1,800.00 Per Bike + Fuel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Pedal down the highest motorable road on a cycle:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rs.1,500 per Pax including transport (min 4 pax)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Camel Ride in Nubra Valley&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 500 Per Person (approximately)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7ATV Ride in Nubra Valley&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 1200 Per Person (approximately)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Hall of Fame sound &amp; Light show (Vehicle Cost)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Rs. 1500.00 (Return)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Cultural Dance Program:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 12,000 Per Program<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7Oxygen Cylinder Charges: &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Rs. 800 Per Day (approximately)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2>SPECIAL NOTE: COVID19<\\/h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>NOTE:&nbsp;Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report 96 hours prior to arrival date.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>Travelers who have had both vaccination and 15 days have passed since the last dose are not required to furnish a negative report. They can come with a hard copy of the vaccination certificate.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior to coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Once you land in Leh Kindly wear a jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transport: As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding the commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last-minute confusion.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hotels: We have been using hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS are attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Traveller: Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travelers as well and kindly share the same with the traveler as well.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Itinerary:&nbsp; Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strict as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteries and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non-operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 1, 0),
(275, 'MR CHETAN AGARWAL', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '7978465033', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LADAKH', '2022-04-29', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"29-04-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/>Arrival at Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum, and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by MT representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Overnight at Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh - Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"30-04-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with the Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by Indian Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 km from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev Ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"01-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a bacterium camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes beside the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarters town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"02-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards the Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through a few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running on the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and the environment and the scenery are unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"03-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs enroute visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp;3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check in at our hotel for an Overnight<b> <\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"04-05-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Tour concludes. Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"238\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"6800\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2024\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"12850\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8126\",\"dep_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"10500\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"8136\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Jharsuguda (JRG)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8362\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"11908\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2024\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"12850\"},{\"id\":7,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"206\",\"dep_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"10000\"},{\"id\":8,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Jharsuguda (JRG)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8361\",\"dep_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"04 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"8889\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Northern Singe\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"01\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/05\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Nubra Valley\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Verda White Sands Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"02\\/05\\/2022\",\"city\":\"Pangong Lake\",\"hotel_name\":\"World Attic Camp\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Tent\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"03\\/05\\/2022\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Presidency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/05\\/2022\",\"meal\":\"map\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi/Raipur.</strong></li>\n	<li>Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</li>\n	<li>Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</li>\n	<li>03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan MAP (<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</li>\n	<li>Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac <strong>Innova/Similar.</strong></li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"30\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":81933,\"land_cost\":\"103000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":184933,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 55479.9\",\"selling_price\":240412.89999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0271/042022', 240000, 60000, 0, '2022-04-18 13:20:16', '2022-05-02 16:15:41', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(276, 'Mr Rishi Ajatshatru', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '9431707142', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2022-04-25', 6, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"752\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"20905\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"706\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"707\",\"dep_date\":\"01 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"01 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"21898\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"01 May 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"01 May 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wildflower Hall, An Oberoi Resort\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Garden View Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"60000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Span Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Premiere Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/04\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"51000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/04\\/2022\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"check_out\":\"01\\/05\\/2022\",\"nights\":1,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Taj\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"9650\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<