ft:15px\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"tahoma, sans-serif\\\">Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari,betaab valley in Pahalgam&nbsp; Private Cab@2500\\/- for 06 Persons.&nbsp;and 100 Rs per person for entrance.<\\/font><\\/font><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"margin-left:15px\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\"><font face=\\\"tahoma, sans-serif\\\">Entry fees for any Garden 50- 100 Per Person (approx)<\\/font><\\/font><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:justify\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0);
