Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival.</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in Leh on double sharing Basis as per the Itinerary.</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in Nubra Valley on Double sharing Basis as per the Itinerary.</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in Pangong Lake on double&nbsp; sharing Basis as per the Itinerary.</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Meal Plan - MAPAI <strong>(Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by&nbsp;<strong>Non-Ac Innova&nbsp;</strong>as per the Itinerary</p>\n\n<p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":139322,\"land_cost\":\"198005\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":337327,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 47225.78\",\"selling_price\":384552.78000000002793967723846435546875}', 'MZQ/0282/052022', 385200, 64200, 0, '2022-05-24 13:03:07', '2022-05-24 13:03:07', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
