(307, 'MR NITESH KEJRIWAL', 'BNI CELEBRITIES', '9431108596', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2022-10-06', 6, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"06-10-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"07-10-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"08-10-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"09-10-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your full day in Pahalgam,&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"10-10-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"11-10-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in HouseBoat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onward destination\",\"date\":\"12-10-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Ends!!!!!!!!!!!<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"745\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":77856},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"741\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2146\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":55632},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6198\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/10\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Petal Or Similar\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/10\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/10\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sparrow Or Similar\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/10\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/10\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park Or Similar\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/10\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/10\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Super Deluxe HouseBoat\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/10\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Dbl Room + 02 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner&nbsp;</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Arrival&nbsp; &amp; Departure Srinagar Airport / Railway Station.</li>\n	<li>01 Private <strong>Tempo Traveller 12 Seater</strong>&nbsp;for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Day trip to Sonmarg</li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure .</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":133488,\"land_cost\":\"180000\",\"transport_cost\":\"14000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":327488,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39298.56\",\"selling_price\":366786.5599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0302/082022', 366400, 45800, 0, '2022-08-30 14:31:23', '2022-08-30 14:31:23', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(308, 'MR RISHAB', 'shreyas goyal', '8269891412', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KERALA', '2022-09-15', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Cochin Airport - Munnar\",\"date\":\"15-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>On reaching Kochi airport, you will be greeted and escorted by an agent\\u2019s representative to the hill town \\u2013 Munnar. As you move to this beautiful town, delight in the sight of Valara and Cheeyappara waterfalls, and lush green expanses. Once you reach Munnar, check-in to the hotel and wash away the journey fatigue. Remaining day is free for you to enjoy the way you want or simply relax at the hotel. Later, sleep restfully at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Distance from Kochi to Munnar<\\/strong>: 130 km (approx.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Travel Time<\\/strong>: 4 hours (approx.)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"16-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Savor a delectable breakfast and set off for a sightseeing spree according to this&nbsp;<strong>Kerala tour package for 5 days<\\/strong>. Attractions such as Eravikulam National Park, Tea Museum by Tata Tea, Rose Garden, Photo Point, Mattupetty Dam, Elephant Arrival Point, Echo Point, and Indo Swiss Project (entrance is subject to prior permission) will keep you intrigued throughout the day. after a happening day, come back to the hotel and slip into your bed for a good night sleep.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar - Thekkady\",\"date\":\"17-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;a nutritious breakfast, checkout from the hotel. Now, you will be moving to the rousing expanses of Thekkady. On arrival, check-in to the hotel and relax. The day now treats you to a jeep safari in Periyar National Park. After the enthralling safari, you can enjoy boating in Periyar Lake. After an amazing day, return to the hotel and sleep peacefully.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Optional<\\/strong>: Enjoy bamboo rafting in Thekkady (charges extra)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Distance from Munnar to Thekkady<\\/strong>: 94 km (approx.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Travel time<\\/strong>: 3 hours (approx.)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thekkady - Allepey\",\"date\":\"18-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arise to a healthy morning meal and checkout from the hotel &amp; proceed to Allepey. On reaching, you will check-in to the houseboat. Satiate your hunger pangs with a lovable lunch before setting off for a lovely cruise along the backwaters. After a pleasurable day, enjoy a refreshing tea with snacks. Later, savor delicious dinner onboard and tuck yourself in your beds for the night at houseboat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Distance from Thekkady to Alleppey<\\/strong>: 140 km (approx.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Travel time<\\/strong>: Approx. 4 hours (approx.)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey - Cochin\",\"date\":\"19-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Relish a sumptuous breakfast onboard and checkout from the houseboat. Now, you will be transferred to Cochin Airport to catch your return flight. Back home with fond memories.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Distance from Alleppey to Cochin<\\/strong>: 53 km (approx.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Travel time<\\/strong>: 1.5 hours (approx.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Adieu Kerala!<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Pune (PNQ)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"553\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Sep 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Sep 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:50 AM\",\"fare\":9828},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"955\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Sep 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Sep 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6676\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Sep 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Sep 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:00 PM\",\"fare\":7124},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Pune (PNQ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"232\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Sep 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Sep 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:25 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/09\\/2022\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Elephant Passage\",\"room_type\":\"Cottage Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/09\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"16902\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/09\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Mountain Courtyard\",\"city\":\"THEKKADY\",\"room_type\":\"Forest Flame Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/09\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"6444\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/09\\/2022\",\"city\":\"ALLEPEY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Luxury Premium cruise\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/09\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"7829\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return&nbsp;Flight Ticket <strong>Ex- Pune.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at <strong>Munnar </strong>with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation at <strong>Thekkady </strong>with Breakfast.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in <b>Luxury Houseboat</b>&nbsp;at Alleppey with&nbsp;All Meals.</li>\n	<li>All transfers and sightseeing by&nbsp;<strong>AC Sedan Car.</strong></li>\n	<li>All toll taxes, parking charges, driver allowances.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":16952,\"hotel_cost\":31175,\"transport_cost\":\"20000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":68127,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10219.05\",\"selling_price\":78346.050000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0303/082022', 78400, 39200, 0, '2022-08-30 19:28:18', '2022-08-30 19:28:18', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
