ercent\":\"Rs 32258.85\",\"selling_price\":247317.85000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0304/092022', 247200, 61800, 0, '2022-09-06 17:57:48', '2022-09-06 17:57:48', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(310, 'MR MAYANK', 'HOPPIPOLA', '9065845040', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2022-11-13', 5, 0, 6, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"517\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"fare\":187506},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"512\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hyatt Regency Dubai Creek Height\",\"room_type\":\"Regency Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"18\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"174800\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Nights</strong> accommodation at\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Hyatt Regency Dubai Creek Height&nbsp;</strong>with<b> <em>Breakfast.</em></b></li>\n	<li><strong>Arrival </strong>Airport Transfer.</li>\n	<li><strong>Departure</strong> Airport Transfer.</li>\n	<li>Half Day <strong>Dubai City Tour</strong> with <strong>Monorail</strong> (One Way)</li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124th Floor&nbsp;</strong>- At The Top + <strong>Dubai Mall Tour</strong> with <strong>Fountain Show</strong>.</li>\n	<li>\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Dubai Desert Safari&nbsp;(<em>Deluxe</em>)&nbsp;</strong>with BBQ Dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Dhow Cruise (<em>Deluxe</em>)&nbsp;</strong>With Dinner.</li>\n	<li>\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Bollywood Park</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Museum of Future.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Limo Ride</strong> (<em><strong>01 Hour</strong></em>).</li>\n	<li>\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Abu Dhabi </strong>with <strong>Ferrari World Theme Park</strong>&nbsp;<em>(<strong>Express Ticket</strong>)</em> &amp;&nbsp;a visit to<strong> Abu Dhabi</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Grand Mosque.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Dubai Visa.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong><em>All Tours &amp; Transfers on&nbsp;Private basis.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong><em>VAT </em>Included<em>.</em></strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><em><strong>Extra 5% TCS</strong> </em>will be applicable on land Part.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":187506,\"land_cost\":\"220644\",\"hotel_cost\":174800},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":582950,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46636\",\"selling_price\":629586}', 'MZQ/0305/092022', 632400, 105400, 0, '2022-09-09 18:52:22', '2022-09-10 18:50:59', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(311, 'MR AKSHAT', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '8235283815', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2022-10-08', 5, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5043\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"fare\":\"56109\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"21\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"24\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:50 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5037\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"05:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Omega, Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"13\\/10\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"31912\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return <strong>Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights</strong> Accomodation in<strong> Hotel&nbsp;Grand Excelsior with Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Airport transfers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half Day Dubai City Tour</strong> with drop to <strong>Dubai Mall</strong> with <strong>Burj Khalifa 124<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Desert Safari Tour with BBQ Dinner</strong>, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show and other camp activities.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Dhow Cruise</strong> with Buffet Dinner.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Abu Dhabi with Ferrari World Theme Park </strong>with visit to Grand Mosque.</li>\n	<li><strong>Museum of Future.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa</strong> + <strong>Basic Insurance</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing / Tours and Transfers on&nbsp;<u>PVT</u>&nbsp;basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>5% VAT </strong>Inclusive in the above cost.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>5% TCS will be applicable.</li>\n	<li>All Applicable Taxes except Tourism Dirham Fee</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"19\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":56109,\"land_cost\":\"86832\",\"hotel_cost\":31912},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":174853,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 33222.07\",\"selling_price\":208075.0700000000069849193096160888671875}', 'MZQ/0306/092022', 207332, 103666, 0, '2022-09-10 11:31:44', '2022-09-27 12:22:04', 0, 1, '\"<p><b><u>Imp Note for Abu Dhabi:<\\/u><\\/b><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Guest visiting to Abu Dhabi for Tours (Grand Mosque) and Theme Parks, it is advisable to have 02 doses of WHO approved Vaccine and Negative PCR report (we advise and recommend guest to have a PCR test done in UAE approved lab, in order to avoid last minute changes)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(312, 'MR DEEPAK AGARWAL', 'BUILDER', '8298000044', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2022-11-02', 5, 0, 10, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive in Srinagar\",\"date\":\"02-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in HouseBoat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"03-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"04-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"05-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"06-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onward destination.\",\"date\":\"07-11-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the Srinagar airport to board your scheduled flight for your onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour ends...<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deluxe HouseBoat\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE + TRIPLE\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/11\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sparrow\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + TRIPLE\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/11\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"04\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Gulmarg House\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + TRIPLE\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/11\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"05\\/11\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Batoo\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + TRIPLE\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/11\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;DOUBLE + 02 TRIPLE Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner&nbsp;</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Arrival&nbsp; &amp; Departure Srinagar Airport / Railway Station.</li>\n	<li>01 Private <b>Tempo Traveller&nbsp;</b>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing <strong>(<em>Day 02 - Day 06</em>)</strong> as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Day trip to Sonmarg</li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure .</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered</li>\n	<li>Anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.</li>\n	<li>The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure&nbsp;days&nbsp;&amp; after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>Guide fee, Camera fee &amp; any monument &nbsp;Entrances</li>\n	<li>Medical &amp; Travel insurance</li>\n	<li>Any changes you may choose to make during your tour</li>\n	<li>Additional costs due to flight cancellation, roadblocks, etc.</li>\n	<li>Gondola Ticket, Pony/Sledge riding at Gulmarg / Pahalgam / SonmargEntrance fee, Local Guide, Shikara Ride</li>\n	<li>Trip to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero point in Sonamarg,</li>\n	<li>Trip to Chandanwari, Aru, Betaab valley, etc.</li>\n	<li>Any Loss/expenses incurred by unforeseen circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown strikes, etc</li>\n	<li>Chained Vehicles From tangmarg to Gulmarg &amp; Gulmarg to Tangmarg in case of Snow</li>\n	<li>Chained vehicles in Sonmarg in case of Snow</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"24\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"127500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":127500,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 30600\",\"selling_price\":158100}', 'MZQ/0307/092022', 157500, 15750, 27800, '2022-09-13 16:08:18', '2022-09-16 12:02:04', 0, 1, '\"<p><em><strong>SUPPLEMENT COST:-<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Cable&nbsp;Car(Gondola ride)&nbsp;<\\/strong>in Gulmarg Ist Phase :Rs 850\\/-Per Person &amp; 2nd&nbsp;Phase 950\\/-Per Person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari,betaab valley in Pahalgam&nbsp; <\\/strong>Private Cab@2500\\/- for 06 Persons.&nbsp;and 100 Rs per person for entrance.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Entry fees for any Garden<\\/strong>&nbsp;: Rs 50- 100 Per Person (approx)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2 style=\\\"font-style:italic;\\\">SPECIAL NOTE: COVID19<\\/h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>NOTE:&nbsp;Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report 96 hours prior to arrival date.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>Travelers who have had both vaccination and 15 days have passed since the last dose are not required to furnish a negative report. They can come with a hard copy of the vaccination certificate.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior to coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Once you land in Leh Kindly wear a jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transport: As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding the commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last-minute confusion.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hotels: We have been using hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS are attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Traveller: Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travelers as well and kindly share the same with the traveler as well.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Itinerary:&nbsp; Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strict as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteries and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non-operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(313, 'Ms Vasu', 'SONI GAYA', '9304628847', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2022-12-12', 6, NULL, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"12-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\'s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"13-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"14-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel. Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure. Kept free to enjoy the beach side property and Water activities\",\"date\":\"15-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>How, about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving, Kayaking, Glass bottom boat ride and Sea Walk can be done at an additional cost on this day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Our team at Havelock Or Neil Island will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"16-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset. Note: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop + Shopping trip\",\"date\":\"17-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR || DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"18-12-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8263\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Dec 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Dec 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"fare\":26452},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Dec 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Dec 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":23506}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/12\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/12\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/12\\/2022\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sandy Waves Beach Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"16\\/12\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"16\\/12\\/2022\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Cottage\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/12\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"17\\/12\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/12\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Kolkata</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation </strong>in rooms as given at hotels in <strong>Port Blair, Havelock and Neil</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet service</strong> at airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>Private AC Vehicle </strong>at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side <strong>Ferry Tickets</strong> Included <strong>03 Side Cruise </strong>to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>Airport pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>entry tickets, ferry tickets and permit charges</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast</strong>&nbsp;at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>One session for snorkeling is complimentary.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance </strong>by Multi Zone Travel Experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Vehicle not at disposal at any of the islands.</li>\n	<li>Any extra excursion or sightseeing apart from suggested tour itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Lunch not included.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li><strong>5% GST.</strong></li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":49958,\"land_cost\":\"66192\"},\"cost_price\":116150,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16261\",\"selling_price\":132411,\"profit_figure\":\"127623\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"109.00%\",\"extra\":[]}', 'MZQ/0308/092022', 132400, 66200, NULL, '2022-09-13 16:57:06', '2022-09-13 16:57:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(314, 'MR RUPESH MISHRA', 'BUILDER', '9835894355', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2022-10-08', 7, 0, 5, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai Smile\",\"fno\":\"314\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 AM\",\"fare\":123900},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai Smile\",\"fno\":\"313\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Oct 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Oct 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grande Classic\",\"room_type\":\"Classic Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"13\\/10\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Le Fenix\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"15\\/10\\/2022\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of