Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":123900,\"land_cost\":\"103740\",\"visa_cost\":\"25000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":252640,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25264\",\"selling_price\":277904}', 'MZQ/0309/092022', 278000, 55600, 0, '2022-09-15 14:03:58', '2022-09-15 14:03:58', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(315, 'MR BABLU SAHU', 'ARGORA', '9031267643', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2022-09-21', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive in Srinagar\",\"date\":\"21-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in HouseBoat.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"22-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"23-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"24-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"25-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onward destination.\",\"date\":\"26-09-2022\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the Srinagar airport to board your scheduled flight for your onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour ends...<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/09\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Super Deluxe HouseBoats\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE + SINGLE\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/09\\/2022\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"22\\/09\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sparrow\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + SINGLE\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/09\\/2022\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/09\\/2022\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + SINGLE\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/09\\/2022\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"24\\/09\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Petal\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE  + SINGLE\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/09\\/2022\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;DOUBLE + 01 SINGLE&nbsp;Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner&nbsp;</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Arrival&nbsp; &amp; Departure Srinagar Airport / Railway Station.</li>\n	<li>01 Private <b>Innova&nbsp;</b>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Day trip to Sonmarg</li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure .</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any Kind of Personal Expenses or Optional Tours / Extra Meals Ordered</li>\n	<li>Anything not specifically mentioned under the head “Prices included”.</li>\n	<li>The Services of Vehicle is not included on leisure&nbsp;days&nbsp;&amp; after finishing the sightseeing tour as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>Guide fee, Camera fee &amp; any monument &nbsp;Entrances</li>\n	<li>Medical &amp; Travel insurance</li>\n	<li>Any changes you may choose to make during your tour</li>\n	<li>Additional costs due to flight cancellation, roadblocks, etc.</li>\n	<li>Gondola Ticket, Pony/Sledge riding at Gulmarg / Pahalgam / SonmargEntrance fee, Local Guide, Shikara Ride</li>\n	<li>Trip to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero point in Sonamarg,</li>\n	<li>Trip to Chandanwari, Aru, Betaab valley, etc.</li>\n	<li>Any Loss/expenses incurred by unforeseen circumstances e.g. flight delays/cancellations, road blockage, vehicle breakdown strikes, etc</li>\n	<li>Chained Vehicles From tangmarg to Gulmarg &amp; Gulmarg to Tangmarg in case of Snow</li>\n	<li>Chained vehicles in Sonmarg in case of Snow</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"35\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"78000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":78000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27300\",\"selling_price\":105300}', 'MZQ/0310/092022', 105000, 35000, 27800, '2022-09-16 15:17:57', '2022-09-16 16:03:31', 0, 1, '\"<p><em><strong>SUPPLEMENT COST:-<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Cable&nbsp;Car(Gondola ride)&nbsp;<\\/strong>in Gulmarg Ist Phase :Rs 850\\/-Per Person &amp; 2nd&nbsp;Phase 950\\/-Per Person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Trip to Aru &amp; Chandanwari,betaab valley in Pahalgam&nbsp; <\\/strong>Private Cab@2500\\/- for 06 Persons.&nbsp;and 100 Rs per person for entrance.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>.&nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>Entry fees for any Garden<\\/strong>&nbsp;: Rs 50- 100 Per Person (approx)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<table>\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<h2 style=\\\"font-style:italic;\\\">SPECIAL NOTE: COVID19<\\/h2>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>NOTE:&nbsp;Guest should carry COVID -19 negative test report 96 hours prior to arrival date.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>Travelers who have had both vaccination and 15 days have passed since the last dose are not required to furnish a negative report. They can come with a hard copy of the vaccination certificate.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;To avoid high altitude sickness Diamox tablet can be taken prior to coming to Leh but only after consulting with your doctor.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Once you land in Leh Kindly wear a jacket to avoid high altitude sickness.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Transport: As per the SOPs and guidelines regarding the commercial transport 5 people are permitted to travel in Innova, 8 people in Tempo Traveller. Please convey the same to the group as well to eliminate the last-minute confusion.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hotels: We have been using hotels that are strictly following the health and hygiene SOPS suggested by MHA and WHO. The SOPS are attached for your kind reference. Please go through the same.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Traveller: Post COVID-19 the entire globe has changed so has been the travel. We have tried to compile the SOPs for the travelers as well and kindly share the same with the traveler as well.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u2714&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Itinerary:&nbsp; Please note sightseeing and excursion will be strict as per the norm laid by the MHA and Monasteries and other attractions opening and entry is subject to the guidelines suggested by MHA and local administration. You may find few sightseeing points non-operational which have been mentioned in the itinerary kindly accept as it is on the given day.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\"', 0, 0),
(316, 'MR SARAWGI', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '7549100000', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2022-10-04', 7, 0, 4, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Park Regis Kris Kin\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Rooms\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":7,\"check_out\":\"11\\/10\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"129424\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>07&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in<strong> Hotel&nbsp;Park Regis Kris Kin </strong>with<strong> Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Airport transfers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half Day Dubai City Tour</strong> with <strong>Dubai Mall</strong> &amp; <strong>Burj Khalifa 148<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;Floor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Desert Safari Tour with BBQ Dinner</strong>, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show, and other camp activities.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Abu Dhabi with Ferrari World Theme Park </strong>with a visit to Grand Mosque.</li>\n	<li><strong>AquaVenture</strong> Water Park &amp; <strong>Lost Chambers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Museum of Illusions.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Bollywood Parks.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Motion Gate.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>IMG Worlds of Adventure.</strong></li>\n	<li><b>Dubai Frame.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>Ski Dubai(</strong><em>Snow Plus Pass</em><strong>).</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa</strong> + <strong>Basic Insurance</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing / Tours and Transfers on a Private&nbsp;basis.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>5% TCS will be applicable.</li>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"219784\",\"hotel_cost\":\"120800\",\"visa_cost\":\"25600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":366184,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":434280,\"profit_figure\":\"68096\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"18.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0311/092022', 434280, 108570, 0, '2022-09-23 16:20:32', '2022-09-28 11:31:07', 0, 1, '\"<p><b><u>Imp Note for Abu Dhabi:<\\/u><\\/b><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Guest visiting to Abu Dhabi for Tours (Grand Mosque) and Theme Parks, it is advisable to have 02 doses of WHO approved Vaccine and Negative PCR report (we advise and recommend guest to have a PCR test done in UAE approved lab, in order to avoid last minute changes)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(317, 'MR GOPESH GOENKA', 'BNI', '9709087799', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2022-10-01', 6, 4, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"01-10-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"02-10-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg  (56 Kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"03-10-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 56 Kms will be covered in about 2:00 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Pahalgam (140 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"04-10-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"05-10-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your full day in Pahalgam,&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"06-10-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in HouseBoat<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"07-10-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Tour Ends!!!!!!!!<\\/b><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snowland\",\"room_type\":\"Premuim Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"03\\/10\\/2022\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green Heights\",\"room_type\":\"Club Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"04\\/10\\/2022\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"04\\/10\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Silver Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/10\\/2022\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/10\\/2022\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Alexender Group of HouseBoats\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"07\\/10\\/2022\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7},{\"age\":6},{\"age\":3},{\"age\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;DOUBLE ROOMS + 02 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner&nbsp;</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Arrival&nbsp; &amp; Departure Srinagar Airport / Railway Station.</li>\n	<li>01 Private <b>Innova&nbsp;</b>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Day trip to Sonmarg</li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":0}', 'MZQ/0312/092022', 0, NULL, 0, '2022-09-23 17:20:54', '2022-09-23 17:42:47', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
