(321, 'MR BIKAS KUMAR', NULL, '9955208900', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2022-11-14', 7, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1914\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"27019\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"2284\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"10173\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"57\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"41273\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Amari Phuket\",\"room_type\":\"Double Deluxe Ocean View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"17\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"45812\",\"nights\":3},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Sea View\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hard Rock\",\"rate\":\"19847\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"19\\/11\\/2022\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/11\\/2022\",\"room_type\":\"Premier King\",\"city\":\"BANKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Amari Watergate\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"21\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"26159\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex- Mumbai.</li>\n	<li>03 Nts Accomodation at Phuket.</li>\n	<li>02&nbsp;Nts Accomodation at Pattaya.</li>\n	<li>02&nbsp;Nts Accomodation at Bankok.</li>\n	<li>All Breakfasts.</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Phuket&nbsp;Airport To Phuket Hotel -&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Phuket&nbsp;Hotel To Phuket Airport&nbsp;-&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Suvarnabhumi BKK Airport To Pattaya Hotel -&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>Transfer From Pattaya Hotel To Bangkok Hotel&nbsp;-&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Bangkok Hotel To Suvarnabhumi BKK Airport&nbsp;-&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>Chaophraya Princess Cruise Entry Ticket with Dinner&nbsp;-&nbsp;Private</li>\n	<li>FantaSea Show Entry Ticket (Open&nbsp;Tuesday&nbsp;-&nbsp;Friday&nbsp;-&nbsp;Sunday)&nbsp;-&nbsp;Private -&nbsp;<b>GOLD CLASS Seat</b></li>\n	<li>James Bond Fully Loaded Tour By Luxury Boat Passion Catamaran Including National Park Fee &amp; Shared Transfer On SIC Basis</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>5% TCS </strong>Applicable.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78465,\"hotel_cost\":91818,\"land_cost\":\"48000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":218283,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39290.94\",\"selling_price\":257573.9400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0316/0112022', 257200, 128600, 0, '2022-11-09 14:01:15', '2022-11-14 20:17:55', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(322, 'MR PRIYAL', NULL, '9631802809', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'RAJASTHAN', '2022-11-23', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Jaisalmer\",\"date\":\"23-11-2022 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive Jaisalmer and transfer to your hotel. Evening is free on your own, Overnight stay at Jaisalmer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;After that transfer to Jaisalmer. Enroute visit Jaisalmer War Museum - The Jaisalmer War Museum is located 10 km short of Jaisalmer on the Jaisalmer - Jodhpur Highway. The unique museum has been designed with the view of honouring the contributions and sacrifices of war heroes, and to highlight their bravery. It also traces the evolution of the Indian Army.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Jaisalmer.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaisalmer Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"24-11-2022 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After early breakfast visit the Jaisalmer Fort which is made by unique Golden Lime stone, that\\u2019s why its known as Golden Fort or Sonar Kella. After that visit Patwon-ki-haveli, Nathmal-ki-haveli. Salim singh-ki-Haveli. People still live in these ancient buildings dating from 12th to 15th century. Every house has exquisite carvings and filigreed work. After that also visit Gadishar Lake. In evening proceed for camel ride on Sam Sand Dunes &amp; you can experience the spectacular view of Sun set in Thar desert.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Jaisalmer Camp.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaisalmer \\u2013 Jodhpur (285 Km \\/ 6 hrs)\",\"date\":\"25-11-2022 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast transfer to Jodhpur. On arrival check-in to your hotel.&nbsp; Evening is free on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Jodhpur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jodhpur Half day Sightseeing \\u2013 Udaipur\",\"date\":\"26-11-2022 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for half-day sightseeing covering Umaid Bhawan Palace, Mehrangarh Fort, and Jaswant Thada. After that transferred to Udaipur. On arrival check-in into your hotel.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"27-11-2022 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for the Udaipur city tour. Visiting Fateh Sagar, Maharana Pratap Memorial, take a photo stop at Nehru Garden, Sehelion-KI-Bari - Queen\\u2019s resort for their friends, Sukhadia Circle (Drive Pass), Bhartiya Lok Kala Museum - a museum of folk and art, it displays a rich collection of folk dresses, ornaments, puppets, masks, dolls. After that visit City Palace \\u2013 The largest palace complex of Rajasthan, Jagdish Temple \\u2013 built by Maharana Jagat Singh and is dedicated to Lord Vishnu &amp; Gulab Bagh.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Local\",\"date\":\"28-11-2022 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.travelogyindia.com\\/rajasthan\\/chittorgarh\\/\\\">Chittorgarh<\\/a><\\/strong>&nbsp;which is popular for&nbsp;<strong>Chittorgarh Fort<\\/strong>. The fort covers an enormous area of 700 acres and denotes courage, pride, and romance among Rajasthani people.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Also visit Padmini Palace, Vijay Stambh, and Rana Kumbha\\u2019s palace<\\/strong>&nbsp;which signifies the sacrifice and valor of the heroic Rajaputans. Some other attractions inside the fort such as the&nbsp;<strong>Kirti Stambh and Kalika Mata Temple<\\/strong>, that you will visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After sightseeing, return to Udaipur.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Udaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Departure\",\"date\":\"29-11-2022 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After having breakfast in the hotel it\'s time to depart for Udaipur Airport for the next destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5043\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"7690\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Jaisalmer (JSA)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"3757\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"15195\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Udaipur (UDR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6344\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"15109\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7234\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Nov 2022\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Nov 2022\",\"dep_time\":\"04:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/11\\/2022\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Antra Inn\",\"city\":\"JAISALMER\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"2950\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"JAISALMER\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Tent Suite\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Kafila Desert Camp\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"9000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"JODHPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rajwara Palace\",\"room_type\":\"Cozy Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/11\\/2022\",\"rate\":\"3500\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"26\\/11\\/2022\",\"city\":\"UDAIPUR\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/11\\/2022\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel juSTa Rajputana\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rate\":\"21000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of c