(329, 'Mr Anup Agarwal', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9504919900', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2023-01-08', 6, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later visit Cellular Jail and Light and Sound Show\",\"date\":\"08-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you check in. Post lunch we proceed to one of the most visited attractions in the Andaman Islands, Cellular Jail. This jail before India\'s Independence hosted Indian freedom fighters as prisoners in the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Today, this jail stands as a national memorial. Visit this historic attraction and know about the rich history of the Andaman Islands. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"09-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"10-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel. Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure. Kept free to enjoy the beach side property and Water activities\",\"date\":\"11-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>How, about relaxing in the lap of nature. Today, you can relax and spend the day enjoying white sand beaches. Additional activities such as Scuba Diving, Kayaking, Glass bottom boat ride and Sea Walk can be done at an additional cost on this day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Our team at Havelock Or Neil Island will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"12-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching the island our representative will take you to respective resort. Rest and then proceed to Bharatpur Beach and Laxmanpur beach \\u2013 is a secluded beach, lies 2 km north of Neil jetty. View the natural coral bridge and stay to view the mesmerizing sunset. Note: Do note that you will have to check out the hotels before the trip begins. Your luggage will be kept in a kiosk safely. Our representative will get the luggage before you board the ferry back to the other island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop + Shopping trip\",\"date\":\"13-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR || DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"14-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8263\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Jan 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Jan 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":110848},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jan 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jan 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":146936}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/01\\/2023\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sinclairs Bay View\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/01\\/2023\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/01\\/2023\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Coral Reef Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Coral\\nTurquoise\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/01\\/2023\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/01\\/2023\",\"city\":\"NEIL ISLAND\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Panorama\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/01\\/2023\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"13\\/01\\/2023\",\"city\":\"PORT BLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sinclairs Bay View\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/01\\/2023\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https: