ong> PVT</strong> &amp; All Tours on <strong>SIC</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>CRUISE INCLUSIONS :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accomodation</li>\n	<li>Port Charges</li>\n	<li>04 Complimentary meals a day – at the following Restaurants<br />\n	Dream Dining Lower/ Deck 7 FWD ( International Cusine)<br />\n	Dream Dining Upper/ Deck 8 FWD ( Chinese Cusine)<br />\n	The Lido/ Deck 16 AFT -24 Hours Snacks (Finger Food) Counter<br />\n	( Indian Cusine, jain meals available )<br />\n	3 more venues (Blue Lagoon, Crystal Life Cuisine and Function 8) for inclusive meals services:<br />\n	Blue Lagoon inclusive meal set will be an extension from Dream Dinning Upper for lunch and dinner.<br />\n	Crystal Life Cuisine will serve breakfast, lunch and dinner with simple set menu.</li>\n	<li>Usage of specified cruise facilities (As per Daily Programme List)</li>\n	<li>Participation in our specified cruise activities (As per Daily Programme List)</li>\n	<li>Usage of Rope Course, Zip Lining, Rock Climbing, Swimming Pool, Jacuzzi, Gymnasium, Water Slides, Mini Golf, Basketball</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":77791,\"hotel_cost\":140228,\"land_cost\":\"60000\",\"visa_cost\":\"7000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":285019,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 37052.47\",\"selling_price\":322071.46999999997206032276153564453125}', 'MZQ/0325/0122022', 321800, 160900, 0, '2022-12-28 14:18:39', '2022-12-28 14:18:39', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(331, 'MR VIBHOR AGARWAL', 'BNI', '9234608415', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2023-01-13', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kolkata Arrival\",\"date\":\"13-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today depart for Kolkata &amp;&nbsp;stay Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later visit Cellular Jail and Light and Sound Show\",\"date\":\"14-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you check in. Post lunch we proceed to one of the most visited attractions in the Andaman Islands, Cellular Jail. This jail before India\'s Independence hosted Indian freedom fighters as prisoners in the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Today, this jail stands as a national memorial. Visit this historic attraction and know about the rich history of the Andaman Islands. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"15-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"16-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel. Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop + Shopping trip\",\"date\":\"17-01-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, after Breakfast Checkout from Hotel &amp; we drop you back to Havelock jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR || DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"18-01-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"Howrah (HWH)\",\"name\":\"Shatabdi Express\",\"fno\":\"12020\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Jan 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Jan 2023\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"3100\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"GO FIRST\",\"fno\":\"101\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jan 2023\",\"arv_date\