 service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59636,\"hotel_cost\":\"266294\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":325930,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":379600,\"profit_figure\":\"53670\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"16.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0343/032023', 379600, 189800, 0, '2023-03-01 18:36:04', '2023-03-23 14:15:04', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(349, 'MR NITESH AGARWAL', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9031090356', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ASSAM + MEGHALAYA', '2023-10-27', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Guwahati\",\"date\":\"27-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Guwahati. Meet and be assisted by our representative at the Airport.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Check-in to Hotel .&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati \\u2013 Shillong (100 KM | 3 HRS)\",\"date\":\"28-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast proceed to Shillong, also called \'Scotland of the East\\\". Reach the majestic Umiam Lake (Barapani). You may do the water sports here (Optional). On arrival at Shillong, check in at your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will be at Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong - Dawki - Mawlynnong Village - Shillong (90 KM | 2 Hrs Per Way)\",\"date\":\"29-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit Mawlynnong Village. This cute and colorful little village is known for its cleanliness.&nbsp; Besides the picturesque village, it offers many interesting sights such as the Living Root Bridge and another strange natural phenomenon of a boulder balancing on another rock. Visit Dawki, It is along the Indo-Bangladesh border. You can enjoy boating in the crystal clear waters of the Umngot River Evening return to Shillong.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will be in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong - Cherrapunji(65 KM | 1.5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"30-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Get up early today to enjoy the mesmerizing mornings of Shillong. After breakfast,&nbsp;drive to Cherrapunji. The sightseeing includes Eco Park, Dainthlen Falls, Nohkalikai Falls, Seven Sisters Fall), Mawsmai Cave and Thangkharang Park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will in Cherrapunji.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cherrapunji - Guwahati (165 KM | 5.0 HRS)\",\"date\":\"31-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel. Transfer to Guwahati. If time permits, you may visit the Kamakhya Temple (darshan takes minimum 02 hours) or an evening cruise on Brahmaputra River (on a direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will be at Guwahati.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati \\u2013 Airport Transfer\",\"date\":\"01-11-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Transfer to Guwahati&nbsp;Airport for your onward journey.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7116\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":13814},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Guwahati(gauhati) (GAU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6294\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Guwahati(gauhati) (GAU)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"213\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Nov 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Nov 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"fare\":13512},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7234\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Nov 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Nov 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/10\\/2023\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room\",\"city\":\"GUWAHATI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Ornate\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/10\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"4609\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/10\\/2023\",\"city\":\"SHILLONG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Centre Point\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room