(355, 'MR PRAVIN KUMAR', 'SONI GAYA', '7277033204', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ASSAM + MEGHALAYA', '2023-04-26', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Guwahati\",\"date\":\"26-04-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Guwahati. Meet and be assisted by our representative at the Airport.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Check-in to Hotel . Enjoy the beautiful City.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>There were main tourist places in, Assam here State Zoo, Srimanta Shankar dev Kalakshetra, and State Museum.&nbsp;If possible guests will visit a River cruise&nbsp; Alfresco Grand (Additional 1650\\/-)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;Guwahati.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati to Cherrapunji\",\"date\":\"27-04-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After early breakfast drive to Cherrapunjee (4,400 ft.), the wettest place in the world. You will see the beautiful waterfall known as Nohkalikai. You can also explore the caves known as Mawsmai.<br \\/>\\nCherrapunjee, also known as Sohra, is a high-altitude town in the northeast Indian state of Meghalaya.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cherrapunji is world \\u2013 renowned for being the wettest place on earth.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cherrapunjee\\u2019s star attractions are \\u2013 Nohsngithiang Falls, Thagkharang Park, Mawamai, double-decker bridge, Rainbow falls, Seven Sister Falls, etc.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;Cherrapunji.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cherrapunji to Shillong [ Shillong - Dawki - Mawlynnong Village - Shillong ]\",\"date\":\"28-04-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we&nbsp;will proceed to Shillong also called the second Scotland of East.<br \\/>\\nAfter breakfast, proceed to visit Mawlynnong Village. This cute and colorful little village is known for its cleanliness.&nbsp; Besides the picturesque village, it offers many interesting sights such as the Living Root Bridge and another strange natural phenomenon of a boulder balancing on another rock. Visit Dawki, It is along the Indo-Bangladesh border. You can enjoy boating in the crystal clear waters of the Umngot River Evening return to Shillong.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will be in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong - Laitlum Canyons -Krang Suri Falls - Shillong\",\"date\":\"29-04-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast we proceed to Laitlum Canyons for some breathtaking views. Visit Krang Suri Falls. It is one of the best waterfalls in Meghalaya. You can also swim in a naturally formed pool here. You can also go behind the waterfall and see the water falling in front of you.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay will be in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong Sightseeing \\u2013 Guwahati (100 kms \\/ 3 hrs.)\",\"date\":\"30-04-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast visit Don Bosco Museum &amp; Ward\\u2019s Lake. After that drive to Guwahati.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive and check in at hotel. In evening we suggest an optional tour of Golden sunset cruise on the Brahmaputra (Direct Payment by own). Overnight stay at Guwahati.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hotel \\u2013 Guwahati Airport \\/ Rly Station\",\"date\":\"01-05-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early Morning Transfer to Guwahati Airport \\/ Railway Station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note: Temple visit will depend on your departure time. It May be done on previous day.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/04\\/2023\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"GUWAHATI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vishwaratna\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"3976\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2023\",\"city\":\"CHERRAPUNJI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Abode Of Clouds Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/04\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"3875\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"28\\/04\\/2023\",\"city\":\"SHILLONG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Phoenix Residency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/04\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"11613\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"30\\/04\\/2023\",\"city\":\"GUWAHATI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Ornate\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room with Work Desk\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/05\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"4534\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation on<strong> Triple Sharing </strong>in all the hotels as mentioned above.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast</strong>&nbsp;will be served in all the Hotels except Kaziranga.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Swift Dzire</strong> for all transfers and sightseeing exactly as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Toll, Parking, driver’s Bata, road tax &amp; fuel charges.</li>\n	<li>Air-Port Pick up &amp; Drop.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"transport_cost\":\"21000\",\"hotel_cost\":23998},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":44998,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 4499.8\",\"selling_price\":49497.800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0350/042023', 48300, 16100, 0, '2023-04-06 14:23:57', '2023-04-19 14:02:52', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
