(365, 'MR ANUP AGARWAL', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9431101780', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LADAKH', '2023-06-19', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Leh\",\"date\":\"19-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/>Arrival at Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum, and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.) Upon arrival, you will meet by MT representative and transfer to Hotel for Check-in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel. Overnight at Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh - Excursion to Sham Valley (50 Kms \\/ 03-04 Hr)\",\"date\":\"20-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">After breakfast, you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with the Hall Of Fame (Museum Constructed by Indian Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 km from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev Ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity. As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek. Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.Overnight at Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leh\\u2013Nubra Valley via Khardung La 18,390 FT. (120 Kms \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"21-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra, we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have the opportunity to ride on a bacterium camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high-altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon. Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes beside the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan. On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarters town of the Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores. Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back to Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nubra Valley to Pangong Lake (170 Kms \\/ 7 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"22-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\\n\\n<p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">Post breakfast we drive towards Pangong Tso via Agham &amp; Shyok Valley. Some of the road patches in areas are extremely tough (towards the Nubra side) in terms of road conditions but no doubt the journey is very scenic!&nbsp; Later after crossing this adventurous part we drive further towards Durbuk &amp; Tangtse for Pangong you pass through a few small villages of Changthang and finally, you can have a sudden view of the Pangong lake situated at 14,000 feet (4,267 m). This famous blue brackish Lake of Pangong is 5\\/6 Kms wide and over 133 Kms long with half of its running on the other side of the \\\"Indo China Border\\\". One rarely feels so close to nature and the environment and the scenery are unforgettable. After the success of 3 Idiots, this beautiful natural location has attracted more tourists from all over the world. Upon arrival, we check-in at our Camp Near Pangong lake. Dinner &amp; Overnight at the Camp.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pangong Lake to Leh Via Changla (140 Kms \\/ 6 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"23-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/>Morning at leisure to explore the beauty of the lake and later we drive back to Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs enroute visiting Thiksey an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village and another 5 Kms Driving through a picturesque landscape we reach to Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh&nbsp; &amp;3 Idiots Rancho School. Drive further to Leh and check in at our hotel for an Overnight<b> <\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Leh (Fly Out)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Tour concludes. Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;thanks you for your patronage and ensures a punctual transfer to Domestic Airport to catch the flight for your onward Destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" \\/><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2422\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"07:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 PM\",\"fare\":25924},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8125\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"08:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":22552},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8126\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":42768},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":25380}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sinnge Palace \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/06\\/2023\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Nubra Valley\",\"hotel_name\":\"Mystique Earth Homes \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/06\\/2023\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"22\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Pangong Lake\",\"hotel_name\":\"Crystal Lake Resort  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/06\\/2023\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"23\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Nirvana Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/06\\/2023\",\"meal\":\"map\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi/Raipur.</strong></li>\n	<li>Assistance upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport</li>\n	<li>Traditional welcome in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival</li>\n	<li>03 Night Accommodation in Leh on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Nubra Valley on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary</li>\n	<li>01 Night Accommodation in Pangong Lake on twin sharing Basis as per the Itinerary&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meal Plan MAP (<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Morning Tea / Coffee with Biscuits on the day of departure</li>\n	<li>Return airport and round trip transfers along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac <strong>Innova/Similar.</strong></li>\n	<li>Inner Line Permit (Wildlife, Red Cross &amp; Environment fees)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":116624,\"land_cost\":\"158678\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":275302,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 41295.3\",\"selling_price\":316597.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0360/052023', 316400, 79100, 0, '2023-05-22 12:06:12', '2023-06-13 11:09:56', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(366, 'MR BABLU SAHU', NULL, '9031267643', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL TOUR', '2023-06-12', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi  to Shimla\",\"date\":\"12-06-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Delhi railway station\\/airport and transfer to Shimla 8 hours drive. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Shimla:&nbsp;Known as the Summer Capital of The Britishers, and currently the capital of Himachal Pradesh, Shimla is one of India\'s most popular hill resorts, buzzing with a happy flow of heat-escaping Indian vacationers.&nbsp;Situated at a height of 2200m, Shimla still retains its old-world charm with beautiful colonial architecture, pedestrian-friendly Mall Road, and the ridge lined up with multiple shops, cafes, and restaurants.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla Local\",\"date\":\"13-06-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney, and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri after lunch sightseeing various places in and around.&nbsp; Jakhoo Temple, Vice regal Lodge built-in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theatre- the first beauty contest of the world was supposed to start (1887), The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Jakhoo Temple,&nbsp;Kufri,&nbsp;Viceroy Lodge and Botanical garden,&nbsp;Christ Church,&nbsp;The Ridge,&nbsp;The Mall Road,&nbsp;Scandal Point, Gaiety Theatre,&nbsp;Kali Bari Temple,&nbsp;Town Hall<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla to Manali\",\"date\":\"14-06-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 265 km 8 hrs.&nbsp; on the way visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple, Kullu Valley, O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Manali:&nbsp;Also known as the&nbsp; Queen of Hill stations and a&nbsp;mecca for adventure sports enthusiasts, Manali is situated at 6,398 ft in the Himalayas.&nbsp;What you dream of having at a hill station this place has everything to offer, Snow clad mountains, Beautiful valleys, Rivers, small streams, High altitude roads, and gateways to the most offbeat destinations like&nbsp; Ladakh, Lahaul, and Spiti.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local\",\"date\":\"15-06-2023 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu temple, Vashisht Bath, ( trek\\/Walk to Jogini&nbsp; Fall optional), Van Vihar, and evening shopping at the local market. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Hadimba Temple,&nbsp;Manu Temple,&nbsp;Vashisht,&nbsp;Jogini Fall<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local\",\"date\":\"16-06-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley and further to Atal tunnel till the north pole. Evening at Leisure. O\\/N Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Solang Valley,&nbsp;Atal Tunnel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali to Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"17-06-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Checkout&nbsp;from the hotel drive to Chandigarh. Chandigarh is the 1st planned modern city of India designed by the French architect Le Corbusier. The city was named after the mother goddess of power, Chandi, whose temple Chandimandu is a feature of the new city.&nbsp; Evening visit Chandigarh Sightseeing Rock Garden, Rock Garden and Sukhna Lake is subject to time availability O\\/N Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh to Delhi Drop\",\"date\":\"18-06-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>After breakfast checkout form hotel and drive to&nbsp; Delhi Station Airport drop<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"549\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"14400\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"753\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"19448\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Larisa\",\"room_type\":\"Boulevard Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"25000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"SNOW FLAKES RESORT & SPA, MANALI\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Valley View\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"17\\/06\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"31500\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/06\\/2023\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Shagun, Zirakpur\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Rooms\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/06\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"5900\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>Tours &amp; Sightseeing by Private <strong>Innova Crysta Ex-Delhi. (</strong><em>AC will not work in Hilly Areas</em><strong>)</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tool/Parking/Driver Allowances&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":33848,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":62400,\"transport_cost\":\"38000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":134248,\"profit_figure\":\"42152\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"31.00%\",\"selling_price\":176400}', 'MZQ/0361/062023', 176400, 58800, 0, '2023-06-08 10:17:16', '2023-06-13 11:14:32', 1, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
