ee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":100344,\"hotel_cost\":49440,\"land_cost\":\"98404\",\"visa_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":263188,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":312000,\"profit_figure\":\"48812\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"18.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0362/062023', 312000, 104000, 0, '2023-06-19 06:30:09', '2023-07-03 05:00:37', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(368, 'MR AJAY MINZ', 'DIBADIH', '9002042327', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'NORTH EAST', '2023-06-21', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"IXB Airport - Gangtok (125Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"21-06-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at&nbsp; Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok&nbsp;(5,413 Ft.).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs. one-way)\",\"date\":\"22-06-2023 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. \\/ 37 Kms. \\/ 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. \\/ 16 Kms. \\/ 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok Full Day Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"23-06-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start for a Full day city tour covering Tashi view point, Ganesh Tok, Hanuman Tok, Flower show, Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (Closed on Sunday and 1st and 3rd Saturday of the month), Institute of Tibetology (Closed on Sunday), Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery and Banjakhri Falls (maximum 6 hours).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok -Pelling(128 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Pelling (6,300 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling Full Day Sightseeing with Skywalk\",\"date\":\"25-06-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, cover Darap village, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground.&nbsp; Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling \\u2013 Darjeeling (72Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"26-06-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling&nbsp;(6,950 Ft.)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On arrival, check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"27-06-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling -IXB Airport (68Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"28-06-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, checkout from the hotel and take the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7562\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jun 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jun 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"08:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"23200\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"751\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jun 2023\",\"ar