ed vehicles in Sonmarg in case of Snow</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"33\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":134431,\"hotel_cost\":\"28642\",\"land_cost\":\"126000\",\"transport_cost\":\"11000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":300073,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 99024.09\",\"selling_price\":399097.089999999967403709888458251953125}', 'MZQ/0386/082023', 398400, 66400, 27800, '2023-08-27 07:57:03', '2023-10-16 08:30:56', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
