(394, 'MR GOPAL DAS', 'CCL', '8434972837', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2023-10-23', 6, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Mumbai\",\"date\":\"23-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive Mumbai &amp; proceed to Hotel for Night Stay.<br \\/>\\nEarly Moprning Checkout &amp; proceed to Airport for your Andaman Holiday Tour.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n<strong><em>(For Mumbai : You&nbsp;need to manage the Taxi on yoiur Own)<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later visit Cellular Jail and Light and Sound Show\",\"date\":\"24-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you check in. Post lunch we proceed to one of the most visited attractions in the Andaman Islands, Cellular Jail. This jail before India\'s Independence hosted Indian freedom fighters as prisoners in the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Today, this jail stands as a national memorial. Visit this historic attraction and know about the rich history of the Andaman Islands. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"25-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands\' most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends to you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\'s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"26-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater? Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination on Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one of the best reefs on Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends to you and drops you at your hotel. Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"27-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\'s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back at your hotel in Neil Island. Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop + Shopping Trip\",\"date\":\"28-10-2023\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE FROM PORT BLAIR || DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"29-10-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast drop to the Airport. Return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination, the Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"341\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"17831\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"313\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"07:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"27134\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6306\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"62681\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"186\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2023\",\"city\":\"MUMBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Auris\",\"room_type\":\"Hazel Triple\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"