e of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":12}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare/TrainFare&nbsp;<em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation </strong>on <strong>Triple sharing </strong>at given hotels in <strong>Mumbai,&nbsp;Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet service</strong> at PortBlair&nbsp;airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport</strong> pickup and drop at Portblair.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>Private AC Vehicle </strong>at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side <strong>Ferry Tickets</strong> Included <strong>03 Side Cruises </strong>to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling</strong> is complimentary.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance </strong>by <strong><em>Multi Zone Travel </em></strong><em>experts</em> in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":107646,\"hotel_cost\":\"5033\",\"land_cost\":\"91020\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":203699,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":241100,\"profit_figur