(397, 'Mr Prakhar', 'BNI C | Ankur Tulsyan', '7979754501', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2023-09-23', 6, NULL, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"23-09-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the&nbsp;Pahalgam. Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy nature admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;the&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow-clad mountains with dense forests of pine and deodar trees, vast meadows, and a Fresh Fast fast-running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"24-09-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your full day in Pahalgam,&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amrnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"25-09-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visit the local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg Local Sightseening - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately\",\"date\":\"26-09-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast enjoy a full day in Gulmarg. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Drive Back to Srinagar, Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"27-09-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<div>\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in Dal Lake and&nbsp;return to visit the Local handicraft showroom for hand - especially silken shawls, carpet, and jewelry ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"28-09-2023 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d.Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas Glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t<p><strong>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in HouseBoat&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"29-09-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Ends!!!!!!!!<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2173\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"23810\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2124\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia India\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"24773\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hilltop\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/09\\/2023\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hilltop\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/09\\/2023\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Palm Spring\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/09\\/2023\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Wangnoo Sheraton Group of HouseBoat\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/09\\/2023\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>Deluxe Room + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Srinagar <strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li>01 Private <strong>Car (Innova)&nbsp;</strong>for transfers and sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Day trip to Sonmarg</strong></li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong> in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong> in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":48583,\"land_cost\":\"90000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":138583,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":173754,\"profit_figure\":\"35171\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"25.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0392/092023', 173754, 57918, NULL, '2023-09-13 13:52:28', '2023-09-22 06:24:58', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(399, 'Mr. Saket Saraf', 'BNI', '9835574327', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SRI LANKA', '2023-12-26', 6, 2, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"INDIA- AIRPORT-PINNNAWALA \\u2013 KANDY\",\"date\":\"26-12-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Sri Lanka. You will be met by representatives of Red Apple Travels and transferred to&nbsp;Kandy.&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 03 &amp; \\u00bd hrs)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En route visit *Pinnawela Elephant Orphanage -&nbsp;App. 55 miles from Colombo, off the Colombo - Kandy road is Pinnawela, where an orphanage was started in 1975 to house the abandoned and wounded elephants. The number of elephants has increased to more than 65 now; including Baby Elephants brought from various parts, as well as the 23 babies born, as a result of the captive breeding program. The best time to visit is the feeding time from 0930-1000 hrs and 1330-1400 hrs and the bathing time from 1000-1030 hrs and 1400-1430 hrs when all the elephants are taken to the river close by.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Pinnawala Open Zoo&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Spice Garden Visit&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to *Kandy&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>**Gem Gallery visit&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening witness the colorful Kandy Cultural Show&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Kandy&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY -PERADENIYA-KANDY\",\"date\":\"27-12-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;*Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic&nbsp;- ever since 4th Century A.D, when the Buddha\'s Tooth was brought to Sri Lanka hidden from sacrilegious hands in an Orissan princess\' hair, the Relic has grown in repute and holiness in Sri Lanka and throughout the Buddhist world. It is considered Sri Lanka\'s most prized possession.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;*Peradeniya Royal Botanical Garden&nbsp;- 147 acres in extent; Started in 1374 as a pleasure garden of the Kings of Gampola and Kandy.&nbsp; There are more than 4,000 species of trees, plants, and creepers. Some rare and endemic as well as flora from the tropical world are found in the gardens.&nbsp; Spice Garden and Orchid House are popular with tourists. There are 5 Palm Avenues beautifying the gardens, the earliest and tallest Palm Avenue (Royal Palm Avenue) was planted in 1905 and the Double Coconuts from Seashells Island, with the largest seed of all plants in the world, is one such avenue.&nbsp;(The excursion will take approx: 2 hrs)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to Kandy &amp; visit Kandy city in the evening.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Kandy&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY - NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"28-12-2023 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>This morning you will be going to&nbsp;Nuwara Eliya&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 02 &amp; 1\\/2hrs)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En-route visit&nbsp;Ramboda Hanumanji Temple (subject to temple timing), Tea Plantation &amp; Ramboda Falls&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon proceed to Nuwara Eliya &amp; evening free and relax in the hotel.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Nuwara Eliya&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA \\u2013 BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"29-12-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to&nbsp;Bentota&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 05hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En-route&nbsp;*Witness St Clairs Falls &amp; Devon Falls&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Optional \\u2013 Kitulgala White Water Rafting \\u2013 USD 10 per person&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Continue to Bentota &amp; leisure at the hotel&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Bentota&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"30-12-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the hotel.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Commence Bentota sightseeing&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Maadu River Ride&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride &amp; Tube Ride)&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Bentota<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA \\u2013 COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"31-12-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to&nbsp;Colombo&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 02hrs)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Colombo -&nbsp;a drive through the city taking you to the busy commercial areas as well as the tree-lined residential, Cinnamon Gardens. Visit Fort, the former British administrative center and military garrison, Sea Street - the Goldsmith\\u2019s quarters in the heart of Pettah, the Bazaar area, where is also a Hindu Temple with elaborate stone carvings, and the Dutch Church of Wolfendhal dating back to 1749. Also, visit the BMICH, see the replica of Avukana Buddha &amp; the Independence Square.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Shopping&nbsp;in Colombo.......visit *ODEL&nbsp;Unlimited provides ample opportunity to indulge, not only in shopping for designer wear apparel for the whole family, but also take taste buds on a voyage of discovery.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in COLOMBO<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO - AIRPORT\",\"date\":\"01-01-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon completion, you will be transferred to the airport for your departure flight back to India.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"209\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 PM\",\"fare\":252980},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1207\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Dec 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Dec 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1168\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"221\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Kandy\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Earls Reegency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/12\\/2023\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Nuwara Eliya\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Araliya Green City\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/12\\/2023\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Bentota\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Cinnamon Bey\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/12\\/2023\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"31\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Colombo\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Cinnamon Lakeside\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/01\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7},{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Airfare Ex- Ranchi (IXR)</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06nights’ Accommodation</strong> at the above-mentioned Hotels&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><b>06breakfasts @ the hotels</b>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><b>06dinners @ the hotels</b>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Gem Gallery Visit&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Kandy Cultural Show -A Gem Gallery visit is a must to obtain the complimentary coupon for the Kandy Cultural Show&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Complimentary Spice Garden visit&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Transportation in an A/C vehicle on PVT Basis&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Services of English-Speaking Chauffer&nbsp;Guide&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Arrival &amp; Departure Assistance at the Airport&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>City Tour &amp; Shopping&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Applicable Taxes excluding GST or Bank fee&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":252980,\"land_cost\":\"234345\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"14900\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Sight Seen\",\"amount\":\"42000\"}],\"cost_price\":544225,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 65307\",\"selling_price\":609532}', 'MZQ/0394/092023', 613700, 98500, 60600, '2023-09-19 12:16:25', '2023-09-19 12:17:16', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(400, 'MR UDIT NARAYAN', 'CALVIN', '8987492227', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DARJEELING & GANGTOK', '2023-09-25', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok - Pickup\",\"date\":\"25-09-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure. Overnight stay at Gangtok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir - Excursion\",\"date\":\"26-09-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. \\/ 37 Kms. \\/ 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. \\/ 16 Kms. \\/ 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok. Overnight stay at Gangtok. Note: In case of a Land slide or any other reason Tsomgo Lake is closed we will provide alternate sightseeing. Due to the winter season (heavy snow), vehicles will be able to drive to Snow Point on the way to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Darjeeling - Halfday Sightseeing and Transfer\",\"date\":\"27-09-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Check out from the Hotel &amp; enjoy a half-day city tour visiting the Flower show, Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (Closed on Sunday and 1st and 3rd Saturday of the month), Institute of Tibetology (Closed on Sunday), Dro-Dul Chorten &amp; Gonjang Monastery. Afternoon proceed to Darjeeling. On arrival, check in to your hotel, and the rest of the day is free. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"28-09-2023 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to the hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on the 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), and Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for shopping or leisure. Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"29-09-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from the hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5174\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"18206\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6175\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"12374\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7234\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Sep 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MAYFAIR SPA RESORT & CASINO\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/09\\/2023\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/09\\/2023\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL MAYFAIR\",\"room_type\":\"Heritage Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/09\\/2023\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare for&nbsp;(&nbsp;<em>02 Adults + 01 Child + 01 Infant )&nbsp;</em><strong>Delhi-Bagdogra-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on Double Sharing Basis.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>Private 01 AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova</strong> as per itinerary on point to point basis only (Ac will not run in Hill area).&nbsp;<strong>The vehicle will not be at disposal &amp; it will be available as per itinerary only (point to point basis).</strong></li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Personal Expenses such as Laundry, telephone calls, tips &amp; gratuity, mineral water, soft &amp; hard drinks, rafting, rock climbing, paragliding, joy ride (Toy Train), porterage.</li>\n	<li>Additional sightseeing or extra usage of vehicle, other than mentioned in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Entrance Fees &amp; Guide charges.</li>\n	<li>Any cost arising due to natural calamities like landslides, road&nbsp;blockage, political disturbances (strikes), etc (to be borne by the client, should be is directly payable on the spot).</li>\n	<li>Any increase in taxes or fuel price, leading to an increase in cost on surface transportation &amp; land arrangements, which may come into effect prior to departure.</li>\n	<li>Room Heater Charges</li>\n	<li>Insurance.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":30580,\"land_cost\":\"78200\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":108780,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":150600,\"profit_figure\":\"41820\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"38.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0395/092023', 150600, 63500, 23600, '2023-09-20 06:22:00', '2023-09-20 09:27:27', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(401, 'Mrs. Rashmi Jain', 'Ms. Neha Agarwal', '9835715549', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2023-10-20', 5, 1, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"20-10-2023 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"21-10-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"22-10-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach for Sunset\",\"date\":\"23-10-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil Island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\\u2019s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"atural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop\",\"date\":\"24-10-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpurbeach.Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"25-10-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"Howrah (HWH)\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2023\",\"name\":\"Shatabdi Express (CC)\",\"fno\":\"12020\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 Pm\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 Pm\",\"fare\":\"5220\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"787\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"05:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"41400\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"788\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Oct 2023\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"37800\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Howrah (HWH)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"name\":\"Vande Bharat Express (EC)\",\"fno\":\"20897\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Oct 2023\",\"dep_time\":\"03:45 Pm\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2023\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 Pm\",\"fare\":\"9600\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/10\\/2023\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/10\\/2023\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/10\\/2023\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Palms Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Cottage Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/10\\/2023\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2023\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Aquays Hotels & Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Lagoon Vista\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/10\\/2023\"},{\"id\":3,\"chec