n <strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet service</strong> at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport</strong> pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>Private AC Vehicle </strong>at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side <strong>Ferry Tickets</strong> Included <strong>03 Side Cruises </strong>to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling</strong> is complimentary.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance </strong>by <strong><em>Multi Zone Travel </em></strong><em>experts</em> in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"19\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":94020,\"land_cost\":\"116000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":210020,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39903.8\",\"selling_price\":249923.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0396/092023', 249200, 62300, 62300, '2023-09-22 07:21:46', '2023-09-29 10:44:42', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
