ioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":195028,\"land_cost\":\"131240\",\"hotel_cost\":316485,\"visa_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":670753,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 80490.36\",\"selling_price\":751243.359999999986030161380767822265625,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"10.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0398/092023', 750000, 187500, 0, '2023-09-22 13:59:18', '2023-09-23 14:32:23', 0, 1, '\"<p><b><u>Imp Note for Abu Dhabi:<\\/u><\\/b><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Guest visiting to Abu Dhabi for Tours (Grand Mosque) and Theme Parks, it is advisable to have 02 doses of WHO approved Vaccine and Negative PCR report (we advise and recommend guest to have a PCR test done in UAE approved lab, in order to avoid last minute changes)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
