(423, 'Ms Dimple Gupta', 'MZ CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2024-01-06', 6, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Land at Port Blair - Corbyn\'s Cove Beach + Cellular Jail + Sound & Light Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"06-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Land at Port Blair airport in the&nbsp;<u>morning or afternoon<\\/u>&nbsp;and transfer to&nbsp;<u>hotel<\\/u>. Proceed for a quick visit to&nbsp;<b><u>Corbyn\'s Cove Beach,<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;the only beach in Port Blair where you can swim, relax and unwind. Guests can enjoy some water-sport activities like Jet-Ski, Parasailing, Sea-Kart, Speed Boat rides, etc. on a direct payment basis and then proceed to visit the famous&nbsp;<b><u>Cellular Jail,<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;(entry closes at 1545hrs), an old colonial prison situated in Port Blair also known as \'Kalapani\'. Later, attend the enthralling&nbsp;<b><u>Sound &amp; Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/u><\\/b>&nbsp;where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive and then drop back to hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - North Bay & Ross Island (Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose Island)\",\"date\":\"07-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;after breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to&nbsp;<b>North Bay Island<\\/b>&nbsp;(Coral Island) by sharing boats. The same boat will then take the guest to&nbsp;visit<b>&nbsp;Ross Island (Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose Island)&nbsp;<\\/b>which was named after Mr. Daniel Ross, a famous marine surveyor. In December 2018, it was renamed as Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose Island. Drop back to hotel and evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Afternoon visit to Beach No 7\",\"date\":\"08-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Departure by&nbsp;morning or afternoon&nbsp;<b>Private ferry (PB- HL)&nbsp;-&nbsp;<\\/b>Journey time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs. On arrival at Havelock (Swaraj Dweep),&nbsp;our team will meet the guest at the exit gate and then the guest will be dropped to their havelock hotel. At around 1430hrs - 1530hrs, proceed to Beach No. 7 (Radhanagar Beach) rated as the \\u2018Best Beach in Asia\\u2019 by Time Magazine to unwind, relax and enjoy the pristine white sand beach. Later drop back to the hotel. Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Elephant Beach\\/ Lighthouse\",\"date\":\"09-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Embark on the most memorable excursion to<b>&nbsp;Elephant Beach or Light House<\\/b>&nbsp;by sharing boat. The&nbsp;<b>journey time is 30-45&nbsp;<\\/b>mins and you can also opt for some water sports activities like Snorkeling, Sea Walk, Jet Ski, Glass bottom Boat, Banana Boat Ride, Sofa boat ride, Parasailing, etc. on direct payment.<b>&nbsp;<\\/b><i><u>It is advisable to pre book activity at the boarding point itself to avoid missing out on these activities, our tour manager will assist you with the same.<\\/u><\\/i><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>Return after 3 hrs. in the same sharing boat to the jetty. Our tour manager will meet and assist with car transfers. Later proceed to the hotel. Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep)- O\\/N at Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) - 03 Beach Visit\",\"date\":\"10-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Dweep) to Neil (Shaheed Dweep)<\\/b>&nbsp;(Journey time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs). On arrival at Neil (Shaheed Dweep), our team will meet the guest at the exit gate and then the guest will be head to visit&nbsp;<b><u>Bharatpur,<\\/u>&nbsp;<u>Laxmanpur beach<\\/u>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<u>Natural Bridge<\\/u>&nbsp;<\\/b>(also known as Howrah Bridge by the locals - this can be accessed only during the Low Tide)<b>&nbsp;<\\/b>and transfer to their Neil hotel. Enjoy a comfortable overnight stay and evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) - Port Blair - Shopping\",\"date\":\"11-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Wake up to the quaint and mesmerizing Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) also called the \'Vegetable bowl of Andamans\' and check-out as per hotel allocated time and then, proceed to the Neil (Shaheed Dweep) jetty to board the&nbsp;<b>afternoon private ferry (NL-PB) Neil Island (Shaheed Dweep) - Port Blair.<\\/b>&nbsp;On arrival at Port Blair, our team will meet the guest at the exit gate of the jetty and will be dropped to their Port Blair hotel. In the evening proceed to Sagarikha Emporium for Shopping. Evening at leisure<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair Airport\",\"date\":\"12-01-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and check-out from the Port Blair hotel as per the hotel\'s allocated time. Head&nbsp;<b>straight to the airport<\\/b>&nbsp;to board the departure flight. Have a safe trip home taking back fond memories of these stunning islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Villa\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Lagoon\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/01\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation </strong>on Double sharing at given hotels in<strong> Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet service</strong> at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport </strong>pickup and drop.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>Private AC Vehicle</strong> at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side <strong>Ferry Tickets</strong> Included <strong>03 Side Cruises</strong> to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast and Dinner </strong>at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling </strong>is complimentary.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance</strong> by <em><strong>Multi Zone Travel</strong></em> experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"9\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"295470\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":295470,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 26592.3\",\"selling_price\":322062.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0418/0112023', 321600, 53600, 62300, '2023-11-16 10:15:02', '2023-11-29 05:47:02', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
