s, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in<strong> Hotel&nbsp;Howard Johnson.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast </strong>at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Airport transfers</strong> on PVT.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong> with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong> Fountain Show </strong>on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124th &amp; 125th Floor</strong> on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Deluxe Marina Dhow Cruise</strong> on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Deluxe Desert Safari </strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show, and other camp activities on SIC.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Abu Dhabi with Ferrari World Theme Park</strong> with a visit to the&nbsp;<strong>Grand Mosque</strong> on PVT.</li>\n	<li><b>Miracle Garden&nbsp;</b>on PVT.</li>\n	<li><b>Global Village&nbsp;</b>on PVT.</li>\n	<li><strong>Aquaventure Water Park</strong> &amp; <strong>Lost Chamber <em>(04 Pax)</em></strong> on PVT.</li>\n	<li><b>Museum of the Future&nbsp;</b>on PVT.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist VIsa</strong> with Insurance.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee @ <strong>20 AED</strong> Per Room Per Night.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":108270,\"hotel_cost\":51500,\"land_cost\":\"120000\",\"visa_cost\":\"19500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":299270,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 44890.5\",\"selling_price\":344160.5}', 'MZQ/0424/0112023', 344100, 114700, 0, '2023-11-29 13:07:18', '2023-11-30 07:41:25', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(431, 'Mr. A K Pandey', 'BNI | CELEB | Rohit Prasad', '9241050550', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2023-12-23', 4, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Land at Port Blair - Cellular Jail + Sound & Light Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"23-12-2023 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Land at Port Blair airport in the morning or afternoon and transfer to hotel. After some rest, visit the famous&nbsp;<b>Cellular Jail<\\/b>, (entry closes at 1545hrs), an old colonial prison situated in Port Blair also known as \'Kalapani\'. Later, attend the enthralling&nbsp;<b>Sound &amp; Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/b>&nbsp;where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive, and then drop back to the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Afternoon visit to Beach No 7\",\"date\":\"24-12-2023 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Departure by morning or afternoon&nbsp;<b>Private ferry (PB- HL) -&nbsp;<\\/b>Journey time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs. On arrival at Havelock (Swaraj Dweep), our team will meet the guest at the exit gate and then the guest will be dropped to their havelock hotel. At around 1430hrs - 1530hrs, proceed to Beach No. 7 (Radhanagar Beach) rated as the \\u2018Best Beach in Asia\\u2019 by Time Magazine to unwind, relax and enjoy the pristine white sand beach. Later drop back to the hotel. Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Elephant Beach\\/ Lighthouse\",\"date\":\"25-12-2023 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Embark on the most memorable excursion to<b>&nbsp;Elephant Beach or Light House<\\/b>&nbsp;by sharing boat. The&nbsp;<b>journey time is 30-45&nbsp;<\\/b>mins and you can also opt for some water sports activities like Snorkeling, Sea Walk, Jet Ski, Glass bottom Boat, Banana Boat Ride, Sofa boat ride, Parasailing, etc. on direct payment.<b>&nbsp;<\\/b><i><u>It is advisable to pre book activity at the boarding point itself to avoid missing out on these activities, our tour manager will assist you with the same.<\\/u><\\/i><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>Return after 3 hrs. in the same sharing boat to the jetty. Our tour manager will meet and assist with car transfers. Enroute proceed to&nbsp;<b>Something Different \\u2013 A Beach Side Caf\\u00e9 (Highest Reviewed Restaurant on Tripadvisor.com)<\\/b>&nbsp;and enjoy a&nbsp;<b>complimentary<\\/b>&nbsp;pint of&nbsp;<b>Domestic Beer\\/Glass of mocktail\\/ Glass of Soft drink&nbsp;<\\/b>per person from Set Menu (Any one). Later proceed to the hotel. Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Port Blair \\u2013 Shopping\",\"date\":\"26-12-2023 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check-out from Havelock hotel and then head to&nbsp;<b>Something Different \\u2013 A Beach Side Cafe&nbsp;<\\/b>the only multi-cuisine beachside caf\\u00e9 that offers a fabulous view along with a fun play-zone for kids, a book-reading corner, and lots more. Afterwards, proceed to the Havelock jetty to board the&nbsp;<b>Private ferry (HL - PB) - The journey<\\/b>&nbsp;time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs. On arrival at Port Blair, our team will meet the guest at the exit of the Port Blair jetty and then proceed to Shop. e.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair Airport\",\"date\":\"27-12-2023 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and check-out from the Port Blair hotel as per the hotel allocated time. Head&nbsp;<b>straight to the airport<\\/b>&nbsp;to board the departure flight. Have a safe trip home taking back fond memories of these stunning islands.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kalki\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2023\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\