problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Pattaya.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Bangkok.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;</strong>on <strong>Double Sharing</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Coral Island&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;</strong>By Speedboat with Indian Lunch&nbsp;SIC</li>\n	<li><b>Tiger Park </b>PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Dinner Cruise&nbsp;</strong>SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World with Marine Park&nbsp;</strong>with Indian Lunch SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Bangkok Temple Tour SIC</strong></li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok BKK Airport To Pattaya Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;Pattaya Hotel&nbsp;To Bangkok Hotel PVT<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Free Thailand VISA on Arrival</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":61498,\"hotel_cost\":30116,\"land_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":119614,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0