(442, 'Mr. Akshat', 'BNI', '8235283815', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2024-01-20', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"20-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"21-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"22-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach for Sunset\",\"date\":\"23-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil Island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\\u2019s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"atural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop\",\"date\":\"24-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpurbeach.Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"25-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8263\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":15880},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5599\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"fare\":20192},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7234\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Chalet\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"23\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Cottage\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"24\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/01\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirma