rivate AC Vehicle&nbsp;</strong>at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All side&nbsp;<strong>Ferry Tickets</strong>&nbsp;Included&nbsp;<strong>03 Side Cruises&nbsp;</strong>to Havelock and Neil.</li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;<strong>entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling</strong>&nbsp;is complimentary.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance&nbsp;</strong>by&nbsp;<strong><em>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;</em></strong><em>experts</em>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":36072,\"land_cost\":\"81388\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":117460,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18793.6\",\"selling_price\":136253.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0436/0122023', 136200, 68100, 62300, '2023-12-18 06:54:15', '2023-12-18 06:54:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
