(443, 'DR P K Chaudhuri', NULL, '9431590890', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'WAYANAD + OOTY', '2023-12-20', 5, 0, 4, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"WAYANAD\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Karapuzha Village Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DLX Waterfront Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"23\\/12\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"39600\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2023\",\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2023\",\"city\":\"OOTY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sterling Ooty Fern Hill\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"rate\":\"56717\",\"room_type\":\"Family Suite\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights </strong>Accommodation on Double sharing in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Wayanad.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights </strong>Accommodation on Quad sharing in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room&nbsp;at <strong>Ooty.</strong></li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner.</strong></li>\n	<li>Tour by <strong>A/C Innova</strong> <strong>Ex-Bangalore</strong> on a disposal basis.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":96317,\"transport_cost\":\"35000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":131317,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27576.57\",\"selling_price\":158893.5700000000069849193096160888671875}', 'MZQ/0437/0122023', 159100, 39775, 0, '2023-12-18 11:28:00', '2023-12-19 06:44:22', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(444, 'Mr. Manoj', 'Anjali Mam', '9009696736', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Kerela 3*', '2024-01-02', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Cochin\",\"date\":\"02-01-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Cochin airport\\/RLY station and transfer to hotel.&nbsp; Check in and relax. Afternoon visits the Mattancherry Dutch Palace - (closed on&nbsp;Fridays&nbsp;and public holidays), which was built by the Portuguese in 1555 and renovated by the Dutch in 1663. Visit a Jewish Synagogue-(closed on all&nbsp;Saturdays&nbsp;and Jewish holidays) in Jew Town.&nbsp; Proceed to Fort Cochin Area. There are a couple of streets of picture-postcard houses out of another age. Visit St. Francis Church - (closed for visitors on&nbsp;Sundays&nbsp;from 08.00 to 11.00 hrs.) the oldest European Church in India. It has several antiquities including a wealth of records. See the Chinese Fishing Nets, along the tip of Fort Cochin unique to this part of Kerala and living symbols of a centuries-old Chinese influence on this coast. Stay overnight at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin to Munnar\",\"date\":\"03-01-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout and transfer to Munnar. Munnar is a picturesque hill station situated in the eastern part of Kerala; lush green-carpeted tea and coffee plantations surround it. The beautiful landscapes, cosy weather, and the smell of tealeaves make Munnar one of the most sought-after destinations in South India. Munnar is situated near the Anaimudi Peak, the highest peak in the Western Ghats. On the way - stop at&nbsp;<strong>Cheeyappara waterfalls<\\/strong>. Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar\",\"date\":\"04-01-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;morning after breakfast visit&nbsp;<strong>Eravikulam national Park&nbsp;<\\/strong>famous for Nilghiri Mountain goats,<strong>&nbsp;Tea museum&nbsp;<\\/strong>explains about the processing of tea.&nbsp;<strong>Mattuppetty dam&nbsp;<\\/strong>which has an artificial lake built by a small Hydro-electric project.&nbsp;<strong>Echo Point&nbsp;<\\/strong>is known for the natural echo affect it produces. Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar \\u2013 Thekkady\",\"date\":\"05-01-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;after breakfast depart for Periyar by road. Arrive Periyar and transfer to hotel. The town also houses one of world\\u2019s most fascinating natural wildlife sanctuaries. A visit to Periyar also provides you the opportunity to see wildlife at close ranges, besides the varied vegetation and a wide variety of birds. Lying at an altitude of 700-1900 m above sea level, Periyar has a cool and comfortable climate. Out here, you can also go for treks and mountain walks or visit&nbsp;<strong>spice plantation or enjoy boat ride at Lake Periyar<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Kathakali, Kalarippayattu show etc<\\/strong>.<strong>..<\\/strong>&nbsp;Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thekkady \\u2013 Alleppey\",\"date\":\"06-01-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out of the hotel. Drive to Alleppey and arrive by the afternoon, enjoy cruise in the backwaters. Stay overnight at the Hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Cochin\",\"date\":\"07-01-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today after breakfast check out of the hotel and proceed to Cochin airport for an onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2219\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":26288},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6091\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"539\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":24114},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6113\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"02\\/01\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Broadbean\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2024\",\"rate\":null,\"city\":\"Cochin\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"03\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Munnar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Whispering Meadows\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/01\\/2024\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"05\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Thekkady\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Periyar Meadows\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Alleppey\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pagoda resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/01\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be c