ents, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room in <strong>Hotel Fairfield by Marriott Anjuna.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half Day North Goa </strong>Sight Seeing.</li>\n	<li><strong>RoundTrip Airport Transfers</strong> by A/C Dzire.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":45186,\"land_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"5500\",\"hotel_cost\":25600},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":76286,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12205.76\",\"selling_price\":88491.759999999994761310517787933349609375,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0440/0122023', 88200, 36200, 15800, '2023-12-25 08:32:49', '2023-12-26 05:37:29', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(447, 'Mr Sushant Prabhat', 'Argora', '6203812020', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2024-01-15', 5, NULL, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"15-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"16-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"17-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Pahalgam Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"18-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Gulamarg Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately) Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"19-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar HouseBoat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"20-01-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"745\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"fare\":21026},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"741\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"710\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"fare\":17208},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"589\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Petal\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"check_out\":\"17\\/01\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/01\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"18\\/01\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hotel Sparrow\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/01\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"19\\/01\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/01\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"check_out\":\"20\\/01\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deluxe HouseBoat\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Ranchi</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Hotel / HouseBoat accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;DOUBLE Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li>01 Private&nbsp;<strong>Car&nbsp;</strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Day trip to Sonmarg</strong></li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong>&nbsp;in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":38234,\"land_cost\":\"60000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":98234,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19646.8\",\"selling_price\":117880.800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0441/0122023', 117800, 58900, NULL, '2023-12-25 13:17:14', '2023-12-25 13:17:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(448, 'Mr Manoj Kr Sinha', 'MKS A NAGAR', '7739365310', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN', '2024-01-05', 7, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Chennai\",\"date\":\"05-01-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive Chennai &amp; Check-in to Hotel<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Land at Port Blair - Ross Island\",\"date\":\"06-01-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Checkout from Hotel &amp; proceed to Chennai Airport for your upcoming trip to Andaman Islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Land at Port Blair airport in the afternoon and transfer to hotel. After some rest, visit the famous&nbsp;<b>Ross Island<\\/b>, and then drop back to hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair - Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Afternoon visit to Beach No 7\",\"date\":\"07-01-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Departure by morning or afternoon&nbsp;Private ferry (PB- HL) \\u2013&nbsp;Journey time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs. On arrival at Havelock (Swaraj Dweep), our team will meet the guest at the exit gate and then the guest will be dropped to their havelock hotel. At around 1430hrs - 1530hrs, proceed to Beach No. 7 (Radhanagar Beach) rated as the \\u2018Best Beach in Asia\\u2019 by Time Magazine to unwind, relax and enjoy the pristine white sand beach. Later drop back to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Elephant Beach\\/ Lighthouse (Complimentary Beer or Mocktail at Something Different)\",\"date\":\"08-01-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Embark on the most memorable excursion to<b>&nbsp;Elephant Beach or Light House<\\/b>&nbsp;by sharing boat. The&nbsp;<b>journey time is 30-45&nbsp;<\\/b>mins and you can also opt for some water sports activities like Snorkeling, Sea Walk, Jet Ski, Glass bottom Boat, Banana Boat Ride, Sofa boat ride, Parasailing, etc. on direct payment.<b>&nbsp;<\\/b><i><u>It is advisable to pre book activity at the boarding point itself to avoid missing out on these activities, our tour manager will assist you with the same.<\\/u><\\/i><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>Return after 3 hrs. in the same sharing boat to the jetty. Our tour manager will meet and assist with car transfers. Enroute proceed to&nbsp;<b>Something Different \\u2013 A Beach Side Caf\\u00e9 (Highest Reviewed Restaurant on Tripadvisor.com)<\\/b>&nbsp;and enjoy a&nbsp;<b>complimentary<\\/b>&nbsp;pint of&nbsp;<b>Domestic Beer\\/Glass of mocktail\\/ Glass of Soft drink&nbsp;<\\/b>per person from Set Menu (Any one). Later proceed to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"09-01-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Relax and unwind on the picturesque&nbsp;<b>beaches of Havelock (Swaraj Dweep)<\\/b>&nbsp;or guest can&nbsp;<b>rent a two-wheeler<\\/b>&nbsp;and explore the island. Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) can be covered in one day as the total motorable road distance is only approximately 30 kms. One could also explore the breath-taking underwater by booking a&nbsp;<b>diving experience<\\/b>&nbsp;for Rs 4200 with a certified dive shop. We highly recommend a visit to&nbsp;<b>\\u2018Something Different \\u2013 A Beachside Caf\\u00e9\\u2019 (Rated #1 on&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/tripadvisor.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tripadvisor.com<\\/a>)<\\/b>&nbsp;and the only&nbsp;<b>multi-cuisine<\\/b>&nbsp;beachside caf\\u00e9 that offers a&nbsp;<b>fabulous view&nbsp;<\\/b>along with a&nbsp;<b>fun play-zone for kids, a book-reading corner&nbsp;<\\/b>and lots more.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>All activities on this day are on extra payment and not included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock (Swaraj Dweep) - Port Blair \\u2013 Free Time for shopping\",\"date\":\"10-01-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check-out from Havelock hotel and then optionally head to&nbsp;<b>Something Different \\u2013 A Beach Side Cafe (Rated&nbsp; #1 on&nbsp;<a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/tripadvisor.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">tripadvisor.com<\\/a>)<\\/b>&nbsp;and the only multi-cuisine beachside caf\\u00e9 that offers a fabulous view along with a fun play-zone for kids, a book-reading corner and lots more. Afterwards, proceed to the Havelock jetty to board the&nbsp;<b>Private ferry (HL \\u2013 PB) -&nbsp;<\\/b>Journey time is 1.5 \\/ 2.5 hrs). On arrival at Port Blair, our team will meet the guest at the exit of the Port Blair jetty and then drop them to the local market for shopping. Later they will be picked up and dropped off at the&nbsp;hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening at leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair Airport\",\"date\":\"11-01-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and check-out from the Port Blair hotel as per the hotel allocated time. Head&nbsp;<b>straight to the airport<\\/b>&nbsp;to board the departure flight. Have a safe trip home taking back fond memories of these stunning islands.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nArrival&nbsp;Chennai&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure Chennai\",\"date\":\"12-01-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and check-out from the Chennai hotel as per the hotel allocated time.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"845\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":38980},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"607\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jan 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jan 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"fare\":35840}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"CHENNAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramada Plaza by Wyndham\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/01\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"12400\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Welcomhotel by ITC\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"07\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Taj Exotica & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"10\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"10\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Welcomhotel by ITC\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/01\\/2024\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"11\\/01\\/2024\",\"city\":\"CHENNAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramada Plaza by Wyndham\",\"rate\":\"10600\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/01\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":12}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex- Chennai.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on <strong>Double sharing + 01 Extra Bed</strong> at given hotels in Chennai,&nbsp;Port Blair, Havelock.</li>\n	<li><strong><a name=\"m_-3385228332364360146_m_-4050107511038425657__Hlk93151615\">Daily&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;+ dinner&nbsp;on a set menu or buffet basis, as indicated in the meal plan (Except breakfast on day of arrival &amp; Except Lunch on day of Departure).</a></strong></li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Entry tickets</strong> to all sightseeing places as per the itinerary.&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Private Ferry Tickets</strong> (Base Category): Port Blair - Havelock&nbsp;+&nbsp;Havelock - Port Blair&nbsp;(Makruzz / Nautika / ITT Majestic / Aashi/ Sea Link or Green Ocean, subject to availability</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>All transfers by&nbsp;1 AC Car</strong>&nbsp;in Port Blair/ Havelock&nbsp;(We provide AC Xylos / Ertiga at Port Blair and Havelock)&nbsp;on point-to-point basis only.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><a name=\"m_-3385228332364360146_m_-4050107511038425657__Hlk98764484\"></a><a name=\"m_-3385228332364360146_m_-4050107511038425657__Hlk98764197\"></a>Excursion to Elephant Beach or Lighthouse subject to weather conditions.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Complimentary:&nbsp;</strong>Few mins of snorkelling at Elephant Beach.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Complimentary:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;1 pint of&nbsp;domestic beer or 1 glass of mocktail will be provided complimentary per person&nbsp;at&nbsp;Something Different – A Beachside Café&nbsp;only enroute from Elephant Beach to Hotel. Children’s drinks are non-transferrable. Offer is valid only on the mentioned drinks and only on day when guest have Elephant Beach and for lunch only. Please note this is a complimentary add on. If the guest does not avail the same there shall be no refund.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p>&nbsp;<strong>Meet and Greet </strong>Service at Airport</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><strong>Tour Manager </strong>briefing every evening at Port Blair and Havelock.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance by <strong>Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;</strong>experts in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":74820,\"hotel_cost\":\"23000\",\"land_cost\":\"311760\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":409580,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 65532.8\",\"selling_price\":475112.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0442/0122023', 475200, 162100, 75500, '2023-12-28 06:54:06', '2023-12-28 06:54:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
