(451, 'MR SANJIV PURI', 'MZ CDG', '9650990777', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DARJEELING', '2024-02-01', 2, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport - Darjeeling (75 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"01-02-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.) via&nbsp;<strong>Sumendu Lake<\\/strong>, which is famous for being one of the most beautiful man-made lakes. You may enjoy horse ride and boating there (on direct payment basis). Enroute visit <strong>Pasupati Market<\\/strong>, which is situated in India Nepal border (Extra vehicle charges will be applicable for Nepal Border to Pasupati Market on direct payment basis). On arrival check-in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"02-02-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), and Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"03-02-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from the hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/02\\/2024\",\"city\":\"DARJEELING\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sumitel\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/02\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"7681\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation on Double Sharing Basis.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>Private vehicle</strong> as per itinerary on point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in Hill area).&nbsp;<strong>The vehicle will not be at your disposal &amp; it will be available as per itinerary only (point to point basis).</strong></li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":7681,\"transport_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":22681,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 3175.34\",\"selling_price\":25856.34000000000014551915228366851806640625}', 'MZQ/0445/012024', 25700, 12850, 0, '2024-01-03 12:32:23', '2024-01-04 13:49:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
