Alleppey.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Kovalam.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all respected Hotels.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Candle Light Dinner @Kovalam</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Flower Bed Decoration&nbsp;@Kovalam</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by <strong>AC&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>Swift Dzire.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>All Toll / Parking/ Driver Allowances.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":32746,\"hotel_cost\":\"61000\",\"transport_cost\":\"18700\",\"land_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":112446,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":137500,\"profit_figure\":\"25054\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"22.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0447/012024', 137500, 68750, 0, '2024-01-09 13:34:47', '2024-01-30 05:56:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(454, 'Mr Sidharth Agarwal', 'MZ CDG', '9650367939', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KERALA', '2024-02-16', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kannur Transfer to Coorg (Approx 90 kms\\/ 2.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"16-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Kannur Airport and transfer to Coorg. A mesmerising hill station nuzzled in the vast greenery of Western Ghats, Coorg is one of the most popular hill stations in the country. Located 1452 m above sea level, Kodagu which is another name for Coorg is a small district in Karnataka State. Coorg is world famous for its coffee; on arrival check in to your hotel, Later proceed for sightseeing of Madikeri covering Omkareshwara temple - a unique amalgamation of Gothic and Islamic architectural styles. Abbey falls, Madikeri fort &amp; Raja seat. You can also visit Mercara Gold estate coffee plantations\\/ Pappy\\u2019s Coffee Island, which familiarises you with coffee plantations and processing of coffee.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Stay overnight at hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg\",\"date\":\"17-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast proceed to visit Dubare Elephant camp. Besides a normal visit you can choose from various interactive sessions like elephant grooming, feeding, and elephant ride etc (on direct payment basis) and then visit Nisargadhama - is an island formed by river Cauvery and is used as a picnic spot island, with lush foliage of thick bamboo groves, Afternoon visit the golden temple monastery which is the Tibetan settlement in South India.&nbsp;Then Return to hotel and overnight in Coorg.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg - Wayanad (130 kms\\/ 3.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"18-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout from hotel and get transferred to Wayanad. This small yet popular town of Wayanad in Kerala is complete with historical and ancient caves, beautiful serene waterfalls, wildlife and spice plantations is a famous tourist destination in Kerala. On the way visit, Kuruva Island \\u2013 Located in the middle of Kabini River this uninhabited island is spread over 950 acres. It houses a vast array of rare flora and fauna. You can do bamboo rafting, river rafting, bird watching etc... Proceed to hotel. Check in and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Stay overnight at Wayanad.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Wayanad\",\"date\":\"19-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning after breakfast proceed to visit the ancient Jain temple at Sulthan bathery \\u2013 built in 13th century. Then to Edakal Caves - Located at a height of 1000m on Ambukuthi mala near Ambalavayal are the Edakal Caves. Etchings found on the walls of these caves have drawn the serious attention of archaeologists and historians worldwide. With at least three distinct sets of petroglyphs, the earliest thought to date back over 5000 years, it is assumed that the Edakkal caves had been inhabited at various stages in history. This cave is accessible only by a kilometre trekking\\/hiking from Edakal. After noon by 02.00 pm reach Muthanga wild life sanctuary for wild life safari. Spread over a vast area Muthanga is part of Wayanad wildlife sanctuary. A variety of large wild animals such as gaur, Asian elephant, deer and tiger etc...are found here. Enjoy a 02 hrs wild life jeep safari from 03.00 pm to 05.00 pm (On direct payment basis). Return to hotel and over night at Wayanad.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note \\u2013 Today you can also plan for an alternate visit for 900 kandi by offroad jeep safari. Adventure activities like Zip line at Karlad lake, paragliding, trekking&nbsp; etc\\u2026(on direct payment basis)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Wayanad to Kannur (130kms\\/ 3.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"20-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout and transfer to Kannur. On the way visit Banasura Sagar dam - It is the largest earthen dam in India and the second largest in Asia. One of the must visit in Wayanad. The view point pathway is a kilometre away from the main gate and you can choose to walk or take a van ride. Once you reach the top, the view of the reservoir and the mountains is truly serene and breathtaking. Then proceed to Kannur, The coastal town Kannur, believed to be the ancient port of Naura, from whose shores King Solomon\\u2019s ships collected timber to build the great temple of Jerusalem. Now known as city of looms and lore\\u2019s because of a considerable number of handloom industries functional in this area and also the rituals and folklores namely Theyyam practiced in the temples of this region (during Nov to May). On arrival check in hotel, later visit Light house museum \\u2013 This is the fourth light house museum ever constructed in India. The evolution of the technologies in the lighthouse apparatuses and the developments in the lamps are the main point of interests that the Lighthouse Museum focuses on. Also visit the light house here which is 75 feet tall which gives you an amazing view. Then visit Handloom museum - Ten galleries that showcase the origin of the fabric, beginning of handloom, the history of weaving machines, the outfits in various ages etc...St. Angelo\\u2019s fort which is built by Portuguese in 16 century and then visit Payambalam beach one of the famous beaches in Kannur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart from Kannur\",\"date\":\"21-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning after breakfast checkout from hotel and if time permits - visit Parassini kadavu temple which attracts visitors from across the world. You can also do motor boat, speed boat, house boat cruises in Parassini river in front of the temple. Then proceed to Kannur airport for return journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Tour Ends.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6814\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:25 AM\",\"fare\":\"15890\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Kannur(cannanore) (CNN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"591\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:50 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kannur(cannanore) (CNN)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"592\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":14866},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6082\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/02\\/2024\",\"city\":\"COORG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Aurika Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/02\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/02\\/2024\",\"city\":\"WAYANAD\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vythiri Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/02\\/2024\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/02\\/2024\",\"city\":\"KANNUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Anansa by Kannur Club\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/02\\/2024\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Delhi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Coorg.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Wayanad.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Kannur.</strong></li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner @ Coorg &amp; Wayanad </strong>&amp; Only <strong>Breakfast @ Kannur.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Swift Dzire/Etios&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary (A/C will be switched off during hilly drives).</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":30756,\"land_cost\":\"95550\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":126306,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22735.08\",\"selling_price\":149041.0800000000162981450557708740234375}', 'MZQ/0448/012024', 148800, 74400, 0, '2024-01-11 10:36:04', '2024-01-11 10:36:04', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>The above Price doesn\'t include:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any monuments\\/park entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any other meal not mentioned in price includes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any other destinations not mentioned in the itinerary<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any expenses of personal nature.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Important Things to Note:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Vehicle is as per the itinerary only &amp; not at disposal. Means, it covers the given sightseeing only.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rates subject to total no. of passengers travelling together as per mentioned in each column.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rooms in hill stations like Wayanad, Munnar, Thekkady, Vagamon, Coorg, Ooty etc... are normally non a\\/c. In some hotels there are options to book a\\/c rooms on additional charges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rooms subject to availability. We are not holding any rooms.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Photo ID card mandatory while you are on tour (Pan Card not valid)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022Hotel Check in time is 02:00 PM &amp; Check out time is 10:00 AM. Early check in or late checkout will&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; be as per availability.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022Using base category of rooms at respective hotels, unless specified<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Sightseeing will be as per time permissible only<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
