>All <strong>Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island - Pileh Lagoon - Khai Island - Maya Bay </strong>By Speed Boat with Lunch&nbsp;SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>James Bond Island</strong> By Big Boat with Lunch SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Coral Island&nbsp;Tour&nbsp;</strong>By Speedboat with Indian Lunch&nbsp;SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Dinner Cruise&nbsp;</strong>SIC</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Airport To Phuket Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer&nbsp;Phuket Hotel&nbsp;To Phuket Airport PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok BKK Airport To Pattaya Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Pattaya Hotel&nbsp; To Bangkok Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Free Thailand VISA on Arrival</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":183390,\"hotel_cost\":71545,\"land_cost\":\"61250\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":316185,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 31618.5\",\"selling_price\":347803.5,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"4.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0454/012024', 348000, 69600, 0, '2024-01-17 13:38:10', '2024-01-17 13:47:24', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(461, 'Mr S L Jain', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LUXURY KASHMIR', '2024-02-04', 5, NULL, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"04-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"05-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"06-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Pahalgam Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"07-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Gulamarg Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately) Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"08-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar HouseBoat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"09-02-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"643\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"fare\":13104},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"713\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Feb 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Feb 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":13144}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/02\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vivanta By Taj\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Delight Room\",\"check_out\":\"06\\/02\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/02\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"07\\/02\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hotel Pine n Peak\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"07\\/02\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"08\\/02\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hotel The Khyber Himalayan Resorts and Spa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"08\\/02\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"check_out\":\"09\\/02\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Super Deluxe HouseBoat\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangeme