LL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"26\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":36702,\"land_cost\":\"62895\",\"visa_cost\":\"6000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":105597,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27455.22\",\"selling_price\":133052.22000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0465/022024', 132900, 66450, 62300, '2024-02-08 08:36:47', '2024-02-12 12:29:40', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(472, 'Mr Ritesh', 'Pankaj Lakhani', '8789998213', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KERALA', '2024-03-07', 3, 1, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Cochin \\u2013 Munnar (135kms\\/4hrs)\",\"date\":\"07-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Cochin airport and transfer to Munnar. Munnar is a picturesque hill station situated in the eastern part of Kerala; lush green-carpeted tea and coffee plantations surround it. The beautiful landscapes, cosy weather, and the smell of tealeaves make Munnar one of the most sought-after destinations in South India. Munnar is situated near the Anaimudi Peak, the highest peak in the Western Ghats. On the way - stop at&nbsp;<strong>Cheeyappara waterfalls<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar\",\"date\":\"08-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;morning after breakfast visit&nbsp;<strong>Eravikulam National Park&nbsp;<\\/strong>famous for Nilghiri Mountain goats,<strong>&nbsp;The Tea museum&nbsp;<\\/strong>explains the processing of tea.&nbsp;<strong>Mattuppetty dam&nbsp;<\\/strong>which has an artificial lake built by a small Hydroelectric project.&nbsp;<strong>Echo Point&nbsp;<\\/strong>is known for the natural echo effect it produces.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar \\u2013 Allepey(170kms\\/4.5hrs)\",\"date\":\"09-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out of the hotel. Drive to Alleppey and arrive by the afternoon, Alleppey is known as Venice of the east for its vast network of narrow canals and big lakes, House boats are olden days rice boats which used to transport items like rice and coconuts across Kerala. Check into the Houseboat and enjoy the delicious Kerala lunch, and the rest of the day at leisure cruising in the backwater and narrow canals to see the local life and green fields, etc... Cruise till 05.30 pm.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Dinner and Stay overnight at the Houseboat. (Check-in time 12. Noon\\/ Check out \\u2013 09.00 am)<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey - Cochin (85kms\\/2.5hrs)\",\"date\":\"10-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out of the hotel.<br \\/>\\nDrive to Cochin to catch your return flight with sweet Memories of Kerala.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6799\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Mar 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Mar 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"fare\":\"19164\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"703\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Mar 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Mar 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"571\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"20276\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6113\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Eterno Camellia & Elettaria\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Valley View\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/03\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"17400\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPEY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deluxe House Boat 01 Bed\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"rooms\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/03\\/2024\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"12075\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Munnar.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Alleppey.</strong></li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner @Munnar </strong>&amp; <strong>All Meals @HouseBoat.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers&nbsp;by <strong>Dzire/Etios&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary (A/C will be switched off during hilly drives).</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"43277\",\"land_cost\":\"9000\",\"hotel_cost\":29475,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":81752,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14715.36\",\"selling_price\":96467.360000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0466/022024', 96400, 30967, 3499, '2024-02-08 09:42:14', '2024-03-05 07:28:39', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>The above Price doesn\'t include:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any monuments\\/park entrance fees, camera fees, guide charges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any other meal not mentioned in price includes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any other destinations not mentioned in the itinerary<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7 Any expenses of personal nature.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Important Things to Note:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Vehicle is as per the itinerary only &amp; not at disposal. Means, it covers the given sightseeing only.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rates subject to total no. of passengers travelling together as per mentioned in each column.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rooms in hill stations like Wayanad, Munnar, Thekkady, Vagamon, Coorg, Ooty etc... are normally non a\\/c. In some hotels there are options to book a\\/c rooms on additional charges.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Rooms subject to availability. We are not holding any rooms.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Photo ID card mandatory while you are on tour (Pan Card not valid)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022Hotel Check in time is 02:00 PM &amp; Check out time is 10:00 AM. Early check in or late checkout will&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; be as per availability.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022Using base category of rooms at respective hotels, unless specified<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2022 Sightseeing will be as per time permissible only<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
