ult show</li>\n	<li>Game Rental / KTV Rooms / Conference Facilities</li>\n	<li>Shore Excursions</li>\n	<li>Glow Bowl</li>\n	<li>Exercise Classes and Personal Trainer</li>\n	<li>Casino and Gambling Activities</li>\n	<li>Dining Entertainment</li>\n	<li>Transfers and airfares (unless pre-purchased with air/sea packages)</li>\n	<li>Hotel Stays pre-/post-cruise (unless pre-purchased)</li>\n	<li>Duty-free shopping</li>\n	<li>Photography</li>\n	<li>Internet Access</li>\n	<li>Baby Sitting Services</li>\n	<li>Specialty Onboard Seminars</li>\n	<li>Art purchases</li>\n	<li>Gift shop purchases</li>\n	<li>Video Arcade</li>\n	<li>Phone calls off the ship</li>\n	<li>Wi/Fi &amp; Satellite connection for tablets, phones/mobile devices</li>\n	<li>Laundry Services</li>\n	<li>Use of the Medical Centre</li>\n	<li>Any additional credit card and fuel surcharges; and taxes on the provision of additional services, including services that are not provided by Resort World Cruises.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78231,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"10500\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"SINGAPORE LAND\",\"amount\":104265},{\"name\":\"Malaysia Visa\",\"amount\":9600},{\"name\":\"Malaysia Land\",\"amount\":37315},{\"name\":\"Coach Ticket with Transfers\",\"amount\":\"10000\"}],\"cost_price\":249911,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 37486.65\",\"selling_price\":287397.650000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0471/022024', 287600, 104900, 77800, '2024-02-20 13:45:29', '2024-02-20 13:45:29', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(478, 'Mr Mangukiya Jigar Pravinbhai', 'BNI | CELEB', '9687110148', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok,Darjeeling & Pelling', '2024-03-05', 5, 1, 7, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"05-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Pelling\",\"date\":\"06-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for Pelling (6,300 Ft. \\/ 120 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs.). On arrival check in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling Full Day Sightseeing with Skywalk\",\"date\":\"07-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, cover Darap village, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground.&nbsp; Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling to Darjeeling - Halfday Sightseeing and Transfer\",\"date\":\"08-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for a half-day sightseeing and visit Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground. In afternoon, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft. \\/ 80 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.) via Singla Check post. On arrival check-in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"09-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to the hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday&nbsp;closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"10-03-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Pinasa Residency\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/03\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"7800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Pelling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Palm Residency\",\"room_type\":\"Kanchenjunga View Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/03\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"15600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"08\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel North Star\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/03\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"17600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Gangtok Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed/Mattress.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;Pelling Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed/Mattress..</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation at&nbsp;Darjeeling Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed/Mattress.s.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>Private 01&nbsp; Non AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova + 01 Wagon R</strong> as per itinerary on point to point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in the Hill area).&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":41000,\"transport_cost\":\"60000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":101000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15150\",\"selling_price\":116150,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"92.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0472/022024', 116200, 16600, 0, '2024-02-24 14:40:25', '2024-02-26 06:51:11', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(479, 'Mr. Saket Saraf', 'BNI', '9835574327', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ALMATY', '2024-04-18', 4, 0, 12, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DELHI \\u2013 ALMATY \\u2013 WELCOMES YOU\",\"date\":\"18-04-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Land at Almaty International Airport @ 1520 hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Clear Customs, Get your passport stamped collect your luggage<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Meet your tour manager in the arrivals area.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer in an AC Vehicle to your hotel<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Check-in into the hotel.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Get Rest at the hotel.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1900 Hrs Proceed for Dinner at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer&nbsp;to&nbsp;Hotel<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free&nbsp;time \\u2013 can&nbsp;explore&nbsp;night&nbsp;Life&nbsp;activities on&nbsp;your&nbsp;own.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight&nbsp;at&nbsp;Hotel.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY ALMATY CITY TOUR FOLLOWED BY VISIT TO ZILYONI BAZAAR\",\"date\":\"19-04-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Breakfast 0700-1000 Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>10:30 AM Almaty city Tour with English speaking guide<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>You will know more about history and development of the southern capital of Kazakhstan and see its major attractions: Palace of President, Republic Square and Monument of Independence, and Astana Square, Panfilov Park, Abai Square and Palace of Republic, Presidential Park.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Proceed for Lunch at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>14:30 PM Continue Almaty City Tour, Rakhat Chocolate Factory shop and Local Market Zilyoni - Bazaar.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>You can buy Chocolates from Rakhat Chocolate Factory shop; can buy Dry Fruits at cheap rates and some souvenirs from Zilyoni Bazaar.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free time to Relax a bit after a long walk.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1900 Hrs Proceed for Dinner at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer Back to Hotel<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free time \\u2013 can explore night activities at you own<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight in hotel<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ALMATY - MEADOWS & CHIMBULAK TOUR\",\"date\":\"20-04-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Breakfast 0700-1000 Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer to excursion at 10:30 Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>This tour provides you the best opportunity to see the beautiful mountain surroundings of Almaty city. The first stop of the tour awaits you in the Meadow Gorge, where in the wonderful mountains of Trans-Ili Ala-Tau the largest high mountain skating rink in the world is located as well as the huge dam, protecting the city from destructive mudflows formed on the tops of the western Tien Shan. Next destination is Chimbulak ski resort (Cable Car Fee Included), located at an altitude of 2230 meters above sea level. It is very popular for its mild climate, large quantity of sunny days and snow through the winter and remarkable scenery of mountain ranges.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Proceed for Lunch at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free time to Look Around!!!!<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1900 Hrs Transfer for Gala Dinner (with 2+2 Snacks, Local Vodka &amp; Beer, Soft drinks, Mixtures, Belly Dance Performance &amp; Music) at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer to Hotel<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free time \\u2013 can explore night activities at you own<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight in Hotel<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ALMATY \\u2013 VISIT TO GORKY PARK (ENTRY ONLY) FOLLOWED BY KOK-TOBE TOUR\",\"date\":\"21-04-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Breakfast 0700-1000 Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Proceed to Gorky Park (Gorky Central Park is a public park located in the heart of Almaty, Kazakhstan. It was founded in 1856 and has since become one of the most popular recreational areas in the city. The park covers an area of over 100 hectares and is named after the famous Russian writer Maxim Gorky.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Gorky Park features a variety of attractions and amenities including walking paths, playgrounds, sports fields, cafes, restaurants, and a small lake. Visitors can rent bicycles or rollerblades to explore the park or simply relax on the grassy lawns. In the winter months, the park transforms into a winter wonderland with ice skating rinks and other seasonal activities.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Throughout the year, the park hosts various cultural and entertainment events including music concerts, art exhibitions, and outdoor movie screenings. Gorky Park is a great place for families, friends, and couples to spend a leisurely day in a beautiful and peaceful setting.)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>1400 Hrs Proceed for Lunch at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Proceed towards the tour of Kok-Tobe. It is a mountain which is the highest point of Almaty, Kazakhstan\'s largest city. There is a popular recreation area on top of the mountain. The mountain\'s height is 1100 meters above sea level. Kok-tobe is one of the main landmarks in the city, and it is popular among visitors and tourists to Almaty.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>The Kok-Tobe recreational area has a variety of amusement park type attractions and restaurants. The City Terminal is located near Hotel Kazakhstan. Also, there is a 372 meters tall TV Tower at the foot of the mountain. The tower can be seen from most parts of the city.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1900 Hrs Proceed for Dinner at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Free time \\u2013 can explore night Life activities at you own.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SHOPPING TOUR & GOODBYE ALMATY\",\"date\":\"22-04-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Breakfast&nbsp;0700-1000 Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Check-Out&nbsp;from&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;@&nbsp;1200&nbsp;Hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1330 Hrs Proceed for Lunch at Indian Restaurant<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Transfer for Mega Mall for Shopping<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Drop&nbsp;to&nbsp;Almaty&nbsp;International&nbsp;Airport&nbsp;to&nbsp;board&nbsp;a&nbsp;flight&nbsp;to&nbsp;India<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"908\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Apr 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Apr 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"963\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Apr 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Apr 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/04\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Almaty\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Atlas\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":6,\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"22\\/04\\/2024\",\"meal\":\"ap\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Return Airfare</strong> on Air Astana Ex-Delhi (Delhi – Almaty – Delhi)</li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in the mentioned Hotel @ Almaty</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Buffet Breakfast </strong>in the hotel</li>\n	<li><strong>04 Lunch &amp; 03 Dinners @ Indian Restaurant </strong>(Fixed Menu)</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Gala Dinner </strong>(with 2+2 Snacks, Local Vodka &amp; Beer, Soft drinks, Mixtures, Belly Dance Performance &amp; Music) at Indian Restaurant</li>\n	<li><strong>Almaty city tour</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Kok-Tobe tour </strong>by cable car</li>\n	<li><strong>Meadows and Shymbulak tour</strong> with Cable Car tickets included</li>\n	<li><strong>2x bottles of 500 ml water</strong> per person per day</li>\n	<li><strong>Return Airport transfers </strong>on Pvt Basis</li>\n	<li><strong>All Tours &amp; Transfers </strong>on Pvt Basis</li>\n	<li><strong>Professional English-speaking guide</strong> during tours</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>TCS*</strong></li>\n	<li>Security Deposit at the time of Hotel Check-in</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>50% Advance at the time of holding</li>\n	<li>25 % 21 Days before Departure,</li>\n	<li>25% 14 Days before departure.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Cancellation prior 40 days – No Charges</li>\n	<li>Cancellation prior 30 days – 50% charge of the tour price</li>\n	<li>Cancellation prior 15 days – 100% charge of the tour price</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"672000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":672000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 67200\",\"selling_price\":739200}', 'MZQ/0473/022024', 739200, 61600, 0, '2024-02-27 11:40:25', '2024-02-27 12:02:55', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(480, 'Mr. Manmeet Bindra', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Phuket & Krabi', '2024-06-05', 5, 0, 4, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1073\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"155568\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1074\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Krabi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Centara Life Phu Pano\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/06\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"13241\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Phuket\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Patong Paragon Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/06\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"24734\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Krabi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nts </strong>Accommodation at <strong>Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Room </strong>on <strong>Double Sharing</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>4 Island Tour&nbsp;By Long Tail Boat</strong> with Indian Beach Lunch&nbsp;Set Meal&nbsp;SIC (Excluding NPF @200 THB per pax)</li>\n	<li><strong>Phuket City Tour with Big Buddha</strong>&nbsp;Indian Beach Lunch&nbsp;Set Meal&nbsp;SIC&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island &amp; Khai Island Tour&nbsp;By Speed Boat </strong>with Indian Lunch&nbsp;SIC&nbsp;(Excluding NPF @400 THB per pax)</li>\n	<li><strong>Fanta-Sea Show</strong>&nbsp;with Dinner SIC</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket HKT Airport To Krabi Hotel PVT&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Transfer Krabi Hotel To Phuket Hotel PVT&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Hotel To Phuket HKT Airport PVT&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":155568,\"hotel_cost\":37975,\"l