(482, 'Mr Rashmi Jeet', 'Walkin', '9570874056', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KERALA 4*', '2024-03-06', 5, NULL, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Cochin\",\"date\":\"06-03-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Cochin airport and transfer to hotel. &nbsp;Check in and relax. Afternoon visit the Mattancherry Dutch Palace - (closed on&nbsp;Fridays&nbsp;and public holidays), which was built by the Portuguese in 1555 and renovated by the Dutch in 1663. Visit a Jewish Synagogue-(closed on all&nbsp;Saturdays&nbsp;and Jewish holidays) in Jew Town.&nbsp; Proceed to Fort Cochin Area. There are a couple of streets of picture-postcard houses out of another age. Visit St. Francis Church - (closed for visitors on&nbsp;Sundays&nbsp;from 08.00 to 11.00 hrs.) the oldest European Church in India. It has several antiquities including a wealth of records. See the Chinese Fishing Nets, along the tip of Fort Cochin unique to this part of Kerala and living symbols of a centuries-old Chinese influence on this coast.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight at the hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin to Munnar (135kms\\/4hrs)\",\"date\":\"07-03-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout and transfer to Munnar. Munnar is a picturesque hill station situated in the eastern part of Kerala; lush green-carpeted tea and coffee plantations surround it. The beautiful landscapes, cozy weather, and the smell of tea leaves make Munnar one of the most sought-after destinations in South India. Munnar is situated near the Anaimudi Peak, the highest peak in the Western Ghats. On the way - stop at&nbsp;<strong>Cheeyappara waterfalls<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar\",\"date\":\"08-03-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;morning after breakfast visit,<strong>&nbsp;Tea museum&nbsp;<\\/strong>explains about the processing of tea.&nbsp;<strong>Mattuppetty dam&nbsp;<\\/strong>which has an artificial lake built by a small Hydro-electric project.&nbsp;<strong>Echo Point&nbsp;<\\/strong>is known for the natural echo affect it produces. Stop for photo shoot at photo point.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar \\u2013 Thekkady (110kms\\/3.5hrs)\",\"date\":\"09-03-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;after breakfast depart for Thekkady by road. Arrive at Thekkady and transfer to the hotel. The town also houses one of the world\\u2019s most fascinating natural wildlife sanctuaries. A visit to Thekkady also provides you the opportunity to see wildlife at close ranges, besides the varied vegetation and a wide variety of birds. Lying at an altitude of 700-1900 m above sea level, Thekkady has a cool and comfortable climate. Out here, you can also go for treks and mountain walks or visit&nbsp;<strong>spice plantation, or enjoy a boat ride at Lake Periyar<\\/strong>,&nbsp;<strong>Kathakali, Kalarippayattu show, etc<\\/strong>.<strong>..<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight at the hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thekkady - Alleppey (160kms\\/4hrs)\",\"date\":\"10-03-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out of the hotel. Drive to Alleppey and arrive by the afternoon, enjoy the cruise in the backwaters (on direct payment). Evening visit Alleppey beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight at the Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart from Kochi (100 kms\\/ 3.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"11-03-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>The morning after breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to Kochi for the departure train.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>End of the Tour &amp; Our Service<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Cochin\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Luxo\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Junior Suite Room + 02 SGL Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/03\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Munnar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Broadbean\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Premium Suite Room + 02 SGL Superior Club Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/03\\/2024\",\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Thekkady\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Wild Avenue\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Aromatic Suite Room + 02 SGL Gardenia Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/03\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"10\\/03\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Alleppey\",\"hotel_name\":\"A\\/C Luxury Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Bedroom\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/03\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Cochin.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Munnar.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Thekkady.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Alleppey.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all respected Hotels.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by <strong>02</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Innova Crysta.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Children</strong> ages 03 Yrs &amp; 0.6 Yrs<strong> are Complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>All Toll / Parking/ Driver Allowances.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"104500\",\"transport_cost\":\"39600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":144100,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21615\",\"selling_price\":165715}', 'MZQ/0475/022024', 165600, 41400, 0, '2024-02-29 10:04:22', '2024-02-29 12:03:07', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(483, 'Mr Tushar Patel', 'BNI | CELEB | Jigar Patel', '9033333611', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'NORTH EAST 3*', '2024-05-22', 5, 1, 7, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"22-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Pelling\",\"date\":\"23-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for Pelling (6,300 Ft. \\/ 120 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs.). On arrival check in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling Full Day Sightseeing with Skywalk\",\"date\":\"24-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, cover Darap village, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground.&nbsp; Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling to Darjeeling - Halfday Sightseeing and Transfer\",\"date\":\"25-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for a half-day sightseeing and visit Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground. In afternoon, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft. \\/ 80 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.) via Singla Check post. On arrival check-in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"26-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to the hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday&nbsp;closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"27-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Pinasa Residency\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"9600\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Pelling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Palm Bliss\",\"room_type\":\"Kanchenjunga View Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"20200\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Star\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"22200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Gangtok Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;Pelling Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation at&nbsp;Darjeeling Hotel&nbsp;on <strong>03&nbsp;Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>Private 01&nbsp; Non AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova + 01 Wagon R</strong> as per itinerary on point to point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in the Hill area).&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":52000,\"transport_cost\":\"60000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":112000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16800\",\"selling_price\":128800,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0476/022024', 128800, 18400, 0, '2024-02-29 11:50:29', '2024-02-29 12:22:59', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
