(488, 'Ms. Shivani Maroo', 'Dr Rajesh Maroo', '9438760181', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 4*', '2024-05-16', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"16-05-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at the&nbsp;Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to the&nbsp;Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and&nbsp;Overnight stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"17-05-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 52 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;02:00&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.).You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"18-05-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about&nbsp;140 kms, and will be covered in about 03:00 -03:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost)&nbsp;,Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Halt  - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"19-05-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car&nbsp;(Own Cost)&nbsp;famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam -  Srinagar (Viz. Mughal Garden)\",\"date\":\"20-05-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar&nbsp;Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, Cheshmashahi,Pari mahal,&nbsp;ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar,Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"21-05-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning&nbsp;,proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 2:00-2:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride (at your own cost) to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero Point&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Srinagar Airport\",\"date\":\"22-05-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel and drive to Airport&nbsp; to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6947\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:15 PM\",\"fare\":26524},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6946\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"fare\":27728}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Palm Spring\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"check_out\":\"17\\/05\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/05\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"check_out\":\"18\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/05\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"check_out\":\"20\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine Spring\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"HouseBoat Wangnoo Sheratoon\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Palm Spring\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelle