(497, 'Ms. Shalini', 'Mr. Prabhakar', '9873171167', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2024-06-09', 5, NULL, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"09-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"10-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"11-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;&nbsp;can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"12-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Tulip Garden&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return to the Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"13-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar. Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"14-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2332\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"45976\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2747\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2137\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"44236\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"09\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Heritage Luxury\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"check_out\":\"10\\/06\\/2024\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/06\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"11\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sparrow\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"11\\/06\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"12\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Gulmarg House\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Batoo\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"ni