accommodation</strong> at Hotel Gulmarg House at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Batoo&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova </strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Day trip to Sonmarg</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong>&nbsp;in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"23\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":90212,\"land_cost\":\"84000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":174212,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 40068.76\",\"selling_price\":214280.76000000000931322574615478515625}', 'MZQ/0490/042024', 214400, 53600, NULL, '2024-04-06 06:35:18', '2024-06-10 11:28:54', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(498, 'MR SIDHARTH', 'SONU GAYA', '7631137987', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Mauritius', '2024-07-20', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Mauritius\",\"date\":\"20-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Arrive at the most charming place in Africa<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On your arrival in Mauritius, you will be picked up from the airport by the transfer services we offer. Proceed to the hotel and complete the check-in formalities. Head to your room and relax for the day. As you have the entire day for leisure, you can explore the classic facilities in your hotel or go out and explore the nearby places.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ile Aux Cerfs Day Tour\",\"date\":\"21-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Have a fun day enjoying at Ile Aux Cerfs<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the second day of your tour, get ready after a delicious breakfast. This day is planned for excursion to Ile Aux Cerfs. Head out with the representative and reach the place. It is a private island located in the east coast of Mauritius and boasts the largest lagoon here. You may also take part in parasailing, underwater walking and more in Ile Aux Cerfs. Note that these activities are to be done at an extra cost, paid in person by the traveler. Have an adventurous day here. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North Island Day Tour\",\"date\":\"22-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Explore and enjoy in the North island of Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the third day, have your breakfast and get ready for the day. You will be covering the major attractions of North Island today. Proceed with the transfer and reach the North island. Some of the major places you can visit here are the Port Louis Caudan Waterfront, Grand Baie, China Town and Mauritius Aquarium. Enjoy at these places. Any entry fee, if required, must be met by the travelers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"South island Day Tour\",\"date\":\"23-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Spend an entire day having fun at South island<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the fourth day of the tour, get ready after breakfast. This day is planned for SOuth Island tour. Reach the South Island in Mauritius and begin sightseeing of the major tourist spots here. Some of the best places that you can visit here are the Crocodile Farm &amp; Nature Park, Bois Cheri- Tea Plantation and Factory, Saint Aubin Tea House, Grand Bassin, Mangal Mahadev- Shiva Statue and the village of Gris- Gris. You have the whole day to enjoy according to your own will. Have authentic Mauritian food during anytime of the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"24-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Make some adventurous memories Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the fifth day of your tour, have breakfast at the hotel. Get ready after that and proceed with the day\\u2019s itinerary. This day in entirely for leisure. It is a good chance to go out and try various activities in the shores of Mauritius. You may go for kayaking, snorkeling, swimming or scuba diving. You may also choose to relax by the pool of the resort. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"25-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Spend a leisurely day in Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the sixth day of your tour, have breakfast. The entire day is for leisure. Spend it according to your own will. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"26-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Say good-bye to Mauritius with warm memories<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the seventh day of your tour, have breakfast and proceed to check out. The transfer service will drop you off at the airport. Board the flight and return to India with warm memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"850\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"121000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Mauritius (MRU)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"241\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Mauritius (MRU)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"242\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"Vistara\",\"fno\":\"857\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:25 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/07\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Ocean Facing Room\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"27\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"MAURITIUS\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel InterContinental\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"127588\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Bangalore</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>06&nbsp;Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Deluxe Ocean Facing Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>RoundTrip Airport&nbsp;transfers.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet at Mauritius International Airport.</li>\n	<li>Stylish check-in with a glass of bubbly or soft drink of your choice.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfasts&nbsp;</strong>&amp; <strong>Dinners</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Flower Bed Decoration </strong>with Cake.</li>\n	<li>Full day <b>North Island Tour.</b></li>\n	<li>Full day <b>South Island Tour.</b></li>\n	<li>Full day<b> Ile Aux Cerf Tour.</b></li>\n	<li>All tours &amp; Transfers on SIC.</li>\n	<li>Wireless internet access is&nbsp;available throughout the resort.</li>\n	<li>Green Tax.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":121000,\"hotel_cost\":127588},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Flower bed + Cake\",\"amount\":8000}],\"cost_price\":256588,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46185.84\",\"selling_price\":302773.839999999967403709888458251953125}', 'MZQ/0491/042024', 303800, 151900, 0, '2024-04-06 11:27:51', '2024-05-11 12:05:16', 0, 1, '\"<ol>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Check In time is 15:00 hours.Check Out time is 12:00 hours.For Guaranteed Early Check. In &amp; Late Check. Out, 60% of the room rate will be charged.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Unexpected departure - 100% fee on unused nights &amp; No Show - 100% fee on whole stay<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Child Policy\\u2022 Child 0-3 years will be provided complimentary Breakfast.\\u2022 Child 4-11 Years old is chargeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Complimentary Water Sports at the hotel: Snorkelling, Paddle Boats, Kayaking.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>City tax and Resort fee are to be paid directly at hotel if applicable.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\"', 0, 0),
(499, 'Mr. Ravi Ranjan Kumar', 'India Post', '8210154767', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Himachal Pradesh', '2024-05-21', 5, 3, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla\",\"date\":\"21-05-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Chandigarh Airport \\/ Station and depart for Shimla by road. Shimla the state capital of Himachal Pradesh is surrounded by pine deodar, oak, and rhododendron forests. Shimla was also the summer capital of the British Raj. Arrive Shimla and check into your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla\",\"date\":\"22-05-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning post breakfast, proceed for an excursion to Kufri &amp; later visit Himachal State Museum, Vice Regal Lodge, Jakoo Hill, Lakkar Bazaar &amp; Walk through the Mall Road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"23-05-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After early breakfast get transferred to Manali.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"24-05-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>This morning visit Hadimba Temple, Manu Mandir, Vashisth Kund, Tibetan Monastery &amp; Handicraft Centre. Rest of the day is at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"25-05-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post Breakfast visit Solang Valley OR Optionally visit Rohtang Pass (On Own).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"26-05-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After early breakfast drive to Chandigarh, on arrival Transfer to Chandigarh Airport \\/ Railway Station for onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Shimla\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Golden Fern Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL + 02 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Manali\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Utopia Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"DBL + 02 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"26\\/05\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":12},{\"age\":11},{\"age\":9}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Golden Fern Resort / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Shimla</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Tulip Cottage&nbsp;/ Similar&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Manali</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02 DBL + 02 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well appointed Air-Conditioned Room</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily)..</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>Tours &amp; Sightseeing by Private Sanitized <strong>SUV. (</strong><em>AC will not work in Hilly Areas</em><strong>)</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"162752\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":162752,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 32550.4\",\"selling_price\":195302.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0492/042024', 194400, 33600, 20000, '2024-04-12 10:31:37', '2024-04-12 10:35:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(501, 'Mr. Suresh', 'MZ CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2024-04-24', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"24-04-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Welcome to Singapore! On arrival at Singapore Airport, complete all necessary formalities &amp; transfer to hotel. Later in the afternoon, we proceed to Singapore Night Safari. The Singapore Night Safari is the world\'s first nocturnal zoo, offering a unique and immersive wildlife experience after dark. Located in the Mandai rainforest, it spans 35 hectares and is home to over 2,500 animals representing more than 130 species Guests have the opportunity to explore Bird Paradise. With 3,500 feathery residents from more than 400 species, Bird Paradise more than lives up to its name. These spectacular habitats have been designed not just for the viewing pleasure of visitors, but to simulate the home ecologies of the park\\u2019s inhabitants, from adorable penguins to mesmerizing songbirds.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"25-04-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast at the hotel, you begin your tour of the city. Your half-day tour of Singapore will include all major attractions such as Merlion Park, Fountain of Wealth, Chinatown, Little India, City Hall, and Parliament House. Shop for souvenirs at the Chinatown Street market and try the uniquely Singaporean Roti Prata at Little India.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"26-04-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at your Hotel. Universal Studios is Southeast Asia\\u2019s first and only Universal Studios theme park, featuring 24 rides, shows, and attractions in seven themed zones. It\\u2019s a perfect destination for families and adrenaline junkies with breathtaking rides and themed movie sets. Experience cutting-edge rides, shows, and attractions based on your favorite blockbuster films and television series, including Puss In Boots\\u2019 Giant Journey, Battlestar Galactica: HUMAN vs. CYLON\\u2122, TRANSFORMERS The Ride: The Ultimate 3D Battle, Jurassic Park Rapids Adventure\\u2122, Sesame Street Spaghetti Space Chase and more!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"27-04-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Breakfast at the Hotel. Later we proceed to Half Day Sentosa Island Tour. Start your Sentosa experience on a high by riding the Singapore Cable Car Sky Network from Faber Peak Singapore into the island. It\'s the ultimate fun day out for the whole family.&nbsp;<br \\/>\\nMadame Tussauds (5 in 1): Meet your favorite stars from Hollywood, Bollywood, TV, sports, and more at Madame Tussauds Singapore. This 5-in-1 experience comes free with your pass. Experiences include: Madame Tussauds Singapore, Images of Singapore, Spirit of Singapore Boat Ride, Marvel 4D Experience &amp; Ultimate Film Star Experience<br \\/>\\nS.E.A Aquarium: The S.E.A. Aquarium features a diverse range of marine life, including various species of fish, sharks, rays, and other aquatic creatures.<br \\/>\\nWings of Time: \\\"Wings of Time\\\" is a multimedia night show located on Sentosa Island in Singapore. It is a popular outdoor attraction that combines water, laser, fire, and music to create a spectacular visual display.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"28-04-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel. Today afternoon we set out for a half-day excursion to Gardens by the Bay (2 Domes) &amp; Marina Bay Sands Sky Park with an Observation Deck. Gardens by the Bay is a nature park spanning 101 hectares. The conservatory complex at Gardens by the Bay, Singapore, comprises two cooled conservatories \\u2013 the Flower Dome &amp; the Cloud Forest. Our next stop is Marina Bay Sands Sky Park with Observation Deck. Located 57 stories up from the heart of the Marina Bay area, the Sky Park Observation Deck boasts scenic views of the panoramic vistas of Marina Bay and Singapore\\u2019s world-class cityscape.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore\",\"date\":\"29-04-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy your last morning in Singapore before checking out and being transferred to the airport, where you will depart for your destination with bags full of souvenirs and happy memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1005\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Apr 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 AM\",\"fare\":84550},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1006\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/04\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ibis Budget Imperial\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2024\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telep