2 Domes) &amp; Sky Park at Marina Bay Sands on Seat in Coach Basis&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All Local Taxes &amp; Charges</li>\n	<li><strong>All Tours &amp; Transfers</strong> on Seat in Coach Basis.</li>\n	<li>Singapore Visa.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>5% TCS</strong> will be Applicable on <strong>Land</strong> &amp; <strong>Cruise Portion</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":84550,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"113471\",\"visa_cost\":\"10000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":208021,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 31203.15\",\"selling_price\":239224.14999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0494/042024', 239000, 92000, 55000, '2024-04-13 11:41:10', '2024-04-13 11:42:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
