 not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Bangalore.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in<strong> Hotel Hotel Holiday International Hotel Bur Dubai.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast </strong>at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Airport transfers</strong> on PVT.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong> with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong> Fountain Show </strong>on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124-125th Floor</strong> on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Dhow Cruise </strong>on SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Desert Safari </strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, and other camp activities on SIC.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>\n	<style type=\"text/css\"><!--td {border: 1px solid #cccccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}-->\n	</style>\n	<strong>Dubai Frame&nbsp;</strong>on PVT.</li>\n	<li><b>Museum of the Future&nbsp;</b>on PVT.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa </strong>with&nbsp;Insurance.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee @ <strong>20 AED</strong> Per Room Per Night payable directly while&nbsp;check in.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":95136,\"hotel_cost\":32600,\"land_cost\":\"93075\",\"visa_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":220811,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 2870