(505, 'Mr. Sundeep Khanna', 'BNI', '9835527233', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Kashmir 4* & Amritsar', '2024-05-29', 8, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"29-05-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar  Local sightseeing\",\"date\":\"30-05-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return to the Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Sonmarg ( 79  kms \\/ 2:17 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"31-05-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave&nbsp; for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Sonmarg   - Gulmarg  (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"01-06-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;&nbsp;can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg  - Pahalgam (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"02-06-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Katra (260 kms \\/ 6:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"03-06-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning&nbsp;in Pahalgam &amp; drive to&nbsp;Katra&nbsp;and check in at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in the Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Amritsar  Onward destination.\",\"date\":\"04-06-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in&nbsp;Katra&nbsp;and get ready for transfer to the Amritsar Airport \\/Railway Station for onward destination<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Amritsar\",\"date\":\"05-06-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Amritsar Sightseeing.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Amritsar\",\"date\":\"06-06-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Amritsar sightseeing &amp; Departure with Sweet memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Palm Spring \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed \\/ Mattress\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"30\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Sonmarg\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Imperial\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed \\/ Mattress\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"31\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed \\/ Mattress\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/06\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sparrow \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed \\/ Mattress\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Katra\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/06\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"DBL Room + 01 Extra Bed \\/ Mattress\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Devi Grand \\/ Similar\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"05\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Amritsar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regenta Place by Royal Orchid  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/06\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"8000\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":12}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel&nbsp;Palm Spring / Rose Petal at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Imperial&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Sonmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Park&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel Sparrow&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Devi Grand&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Jammu</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Regenta Place by Royal Orchid Hotels Limited&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Amritsar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;Double Room + 01&nbsp;Extra Bed / Mattress.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova Crysta&nbsp;</strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Day trip to Sonmarg</strong></li>\n	<li>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong>&nbsp;in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"136000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":136000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27200\",\"selling_price\":163200}', 'MZQ/0496/042024', 164240, 50610, 31510, '2024-04-15 10:22:47', '2024-04-19 14:50:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(506, 'Mr Ravi Ranjan Kumar', 'India Post', '8210154767', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok,Darjeeling & Pelling', '2024-05-21', 5, 3, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"21-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Pelling\",\"date\":\"22-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for Pelling (6,300 Ft. \\/ 120 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs.). On arrival check in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling Full Day Sightseeing with Skywalk\",\"date\":\"23-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, cover Darap village, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground.&nbsp; Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling to Darjeeling - Halfday Sightseeing and Transfer\",\"date\":\"24-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel &amp; start for a half-day sightseeing and visit Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground. In afternoon, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft. \\/ 80 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.) via Singla Check post. On arrival check-in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"25-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to the hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday&nbsp;closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"26-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Pinasa Residency  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"15600\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Pelling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rufina Palm Residency  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Kanchenjunga View Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"7600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel North Star  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/05\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"21000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":12},{\"age\":11},{\"age\":9}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Rufina Pinasa Residency / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Gangtok</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Rufina Palm Residency&nbsp;/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Pelling</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel North Star&nbsp; / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Darjeeling</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Acco