n	<li><strong>02 Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Bangkok.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Rooms&nbsp;</strong>on <strong>Double Sharing</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>4 Island Tour </strong>by Speed&nbsp;Boat with Picnic Lunch Transfer By Open Air Vehicle&nbsp;<em>(Ex. NP Fee THB 200 Per Pax)</em> SIC.</li>\n	<li>Enroute Krabi-Phuket : <strong>Phuket City Tour </strong>PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island - Pileh Lagoon - Khai Island - Maya Bay </strong>By Speed Boat with Lunch <em>(Ex. NP Fee THB 400 Per Pax)</em> SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>Tiger Park</strong>&nbsp;PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Dinner Cruise</strong> PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World with Marine Park</strong> with Indian Lunch PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Bangkok City Tour</strong> (Golden Buddha + Mini Reclining Buddha + Gems Gallery) SIC</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket HKT Airport To Krabi Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Krabi Hotel To Phuket Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Hotel To Phuket HKT Airport PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok BKK Airport&nbsp;&nbsp;To Bangkok Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Thailand Visa </strong>on Arrival.</li>\n	<li><strong>For 03 years old Kids</strong> you can&nbsp;Pay Directly in the sightseeings wherever required.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":261868,\"hotel_cost\":98300,\"land_cost\":\"122500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":482668,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 77226.88\",\"selling_price\":559894.880000000004656612873077392578125,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"13.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0505/042024', 560120, 69840, 35620, '2024-04-30 15:07:17', '2024-05-01 09:32:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(515, 'ROHIT RAJPAL', 'AF', '6206499800', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GREECE', '2024-06-06', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Athens\",\"date\":\"06-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Athens! Athens is the capital city of Greece, known for its rich history and cultural significance. It is often referred to as the cradle of Western civilization, as it was the birthplace of democracy, philosophy, and many other elements of classical civilization. The city is home to iconic landmarks such as the Acropolis, Parthenon, and various museums that showcase its historical and cultural heritage. On arrival, our local representative will meet &amp; transfer you to our hotel in Athens.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Evening free at leisure to explore this beautiful city on your own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Athens Local\",\"date\":\"07-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>This tour allows you to observe the striking contrasts that make Athens such a fascinating city. Our expert guides will take you to see the Panathenaic Stadium where the first Olympic Games of modern times were held in 1896 (short stop). Continue and pass by the Prime Minister\\u2019s residence (ex. Royal Palace) guarded by the Euzones in their colorful uniform, the Temple of Olympian Zeus, the Hadrian\\u2019s Arch, the Parliament and the memorial to the Unknown Soldier, the Academy, the University, the National Library, the Constitution Square (Syntagma). On the Acropolis visit the Architectural Masterpieces of the Golden Age of Athens: The Propylaea, the Temple of Athena Nike, the Erechtheion, and finally \\u201cthe harmony between material and spirit\\u201d the monument that \\u201cputs order in the mind\\u201d the Parthenon. Continue and visit the place where at last the statues found their home and admire the wonders of the classical era: The new Acropolis museum.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Athens - Santorini\",\"date\":\"08-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Transfer to Athens Port for Ferry to Santorini. Santorini is a world-famous volcanic island located in the southern part of the Cyclades group of islands in the Aegean Sea, in Greece. Once you set your foot on the island, you\\u2019ll feel like entering a whole new world. A world where all the shades of red create unreal sunsets. The caldera offers the most dramatic sea views you\\u2019ve ever seen and enormous cliffs are dotted with dreamy Cycladic whitewashed houses! Evening free at Leisure to explore Santorini.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Santorini Local\",\"date\":\"09-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Embark on a mesmerizing journey through Santorini\'s iconic landscapes and its best-kept secrets. As dawn breaks, we gather at<br \\/>\\nthe heart of the island, ready to unravel Santorini\\u2019s tales and traditions. We begin with the historic Akrotiri Lighthouse, standing as a beacon since the 19th century. Its grandeur offers breathtaking panoramas of the Aegean\\u2019s endless blue. Let the horizon captivate you before we whisk you to the unique beauty of Perivolos.<br \\/>\\nHere, the striking black sands meet crystal-clear waters in a dance of contrasts, a spectacle to behold and experience firsthand. From the shores, step into the time -<br \\/>\\ncapsule village of Megalochori. Stroll through its cobblestoned paths, past preserved bell towers, and welcoming squares. The atmosphere is thick with tales from bygone eras, inviting you to get lost in its charm. As we leave its charm, ascend to Profitis Ilias, a vantage point that offers unparalleled views and serenity that words can scarcely describe. This enchantment continues at Panagia Episkopi, Santorini\\u2019s oldest preserved church. Marvel at the richness of its Byzantine heritage, a testament to time and faith. As afternoon shades into evening, indulge in the island\\u2019s vinicultural legacy. A local winery welcomes you to taste the notes of Santorini\\u2019s volcanic soil in every sip. Let stories of grapevines and harvests unfold as the taste of Assyrtiko graces your palate. And just as the day reaches its crescendo, we end our tour at the village of Oia, bathed in golden hues as the sun performs its final act melting into the horizon.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Santorini - Athens\",\"date\":\"10-06-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, after breakfast you will be transferred to Santorini port for your way back to Athens. Arrive at Athens port and transfer to your hotel. Free time to settle in your room.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure Athens\",\"date\":\"11-06-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast in the Hotel. Depending on the timings for your onward flight we will transfer you to the airport. We hope you had a good time &amp; enjoyed your stay in Greece.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"11\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":50775},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Athens (ATH)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"4005\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Athens (ATH)\",\"to\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"4038\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":57209},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"12\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:05 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/06\\/2024\",\"check_out\":\"10\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"ATHENS\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Athenaeum Grand Or Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"15000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in <strong>Athens.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in <strong>Santorini.</strong></li>\n	<li>Daily <strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>Private Transfer from <strong>Athens Airport – Hotel – Athens Airport</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Athens Sightseeing Tour, Acropolis Site &amp; Museum</strong> on Seat In Coach Basis</li>\n	<li><strong>Transfer from Santorini Port – Hotel – Santorini Airport </strong>on Seat in Coach Basis</li>\n	<li><strong>Full-Day Panoramic Santorini Bus Tour </strong>on Seat In Coach Basis</li>\n	<li><strong>Ferry Economy Class Tickets</strong>: Athens – Santorini | Santorini - Athens</li>\n	<li><strong>Local Taxes &amp; VAT</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Greece Visa</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Travel Insurance</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n	<li>City Tax 1.5 Euro (3*) | 3 Euro (4*) | 4 Euro (5*) per room per night will be charged to the guest’s extra invoice &amp; will be payable by the guests before their check-out.</li>\n	<li>Expenses of personal nature such as tips, telephone calls, laundry, liquor, etc.</li>\n	<li>Guide &amp; Entrance fees during sightseeing or any other item not specified in inclusions.</li>\n	<li>Cost of Transfer from Hotel to designated Pick-up Point (for Sightseeing)</li>\n	<li>Any revision in air fares, increase in taxes or fuel surcharge, ROE, leading to an increase in surface transportation and land arrangements, which may come into effect before departure.</li>\n	<li>Any Surcharges if applicable due to peak season or any other event</li>\n	<li>Rates are subject to availability &amp; are subject to change depending on the season, surcharge, exhibitions, fairs, etc</li>\n	<li>The above-mentioned rates reflect cost and exchange rates etc. valid on January 2024. In case of any significant change, caused by tax increase, fuel surcharge, etc. deriving from governmental laws, Akbar Holidays reserves the right to adjust the rates accordingly.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":107984,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"26000\",\"land_cost\":\"241500\",\"travel_insurance\":\"3200\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":378684,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 56802.6\",\"selling_price\":435486.599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0506/052024', 435700, 217850, 0, '2024-05-01 06:51:41', '2024-05-01 12:44:33', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(516, 'Mr. Shashi Sahu', 'Argora', '7903109421', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2024-06-05', 4, 2, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"05-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"06-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 -02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost)&nbsp;,Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwandi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"07-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;&nbsp;03:00 -03:30&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>NOTE:-As Per The New Rules From Cable Car Corporation All Gondola Tickets Has To Be Booked By Online Only&nbsp;(&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com<\\/a>)&nbsp;by the guest with valid ID Proof .<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"08-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning&nbsp;, proceed to Srinagar.Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).&nbsp;Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, Cheshmashahi,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at&nbsp;Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"09-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel and drive to Airport to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"738\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"79731\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2741\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2137\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"85872\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5095\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"03:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ennco Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"check_out\":\"06\\/06\\/2024\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/06\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"07\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regency\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"08\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"08\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ennco Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/06\\/2024\",\"meal\":\"map\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":8}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Ranchi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Ennco Resort at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Regency&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Park&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;Double Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova </strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong>&nbsp;in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":165603,\"land_cost\":\"78000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":243603,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":266545,\"profit_figure\":\"22942\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"9.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0507/052024', 266544, 52036, 29200, '2024-05-01 08:24:25', '2024-05-14 12:45:32', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(517, 'Mr Azhar Ahmad', 'Mahtab Ussmani', '9334452207', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2024-05-21', 5, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"21-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"22-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast leave with a full day excursion for Sonmarg \\u201cThe meadow of gold. Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d .Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is a major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"23-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to Pahalgam ``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for a Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it a popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;One can also enjoy a pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on a direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in a peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Pahalgam Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"24-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Gulmarg \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;One can also have the view of Nanga Parbhat if weather permits. The view enroute from Tangmarg to Gulmarg is fascinating. One can also have a short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on a Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Gulamarg Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Srinagar (56 kms \\/ 2:00 hours approximately) Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"25-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>SS of Badamwari Garden in Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>and return visit Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar HouseBoat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar- Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"26-05-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"738\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"21 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":56450},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2741\",\"dep_date\":\"21 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"21 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1597\",\"dep_date\":\"26 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"26 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":52420},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"710\",\"dep_date\":\"26 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"26 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Batoo \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"24\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Tulip Cottage  \\/ Similar\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/05\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"25\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"H