ot be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Chandigarh.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Godwin Resort | Goa.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>Half Day <strong>North Goa Sight Seeing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>RoundTrip Airport Transfers</strong> by A/C Innova.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":79380,\"hotel_cost\":30000,\"transport_cost\":\"8000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":117380,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19954.6\",\"selling_price\":137334.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0512/052024', 137250, 27450, 0, '2024-05-06 06:51:33', '2024-05-06 06:59:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(522, 'Mr Rohit Tulsyan', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9304475550', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2024-07-25', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"25-07-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Vietnam, a beautiful country in South East Asia. Meet up our guide at the airport.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight in Ha Noi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"26-07-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel. Then our tour guide will pick you up for Hanoi city tour. First we visit&nbsp;Tran Quoc Pagoda&nbsp;located on Golden Fish Island in West Lake. It is the oldest pagoda in Ha Noi built in the 6thcentury.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then visit&nbsp;Ho Chi Minh Mausoleum (exterior), and Ba Dinh Square \\u2013 the biggest square in Hanoi where all the biggest cultural, political events of the cities, especially demonstrations, take place.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon, we visit&nbsp;The French Opera house, The St. Joseph\'s Cathedral, Train street where you can enjoy some coffee while relaxing near the train tracks (at own expense). Lastly, explore the 36 streets of Old Quarter surrounding the Hoan Kiem lake, one of the most famous symbols of Hanoi capital city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight in Ha Noi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HA NOI \\u2013 HALONG FULL DAY TOUR\",\"date\":\"27-07-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel. Then our tour guide and car will pick you up at your hotel at around 8h30 AM and depart for Ha Long Bay. Arrive Ha Long Harbor, welcome aboard, and safety briefing. The cruise will take you on a 5 hours journey via 2 day-sleeper boat cruise route which renowned for its striking, passages uninhabited islets and outcrops have been given imaginative names by the locals, due to their perceived shapes, including Cock Fighting and Thumb, while enjoy Vietnamese mouth-watering lunch on boat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon, we arrive Bo Hon archipelago, you will visit&nbsp;Surprising Cave&nbsp;to see a lot of stalagmites and stalactites with different shapes of sea lives, then go kayaking or bamboo boat in Luon Cave to discover the beautiful lagoon. Then we visit&nbsp;Titov Island&nbsp;with sandy beach adjacent to the towering limestone mountain with excellent backdrop of the Bay and climb up Titov Peak for a panoramic view of the bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We return the Cruise back toward the Harbor. There is a lot of time for sunbathing on the upper deck with music, enjoy great fun of group touring fellows among world iconic natural scenery. Transfer to the bus back to Hanoi, short break on the way.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Back to your hotel around 20h00-20h30. Tour ends.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight in Ha Noi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HA NOI \\u2013 FLY TO DA NANG \\u2013 HOI AN\",\"date\":\"28-07-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel. Our driver will pick you up for the airport.&nbsp;Then fly to Da Nang. Arrival in Da Nang, our driver picks you up at the airport and transfer to visit Cam Thanh coconut village, enjoy the basket boat and have some refreshing coconut water.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then Visit Hoi An Ancient town, Hoi An, Japanese Bridge: This only remain of Japanese culture is now considered as a symbol of Hoi An. Taking a walk on the street along the Hoai River, enjoy the night life of Hoi An Town. Colorful lanterns are hung on in front of the houses, across the streets and paths all around the town, which is going to make you feel peaceful, serene and want to last this walk forever.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight in Danang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANA HILL \\u2013 GOLDEN BRIDGE HANDS\",\"date\":\"29-07-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning,&nbsp;have breakfast at the hotel then our guide and driver will pick you up from your hotel,&nbsp;<a name=\\\"m_-509312582270721794__Hlk127880313\\\"><\\/a>depart for Ba Na Hill through one of the most beautiful seaside streets of Central Vietnam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We arrive in Ba Na, you will have a chance to experience the cable system up to the top of the hill and enjoy the beautiful sight of Mo stream, Toc Tien waterfall. Sightseeing on Ba Na Hill to: Hand of the gods hold Vietnam\\u2019s Golden Bridge.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>L\\u2019Jardin Zone with French Architecture Building: TinhT\\u00e2m Garden, French Stable, one hundred years-old pomelo tree, Old Villas, Linh Ung Pagoda, 27 meters Buddha Statue, LocUyen Garden.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon,&nbsp;from Debay station, you will get on the second cable system to move to Nui Chua Peak \\u2013 the rooftop of Da nang City. Continue the tour with Fantasy Park \\u2013 one of the most modern indoor game centers of the Asia. Visit Linh Chua LinhTu temple, enjoy a panoramic view of the whole Da Nang city and Da Nang bay through the mist in a romantic afternoon on Ba Na peak.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then we go down by the cable system. Get on coach and return the city center at around 17h00 \\u2013 18h00. Tour ends.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight in Danang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG \\u2013 MORNING FLY TO HO CHI MINH \\u2013 CU CHI TUNNELS\",\"date\":\"30-07-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel. Our guide and driver will pick you up for the airport.&nbsp;Then fly to Ho Chi Minh. Arrival in Ho Chi Minh, our guide and driver picks you up at the airport and transfer to the hotel. Checking in hotel for relax before tour in the afternoon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then our tour guide will pick you up for&nbsp;Cu Chi tunnels&nbsp;from the meeting point. Visitors will arrive at Cu Chi tunnels after a drive of&nbsp;1,5 hours. Our tour guide will give you an overview introduction to Cu Chi and its legendary history. A documentary film about the tunnels will explain the tunnel\'s histories and how fierce the war was in the area. You will be guided to the tunnels system, including the weapon factory, hospitals, and kitchens, and crawl under the tunnels.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nOvernight in Ho Chi Minh.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HCM CITY TOUR \\u2013 DEPATURE - AIRPORT TRANSFER (B)\",\"date\":\"31-07-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel and&nbsp;<a name=\\\"m_-509312582270721794__Hlk127881756\\\"><\\/a>then check out of room.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We take to visit&nbsp;Independence Palace,&nbsp;also known at the Reunification palace, was built on the sight of the former Norodom palace. The Independence palace is a widely known landmark of Ho Chi Minh City and was designed by the architect Ngo Viet Thu. Continue seeing the beautiful structures from the French Colonial times such as&nbsp;the&nbsp;Notre Dame Cathedral,&nbsp;the historic&nbsp;Central Post Office.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then time at your leisure until transfer to the International Airport for departure. Goodbye Vietnam.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":46636},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1631\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"505\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":29320},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"623\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"fare\":25348},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1642\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:30 AM\",\"fare\":40648},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7561\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Thang Long Opera\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"28\\/07\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"DA NANG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Dong Duong\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/07\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"HO CHI MINH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Happy Life Grand\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return AirFare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>HANOI.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>DA NANG.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nt</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>HO CHI MINH.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Rooms&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;<strong>Double Sharing</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;<strong>Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <em><strong>Entrance fees and Sightseeing </strong></em>as mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li><strong><em>Day Trip Cruise </em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Halong Bay.</strong></li>\n	<li>Local <strong>English speaking guide</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All T<strong>ransportation by Air-conditioned&nbsp;Vehicle.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Water Bottle&nbsp;</strong>during tour day.</li>\n	<li><strong>Vietnam Tourist Visa.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Travel Insurance.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Compulsory Tipping for guide and driver (3-5 USD/pax/day)</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":141952,\"hotel_cost\":\"8000\",\"visa_cost\":\"10000\",\"land_cost\":\"208420\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":368372,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 47888.36\",\"selling_price\":416260.359999999986030161380767822265625}', 'MZQ/0513/052024', 416800, 104200, 0, '2024-05-07 11:03:54', '2024-05-07 11:03:54', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(523, 'Mr. Ashish Sahu', 'BNI', '9905033404', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'CHARDHAM YATRA BY HELICOPTER', '2024-05-28', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Dehradun\",\"date\":\"28-05-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>The tour Commences with pick up from Dehradun airport or Railway station one day prior to the Chardham Yatra departure, followed by drop to the hotel. In the evening, our team will brief the guests about the entire Chardham Yatra.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>The overnight stay at Dehradun with dinner awaits you.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Yamunotri\",\"date\":\"29-05-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>06:00 Departure <\\/strong>Sahastradhara helipad, Dehradun<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>06:30 Arrival <\\/strong>Kharsali helipad, Yamunotri<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\nUpon arrival at kharsali passengers are welcomed by ground staff and transfer to yamunotri temple by palkis\\/ Pony. This trek from helipad to temple is 6 kms and return trip by palki takes about 5 hours. After Darshan return back to Helipad.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Kharsali<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangotri\",\"date\":\"30-05-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>06:35 Departure <\\/strong>Kharsali helipad, Yamunotri<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>07:00 Arrival <\\/strong>Harsil Helipad<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\nHarsil is one of the most beautiful and picturesque valleys in Uttarakhand. Some people also call it mini Switzerland. Gangotri temple is about 22 kms from Harsil helipad and the drive by car takes 50 minutes.<br \\/>\\nIt is advisable that passengers leave straight for temple from helipad. Our ground staff will assist the passengers with darshan at Gangotri temple.<br \\/>\\nAfter return from temple passengers can take lunch in resort and thereafter relax and have campfire in the evening. It is recommended to visit the nearby village for an evening walk and buy pure wool stuff (sweaters, shawls n mufflers) made by local tribal womenfolk.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kedarnath\",\"date\":\"31-05-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>07:30 Departure<\\/strong> Harsil Helipad<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>08:10 Arrival <\\/strong>Kedarnath Helipad<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>The helicopter will land at Kedarnath helipad which is at a distance of 500 meters from the temple. After Darshan return back to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Night halt will be at Guptkashi or Kedarnath.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Badrinath\",\"date\":\"01-06-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>08:30 Departure<\\/strong> Kedarnath \\/ Guptkashi Helipad<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>09:00 Arrival <\\/strong>Badrinath helipad<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>After arrival at Badrinath helipad passengers can check-in in Hotel which is Near to the temple. Our ground staff will assist the passengers in taking darshan at the temple.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>A visit to Mana village in evening is highly recommended as this is the first village after international border with China.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Return to Dehradun\",\"date\":\"02-06-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early Morning ready for Special Abhishek Puja (as your own cost) at Badrinath temple is the highlight of this entire yatra. It starts sharp at 4.30 am in the morning and lasts for 2 hours. Passengers will get an opportunity to sit inside the temple and have darshan of the shringar of the deity from very close quarters. After darshan return back to hotel have breakfast and fly for Dehradun. On arrival at Dehradun helipad you will transfer to Airport \\/ Railway station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Here Helicopter tour ends here with happy memories to be cherished forever.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2332\",\"dep_date\":\"28 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"28 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":43820},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dehradun (DED)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2291\",\"dep_date\":\"28 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"28 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dehradun (DED)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2253\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":53824},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2218\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"city\":\"Dehradun\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kalindi Hill Top\",\"city\":\"Kharsali\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel  Nine Apple Resort\",\"city\":\"Harsil\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"31\\/05\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kedarnatha Resort\",\"city\":\"Guptkashi\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"DBL Room\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel  Lords Centric\",\"city\":\"Badrinath\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/06\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night Accommodation at Hotel Lemon Tree at&nbsp;Dehradun.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night Accommodation at Hotel Kalindi Hill Top&nbsp;at&nbsp;Kharsali.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night Accommodation at Hotel &nbsp;Nine Apple Resort&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;Harsil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night Accommodation at Hotel Kedarnatha Resort&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;Guptkashi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night Accommodation at Hotel &nbsp;Lords Centric&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;Badrinath.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Helicopter Trip from Dehradun to Dehradun (Weight up to 75kg)</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All meals in Hotels </strong>at Dham (Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner).</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong> during the stay in <strong>Dehradun</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Palki / Doli Charges</strong> service at Yamunotri.</li>\n	<li><strong>VIP darshan</strong> arrangement at all temples.</li>\n	<li><strong>Landing &amp; Parking charges at Sersi /Sitapur/Guptkashi H</strong>elipad.</li>\n	<li><strong>Local Transport for darshan</strong> and sightseeing at Gangotri, Badrinath and Kedarnath as per itinenary.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dehradun Airport Pickup &amp; drop Facilities.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Helicopter weight allowance (Weight up to 75kg)<br />\n	Extra Weight @2000/- per kg Inclusive of 5%GST</strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"6\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":97644,\"land_cost\":\"800000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":897644,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 53858.64\",\"selling_price\":951502.640000000013969838619232177734375}', 'MZQ/0514/052024', 951600, 237900, 0, '2024-05-10 07:31:16', '2024-05-10 07:31:16', 0, 1, '\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>ADD-ON SERVICES<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Maha Abhishek Puja at Badrinath ji \\u2013Total amount has to be paid in cash to SBTM Representative at\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Dehradun, so that we can arrange and book the Puja in advance on behalf of each passenger.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Note \\u2013 Maha Abhishek Puja will not be included in our package or billing cost, since the total amount for the same goes directly to Badrinath ji Mandir Samiti.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Rudra Abhishek Puja at Kedarnath ji \\u2013Total amount has to be paid in cash to SBTM representative at Dehradun, so that we can arrange and book the Puja in advance onbehalf of each passenger. Arrangement of Rudra Abhishek puja will be done subject to availability of rooms at Kedarnath-Top, as passengers will have tostay there overnight for the puja. Therefore, the additional charges towards the hotel stay will be extra chargeable. Note \\u2013 Rudra Abhishek Puja will not be included in our package or billing cost, since the total amount for the same goes directly toKedarnath ji Mandir Samiti.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Disclaimer \\u2013 Accommodation at Kedarnath-top is budget category, and there can be instances of complaints in regards to the hotel services &amp; rooms. Furthermore, temperature at<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Kedarnath-top maydrop to sub-zero levels at night in Sep\\/Oct; therefore passengers areadvised to take decision keeping the same in consideration.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Booking of Scheduled\\/Non-Scheduled Flights or Train Tickets:\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Price on demand.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>While our team takes care of your entire Chardham tour, they can also assist you in booking of air\\/Train tickets to Dehradun.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>GUIDELINES FOR PASSENGERS<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>There is very limited space for luggage in the helicopter. Only 5 kg luggage per passenger will be permitted.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Passengers should carry only handbags as suitcases cannot be kept in the helicopter\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All temples in Chardham are located in high altitude areas. Passengers having asthma problems should not undertake this yatra\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All passengers undertaking this yatra should be medically and physically fit.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Passengers are advised to carry a small oxygen bottle with them as a precaution. It is available locally at all medical shops\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Although day temperatures at these locations are normal it becomes cold in the night and so passengers must carry woolen clothes with them.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All passengers are advised to carry their own medication.\\uf020\\uf076 When planning your tour, We strongly advise the guests to keep one additional day at hand at Dehradun, over and above 05N\\/06D period, so that they do not end up in problem in case the weather gets very bad after the commencement of tour, which may lead to extension of the tour.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Company shall not be liable for any medical emergency on the ground to the party, thus advised guests to get the fitness certificate from doctor to travel to the high altitude sector.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Weighing at the time of boarding the helicopter is must since the pilot will not allow boarding in case it exceeds the weight conveyed at the time of booking &amp; we reserve the right to shuffle passengers to manage the right weight of helicopters for safe flying in the hills.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>TERMS AND CONDITIONS<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The quality of accommodation available at Yamunotri and Kedarnath upper is just above average and so passengers should not have very high expectations. However, at Harsil, Guptkashi and Badrinath the accommodation standard is 3 stars.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Only 5 Kg baggage per passenger will be permitted. Passengers are advised not to carry big suitcases as there is very small baggage space inside helicopter. Passengers bringing excess baggage might not be allowed to take the same in the chopper by pilot.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Children above the age of 2 years will be considered full ticket. Infant below 02 Yrs. \\/12 Kg are carried free of charge. In case of verification of age, ID proof (Birth certificate) of the child shall be checked.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>There is no provision of concession to children or senior citizens.\\uf020\\uf076 Total passenger weight should not exceed - 450:6 PAX Beyond the\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>said weight limit the flight won\\u2019t be able to take off and your journey will be cancelled effective immediately (it is vital for you to provide us with the right &amp; exact weight to avoid such situation. \\uf076 The booking has to be done in advance with a deposit of 50% of the charter amount and balance amount has to be deposited 15 days prior to date of journey otherwise booking stand cancelled without any refund.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>In case the journey is not finished within the stipulated time and passengers are not able to visit one or more Dhams due to bad weather conditions\\/technical reasons then the company will try to visit all places within the stipulated time. Although if this is not possible then the liability of the company will be limited to refund of unutilized sector\\/s.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Rescheduling of booking to a next date will be done subject to availability and on payment of 20% of the cost. This will be permitted only if applied 15 days before journey date. In case the rescheduling is requested with less than 15 days to the journey then booking will be treated as cancelled and a fresh booking will be given subject to availability.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>The Company reserves the right, without assigning any reason, to cancel, advance, reschedule, over-fly or delay the commencement or continuance of the flight. Without incurring any liability in damages or otherwise to the passengers or any other person on any ground whatsoever. The Company reserves the right to refuse to carry any person whom it considers unfit for travel or what in the opinion of the company may constitute risk to the aircraft or to the persons on board.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>In regards to the guests stranded at any Dham, if any group requests to cancel their tour on their own desire &amp; come down before their scheduled return date, the arrangement of vehicle for their return journey by road shall be done by us, however, cost for the same shall be borne by the guest on direct payment basis. No refunds are applicable in case guests wish to cancel &amp; return mid-tour.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>We would like to inform our pilgrims that we do not provide insurance coverage for accidents, sickness, loss due to theft, or any other unforeseen circumstances. Therefore, we strongly recommend that pilgrims make their own arrangements for insurance coverage. Please note that all baggage and personal belongings are solely the responsibility of the client at all times.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>BAD WEATHER SITUATION: If you are stuck in a bad weather situation on any particular day out of the 5 days we will still try to finish the darshan on next day. In case we are completely unable to visit any dham due to bad weather situation then we will refund only flying timing cost approximately INR 20,000\\/-(Twenty Thousand Rupees) against each Dham per seat.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All disputes are subject to Delhi Jurisdiction.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bookings will be taken, considering there is acceptance of the above \\u2013 mentioned terms &amp; conditions by the party.\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>5% Service charge + Utilized Services like Hotel Stay and Transportation will be applicable in Case of cancellation due to any reason \\/ Bad weather.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>If passengers wish to cancel their booking, then they will have to pay following cancellation charges<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Up to 30 days before journey -30% of amount\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Up to 20 Days before journey -50% of amount\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Up to 14 Days before journey -No Refund\\uf020<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>No Show \\u2013No Refund\\uf020<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>Note: -<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n1. Exact Schedule can be advised before a day of departure. Above mentioned schedule is tentative just for understanding the operational system &amp; timing. Things can be changed last moment due to any operational or weather changes.<br \\/>\\n2. Package Confirmation &amp; Booking, please deposit the 50 % amount of the Tour cost to process the booking and the balance amount is to be paid 15 days before from your departure dates.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(524, 'Ms Debbie Awa', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok,Darjeeling & Pelling', '2024-06-12', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"IXB Airport - Gangtok (128 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"12-06-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs. one-way)\",\"date\":\"13-06-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for an excursion to Tsomgo Lake (12,400 ft. \\/ 37 Kms. \\/ 02 Hrs. from Gangtok) and further drive to Baba Mandir (13,200 ft. \\/ 16 Kms. \\/ 01 Hrs. from Tsomgo Lake). Evening back to Gangtok.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok - Pelling via Namchi (150 Kms. \\/ 7 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"14-06-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for Pelling (6,300 Ft. \\/ 120 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs<b>.<\\/b>) via Namchi to visit Siddheshwar Dham (Chardham) and Sai Temple. On arrival check-in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling Full Day Sightseeing with Skywalk\",\"date\":\"15-06-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for a full day sightseeing tour. In first half, cover Darap village, Rimbi waterfalls, Khecheopalri Lake (Wishfulling Lake) and Khangchendzongha waterfalls. In the second half cover the Pemayangtse monastery, Rabdantse ruins (2nd capital of Sikkim), Sang-Ngag Choling (Skywalk), New helipad ground.&nbsp; Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Pelling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pelling - Darjeeling (80 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"16-06-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.) via Singla Check post. On arrival, check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"17-06-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday&nbsp;closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday&nbsp;closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport (75 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"18-06-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to&nbsp; Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8841\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"27900\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5249\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"fare\":27000}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ginger Bojoghari\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Pelling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mount Magnolia\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/06\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"16\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Anutri Hill Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/06\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Ginger Bojoghari at Gangtok<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Mount Magnolia at Pelling<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Anutri Hill Resort at Darjeeling<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms on Double Sharing basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Private 01&nbsp;Non AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova </strong>as per itinerary on point to point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in the Hill area).&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":54900,\"land_cost\":\"120800\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":175700,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 29869\",\"selling_price\":205569}', 'MZQ/0515/052024', 206000, 51500, 0, '2024-05-10 12:11:09', '2024-05-10 13:31:57', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(525, 'MR NAMAN THAKUR', 'AF', '7763810001', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2023-05-16', 5, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":32746},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1641\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"17 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"130\",\"dep_date\":\"19 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"19 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":13948},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1632\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"03:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:25 AM\",\"fare\":26098},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7561\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:45 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2023\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Parkroyal Saigon\",\"city\":\"HO CHI MINH\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"19\\/05\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"23200\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/05\\/2023\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hilton Garden Inn\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2023\",\"rate\":\"15900\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refun