(537, 'Ms. Garima Singh', 'BNI | CELEB', '9323936253', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Turkey', '2024-08-11', 6, 0, 1, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"11\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"46604\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Kayseri (ASR)\",\"name\":\"Turkish Air\",\"fno\":\"2012\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"6547\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kayseri (ASR)\",\"to\":\"Antalya (AYT)\",\"name\":\"Pegasus Hava Tasimaciligi\",\"fno\":\"3503\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"6623\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Antalya (AYT)\",\"to\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"name\":\"Turkish Air\",\"fno\":\"2409\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"6482\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"12\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:05 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"11\\/08\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Istanbul\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Radisson Blu Pera\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/08\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"8719\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"12\\/08\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Cappadocia\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Cappadocia Estate\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/08\\/2024\",\"rate\":\"13834\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"14\\/08\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Antalya\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Zemira Garden\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/08\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"9390\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"16\\/08\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramada Plaza By Wyndham Istanbul City Center\",\"city\":\"Istanbul\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/08\\/2024\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"11488\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>DAY WISE ITINERARY:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>11 Aug</strong>: Arrive Istanbul and transfer to the hotel. In the Evening&nbsp;SIC&nbsp;<strong>Bosphorus Cruise with Dinner</strong> &amp; <strong>Folkloric Show</strong> (unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included) (Cruise will be on SIC basis, transfers are on private basis). <strong>Overnight in Istanbul.</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>12 Aug</strong>:&nbsp;Transfer to the Istanbul airport for flight to Cappadocia. Transfer to the hotel. Overnight in Cappadocia.</p>\n\n<p><strong>13 Aug</strong>:&nbsp;SIC&nbsp;Full Day <strong>Cappadocia North Tour </strong>with Goreme Open Air Museum, Dervent Valley, Pasabag, Avanos.&nbsp;Lunch&nbsp;at local Restaurant.&nbsp;Overnight&nbsp;in&nbsp;Cappadocia</p>\n\n<p><strong>14 Aug</strong>: Earlty morning proceed for <strong>Hot Air Ballon Ride </strong>(Subject to Weather Permit) Later check out (12 PM) and as per flight timings Transfer to the Kayseri airport for flight to Antalya. Transfer to the hotel. Overnight in Antalya.</p>\n\n<p><strong>15 Aug</strong>:&nbsp;SIC&nbsp;Full Day <strong>Antalya Tour </strong>&amp; Waterfall Tour.&nbsp;Lunch&nbsp;at local Restaurant.&nbsp;Overnight in Antalya</p>\n\n<p><strong>16 Aug</strong>:&nbsp;Transfer to the Antalya airport for flight to Istanbul. Arrive and transfer to hotel (Check in tiume is 2-3 PM) After reaching hotel drop your luggage and transfer for <strong>Hammam Bath</strong>, Retun back to hotel. Over night stay in Istanbul.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>17 Aug</strong>: After breakfast check out and proceed to visit <strong>Camalica Hill</strong> -&nbsp;Camlica Hill&nbsp;is one of the highest points of the&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;and&nbsp;Istanbul, 267 metres above sea level on the Anatolian, Asian Side, of Istanbul. The hill borders the Uskudar District and offers&nbsp;wonderful panoramic views over the city as well as the Marmara Sea and&nbsp;Bosphorus Strait. On a clear day, you can see all the way to the&nbsp;Princes Islands&nbsp;and the snow-covered ridge of Uludag Mountain.&nbsp;At sunset, the domes and minarets of&nbsp;Istanbul\'s many mosques&nbsp;make a stunning silhouette against the colourful sky.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Return back to hotel by 3 PM and then transfer to airport for your return flight.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>INCLUSIONS:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex- Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li>Internal Domestic Flights :<strong> Istanbul (IST)-Kayseri (ASR)-Antalya (AYT)-Istanbul (IST).</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Radisson Blu Pera&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel Cappadocia Estate&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Cappadocia&nbsp;</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Zemira Garden at&nbsp;<strong>Antalya&nbsp;</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Blue Gilroy&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul</strong>.</li>\n	<li>At all Hotels<strong> Twin Beds.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Local Lunches.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers </strong>Mentioned in the Itinerary&nbsp;(PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>Tours Mentioned</strong> in the Itinerary&nbsp;(SIC Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>English Speaking</strong> Tour Guide During Tours.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Entrance Fees</strong> Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Transportation Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li><strong>Turkey Visa </strong>Charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel Insurance.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":66256,\"hotel_cost\":43431,\"visa_cost\":\"19500\",\"land_cost\":\"64170\",\"travel_insurance\":\"1000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":194357,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19435.7\",\"selling_price\":213792.7000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0528/052024', 220600, 220600, 0, '2024-05-30 06:53:46', '2024-07-23 10:23:17', 0, 1, '\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>The rates are dynamic &amp; will keep on changing until we hold it as per the final confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nothing is on hold until &amp; unless we provide it in the written confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All internal flights tickets are non refundable &amp; non exchangeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All services &amp; rates are remain subject to availability at the time of confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pick up &amp; drop for all tours &amp; transfers will be done from city center hotels only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Above quote is based on all paying pax travelling together. Any revision in number of pax will affect the given cost.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Company does not have any liability if the tour is cancelled or itinerary changed during the tour due to any unpredictable event like any political disturbance or weather condition or natural&nbsp;disaster&nbsp;etc.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All ferries, boats, cruises &amp; cable cars ride will be done on SIC basis.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
