 Entrance Fees</strong> Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Transportation Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n	<li><strong>Turkey Visa </strong>Charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel Insurance.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":66319,\"hotel_cost\":31943,\"visa_cost\":\"19000\",\"land_cost\":\"60450\",\"travel_insurance\":\"1000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":178712,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21445.44\",\"selling_price\":200157.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0529/052024', 206500, 206500, 0, '2024-05-30 06:55:54', '2024-07-23 10:22:28', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(539, 'Ms. Ayesha Zakaria', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL PRADESH 4*', '2024-07-25', 6, 1, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh to Shimla\",\"date\":\"25-07-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Pick up from Chandigarh Railway Station and drive&nbsp; to Shimla.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla\",\"date\":\"26-07-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Excursion to Kufri. Kufri is famous for its Himalayan National Park, Poney and Yak Ride and One can see the endless Himalayan Panorama from Kufri, after lunch sightseeing of various places in and around. Shimla mosques built in (1830), Vice regal Lodge built in (1885), Christ Church built in (1844), The Gaiety Theatre- the first beauty contest of world was supposed to start (1887), The Grindlays Bank (1912)- the world wide bank started by Robert Melville Grindlay, The Scandal Point and The famous Shopping Plaza of the North The Mall.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla to Manali\",\"date\":\"27-07-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel a distance of 265 km 8 hrs.&nbsp; on the way visit Sunder Nagar, Pandoh Dam, Hanogi Mata Temple , Kullu Valley.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"28-07-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b>After breakfast sightseeing of places in and around Manali, Like Hadimba temple, Manu templ(By walk) &nbsp;Vashisht Bath, Van Vihar and evening shopping at the local market.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali\",\"date\":\"29-07-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion to Solang Valley&nbsp;and back to Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>OR<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Excursion to Rohatang Pass till snow point&nbsp;&nbsp;(Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Guest Own on direct payment &amp; Subject to Permit).&nbsp;Situated at an altitude of 3979 mtrs above sea level and 51 kms outside Manali is the mighty Rohtang Pass - the gateway to Lahaul-Spiti valley. It affords a wide panoramic view of the mountains. Here one sees the majesty of the mountains at its height and splendour. At the top of the pass the air seems to glitter against the snow as you look down over herringboned ridges into the Lahaul valley. Evening at Leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali to Kasol\",\"date\":\"30-07-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today&nbsp;checkout from hotel then drive to Kasol visit Kullu &amp; Manikran O\\/N at hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kasol to Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"31-07-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>&nbsp;Kasol to Chandigarh Drop.<\\/b><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"rate\":null,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Golden Fern Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL  Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/07\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel White Stone Resort\",\"rate\":null,\"room_type\":\"DBL  Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/07\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"KASOL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal castle\",\"room_type\":\"DBL  Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":11}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts</strong> Accommodation Hotel Golden Fern Resort at&nbsp;<strong>Shimla.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts</strong> Accommodation Hotel Utopia Resorts &amp; Spa at&nbsp;<strong>Manali.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nts</strong> Accommodation Hotel Royal castle at&nbsp;<strong>kasol.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Double Room + 01 Extra Bed&nbsp;</strong>with <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova Crysta</strong> for all transfers &amp; tours on disposal basis.</li>\n	<li>Toll, Parking, driver’s Bata, road tax &amp; fuel charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>All taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"97604\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":97604,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14640.6\",\"selling_price\":112244.60000000000582076609134674072265625,\"profit_figure\":\"0\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0530/052024', 112260, 33900, 10560, '2024-05-30 10:55:52', '2024-06-01 12:53:24', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(540, 'Ms Ritika', 'Ankur OP Tulsyan', '7667224924', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2024-07-10', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"10-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Srinagar Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"11-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 -02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost)&nbsp;,Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwandi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"12-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;&nbsp;03:00 -03:30&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>NOTE:-As Per The New Rules From Cable Car Corporation All Gondola Tickets Has To Be Booked By Online Only&nbsp;(&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com<\\/a>)&nbsp;by the guest with valid ID Proof .<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"13-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning&nbsp;, proceed to Srinagar.Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).&nbsp;Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, Cheshmashahi,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at&nbsp;Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onwards destination.\",\"date\":\"14-07-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel and drive to Airport to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7562\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"fare\":38156},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"874\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"559\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"fare\":48964},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"776\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jul 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jul 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"04:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Kaisar\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Room\",\"check_out\":\"11\\/07\\/2024\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"11\\/07\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"12\\/07\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Queens Park\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/07\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"13\\/07\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"13\\/07\\/2024\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deluxe Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/07\\/2024\",\"meal\":\"map\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Grand Kaisar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Regency&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Park&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Deluxe Houseboat at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova </strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>SS Mughal Gardens, Shankara Achariya Temple&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li><strong>SS of Badamwari Garden</strong>&nbsp;in Srinagar</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Rafting, Glacier visit, Pony Ride,Gondola,Aru,&nbsp;BetabValley&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Chandanwadi.</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees to monuments, Gardens. Meals other than mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>Prepaid Sim Cards will not work here, Kindly Plan a Postpaid&nbsp;Sim card.</li>\n	<li>Any costs arising out of unforeseen circumstances like landslides, road blocks, bad weather, Political Strike etc.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":87120,\"land_cost\":\"80500\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":167620,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25143\",\"selling_price\":192763,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"29.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0531/062024', 192800, 48200, 0, '2024-06-03 09:50:57', '2024-06-03 09:50:57', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(541, 'MR RAJESH SAHU', 'BIKAS BHAIYA', '9955208900', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BHUTAN', '2024-06-09', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL PARO : TRANSFER TO THIMPHU\",\"date\":\"09-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Paro Airport and transfer to Thimphu, the capital city of Bhutan. On arrival check in at the hotel. In an evening visit Tashichhoe Dzong, ( Outer View ) and explore the Thimphu town by walk.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Thimphu.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Approx. Distance: 65 km \\u2022 Est. Travel Time: 2 hours<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"THIMPHU - FULL DAY SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"10-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast visit outer view Kuensel Phodrang (Buddha Statue), Hindu Temple, Outer view of National Memorial Chorten (Monument) and Wagdi tse Lhakhanag (short hike of 40 mins). Afternoon visit Nunnery, BBS Tower, National Library, Centenary Farmer Market ( Handicraft product and Local product can be Found here.&nbsp; In the evening the Tashichhoe Dzong Outer view (Fortress of the Glorious Religion). Craft Bazar for shopping can be seen here.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Thimphu.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"THIMPHU TO PUNAKHA - TRANSFER & SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"11-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Punakha \\/ Wangdue, on the way Stop at Dochu-La-Pass (3150 mts.), during clear days you will get a chance to see Himalayan mountain ranges of Bhutan. After noon visit Punakha Dzong ( entry fee 500 ) built in 1637 by Zhabdrung Ngawang Namgyal. For many years until the time of the second king, it served as the seat of the Government. The Dzong was named PungthangDechenPhodrang (Palace of Great Happiness). Punakha is still the winter residence of monastic body. Evening free for leisure.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Over night stay at Punakha .<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Approx. Distance: 77 km \\u2022 Est. Travel Time: 3 hours<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PUNAKHA - EXCURSION TO GANGTEY\\/PHOBJIKHA\",\"date\":\"12-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start for full day excursion trip to Gangtey (3000mts.). Gangtey is the home of Black Necked Crane which migrates from the arid plains of Tibet in the north. It is a beautiful valley of Bhutan. You can also visit Gangtey Gompha. Evening return back.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Punakha\\/Wangdue.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Approx. Distance: 78 km \\u2022 Est. Travel Time: 3 hours<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PUNAKHA TO PARO - TRANSFER & SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"13-06-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Paro and on the way visit near river side and drive Bonday Zangthophelri, Airport View, Ta Dzong \\u2013 National Museum&nbsp; with an excellent collection of arts, relics, religious thangka. RinpungDzong (outer view) - Meaning \\\"fortress of the heap of jewels\\\" Evening Leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Paro.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Approx. Distance: 128 km \\u2022 Est. Travel Time: 4 hours<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PARO - EXCURSION TO CHELE-LA-PASS\",\"date\":\"14-06-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast excursion trip to Chele-La-Pass \\u2013 the highest motorable road in Bhutan. Enjoy the scenic beauty and memorable landscapes from Chele-La-Pass. Back to Paro. And Evening&nbsp; Try Bhutanese Traditional&nbsp; Dress&nbsp; and Shopping at Town.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at Paro<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PARO - AIRPORT DROP\",\"date\":\"15-06-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from hotel and drop at Paro Airport for departure.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Paro (PBH)\",\"name\":\"Flexflight\",\"fno\":\"521\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"68000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Paro (PBH)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Flexflight\",\"fno\":\"520\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jun 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jun 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"10:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"THIMPHU\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ramada Valley \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"11\\/06\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"11\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PUNAKHA\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/06\\/2024\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Khuru Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"13\\/06\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PARO\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Paro Grand\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/06\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong>&nbsp;Ex-Ranchi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Thimphu</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at<strong> Punakha.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong>&nbsp;at<strong>&nbsp;Paro.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;Double Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova / Santafee / Creata / Celtos / Sonnet / Similar&nbsp;</strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily surcharge</strong> of Rs 1200 per night.</li>\n	<li><strong>Professional tour guide</strong>&nbsp;(mandatory) Phuentsholing to Phuentsholing.</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\">Monument entrance fee </span></b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":68000,\"land_cost\":\"112000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":180000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25200\",\"selling_price\":205200}', 'MZQ/0532/062024', 205400, 102700, 0, '2024-06-04 07:14:10', '2024-06-04 09:08:54', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>REQUIREMENTS FOR ENTRY INTO BHUTAN<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Passport (with min 6 months validity) or Voters card for adults<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Passport (with min 6 months validity) or Birth Certificate for children<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Covid vaccination certificate<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Passport Photo<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Details of number of times the guests have visited Bhutan<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>It is advisable that the above is sent to us at the time of booking confirmation<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>ITINERARY NOTES<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Our representative will be there to receive the guest at the single Exit gate of Bagdogra Airport or at the new Exit(where escalator is present) of New Jalpaiguri Railway Station or the exit of Alipurduar or Hasimara station or exit of Paro Airport.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>In case the guest is arriving\\/arrives the railway station during \\/ after midnight or before dawn, the guest is advised to rest in the Retiring\\/Waiting Room as it is not safe to travel at that time. Our representative will meet the guest in the morning for their further transfers.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Hotels suggested are subject to availability at the time of booking. In case the same is not available, then similar category hotel will be provided.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Please don\'t expect the service standards to be at par with the services that we may get in the plains \\/Metropolitan cities.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Days in the hills are shorter. So the excursions start early in the morning to cover all the points before the weather gets foggy.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Unavoidable situations - bad weather, bad road, strike or bandh - may require omission of sight-seeing points or change of tour plan and will be advised by our tour guide.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Any additional expense incurred due to change in route plan because of road blockage -caused by snowfall or landslides- will have to be borne by the guest.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Please take full risk and responsibility of your luggage.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>People in the hills wear 1 cardigan during their summer months. Please carry woolens accordingly.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>If the guest wants some minor change in their sightseeing schedule, it should be informed to our representative 1 day prior before 14:00 hrs. If informed later than 14:00 hrs. cancellation rules will apply and the guest will have to pay additionally for the desired changes.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Some points have less oxygen content in the air, owing to high altitude and presence of snow. People with heart problem, blood pressure and knees problem &amp; having children below 05 years are advised to avoid these points as adequate medical systems are not available here.<br \\/>\\n\\t&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
