copter Tickets</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Snowland/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Snowland/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Sonmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Meerzt&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;Double Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>) at all Hotel in Srinagar &amp; Sonmerg.</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Ac Etios/Similar</strong><strong> </strong>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":30532,\"land_cost\":\"66800\",\"hotel_cost\":\"11944\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":109276,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21855.2\",\"selling_price\":131131.2000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0540/062024', 131200, 65600, 0, '2024-06-25 07:45:41', '2024-06-25 08:52:23', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(550, 'Mr Mayank Jaiswal', 'Sanu Sahu', '7004493342', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2024-08-15', 5, NULL, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Srinagar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"15-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to the Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"16-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning, proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 2:00-2:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride (at your own cost) to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero Point&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return back to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>NOTE:-<strong>As Per Amarnath Yatra Advisory,You Have to Travel Sonmarg in the Early&nbsp;Morning &amp; Return From Sonmarg to Srinagar Before 02:00 P.M.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"17-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 - 02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost).&nbsp;Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;to see&nbsp; famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel In Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"18-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;03:00 - 03:30&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"19-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Srinagar Back. After arrival proceed to Srinagar&nbsp;Local&nbsp;Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden,Cheshmashahi,&nbsp;Pari mahal, ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Houseboat In Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport Drop\",\"date\":\"20-08-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning,Check out From Hotel &amp;&nbsp;drive to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":21782},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6961\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1713\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Aug 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"01:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"fare\":17346},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"776\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Aug 2024\",\"arv_date\