 be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Ibis Styles Goa Calangute | Goa.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Rooms </strong>on<strong> DBL Sharing + 01 Room </strong>on <strong>Single Occupancy.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu <strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>RoundTrip Dabolim Airport Transfers</strong>&nbsp;by 01&nbsp;Innova + 01 Swift Dzire.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":67515,\"hotel_cost\":56400,\"transport_cost\":\"7000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":130915,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 13091.5\",\"selling_price\":144006.5}', 'MZQ/0546/072024', 144200, 20600, 0, '2024-07-02 08:36:04', '2024-07-02 13:14:43', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>Optional Cost :<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>South Goa Day Trip by 01 Innova on PVT <em>@<strong>Rs 4500\\/-<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li>North Goa Day Trip by 01 Innova on PVT <em>@<strong>Rs 4000\\/-<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(556, 'Ms Poonam', 'CDG', '981062191', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Andaman 4*', '2024-12-20', 6, NULL, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup Later Corbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"20-12-2024 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyns Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. <\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for Indias Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"21-12-2024 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\">Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asias best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"22-12-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Note: Our team at Havelock will guide you in case you require any assistance on the ground.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"No Tour On This Day - Day At Leisure\\/ Self Plan\",\"date\":\"23-12-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Today is a day at leisure or the tour has been planned by the guest directly.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"24-12-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. We begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach.Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"25-12-2024 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Today, we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"26-12-2024 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom:13px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:10pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"line-height:115%\\\">Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"8263\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Dec 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Dec 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":74440},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Dec 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Dec 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":59960}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/12\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/12\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony palms Beach Resort\",\"city\":\"Havelock\",\"room_type\":\"Havelock Cottage + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2024\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/12\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sand\",\"city\":\"Neil Island\",\"room_type\":\"Casa Earth + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2024\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2024\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2024\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex- Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation&nbsp;on<strong> Double sharing + 02 Extra Bed</strong>&nbsp;at given <strong>Hotels in&nbsp;Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>MAP (Breakfast &amp; Dinner) </strong>at all respected Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet </strong>service at airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>1 Private AC Vehicle</strong> at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>Transfer to <strong>Havelock Island/Neil Island</strong> in Nautika/Makruzz/Green Ocean.</li>\n	<li><strong>Full day tour with all transfers</strong> including airport pick up and drop.</li>\n	<li><strong>All entry tickets, ferry tickets</strong> and permit charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Personal Tour Coordinators</strong> for one Point of Contact.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance by field executive at all the major entry exit points</strong> (Airport/Jetty/Jail/Water sports complex, Havelock / Neil etc).</li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle <strong>(Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) </strong>as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li><strong>Gala dinner charges included</strong> on the Eve of Christmas on <strong>24th Night.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Parking charge</strong>s.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<em><strong>Multi Zone Travel</strong></em>&nbsp;experts&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":134400,\"land_cost\":\"229912\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":364312,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 29144.96\",\"selling_price\":393456.9600000000209547579288482666015625}', 'MZQ/0547/072024', 393600, 65600, 0, '2024-07-04 11:12:44', '2024-07-04 11:12:44', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
