(561, 'Ms Prerna', 'Divya PNB', '8757382011', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Mauritius', '2024-10-18', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Mauritius\",\"date\":\"18-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Arrive at the most charming place in Africa<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On your arrival in Mauritius, you will be picked up from the airport by the transfer services we offer. Proceed to the hotel and complete the check-in formalities. Head to your room and relax for the day. As you have the entire day for leisure, you can explore the classic facilities in your hotel or go out and explore the nearby places.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ile Aux Cerfs Day Tour\",\"date\":\"19-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Have a fun day enjoying at Ile Aux Cerfs<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the second day of your tour, get ready after a delicious breakfast. This day is planned for excursion to Ile Aux Cerfs. Head out with the representative and reach the place. It is a private island located in the east coast of Mauritius and boasts the largest lagoon here. You may also take part in parasailing, underwater walking and more in Ile Aux Cerfs. Note that these activities are to be done at an extra cost, paid in person by the traveler. Have an adventurous day here. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North Island Day Tour\",\"date\":\"20-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Explore and enjoy in the North island of Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the third day, have your breakfast and get ready for the day. You will be covering the major attractions of North Island today. Proceed with the transfer and reach the North island. Some of the major places you can visit here are the Port Louis Caudan Waterfront, Grand Baie, China Town and Mauritius Aquarium. Enjoy at these places. Any entry fee, if required, must be met by the travelers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"South island Day Tour\",\"date\":\"21-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Spend an entire day having fun at South island<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the fourth day of the tour, get ready after breakfast. This day is planned for SOuth Island tour. Reach the South Island in Mauritius and begin sightseeing of the major tourist spots here. Some of the best places that you can visit here are the Crocodile Farm &amp; Nature Park, Bois Cheri- Tea Plantation and Factory, Saint Aubin Tea House, Grand Bassin, Mangal Mahadev- Shiva Statue and the village of Gris- Gris. You have the whole day to enjoy according to your own will. Have authentic Mauritian food during anytime of the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"22-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Make some adventurous memories Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the fifth day of your tour, have breakfast at the hotel. Get ready after that and proceed with the day\\u2019s itinerary. This day in entirely for leisure. It is a good chance to go out and try various activities in the shores of Mauritius. You may go for kayaking, snorkeling, swimming or scuba diving. You may also choose to relax by the pool of the resort. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"23-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Spend a leisurely day in Mauritius<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the sixth day of your tour, have breakfast. The entire day is for leisure. Spend it according to your own will. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"24-10-2024\",\"todo\":\"<p><em>Say good-bye to Mauritius with warm memories<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the seventh day of your tour, have breakfast and proceed to check out. The transfer service will drop you off at the airport. Board the flight and return to India with warm memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"6430\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Oct 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Oct 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 PM\",\"fare\":140596},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Mauritius (MRU)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"6749\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Mauritius (MRU)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"6748\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"806\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Oct 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"08:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/10\\/2024\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Mountain View room\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"24\\/10\\/2024\",\"city\":\"MAURITIUS\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Radisson Blu Poste Lafayette Resort & Spa\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"127588\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subj