(577, 'Mr Nishant Modi', 'BNI CELEB', '7870477591', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'TURKEY', '2024-10-12', 9, 0, 6, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"12\\/10\\/2024\",\"city\":\"CAPPADOCIA\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"15\\/10\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Serene Premium Stone House\",\"room_type\":\"Elite Room + 01 Comfort Room\",\"rate\":\"90480\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/10\\/2024\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ecclesia Boutique\",\"room_type\":\"Classic Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"18\\/10\\/2024\",\"city\":\"FETHIYE\",\"rate\":\"129381\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"18\\/10\\/2024\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/10\\/2024\",\"city\":\"ISTANBUL\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ayramin Deluxe\",\"rate\":\"95800\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>DAY WISE ITINERARY:</strong></p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>12 Oct :</strong> <strong>Inter Airport Transfer</strong> IST-SAW Airport for your flight to cappadocia. Arrival at Kayseri airport &amp; Transfer to hotel.<br />\nOvernight in Cappadocia.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>13 Oct :</strong> Early Morning head to <strong>Hot Air Balloon Tour</strong>. Overnight in Cappadocia.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>14 Oct :</strong> After Breakfast,&nbsp;<strong>Full Day Cappadocia South Tour </strong>with Underground City, Red Valley, Cavusin, Ortahisar, Pigeon<br />\nValley. Lunch at local Restaurant</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>15 Oct : </strong>After breakfast, <strong>transfer to Kayseri Airport </strong>for your flight to Dalaman airport PVT. Arrival at Dalaman airport &amp; Transfer<br />\nto Fethiye hotel. Overnight in Fethiye.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>16 Oct : </strong>After Breakfast,&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Mud bath and turtle beach tour</strong>,&nbsp;Lunch&nbsp;at local Restaurant. Overnight in Fethiye.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>17 Oct : </strong>After Breakfast,&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Butterfly valley boat tour,&nbsp;</strong>Lunch&nbsp;at local Restaurant. Overnight in Fethiye.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>18 Oct : </strong>After Breakfast,&nbsp;<strong>Paragliding Tour </strong>&amp; then&nbsp;Transfer to Dalaman Airport for your flight to Istanbul PVT. Arrive IST/SAW Airport than Transfer to Hotel. :&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>19 Oct : </strong>After Breakfast :&nbsp;<strong>Full Day istanbul </strong>Ottoman Relics and Byzantium Tour with Topkapi Palace, St Sophia, Hippodrome,<br />\nBlue Mosque and Grand Bazaar. Lunch at local Restaurant. Museum entrances are included.</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>21 Oct : </strong>After Breakfast : <strong>Cemberlitas Hamam Bath </strong>basic hamam (Self Service Bath) : Evening <strong>Bosphorus Cruise</strong> with&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;&amp; Folkloric Show (unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included)<br />\n<br />\n<strong>22 Oct : Transfer to IST/SAW Airport</strong> for your departure flight.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<strong>INCLUSIONS:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> accommodation at <strong>Hotel Serene Premium Stone House&nbsp;</strong>at Cappadocia .</li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> accommodation at <strong>Hotel Ecclesia Boutique&nbsp;</strong>at Fethiye.</li>\n	<li>03 Nights accommodation at <strong>Hotel Ayramin Deluxe</strong> at Istanbul.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective Hotels.</li>\n	<li>04 Local Lunches &amp; 01 Local Dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>Paragliding </strong>at Fethiye.</li>\n	<li><strong>Hot Air Balloon</strong> at Cappadocia.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers </strong>mentioned in the Itinerary (PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Tours &amp; Transfers</strong> on <strong>PVT Basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>English Speaking Tour Guide During Tours.</li>\n	<li>All Entrance Fees Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"8\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":315661,\"land_cost\":\"564300\",\"transport_cost\":\"4000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":883961,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 70716.88\",\"selling_price\":954677.880000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0568/092024', 954600, 159100, 0, '2024-09-14 10:42:33', '2024-09-19 05:09:25', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
