(587, 'Mr Anand Sahu', 'Argora', '9304047149', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2024-12-29', 5, 0, 10, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket \\u2013 Krabi\",\"date\":\"29-12-2024 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet our tour representative upon your arrival at Phuket Airport. Receive a warm welcome and enjoy a guided transfer to the hotel in Krabi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After reaching, complete the check-in formalities and spend the rest of the day doing leisurely activities of your interest. You can go out to explore the magnificent landscapes or partake in some adventure activities. Or else, you can sit back and soak in the comforts of your room.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at a hotel in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi Four Island Tour With Lunch\",\"date\":\"30-12-2024 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today morning&nbsp;have your breakfast and get ready for an enthralling 4 Island Krabi Tour. You will explore Thale-Whake, Chicken Island, Pordah Island, and Phra Nang Bay during this tour. If you get lucky enough, you witness a lovely white sand pathway revealed at low tide.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Walk from one island to the other and delight in a memorable experience. You can partake in several activities for the whole day and get rejuvenating vibes on these islands. You can enjoy romantic walks, indulge in adventure activities, soak in the pristine beauty, or do whatever suits you best.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at a hotel in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi - Phuket\",\"date\":\"31-12-2024 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check-out from the hotel &amp; you will get transferred to Phuket by surface.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching, complete the check-in formalities at the hotel and unwind. After some time, you will go out to explore the surroundings on your own or take a leisurely walk around.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at a hotel in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Tour With Lunch\",\"date\":\"01-01-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Begin the day with a delicious breakfast and get comfortably transferred to the stunning archipelago. Then, enjoy a boat ride to the beautiful island and curate lifetime memories. Once you reach it, marvel at the fantastic views of the Maya Bay landscapes. Later on, savor lunch at beachside hotels soaking in the matchless bliss. This is followed by a trip to the secluded parts of the beach, where you can partake in several watersports activities. Try your hands at snorkeling or swimming or try other activities. If you don\'t like watersports activities, you can sit back and bask in the sunshine.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at a hotel in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour\",\"date\":\"02-01-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post having your breakfast, get ready for a guided tour of Phuket. You will enjoy time travel while marveling at the Portuguese-style buildings during the sightseeing. The vibrant markets in Phuket will surely lure you into buying wonderful souvenirs that will remind you of this fantastic trip. You should show your bargaining skills in the market to buy as many things as you can without burning a hole in your pocket.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later on, you will be paying homage at the Wat Chalong Temple. When here, remember to witness the 60 meters tall stupa (chedi) protecting a bone fragment of Lord Buddha. Subsequently, you will visit Rawai Beach. A trip to Sea Gypsy village and Cape Promthep is also on the list.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay at a hotel in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"03-01-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Relish a tasty breakfast and wait for our tour representative to comfortably drive you to the airport. He will further take care that you enjoy an incredible journey back home.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"187\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2024\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2024\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"340000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"186\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2024\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramada by Wyndam Aonang\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/12\\/2024\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"31\\/12\\/2024\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel New Square Patong\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Kolkata.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Krabi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts </strong>Accommodation at <strong>Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Rooms&nbsp;</strong>on <strong>Double Sharing</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island - Pileh Lagoon - Khai Island - Maya Bay By Speed Boat with Lunch </strong><em>(Ex. NP Fee THB 400 Per Pax)</em> SIC.</li>\n	<li><strong>04 Island Tour&nbsp;By Speedboat&nbsp;with Picnic Lunch&nbsp;</strong><em>(Ex. NP Fee THB 200 Per Pax)</em>SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Guided Phuket City Tour.</strong></li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket HKT Airport To Krabi Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Krabi Hotel To Phuket Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Hotel&nbsp;To Phuket HKT Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Thailand Visa </strong>on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":340000,\"land_cost\":\"87500\",\"hotel_cost\":\"228000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":655500,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 78660\",\"selling_price\":734160}', '