(601, 'Mrs Mittal', NULL, '7765941881', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE + CRUISE', '2025-03-10', 6, 0, 5, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7235\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"37500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1015\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"392\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"20500\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1092\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 PM\",\"fare\":23245},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1014\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 PM\",\"fare\":47659},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5044\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Boss\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room + 01 Triple Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"115000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE CRUISE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Genting Dream RWC\",\"room_type\":\"Balcony Room + 01 Interior Stateroom\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"203575\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>SINGAPORE</strong>&nbsp;<strong>INCLUSIONS :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi </strong><em>for </em><strong><em>03 Pax.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Bangalore&nbsp;</strong><em>for </em><strong><em>02&nbsp;Pax.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Airport Transfers&nbsp;- PVT</strong><b>&nbsp;Basis.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Cruise Terminal Transfer</strong>&nbsp;<strong>- PVT</strong><b>&nbsp;Basis.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Boss</strong>, Singapore.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms</strong> : 01 DBL + 01 TRIPLE</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfasts </strong>@ Singapore Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore City Tour </strong>on <strong>SIC</strong></li>\n	<li>Full Day <strong>Sentosa</strong> <strong>Tour&nbsp;</strong>(Cable Car + WOT + S.E.A Aquarium + Sky Helix&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Full Day <strong>Universal Studios</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Gardens by the Bay</strong>: 2 Conservatories (Cloud Forest + Flower Dome)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Night Safari +&nbsp;River Wonder&nbsp;</strong>+ Tram Ride</li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore Visa</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>CRUISE INCLUSIONS :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> accommodation on <strong>Double Sharing + Triple Sharing</strong> basis in <strong>01 Interstate Room Cabin + 01 Balcony State Room Cabin.</strong></li>\n	<li>Port Charges</li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Complimentary meals Per&nbsp;day</strong> – at the following Restaurants<br />\n	Dream Dining Lower/ Deck 7 FWD ( International Cusine)<br />\n	Dream Dining Upper/ Deck 8 FWD ( Chinese Cusine)<br />\n	The Lido/ Deck 16 AFT -24 Hours Snacks (Finger Food) Counter<br />\n	( Indian Cusine, jain meals available )<br />\n	3 more venues (Blue Lagoon, Crystal Life Cuisine and Function 8) for inclusive meals services:<br />\n	Blue Lagoon inclusive meal set will be an extension from Dream Dinning Upper for lunch and dinner.<br />\n	Crystal Life Cuisine will serve breakfast, lunch and dinner with simple set menu.</li>\n	<li>Usage of specified cruise facilities (As per Daily Programme List)</li>\n	<li>Participation in our specified cruise activities (As per Daily Programme List)</li>\n	<li>Usage of Rope Course, Zip Lining, Rock Climbing, Swimming Pool, Jacuzzi, Gymnasium, Water Slides, Mini Golf, Basketball</li>\n</ul>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><b>Gratuities (applicable to&nbsp;2&nbsp;yrs and above): SGD 27 per person per&nbsp;night have to pay on cruise directly</b></li>\n	<li><strong>5% TCS</strong> will be Applicable on <strong>Land</strong> &amp; <strong>Cruise Portion</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>CRUISE :&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Any meal or snack you have at other restaurant other than specified above will be chargeable</li>\n	<li>Beverage Orders</li>\n	<li>Massage Centre ,Beauty Salon</li>\n	<li>Late night adult show</li>\n	<li>Game Rental / KTV Rooms / Conference Facilities</li>\n	<li>Shore Excursions</li>\n	<li>Glow Bowl</li>\n	<li>Exercise Classes and Personal Trainer</li>\n	<li>Casino and Gambling Activities</li>\n	<li>Dining Entertainment</li>\n	<li>Transfers and airfares (unless pre-purchased with air/sea packages)</li>\n	<li>Hotel Stays pre-/post-cruise (unless pre-purchased)</li>\n	<li>Duty-free shopping</li>\n	<li>Photography</li>\n	<li>Internet Access</li>\n	<li>Baby Sitting Services</li>\n	<li>Specialty Onboard Seminars</li>\n	<li>Art purchases</li>\n	<li>Gift shop purchases</li>\n	<li>Video Arcade</li>\n	<li>Phone calls off the ship</li>\n	<li>Wi/Fi &amp; Satellite connection for tablets, phones/mobile devices</li>\n	<li>Laundry Services</li>\n	<li>Use of the Medical Centre</li>\n	<li>Any additional credit card and fuel surcharges; and taxes on the provision of additional services, including services that are not provided by Resort World Cruises.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":128904,\"hotel_cost\":318575,\"land_cost\":\"136155\",\"visa_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":598634,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 83808.76\",\"selling_price\":682442.76000000000931322574615478515625}', 'MZQ/0592/0112024', 682300, 136460, 0, '2024-11-05 12:49:36', '2024-11-05 12:49:36', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Each stateroom must have at least one passenger who is age 18+<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Age of Infant: 6 months to less than 2 years old. Infants must be at least 6 months old on date of sailing to be allowed to board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;All passports must have at least 6 months validity from the date of sailing<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Passengers are responsible to ensure that all travel documents and visas are in order prior to departure from their home country<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruise Pte Ltd will not accept passengers who have entered their 24th week of pregnancy by the beginning of, or at any time during their cruise vacation<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruises Pte Ltd reserves the right to cancel or substitute any scheduled port of call\\/itinerary\\/price\\/programme at any time without prior notice<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Distance from the airport to the departure port is approx. 25-45 Mins. (Depending on the traffic)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check-in starts 4 hours prior to the sailing time and closes 2 hours before the sailing time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Your cabin key is also a currency card for the cruise, all the onboard purchases\\/gratuities will be added in the same and the final amount would have to be settled at the time of check out<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You would get a Daily Programme List once you check in, the same would contain the details of all the onboard activities and entertainment shows<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Wi-Fi packages available on board at additional cost<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You can\'t carry alcohol on board, liquor packages can be booked on board<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;A swimming costume is mandatory to access the swimming pool<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check out formalities takes almost two hours (please plan your return Flight accordingly)&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
