 arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique Hotel.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp; Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Bhawna Clarks.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Fern Residency.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Airport Pickup</strong>&nbsp;by Innova Crysta / Similar <strong>on&nbsp;PVT basis.<em>(12th Feb)</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing &amp; tour </strong>by Innova Crysta / Similar <strong>on PVT basis<em>(15-18th Feb).</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"44\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":33217,\"transport_cost\":\"24500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":57717,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25395.48\",\"selling_price\":83112.479999999