/b></li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island - Pileh Lagoon - Khai Island - Maya Bay </strong>By Speed Boat with Lunch <em>(Ex. NP Fee THB 400 Per Pax)</em>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Phuket Guided City Tour.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World with Marine Park</strong> with Indian Lunch.</li>\n	<li><strong>Bangkok City Tour.</strong></li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket HKT Airport To Krabi Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Krabi Hotel To Phuket Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Hotel&nbsp;To Phuket HKT Airport PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok DMK Airport&nbsp;To Bangkok Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Thailand Visa </strong>on Arrival.</li>\n	<li><strong>For 03 years old Kids</strong> you can&nbsp;Pay Directly in the sightseeings wherever required.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":58148,\"hotel_cost\":44300,\"land_cost\":\"39000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":141448,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18388.24\",\"selling_price\":159836.23999999999068677425384521484375,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"13.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0612/0122024', 159960, 79980, 35620, '2024-12-12 05:44:41', '2024-12-12 05:44:41', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(622, 'Mr Manish', 'Betiah', '9955330000', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SRILANKA', '2025-01-14', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"14-01-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Sri Lanka. You will be met by our representative&nbsp;and transferred to&nbsp;Hotel @ Colombo.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO - PINNNAWALA \\u2013 KANDY\",\"date\":\"15-01-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Checkout &amp; proceed to Kandy (Travel time approx: 03 &amp; \\u00bd hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En route visit *Pinnawela Elephant Orphanage \\u2013 (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;App. 55 miles from Colombo, off the Colombo - Kandy road is Pinnawela, where an orphanage was started in 1975 to house the abandoned and the wounded elephants. The number of elephants has increased to more than 65 now; including Baby Elephants brought from various parts, as well as the 23 babies born, as a result of the captive breeding programme. The best time to visit is the feeding time from 0930-1000 hrs and 1330-1400 hrs and the bathing time from 1000-1030 hrs and 1400-1430 hrs when all the elephants are taken to the river close by.&nbsp;(CLOSING TIME @04 PM) \\u2013<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>*Pinnawala Open Zoo<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>*Spice Garden Visit&nbsp;\\u2013 (Included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to *Kandy<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>*Gem Gallery visit - \\u2013 (Included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Evening witness the colorful Kandy Cultural Show<\\/strong> -\\u2013 (Included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Kandy<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY - PERADENIYA - KANDY\",\"date\":\"16-01-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;<b>*Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic<\\/b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b>\\u2013 (Entry tickets Not included in the package)<\\/b>&nbsp;ever since 4th Century A.D, when the Buddha\'s Tooth was brought to Sri Lanka hidden from sacrilegious hands in an Orissan princess\' hair, the Relic has grown in repute and holiness in Sri Lanka and throughout the Buddhist world. It is considered Sri Lanka\'s most prized possession.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit&nbsp;<b>*Peradeniya Royal Botanical Garden<\\/b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b>\\u2013 (Entry tickets Not included in the package)<\\/b>&nbsp;147 acres in extent; Started in 1374 as a pleasure garden of the Kings of Gampola and Kandy.&nbsp; There are more than 4,000 species of trees, plants and creepers. Some rare and endemic as well as flora from the tropical world are found in the gardens.&nbsp; Spice Garden and Orchid House are popular with tourists. There are 5 Palm Avenues beautifying the gardens, the earliest and tallest Palm Avenue (Royal Palm Avenue) was planted in 1905 and the Double Coconuts from the Seashells Island, with the largest seed of all plants in the world is one such avenue.&nbsp;<i>(The excursion will take approx: 2 hrs)<\\/i><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to Kandy &amp; visit Kandy city in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Kandy<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KANDY - NUWARA ELIYA\",\"date\":\"17-01-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Today&nbsp;morning you will be going to&nbsp;Nuwara Eliya&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 02 &amp; 1\\/2hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En route visit&nbsp;Ramboda Hanumanji Temple (subject to temple timing), Tea Plantation &amp; Ramboda Falls<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon proceed to Nuwara Eliya<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy the scenic beauty of hill country<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Nuwara Eliya&nbsp;- The \\u2018Little England\\u2019 of Sri Lanka, is set against beautiful backdrops of Mountains, Valleys, Waterfalls and Tea Plantations. It is supposed to be one of the coolest places in the Island, but it is really just like an English spring day, although the temperature does drop at night. All around Nuwara Eliya you will see evidence of the British influence, houses like country cottages or Queen Ann style mansions. The Victoria Park, in the middle of the town, is a lovely place for a stroll or a picnic and is also good for Birding as you get some rare birds in this Park. Seasons may be absent elsewhere in Sri Lanka, but here you can read them by the flowers, which bloom in the spring (March to May) and the fall (August and September). These are the \\u201cseasons\\u201d when low-country folk flock to Nuwara Eliya to escape the sea level heat and humidity.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Gregory Lake &amp; Boat Ride&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Hakgala Botanical Garden&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Victoria Park&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Seetha Amman Temple &amp; Asoka Vatika&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Nuwara Eliya<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUWARA ELIYA \\u2013 BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"18-01-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the Hotel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to&nbsp;Bentota&nbsp;(Travel time approx: 05hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>En-route&nbsp;*Witness St Clairs Falls &amp; Devon Falls<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Optional \\u2013 Kitulgala White Water Rafting \\u2013 USD 10 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Continue to Bentota<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Bentota&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA\",\"date\":\"19-01-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Commence Bentota sightseeing&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Maadu River Ride<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride &amp; Tube Ride)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in Bentota&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BENTOTA - COLOMBO\",\"date\":\"20-01-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Proceed to&nbsp;Colombo&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>*Colombo -&nbsp;a drive through the city taking you to the busy commercial areas as well as the tree-lined residential, Cinnamon Gardens. Visit Fort, the former British administrative center and military garrison, Sea Street - the Goldsmith\\u2019s quarters in the heart of Pettah, the Bazaar area, where is also a Hindu Temple with elaborate stone carvings, and the Dutch Church of Wolfendhal dating back to 1749. Also visit the BMICH, see the replica of Avukana Buddha &amp; the Independence Square.&nbsp;&nbsp; (Entry tickets Not included in the package)&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at&nbsp;a Hotel in COLOMBO<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COLOMBO - AIRPORT\",\"date\":\"21-01-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon completion, you will be transferred to the airport for your departure flight back to India.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"805\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"27000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1163\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Colombo (CMB)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1168\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"30500\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6451\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:15 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Cinnamon Red\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"15\\/01\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"8500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"15\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Topaz\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/01\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NUWARA ELIYA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Blackpool\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/01\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"18\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BENTOTA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Palms\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/01\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"20\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"COLOMBO\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Granbell\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/01\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Patna.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nt&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at <strong>Hotel Cinnamon Red</strong>&nbsp;at Colombo.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Hotel Topaz</strong>&nbsp;at Kandy.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nt&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at <strong>Hotel Blackpool</strong>&nbsp;at Nuwara Eliya.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nts</strong> Accommodation at <strong>Hotel The Palms</strong> at Bentota.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nt&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at <strong>Hotel Morven</strong>&nbsp;at Colombo.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfasts &amp; Dinners.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Arrival &amp; Departure Assistance </strong>at the Airport</li>\n	<li><strong>City Tour </strong>&amp; <strong>Shopping.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Transfers &amp; Sightseeings by <strong>A/C Vehicle on PVT basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>Services of <em><strong>English-Speaking Chauffeur Driver.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nos. of 500 ml of Mineral Water Bottle</strong>&nbsp; – per person per day throughout the tour</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Complimentary Sim Card on arrival</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":57500,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"82960\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":140460,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21069\",\"selling_price\":161529}', 'MZQ/0613/0122024', 161940, 80970, 0, '2024-12-12 12:13:23', '2024-12-12 12:13:23', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>Visa Fee \\u2013 has been exempted officially until further notice&nbsp;-<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li><b>Can be obtained on arrival<\\/b><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Required doc\\/s,<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Passport should be valid 6months prior to the arrival<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Service voucher&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Return Airtickets<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<table cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\">\\n\\t<tbody>\\n\\t\\t<tr>\\n\\t\\t\\t<td>\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b>Supplement for the entrance fee which aren\\u2019t included in the above mentioned costs:<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b><u>Colombo<\\/u><\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Gangaramaya Floating Temple in Colombo \\u2013 USD 02 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Colombo Lotus Tower \\u2013 USD 24 per person (inclusive of VAT [18%])<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b><u>Kandy<\\/u><\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Temple of the Tooth Relic \\u2013 USD 05 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage + Pinnawala Open Zoo (Combo offer) \\u2013 USD 12 per person (inclusive of VAT [18%])<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Peradeniya Royal Botanical Garden \\u2013 USD 10 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b><u>Nuwara Eliya<\\/u><\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hakgala Botanical Garden \\u2013 USD 10 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Gregory Lake \\u2013 USD 02 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Gregory Lake Boat Ride \\u2013 USD 22 per boat upto 06pax<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Victoria Park \\u2013 USD 02 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p><b><u>Bentota \\u2013 only if booked through Red Apple<\\/u><\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Maadu River Ride \\u2013 USD 22 per boat upto 06pax and every additional pax will be charged USD 02 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride, Tube Ride) \\u2013 USD 18 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery \\u2013 USD 03 per person<\\/p>\\n\\n\\t\\t\\t<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/td>\\n\\t\\t<\\/tr>\\n\\t<\\/tbody>\\n<\\/table>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Vehicle type<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7<em><strong>&nbsp;Based on 01 to 02 Adults \\u2013 Toyota PRIUS \\/ AXIO \\/ Honda FIT SHUTTLE or Honda Insight or Similar<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"', 0, 0);
