modation at <strong>Thekkady.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Allepey.</strong></li>\n	<li>Buffet/Fixed Menu&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast + Dinner @ Cochin,&nbsp;Munnar, Thekkady&nbsp;</strong>&amp; <strong>All Meals&nbsp;@ Allepey.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>02 Innova Crysta&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary (A/C will be switched off during hilly drives).</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":209729,\"hotel_cost\":232712,\"transport_cost\":\"47000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":489441,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 73416.15\",\"selling_price\":562857.150000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0617/0122024', 562856, 70357, 20220, '2024-12-20 13:54:22', '2024-12-20 13:55:10', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(628, 'Mr. Sneh Naman', 'GYM', '7763810001', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2025-01-03', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"03-01-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"04-01-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"05-01-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"06-01-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"07-01-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"08-01-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2641\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":24772},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Akasa Air\",\"fno\":\"1926\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Jan 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Jan 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"fare\":20431}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"03\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sand Heaven\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/01\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"5700\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea\\u00a0Hills\\u00a0Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Pearl\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/01\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"16600\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sands Beach Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Casa Aqua\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/01\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"7800\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"07\\/01\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sand Heaven\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/01\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"5700\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at given hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":45203,\"land_cost\":\"37200\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":35800},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":118203,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21276.54\",\"selling_price\":139479.54000000000814907252788543701171875}', 'MZQ/0618/0122024', 138080, 56560, 12480, '2024-12-24 11:02:15', '2024-12-24 13:23:10', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
