s than 2 years old. Infants must be at least 6 months old on date of sailing to be allowed to board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;All passports must have at least 6 months validity from the date of sailing<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Passengers are responsible to ensure that all travel documents and visas are in order prior to departure from their home country<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruise Pte Ltd will not accept passengers who have entered their 24th week of pregnancy by the beginning of, or at any time during their cruise vacation<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruises Pte Ltd reserves the right to cancel or substitute any scheduled port of call\\/itinerary\\/price\\/programme at any time without prior notice<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Distance from the airport to the departure port is approx. 25-45 Mins. (Depending on the traffic)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check-in starts 4 hours prior to the sailing time and closes 2 hours before the sailing time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Your cabin key is also a currency card for the cruise, all the onboard purchases\\/gratuities will be added in the same and the final amount would have to be settled at the time of check out<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You would get a Daily Programme List once you check in, the same would contain the details of all the onboard activities and entertainment shows<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Wi-Fi packages available on board at additional cost<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You can\'t carry alcohol on board, liquor packages can be booked on board<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;A swimming costume is mandatory to access the swimming pool<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check out formalities takes almost two hours (please plan your return Flight accordingly)&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(634, 'Dr. Rajshri', 'priyal Chaubey', '7070469697', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 4*', '2025-03-13', 5, 1, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Srinagar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"13-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to Srinagar.After fresh up&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar Local&nbsp;&nbsp;Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden,Cheshmashahi,&nbsp;Pari mahal&nbsp;You have To hire a Union vehicle Upto 1 km,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"14-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning, proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 02:00 - 02:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride&nbsp;&nbsp;to Thajiwas Glacier&nbsp;(at your own cost) &amp; Zero Point by union vehicle&nbsp;&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.Return back to Srinagar.Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"15-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 51 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;&nbsp;02:00&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region &amp;&nbsp;You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel in&nbsp; Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Note :-In case there is heavy snowfall at that time,Govt. does not allow our vehicle towards gulmarg..In that case you have to hire a chain block vehicle from&nbsp;Tangmarg&nbsp;to Gulmarg &amp; Return (Own Cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"16-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 140 kms, and will be covered in about 03:00 - 03:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost).&nbsp;Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;to see&nbsp; famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Hotel In&nbsp; Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar + H.B\",\"date\":\"17-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Srinagar.Later&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included&nbsp; For 01 Hour).Dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight Stay at Houseboat in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport Drop\",\"date\":\"18-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning,drive to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5043\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":59634},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5106\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2221\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"fare\":50664},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5071\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Kaisar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"check_out\":\"15\\/03\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"15\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/03\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"16\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel White Water Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/03\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"17\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Houseboat Young Bombay\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/03\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Ranchi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Grand Kaisar / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Park / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel White Water Resort&nbsp;/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Deluxe HouseBoat&nbsp;Young Bombay&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>02 Double Rooms + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ac Innova /Similar</strong><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><i> </i></span></font>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":110298,\"land_cost\":\"106200\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":216498,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25979.76\",\"selling_price\":242477.76000000000931322574615478515625}', 'MZQ/0624/012025', 242720, 44840, 18520, '2025-01-16 12:28:20', '2025-01-16 12:59:22', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(635, 'Mr Bishnu Maroo', 'Dr Rajesh Maroo', '9040095230', 'maroohimgiri@yahoo.com', 'GOA', '2025-03-01', 3, 0, 50, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GOA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ginger Candolim An IHCL Brand\",\"room_type\":\"Luxe Room \\u2013 Queen\\/Twin\",\"rooms\":25,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"04\\/03\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><b>MEALS:</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>01 Mar&nbsp;: Welcome Drink on Arrival + Dinner</li>\n	<li>02 Mar&nbsp;: Breakfast + Lunch<i> </i>+ Dinner<i>(Casino)</i></li>\n	<li>03 Mar&nbsp;:&nbsp;Breakfast + Lunch&nbsp;+ Dinner</li>\n	<li>04 Mar&nbsp;: Breakfast + Departure</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>FOOD MENU&nbsp;</b><i><b>(Lunch/Dinner)</b></i><b>:</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>1 Soup, Variety of Salads, Variety of Raitas,</li>\n	<li>01 Dal Preparation, 01 Paneer Preparation, 01 Veg Preparation, 02 Non-Veg Preparation,</li>\n	<li>Indian Breads, Rice, 1 Hot and 1 Cold Dessert</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>CONFERENCE HALL (<i>FOR 01 EVENING 07:30 PM till 10:30 PM</i>) :&nbsp;</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Synergy Hall (2400Sq.ft) 120 on cluster seating</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>DELTIN CASINO PREMIUM PACKAGE:</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Red Label / Ballantine / Black &amp; White / 100 Pipers / Vat 69 /&nbsp;Passport Scotch / Black Dog 12yrs / Smirnoff Regular</li>\n	<li>Gordons Gin Strangers &amp; Sons Gin Morpheus Carlsburg Ampersand Red &amp; White Wine Sidus by Fratelli</li>\n	<li>Red &amp; White Wine Rose Wine Barney\'s Hard Seltzer Breezers Energy Drinks</li>\n	<li><b><i>Also, includes&nbsp;Classic Package&nbsp;Liquors</i></b> (Signature / Blenders Pride / Roullete / Magic Moment / Old Monk / Bacardi White / Bacardi Black</li>\n	<li>Cabo Blue Riband / Honey Bee / Mansion House / Kingfisher Pint /&nbsp;Big boss Coconut Feni / Big boss Cashew Feni).</li>\n	<li><i>Brands are subject to availability.</i></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><b>TRANSPORTATION :</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>02 Nos. AC Coaches each 40 Seater for all Transfers &amp; Tours.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><b>DAY WISE ITINERARY :</b></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><b>01 Mar : </b>Airport Pickup&nbsp;&amp; Check-in @Hotel</li>\n	<li><b>02 Mar :&nbsp;</b>North Goa&nbsp;Sightseeing&nbsp;+&nbsp;Deltin Casino&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><b>03 Mar :&nbsp;</b>North&nbsp;Goa&nbsp;Sightseeing + Water Sports</li>\n	<li><b>04 Mar :</b>&nbsp;Airport Drop&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>40 % at the time of Confirmation.</li>\n	<li>Balance 60 %&nbsp; to be paid 15 days prior to the check in</li>\n	<li>All Extras to be settled before checkout</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>30 Days before check-in date: 100 % Cancellable</li>\n	<li>15 Days before Check-in date: 50% retention will be applicable</li>\n	<li>15-0 Days before check-in date: 100% retention will be charged</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"68000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"495865\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Deltin Casino\",\"amount\":\"152100\"},{\"name\":\"Tour Coordinator for 02 days\",\"amount\":\"4400\"}],\"cost_price\":720365,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 144073\",\"selling_price\":864438}', 'MZQ/0625/012025', 877500, 17550, 0, '2025-01-16 14:00:31', '2025-03-03 07:57:10', 0, 0, '\"<p><b>SUPPLEMENT COST <i>(+ 18 % Taxes)<\\/i>: <\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul dir=\\\"ltr\\\">\\n\\t<li>Projector, Mike, Screen :&nbsp; Rs 12000\\/-&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Stage 10 x 12 | LED Wall - 8 X 10 : Rs 35000\\/-<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Hi-tea (Tea, Coffee, cookies and 01 Snack) :&nbsp; Rs 400\\/- per person<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Cocktail Snacks (02 Veg + 2 Non-Veg Snacks) :&nbsp; Rs 750\\/- per person<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Mocktails and Juices will be charged on actuals<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><b>WATER SPORTS PACKAGE<\\/b>: Rs 1250\\/- Per Pax + 5% Taxes (Parasailing + Banana Ride + Jetski Ride + Speed Boat Bumper Ride)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>LIQUORS: <\\/b>Bottle Rates will be applicable as per attached rate sheet + 22% Taxes<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>NOTE: <\\/b>PPL\\/NOVEX\\/IPRS license is mandatory for any musical event (Approx Charges: Rs 180000\\/-)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Water Sports Package:<\\/strong> <strong>Rs 1250\\/- Per Pax<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Parasailing&nbsp;<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Banana Ride<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Jetski Ride<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Speed Boat<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bumper Ride<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
