y\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"check_out\":\"15\\/02\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel One Farrer\",\"room_type\":\"Mint Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"33068\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"CRUISE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Royal Caribbean Anthem of the Seas\",\"room_type\":\"Balcony Stateroom\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"19\\/02\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"311080\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel One Farrer\",\"room_type\":\"Mint Room\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"22\\/02\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":2,\"rate\":\"83528\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>SINGAPORE INCLUSIONS :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Raipur.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>Hotel One Farrer, Singapore.</strong></li>\n	<li>02&nbsp;Rooms on <strong>Double&nbsp;Sharing</strong></li>\n	<li>All<strong> Breakfasts</strong> @ Singapore Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Airport Transfer to SIN Hotel&nbsp;-&nbsp;</strong>PVT Basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Cruise Terminal Transfers -&nbsp;</strong>PVT Basis.<br />\n	<strong>01 Coach Terminal Transfer -&nbsp;</strong>PVT Basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>Merlion City Drive</strong> (Arts Museum + CBD area + China Town + Civic District + Civilian War memorial + Dhoby Ghaut + Esplanade Theatre By the Bay + Helix Bridge + Istana (Orchard) + Marina Floating Bay + Merlion (PHOTO-STOP) + SIN Flyer (PHOTO-STOP) + Plaza Singapura + Raffles Hotel + Suntec city + Swiss Hotel Stamford)</li>\n	<li>Full Day <strong>Universal Studios</strong></li>\n	<li>Full Day<b>&nbsp;</b><strong>Sentosa Tour</strong>&nbsp;<em>(S.E.A. Aquarium + Cable Car + Wings Of Time + Sky Helix).&nbsp;</em></li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Bay&nbsp;</strong>Sands Sky Park.</li>\n	<li><strong>Gardens by the Bay:</strong> 2 Conservatories <em>(Cloud Forest + Flower Dome)</em>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Night Safari + River Wonders&nbsp;</strong><em>(Animal Show + Tram Ride).</em></li>\n	<li>All Tours on <strong>SIC basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore Visa.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>CRUISE INCLUSIONS :</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> accommodation on <strong>Quad Sharing </strong>in <em><strong>Balcony State Room Cabin.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Port Charges</li>\n	<li><strong>Complimentary meals </strong>Per day</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</h3>\n\n<table>\n	<thead>\n		<tr>\n			<th>Date</th>\n			<th>Port<sup>***</sup></th>\n			<th>Arrive</th>\n			<th>Depart</th>\n			<th>Activity</th>\n		</tr>\n	</thead>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">15-Feb-2025</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">16:30:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">EMBARK</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">16-Feb-2025</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">PENANG - MALAYSIA</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">14:00:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">21:00:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">DOCKED</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">17-Feb-2025</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">PHUKET - THAILAND</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">08:00:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">20:00:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">TENDERED</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">18-Feb-2025</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">CRUISING</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">CRUISING</td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">19-Feb-2025</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">SINGAPORE - SINGAPORE</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">07:00:00</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">&nbsp;</td>\n			<td data-title=\"Day\">DEBARK</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>5% TCS</strong> Applicable on Land + Cruise.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>CRUISE EXCLUSIONS:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>As of November 1, 2024, the automatic service gratuity of $18.50 USD per person, per day for guests in non-suites staterooms and Junior Suite, or $21.00 USD per person, per day for guests in Suites, will be applied to each guest’s SeaPass account on a daily basis. The gratuity applies to individual guests of all ages and stateroom categories. As a way to reward our crew members for their outstanding service, gratuities are shared among dining, bar &amp; culinary services staff, stateroom attendants and other hotel services teams who work behind the scenes to enhance the cruise experience.<br />\n	A 18% gratuity is automatically added to all beverages and mini bar items.<br />\n	A 20% gratuity is automatically added to all spa &amp; salon purchases.</li>\n	<li>Any meal or snack you have at other restaurant other than specified above will be chargeable</li>\n	<li>Beverage Orders</li>\n	<li>Massage Centre ,Beauty Salon</li>\n	<li>Late night adult show</li>\n	<li>Game Rental / KTV Rooms / Conference Facilities</li>\n	<li>Shore Excursions</li>\n	<li>Glow Bowl</li>\n	<li>Exercise Classes and Personal Trainer</li>\n	<li>Casino and Gambling Activities</li>\n	<li>Dining Entertainment</li>\n	<li>Transfers and airfares (unless pre-purchased with air/sea packages)</li>\n	<li>Hotel Stays pre-/post-cruise (unless pre-purchased)</li>\n	<li>Duty-free shopping</li>\n	<li>Photography</li>\n	<li>Internet Access</li>\n	<li>Baby Sitting Services</li>\n	<li>Specialty Onboard Seminars</li>\n	<li>Art purchases</li>\n	<li>Gift shop purchases</li>\n	<li>Video Arcade</li>\n	<li>Phone calls off the ship</li>\n	<li>Wi/Fi &amp; Satellite connection for tablets, phones/mobile devices</li>\n	<li>Laundry Services</li>\n	<li>Use of the Medical Centre</li>\n	<li>Any additional credit card and fuel surcharges; and taxes on the provision of additional services, including services that are not provided by Resort World Cruises.</li>\n	<li>Any Government Taxes e.g. TCS or GST or TDS, etc.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":142261,\"hotel_cost\":427676,\"land_cost\":\"111139\",\"visa_cost\":\"13000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Cancellation Loss 01 Pax (RPR-HKT \\/ BKK-RPR)\",\"amount\":13135},{\"name\":\"TCS\",\"amount\":16957}],\"cost_price\":724168,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":820000,\"profit_figure\":\"95832\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"13.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0628/022025', 820000, 205000, 0, '2025-02-01 09:19:58', '2025-02-12 07:06:26', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>IMPORTANT INFORMATION<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Each stateroom must have at least one passenger who is age 18+<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Age of Infant: 6 months to less than 2 years old. Infants must be at least 6 months old on date of sailing to be allowed to board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;All passports must have at least 6 months validity from the date of sailing<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Passengers are responsible to ensure that all travel documents and visas are in order prior to departure from their home country<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruise Pte Ltd will not accept passengers who have entered their 24th week of pregnancy by the beginning of, or at any time during their cruise vacation<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;RW Cruises Pte Ltd reserves the right to cancel or substitute any scheduled port of call\\/itinerary\\/price\\/programme at any time without prior notice<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Distance from the airport to the departure port is approx. 25-45 Mins. (Depending on the traffic)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check-in starts 4 hours prior to the sailing time and closes 2 hours before the sailing time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Your cabin key is also a currency card for the cruise, all the onboard purchases\\/gratuities will be added in the same and the final amount would have to be settled at the time of check out<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You would get a Daily Programme List once you check in, the same would contain the details of all the onboard activities and entertainment shows<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Wi-Fi packages available on board at additional cost<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;You can\'t carry alcohol on board, liquor packages can be booked on board<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;A swimming costume is mandatory to access the swimming pool<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;Check out formalities takes almost two hours (please plan your return Flight accordingly)&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(639, 'MR SAKET SARAF', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9835574327', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MALAYSIA', '2025-03-08', 7, 1, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"185\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"63274\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Langkawi (LGK)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"1438\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"22060\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Langkawi (LGK)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"1433\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"184\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LANGKAWI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pelangi Beach Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Garden Terrace\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"48576\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KUALALUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Berjaya Times Square\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room with Bathtub\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"13562\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GENTING\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/03\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Resort Hotel Genting\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"19536\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Kolkata</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accomodation on DBl Sharing @&nbsp;<strong>Langkawi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accomodation on DBl Sharing @&nbsp;<strong>Kualalumpur.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accomodation on DBl Sharing @&nbsp;<strong>Genting.</strong></li>\n	<li><em><strong>Under Water World</strong></em>&nbsp;- Tickets&nbsp;<b>**&nbsp;Ticket Only</b></li>\n	<li><em><strong>Langkawi Island Hoping&nbsp;</strong></em>(Entrance Fee for fresh lake upto 10 MYR is to be paid directly on tour) + Transfers &amp; Boat trip to Pregnant Maiden Island, Beras Basah Island &amp; Singa Besar Island on Seat In Coach Boat)</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Half Day Langkawi Island Tour</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;(Excludes Entrance Fee)</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Batu Caves&nbsp;</strong></em>( 20 Min Photo Stop )</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Genting Cable Car&nbsp;</strong></em>(two Way)&nbsp;<b>**&nbsp;Ticket Only&nbsp;&nbsp;**</b></li>\n	<li><em><strong>Skyworld Outdoor Theme Park</strong></em>&nbsp;One Day Pass (except&nbsp;Tuesday)&nbsp;<b>**&nbsp;Ticket Only&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></li>\n	<li><em><strong>Half Day City Tour With Kl Tower</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>Full Day Sunway Lagoon Tour</strong>&nbsp;(Except&nbsp;Tuesday)&nbsp;(All parks included except Extreme Park (Bungy Jump, G-Force X &amp; Go Kart)&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;<strong>Airport Transfers &amp; Tours&nbsp;</strong>on<em><strong>&nbsp;PVT basis.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Malaysia&nbsp;<strong>Tourist Visa</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>DAY WISE ITINERARY: </strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>09 Feb: </strong>Arrival Langkawi &amp; Hotel Checkin</p>\n\n<p><strong>10 Feb: </strong>Langkawi Island Hoping</p>\n\n<p><strong>11 Feb: </strong>Half Day Langkawi Island Tour + Under Water World</p>\n\n<p><strong>12 Feb: </strong>LGK-KUL Arrival &amp; Hotel Checkin</p>\n\n<p><strong>13 Feb: </strong>Full Day Sunway Lagoon</p>\n\n<p><strong>14 Feb: </strong>KUL-GEN + Batu Caves &amp; Hotel Checkin +&nbsp;+ Genting Cable Car (two Way)</p>\n\n<p><strong>15 Feb: </strong>Skyworld Outdoor Theme Park One Day Pass</p>\n\n<p><strong>16 Feb: </strong>GEN @12:00 Noon -Half Day City Tour With Kl Tower- Departure Transfer(Drop to KUL Airport by 06:30 Pm)</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":85334,\"land_cost\":\"59840\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":81674},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":226848,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":255224,\"profit_figure\":\"28376\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"12.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0629/022025', 257000, 95000, 67000, '2025-02-07 14:11:27', '2025-02-13 13:20:11', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(640, 'Mr. Sujit', 'Shanky', '6299074516', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 3*', '2025-02-15', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"15-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"16-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"17-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise. Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach for Sunset\",\"date\":\"18-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil Island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neil\\u2019s jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"atural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip. Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop\",\"date\":\"19-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpurbeach.Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"20-02-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"263\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Feb 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Feb 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"16700\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Feb 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Feb 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"13200\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Luxor\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/02\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Placid Garden Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Areca Garden View Cottage Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/02\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pearl Park Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/02\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/02\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Bay Walk By Sea Side\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/02\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at given hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":29900,\"land_cost\":\"45612\",\"visa_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":75512,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15102.4\",\"selling_price\":90614.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0630/022025', 91240, 45620, 56700, '2025-02-11 11:09:32', '2025-02-11 11:09:32', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(641, 'Mr. Gopal Tibrewala', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BALI', '2025-03-14', 5, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"64\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:30 AM\",\"fare\":\"80682\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"378\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"377\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"65\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Bliss Surfer \\/ Similar\",\"city\":\"BALI Kuta\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"19\\/03\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"13300\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Extra <strong>Check-in Baggage&nbsp;20 Kgs</strong>&nbsp;Included in AirAsia Flight.</li>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Nts Accommodation </strong>on Double Sharing in the above-mentioned <strong>Hotel.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast</strong> in all the Hotels.</li>\n	<li>Return Airport Transfers.</li>\n	<li><strong>Tanjung Benoa Water Sports</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Uluwatu Temple with Kecak Dance&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Full Day&nbsp;West Nusa penida Day trip</strong> including Local Lunch</li>\n	<li><strong>Kintamani Volcano view +&nbsp;Ubud Market</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by&nbsp;AC car Xenia /Avanza / Suzuki APV / with English speaking DRIVER&nbsp;on a<strong> PRIVATE basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">DAY WISE ITINERARY:</span></span></span></strong></em></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 01&nbsp;:</strong> Arrival Bali. Meet &amp; Greet with our Representative (driver)+ Welcome flower garland &amp; Coconut drink at Airport. Transfer to Hotel.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 02&nbsp;: </strong>Breakfast. pick up at 10.00 for Water sport at Tanjung Benoa (include 1x adventure parasailing, jet ski, banana boat) other activities on personal account. &nbsp;And then followed by &nbsp;&nbsp;Uluwatu Temple - Kecak Dance Tour )(B)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 03&nbsp;:</strong> Breakfast. Pick up at 07.00 for full day Nusa Penida West tour visit Angel Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Cliff, Crystal Bay Beach. Boat return at 16.30. local Lunch include.&nbsp; (B, L)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 04 :&nbsp;</strong>Breakfast at hotel. Pick up at 08.30 for Handara gate, Bedugul Ulundanu temple, Tanah lot temple (B)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 05 :</strong> Breakfast at hotel. Check out Pick up at 08.30 for Kintamani a Mt. Batur Volcano View, Coffee agro plantation, Tegalalang rice terrace, tirta empul temple, Ubud art market and royal palace. drop off to check in &nbsp;hotel in Ubud &nbsp;(B)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><strong>Day 06 :</strong> Breakfast. Free Program until time for transfer to Airport (B)</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":80682,\"hotel_cost\":13300,\"land_cost\":\"33000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":126982,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19047.3\",\"selling_price\":146029.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0631/022025', 146240, 73120, 0, '2025-02-12 05:37:02', '2025-02-12 14:09:17', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(642, 'Mr. Ashish', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-03-25', 6, 2, 7, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL - HALF DAY CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"25-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Greeted at Noi Bai International airport by our guide and driver. Transferred to hotel for check-in<br \\/>\\nAfter that our driver and guide pick you up and leave to visit:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Tran Quoc Pagoda<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Ho Chi Minh complex<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Quoc Tu Giam Temple<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>One Pillar Pagoda<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI \\u2013 HALONG BAY (SHARING CRUISE)\",\"date\":\"26-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Pick up at the hotel and depart to Ha Long by shuttle bus Check-in the cabin and enjoy lunch while cruising through the most beautiful parts with thousands of amazing limestone islands emerging from emerald water.<br \\/>\\nTake a exhilarating kayak trip through the lagoon, have a refreshing swim or simply relax on board and enjoy the sunset<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Dinner on cruise<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight on cruise<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALONG BAY - DA NANG\",\"date\":\"27-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Wake up early and take a position in the upper deck to witness the sun rise over the bay, a cup of hot tea in hand.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Early morning is truly a magical time on the bay as the limestone karsts appear all around you in a different shape, sizes and colors<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Enjoy brunch on board before arriving at Ha Long City Pier at noon where transportation will be waiting for and drive back to Hanoi airport to catch the flight to Da Nang.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Freetime to spend in the beach.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Overnight at hotel<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANA HILLS FULL DAY\",\"date\":\"28-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>Breakfast at the hotel then guide will pick up for Bana Hills.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Check in at the Suoi Mo Cable Car Station and transfer to Marseille Station.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Explore Golden Bridge (The Hands of The Gods) - majestic and impressive as a scene in \\u201cGame of Thrones\\u201d or \\u201cThe Lords of the Rings\\u201d.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Drop by Le Jardin D\\u2019Amour (the Flower Garden of Love) with 9 gardens of Le Jardin D\\u2019Amour are 9 amusing tales in 9 varying architectures, which harmonize so well in a visual sonata of beauty.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Continue the trip with Linh Ung Pagoda &amp; Debay Wine Cellar.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>Stay overnight at Da Nang.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG \\u2013 HOI AN COCONUT TOUR \\u2013 HOI AN ANCIENT TOWN\",\"date\":\"29-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at hotel.<br \\/>\\nTour guide picks up guests at Cua Dai Bridge, Hoi An. Guests Walk along the village path for 5 minutes to the marina.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visitors visit Bay Mau Coconut Forest on basket boats, a typical vehicle of the fishing village of Van Lang village. You can see with your own eyes the local people casting their nets on the river to catch fish and can experience their own casting skills. Then, watch the unique basket-shaking performance of the basket-shaking artisan of Van Lang village.<br \\/>\\nThe group of baskets arrive at the Eco-Restaurant, rest on the leaf house. You can freely visit the space of the eco-tourism area, then gather to participate in folk games with fun prizes: Go monkey bridge, break pots, jump sacks, tunnel,<br \\/>\\n...<br \\/>\\nFarewell to the tourist area, wooden boats take guests to Cua Dai Bridge. Back to Hoi An<br \\/>\\nGo to Hoi An ancient town for the late afternoon. After that, move with our tour guide to the dragon bridge to watch the fire show.<br \\/>\\nGet back to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Stay overnight in Danang<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG \\u2013 HCM CITY\",\"date\":\"30-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Have breakfast at the hotel. Tour guide and driver will pick guests from the hotel to Da Nang airport to take the flight back to Ho Chi Minh at 10:00am.<br \\/>\\nAfter that, take the city tour around HCM city:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>\\u2726 Independence Palace: the former headquarters of the United States located in South Vietnam.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\u2726 Notre Dame Cathedral: an architectural masterpiece - a typical work contributing to the urban appearance of Saigon - Ho Chi Minh City. The work also records the introduction, exchange and acculturation of East-West culture and architecture.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\u2726 City Post Office: is an indispensable destination for tourists when coming to Ho Chi Minh City, an ancient architecture, more than 120 years old.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>\\u2726 War remnants museum<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight in HCM<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HCM CITY \\u2013 CU CHI TUNNELS \\u2013 INDIA\",\"date\":\"31-03-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Breakfast at hotel. Tour guide and driver will pick guests from the hotel to visit Cu Chi Tunnels.<br \\/>\\nThe Cu Chi Tunnels are an underground labyrinth of passageways, used by the Viet Cong during the Vietnam War as protection against American air raids. Those inclined are invited to crawl through selections of the tunnels to better understand what life was like for the Vietnamese soldiers during wartime.<br \\/>\\nAfter that, move to HCM airport to catch the flight back to your country.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br \\/>\\n<strong>End of trip. See you soon!<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2057\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"fare\":159169},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1631\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"513\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"57065\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"1629\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"64692\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"895\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"128736\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Nesta Hanoi \\/similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"10000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HALONG BAY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Crown Legend Cruise\\/similar\",\"room_type\":\"Junior King\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/03\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"27\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DANANG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hadana Boutique Resort Hoi An\\/similar\",\"room_type\":\"Senior Deluxe with Pool View\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"30\\/03\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"30\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HO CHI MINH CITY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Odys Boutique hotel\\/similar\",\"room_type\":\"Junior Deluxe and Deluxe\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/03\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return <strong><em>Airfare Ex-Delhi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>07&nbsp;Nts Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;based on <strong>03&nbsp;DBL Rooms&nbsp; + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>Meals as mentioned on the program: (B) for breakfast, (L) for lunch or (D) for dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>Sharing Day Cruise with vegetarian meal in Ha Long Bay.</strong></li>\n	<li>Full transfers by a <strong>16-seater A/C tourist private car.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Entrance fees</strong> for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Experienced English speaking guide</strong></em> during all tours and transfers</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Mineral water </strong></em>is available as complementary (02 bottle per pax per day).</li>\n	<li>Experienced <strong>English-speaking guide.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Vietnam Visa</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<p><strong>TIPPING FOR GUIDE AND DRIVER (PAID DIRECTLY TO GUIDE)</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong><em>US$ 2/pax/day</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Visa stamping fee at the airport (25US$ for single visa to Vietnam, paid by cash at the airport)</li>\n	<li value=\"5\">Surcharge for special request on food, and meals.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li value=\"5\">Insurance, gratuities and personal expenses</li>\n	<li value=\"5\">Surcharge for public holidays (if any)</li>\n	<li value=\"5\">All other service not stated in the program.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":409662,\"land_cost\":\"316800\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"27000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":753462,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 82880.82\",\"selling_price\":836342.82000000006519258022308349609375}', 'MZQ/0632/022025', 836013, 96105, 81639, '2025-02-14 11:30:30', '2025-02-14 14:34:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(643, 'Mr Satish Chandra', 'SBI', '7979045885', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2025-04-13', 7, NULL, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5062\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":36440},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2248\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Amritsar (ATQ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"478\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:30 PM\",\"fare\":9568},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Amritsar (ATQ)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AI Express\",\"dep_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Mar 2025\",\"fno\":\"IX-1199\",\"fare\":\"13518\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AI Express\",\"dep_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Apr 2025\",\"fno\":\"IX-1113\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"13\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Blossom \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lidder Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/04\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"16\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Zahgeer Continental  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"17\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deluxe HouseBoat  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/04\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"18\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"AMRITSAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel One Earth GG Regency\",\"rate\":\"6300\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Queen Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/04\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Ranchi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Blossom / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Lidder Resort / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Zahgeer Continental &nbsp;/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Deluxe HouseBoat&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> accommodation <strong>with B/F</strong> at Hotel One Earth GG Regency at <strong>Amritsar.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>01&nbsp;Double Room.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>) @ Kashmir</li>\n	<li><strong>Amritsar Airport</strong> Pickup &amp; Drop.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Day Local Sightseeing </strong>in Amritsar.</li>\n	<li>Ac Dzire/Similar for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>01 Hour Shikara Ride&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"23\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59526,\"land_cost\":\"49100\",\"hotel_cost\":\"6300\",\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Amritsar\",\"amount\":7000}],\"cost_price\":121926,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 28042.98\",\"selling_price\":149968.98000000001047737896442413330078125}', 'MZQ/0633/022025', 146700, 73350, NULL, '2025-02-15 06:12:25', '2025-04-12 12:16:16', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(644, 'Mr Sanjay', 'Manoj Arya Bro', '+151067690', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-04-06', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai & Hotel Check-in (PVT)\",\"date\":\"06-04-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"49\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"96\\\" data-start=\\\"65\\\">Dubai International Airport<\\/strong>, you will be greeted and assisted with a <strong data-end=\\\"172\\\" data-start=\\\"138\\\">private transfer to your hotel<\\/strong>. After check-in, take some time to unwind and settle in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"495\\\" data-start=\\\"233\\\">Depending on your arrival time, you may choose to explore the nearby surroundings, visit a caf\\u00e9, or take a leisurely stroll along the vibrant streets of Dubai. You can also relax at your hotel, enjoying its amenities in preparation for the exciting days ahead.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"525\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"525\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\">Overnight stay in Dubai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour & Burj Khalifa Experience (PVT)\",\"date\":\"07-04-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"379\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">After breakfast, embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"125\\\" data-start=\\\"86\\\">half-day private city tour of Dubai<\\/strong>, exploring its modern and historical highlights. Visit iconic landmarks, including the <strong data-end=\\\"227\\\" data-start=\\\"213\\\">Dubai Mall<\\/strong>, home to world-class shopping and entertainment, and witness the mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"328\\\" data-start=\\\"305\\\">Dubai Fountain Show<\\/strong>, a stunning display of water, music, and lights.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"381\\\">Later, enjoy an unforgettable experience at the <strong data-end=\\\"445\\\" data-start=\\\"429\\\">Burj Khalifa<\\/strong>, ascending to the <strong data-end=\\\"479\\\" data-start=\\\"464\\\">148th floor<\\/strong>, the highest observation deck in the world, for breathtaking panoramic views of the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"629\\\" data-start=\\\"573\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\">Overnight stay in Dubai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Miracle Garden & Premium Desert Safari (PVT)\",\"date\":\"08-04-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">After breakfast, visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"90\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong>, the world\\u2019s largest natural flower garden, featuring breathtaking floral designs, colorful sculptures, and beautifully arranged themed gardens. Stroll through the vibrant displays and take in the mesmerizing beauty of millions of blooming flowers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"763\\\" data-start=\\\"367\\\">In the afternoon, get ready for an unforgettable <strong data-end=\\\"452\\\" data-start=\\\"416\\\">Premium Desert Safari experience<\\/strong>. Enjoy an adventurous drive over the golden sand dunes before arriving at a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"570\\\" data-start=\\\"541\\\">Bedouin-style desert camp<\\/strong>. Here, indulge in a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"615\\\" data-start=\\\"601\\\">BBQ dinner<\\/strong> while being entertained by a <strong data-end=\\\"692\\\" data-start=\\\"645\\\">belly dance performance, Tanoura dance show<\\/strong>, and other cultural activities like camel riding and henna painting.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"810\\\" data-start=\\\"765\\\">Return to your hotel after an exciting day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"840\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"840\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\">Overnight stay in Dubai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure Day in Dubai\",\"date\":\"09-04-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"265\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">Today is a <strong data-end=\\\"59\\\" data-start=\\\"47\\\">free day<\\/strong> to explore Dubai at your own pace or simply relax. You can choose to unwind at your hotel, visit a luxurious spa, or go shopping at world-famous malls like <strong data-end=\\\"234\\\" data-start=\\\"216\\\">The Dubai Mall<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"262\\\" data-start=\\\"238\\\">Mall of the Emirates<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"486\\\" data-start=\\\"267\\\">If you\'re in the mood for adventure, you may opt for <strong data-end=\\\"343\\\" data-start=\\\"320\\\">optional activities<\\/strong>, such as a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"483\\\" data-start=\\\"364\\\">Atlantis Aquaventure Waterpark, a yacht cruise at Dubai Marina, Ski Dubai, or exploring Old Dubai and the Gold Souk<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"567\\\" data-start=\\\"488\\\">Spend the day as you wish, making the most of your time in this dynamic city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"569\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"569\\\">Overnight stay in Dubai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai (PVT)\",\"date\":\"10-04-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"290\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"125\\\" data-start=\\\"94\\\">Dubai International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey. Depart with wonderful memories of your incredible tour, filled with breathtaking sights, cultural experiences, and unforgettable moments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"336\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"292\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"336\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"292\\\">Wishing you a safe and pleasant journey!<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Two Way Airport Transfers.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong>&nbsp;Fountain Show.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 148th Floor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Miracle Garden.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Premium Desert Safari </strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, Tanoura Show and other camp activities<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Tours &amp; Transfers on&nbsp;PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"49808\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":49808,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10459.68\",\"selling_price\":60267.6800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0634/022025', 60360, 30180, 0, '2025-02-15 13:56:05', '2025-02-24 05:25:53', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(645, 'Mr Alok Kataruka', 'Sanchit', '9905528848', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-04-29', 6, 0, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1238\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:25 AM\",\"fare\":28182},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Sharjah (SHJ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"251\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Abu Dhabi (AUH)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1408\",\"dep_date\":\"05 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"06 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:45 AM\",\"fare\":32592},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"421\",\"dep_date\":\"06 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"06 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:35 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Omega, Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room with Bathtub\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"03\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"18000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ABU DHABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Park Inn by Radisson, Yas Island\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room Plaza View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"39900\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in<strong>&nbsp;Hotel Hotel Omega, Bur Dubai.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in<strong>&nbsp;Hotel Crowne Plaza Yas Island.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;on Double Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Sharjah Airport Transfer</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Interhotel Transfer.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Abu Dhabi Airport Transfer.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong>&nbsp;Fountain Show.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124-125th Floor</strong>..</li>\n	<li><strong>Deluxe&nbsp;Desert Safari&nbsp;</strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, and other camp activities.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Luxury Lotus / Desert Rose Marina Dinner Cruise </strong>(Soft Drink Package)</li>\n	<li><strong>Yas Island 02 Day any 02 Parks</strong> <em>(Ferrari World + Warner Bros)</em></li>\n	<li><strong>Abu Dhabi City Tour with BAPS Hindu Temple.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>IMG Theme Park</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Miracle Garden</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Heli Dubai Helicopter Ride - Iconic Tour (12 Mins)&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Museum of the Future</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;Insurance.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Tours &amp; Transfers on PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tourism Dirham Fee applicale.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":60774,\"hotel_cost\":57900,\"land_cost\":\"120208\",\"visa_cost\":\"14500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":253382,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 32939.66\",\"selling_price\":286321.660000000032596290111541748046875,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0635/022025', 287160, 143580, 0, '2025-02-17 11:43:22', '2025-02-17 11:45:53', 0, 1, '\"<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>Important Note : - <\\/strong>Entrance to Grand Mosque Without a DTCM Guide is Not allowed, as per new rules. If guest wants to enter the Grand Mosque a charge of <strong>@USD 55\\/- Per Person <\\/strong>will be additional.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(646, 'Mr Manoj Arya', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9709400140', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'TURKEY + EGYPT', '2025-12-21', 13, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"43\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST) or Sabiha G\\u00f6k\\u00e7en Airport (SAW)<\\/strong> and transfer to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After check-in, unwind or take a stroll to explore nearby attractions. If time allows, savor a traditional Turkish meal at a local restaurant. Enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of the city before returning to your hotel for a restful night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"396\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"365\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL CITY TOUR : PVT\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"33\\\">After breakfast, set out on a <strong data-end=\\\"87\\\" data-start=\\\"63\\\">full-day guided tour<\\/strong> exploring Istanbul\\u2019s rich Ottoman and Byzantine heritage. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"174\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Topkapi Palace<\\/strong>, once the grand residence of Ottoman sultans, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"257\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">Hagia Sophia<\\/strong>, an architectural masterpiece blending Christian and Islamic influences. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"347\\\">Hippodrome<\\/strong>, the historic center of chariot races and public events, before admiring the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"463\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Blue Mosque<\\/strong>, known for its iconic blue tiles and impressive domes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"804\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\">After a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">lunch at a local restaurant<\\/strong>, immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of the <strong data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\">Grand Bazaar<\\/strong>, one of the world\\u2019s oldest and largest covered markets, offering a wide variety of Turkish crafts, jewelry, and spices. <strong data-end=\\\"802\\\" data-start=\\\"760\\\">All museum entrance fees are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\">Return to the hotel and relax after a day of exploration.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY ON LEISURE\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"373\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">Start with a <strong data-end=\\\"63\\\" data-start=\\\"42\\\">Turkish breakfast<\\/strong>, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Bosphorus cruise<\\/strong>, explore <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Ortak\\u00f6y<\\/strong>, relax at a <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\">hammam<\\/strong>, sip <strong data-end=\\\"161\\\" data-start=\\\"143\\\">Turkish coffee<\\/strong>, stroll in <strong data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">G\\u00fclhane Park<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"202\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Bebek<\\/strong>, watch the <strong data-end=\\\"236\\\" data-start=\\\"214\\\">sunset from Galata<\\/strong>, have a <strong data-end=\\\"270\\\" data-start=\\\"245\\\">Bosphorus-view dinner<\\/strong>, and end with <strong data-end=\\\"303\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">rooftop drinks<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\">Return to your hotel and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LOCAL MARKET EXPLORATION & BOSPHORUS CRUISE : SIC\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\">leisurely morning exploring Istanbul\\u2019s local markets<\\/strong> at your own pace. Discover the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"195\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">Spice Bazaar<\\/strong>, where aromatic spices, teas, and Turkish delights fill the air, or visit hidden gems like the <strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">Arasta Bazaar<\\/strong> for handcrafted souvenirs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">In the <strong data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">evening, embark on a magical Bosphorus Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>, sailing between <strong data-end=\\\"439\\\" data-start=\\\"420\\\">Europe and Asia<\\/strong>. Enjoy a delicious meal while watching a <strong data-end=\\\"511\\\" data-start=\\\"481\\\">traditional folkloric show<\\/strong>, featuring live music, belly dancing, and cultural performances. <strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">Unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\">Return to your hotel and relax after a memorable evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL - ASWAN\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"145\\\" data-start=\\\"115\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST\\/SAW)<\\/strong> to catch your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"186\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">Aswan, Egypt<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"191\\\">Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"216\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Aswan<\\/strong>, proceed to your hotel for <strong data-end=\\\"271\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">check-in and relaxation<\\/strong> after your journey. Enjoy a leisurely evening, preparing for the adventures ahead.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\">Overnight stay in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ASWAN (Local Sightseeing) - NILE CRUISE\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"157\\\" data-start=\\\"113\\\">private tour of Aswan\\u2019s iconic landmarks<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"176\\\" data-start=\\\"164\\\">High Dam<\\/strong> \\u2013 A modern engineering marvel built in the 1960s, providing irrigation and hydroelectric power.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"299\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/strong> \\u2013 The largest known ancient obelisk, offering insights into ancient Egyptian stone-cutting techniques.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"424\\\" data-start=\\\"407\\\">Philae Temple<\\/strong> \\u2013 A stunning temple dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"474\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Goddess Isis<\\/strong>, relocated to Agilkia Island to preserve its heritage.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"577\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"574\\\" data-start=\\\"561\\\">3\\u20134 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"754\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">After the tour, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"648\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Nile Cruise for check-in and lunch<\\/strong>. Enjoy the rest of the day relaxing onboard as you prepare for an unforgettable journey along the Nile.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\">Overnight on the cruise in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Abu Simbel & Kom Ombo Temple Visits)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"79\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\">Early Morning (04:30 AM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"82\\\" data-start=\\\"79\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"144\\\" data-start=\\\"114\\\">private tour to Abu Simbel<\\/strong>. Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"190\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"169\\\">Abu Simbel Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most iconic monuments, built by Ramses II. The temples are carved into the mountainside and are famous for their grand statues and remarkable preservation.<br data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"412\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Afternoon:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"431\\\" data-start=\\\"428\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to the cruise by early afternoon and have lunch onboard as the cruise begins to sail from Aswan around <strong data-end=\\\"555\\\" data-start=\\\"544\\\">2:00 PM<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"558\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\">Evening (05:00 PM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"586\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"646\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">visit to Kom Ombo Temple<\\/strong>. Explore the unique <strong data-end=\\\"689\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\">Greco-Roman temple<\\/strong> dedicated to two gods: <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">Sobek, the crocodile god<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\">Haroeris, the sun god<\\/strong>. The temple\\u2019s location along the Nile offers stunning views and fascinating historical significance.<br data-end=\\\"876\\\" data-start=\\\"873\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"920\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"965\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\">Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Edfu Temple)\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>At 05:30 AM, you\\u2019ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">private tour to Edfu Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most remarkable and well-preserved temples. Dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Horus<\\/strong>, the falcon god, this temple is known for its large scale and intricate carvings that tell the story of Horus\\u2019s battle with his enemy Set. It offers fascinating insights into ancient Egyptian religion and mythology. The tour lasts about <strong data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"425\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>, giving you ample time to explore the temple\\u2019s impressive structure, including its towering pylons, courtyards, and the sanctuary.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISE - LUXUR\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, check out from the cruise at <strong data-end=\\\"116\\\" data-start=\\\"104\\\">09:00 AM<\\/strong> and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore <strong data-end=\\\"170\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Luxor<\\/strong>. First, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"205\\\" data-start=\\\"189\\\">Luxor Temple<\\/strong>, dedicated to the Theban Triad, followed by a visit to the grand <strong data-end=\\\"288\\\" data-start=\\\"271\\\">Karnak Temple<\\/strong>, one of the largest temple complexes in Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"654\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">Next, continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, where you can explore the tombs of pharaohs, including that of <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"449\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>, and visit the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">Temple of Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, dedicated to the female pharaoh. The tour also includes a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"612\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\">Colossi of Memnon<\\/strong>, two colossal statues of Amenhotep III.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"760\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\">The entire tour will take around <strong data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">5\\u20136 hours<\\/strong>. Afterward, check in to your hotel in Luxor and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\">Overnight stay at a Luxor hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LUXUR - CAIRO\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"32\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Luxor and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"117\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Luxor Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"146\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">Cairo<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"412\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"184\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met and assisted with your transfer to your hotel. Once checked in, enjoy the rest of the evening at leisure. You can either explore <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\">Cairo at your own pace<\\/strong> or relax at your hotel to unwind after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Day Trip to Alexandria)\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"468\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"51\\\" data-start=\\\"39\\\">07:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\\u2019ll be picked up from your hotel for an <strong data-end=\\\"126\\\" data-start=\\\"96\\\">overday trip to Alexandria<\\/strong>, a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">3-hour drive<\\/strong> from Cairo. Once in Alexandria, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">Citadel of Qaitbay<\\/strong> from the outside, an impressive fortress located on the Mediterranean coast. Then, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"331\\\" data-start=\\\"314\\\">Pompey Pillar<\\/strong>, the largest ancient column in Egypt, and the <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Roman Theatre<\\/strong>, where you can explore the ruins of this historical performance space.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\">Finally, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">Catacombs of Kom El-Shoqafa<\\/strong>, an ancient burial site that blends Egyptian, Greek, and Roman influences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"723\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">The trip offers a fascinating mix of ancient history, architecture, and culture, before returning to Cairo in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Pyramids of Giza, Egyptian Museum & More)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"69\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">08:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\'ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore some of Cairo\\u2019s most iconic landmarks. Start with the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"213\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong> and the <strong data-end=\\\"232\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Sphinx<\\/strong>, marveling at the ancient wonders and learning about their fascinating history.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"554\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Next, visit a <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">papyrus fair<\\/strong>, where you can see how the ancient Egyptians made papyrus, followed by a stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">perfume factory<\\/strong> to experience traditional Egyptian scents, and a <strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"499\\\">cotton shop<\\/strong> to discover the fine Egyptian cotton.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\">Afterward, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"598\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">Egyptian Museum<\\/strong>, home to a vast collection of ancient Egyptian antiquities, including the famous treasures of <strong data-end=\\\"708\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">The tour will last approximately <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>, providing a deep dive into Egypt\\u2019s rich history and culture.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (SELF EXPLORATION)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\">Today, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\">self-exploration day<\\/strong> in Cairo, immersing yourself in the city\'s vibrant local markets and food scene. Start your day by visiting the famous <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you can wander through narrow alleys lined with shops selling everything from spices and perfumes to jewelry and handcrafted goods. It\\u2019s the perfect spot to experience the bustling atmosphere of Cairo.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"773\\\" data-start=\\\"457\\\">Next, dive into the local food scene. Try some of Cairo\\u2019s most famous dishes, like <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">koshari<\\/strong> (a mix of lentils, rice, pasta, and fried onions), <strong data-end=\\\"614\\\" data-start=\\\"603\\\">falafel<\\/strong> (crispy chickpea fritters), and <strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"647\\\">shawarma<\\/strong> (seasoned meat wraps). For dessert, don\'t miss out on <strong data-end=\\\"725\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\">baklava<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"739\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\">kunafa<\\/strong> (a sweet pastry soaked in syrup).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"973\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Explore at your own pace, tasting street food, visiting cafes, and chatting with the friendly locals. It\\u2019s a great opportunity to connect with the culture and enjoy Cairo\\u2019s rich culinary traditions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"975\\\">Spend the day as you wish, and return to your hotel in the evening for some rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":14,\"index\":13,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE CAIRO\",\"date\":\"03-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"372\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">After a memorable journey, it\\u2019s time to check out from your hotel and head to <strong data-end=\\\"129\\\" data-start=\\\"112\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. As you leave, take with you the sweet memories of the <strong data-end=\\\"276\\\" data-start=\\\"208\\\">Pyramids, ancient temples, vibrant markets, and the rich culture<\\/strong> you experienced throughout your tour. Safe travels and hope to welcome you again in the future!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"395\\