ud Market</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by&nbsp;AC car Xenia /Avanza / Suzuki APV / with English speaking DRIVER&nbsp;on a<strong> PRIVATE basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>DAY WISE ITINERARY:</strong></em></p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 01&nbsp;:</strong> Arrival Bali. Meet &amp; Greet with our Representative (driver)+ Welcome flower garland &amp; Coconut drink at Airport. Transfer to Hotel.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 02&nbsp;: </strong>Breakfast. pick up at 10.00 for Water sport at Tanjung Benoa (include 1x adventure parasailing, jet ski, banana boat) other activities on personal account. &nbsp;And then followed by &nbsp;&nbsp;Uluwatu Temple - Kecak Dance Tour )(B)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 03&nbsp;:</strong> Breakfast. Pick up at 07.00 for full day Nusa Penida West tour visit Angel Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Cliff, Crystal Bay Beach. Boat return at 16.30. local Lunch include.&nbsp; (B, L)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 04 :&nbsp;</strong>Breakfast at hotel. Pick up at 08.30 for Handara gate, Bedugul Ulundanu temple, Tanah lot temple (B)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 05 :</strong> Breakfast at hotel. Check out Pick up at 08.30 for Kintamani a Mt. Batur Volcano View, Coffee agro plantation, Tegalalang rice terrace, tirta empul temple, Ubud art market and royal palace. drop off to check in &nbsp;hotel in Ubud &nbsp;(B)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 06 :</strong> Breakfast. Free program (B)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Day 07&nbsp;: </strong>Breakfast. Free Program until time for transfer to Airport (B)</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":84084,\"hotel_cost\":42707,\"land_cost\":\"31680\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":158471,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20601.23\",\"selling_price\":1790