(653, 'Mr Nilesh Chawwnika', 'BNI | CELEB', '9570112002', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2025-03-19', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Night Safari\",\"date\":\"19-03-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in <strong data-end=\\\"60\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"47\\\">Singapore<\\/strong>, proceed for <strong data-end=\\\"92\\\" data-start=\\\"74\\\">airport pickup<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"124\\\" data-start=\\\"98\\\">check in to your hotel<\\/strong>. In the evening, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"168\\\" data-start=\\\"152\\\">Night Safari<\\/strong>, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"201\\\" data-start=\\\"180\\\">tram ride &amp; shows<\\/strong>, then return to the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Merlion City Drive & Sentosa Tour\",\"date\":\"20-03-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"95\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Merlion City Drive<\\/strong>, then head to <strong data-end=\\\"128\\\" data-start=\\\"110\\\">Sentosa Island<\\/strong> via <strong data-end=\\\"146\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">Cable Car<\\/strong>. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"177\\\" data-start=\\\"158\\\">S.E.A. Aquarium<\\/strong>, experience <strong data-end=\\\"210\\\" data-start=\\\"190\\\">SkyHelix Sentosa<\\/strong>, and end with the <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"229\\\">Wings of Time<\\/strong> show.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day at Universal Studios\",\"date\":\"21-03-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, spend the day at <strong data-end=\\\"112\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"81\\\">Universal Studios Singapore<\\/strong>, enjoying rides, shows, and themed attractions. Have lunch inside the park, explore souvenir shops, and return to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Marina Bay Sands & Gardens by the Bay\",\"date\":\"22-03-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"90\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\">Marina Bay Sands SkyPark<\\/strong> for panoramic views, then explore the <strong data-end=\\\"145\\\" data-start=\\\"129\\\">Cloud Forest<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"165\\\" data-start=\\\"150\\\">Flower Dome<\\/strong> at <strong data-end=\\\"191\\\" data-start=\\\"169\\\">Gardens by the Bay<\\/strong>. Optionally, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"245\\\" data-start=\\\"215\\\">Garden Rhapsody light show<\\/strong> before returning to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure Singapore\",\"date\":\"23-03-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, <strong data-end=\\\"54\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"41\\\">check out<\\/strong> from the hotel and head to <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"82\\\">Changi Airport<\\/strong> for your flight, allowing time for check-in and relaxation at the airport before your departure. Safe travels!<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"92000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1015\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1016\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\