(655, 'Mr Sanjay Kumar', 'BNI Exp Ajit Chaubey', '8292468671', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2025-04-13', 5, 0, 9, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Pahalgam N\\/S\",\"date\":\"13-04-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to the&nbsp;Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about&nbsp; 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 - 02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost).&nbsp;Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).You Can&nbsp;Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car&nbsp;(own Cost,Time halt will be 01 Hour at Each Spot)&nbsp;to see&nbsp; famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel In Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam  - Gulmarg  N\\/S\",\"date\":\"14-04-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the&nbsp; morning,proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;&nbsp;03:00 -03 :30&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region.You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost)&nbsp;which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in&nbsp; Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar -N\\/S\",\"date\":\"15-04-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the&nbsp; morning,&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar.Later&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 01 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg - Srinagar  N\\/S\",\"date\":\"16-04-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning, proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 02:00 - 02:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride to Thajiwas Glacier&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;&amp; Zero Point by Union Vehicle&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.Later Drive back to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Local Sightseeing N\\/S\",\"date\":\"17-04-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast,&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar Local&nbsp;&nbsp;Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden,Shalimar Garden,Tulip Garden,Cheshmashahi&nbsp;You have To hire a Union vehicle Upto 1 km,&nbsp;Pari mahal&nbsp;ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at a Hotel in srinagar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport  Drop\",\"date\":\"18-04-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast in the morning,Check out From Hotel and drive to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green Heights \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"map\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snowland \\/ Similar\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"18\\/04\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the 