inner</strong>)</li>\n	<li><strong>04 way Amritsar Airport</strong> Pickup &amp; Drop.</li>\n	<li><strong>Ac Tempo Traveller</strong> for all transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride&nbsp;</strong>in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"344000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Amritsar Airport Pick up & Drop\",\"amount\":18000}],\"cost_price\":362000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 43440\",\"selling_price\":405440}', 'MZQ/0645/032025', 405450, 45050, 0, '2025-03-08 13:34:12', '2025-03-08 13:34:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(656, 'Mr Nilesh Chhawanika', 'BNI CELEB', '9570112002', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GANGTOK & SILLIGURI', '2025-03-19', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Transfer to Siliguri\",\"date\":\"19-03-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"75\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">Bagdogra Airport<\\/strong>, meet your driver, and transfer to your <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"116\\\">hotel in Siliguri<\\/strong>. After check-in and some rest, explore nearby attractions like <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"201\\\">ISKCON Temple<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"242\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Hong Kong Market<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy dinner and an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day on Leisure (No Vehicle)\",\"date\":\"20-03-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a relaxing day at <strong data-end=\\\"86\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"66\\\">Mayfair Siliguri<\\/strong>, indulging in its <strong data-end=\\\"135\\\" data-start=\\\"105\\\">spa, pool, and fine dining<\\/strong>. Unwind at the <strong data-end=\\\"165\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">bar\\/lounge<\\/strong> or explore nearby shopping areas before ending the day with a peaceful dinner and overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Silliguri to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"21-03-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, <strong data-end=\\\"64\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"51\\\">check out<\\/strong> from the hotel and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"93\\\">Gangtok<\\/strong> (4-5 hours). Upon arrival, <strong data-end=\\\"144\\\" data-start=\\\"132\\\">check in<\\/strong> to your hotel, relax, and explore <strong data-end=\\\"190\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">MG Marg<\\/strong> in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight stay in Gangtok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"22-03-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore <strong data-end=\\\"88\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"59\\\">Gangtok\\u2019s top attractions<\\/strong>, including <strong data-end=\\\"192\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Tsomgo Lake, Baba Harbhajan Singh Temple, Tashi Viewpoint, Rumtek Monastery, and MG Marg<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy local cuisine before returning to the hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"23-03-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, <strong data-end=\\\"65\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"52\\\">check out<\\/strong> from the hotel and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"94\\\">Bagdogra Airport<\\/strong> for your departure. Safe travels!<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":29997},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6134\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1113\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"fare\":40872}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SILLIGURI\",\"room_type\":\"Jungle View Room with Bathtub and Balcony\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mayfair Tea Resort\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"32000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GANGTOK\",\"room_type\":\"Club Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Denzong Regency Hotels & Resorts\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"23800\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel&nbsp;Mayfair Tea Resort&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Silliguri</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel&nbsp;Denzong Regency Hotels &amp; Resorts&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<b>Gangtok.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast @ Silliguri.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner @ Silliguri.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Innova Crysta&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary (A/C will be switched off during hilly drives).</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":70869,\"hotel_cost\":55800,\"transport_cost\":\"22000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":148669,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22300.35\",\"selling_price\":170969.35000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0646/032025', 170968, 67174, 36620, '2025-03-11 11:44:08', '2025-03-11 12:27:00', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(657, 'Mr Gaurav Agarwal', 'BNI', '92346084', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'NASHIK', '2025-03-14', 2, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL NASHIK\",\"date\":\"14-03-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arriving in Nashik in the evening, proceed to your hotel for a smooth check-in. After freshening up, enjoy a relaxing dinner at the hotel or a nearby restaurant.&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day Trip to Trimbakeshwar\",\"date\":\"15-03-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start early from Nashik and reach <strong data-end=\\\"105\\\" data-start=\\\"81\\\">Trimbakeshwar Temple<\\/strong> for darshan and rituals. After breakfast, visit <strong data-end=\\\"173\\\" data-start=\\\"154\\\">Brahmagiri Hill<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"197\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Kushavarta Kund<\\/strong>, followed by lunch at a local restaurant. In the afternoon, explore <strong data-end=\\\"283\\\" data-start=\\\"266\\\">Anjneri Hills<\\/strong>, then return to Nashik by evening.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE NASHIK\",\"date\":\"16-03-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and head to the airport. Allow ample time for travel and check-in. Safe journey!<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/03\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL EXPRESS INN THE BUSINESS LUXURY\",\"city\":\"NASHIK\",\"rate\":\"14560\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room + EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/03\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Express Inn&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Nashik</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room </strong>on <strong>DBL Sharing + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Kia carens&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"42\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":14560,\"transport_cost\":\"8000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":22560,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9475.2\",\"selling_price\":32035.20000000000072759576141834259033203125}', 'MZQ/0647/032025', 32000, 16000, 0, '2025-03-12 11:03:08', '2025-03-13 07:17:23', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(658, 'Mr Manoj Arya x 04', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9709400140', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'TURKEY + EGYPT', '2025-12-21', 13, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"43\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST) or Sabiha G\\u00f6k\\u00e7en Airport (SAW)<\\/strong> and transfer to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After check-in, unwind or take a stroll to explore nearby attractions. If time allows, savor a traditional Turkish meal at a local restaurant. Enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of the city before returning to your hotel for a restful night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"396\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"365\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL CITY TOUR : PVT\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"33\\\">After breakfast, set out on a <strong data-end=\\\"87\\\" data-start=\\\"63\\\">full-day guided tour<\\/strong> exploring Istanbul\\u2019s rich Ottoman and Byzantine heritage. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"174\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Topkapi Palace<\\/strong>, once the grand residence of Ottoman sultans, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"257\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">Hagia Sophia<\\/strong>, an architectural masterpiece blending Christian and Islamic influences. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"347\\\">Hippodrome<\\/strong>, the historic center of chariot races and public events, before admiring the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"463\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Blue Mosque<\\/strong>, known for its iconic blue tiles and impressive domes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"804\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\">After a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">lunch at a local restaurant<\\/strong>, immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of the <strong data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\">Grand Bazaar<\\/strong>, one of the world\\u2019s oldest and largest covered markets, offering a wide variety of Turkish crafts, jewelry, and spices. <strong data-end=\\\"802\\\" data-start=\\\"760\\\">All museum entrance fees are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\">Return to the hotel and relax after a day of exploration.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY ON LEISURE\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"373\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">Start with a <strong data-end=\\\"63\\\" data-start=\\\"42\\\">Turkish breakfast<\\/strong>, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Bosphorus cruise<\\/strong>, explore <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Ortak\\u00f6y<\\/strong>, relax at a <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\">hammam<\\/strong>, sip <strong data-end=\\\"161\\\" data-start=\\\"143\\\">Turkish coffee<\\/strong>, stroll in <strong data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">G\\u00fclhane Park<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"202\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Bebek<\\/strong>, watch the <strong data-end=\\\"236\\\" data-start=\\\"214\\\">sunset from Galata<\\/strong>, have a <strong data-end=\\\"270\\\" data-start=\\\"245\\\">Bosphorus-view dinner<\\/strong>, and end with <strong data-end=\\\"303\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">rooftop drinks<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\">Return to your hotel and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LOCAL MARKET EXPLORATION & BOSPHORUS CRUISE : SIC\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\">leisurely morning exploring Istanbul\\u2019s local markets<\\/strong> at your own pace. Discover the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"195\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">Spice Bazaar<\\/strong>, where aromatic spices, teas, and Turkish delights fill the air, or visit hidden gems like the <strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">Arasta Bazaar<\\/strong> for handcrafted souvenirs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">In the <strong data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">evening, embark on a magical Bosphorus Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>, sailing between <strong data-end=\\\"439\\\" data-start=\\\"420\\\">Europe and Asia<\\/strong>. Enjoy a delicious meal while watching a <strong data-end=\\\"511\\\" data-start=\\\"481\\\">traditional folkloric show<\\/strong>, featuring live music, belly dancing, and cultural performances. <strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">Unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\">Return to your hotel and relax after a memorable evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL - ASWAN\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"145\\\" data-start=\\\"115\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST\\/SAW)<\\/strong> to catch your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"186\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">Aswan, Egypt<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"191\\\">Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"216\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Aswan<\\/strong>, proceed to your hotel for <strong data-end=\\\"271\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">check-in and relaxation<\\/strong> after your journey. Enjoy a leisurely evening, preparing for the adventures ahead.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\">Overnight stay in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ASWAN (Local Sightseeing) - NILE CRUISE\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"157\\\" data-start=\\\"113\\\">private tour of Aswan\\u2019s iconic landmarks<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"176\\\" data-start=\\\"164\\\">High Dam<\\/strong> \\u2013 A modern engineering marvel built in the 1960s, providing irrigation and hydroelectric power.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"299\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/strong> \\u2013 The largest known ancient obelisk, offering insights into ancient Egyptian stone-cutting techniques.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"424\\\" data-start=\\\"407\\\">Philae Temple<\\/strong> \\u2013 A stunning temple dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"474\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Goddess Isis<\\/strong>, relocated to Agilkia Island to preserve its heritage.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"577\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"574\\\" data-start=\\\"561\\\">3\\u20134 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"754\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">After the tour, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"648\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Nile Cruise for check-in and lunch<\\/strong>. Enjoy the rest of the day relaxing onboard as you prepare for an unforgettable journey along the Nile.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\">Overnight on the cruise in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Abu Simbel & Kom Ombo Temple Visits)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"79\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\">Early Morning (04:30 AM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"82\\\" data-start=\\\"79\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"144\\\" data-start=\\\"114\\\">private tour to Abu Simbel<\\/strong>. Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"190\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"169\\\">Abu Simbel Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most iconic monuments, built by Ramses II. The temples are carved into the mountainside and are famous for their grand statues and remarkable preservation.<br data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"412\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Afternoon:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"431\\\" data-start=\\\"428\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to the cruise by early afternoon and have lunch onboard as the cruise begins to sail from Aswan around <strong data-end=\\\"555\\\" data-start=\\\"544\\\">2:00 PM<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"558\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\">Evening (05:00 PM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"586\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"646\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">visit to Kom Ombo Temple<\\/strong>. Explore the unique <strong data-end=\\\"689\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\">Greco-Roman temple<\\/strong> dedicated to two gods: <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">Sobek, the crocodile god<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\">Haroeris, the sun god<\\/strong>. The temple\\u2019s location along the Nile offers stunning views and fascinating historical significance.<br data-end=\\\"876\\\" data-start=\\\"873\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"920\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"965\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\">Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Edfu Temple)\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>At 05:30 AM, you\\u2019ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">private tour to Edfu Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most remarkable and well-preserved temples. Dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Horus<\\/strong>, the falcon god, this temple is known for its large scale and intricate carvings that tell the story of Horus\\u2019s battle with his enemy Set. It offers fascinating insights into ancient Egyptian religion and mythology. The tour lasts about <strong data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"425\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>, giving you ample time to explore the temple\\u2019s impressive structure, including its towering pylons, courtyards, and the sanctuary.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISE - LUXUR\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, check out from the cruise at <strong data-end=\\\"116\\\" data-start=\\\"104\\\">09:00 AM<\\/strong> and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore <strong data-end=\\\"170\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Luxor<\\/strong>. First, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"205\\\" data-start=\\\"189\\\">Luxor Temple<\\/strong>, dedicated to the Theban Triad, followed by a visit to the grand <strong data-end=\\\"288\\\" data-start=\\\"271\\\">Karnak Temple<\\/strong>, one of the largest temple complexes in Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"654\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">Next, continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, where you can explore the tombs of pharaohs, including that of <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"449\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>, and visit the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">Temple of Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, dedicated to the female pharaoh.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"760\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\">The entire tour will take around <strong data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">5\\u20136 hours<\\/strong>. Afterward, check in to your hotel in Luxor and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\">Overnight stay at a Luxor hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LUXUR - CAIRO\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"32\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Luxor and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"117\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Luxor Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"146\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">Cairo<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"412\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"184\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met and assisted with your transfer to your hotel. Once checked in, enjoy the rest of the evening at leisure. You can either explore <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\">Cairo at your own pace<\\/strong> or relax at your hotel to unwind after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Day Trip to Alexandria)\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"468\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"51\\\" data-start=\\\"39\\\">07:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\\u2019ll be picked up from your hotel for an <strong data-end=\\\"126\\\" data-start=\\\"96\\\">overday trip to Alexandria<\\/strong>, a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">3-hour drive<\\/strong> from Cairo. Once in Alexandria, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">Citadel of Qaitbay<\\/strong> from the outside, an impressive fortress located on the Mediterranean coast. Then, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"331\\\" data-start=\\\"314\\\">Pompey Pillar<\\/strong>, the largest ancient column in Egypt, and the <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Roman Theatre<\\/strong>, where you can explore the ruins of this historical performance space.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\">Finally, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">Catacombs of Kom El-Shoqafa<\\/strong>, an ancient burial site that blends Egyptian, Greek, and Roman influences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"723\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">The trip offers a fascinating mix of ancient history, architecture, and culture, before returning to Cairo in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Pyramids of Giza, Egyptian Museum & More)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"69\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">08:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\'ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore some of Cairo\\u2019s most iconic landmarks. Start with the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"213\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong> and the <strong data-end=\\\"232\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Sphinx<\\/strong>, marveling at the ancient wonders and learning about their fascinating history.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"554\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Next, visit a <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">papyrus fair<\\/strong>, where you can see how the ancient Egyptians made papyrus, followed by a stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">perfume factory<\\/strong> to experience traditional Egyptian scents, and a <strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"499\\\">cotton shop<\\/strong> to discover the fine Egyptian cotton.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\">Afterward, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"598\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">Egyptian Museum<\\/strong>, home to a vast collection of ancient Egyptian antiquities, including the famous treasures of <strong data-end=\\\"708\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">The tour will last approximately <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>, providing a deep dive into Egypt\\u2019s rich history and culture.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (SELF EXPLORATION)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\">Today, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\">self-exploration day<\\/strong> in Cairo, immersing yourself in the city\'s vibrant local markets and food scene. Start your day by visiting the famous <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you can wander through narrow alleys lined with shops selling everything from spices and perfumes to jewelry and handcrafted goods. It\\u2019s the perfect spot to experience the bustling atmosphere of Cairo.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"773\\\" data-start=\\\"457\\\">Next, dive into the local food scene. Try some of Cairo\\u2019s most famous dishes, like <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">koshari<\\/strong> (a mix of lentils, rice, pasta, and fried onions), <strong data-end=\\\"614\\\" data-start=\\\"603\\\">falafel<\\/strong> (crispy chickpea fritters), and <strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"647\\\">shawarma<\\/strong> (seasoned meat wraps). For dessert, don\'t miss out on <strong data-end=\\\"725\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\">baklava<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"739\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\">kunafa<\\/strong> (a sweet pastry soaked in syrup).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"973\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Explore at your own pace, tasting street food, visiting cafes, and chatting with the friendly locals. It\\u2019s a great opportunity to connect with the culture and enjoy Cairo\\u2019s rich culinary traditions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"975\\\">Spend the day as you wish, and return to your hotel in the evening for some rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":14,\"index\":13,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE CAIRO\",\"date\":\"03-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"372\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">After a memorable journey, it\\u2019s time to check out from your hotel and head to <strong data-end=\\\"129\\\" data-start=\\\"112\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. As you leave, take with you the sweet memories of the <strong data-end=\\\"276\\\" data-start=\\\"208\\\">Pyramids, ancient temples, vibrant markets, and the rich culture<\\/strong> you experienced throughout your tour. Safe travels and hope to welcome you again in the future!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\">End of your tour.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"738\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"105580\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"to\":\"Aswan (ASW)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"84\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Luxor (LXR)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"75\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"40600\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ISTANBUL\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room - Sea View\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"100000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ASWAN\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Basma\",\"room_type\":\"Garden View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NILE CRUISE\",\"hotel_name\":\"M\\/S Esmeralda 5\\u2605 Nile Cruise\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"Cabins with Nile view window\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LUXUR\",\"room_type\":\"Standard City View Room\",\"rate\":null,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":4,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sonesta St. George\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"CAIRO\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramses Hilton\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Nile View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare <strong>Istanbul-Aswan &amp; Luxor-Cairo.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Basma&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Aswan</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>M/S Esmeralda 5★ Nile Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Sonesta St. George Luxor&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Luxor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Ramses Hilton</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Local Lunch + 01 Local Dinner</strong> in&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All entrance fees.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All meals</strong>&nbsp;at <strong>M/S Esmeralda 5★ Nile Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers </strong>mentioned in the Itinerary&nbsp;(PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>Tours Mentioned</strong> in the Itinerary&nbsp;(SIC/PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>English Speaking</strong> Tour Guide During Tours.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Entrance Fees</strong> Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Visa Charges</li>\n	<li>Tips / Portage /&nbsp;<b>($7 P.P. Per day Compulsory)</b></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":146180,\"hotel_cost\":\"100000\",\"land_cost\":\"626400\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"ISTANBUL  Land\",\"amount\":\"61000\"}],\"cost_price\":933580,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 140037\",\"selling_price\":1073617}', 'MZQ/0648/032025', 1064000, 266000, 0, '2025-03-18 07:55:49', '2025-04-14 07:27:42', 0, 1, '\"<p>PLEASE NOTE:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Hagia Sophia\\/St. Sophia: Closed on&nbsp;Monday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Topkap\\u0131 Palace: Closed on Tuesday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Grand Bazaar: Closed on&nbsp;Sunday, Replaced with Arasta Bazaar.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bosphorus Cruise &amp; Two Continents Tour: Not Operated on&nbsp;Mondays.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>IMPORTANT NOTES:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The rates are dynamic &amp; will keep on changing until we hold it as per the final confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nothing is on hold until &amp; unless we provide it in the written confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All internal flights tickets are non refundable &amp; non exchangeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All services &amp; rates are remain subject to availability at the time of confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pick up &amp; drop for all tours &amp; transfers will be done from city center hotels only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Above quote is based on all paying pax travelling together. Any revision in number of pax will affect the given cost.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Company does not have any liability if the tour is cancelled or itinerary changed during the tour due to any unpredictable event like any political disturbance or weather condition or natural&nbsp;disaster&nbsp;etc.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All ferries, boats, cruises &amp; cable cars ride will be done on SIC basis.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><em>We have requested the room configuration at all hotels as follows:<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><b>02 King-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>02 Twin-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>We thank you for confirming your forthcoming holiday to TURKEY &amp; EGYPT. As you know Egypt as a destination has lot to offer because of its beauty &amp; history, We also understand guest need relaxed itinerary but few place will need early departure might be 4:30 am&nbsp; as&nbsp; we need to reach on time to avoid any kind of disappointment .We will make sure were ever it\'s possible we will start by 10:00 but usually all the tour pick up time is between 7 am -8 am , But as said we will try our best whenever it possible we will start late.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n<b>Sightseeing:&nbsp;<\\/b>We have included general entry of Pyramid \\u2013 However if you wish to visit inside the pyramid then guest has to pay&nbsp; USD 35 to USD 45 apx per person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Notification from the Immigration Department of Egypt<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;All arriving passengers to Egypt who wish to stay for more than 7 days inside Egypt would have to go to the Immigration department (within 7 days of their entry into Egypt) and follow the below steps :<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Register for their arrival in Egypt<br \\/>\\n900 EGP ( approximately 18 USD ) at the airport<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Get their passport stamped with an additional Immigration stamp<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Failure to adhere to these new regulations would result in the passenger paying penalties during his exit from Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We look forward to welcoming you and remain at your service for any further assistance.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(659, 'Mr Shashi Dhar x 04', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9709400140', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'TURKEY + EGYPT', '2025-12-21', 12, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"43\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST) or Sabiha G\\u00f6k\\u00e7en Airport (SAW)<\\/strong> and transfer to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After check-in, unwind or take a stroll to explore nearby attractions. If time allows, savor a traditional Turkish meal at a local restaurant. Enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of the city before returning to your hotel for a restful night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"396\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"365\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL CITY TOUR : PVT\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"33\\\">After breakfast, set out on a <strong data-end=\\\"87\\\" data-start=\\\"63\\\">full-day guided tour<\\/strong> exploring Istanbul\\u2019s rich Ottoman and Byzantine heritage. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"174\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Topkapi Palace<\\/strong>, once the grand residence of Ottoman sultans, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"257\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">Hagia Sophia<\\/strong>, an architectural masterpiece blending Christian and Islamic influences. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"347\\\">Hippodrome<\\/strong>, the historic center of chariot races and public events, before admiring the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"463\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Blue Mosque<\\/strong>, known for its iconic blue tiles and impressive domes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"804\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\">After a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">lunch at a local restaurant<\\/strong>, immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of the <strong data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\">Grand Bazaar<\\/strong>, one of the world\\u2019s oldest and largest covered markets, offering a wide variety of Turkish crafts, jewelry, and spices. <strong data-end=\\\"802\\\" data-start=\\\"760\\\">All museum entrance fees are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\">Return to the hotel and relax after a day of exploration.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY ON LEISURE\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"373\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">Start with a <strong data-end=\\\"63\\\" data-start=\\\"42\\\">Turkish breakfast<\\/strong>, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Bosphorus cruise<\\/strong>, explore <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Ortak\\u00f6y<\\/strong>, relax at a <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\">hammam<\\/strong>, sip <strong data-end=\\\"161\\\" data-start=\\\"143\\\">Turkish coffee<\\/strong>, stroll in <strong data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">G\\u00fclhane Park<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"202\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Bebek<\\/strong>, watch the <strong data-end=\\\"236\\\" data-start=\\\"214\\\">sunset from Galata<\\/strong>, have a <strong data-end=\\\"270\\\" data-start=\\\"245\\\">Bosphorus-view dinner<\\/strong>, and end with <strong data-end=\\\"303\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">rooftop drinks<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\">Return to your hotel and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LOCAL MARKET EXPLORATION & BOSPHORUS CRUISE : SIC\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\">leisurely morning exploring Istanbul\\u2019s local markets<\\/strong> at your own pace. Discover the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"195\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">Spice Bazaar<\\/strong>, where aromatic spices, teas, and Turkish delights fill the air, or visit hidden gems like the <strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">Arasta Bazaar<\\/strong> for handcrafted souvenirs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">In the <strong data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">evening, embark on a magical Bosphorus Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>, sailing between <strong data-end=\\\"439\\\" data-start=\\\"420\\\">Europe and Asia<\\/strong>. Enjoy a delicious meal while watching a <strong data-end=\\\"511\\\" data-start=\\\"481\\\">traditional folkloric show<\\/strong>, featuring live music, belly dancing, and cultural performances. <strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">Unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\">Return to your hotel and relax after a memorable evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL - ASWAN\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"145\\\" data-start=\\\"115\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST\\/SAW)<\\/strong> to catch your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"186\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">Aswan, Egypt<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"191\\\">Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"216\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Aswan<\\/strong>, proceed to your hotel for <strong data-end=\\\"271\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">check-in and relaxation<\\/strong> after your journey. Enjoy a leisurely evening, preparing for the adventures ahead.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\">Overnight stay in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ASWAN (Local Sightseeing) - NILE CRUISE\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"157\\\" data-start=\\\"113\\\">private tour of Aswan\\u2019s iconic landmarks<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"176\\\" data-start=\\\"164\\\">High Dam<\\/strong> \\u2013 A modern engineering marvel built in the 1960s, providing irrigation and hydroelectric power.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"299\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/strong> \\u2013 The largest known ancient obelisk, offering insights into ancient Egyptian stone-cutting techniques.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"424\\\" data-start=\\\"407\\\">Philae Temple<\\/strong> \\u2013 A stunning temple dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"474\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Goddess Isis<\\/strong>, relocated to Agilkia Island to preserve its heritage.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"577\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"574\\\" data-start=\\\"561\\\">3\\u20134 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"754\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">After the tour, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"648\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Nile Cruise for check-in and lunch<\\/strong>. Enjoy the rest of the day relaxing onboard as you prepare for an unforgettable journey along the Nile.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\">Overnight on the cruise in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Abu Simbel & Kom Ombo Temple Visits)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"79\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\">Early Morning (04:30 AM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"82\\\" data-start=\\\"79\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"144\\\" data-start=\\\"114\\\">private tour to Abu Simbel<\\/strong>. Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"190\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"169\\\">Abu Simbel Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most iconic monuments, built by Ramses II. The temples are carved into the mountainside and are famous for their grand statues and remarkable preservation.<br data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"412\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Afternoon:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"431\\\" data-start=\\\"428\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to the cruise by early afternoon and have lunch onboard as the cruise begins to sail from Aswan around <strong data-end=\\\"555\\\" data-start=\\\"544\\\">2:00 PM<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"558\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\">Evening (05:00 PM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"586\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"646\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">visit to Kom Ombo Temple<\\/strong>. Explore the unique <strong data-end=\\\"689\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\">Greco-Roman temple<\\/strong> dedicated to two gods: <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">Sobek, the crocodile god<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\">Haroeris, the sun god<\\/strong>. The temple\\u2019s location along the Nile offers stunning views and fascinating historical significance.<br data-end=\\\"876\\\" data-start=\\\"873\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"920\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"965\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\">Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Edfu Temple)\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>At 05:30 AM, you\\u2019ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">private tour to Edfu Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most remarkable and well-preserved temples. Dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Horus<\\/strong>, the falcon god, this temple is known for its large scale and intricate carvings that tell the story of Horus\\u2019s battle with his enemy Set. It offers fascinating insights into ancient Egyptian religion and mythology. The tour lasts about <strong data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"425\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>, giving you ample time to explore the temple\\u2019s impressive structure, including its towering pylons, courtyards, and the sanctuary.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISE - LUXUR\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, check out from the cruise at <strong data-end=\\\"116\\\" data-start=\\\"104\\\">09:00 AM<\\/strong> and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore <strong data-end=\\\"170\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Luxor<\\/strong>. First, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"205\\\" data-start=\\\"189\\\">Luxor Temple<\\/strong>, dedicated to the Theban Triad, followed by a visit to the grand <strong data-end=\\\"288\\\" data-start=\\\"271\\\">Karnak Temple<\\/strong>, one of the largest temple complexes in Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"654\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">Next, continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, where you can explore the tombs of pharaohs, including that of <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"449\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>, and visit the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">Temple of Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, dedicated to the female pharaoh.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"760\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\">The entire tour will take around <strong data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">5\\u20136 hours<\\/strong>. Afterward, check in to your hotel in Luxor and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\">Overnight stay at a Luxor hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LUXUR - CAIRO\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"32\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Luxor and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"117\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Luxor Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"146\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">Cairo<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"412\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"184\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met and assisted with your transfer to your hotel. Once checked in, enjoy the rest of the evening at leisure. You can either explore <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\">Cairo at your own pace<\\/strong> or relax at your hotel to unwind after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Day Trip to Alexandria)\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"468\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"51\\\" data-start=\\\"39\\\">07:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\\u2019ll be picked up from your hotel for an <strong data-end=\\\"126\\\" data-start=\\\"96\\\">overday trip to Alexandria<\\/strong>, a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">3-hour drive<\\/strong> from Cairo. Once in Alexandria, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">Citadel of Qaitbay<\\/strong> from the outside, an impressive fortress located on the Mediterranean coast. Then, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"331\\\" data-start=\\\"314\\\">Pompey Pillar<\\/strong>, the largest ancient column in Egypt, and the <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Roman Theatre<\\/strong>, where you can explore the ruins of this historical performance space.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\">Finally, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">Catacombs of Kom El-Shoqafa<\\/strong>, an ancient burial site that blends Egyptian, Greek, and Roman influences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"723\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">The trip offers a fascinating mix of ancient history, architecture, and culture, before returning to Cairo in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Pyramids of Giza, Egyptian Museum & More)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"69\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">08:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\'ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore some of Cairo\\u2019s most iconic landmarks. Start with the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"213\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong> and the <strong data-end=\\\"232\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Sphinx<\\/strong>, marveling at the ancient wonders and learning about their fascinating history.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"554\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Next, visit a <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">papyrus fair<\\/strong>, where you can see how the ancient Egyptians made papyrus, followed by a stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">perfume factory<\\/strong> to experience traditional Egyptian scents, and a <strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"499\\\">cotton shop<\\/strong> to discover the fine Egyptian cotton.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\">Afterward, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"598\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">Egyptian Museum<\\/strong>, home to a vast collection of ancient Egyptian antiquities, including the famous treasures of <strong data-end=\\\"708\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">The tour will last approximately <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>, providing a deep dive into Egypt\\u2019s rich history and culture.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (SELF EXPLORATION)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\"><strong><em>After Breakfast Check-out<\\/em><\\/strong>, &amp; enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\">self-exploration day<\\/strong> in Cairo, immersing yourself in the city\'s vibrant local markets and food scene. Start your day by visiting the famous <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you can wander through narrow alleys lined with shops selling everything from spices and perfumes to jewelry and handcrafted goods. It\\u2019s the perfect spot to experience the bustling atmosphere of Cairo.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"773\\\" data-start=\\\"457\\\">Next, dive into the local food scene. Try some of Cairo\\u2019s most famous dishes, like <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">koshari<\\/strong> (a mix of lentils, rice, pasta, and fried onions), <strong data-end=\\\"614\\\" data-start=\\\"603\\\">falafel<\\/strong> (crispy chickpea fritters), and <strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"647\\\">shawarma<\\/strong> (seasoned meat wraps). For dessert, don\'t miss out on <strong data-end=\\\"725\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\">baklava<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"739\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\">kunafa<\\/strong> (a sweet pastry soaked in syrup).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"973\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Explore at your own pace, tasting street food, visiting cafes, and chatting with the friendly locals. It\\u2019s a great opportunity to connect with the culture and enjoy Cairo\\u2019s rich culinary traditions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"975\\\">Spend the day as you wish.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"372\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">After a memorable journey, it\\u2019s time to head to <strong data-end=\\\"129\\\" data-start=\\\"112\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. As you leave, take with you the sweet memories of the <strong data-end=\\\"276\\\" data-start=\\\"208\\\">Pyramids, ancient temples, vibrant markets, and the rich culture<\\/strong> you experienced throughout your tour. Safe travels and hope to welcome you again in the future!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\">End of your tour.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"738\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"105580\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"to\":\"Aswan (ASW)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"84\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Luxor (LXR)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"75\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"40600\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ISTANBUL\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room - Sea View\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"100000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ASWAN\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Basma\",\"room_type\":\"Garden View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NILE CRUISE\",\"hotel_name\":\"M\\/S Esmeralda 5\\u2605 Nile Cruise\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"Cabins with Nile view window\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LUXUR\",\"room_type\":\"Standard City View Room\",\"rate\":null,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":4,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sonesta St. George\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"CAIRO\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramses Hilton\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Nile View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"02\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare <strong>Istanbul-Aswan &amp; Luxor-Cairo.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Basma&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Aswan</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>M/S Esmeralda 5★ Nile Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Sonesta St. George Luxor&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Luxor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Ramses Hilton</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Local Lunch + 01 Local Dinner</strong> in&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All entrance fees.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All meals</strong>&nbsp;at <strong>Movenpick Lily or Lotus 5*&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>NILE CRUISE.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers </strong>mentioned in the Itinerary&nbsp;(PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>Tours Mentioned</strong> in the Itinerary&nbsp;(SIC/PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>English Speaking</strong> Tour Guide During Tours.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Entrance Fees</strong> Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Visa Charges</li>\n	<li>Tips / Portage /&nbsp;<b>($7 P.P. Per day Compulsory)</b></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<p><b>1st Deposit (50%)</b>&nbsp;– Due by&nbsp;<b>Saturday, 12 April 2025</b></p>\n	</li>\n	<li>\n	<p><b>2nd Deposit (50%)</b>&nbsp;– Due by&nbsp;<b>Saturday, 20 September 2025</b></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><i>We kindly request payment as per the above schedule to ensure confirmed reservations and to avoid automatic release of bookings without notice.</i></p>', NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":146180,\"hotel_cost\":\"100000\",\"land_cost\":\"577400\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"ISTANBUL  Land\",\"amount\":\"61000\"}],\"cost_price\":884580,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 132687\",\"selling_price\":1017267}', 'MZQ/0649/032025', 1008000, 252000, 0, '2025-03-18 08:00:41', '2025-04-14 07:10:21', 0, 1, '\"<p>PLEASE NOTE:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Hagia Sophia\\/St. Sophia: Closed on&nbsp;Monday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Topkap\\u0131 Palace: Closed on Tuesday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Grand Bazaar: Closed on&nbsp;Sunday, Replaced with Arasta Bazaar.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bosphorus Cruise &amp; Two Continents Tour: Not Operated on&nbsp;Mondays.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>IMPORTANT NOTES:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The rates are dynamic &amp; will keep on changing until we hold it as per the final confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nothing is on hold until &amp; unless we provide it in the written confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All internal flights tickets are non refundable &amp; non exchangeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All services &amp; rates are remain subject to availability at the time of confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pick up &amp; drop for all tours &amp; transfers will be done from city center hotels only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Above quote is based on all paying pax travelling together. Any revision in number of pax will affect the given cost.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Company does not have any liability if the tour is cancelled or itinerary changed during the tour due to any unpredictable event like any political disturbance or weather condition or natural&nbsp;disaster&nbsp;etc.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All ferries, boats, cruises &amp; cable cars ride will be done on SIC basis.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><em>We have requested the room configuration at all hotels as follows:<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><b>02 King-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>02 Twin-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>We thank you for confirming your forthcoming holiday to TURKEY &amp; EGYPT. As you know Egypt as a destination has lot to offer because of its beauty &amp; history, We also understand guest need relaxed itinerary but few place will need early departure might be 4:30 am&nbsp; as&nbsp; we need to reach on time to avoid any kind of disappointment .We will make sure were ever it\'s possible we will start by 10:00 but usually all the tour pick up time is between 7 am -8 am , But as said we will try our best whenever it possible we will start late.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n<b>Sightseeing:&nbsp;<\\/b>We have included general entry of Pyramid \\u2013 However if you wish to visit inside the pyramid then guest has to pay&nbsp; USD 35 to USD 45 apx per person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Notification from the Immigration Department of Egypt<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;All arriving passengers to Egypt who wish to stay for more than 7 days inside Egypt would have to go to the Immigration department (within 7 days of their entry into Egypt) and follow the below steps :<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Register for their arrival in Egypt<br \\/>\\n900 EGP ( approximately 18 USD ) at the airport<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Get their passport stamped with an additional Immigration stamp<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Failure to adhere to these new regulations would result in the passenger paying penalties during his exit from Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We look forward to welcoming you and remain at your service for any further assistance.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(660, 'Mr Raj Purohit', 'Ahmedabad', '9898509400', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ALMATY', '2025-06-22', 5, 0, 4, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"964\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:55 AM\",\"fare\":121604},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"963\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kazzhol\",\"city\":\"ALMATY\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"27\\/06\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong><em> Ex-Delhi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>05 Nights </strong>accomodation on DBL Sharing <strong>@ Hotel&nbsp;Kazzhol Almaty.</strong></li>\n	<li>All transportation on a private basis using a&nbsp;4 Str. Toyota&nbsp;Alphard</li>\n	<li>Wi-Fi inside vehicles.</li>\n	<li>Airport – hotel – airport transfers</li>\n	<li>Vehicle available from 1000 – 2200 Hrs</li>\n	<li>Sightseeing as per itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Dedicated English speaking&nbsp;Driver cum Guide&nbsp;during the tours</li>\n	<li>2 X 500 ML water bottles per person in the vehicle daily.</li>\n	<li>Refreshing napkins &amp; chocolate inside the vehicle upon arrival</li>\n	<li>Departure souvenir gift.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>ENTRANCE &amp; ACTIVITIES</strong></p>\n\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n	<li>Shymbulak Gondola tickets – L1,2,3 (return)</li>\n	<li>Kok Tobe Gondola tickets – Return</li>\n	<li>Charyn Canyon Toll Tax</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<table dir=\"ltr\">\n	<colgroup>\n		<col />\n		<col />\n		<col />\n		<col />\n		<col />\n	</colgroup>\n	<tbody>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\"><strong>Day wise Itinerary - 5 Nights - 6 Days</strong></td>\n		</tr>\n		<tr>\n			<td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"1\">Day 1 - Arrival at ALMATY<br />\n			Day 2 - Visit the Shymbulak Ski resort – Level 3 via Gondola + Panfilov &amp; Arbat walking tour<br />\n			Day 3 - Almaty city tour + Panfilov Park &amp; Zenkov Cathedral + Visit to Kok Tobe Hill<br />\n			Day 4 - Day Excursion to Charyn Canyon<br />\n			Day 5 - Green Bazaar + Rakhat Chocolate Shop<br />\n			Day 6 - Departure from ALMATY - Drop to Airport</td>\n		</tr>\n	</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":121604,\"land_cost\":\"177480\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":299084,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 29908.4\",\"selling_price\":328992.400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0650/032025', 328960, 82240, 0, '2025-03-18 08:26:50', '2025-03-18 08:26:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(661, 'Ms Chandramukhi', 'MZ CDG', '9988847623', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-04-14', 4, 1, 2, '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1461\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"fare\":94200},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1462\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ascot Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"18\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"17000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Delhi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in<strong>&nbsp;Hotel Ascot Bur Dubai.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Two way Dubai Airport transfers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong>&nbsp;Fountain Show.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124-125th Floor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Dhow Cruise.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Desert Safari&nbsp;</strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, and other camp activities.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Full Day&nbsp;Abu Dhabi City Tour with Yas Island </strong>(1 Day any 1 Park) Ferrari World OR Warner Bros with Grand Mosque Photostop.</li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Dolphinarium - Dolphin &amp; Seal Show</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Tours&nbsp;</strong>on <strong>SIC basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Airport Transfers </strong>on<strong> PVT basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;Insurance.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":94200,\"hotel_cost\":17000,\"land_cost\":\"70000\",\"visa_cost\":\"11500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":192700,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 26978\",\"selling_price\":219678,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"11.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0651/032025', 219750, 77950, 63850, '2025-03-18 08:59:02', '2025-03-18 09:00:10', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(662, 'MR MAHESH SHARMA', 'DM PLY', '9113444748', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'RAJASTHAN', '2025-03-25', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL JAIPUR\",\"date\":\"25-03-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"156\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">Upon your evening arrival at Jaipur Airport, you will be greeted by your driver and transferred to your hotel. Enjoy the city\\u2019s vibrant sights on the way. After a smooth check-in, settle into your room and freshen up. If time allows, explore the hotel\\u2019s amenities or take a short walk nearby.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"156\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">Later, enjoy a delightful dinner at the hotel\\u2019s restaurant, savoring authentic Rajasthani dishes like Dal Baati Churma, Laal Maas, or international cuisine.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"604\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\">After dinner, relax in the comfort of your room and get a good night\'s rest, preparing for an exciting exploration of Jaipur the next day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"JAIPUR LOCAL SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"26-03-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, start your Jaipur sightseeing with a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"77\\\" data-start=\\\"63\\\">Amber Fort<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"95\\\" data-start=\\\"82\\\">Jal Mahal<\\/strong>. Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"124\\\" data-start=\\\"109\\\">City Palace<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"143\\\" data-start=\\\"126\\\">Jantar Mantar<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"163\\\" data-start=\\\"149\\\">Hawa Mahal<\\/strong>. Enjoy lunch at a local restaurant, followed by shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"240\\\" data-start=\\\"224\\\">Johri Bazaar<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"259\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">Bapu Bazaar<\\/strong>. Optionally, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"305\\\" data-start=\\\"283\\\">Albert Hall Museum<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"325\\\" data-start=\\\"309\\\">Birla Temple<\\/strong> before returning to the hotel to relax.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"JAIPUR LOCAL - PUSHKAR\",\"date\":\"27-03-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your Jaipur hotel and begin your local sightseeing, Enjoy lunch at a local restaurant before departing for <strong data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\">Pushkar<\\/strong>. The drive will take approximately 2.5-3 hours. Upon arriving in Pushkar, explore the <strong data-end=\\\"334\\\" data-start=\\\"318\\\">Pushkar Lake<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">Brahma Temple<\\/strong>. Afterward, check in to your hotel for a peaceful night stay. Enjoy a relaxing dinner at the hotel, soaking in the spiritual atmosphere of the town. This itinerary combines a day of sightseeing in Jaipur with a serene evening in Pushkar.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PUSHKAR - CHOWKIDHANI - JAIPUR\",\"date\":\"28-03-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your Pushkar hotel and depart for Jaipur in the afternoon, arriving in around 2.5-3 hours. Upon arrival, head to <strong data-end=\\\"291\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\">Chokhi Dhani<\\/strong> for a cultural experience, where you can enjoy traditional Rajasthani food, folk performances, and a vibrant village setting. After dinner at Chokhi Dhani, return to your hotel in Jaipur for an overnight stay. This day offers a blend of spiritual sightseeing, cultural immersion, and local cuisine.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE JAIPUR\",\"date\":\"29-03-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your Jaipur hotel and depart for the airport. The drive to Jaipur Airport takes approximately 30-45 minutes. Arrive at the airport, complete check-in, and go through security procedures. Make sure to leave with enough time to avoid any rush. Wishing you a safe and smooth journey as you head to your next destination!<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5043\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":33648},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Jaipur (JAI)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2204\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Jaipur (JAI)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2875\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":29756},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2975\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Mar 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Mar 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"JAIPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Golden Tulip 5*\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"28800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PUSHKAR\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/03\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"room_type\":\"Classic Deluxe\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ananta Spa & Resort 5*\",\"rate\":\"19300\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"28\\/03\\/2025\",\"city\":\"JAIPUR\",\"room_type\":\"Shakun Deluxe\",\"hotel_name\":\"Shakun Hotels and Resorts 5*\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/03\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"10700\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>RoundTrip Airfare <strong><em>Ex-Ranchi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Golden Tulip&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Jaipur</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Ananta Spa &amp; Resort&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Pushkar</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Shakun Hotels and Resorts&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Jaipur</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;<strong>DBL Sharing + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>(Except last Night @Jaipur).</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>A/C Kia carens&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Chowkidhani Dinner Charges to be paid directly on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":63404,\"hotel_cost\":58800,\"transport_cost\":\"15800\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":138004,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24840.72\",\"selling_price\":162844.72000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0652/032025', 159800, 39950, 0, '2025-03-20 14:16:08', '2025-03-20 14:16:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(663, 'Mr. N P Agarwal', 'BNI Bhavesh Butala | Ref: Karn Butala', '9431138480', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 4*', '2025-04-08', 4, NULL, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Jammu- Srinagar\",\"date\":\"08-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at the&nbsp;Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to the&nbsp;Hotel in Srinagar. After fresh up&nbsp;&nbsp;proceed&nbsp;to Srinagar,&nbsp;Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, Cheshmashahi,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and&nbsp;Overnight stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar  - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"09-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 -02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost)&nbsp;,Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwandi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"10-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;&nbsp;03:00 -03:30&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>NOTE:-As Per The New Rules From Cable Car Corporation All Gondola Tickets Has To Be Booked By Online Only&nbsp;(&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/www.jammukashmircablecar.com<\\/a>)&nbsp;by the guest with valid ID Proof .<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg  - Srinagar - H.B.\",\"date\":\"11-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Srinagar,Later&nbsp;&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Dinner and Overnight Stay at Houseboat in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Depart Srinagar Airport\",\"date\":\"12-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel and drive to Airport to your&nbsp;destination.Guests are advised to reach Airport 2 hrs before the departure time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5062\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":34960},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Jammu (IXJ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6384\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"828\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":61252},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"9699\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rose Petal\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"check_out\":\"09\\/04\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/04\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"check_out\":\"10\\/04\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hotel Sparrow\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/04\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"check_out\":\"11\\/04\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/04\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"DOUBLE ROOM\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR