(666, 'MR P K LAL DAS', NULL, '9934401181', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-04-22', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL - HALF DAY CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"22-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\'s Noi Bai International Airport you will be welcomed by our guide holding a sign with your name on it. After approximately 50 minutes to 1-hour transfer, you will be at your hotel for check-in <strong><em>(Early check-in with breakfast included).<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Start your half day city tour with a visit to Temple of Literature, known as the first university of Vietnam built in 1070 by the Ly Dynasty to honor Confucius, sages and outstanding Vietnamese scholars. After that, head to the city center to visit Hoan Kiem Lake and Ngoc Son Temple located on an islet in the lake. Hoan Kiem Lake is the center point of Hanoi and home to a rare endangered giant turtle species. Its name \\u201cReturned Sword\\u201d comes from a legend of a sacred sword being lent to an ancient Vietnamese King by a holy turtle from the lake and later returned to the turtle. Then, enjoy a cup of coffee at a street corner Cafe Shop while watching the daily life moves of the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY TAM COC - BICH DONG - HOA LU - HA NOI - TRANSFER TO SAPA BY TRAIN\",\"date\":\"23-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning, meet our guide at your hotel and transfer to Ninh Binh Province about 100 km South of Hanoi. Head for Hoa Lu to see the few vestiges of the first capital of Vietnam. Built in the 10th Century by the Dinh Dynasty not only for a capital but also as a stronghold against the Northern invaders, Hoa Lu shortly later it was inherited by the Le Dynasty. Visit the two old temples one dedicated to Dinh Tien Hoang, the only king of the Dinh Dynasty and also Vietnam\\u2019s first emperor and the other to the succeeding kings of the Le Dynasty. Though the temples are no longer intact, some precious antique carvings and sculpture of stone and wood are still preserved. Then continue to visit Bich Dong pagoda, an ancient three tiered cave pagoda only accessible by steep stone steps, but it is really worth climbing up for a charming pagoda and stupendous view from the top.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon, take a sampan cruise along the Hoang Long River through the scenic landscape of Tam Coc, a 350 ha area of karst mountains scattered over the lush wetland with paddy fields. This area is referred to as \\u201can inland Ha Long bay\\u201d for its strikingly similar water-and-rock terrain features. Depending on the time of visit, you may see local farmers harvesting rice or transplanting seedlings for the new crop. Pass through three big caves which feature the area\\u2019s name (Tam Coc means three caves in Vietnamese) and which represent a host of local rocky caves and grottoes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Free at leisure until being transfer to Train station by our tour guide &amp; driver.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight on overnight train Hanoi - Sapa<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA ARRIVAL - FULL DAY CAT CAT VILLAGE & DISCOVER FANSIPAN MOUNTAIN\",\"date\":\"24-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at Lao Cai Train station, picked up by our tour guide &amp; driver.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Take a short car ride just 3 km out of Sa Pa to Cat Cat village inhabited by a community of the Hmong ethnic minority people. The village is known as a cultural site since many traditions and customs of the Black Hmong are still preserved to date. The traditional trades of brocade making and silver and bronze smith are still practiced nowadays by villagers after numerous generations of their ancestors. You can see Hmong women by their looms weaving fabrics, which will be later on dyed with sap from leaves for the desired coloration. Your walk through the village will take you to Tien Sa waterfall where a French-built hydropower station has been in service since 1920. Leave Cat Cat village and trek a 5 km winding trail by mountainside along a small river in a tranquil setting of hilly land with terraced paddy fields. Arrive in Y Linh Ho village, another Hmong residence characterized by simple houses built of bamboo and clay. Wander around to observe and interact with villagers dressed in elaborate silver-studded clothing and leggings.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Start the tour to the Cable Car station where you will get on cabin and take a 15-minute ride by cable car. At 6292,5m long, this is the longest non-stop three rope cable car in the world. Continue to climb about 600 steps to reach the summit of Mount Fansipan. Spend time to admire the beautiful natural landscape of Sapa, Hoang Lien Son, Muong Hoa valley and the magnificent Hoang Lien Son mountain range.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Sapa<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA - TRANSFER BACK TO HANOI BY TRAIN - HA NOI ARRIVAL (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"25-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until being transfer by our tour guide &amp; driver to Lao Cai train station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive in Ha Noi, pick up by our driver and transfer back to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong><em>Meal: Breakfast<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong><em>Overnight at hotel in Ha Noi<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI - HA LONG OVERNIGHT ON BOAT - TRANSFER BY SHUTTLE BUS\",\"date\":\"26-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Leave Hanoi for a 2.5-hour drive to Ha Long Bay including a 20-minutes stop on the way. Arrive at the jetty in Ha Long City towards noon and proceed with check-in formalities. Be welcomed onboard and have lunch will be served while cruising towards the bay itself. In the afternoon, enjoy some visits and\\/or activities (depending on each boat\\u2019s itinerary) or just spend some time relaxing on board. Towards the end of the day the boat sets anchor for the night among the karst formations. Dinner is served on board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight on Ha Long cruise<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HA LONG - TRANSFER BACK HANOI BY SHUTTLE BUS - HANOI DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE) -DA NANG ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"27-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy the fresh morning in the middle of the bay, the sun rises on Ha Long in the morning and breakfast is served (brunch on some boats) while the vessels cruise slowly through the magnificent rock formations and back towards port. Disembark and transfer back to Hanoi. Arrive in Hanoi late in the afternoon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>You are free at leisure before being transferred by our driver to Noi Bai International Airport for flight departure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrival Da Nang airport, pick up by our guide &amp; driver then transfer to Hotel for check in<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast, Lunch (or Brunch)<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Da Nang<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY DA NANG - BA NA HILL - GOLDEN BRIDGE\",\"date\":\"28-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning, departure for Ba Na Hills, or Chua Mount (Mount of Goddess), by passing the sea-shore on Nguyen Tat Thanh Street, one of the most beautiful roads of Da Nang City and Red Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive at the Cable car station at the foot of Ba Na Mountain. Enjoy the first leg Cable car, which achieves two Guinness World records as the longest non-stop cable car (5,042m) and the highest non-stop cable car (1,292m). The cable cars were built to feed the mountaintop of Ba Na Hills, but they\\u2019re also the perfect way to get spectacular views of Danang and the surrounding forests.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching Ba Na Hills, start the trip with a visit to Golden Bridge which is designed to connect the cable car station with the main gardens of this mountaintop. It is also to provide a scenic overlook and tourist attraction. The gold-colored walkway is lined with purple Lobelia Chrysanthemums and is 150 meters long with two giant hands, constructed of fiberglass and wire mesh. These two hands appear like stone hands that support the structure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After the Golden Bridge, we\\u2019ll continue to visit Le Jardin d\\u2019 Amour, remains of French Villas and Ling Ung Pagoda with 27m high Buddha status. We then leave the Le Jardin for the second cable car station to visit the top of mountain where there are remains of the old French villas found. Start conquering the Peak of Chua Mount at the height of 1,487m, viewing the whole Da Nang city under the cluster of white clouds. After the Peak of Chua Mount, visit the trail of Dreaming Stream, Rainbow Waterfall, Suspension Bridge, Golden Valley, and ruined Opera House. Play with wild monkeys and take photos. Freely until time back to Cable car Station to return to the the foot of the Mountain. Transfer back to Da Nang City.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Da Nang<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"29-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer to Da Nang airport for flight departure<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><em><strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"33574\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1631\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi\",\"to\":\"Sapa\",\"name\":\"CHAPA EXPRESS\",\"fno\":\"Cabin VIP\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:40 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Apr 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"06:25 AM\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"LIMOUSINE VAN\",\"fno\":\"Chair Seat\",\"from\":\"Sapa\",\"to\":\"Hanoi\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Apr 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"543\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"13248\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"1635\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"14886\"},{\"id\":7,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1642\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"30890\"},{\"id\":8,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6152\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Hanoi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Nesta\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"9943\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel KK Sapa 4* Deluxe\",\"city\":\"Sapa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room - Valley View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"10294\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Hanoi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Flower Garden 4* Deluxe\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe room\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/04\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"4674\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"26\\/04\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"city\":\"Ha Long\",\"hotel_name\":\"MON CHERI CRUISE (BIG BAY GROUP) 5*\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Cabin\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Da Nang\",\"hotel_name\":\"Radisson Red Danang 5*\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room - Ocean View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11417\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return&nbsp;<strong><em>Airfare Ex-Ranchi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06&nbsp;Nts Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;in above mentioned Hotels</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room </strong>on Double sharing.</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;way</strong>&nbsp;transfer Ha Noi – Sa Pa by <strong>Night&nbsp;train </strong>in<strong> Private cabin.<br />\n	01 way&nbsp;</strong>transfer Sa Pa -&nbsp;Ha Noi by <strong>Limousine Van </strong>on<strong> Sharing basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night cruise</strong> on Ha Long Bay with<strong> 02 ways transferred by shuttle bus.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in double/ twin room.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meals</strong> as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers on <strong>PVT basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Experienced English-speaking guide </strong>during all tours and transfers (except for arrival day on Day 4, departure day in Ha Noi and Da Nang)</li>\n	<li><strong>Entrance fees </strong>for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li><strong>Vietnam Tourist Visa.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Tipping policy:<em> 05 USD per person per day</em></span></span></b></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"33\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":92598,\"hotel_cost\":\"36328\",\"land_cost\":\"118200\",\"visa_cost\":\"4500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":251626,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 83036.58\",\"selling_price\":334662.5800000000162981450557708740234375}', 'MZQ/0655/032025', 335000, 167500, 0, '2025-03-27 13:06:23', '2025-04-16 13:49:33', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(667, 'Mrs Kavita', 'Walk In', '7257910847', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-04-24', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at DMK Airport \\u2013 Transfer to Pattaya & Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"24-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"52\\\" data-start=\\\"10\\\">Don Mueang International Airport (DMK)<\\/strong> and meet your driver for a transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"103\\\" data-start=\\\"92\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> (approx. 2-2.5 hours). Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and relax after your journey. In the afternoon, visit <strong data-end=\\\"240\\\" data-start=\\\"218\\\">Tiger Park Pattaya<\\/strong>, where you can interact with and take photos with tigers in a safe environment. The evening is free for you to explore Pattaya at your own pace\\u2014enjoy the beach, explore shopping and dining options. Conclude the day with an overnight stay at your Pattaya hotel, preparing for the exciting experiences ahead.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour with Lunch\",\"date\":\"25-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"50\\\" data-start=\\\"28\\\">Pattaya Beach Pier<\\/strong> for a speedboat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"102\\\" data-start=\\\"75\\\">Coral Island (Koh Larn)<\\/strong>. Enjoy thrilling water activities such as <strong data-end=\\\"207\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">parasailing, jet skiing, snorkeling, and banana boat rides<\\/strong> (optional). Relax on the pristine beaches and soak in the tropical beauty. Around midday, savor a <strong data-end=\\\"347\\\" data-start=\\\"306\\\">delicious lunch at a local restaurant<\\/strong>. After lunch, enjoy free time to unwind by the beach. In the afternoon, return to Pattaya by speedboat and transfer back to your hotel. Spend the evening at leisure, exploring the city or relaxing at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya to Bangkok & Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"26-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your <strong data-end=\\\"54\\\" data-start=\\\"37\\\">Pattaya hotel<\\/strong> and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"81\\\" data-start=\\\"70\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> (approx. 2-2.5 hours drive). Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and relax. Spend the afternoon at leisure, exploring nearby attractions or unwinding at the hotel. In the evening, transfer to the <strong data-end=\\\"305\\\" data-start=\\\"279\\\">Chao Phraya River Pier<\\/strong> for a <strong data-end=\\\"341\\\" data-start=\\\"312\\\">Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>. Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"378\\\" data-start=\\\"351\\\">delicious buffet dinner<\\/strong> with live entertainment while admiring Bangkok\\u2019s illuminated skyline and iconic landmarks. After the cruise, return to your hotel for an overnight stay, preparing for the next day\\u2019s adventures.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"27-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"78\\\" data-start=\\\"31\\\">full-day tour of Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>. Begin with an exciting <strong data-end=\\\"124\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Safari Park drive<\\/strong>, where you can see wildlife like lions, tigers, zebras, and giraffes in a natural habitat. Next, explore <strong data-end=\\\"245\\\" data-start=\\\"230\\\">Marine Park<\\/strong>, featuring thrilling animal shows, including <strong data-end=\\\"325\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">dolphins, sea lions, and birds<\\/strong>. Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"335\\\">delicious buffet lunch<\\/strong> at the park before continuing with attractions like the <strong data-end=\\\"461\\\" data-start=\\\"418\\\">Jungle Cruise, Orangutan Show, and more<\\/strong>. After an adventurous day, return to your hotel in the evening to relax and unwind. This fun-filled experience is perfect for wildlife and adventure lovers.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Dream World Tour with Super Visa\",\"date\":\"28-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"43\\\" data-start=\\\"28\\\">Dream World<\\/strong> for a fun-filled day with the <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"74\\\">Super Visa Pass<\\/strong>, granting access to all rides. Enjoy thrilling attractions like roller coasters, water rides, and adventure zones. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"228\\\" data-start=\\\"215\\\">Snow Town<\\/strong> for a winter experience with sledding and ice play, and take on the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"317\\\" data-start=\\\"306\\\">Go-Kart<\\/strong> track. Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"359\\\" data-start=\\\"333\\\">delicious buffet lunch<\\/strong> at the park before continuing with more rides and attractions. In the late afternoon, return to your hotel to relax after an adventurous day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>This experience is perfect for families and thrill-seekers looking for excitement in Bangkok!<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Check-out, Shopping & Departure\",\"date\":\"29-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and spend the day shopping at popular destinations like <strong data-end=\\\"112\\\" data-start=\\\"98\\\">MBK Center<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"130\\\" data-start=\\\"114\\\">Siam Paragon<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"152\\\" data-start=\\\"132\\\">Chatuchak Market<\\/strong>, or <strong data-end=\\\"173\\\" data-start=\\\"157\\\">CentralWorld<\\/strong>. Enjoy browsing through a variety of products, fashion, electronics, and souvenirs. In the afternoon, return to the hotel to collect your luggage and prepare for departure. By evening, depart for <strong data-end=\\\"394\\\" data-start=\\\"370\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport<\\/strong>, allowing enough time for check-in and security procedures.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>This day offers plenty of time for last-minute shopping and exploring Bangkok\'s vibrant shopping scene before heading to the airport for your onward journey. Safe travels!<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"Thai Lion Air\",\"fno\":\"243\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"30500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"313\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 AM\",\"fare\":37980}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"room_type\":\"Studio Room with City View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel LK The Empress\",\"check_out\":\"26\\/04\\/2025\",\"nights\":2,\"rate\":\"17400\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"26\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Benja Sukhumvit 5\",\"room_type\":\"Triple Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2025\",\"nights\":3,\"rate\":\"16100\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<em><strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong>&nbsp;accomodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel LK The Empress, Pattaya.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong>&nbsp;accomodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Royal Benja Sukhumvit 5, Bangkok.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Coral Island tour</strong>&nbsp;by Speed Boat with Lunch</li>\n	<li><strong>Tiger Park <em>(</em></strong><em>Medium Tiger)</em></li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Princess Cruise</strong>&nbsp;Entry Ticket with Dinner</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World + Marine Park</strong>&nbsp;with Lunch</li>\n	<li><strong>Dream World </strong>Super Visa Includes all rides + Snow Town + Go Kart + Buffet Lunch&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Bangkok DMK Airport to Pattaya Hotel on PVT</li>\n	<li>Pattaya Hotel To Bangkok Hotel on PVT</li>\n	<li>Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport on PVT</li>\n	<li><strong>All Tours</strong> on <strong>SIC</strong></li>\n	<li>All taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":68480,\"hotel_cost\":33500,\"land_cost\":\"50000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":151980,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18237.6\",\"selling_price\":170217.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0656/032025', 173280, 57760, 0, '2025-03-28 05:20:22', '2025-03-28 05:20:22', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(668, 'Mr Rishi', 'VK Barnwal', '9955135345', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-05-17', 6, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Dhow Cruise Dinner\",\"date\":\"17-05-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Dubai and transfer to your hotel for check-in. Spend the day settling in and unwinding. In the evening, enjoy a traditional Dhow Cruise Dinner along the Dubai Creek. Experience the city\\u2019s skyline lit up at night while savoring a buffet dinner with live entertainment aboard the wooden boat. A perfect start to your Dubai holiday combining culture, cuisine, and scenic views.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Deluxe Desert Safari\",\"date\":\"18-05-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start the day at leisure, then head into the golden dunes for a thrilling Deluxe Desert Safari. Enjoy dune bashing in 4x4s, camel rides, sandboarding, and henna painting. The evening features cultural performances like belly dancing and Tanoura shows. Conclude with a delicious BBQ dinner under the stars at a traditional desert camp. This immersive Arabian experience blends adventure with local tradition and entertainment.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half Day City Tour, Dubai Mall & Burj Khalifa\",\"date\":\"19-05-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Explore Dubai\\u2019s highlights on a guided half-day city tour covering modern and historic attractions. Visit landmarks like Jumeirah Beach, Palm Jumeirah, and Burj Al Arab. Head to Dubai Mall for shopping and indoor activities (note: fountain show under maintenance). Participate in the whimsical Underwater Fantasy Prince\\/Princess experience before visiting the iconic Burj Khalifa. Ascend to the 124th and 125th floors for panoramic views of the city skyline at sunset.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Day\",\"date\":\"20-05-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Take a break to explore Dubai at your own pace. Use this free day for shopping, relaxing at the hotel, or discovering nearby attractions. Whether you want to visit local markets, lounge on Jumeirah Beach, or indulge in some luxury spa time, the day is yours to enjoy. Optional excursions can be arranged based on your interests. It\\u2019s a great chance to unwind or personalize your Dubai experience.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai Balloon at Atlantis\",\"date\":\"21-05-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Visit the Dubai Balloon at Atlantis, an exciting aerial experience offering breathtaking views of The Palm and beyond. Soar high above the city in a helium balloon for an unforgettable perspective of Dubai\\u2019s skyline, the Arabian Gulf, and its architectural wonders. This gentle, tethered ride is perfect for photos and creating lasting memories. The rest of the day is free for additional sightseeing or relaxation at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Day \\/ Optional Activities\",\"date\":\"22-05-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Another free day to relax or explore more of what Dubai offers. Optional activities include visiting the Miracle Garden, Global Village, or joining a luxury yacht cruise. You may also choose to spend the day at leisure enjoying local cuisine or shopping. This flexible day allows for personal exploration or additional tour customization. It\\u2019s ideal for winding down or fitting in any missed attractions from earlier days.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"23-05-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from your hotel and transfer to Dubai International Airport for your return flight. Reflect on a memorable week filled with cultural experiences, thrilling activities, and iconic landmarks. Your Dubai holiday ends with wonderful stories and photographs to carry home. Please ensure your documents are ready and arrive at the airport on time. We wish you a safe and comfortable journey back and hope to host you again.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"565\",\"dep_date\":\"17 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"17 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"107000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"566\",\"dep_date\":\"23 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Ascot Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"24000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Ex-Bangalore.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>06 Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in<strong>&nbsp;Hotel Royal Ascot Bur Dubai.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Two way Dubai Airport transfers</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Dubai Mall</strong>&nbsp;&amp;<strong>&nbsp;Fountain Show.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Burj Khalifa 124-125th Floor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Deluxe Marina Dhow Cruise.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Deluxe Desert Safari&nbsp;</strong>with BBQ Dinner, Belly Dance Show, and other camp activities.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Underwater Fantasy Prince or Princess </strong>(Including underwater Mermaid show) with&nbsp;Admission for 1 Adult/Guardian.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>The Dubai Balloon at Atlantis</strong> on PVT</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Tours&nbsp;</strong>on <strong>SIC basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Airport Transfers </strong>on<strong> PVT basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;Insurance.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"26\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":107000,\"hotel_cost\":24000,\"land_cost\":\"60000\",\"visa_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":206000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 53560\",\"selling_price\":259560,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"11.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0657/032025', 260010, 93750, 72510, '2025-03-28 07:12:49', '2025-05-12 13:14:25', 0, 1, '\"<p><strong>Underwater Fantasy Prince or Princess&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>(Including underwater Mermaid show)<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Mermaid\\/Pirate Costume<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Dress Up Mermaid\\/Pirate Hairstyling &amp; Makeup<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Professional Photoshoot<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>1 Printed Photo with Frame<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>USB Stick with 12 Digital Photos<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Mermaid encounter Free Admission for 1 Adult\\/Guardian<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(669, 'Mr. Rishab', 'BNI | E', '7766907832', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok 2N - Darjeeling 2N', '2025-05-23', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport - Gangtok (128 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"23-05-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Gangtok (5,500 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs. one-way)\",\"date\":\"24-05-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a full-day city tour of Gangtok. The tour will cover key attractions including Tashi View Point, Ganesh Tok, Hanuman Tok, Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (closed on Sundays and on the 1st &amp; 3rd Saturdays of the month), Institute of Tibetology (closed on Sundays), Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery, and Banjhakri Falls. The tour duration will be approximately 6 hours.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok - Darjeeling (100 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"25-05-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"26-05-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport (75 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"27-05-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><strong data-end=\\\"74\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast<\\/strong>, check out from the hotel and proceed for a delightful ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"166\\\" data-start=\\\"142\\\">Darjeeling Toy Train<\\/strong>. After the ride, continue your journey towards <strong data-end=\\\"286\\\" data-start=\\\"252\\\">Bagdogra International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward travel.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Fern Denzong\",\"room_type\":\"Winter Green\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Orsino Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/05\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Fern Denzong&nbsp;at Gangtok<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Orsino Resort&nbsp;at Darjeeling<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;on Double Sharing basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Toy Train Ticket </strong>Charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Private 01&nbsp;Non AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova </strong>as per itinerary on point to point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in the Hill area).&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n	<li>Rates are valid for INDIAN NATIONALS only.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"64600\",\"transport_cost\":\"7600\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Toy Train\",\"amount\":4000}],\"cost_price\":76200,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 7620\",\"selling_price\":83820}', 'MZQ/0658/042025', 83860, 41930, 0, '2025-04-01 08:15:13', '2025-04-10 13:23:26', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(670, 'Dr. Saket Kumar', 'Giridih', '8210236442', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 5*', '2025-08-06', 6, 2, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"06-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Houseboat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam  (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"07-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to&nbsp;&nbsp;Pahalgam&nbsp;Via&nbsp;Saffron Fields&nbsp;of Pampore .&nbsp;A&nbsp;walk amidst the purple coloured Saffron fields is&nbsp;a&nbsp;one-off experience&nbsp;and visit Awantipura Cricket bat factory&nbsp;on the way .Pahalgam&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for&nbsp;a&nbsp;Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam  Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"08-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;full day in Pahalagm .One can also enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on&nbsp;a&nbsp;direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in&nbsp;a&nbsp;peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"09-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to&nbsp;Gulmarg via Tangmarg . Gulmarg&nbsp;\\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;&nbsp;can also have&nbsp;a&nbsp;short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on&nbsp;a&nbsp;Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar + H.B\",\"date\":\"10-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake return to the Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"11-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast leave with&nbsp;a&nbsp;full day excursion for&nbsp;Sonmarg via&nbsp;Hazratbal Shrine,&nbsp;Ganderbal , Kangan ,Mamar .The drive from Srinagar to Sonamarg is very beautiful as you will pass through some Towns and villages, at many places you can enjoy the view of paddy fields with rivers flowing on one side. The name Sonamarg is derived from two&nbsp;Kashmiri words \\u201cSon\\u201d &amp; \\u201cMarg\\u201d which mean \\u201cGold\\u201d &amp; \\u201cMeadow\\u201d, when put together it means \\u201cMeadow of Gold\\u201d.&nbsp;Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d&nbsp;.Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is&nbsp;a&nbsp;major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onward destination.\",\"date\":\"12-08-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Tour Ends!!!!!!!!!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"896\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"35000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2305\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"41000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Super Deluxe Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"check_out\":\"07\\/08\\/2025\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"07\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine n Peak Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/08\\/2025\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"09\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Khyber Himalayan Resorts and Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/08\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"10\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vivanta by Taj\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"12\\/08\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":8}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Delhi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Super Deluxe Houseboat at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Pine n Peak Welcomhotel By ITC Hotels at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel The Khyber Himalayan Resorts and Spa at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Vivanta by Taj at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Double Rooms + 01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>12 Seater AC Urbania</strong><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><i> </i></span></font>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":76000,\"land_cost\":\"704000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":780000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 109200\",\"selling_price\":889200}', 'MZQ/0659/042025', 889200, 135850, 37050, '2025-04-03 11:19:33', '2025-04-03 13:43:31', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(671, 'Dr. Saket Kumar', 'Giridih', '8210236442', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 5* (Option 02)', '2025-08-06', 6, 2, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrive Srinagar\",\"date\":\"06-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. Spend the day at leisure on boulevard road which is one of the most famous roads in Srinagar for tourists and is situated around the Dal lake surrounded by Zabarwan mountain ranges, also enjoy at Nehru Park on boulevard road.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Houseboat<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam  (85 kms \\/ 2:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"07-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast Drive to&nbsp;&nbsp;Pahalgam&nbsp;Via&nbsp;Saffron Fields&nbsp;of Pampore .&nbsp;A&nbsp;walk amidst the purple coloured Saffron fields is&nbsp;a&nbsp;one-off experience&nbsp;and visit Awantipura Cricket bat factory&nbsp;on the way .Pahalgam&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;``Valley&nbsp;of&nbsp;Shepherds``.&nbsp;On arrival check in at the Hotel in Pahalgam enjoy the nature and admire the beauty of this quiet place and be in awe of the serene surroundings.&nbsp;a&nbsp;best place for&nbsp;a&nbsp;Honeymoon Couple surrounded by snow clad mountains with dense forest of pine and devdar trees, vast meadows, and Fresh Fast running river. The natural beauty makes it&nbsp;a&nbsp;popular hill station of India. You can go trekking along the mountainous path and explore the beauty on the way.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam  Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"08-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After Breakfast enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;full day in Pahalagm .One can also enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;pony ride to nearby places like Chandanwadi (on&nbsp;a&nbsp;direct hire basis) or if you are an avid nature lover you may take pleasure in&nbsp;a&nbsp;peaceful walk along the River Lidder. Pahalgam is famous for some trekking routes also &amp; is the base camp for Amarnath Pilgrimage.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam- Gulmarg  (140 Kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"09-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to&nbsp;Gulmarg via Tangmarg . Gulmarg&nbsp;\\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d 2730 Mts. above sea level. The distance of 140 Kms will be covered in about 3:30 hrs. Gulmarg has one of the best Ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course of the world with 18 holes. Later visirt local market in Gulmarg.&nbsp;&nbsp;can also have&nbsp;a&nbsp;short trek upto Khilanmarg which can be covered in about 3 to 4 hrs or enjoy the scenic view of Kongdori on&nbsp;a&nbsp;Cable Car Known as Gondola (on direct pay basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar + H.B\",\"date\":\"10-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Srinagar and enjoy the site scene of the famous Mughal Gardens<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Cheshma Shahi \\u201cRoyal Spring\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Shalimar \\u201cGarden&nbsp;of&nbsp;Love\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nishat&nbsp;Garden&nbsp;\\u201cGarden of Pleasure\\u201d<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Shankaracharya&nbsp;Temple.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Enjoy 01 Hour Shikara ride in dal lake return to the Local handicraft showroom for hand - knotted specially silken shawls , carpet and jewellery ornaments.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar ( 86 kms \\/ 3:30 hours approximately)\",\"date\":\"11-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast leave with&nbsp;a&nbsp;full day excursion for&nbsp;Sonmarg via&nbsp;Hazratbal Shrine,&nbsp;Ganderbal , Kangan ,Mamar .The drive from Srinagar to Sonamarg is very beautiful as you will pass through some Towns and villages, at many places you can enjoy the view of paddy fields with rivers flowing on one side. The name Sonamarg is derived from two&nbsp;Kashmiri words \\u201cSon\\u201d &amp; \\u201cMarg\\u201d which mean \\u201cGold\\u201d &amp; \\u201cMeadow\\u201d, when put together it means \\u201cMeadow of Gold\\u201d.&nbsp;Situated at an altitude of 9000 Ft. Sonmarg is also called \\u201cThe meadow of gold\\u201d&nbsp;.Sonmarg lies in Sindh Valley streamed with flowers and surrounded by mountains. The place is also the base for some interesting treks to the high altitude of Himalayan Lake. Ponies can be hired for the trip up to Thajiwas glacier, which is&nbsp;a&nbsp;major local attraction during the summer.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Drive back from Sonmarg to Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Hotel<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Onward destination.\",\"date\":\"12-08-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p>After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Srinagar and get ready for transfer to the airport \\/ Railway Station to board your scheduled flight for onward destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Tour Ends!!!!!!!!!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"896\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"47455\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2305\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"39814\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,