f flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":8}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Delhi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at WelcomHeritage Gurkha Houseboats Nigeen Lake at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Radisson Golf Resort&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel The Khyber Himalayan Resorts and Spa at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Taj Dal View at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>)</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>12 Seater AC Urbania</strong><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"times new roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><i> </i></span></font>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":87269,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":580000,\"transport_cost\":\"56000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Misc Entry & Shikara Ride\",\"amount\":5000}],\"cost_price\":728269,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 145653.8\",\"selling_price\":873922.80000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0660/042025', 872160, 132600, 38280, '2025-04-04 09:37:38', '2025-04-10 13:52:39', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(672, 'Mrs Anita', 'WalkIN', '9905157807', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'LADAKH', '2025-04-12', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"RANCHI - DELHI\",\"date\":\"12-04-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Your journey begins from Ranchi, where you will board your flight\\/train to Delhi. Upon arrival, you will be transferred to your hotel for check-in. Enjoy a comfortable overnight stay in Delhi before continuing on with your travel itinerary.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVE LEH\",\"date\":\"13-04-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival Leh Kushok Bakula Airport (This must be one of the Most Sensational Flights in the World. On a clear Day from one side of the aircraft can be seen in the distance the peaks of K2, Nanga Parbat, Gasherbrum and on the other side of the aircraft, so close that you feel you could reach out and touch it, is the Nun Kun massif.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival you will met by our representative and transfer to Hotel for Check in. Complete Day for rest and leisure to acclimatize followed by Welcome tea or Coffee at the Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LEH EXCURSION TO INDUS & SHAM VALLEY REGION (90 KMS \\/ 05 \\u2013 06 HRS)\",\"date\":\"14-04-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post Breakfast we proceed for Indus Valley Monastery Starting with Thiksey Monastery an impressive complex rising tier upon tier on a hill above the village, Shey Palace, The ancient capital of Ladakh, 3 Idiots Rancho School &nbsp;&amp; Sindhu Ghat<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast you drive downstream along the River Indus on Leh \\u2013 Kargil Highway. And start our sightseeing with Hall Of Fame (Remain Closed on Mondays) Museum Constructed by India Army) near Leh is worth a visit for every Indian, and proceed further to Gurudwara Patthar Sahib at an altitude of 3600 Mtrs about 22 Kms from Leh was constructed in memory of Guru Nanak Dev ji Nestled deep in the Himalayas, A drive of another 4 km took us to Magnetic Hill which defies the law of gravity.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>As you move ahead from Magnetic Hills, just before Nimmu Village, there comes a famous Confluence Of Two Rivers Indus River coming from Tibet (left) and Zanskar River coming from&nbsp;Zanskar Valley&nbsp;(right). Zanskar River is known for its famous Chadar Trek.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later we drive back to Leh. Evening visit to Leh Palace, Shanti Stupa &amp; Leh Market.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight at Hotel.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LEH\\u2013NUBRA VALLEY VIA KHARDUNG LA 18,390 FT. (120 KMS \\/ 4 \\u2013 5 HRS)\",\"date\":\"15-04-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast we drive to Nubra Valley. The road journey from Leh to Nubra Valley passes over Khardung La (The Highest Motorable Road In The World) at 5,602 Mtrs \\/ 18,390 Ft, around 39 km from Leh. From the pass, one can see all the way south over the Indus valley to seemingly endless peaks and ridges of the Zanskar range, and north to the giants of the Saser massif. Nubra Valley is popularly known as Ldumra or the valley of flowers. It is situated in the north of Ladakh between the Karakoram and Ladakh ranges of the Himalayas. The average altitude of the valley is 10,000 Ft. above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival in Nubra we check in at our Camp OR Hotel. Evening we drive to Hunder where you have opportunity to ride on a bacterian camel (double humped) amidst the sand dunes of this high altitude desert with snowcapped mountains on the horizon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Between Hunder and Diskit you come across sand dunes besides the road. Seen in isolation you could well be amongst the sand dunes of the Thar Desert in Rajasthan.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the return stop at Diskit which is the headquarter town of Nubra Valley. Stroll around the bazaar observing the shops and local people going about their daily chores.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Diskit is famous for 515 years old Buddhist Monastery, lying magnificently situated on a hilltop, facing the entire Valley. Later we drive back Camp for Dinner &amp; Overnight<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NUBRA VALLEY TO LEH\",\"date\":\"16-04-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast we drive towards Leh via Changla Pass 5486 Mtrs. After reaching in leh we check in at our pre-arranged hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPART LEH (FLY OUT)\",\"date\":\"17-04-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>It\\u2019s time to say good bye after this wonderful trip of this incredible destination and time to get back to home with lots of good memories of Life time.. Tour Concludes<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1114\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"30871\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6821\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"fare\":\"38200\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Leh (IXL)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2584\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"34961\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DELHI\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pride Plaza Aerocity 5*\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"21880\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Gyalpo Residency 4* Deluxe\",\"room_type\":\"Rabsal Heritage Room with Balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"23000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NUBRA\",\"room_type\":\"Family Cottage\",\"hotel_name\":\"LchangNang Retreat 5* Luxury\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"25000\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"16\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LEH\",\"room_type\":\"Rabsal Heritage Room with Balcony\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Gyalpo Residency 4* Deluxe\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/04\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;Accomodation in Delhi</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights Accomodation in Leh.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;Accomodation in Nubra.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Assistance </strong>upon arrival at Kushok Bakula Rinpoche Airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Traditional welcome</strong> in the Hotel with Welcome Drink (Hot Tea / Coffee / Kahwa) on arrival.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meal Plan –Breakfast &amp; Dinner </strong>(Starting With first Day Dinner &amp; Ending with Last Day Breakfast).</li>\n	<li><strong>Return airport and round trip transfers </strong>along with all sightseeing tours by Non-Ac PVT Vehicle.</li>\n	<li><strong>Permits </strong>for restricted areas in Ladakh | Ladakh Ecological fee | Redcross and wildlife fee.</li>\n	<li><strong>Oxygen Cylinder</strong> during visit to Nubra Valley &amp; Pangong Lake.</li>\n	<li><strong>24X07 </strong>Ground Support from our Local Office stationed in Leh.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"27\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":104032,\"land_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"31100\",\"hotel_cost\":81380},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":216512,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 58458.24\",\"selling_price\":274970.23999999999068677425384521484375}', 'MZQ/0661/042025', 275120, 68780, 0, '2025-04-09 13:48:56', '2025-04-14 05:58:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(673, 'Mr Anup Banka', 'Saket Saraf', '8102191713', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-05-28', 7, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL - HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"28-05-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\'s Noi Bai International Airport you will be welcomed by our guide holding a sign with your name on it. After approximately 50 minutes to 1-hour transfer, you will be at your hotel for check-in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Start your half day city tour with a visit to Temple of Literature, known as the first university of Vietnam built in 1070 by the Ly Dynasty to honor Confucius, sages and outstanding Vietnamese scholars. After that, head to the city center to visit Hoan Kiem Lake and Ngoc Son Temple located on an islet in the lake. Hoan Kiem Lake is the center point of Hanoi and home to a rare endangered giant turtle species. Its name \\u201cReturned Sword\\u201d comes from a legend of a sacred sword being lent to an ancient Vietnamese King by a holy turtle from the lake and later returned to the turtle. Then, enjoy a cup of coffee at a street corner Cafe Shop while watching the daily life moves of the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meal: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY TAM COC - BICH DONG - HOA LU\",\"date\":\"29-05-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning, meet our guide at your hotel and transfer to Ninh Binh Province about 100 km South of Hanoi. Head for Hoa Lu to see the few vestiges of the first capital of Vietnam. Built in the 10th Century by the Dinh Dynasty not only for a capital but also as a stronghold against the Northern invaders, Hoa Lu shortly later it was inherited by the Le Dynasty. Visit the two old temples one dedicated to Dinh Tien Hoang, the only king of the Dinh Dynasty and also Vietnam\\u2019s first emperor and the other to the succeeding kings of the Le Dynasty. Though the temples are no longer intact, some precious antique carvings and sculpture of stone and wood are still preserved. Then continue to visit Bich Dong pagoda, an ancient three tiered cave pagoda only accessible by steep stone steps, but it is really worth climbing up for a charming pagoda and stupendous view from the top.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon, take a sampan cruise along the Hoang Long River through the scenic landscape of Tam Coc, a 350 ha area of karst mountains scattered over the lush wetland with paddy fields. This area is referred to as \\u201can inland Ha Long bay\\u201d for its strikingly similar water-and-rock terrain features. Depending on the time of visit, you may see local farmers harvesting rice or transplanting seedlings for the new crop. Pass through three big caves which feature the area\\u2019s name (Tam Coc means three caves in Vietnamese) and which represent a host of local rocky caves and grottoes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Meal: None<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY HANOI - HA LONG ON LA CASTA DAY CRUISE (TRANSFER BY SHUTTLE BUS)\",\"date\":\"30-05-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>7:30 - 8:00 am Pick up at the hotel in the old quarter for the departure of Ha Long Bay one day trip.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>10:30 am La Casta cruise staff will pick you up at Tuan Chau Port to check in on the cruise. The cruise will leave Tuan Chau Port and take you to explore the beauty of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>On the way, tourists can visit the most beautiful places of Ha Long Bay and admire the majesty of Ha Long Bay with thousands of large and small limestone islands such as: Hon Cho Da, Hon Vit Da and especially Hon Ga Choi - the symbol of Ha Long tourism.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>12:00 Guests enjoy a high-class buffet lunch with famous fresh seafood dishes of Quang Ninh as well as traditional Vietnamese dishes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Afternoon<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>13:00 The cruise will stop at Bo Hon island. Here you will participate in 2 main activities according to the program: The tour guide will take you to visit Sung Sot cave. This is the most beautiful and largest cave in the cave complex of Ha Long. The cave is really beautiful and is a must-see attraction. The road to Sung Sot cave is under the forest canopy, the steep stone steps, visitors can both experience the mountain climbing and explore the majestic beauty of Ha Long Bay from above (Tourists who do not visit Sung Sot cave can sit on the boat and sip drinks while admiring the bay view)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the area of \\u200b\\u200b\\u200b\\u200bthe water cave - Hang Luon, visitors can kayak\\/canoe or stay on the boat (Guests who do not use this service can stay on the boat and use the Jacuzzi on the boat). After 60 minutes of experiencing the cave, kayaking, you will pass the beach of Titop island to swim with beautiful white sand. Titov island is where you can swim or sunbathe on the fine white sand or you can also climb to the top of Titop to see the whole view of Halong Bay with thousands of limestone cliffs rising from the blue water.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>16:30 Guests return to the cruise to participate in two activities: Sunset party; relax in the four-season jaccuzi pool. Guests will enjoy relaxing moments sipping traditional Vietnamese tea or coffee with snacks and fresh fruit on the sundeck and relax in the jaccuzi pool in a wonderful natural space and watch the sunset fall gently and peacefully. On the way back to the port, the cruise will pass through Hoa Cuong area - one of the most beautiful places in Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>17:30 The ship arrives at Tuan Chau wharf, ending the 7-hour tour of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>20h30 \\u2013 21h00: Drop off at the hotel\\u2019s doorstep, tour ends<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Meal: Lunch on cruise<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong><em>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE) - DA NANG ARRIVAL - HALF DAY HOI AN CITY TOUR - RELEASE LANTERN\",\"date\":\"31-05-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>You are free at leisure before being transferred by our driver to Noi Bai International Airport for flight departure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrival Da Nang airport, pick up by our guide &amp; driver then transfer to Hotel for check in<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meet our guide at your hotel and transfer out for a city tour. Once a bustling maritime commercial port of Asia between 15th and 19th centuries, Hoi An, recognized by UNESCO as a World Heritage Site, is now a peaceful town of exceptionally well-preserved architecture, lifestyles and traditions. The town exemplifies a fascinating fusion of cultures between Vietnam and the outside world including China, Japan, Thailand and the Philippines. Your sightseeing will include the iconic 400-year-old Covered Bridge with a small temple attached to one side as a prominent example of Japanese architecture, the Museum of Trade Ceramics which is an elegant Vietnamese style wooden house built in 1858 showcasing antique ceramic artifacts. You will also visit the 200-year-old Tan Ky House typifying an ancient Chinese merchant residence, Ong Temple built in 1653 by Chinese settlers to worship Guan Yu, an ancient Chinese general whose character stands for loyalty, bravery and justice and the local market vibrant with colors and activities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore Hoi An at its most magical during an evening tour that includes a boat ride and release the lantern on Hoai river<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meal: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Da Nang<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY DA NANG - BA NA HILL - GOLDEN BRIDGE\",\"date\":\"01-06-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning, departure for Ba Na Hills, or Chua Mount (Mount of Goddess), by passing the sea-shore on Nguyen Tat Thanh Street, one of the most beautiful roads of Da Nang City and Red Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive at the Cable car station at the foot of Ba Na Mountain. Enjoy the first leg Cable car, which achieves two Guinness World records as the longest non-stop cable car (5,042m) and the highest non-stop cable car (1,292m). The cable cars were built to feed the mountaintop of Ba Na Hills, but they\\u2019re also the perfect way to get spectacular views of Danang and the surrounding forests.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon reaching Ba Na Hills, start the trip with a visit to Golden Bridge which is designed to connect the cable car station with the main gardens of this mountaintop. It is also to provide a scenic overlook and tourist attraction. The gold-colored walkway is lined with purple Lobelia Chrysanthemums and is 150 meters long with two giant hands, constructed of fiberglass and wire mesh. These two hands appear like stone hands that support the structure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After the Golden Bridge, we\\u2019ll continue to visit Le Jardin d\\u2019 Amour, remains of French Villas and Ling Ung Pagoda with 27m high Buddha status. We then leave the Le Jardin for the second cable car station to visit the top of mountain where there are remains of the old French villas found. Start conquering the Peak of Chua Mount at the height of 1,487m, viewing the whole Da Nang city under the cluster of white clouds. After the Peak of Chua Mount, visit the trail of Dreaming Stream, Rainbow Waterfall, Suspension Bridge, Golden Valley, and ruined Opera House. Play with wild monkeys and take photos. Freely until time back to Cable car Station to return to the the foot of the Mountain. Transfer back to Da Nang City.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meal: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Da Nang<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE) - PHU QUOC ARRIVAL - HALF DAY PHU QUOC CITY\",\"date\":\"02-06-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer to Da Nang airport for flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrival Phu Quoc airport, you are welcomed by our guide &amp; driver, then transfer to the hotel for relaxing<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Spend half day to explore Phu Quoc city:<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u00b7 Pearl Farm: Learn about the history of pearl farming on Phu Quoc Island<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u00b7 Sim Wine factory: Local Wine production<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u00b7 Pepper Farm: Local family garden, pepper harvesting<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>\\u00b7 Sao Beach: relax \\u2013 swimming \\u2013 sunbath<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>17:00 Return to your hotel and free time<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meal: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight at hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NORTH OF ISLAND (SAFARI & VIN WONDER)\",\"date\":\"03-06-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning, transfer to the north of island and have full day enjoy Vin-complex.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Explore Vin Wonder - the largest theme park in Vietnam that ranks top in Asia &amp; Experience Vietnam\'s and the world\'s record-winning games<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Then, enjoy the unique experience of being enclosed while the animals roam free!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Take a trip past the Safari Park in a safari truck and experience the feeling of \\u2018being enclosed while the animals roam around you\\u2019 through the giant jungle with its impressive diversity.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Indulge in the amazing show by wild friends. The show brings together many talents from the world of birds, conveying the importance of environmental protection to everyone.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Included: Guide, transfer, entrance fee,<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meal: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight in Phu Quoc<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"04-06-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, free time in the morning. Please note: Normal check out time at hotel is 11:00 \\u2013 12:00; late check-out is not included<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Depending on the flight time, you will be transferred by driver only (NO GUIDE) to Phu Quoc airport for the flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Meals: None<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sunset Beach Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe King Ocean Panorama\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"20000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":3}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong><em>Airfare Ex-Ranchi-Kolkata-Hanoi-Danang-PhuQuoc-Kolkata.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>07&nbsp;Nts Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;in above mentioned Hotels</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;</strong>on Double sharing + 01 Extra Bed.</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Meals</strong>&nbsp;as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers on&nbsp;<strong>PVT basis.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Experienced English-speaking guide&nbsp;</strong>during all tours and transfers (except for arrival day on Day 4, departure day in Ha Noi and Da Nang)</li>\n	<li><strong>Entrance fees&nbsp;</strong>for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li><strong>Vietnam Tourist Visa.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":20000,\"land_cost\":\"180000\",\"visa_cost\":\"10000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":210000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 31500\",\"selling_price\":241500}', 'MZQ/0662/042025', 525812, 149478, 113428, '2025-04-14 11:04:26', '2025-04-19 06:33:05', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
