11:50:21', '2025-04-14 11:50:21', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(675, 'Mrs Jyoti Lal', 'Anjali Mam SBI', '9771457837', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok 2N - Darjeeling 2N', '2025-05-08', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport - Gangtok (128 Kms. \\/ 5 Hrs)\",\"date\":\"08-05-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and greet on arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station or Bagdogra International Airport, followed by a transfer to Gangtok (5,500 ft). Upon arrival, check in to the hotel. The rest of the day is at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Tsomgo Lake and Baba Mandir (53 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs. one-way)\",\"date\":\"09-05-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, head out for a 6-hour city tour of Gangtok. Visit popular attractions including Tashi View Point, Ganesh Tok, Hanuman Tok, Dro-dul Chorten, Gonjang Monastery, and Banjhakri Falls. Also explore the Cottage Industry and Handicraft Centre (<em data-end=\\\"329\\\" data-start=\\\"286\\\">closed on Sundays and 1st &amp; 3rd Saturdays<\\/em>) and the Institute of Tibetology (<em data-end=\\\"383\\\" data-start=\\\"364\\\">closed on Sundays<\\/em>).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Supplement cost<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (If guest want any add on Service must be Informed at the time of Booking)<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Nathula pass (Monday closed): <strong>Rs.6,000.00 + 5% GST <\\/strong>(March to June &amp; October to December) per car It can be done on the same day with Tsomgo Lake - Baba Mandir Excursion..<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok - Darjeeling (100 Kms. \\/ 4 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"10-05-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 ft). Upon arrival, check in to the hotel. The rest of the day is at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"11-05-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning visit to Tiger Hill (subject to permit\\/token availability), followed by breakfast at the hotel. Starting at 8:30 AM, enjoy a day tour covering the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (<em data-end=\\\"273\\\" data-start=\\\"256\\\">Thursday closed<\\/em>), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee Self-Help Centre (<em data-end=\\\"348\\\" data-start=\\\"333\\\">Sunday closed<\\/em>), Tea Garden (outer view), and Japanese Temple. Evening is free for shopping or relaxation.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport (75 Kms. \\/ 3 Hrs.)\",\"date\":\"12-05-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for your transfer to New Jalpaiguri Railway Station or Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Supplement cost<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;(If guest want any add on Service must be Informed at the time of Booking)<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Toy Train Joy Ride (Darjeeling) : Rs.1,714\\/- (Ticket Price + Service charge) excluding GST Per Person on the day of Darjeeling local sightseeing + Rs.1500\\/- per vehicle car halting charges.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/05\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Maple Residency \\/ Kingsway Boutique (Veg) \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Q Saina Hotel Mapham (Veg) \\/ Eeshan Rodhi \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"12\\/05\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Fern Denzong&nbsp;at Gangtok<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;Hotel Orsino Resort&nbsp;at Darjeeling<strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Rooms on Double Sharing basis.</strong></li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfast and Dinner</strong>&nbsp;at the Hotel.</li>\n	<li><strong>Private 01&nbsp;Non AC Scorpio / Xylo / Innova </strong>as per itinerary on point to point-to-point basis only (Ac will not run in the Hill area).&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes (as per itinerary).</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"86400\",\"transport_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":86400,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":86400}', 'MZQ/0664/042025', 86400, 21600, 0, '2025-04-14 12:13:37', '2025-04-15 09:50:26', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(676, 'Mr. Mahesh Sharma', 'DM Ply', '911344474', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 4*', '2025-05-14', 12, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Srinagar Local Sightseeing N\\/S\",\"date\":\"14-05-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at the&nbsp;Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer You To Hotel.After Fresh up&nbsp;Proceed to&nbsp;Srinagar&nbsp;Local Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden,Shalimar Garden,Pari Mahal ,Cheshmashahi,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel In Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar -  Sonmarg - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"15-05-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning, proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 2:00-2:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride to Thajiwas Glacier&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;&amp; Zero Point&nbsp; by Union Vehicle&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"16-05-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 89 kms, and will be covered in about 02:00 - 02:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost).&nbsp;Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Halt - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"17-05-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,You Can&nbsp;Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car (at your own Cost)&nbsp;to see&nbsp; famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel In Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"18-05-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 140 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;03:00 -03:30&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own Cost).Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride&nbsp;(own Cost )&nbsp;which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in&nbsp;Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg - Srinagar - H.B.\",\"date\":\"19-05-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar.Later&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 01 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Houseboat In&nbsp;Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop Katra Hotel\",\"date\":\"20-05-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel\\/\\/Houseboat and drive to Katra to your&nbsp;destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Kashmir Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive in Katra and proceed for check-in at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"142\\\" data-start=\\\"139\\\" \\/>\\nAfter some rest, you can either explore the local market of Katra at your own leisure.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Vaishno Devi Darshan\",\"date\":\"21-05-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"66\\\">Today, after breakfast, you may begin the <strong data-end=\\\"132\\\" data-start=\\\"108\\\">Vaishno Devi Darshan<\\/strong> at your convenience.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"234\\\" data-start=\\\"155\\\">Wishing you a safe and blessed journey.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Katra - Jammu - Delhi\",\"date\":\"22-05-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, after breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"150\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">Jammu Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey to <strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Delhi<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"110\\\" data-start=\\\"93\\\">Delhi Airport<\\/strong>, you will be transferred to your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"150\\\" \\/>\\nSpend the evening at leisure and relax after your journey.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi - Agra\",\"date\":\"23-05-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, head to <strong data-end=\\\"123\\\" data-start=\\\"115\\\">Agra<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"127\\\" data-start=\\\"124\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival, check in to the hotel and take some time to relax.<br data-end=\\\"194\\\" data-start=\\\"191\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"218\\\">Taj Mahal<\\/strong>, one of the Seven Wonders of the World, followed by a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"315\\\" data-start=\\\"299\\\">local market<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Agra - Delhi\",\"date\":\"24-05-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"135\\\" data-start=\\\"126\\\">Delhi<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"136\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, relax or explore the <strong data-end=\\\"193\\\" data-start=\\\"176\\\">local markets<\\/strong> at your own pace.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi Local\",\"date\":\"25-05-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a local tour covering <strong data-end=\\\"143\\\" data-start=\\\"129\\\">India Gate<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">Qutub Minar<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"178\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">Lotus Temple<\\/strong>, and a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"220\\\" data-start=\\\"199\\\">Akshardham Mandir<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"224\\\" data-start=\\\"221\\\" \\/>\\nEvening at leisure or optional visit to local markets.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi - Ranchi\",\"date\":\"26-05-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"245\\\" data-start=\\\"107\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"152\\\" data-start=\\\"149\\\" \\/>\\nSpend some time enjoying <strong data-end=\\\"201\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">last-minute shopping<\\/strong> or exploring nearby areas at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"387\\\" data-start=\\\"247\\\">Later, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"280\\\" data-start=\\\"269\\\">airport<\\/strong> as per your flight schedule for your <strong data-end=\\\"336\\\" data-start=\\\"318\\\">onward journey<\\/strong>, carrying with you wonderful memories of the trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5062\",\"dep_date\":\"14 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":67756},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2248\",\"dep_date\":\"14 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Jammu (IXJ)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5054\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"fare\":27488},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"26 May 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"26 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":20584}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Kaisar \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/05\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Baisaran \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/05\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Park \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/05\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Houseboat Mahjong \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/05\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Katra\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Fortune Park, Katra\",\"rate\":\"20000\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2025\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Delhi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique Hotel\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"8000\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"23\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Agra\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Mercure\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"8000\"},{\"id\":7,\"check_in\":\"24\\/05\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Delhi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Royal Plaza\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/05\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"26000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong> Ex-Ranchi.</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel Grand Kaisar / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Baisaran / Similar&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Royal Park / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Houseboat Mahjong / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel Fortune Park / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Katra</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique Hotel&nbsp;/ Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Delhi</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Grand Mercure / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Agra</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights accommodation</strong> at Hotel The Royal Plaza / Similar at&nbsp;<strong>Delhi</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>02&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>MAP&nbsp;(<strong>Breakfast + Dinner</strong>) in Kashmir Tour.</li>\n	<li>CP (<strong>Breakfast</strong>) in rest Hotels.</li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Innova </strong></em>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":115828,\"land_cost\":\"124000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"62000\",\"transport_cost\":\"25000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":326828,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 58829.04\",\"selling_price\":385657.0399999999790452420711517333984375}', 'MZQ/0665/042025', 387992, 96998, 0, '2025-04-16 10:33:00', '2025-04-19 08:28:02', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(677, 'Mr Shashank', 'BNI Raunak Tekriwal', '9852613443', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 4*', '2025-04-23', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport - Srinagar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"23-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will be met by our representative at Srinagar Airport,He will assist and transfer you to Srinagar.After fresh up&nbsp;Proceed to Srinagar Local&nbsp;&nbsp;Sightseeing of&nbsp;Famous Mughal Gardens Viz Nishat Garden,Shalimar Garden,Cheshmashahi,Pari mahal,ShankarAcharya&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;at Srinagar.Later&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar - Sonmarg  - Srinagar\",\"date\":\"24-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning, proceed to Sonamarg which is one of the most beautiful drives from Srinagar.Sonmarg means&nbsp;meadow of gold is a beautiful spot full of snow clad mountains, fast and flowing water and vast meadows&nbsp;is located at a height of 2692 meters.The distance of&nbsp;&nbsp;85 kms from Srinagar.&nbsp;will be covered in about 2:00-2:30 hours.While driving from Srinagar towards Sonamarg you&nbsp;can also&nbsp;enjoy the sightseeing of Sindh River on the way and also you can do river rafting in&nbsp;SINDH River. You may take a pony ride (at your own cost) to Thajiwas Glacier &amp; Zero Point&nbsp;(at your own cost)&nbsp;where snow remains round the year.Later Back To Srinagar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar  - Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"25-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;in the morning,&nbsp;proceed to Gulmarg,&nbsp;(Meadow of Flowers) 2730 mts. above the sea level.The distance of&nbsp; 51 Kms will be covered in about&nbsp;02:00&nbsp;Hours.Gulmarg has one of the best ski slopes in the world and the highest golf course with 18 holes.(at your own cost).If weather permits one can also have the view of Nanga Parbat, the naked mountain that is over 26,000 feets and dominates the entire region&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;You Can Also Go&nbsp;Drung&nbsp;Waterfall from&nbsp;Tangmarg but you will have to take a&nbsp;Union car&nbsp;(Own cost).Enjoy the Gondola Cable car ride (Own Cost) which is highest in Asia.It has 2 phases,The first stage transfers from the Gulmarg resort at 2,600 m (8,530 ft) to Kongdoori Station in the bowl-shaped Kongdori valley.The second stage of the ropeway, which has 36 cabins and 18 towers, takes skiers to a height of 3,747 m (12,293 ft) on Kongdoori Mountain, a shoulder of nearby Afarwat Peak (4,200 m(13,780 ft.Also&nbsp;visit the Kashmir handicraft emporium factory,&nbsp;where you can do shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel in&nbsp; Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg   - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"26-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast&nbsp;&nbsp;in the morning,Proceed to Pahalgam,&nbsp;(The valley of shepherds).The total distance is about 140 kms, and will be covered in about 03:00 - 03:30 hours.En-route, visit the saffron fields of Pampore, Awantipura Ruins (1100 years old temple of Lord Vishnu built by the King Awantivarman), National Highway Bat Market and enjoy the beautiful countryside&nbsp; with Mattan Temple &amp; you can visit the apple garden\'s&nbsp; &amp; you enjoy a&nbsp;Lidder River&nbsp;You can also&nbsp;enjoy a Rafting (Own Cost).&nbsp;Enjoy A short excursion of&nbsp; pony rides to Kashmir Valley,Baisaran Valley, Dubin Valley are some things to do in Pahalgam.Drive through the pine forests and enjoy the Lidder stream.Later, walk along pony trails with a magnificent view of the mountains at your&nbsp;(Own Cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel In Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Halt - Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"27-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After&nbsp;breakfast ,You Can&nbsp;Enjoy&nbsp;Chandanwadi, Betaab valley &amp; Aru Valley&nbsp;you have to take a Union car&nbsp;(own Cost)&nbsp;to see&nbsp; famous local sightseeing at Pahalgam.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Hotel In Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam - Srinagar  - H.B\",\"date\":\"28-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast,Proceed To Srinagar .Later&nbsp;Enjoy a Shikara Ride over Famous Dal Lake&nbsp;(Which is Included For 1 Hour).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner &amp;&nbsp;Overnight Stay at Houseboat in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop Srinagar Airport\",\"date\":\"29-04-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast&nbsp;Check out From Hotel&nbsp; and drive to Srinagar Airport to your&nbsp;destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Tour Concludes with some wonderful long&nbsp;lasting memories.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6961\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":28032},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2510\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:45 PM\",\"fare\":20592}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Kaisar\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine View Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room With Balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Black Pearl Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/04\\/2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"28\\/04\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"House Boat Crown Of India\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of t