</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room </strong>on Double Sharing.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Krabi 4 Island Tour</strong> by Speed Boat with Lunch.</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island - Pileh Lagoon - Khai Island - Maya Bay</strong> By Speed Boat with Lunch.</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World with Marine Park</strong> with Indian Lunch.</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Princess Cruise</strong> Dinner Indian Buffet.</li>\n	<li><strong>Bangkok City Tour</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Tours on SIC.</strong></li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket HKT Airport To Krabi Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Krabi Hotel To Phuket Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Phuket Hotel To Phuket HKT Airport PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok DMK Airport To Bangkok Hotel PVT</li>\n	<li>Transfer Bangkok Hotel To Bangkok BKK Airport PVT</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Thailand Visa </strong>on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":57082,\"hotel_cost\":43500,\"land_cost\":\"36500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":137082,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21933.12\",\"selling_price\":159015.119999999995343387126922607421875,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"13.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0667/042025', 159720, 79860, 35620, '2025-04-21 11:12:03', '2025-04-21 11:12:03', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(679, 'Mr Varun Dave', 'BNI', '9709100140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Bali 4*', '2025-09-24', 7, 3, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Bali\",\"date\":\"24-09-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"300\\\" data-start=\\\"96\\\">Upon arrival in Bali, you will be greeted by our representative with a <strong data-end=\\\"170\\\" data-start=\\\"144\\\">welcome flower garland<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"192\\\" data-start=\\\"175\\\">mineral water<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"196\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\" \\/>\\nYou will then be transferred to your hotel for check-in (check-in time between <strong data-end=\\\"292\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\">14:30 - 15:00<\\/strong>).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Water Sports & Cultural Tour\",\"date\":\"25-09-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"180\\\" data-start=\\\"86\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, pick-up at <strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\">10:00 AM<\\/strong> for water sport activities, including:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"306\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"204\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\">Glass Bottom Boat<\\/strong> to Turtle Island<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"306\\\" data-start=\\\"224\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"306\\\" data-start=\\\"226\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"257\\\" data-start=\\\"226\\\">1 round of Banana Boat ride<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"260\\\" data-start=\\\"257\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<em data-end=\\\"306\\\" data-start=\\\"260\\\">Note: Other activities are at personal cost.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"323\\\" data-start=\\\"308\\\">Later, visit:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"419\\\" data-start=\\\"324\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"366\\\" data-start=\\\"324\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"366\\\" data-start=\\\"326\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"364\\\" data-start=\\\"326\\\">Garuda Wisnu Kencana Cultural Park<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"419\\\" data-start=\\\"367\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"419\\\" data-start=\\\"369\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"387\\\" data-start=\\\"369\\\">Uluwatu Temple<\\/strong> (without Kecak Dance, optional)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"421\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"421\\\">(B)<\\/strong> \\u2013 Breakfast included<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bedugul & Tanah Lot\",\"date\":\"26-09-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"162\\\" data-start=\\\"77\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, pick-up at <strong data-end=\\\"130\\\" data-start=\\\"118\\\">08:30 AM<\\/strong> for a full-day tour visiting:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"163\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"185\\\" data-start=\\\"163\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"185\\\" data-start=\\\"165\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"183\\\" data-start=\\\"165\\\">Bedugul Market<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"210\\\" data-start=\\\"186\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"210\\\" data-start=\\\"188\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"208\\\" data-start=\\\"188\\\">Ulun Danu Temple<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"211\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"213\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"229\\\" data-start=\\\"213\\\">Handara Gate<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\">Tanah Lot Temple<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"284\\\" data-start=\\\"256\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"263\\\" data-start=\\\"256\\\">(B)<\\/strong> \\u2013 Breakfast included<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bali Safari Park & Tegenungan Waterfall\",\"date\":\"27-09-202