(694, 'Mr Shashi Dhar', 'Manoj Arya Friend', '+151061018', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-11-27', 3, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai \\u2013 Visit Museum of the Future\",\"date\":\"27-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"545\\\" data-start=\\\"368\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Dubai International Airport (DXB \\u2013 Terminal 3)<\\/strong> where our representative will meet you and assist with your transfer to the hotel. After check-in, relax and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"715\\\" data-start=\\\"547\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"547\\\">Evening:<\\/strong> Visit the inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"604\\\" data-start=\\\"580\\\">Museum of the Future<\\/strong>, an architectural masterpiece showcasing futuristic technology, visionary concepts, and immersive experiences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"743\\\" data-start=\\\"717\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\">Slot Details<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"810\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"775\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"775\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"763\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">Pick-up Time:<\\/strong> 18:30 hrs<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"810\\\" data-start=\\\"776\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"810\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\">MoTF Entry Slot:<\\/strong> 19:30 hrs<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"844\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\">\\ud83d\\ude90 <strong data-end=\\\"842\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\">Pickup Instructions<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1040\\\" data-start=\\\"845\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"938\\\" data-start=\\\"845\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"938\\\" data-start=\\\"847\\\">Pick up <strong data-end=\\\"871\\\" data-start=\\\"855\\\">first 02 pax<\\/strong> from <em data-end