strong data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"487\">Sightseeing &amp; Experiences</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"519\">\n	<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"519\">\n	<p data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"521\"><strong data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"521\">Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"554\">\n		<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"554\">\n		<p data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"556\">Photo stops at iconic attractions including:</p>\n\n		<ul data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"607\">\n			<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"607\">\n			<p data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"609\"><strong data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"609\">Burj Al Arab</strong>, <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"627\">Atlantis The Palm</strong>, <strong data-end=\"668\" data-start=\"650\">Jumeirah Beach</strong>, and more</p>\n			</li>\n		</ul>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"681\">\n	<p data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"683\"><strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"683\">Visit to Dubai Mall</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"709\">\n	<p data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"711\"><strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"711\">Entry to Burj Khalifa – Levels 124 &amp; 125</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"760\">\n		<li data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"760\">\n		<p data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"762\">Enjoy breathtaking views from the observation deck</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"815\">\n	<p data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"817\"><strong data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"817\">Visit to Museum of the Future</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"855\">\n		<li data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"855\">\n		<p data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"857\">A journey through futuristic innovation and immersive exhibits</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"922\">\n	<p data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"924\"><strong data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"924\">Visit to Miracle Garden</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"956\">\n		<li data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"956\">\n		<p data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"958\">Explore the world’s largest natural flower garden, home to over 150 million blooms arranged in magical displays</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1115\" data-start=\"1073\">🏜️ <strong data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1077\">Luxury Desert Safari Experience</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1116\">\n	<li data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1116\">\n	<p data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1118\">Thrilling <strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1128\">dune bashing</strong> in the golden sands</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1167\">\n	<p data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1169\"><strong data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1169\">Camel ride</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1185\">henna painting</strong>, and optional <strong data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1218\">sandboarding</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1237\">\n	<p data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1239\">Lavish <strong data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1246\">BBQ dinner</strong> under the stars</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1279\">\n	<p data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1281\">Cultural &amp; live entertainment:</p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1316\">\n		<li data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1316\">\n		<p data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1318\"><strong data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1318\">Belly Dance</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1335\">Tanoura Show</strong>, and a spectacular <strong data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1371\">Fire Performance</strong></p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"49\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"127400\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":127400,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 62426\",\"selling_price\":189826}', 'MZQ/0683/052025', 190080, 47520, 0, '2025-05-21 07:39:52', '2025-11-22 09:42:45', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(695, 'Mr Manoj Arya x 08', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9709400140', 'himanshu@multizonetravels.com', 'TURKEY + EGYPT', '2025-12-21', 13, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"43\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST) or Sabiha G\\u00f6k\\u00e7en Airport (SAW)<\\/strong> and transfer to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After check-in, unwind or take a stroll to explore nearby attractions. If time allows, savor a traditional Turkish meal at a local restaurant. Enjoy the vibrant atmosphere of the city before returning to your hotel for a restful night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"396\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"365\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL CITY TOUR : PVT\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"33\\\">After breakfast, set out on a <strong data-end=\\\"87\\\" data-start=\\\"63\\\">full-day guided tour<\\/strong> exploring Istanbul\\u2019s rich Ottoman and Byzantine heritage. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"174\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Topkapi Palace<\\/strong>, once the grand residence of Ottoman sultans, and the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"257\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">Hagia Sophia<\\/strong>, an architectural masterpiece blending Christian and Islamic influences. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"347\\\">Hippodrome<\\/strong>, the historic center of chariot races and public events, before admiring the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"463\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Blue Mosque<\\/strong>, known for its iconic blue tiles and impressive domes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"804\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\">After a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">lunch at a local restaurant<\\/strong>, immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of the <strong data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\">Grand Bazaar<\\/strong>, one of the world\\u2019s oldest and largest covered markets, offering a wide variety of Turkish crafts, jewelry, and spices. <strong data-end=\\\"802\\\" data-start=\\\"760\\\">All museum entrance fees are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\">Return to the hotel and relax after a day of exploration.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"806\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"895\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DAY ON LEISURE\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"373\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">Start with a <strong data-end=\\\"63\\\" data-start=\\\"42\\\">Turkish breakfast<\\/strong>, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Bosphorus cruise<\\/strong>, explore <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Ortak\\u00f6y<\\/strong>, relax at a <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\">hammam<\\/strong>, sip <strong data-end=\\\"161\\\" data-start=\\\"143\\\">Turkish coffee<\\/strong>, stroll in <strong data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">G\\u00fclhane Park<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"202\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Bebek<\\/strong>, watch the <strong data-end=\\\"236\\\" data-start=\\\"214\\\">sunset from Galata<\\/strong>, have a <strong data-end=\\\"270\\\" data-start=\\\"245\\\">Bosphorus-view dinner<\\/strong>, and end with <strong data-end=\\\"303\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">rooftop drinks<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\">Return to your hotel and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"681\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"650\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LOCAL MARKET EXPLORATION & BOSPHORUS CRUISE : SIC\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\">leisurely morning exploring Istanbul\\u2019s local markets<\\/strong> at your own pace. Discover the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"195\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">Spice Bazaar<\\/strong>, where aromatic spices, teas, and Turkish delights fill the air, or visit hidden gems like the <strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">Arasta Bazaar<\\/strong> for handcrafted souvenirs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">In the <strong data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">evening, embark on a magical Bosphorus Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>, sailing between <strong data-end=\\\"439\\\" data-start=\\\"420\\\">Europe and Asia<\\/strong>. Enjoy a delicious meal while watching a <strong data-end=\\\"511\\\" data-start=\\\"481\\\">traditional folkloric show<\\/strong>, featuring live music, belly dancing, and cultural performances. <strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">Unlimited non-alcoholic local drinks are included.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\">Return to your hotel and relax after a memorable evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Overnight stay in Istanbul.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ISTANBUL - ASWAN\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"145\\\" data-start=\\\"115\\\">Istanbul Airport (IST\\/SAW)<\\/strong> to catch your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"186\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">Aswan, Egypt<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"191\\\">Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"216\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Aswan<\\/strong>, proceed to your hotel for <strong data-end=\\\"271\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">check-in and relaxation<\\/strong> after your journey. Enjoy a leisurely evening, preparing for the adventures ahead.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\">Overnight stay in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ASWAN (Local Sightseeing) - NILE CRUISE\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"157\\\" data-start=\\\"113\\\">private tour of Aswan\\u2019s iconic landmarks<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"176\\\" data-start=\\\"164\\\">High Dam<\\/strong> \\u2013 A modern engineering marvel built in the 1960s, providing irrigation and hydroelectric power.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"299\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Unfinished Obelisk<\\/strong> \\u2013 The largest known ancient obelisk, offering insights into ancient Egyptian stone-cutting techniques.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"424\\\" data-start=\\\"407\\\">Philae Temple<\\/strong> \\u2013 A stunning temple dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"474\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Goddess Isis<\\/strong>, relocated to Agilkia Island to preserve its heritage.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"577\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"574\\\" data-start=\\\"561\\\">3\\u20134 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"754\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">After the tour, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"648\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Nile Cruise for check-in and lunch<\\/strong>. Enjoy the rest of the day relaxing onboard as you prepare for an unforgettable journey along the Nile.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"793\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\">Overnight on the cruise in Aswan.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Abu Simbel & Kom Ombo Temple Visits)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"48\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"79\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\">Early Morning (04:30 AM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"82\\\" data-start=\\\"79\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"144\\\" data-start=\\\"114\\\">private tour to Abu Simbel<\\/strong>. Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"190\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"169\\\">Abu Simbel Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most iconic monuments, built by Ramses II. The temples are carved into the mountainside and are famous for their grand statues and remarkable preservation.<br data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"412\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"428\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Afternoon:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"431\\\" data-start=\\\"428\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to the cruise by early afternoon and have lunch onboard as the cruise begins to sail from Aswan around <strong data-end=\\\"555\\\" data-start=\\\"544\\\">2:00 PM<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"558\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"560\\\">Evening (05:00 PM):<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"586\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPickup from the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"646\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">visit to Kom Ombo Temple<\\/strong>. Explore the unique <strong data-end=\\\"689\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"667\\\">Greco-Roman temple<\\/strong> dedicated to two gods: <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">Sobek, the crocodile god<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\">Haroeris, the sun god<\\/strong>. The temple\\u2019s location along the Nile offers stunning views and fascinating historical significance.<br data-end=\\\"876\\\" data-start=\\\"873\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Approximate tour duration: <strong data-end=\\\"920\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"965\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\">Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISING (Edfu Temple)\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>At 05:30 AM, you\\u2019ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">private tour to Edfu Temple<\\/strong>, one of Egypt\\u2019s most remarkable and well-preserved temples. Dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Horus<\\/strong>, the falcon god, this temple is known for its large scale and intricate carvings that tell the story of Horus\\u2019s battle with his enemy Set. It offers fascinating insights into ancient Egyptian religion and mythology. The tour lasts about <strong data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"425\\\">1\\u20132 hours<\\/strong>, giving you ample time to explore the temple\\u2019s impressive structure, including its towering pylons, courtyards, and the sanctuary.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to the cruise after your visit.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"995\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"967\\\">Overnight on the cruise.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CRUISE - LUXUR\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\">After breakfast, check out from the cruise at <strong data-end=\\\"116\\\" data-start=\\\"104\\\">09:00 AM<\\/strong> and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"133\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore <strong data-end=\\\"170\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Luxor<\\/strong>. First, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"205\\\" data-start=\\\"189\\\">Luxor Temple<\\/strong>, dedicated to the Theban Triad, followed by a visit to the grand <strong data-end=\\\"288\\\" data-start=\\\"271\\\">Karnak Temple<\\/strong>, one of the largest temple complexes in Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"654\\\" data-start=\\\"339\\\">Next, continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">Valley of the Kings<\\/strong>, where you can explore the tombs of pharaohs, including that of <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"449\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>, and visit the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">Temple of Hatshepsut<\\/strong>, dedicated to the female pharaoh.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"760\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\">The entire tour will take around <strong data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">5\\u20136 hours<\\/strong>. Afterward, check in to your hotel in Luxor and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\">Overnight stay at a Luxor hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"LUXUR - CAIRO\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"149\\\" data-start=\\\"32\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel in Luxor and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"117\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Luxor Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"146\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">Cairo<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"412\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"184\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met and assisted with your transfer to your hotel. Once checked in, enjoy the rest of the evening at leisure. You can either explore <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\">Cairo at your own pace<\\/strong> or relax at your hotel to unwind after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"442\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Day Trip to Alexandria)\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"468\\\" data-start=\\\"36\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"51\\\" data-start=\\\"39\\\">07:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\\u2019ll be picked up from your hotel for an <strong data-end=\\\"126\\\" data-start=\\\"96\\\">overday trip to Alexandria<\\/strong>, a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"153\\\" data-start=\\\"137\\\">3-hour drive<\\/strong> from Cairo. Once in Alexandria, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">Citadel of Qaitbay<\\/strong> from the outside, an impressive fortress located on the Mediterranean coast. Then, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"331\\\" data-start=\\\"314\\\">Pompey Pillar<\\/strong>, the largest ancient column in Egypt, and the <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Roman Theatre<\\/strong>, where you can explore the ruins of this historical performance space.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"597\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\">Finally, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">Catacombs of Kom El-Shoqafa<\\/strong>, an ancient burial site that blends Egyptian, Greek, and Roman influences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"723\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">The trip offers a fascinating mix of ancient history, architecture, and culture, before returning to Cairo in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"725\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (Pyramids of Giza, Egyptian Museum & More)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"54\\\">At <strong data-end=\\\"69\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">08:00 AM<\\/strong>, you\'ll be picked up for a <strong data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">private tour<\\/strong> to explore some of Cairo\\u2019s most iconic landmarks. Start with the awe-inspiring <strong data-end=\\\"213\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Pyramids of Giza<\\/strong> and the <strong data-end=\\\"232\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Sphinx<\\/strong>, marveling at the ancient wonders and learning about their fascinating history.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"554\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Next, visit a <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">papyrus fair<\\/strong>, where you can see how the ancient Egyptians made papyrus, followed by a stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">perfume factory<\\/strong> to experience traditional Egyptian scents, and a <strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"499\\\">cotton shop<\\/strong> to discover the fine Egyptian cotton.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\">Afterward, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"598\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">Egyptian Museum<\\/strong>, home to a vast collection of ancient Egyptian antiquities, including the famous treasures of <strong data-end=\\\"708\\\" data-start=\\\"693\\\">Tutankhamun<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"713\\\">The tour will last approximately <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">7\\u20138 hours<\\/strong>, providing a deep dive into Egypt\\u2019s rich history and culture.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"825\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAIRO (SELF EXPLORATION)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\">Today, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"100\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\">self-exploration day<\\/strong> in Cairo, immersing yourself in the city\'s vibrant local markets and food scene. Start your day by visiting the famous <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\">Khan El Khalili Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you can wander through narrow alleys lined with shops selling everything from spices and perfumes to jewelry and handcrafted goods. It\\u2019s the perfect spot to experience the bustling atmosphere of Cairo.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"773\\\" data-start=\\\"457\\\">Next, dive into the local food scene. Try some of Cairo\\u2019s most famous dishes, like <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">koshari<\\/strong> (a mix of lentils, rice, pasta, and fried onions), <strong data-end=\\\"614\\\" data-start=\\\"603\\\">falafel<\\/strong> (crispy chickpea fritters), and <strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"647\\\">shawarma<\\/strong> (seasoned meat wraps). For dessert, don\'t miss out on <strong data-end=\\\"725\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\">baklava<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"739\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\">kunafa<\\/strong> (a sweet pastry soaked in syrup).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"973\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Explore at your own pace, tasting street food, visiting cafes, and chatting with the friendly locals. It\\u2019s a great opportunity to connect with the culture and enjoy Cairo\\u2019s rich culinary traditions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"975\\\">Spend the day as you wish, and return to your hotel in the evening for some rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\">Overnight stay in Cairo.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":14,\"index\":13,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DEPARTURE CAIRO\",\"date\":\"03-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"372\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">After a memorable journey, it\\u2019s time to check out from your hotel and head to <strong data-end=\\\"129\\\" data-start=\\\"112\\\">Cairo Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. As you leave, take with you the sweet memories of the <strong data-end=\\\"276\\\" data-start=\\\"208\\\">Pyramids, ancient temples, vibrant markets, and the rich culture<\\/strong> you experienced throughout your tour. Safe travels and hope to welcome you again in the future!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\">End of your tour.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Istanbul (IST)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"738\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"288088\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"to\":\"Aswan (ASW)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"84\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:20 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Luxor (LXR)\",\"to\":\"Cairo (CAI)\",\"name\":\"Egypt Air\",\"fno\":\"75\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ISTANBUL\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room - Sea View\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"200000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ASWAN\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Basma\",\"room_type\":\"Garden View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NILE CRUISE\",\"hotel_name\":\"M\\/S Esmeralda 5\\u2605 Nile Cruise\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"Cabins with Nile view window\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"LUXUR\",\"room_type\":\"Standard City View Room\",\"rate\":null,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":4,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sonesta St. George\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"30\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"CAIRO\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramses Hilton\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Nile View Room\",\"rooms\":4,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"03\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare <strong>Istanbul-Aswan &amp; Luxor-Cairo.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Radisson Sultanahmet</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Basma&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Aswan</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>M/S Esmeralda 5★ Nile Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Sonesta St. George Luxor&nbsp;</strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Luxor.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>accommodation at <strong>Hotel Ramses Hilton</strong>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Cairo</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Local Lunch + 01 Local Dinner</strong> in&nbsp;<strong>Istanbul.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All entrance fees.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All meals</strong>&nbsp;at <strong>M/S Esmeralda 5★ Nile Cruise.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers </strong>mentioned in the Itinerary&nbsp;(PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>Tours Mentioned</strong> in the Itinerary&nbsp;(SIC/PVT Basis).</li>\n	<li><strong>English Speaking</strong> Tour Guide During Tours.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Entrance Fees</strong> Mentioned in the Itinerary.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Entry Visa Charges</li>\n	<li>Tips / Portage /&nbsp;<b>($7 P.P. Per day Compulsory)</b></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":288088,\"hotel_cost\":\"200000\",\"land_cost\":\"1137000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"ISTANBUL  Land\",\"amount\":\"125136\"}],\"cost_price\":1750224,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":2072000,\"profit_figure\":\"321776\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"18.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0684/052025', 2072000, 259000, 0, '2025-05-23 06:46:53', '2025-05-23 06:46:53', 0, 1, '\"<p>PLEASE NOTE:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Hagia Sophia\\/St. Sophia: Closed on&nbsp;Monday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Topkap\\u0131 Palace: Closed on Tuesday, Replaced with Basilica Cistern.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Grand Bazaar: Closed on&nbsp;Sunday, Replaced with Arasta Bazaar.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Bosphorus Cruise &amp; Two Continents Tour: Not Operated on&nbsp;Mondays.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>IMPORTANT NOTES:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>The rates are dynamic &amp; will keep on changing until we hold it as per the final confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Nothing is on hold until &amp; unless we provide it in the written confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All internal flights tickets are non refundable &amp; non exchangeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All services &amp; rates are remain subject to availability at the time of confirmation.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Pick up &amp; drop for all tours &amp; transfers will be done from city center hotels only.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Above quote is based on all paying pax travelling together. Any revision in number of pax will affect the given cost.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Company does not have any liability if the tour is cancelled or itinerary changed during the tour due to any unpredictable event like any political disturbance or weather condition or natural&nbsp;disaster&nbsp;etc.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>All ferries, boats, cruises &amp; cable cars ride will be done on SIC basis.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p><em>We have requested the room configuration at all hotels as follows:<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><b>02 King-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b>02 Twin-Bedded Rooms<\\/b>.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>We thank you for confirming your forthcoming holiday to TURKEY &amp; EGYPT. As you know Egypt as a destination has lot to offer because of its beauty &amp; history, We also understand guest need relaxed itinerary but few place will need early departure might be 4:30 am&nbsp; as&nbsp; we need to reach on time to avoid any kind of disappointment .We will make sure were ever it\'s possible we will start by 10:00 but usually all the tour pick up time is between 7 am -8 am , But as said we will try our best whenever it possible we will start late.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n<b>Sightseeing:&nbsp;<\\/b>We have included general entry of Pyramid \\u2013 However if you wish to visit inside the pyramid then guest has to pay&nbsp; USD 35 to USD 45 apx per person<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Notification from the Immigration Department of Egypt<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;All arriving passengers to Egypt who wish to stay for more than 7 days inside Egypt would have to go to the Immigration department (within 7 days of their entry into Egypt) and follow the below steps :<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Register for their arrival in Egypt<br \\/>\\n900 EGP ( approximately 18 USD ) at the airport<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Get their passport stamped with an additional Immigration stamp<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Failure to adhere to these new regulations would result in the passenger paying penalties during his exit from Egypt.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>We look forward to welcoming you and remain at your service for any further assistance.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(696, 'Mr Rajiv Kr Gaurav', 'Walk IN', '9934635403', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2025-06-03', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh \\u2013 Shimla (Approx. 120 km \\/ 4 hrs)\",\"date\":\"03-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"207\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">Chandigarh Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met by our representative\\/driver. From there, begin your scenic drive to <strong data-end=\\\"304\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Shimla<\\/strong>, the former summer capital of British India, nestled in the Shivalik ranges of the Himalayas. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax. The rest of the day is at your leisure to explore the surroundings or unwind at the property.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"584\\\" data-start=\\\"542\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"584\\\" data-start=\\\"542\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Shimla.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Kufri Excursion & Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"04-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"465\\\" data-start=\\\"66\\\">After breakfast, head to <strong data-end=\\\"151\\\" data-start=\\\"142\\\">Kufri<\\/strong>, known for its <strong data-end=\\\"194\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Himalayan National Park<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"214\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">pony\\/yak rides<\\/strong>, and stunning views of the Himalayas. Post-lunch, explore Shimla\'s key colonial-era landmarks: <strong data-end=\\\"327\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"310\\\">Shimla Mosque<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"349\\\" data-start=\\\"329\\\">Vice Regal Lodge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"368\\\" data-start=\\\"351\\\">Christ Church<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"388\\\" data-start=\\\"370\\\">Gaiety Theatre<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"408\\\" data-start=\\\"390\\\">Grindlays Bank<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"410\\\">Scandal Point<\\/strong>, and enjoy shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"451\\\">Mall Road<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Manali via Kullu Valley (Approx. 265 km \\/ 8 hrs)\",\"date\":\"05-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"527\\\" data-start=\\\"94\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for a beautiful drive to <strong data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">Manali<\\/strong>. En route, enjoy the breathtaking views of the <strong data-end=\\\"318\\\" data-start=\\\"302\\\">Kullu Valley<\\/strong>, known for its lush greenery, river views, and traditional Himachali culture. You may choose to stop for local sightseeing, shopping for woolens or try out river rafting in Kullu (optional, at your own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"661\\\" data-start=\\\"529\\\">Arrive in <strong data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"539\\\">Manali<\\/strong> by evening and check in to your hotel. Spend the evening at leisure or take a stroll through the local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"705\\\" data-start=\\\"663\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"705\\\" data-start=\\\"663\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"06-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"420\\\" data-start=\\\"64\\\">After breakfast, explore popular attractions in and around Manali including the ancient <strong data-end=\\\"203\\\" data-start=\\\"185\\\">Hadimba Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"220\\\" data-start=\\\"205\\\">Manu Temple<\\/strong> (accessible by walk), and the natural hot springs at <strong data-end=\\\"291\\\" data-start=\\\"274\\\">Vashisht Bath<\\/strong>. Stroll through the serene <strong data-end=\\\"332\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"319\\\">Van Vihar<\\/strong> park. In the evening, enjoy shopping and local cuisine at <strong data-end=\\\"419\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\">Manali\\u2019s bustling market<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"451\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"451\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Excursion to Solang Valley\",\"date\":\"07-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"65\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an exciting excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"178\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Solang Valley<\\/strong>, famous for its breathtaking views and adventure activities like paragliding, zorbing, and ropeway rides (activities optional &amp; at own cost). Spend time amidst snow-capped peaks and scenic landscapes before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"411\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"411\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Chandigarh (Approx. 320 km \\/ 8\\u20139 hrs)\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"446\\\" data-start=\\\"117\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">Chandigarh<\\/strong>, India\\u2019s first planned modern city, designed by French architect <strong data-end=\\\"328\\\" data-start=\\\"312\\\">Le Corbusier<\\/strong>. The city derives its name from the goddess <strong data-end=\\\"383\\\" data-start=\\\"373\\\">Chandi<\\/strong>, with the <strong data-end=\\\"416\\\" data-start=\\\"394\\\">Chandimandu Temple<\\/strong> being a significant landmark.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Subject to time availability upon arrival, visit popular attractions such as the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"536\\\">Rock Garden<\\/strong> and the serene <strong data-end=\\\"582\\\" data-start=\\\"567\\\">Sukhna Lake<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Chandigarh.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh \\u2013 Departure\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for your <strong data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">transfer to Chandigarh Railway Station or Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey, carrying fond memories of your trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6485\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"fare\":12902},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6394\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"fare\":12418}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Valley Resorts\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/06\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"13500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Holiday Villa Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Jarden Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"30200\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"check_out\":\"09\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Country Inn & Suites by Radisson\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"4200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Patna.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation Hotel Snow Valley Resorts at&nbsp;<strong>Shimla.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation Hotel The Holiday Villa Resorts &amp; Spa&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Manali.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nts</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation Hotel Country Inn &amp; Suites by Radisson at&nbsp;<strong>Chandigarh.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Double Room</strong>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner <em>(Except Chandigarh).</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Sedan Car</strong>&nbsp;for all transfers &amp; tours on disposal basis.</li>\n	<li>Toll, Parking, driver’s Bata, road tax &amp; fuel charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>All taxes.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":25320,\"hotel_cost\":47900,\"transport_cost\":\"26000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":99220,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15875.2\",\"selling_price\":115095.199999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0685/052025', 115000, 57500, 0, '2025-05-25 13:03:53', '2025-05-25 13:03:53', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(697, 'MR SIMERJEET SINGH', 'BNI', '9431163323', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-06-07', 4, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC ARRIVAL\",\"date\":\"07-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"298\\\" data-start=\\\"131\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f Upon arrival at Phu Quoc Airport, you will be warmly welcomed by our guide and driver.<br data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"220\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude97 Transfer to your hotel for check-in and relaxation after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"363\\\" data-start=\\\"300\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"321\\\" data-start=\\\"304\\\">Meals Included:<\\/em> None<br data-end=\\\"329\\\" data-start=\\\"326\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"345\\\" data-start=\\\"333\\\">Overnight:<\\/em> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NORTH OF ISLAND (SAFARI & VIN WONDER)\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"275\\\" data-start=\\\"172\\\">\\ud83c\\udf05 After breakfast, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"235\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">north of Phu Quoc Island<\\/strong> for an exciting day at <strong data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"259\\\">Vin-complex<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">\\ud83c\\udfa1 <strong data-end=\\\"302\\\" data-start=\\\"280\\\">Explore VinWonders<\\/strong> \\u2013 Vietnam\\u2019s largest theme park and one of the top amusement destinations in Asia. Enjoy world-class rides, thrilling attractions, and unforgettable adventures.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"464\\\">\\ud83e\\udd93 <strong data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\">Visit Vinpearl Safari<\\/strong> \\u2013 Asia\\u2019s first open zoo. Experience the rare thrill of being in a caged vehicle while the animals roam freely around you in their natural habitat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"807\\\" data-start=\\\"641\\\">\\ud83e\\udd9c Don\\u2019t miss the <strong data-end=\\\"676\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\">Wildlife Show<\\/strong>, a spectacular performance by talented feathered and furry friends that delivers a meaningful message about protecting our planet.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"918\\\" data-start=\\\"809\\\">\\u2705 <em data-end=\\\"824\\\" data-start=\\\"811\\\">Inclusions:<\\/em> Guide, transfers, entrance fees<br data-end=\\\"859\\\" data-start=\\\"856\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"871\\\" data-start=\\\"863\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"884\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"900\\\" data-start=\\\"888\\\">Overnight:<\\/em> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"4 ISLAND \\u2013 1 WAY CABLE CAR \\u2013 SNORKELING\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"776\\\" data-start=\\\"211\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"228\\\" data-start=\\\"211\\\">08:00 \\u2013 08:30<\\/strong> | Pickup from your hotel by car and English-speaking guide.<br data-end=\\\"291\\\" data-start=\\\"288\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"291\\\">08:30 \\u2013 09:00<\\/strong> | Transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"339\\\" data-start=\\\"323\\\">An Thoi Port<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"343\\\" data-start=\\\"340\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"360\\\" data-start=\\\"343\\\">09:00 \\u2013 09:20<\\/strong> | Canoe ride to <strong data-end=\\\"401\\\" data-start=\\\"377\\\">May Rut Trong Island<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"405\\\" data-start=\\\"402\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"422\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\">09:20 \\u2013 10:30<\\/strong> | Enjoy swimming and relaxing on May Rut Trong.<br data-end=\\\"473\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"490\\\" data-start=\\\"473\\\">10:30 \\u2013 10:45<\\/strong> | Transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"523\\\" data-start=\\\"505\\\">Gam Ghi Island<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"527\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"524\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"544\\\" data-start=\\\"527\\\">10:45 \\u2013 13:00<\\/strong> | Snorkeling and underwater exploration at Gam Ghi.<br data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"596\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"616\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">13:00 \\u2013 13:15<\\/strong> | Canoe ride to <strong data-end=\\\"657\\\" data-start=\\\"633\\\">May Rut Ngoai Island<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"661\\\" data-start=\\\"658\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"678\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\">13:15 \\u2013 14:00<\\/strong> | Swimming and relaxing at May Rut Ngoai.<br data-end=\\\"723\\\" data-start=\\\"720\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"740\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\">14:00 \\u2013 16:30<\\/strong> | Transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"773\\\" data-start=\\\"755\\\">Hon Thom Islet<\\/strong>:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"777\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"848\\\" data-start=\\\"777\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"848\\\" data-start=\\\"779\\\">Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"803\\\" data-start=\\\"787\\\">buffet lunch<\\/strong> (50\\u201360 Vietnamese &amp; international dishes).<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"849\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"851\\\">Dive into fun at <strong data-end=\\\"892\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\">Aquatopia Water Park<\\/strong>, featuring numerous slides and themed zones.<br data-end=\\\"940\\\" data-start=\\\"937\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"957\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\">16:30 \\u2013 17:15<\\/strong> | Take the <strong data-end=\\\"991\\\" data-start=\\\"969\\\">Hon Thom cable car<\\/strong>, the world\\u2019s longest sea-crossing cable car (7,899.9 meters), back to the mainland.<br data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1075\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"1095\\\" data-start=\\\"1078\\\">17:15 \\u2013 18:00<\\/strong> | Return transfer to your hotel. <strong data-end=\\\"1143\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\">Tour ends.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<hr data-end=\\\"1148\\\" data-start=\\\"1145\\\" \\/>\\n<p data-end=\\\"1169\\\" data-start=\\\"1150\\\">\\u2705 <strong data-end=\\\"1167\\\" data-start=\\\"1152\\\">Inclusions:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1440\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1213\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1213\\\" data-start=\\\"1172\\\">Hotel transfers, English-speaking guide<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1259\\\" data-start=\\\"1214\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1259\\\" data-start=\\\"1216\\\">Canoe with snorkeling gear &amp; life jackets<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1320\\\" data-start=\\\"1260\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1320\\\" data-start=\\\"1262\\\">Refreshments: cold beer (at extra charge), mineral water<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1321\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1323\\\">Buffet lunch at Hon Thom<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1379\\\" data-start=\\\"1350\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1379\\\" data-start=\\\"1352\\\">Free drone photos &amp; video<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1408\\\" data-start=\\\"1380\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1408\\\" data-start=\\\"1382\\\">One-way cable car ticket<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1440\\\" data-start=\\\"1409\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1440\\\" data-start=\\\"1411\\\">Entry to Aquatopia Water Park<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1465\\\" data-start=\\\"1442\\\">\\ud83c\\udf92 <strong data-end=\\\"1463\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\">What to Bring:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1565\\\" data-start=\\\"1466\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1466\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1468\\\">Comfortable clothing &amp; swimwear<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1539\\\" data-start=\\\"1502\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1539\\\" data-start=\\\"1504\\\">Towel, hat, sunglasses, sunscreen<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1565\\\" data-start=\\\"1540\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1565\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\">Spare change of clothes<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1640\\\" data-start=\\\"1567\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1571\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast, Buffet Lunch<br data-end=\\\"1606\\\" data-start=\\\"1603\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1622\\\" data-start=\\\"1610\\\">Overnight:<\\/em> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FREE DAY TO EXPLORE PHU QUOC BEACHES\",\"date\":\"10-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"397\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">Enjoy a relaxing day at your own pace to explore the stunning beaches of Phu Quoc. Spend your time sunbathing, swimming, or trying out local cafes and beachside eateries. Optional activities such as snorkeling, island hopping, or a visit to the night market can also be arranged on request.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"399\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"413\\\" data-start=\\\"403\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"426\\\" data-start=\\\"423\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"444\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"11-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"209\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\">Morning: Have breakfast and check out. Free at leisure until transfer to Phu Quoc Airport for your flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"234\\\" data-start=\\\"211\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"224\\\" data-start=\\\"215\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-64\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"07 May 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"147788\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-543\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-546\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-65\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 PM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\",\"check_out\":\"11\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Novotel Phu Quoc Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Ocean View Room with Balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"28900\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Roundtrip Airfare <em>Ex-Kolkata.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong><em>03 Pcs | 20 Kgs Checkin Baggage included for 03 Pax.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation&nbsp;in double/ twin room with daily breakfast</li>\n	<li>Services of a <strong>driver and private air-conditioned vehicle</strong> during all tours and transfers</li>\n	<li><strong>Meals </strong>as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li><strong>Experienced English-speaking guide</strong> during all tours and transfers (except departure from Phu Quoc and HahhhksnfHa Noi)</li>\n	<li><strong>Entrance fees</strong> for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li><em><strong>All Taxes</strong></em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Tipping policy: 05 USD per person per day</span></span></b></span></span></span></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":147788,\"hotel_cost\":28900,\"land_cost\":\"120000\",\"visa_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":296688,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 44503.2\",\"selling_price\":341191.2000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0686/052025', 341220, 101990, 68620, '2025-05-28 06:30:48', '2025-05-29 13:50:42', 0, 1, '\"<p data-end=\\\"179\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"127\\\" data-start=\\\"83\\\">\\ud83d\\udd39 OPTIONAL TOUR: HALF-DAY PHU QUOC CITY TOUR<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"130\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"139\\\" data-start=\\\"130\\\">Cost:<\\/strong>&nbsp;<strong><em>Rs 4900&nbsp;per adult \\u00d7 2 | 3800 per child \\u00d7 2<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"259\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"195\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">Itinerary:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"198\\\" data-start=\\\"195\\\" \\/>\\nSpend a half day exploring the highlights of Phu Quoc Island:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"636\\\" data-start=\\\"261\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"261\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"263\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"277\\\" data-start=\\\"263\\\">Pearl Farm<\\/strong> \\u2013 Discover the history and techniques of pearl farming unique to the island.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"357\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"438\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"379\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\">Sim Wine Factory<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visit a local facility producing traditional Sim wine.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"439\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"441\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"456\\\" data-start=\\\"441\\\">Pepper Farm<\\/strong> \\u2013 Explore a family-run pepper garden and learn about pepper cultivation.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"636\\\" data-start=\\\"532\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"636\\\" data-start=\\\"534\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"547\\\" data-start=\\\"534\\\">Sao Beach<\\/strong> \\u2013 Enjoy time to relax, swim, and sunbathe on one of the island\\u2019s most beautiful beaches.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"705\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\">\\ud83d\\udd54 <strong data-end=\\\"650\\\" data-start=\\\"641\\\">17:00<\\/strong> \\u2013 Return to your hotel and enjoy free time at leisure.<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(698, 'Mr Kunal Dubey', 'Nikhil YI', '9334544493', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KARNATAKA', '2025-06-05', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Bangalore \\u2013 Drive to Coorg\",\"date\":\"05-06-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Bangalore Airport by 2:15 PM. After a warm welcome, begin your scenic drive to <strong data-end=\\\"622\\\" data-start=\\\"613\\\">Coorg<\\/strong>, famously known as the \\u201cScotland of India.\\u201d Surrounded by misty hills and lush coffee estates, this tranquil destination is perfect for a peaceful retreat.<br data-end=\\\"781\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\" \\/>\\n\\u27a1\\ufe0f Check-in to <strong data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"796\\\">Hotel Woodstock Resorts<\\/strong> and spend the evening at leisure, soaking in the serenity of the Western Ghats.<br data-end=\\\"906\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"919\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\">Stay:<\\/strong> Coorg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"06-06-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the natural and cultural gems of Coorg. Begin with a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-start=\\\"1076\\\">Abbey Falls<\\/strong>, followed by a panoramic stop at <strong data-end=\\\"1140\\\" data-start=\\\"1125\\\">Raja\\u2019s Seat<\\/strong>, a scenic viewpoint. Discover the region\\u2019s heritage at <strong data-end=\\\"1213\\\" data-start=\\\"1196\\\">Madikeri Fort<\\/strong>, and visit the spiritual <strong data-end=\\\"1262\\\" data-start=\\\"1239\\\">Omkareshwara Temple<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1266\\\" data-start=\\\"1263\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy a coffee plantation tour where you\\u2019ll witness the essence of Coorg\\u2019s aromatic legacy.<br data-end=\\\"1360\\\" data-start=\\\"1357\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1373\\\" data-start=\\\"1364\\\">Stay:<\\/strong> Coorg<br data-end=\\\"1382\\\" data-start=\\\"1379\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1386\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg to Ooty\",\"date\":\"07-06-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, depart Coorg after breakfast and drive through picturesque hills to <strong data-end=\\\"1543\\\" data-start=\\\"1535\\\">Ooty<\\/strong>, also known as the \\u201cQueen of the Nilgiris.\\u201d The journey offers spectacular landscapes, tea gardens, and mountain views.<br data-end=\\\"1666\\\" data-start=\\\"1663\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, check into the charming <strong data-end=\\\"1728\\\" data-start=\\\"1702\\\">Sterling Ooty Elk Hill<\\/strong> and relax. The evening is free to explore the local market or enjoy the cool mountain breeze.<br data-end=\\\"1825\\\" data-start=\\\"1822\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1838\\\" data-start=\\\"1829\\\">Stay:<\\/strong> Ooty<br data-end=\\\"1846\\\" data-start=\\\"1843\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1860\\\" data-start=\\\"1850\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ooty Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, set out to explore the best of Ooty. Stroll through the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"2028\\\" data-start=\\\"2007\\\">Botanical Gardens<\\/strong>, visit the scenic <strong data-end=\\\"2062\\\" data-start=\\\"2047\\\">Rose Garden<\\/strong>, and take in the views from <strong data-end=\\\"2110\\\" data-start=\\\"2091\\\">Doddabetta Peak<\\/strong> \\u2014 the highest point in the Nilgiris.<br data-end=\\\"2150\\\" data-start=\\\"2147\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy a tranquil boat ride on <strong data-end=\\\"2193\\\" data-start=\\\"2180\\\">Ooty Lake<\\/strong> and learn about tea production at the <strong data-end=\\\"2256\\\" data-start=\\\"2232\\\">Tea Factory &amp; Museum<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2260\\\" data-start=\\\"2257\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2273\\\" data-start=\\\"2264\\\">Stay:<\\/strong> Ooty<br data-end=\\\"2281\\\" data-start=\\\"2278\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2295\\\" data-start=\\\"2285\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ooty to Mysore\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive toward the royal city of <strong data-end=\\\"2432\\\" data-start=\\\"2422\\\">Mysore<\\/strong>. If time permits, enjoy an optional detour via <strong data-end=\\\"2506\\\" data-start=\\\"2480\\\">Bandipur National Park<\\/strong> for a quick wildlife experience.<br data-end=\\\"2542\\\" data-start=\\\"2539\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival in Mysore, explore the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"2600\\\" data-start=\\\"2583\\\">Mysore Palace<\\/strong>, a stunning symbol of Indo-Saracenic architecture. In the evening, visit the illuminated <strong data-end=\\\"2711\\\" data-start=\\\"2690\\\">Brindavan Gardens<\\/strong> for a relaxing walk by the fountains.<br data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2749\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-in at <strong data-end=\\\"2790\\\" data-start=\\\"2764\\\">Regenta Central Herald<\\/strong> and unwind.<br data-end=\\\"2805\\\" data-start=\\\"2802\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2818\\\" data-start=\\\"2809\\\">Stay:<\\/strong> Mysore<br data-end=\\\"2828\\\" data-start=\\\"2825\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2842\\\" data-start=\\\"2832\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bangalore\",\"date\":\"10-06-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and head to <strong data-end=\\\"2977\\\" data-start=\\\"2956\\\">Bangalore Airport<\\/strong> to catch your return flight to Ranchi (IndiGo 221 at 5:35 PM). Arrive in Ranchi by 7:55 PM, bringing your memorable South India journey to a close.<br data-end=\\\"3128\\\" data-start=\\\"3125\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3142\\\" data-start=\\\"3132\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2723\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:15 PM\",\"fare\":23502},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"221\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\",\"fare\":20769}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"COORG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Woodstock Resorts\",\"rate\":\"18000\",\"room_type\":\"Attic Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/06\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"OOTY\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sterling Ooty Elk Hill\",\"rate\":\"24800\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/06\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"MYSORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regenta Central Herald\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/06\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"5200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>RoundTrip Airfare&nbsp;<strong><em>Ex-Ranchi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Woodstock Resorts&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Coorg</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Sterling Ooty Elk Hill&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Ooty</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong><em>Hotel Regenta Central Herald&nbsp;</em></strong>at&nbsp;<strong>Mysore</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;</strong>on&nbsp;<strong>DBL Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by <strong>01 PVT</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Dzire&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances.</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":44271,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":48000,\"transport_cost\":\"26500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":118771,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 17815.65\",\"selling_price\":136586.64999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0687/062025', 136560, 57660, 21240, '2025-06-02 08:52:44', '2025-06-02 09:03:29', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(699, 'Mr Niraj', 'Nikki Di Madhepura', '9110920509', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-06-17', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai \\u2013 Welcome to the City of Wonders + Desert Safari\",\"date\":\"17-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"141\\\" data-start=\\\"65\\\">Arrive in <strong data-end=\\\"162\\\" data-start=\\\"153\\\">Dubai<\\/strong>, the dazzling city of innovation, luxury, and culture. After clearing immigration, meet our representative and transfer to your hotel for check-in. Take some time to relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"696\\\" data-start=\\\"337\\\">In the afternoon, embark on an exciting <strong data-end=\\\"394\\\" data-start=\\\"377\\\">Desert Safari<\\/strong>. Experience a thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"419\\\">dune bashing ride<\\/strong> over golden sands, followed by activities like <strong data-end=\\\"504\\\" data-start=\\\"488\\\">camel riding<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"522\\\" data-start=\\\"506\\\">sandboarding<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"546\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\">henna painting<\\/strong>. As the sun sets, enjoy a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\">BBQ dinner<\\/strong> with <strong data-end=\\\"627\\\" data-start=\\\"605\\\">live entertainment<\\/strong>, including <strong data-end=\\\"656\\\" data-start=\\\"639\\\">Tanoura dance<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"675\\\" data-start=\\\"658\\\">belly dancing<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"695\\\" data-start=\\\"681\\\">fire shows<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"771\\\" data-start=\\\"698\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"747\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\">Overnight at Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"750\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"764\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour & Burj Khalifa Visit\",\"date\":\"18-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set out on a guided city tour to discover Dubai\\u2019s iconic landmarks. Visit photo-stop locations like Jumeirah Mosque, Burj Al Arab, Atlantis the Palm, and Jumeirah Beach. Drive past Sheikh Zayed Road and catch glimpses of Dubai\\u2019s modern architecture.<br data-end=\\\"1271\\\" data-start=\\\"1268\\\" \\/>\\nLater, head to Dubai Mall and ascend the world\\u2019s tallest building \\u2013 the <strong data-end=\\\"1381\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\">Burj Khalifa (124th &amp; 125th floor)<\\/strong> for stunning panoramic views of the city skyline.<br data-end=\\\"1434\\\" data-start=\\\"1431\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1481\\\" data-start=\\\"1438\\\">Overnight at <strong>Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong><\\/em><br data-end=\\\"1484\\\" data-start=\\\"1481\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1495\\\" data-start=\\\"1488\\\">Meal:<\\/em> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai Frame + Museum of the Future\",\"date\":\"19-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"120\\\" data-start=\\\"75\\\">After breakfast, begin your day with a visit to the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"196\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">Dubai Frame<\\/strong> \\u2013 the world\\u2019s largest picture frame. Enjoy panoramic views of both <strong data-end=\\\"285\\\" data-start=\\\"264\\\">old and new Dubai<\\/strong> from the sky glass bridge and explore the interactive galleries that showcase the city\\u2019s past, present, and future.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"619\\\" data-start=\\\"403\\\">Later, proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"425\\\">Museum of the Future<\\/strong>, one of Dubai\\u2019s most futuristic landmarks. Immerse yourself in a visionary experience with exhibits on <strong data-end=\\\"589\\\" data-start=\\\"553\\\">AI, space travel, sustainability<\\/strong>, and cutting-edge technology.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"697\\\" data-start=\\\"621\\\">Spend the evening at leisure or explore nearby attractions at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"775\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"748\\\" data-start=\\\"703\\\">Overnight at Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"751\\\" data-start=\\\"748\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"765\\\" data-start=\\\"755\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Abu Dhabi City Tour + Ferrari World + Grand Mosque + BAPS Hindu Temple\",\"date\":\"20-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2846\\\" data-start=\\\"2334\\\">Today, head to the capital city, <strong data-end=\\\"3006\\\" data-start=\\\"2993\\\">Abu Dhabi<\\/strong>, for an exciting full-day excursion. Visit the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"3092\\\" data-start=\\\"3063\\\">Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque<\\/strong>, known for its opulence and spiritual aura. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"3180\\\" data-start=\\\"3149\\\">Ferrari World on Yas Island<\\/strong> (entry included) for thrilling rides and attractions.<br data-end=\\\"3237\\\" data-start=\\\"3234\\\" \\/>\\nAlso stop by the newly opened <strong data-end=\\\"3288\\\" data-start=\\\"3267\\\">BAPS Hindu Temple<\\/strong>, a marvel of Indian craftsmanship and culture.<br data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3335\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3385\\\" data-start=\\\"3342\\\">Overnight at <strong>Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong><\\/em><br data-end=\\\"3388\\\" data-start=\\\"3385\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3399\\\" data-start=\\\"3392\\\">Meal:<\\/em> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai Dolphinarium Show + Leisure Time for Shopping or Exploration\",\"date\":\"21-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"3559\\\" data-start=\\\"3537\\\">Dubai Dolphinarium<\\/strong> for a delightful <strong data-end=\\\"3600\\\" data-start=\\\"3577\\\">Dolphin &amp; Seal Show<\\/strong>, perfect for families and children. Watch the intelligent sea creatures perform tricks and entertain with their skills.<br data-end=\\\"3723\\\" data-start=\\\"3720\\\" \\/>\\nThe rest of the day is free for you to relax, enjoy the hotel facilities, or indulge in some <strong>last-minute shopping <\\/strong>at the nearby <strong>souks or malls.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3869\\\" data-start=\\\"3866\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3916\\\" data-start=\\\"3873\\\">Overnight at <strong>Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong><\\/em><br data-end=\\\"3919\\\" data-start=\\\"3916\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3930\\\" data-start=\\\"3923\\\">Meal:<\\/em> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Checkout + Marina Dhow Cruise + Departure\",\"date\":\"22-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"121\\\" data-start=\\\"69\\\">After breakfast, <strong data-end=\\\"168\\\" data-start=\\\"140\\\">check out from the hotel<\\/strong>. You may store your luggage at the hotel and enjoy some free time for shopping or sightseeing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"494\\\" data-start=\\\"265\\\">In the evening, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"309\\\" data-start=\\\"293\\\">Dubai Marina<\\/strong> for a delightful <strong data-end=\\\"353\\\" data-start=\\\"327\\\">Dhow Cruise experience<\\/strong>. Sail past the illuminated skyline aboard a traditional wooden dhow, while enjoying a <strong data-end=\\\"457\\\" data-start=\\\"440\\\">buffet dinner<\\/strong>, soft music, and live entertainment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"623\\\" data-start=\\\"496\\\">After the cruise, proceed to the airport for your <strong data-end=\\\"566\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\">departure flight<\\/strong>, bringing home wonderful memories of your trip to Dubai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"669\\\" data-start=\\\"625\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"639\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Dinner (on cruise)<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"to\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"178\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"59418\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1477\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:15 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jun 2025\",\"fno\":\"1512\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:50 AM\",\"fare\":\"52411\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jun 2025\",\"fno\":\"673\",\"name\":\"Air India\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"23264\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Ascot Hotel Bur Dubai\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"rate\":\"46713\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"22\\/06\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availabi