" data-start=\"2084\">Burj Khalifa – 124th &amp; 125th Floor</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2178\" data-start=\"2125\">\n	<p data-end=\"2178\" data-start=\"2127\">🏜️ <strong data-end=\"2156\" data-start=\"2131\">Premium Desert Safari</strong> with dinner &amp; shows</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2179\">\n	<p data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2181\">⛴️ <strong data-end=\"2220\" data-start=\"2184\">Deluxe Marina Dhow Cruise Dinner</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2261\" data-start=\"2223\">\n	<p data-end=\"2261\" data-start=\"2225\">🏛️ <strong data-end=\"2253\" data-start=\"2229\">Museum of the Future</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2285\" data-start=\"2262\">\n	<p data-end=\"2285\" data-start=\"2264\">🖼️ <strong data-end=\"2283\" data-start=\"2268\">Dubai Frame</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2286\">\n	<p data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2288\">🐬 <strong data-end=\"2314\" data-start=\"2291\">Dolphin &amp; Seal Show</strong> at <strong>Dubai Dolphinarium</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2429\" data-start=\"2339\">\n	<p data-end=\"2429\" data-start=\"2341\">🕌 <strong data-end=\"2367\" data-start=\"2344\">Abu Dhabi City Tour</strong> with <strong data-end=\"2390\" data-start=\"2373\">Ferrari World</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2408\" data-start=\"2392\">Grand Mosque</strong>, &amp; <strong data-end=\"2427\" data-start=\"2412\">BAPS Temple</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2491\" data-start=\"2430\">\n	<p data-end=\"2491\" data-start=\"2432\">🌊 Entry to <strong data-end=\"2469\" data-start=\"2444\">Aquaventure Waterpark</strong> + <strong data-end=\"2489\" data-start=\"2472\">Lost Chambers</strong>.</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2549\">\n	<p data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2551\">🚗 All Tours &amp; Transfers on <strong data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2579\">Private Basis.</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2549\">\n	<p data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2551\"><strong data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2579\">Dubai Visa</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong><em>Tourism Dhiram Fee(To be paid at all Hotels directly).</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":135093,\"hotel_cost\":46713,\"land_cost\":\"131196\",\"visa_cost\":\"28000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":341002,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 75020.44\",\"selling_price\":416022.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0688/062025', 418000, 104500, 0, '2025-06-02 12:42:58', '2025-06-09 10:22:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(700, 'Ms. Priyanka', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DARJEELING 4*', '2025-06-08', 3, 0, 10, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bagdogra Airport to Darjeeling - Pickup\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Fullday Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of token, if not possible at the time of Sunrise, then it will be covered in day time.) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday&nbsp;closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway (Note: Closed on 19th of Every Month), Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday&nbsp;closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple(Peace Pagoda). Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Note: Darjeeling ropeway will be on direct payment basis. It has limited cabins (Approx. 8 and per cabin 4 persons can be accommodated), resulting in long queues due to high tourist volume. Be patient with potential delays. It could also impact your schedule for other sightseeing activities due to time constraints.<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - Mirik and Pashupati Market Day Visit\",\"date\":\"10-06-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for a full day excursion trip to Mirik (4,902 ft.), which is a small picturesque hill station with a beautiful lake surrounded by forested hills on all sides with the back drop of Mt Kanchenjunga. The road runs through some fascinating tea gardens, and pine forests. Visit Sumendu Lake, which is famous for it being one of the best man-made lakes. Enjoy horse ride and boating at the lake site on direct payment basis. On the way back to Darjeeling return via Pasupati Market, which is situated in Indo-Nepal border (Extra vehicle charges will be applicable for Nepal Border to Pasupati Market on direct payment basis). Evening back to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling to Bagdogra Airport - Drop\",\"date\":\"11-06-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to <em><strong>Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"text-align:start; text-indent:0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width:0px\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"126\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"80000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6533\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"68000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Orsino Spa Resort \\/ Similar\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"11\\/06\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"151\"><strong data-end=\"169\" data-start=\"151\">Return Airfare</strong>: Ex-Delhi</li>\n	<li data-end=\"254\" data-start=\"184\"><strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"184\">Accommodation</strong>: 03 Nights at <em data-end=\"241\" data-start=\"216\">Hotel Orsino Spa Resort</em> or similar</li>\n	<li data-end=\"370\" data-start=\"335\"><strong data-end=\"348\" data-start=\"335\">Meal Plan</strong>: As mentioned above</li>\n	<li data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"373\"><strong data-end=\"386\" data-start=\"373\">Transport</strong>: Exclusive Non-AC vehicle for transfers and sightseeing</li>\n	<li data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"449\"><em data-end=\"585\" data-start=\"449\">The vehicle is not at disposal—it will be available strictly as per the itinerary on a point-to-point basis.</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"590\"><strong data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"590\">Permits &amp; Taxes</strong>: All applicable permit fees and hotel taxes as per the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"734\" data-start=\"679\"><strong data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"679\">Note</strong>: Rates are valid for <strong data-end=\"734\" data-start=\"709\">Indian Nationals only</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"9\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":148000,\"land_cost\":\"126000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":274000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24660\",\"selling_price\":298660}', 'MZQ/0689/062025', 298640, 29864, 0, '2025-06-02 12:47:43', '2025-06-02 12:53:24', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(701, 'Mr Rahul Yadav', 'Jolly Chatterjee', '8527420349', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Andaman 3*', '2025-06-08', 6, 2, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Port Blair \\u2013 Corbyn\\u2019s Cove & Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"359\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\">Arrive at Port Blair Airport, where our representative will greet you and assist with your hotel transfer. After check-in and some rest, head out to <strong data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"290\\\">Corbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach<\\/strong> for a relaxing coastal drive and photo stops.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">In the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"426\\\" data-start=\\\"387\\\">Sound &amp; Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/strong>, which narrates the inspiring story of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. After the show, return to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair to Havelock Island \\u2013 Visit Radhanagar Beach\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"344\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Today, we head to one of the most stunning destinations in the Andaman Islands \\u2013 <em data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"237\\\">Havelock Island<\\/em>, often ranked as the best island in India. Transfer by ferry from Port Blair to Havelock.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"596\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">On arrival, our local representative will receive you and assist with your hotel check-in. After some rest, visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"497\\\" data-start=\\\"477\\\">Radhanagar Beach<\\/strong>, known for its pristine white sands and turquoise waters \\u2013 often listed among Asia\\u2019s best beaches.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-start=\\\"598\\\">Spend time here soaking in the beauty and stay until sunset before returning to your resort to relax and unwind for the night.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock Island \\u2013 Excursion to Elephant Beach with Snorkeling\",\"date\":\"10-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"485\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">After breakfast, gear up for an exciting adventure to <strong data-end=\\\"234\\\" data-start=\\\"216\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, one of Havelock Island\\u2019s most popular spots for water activities. A scenic 30-minute boat ride brings you to this vibrant beach, home to one of the island\\u2019s best coral reefs. The reef begins at just a meter in depth, making it perfect for beginners.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"735\\\" data-start=\\\"487\\\">Relax on the beach and enjoy the tropical surroundings. Later, experience a <strong data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"563\\\">complimentary snorkeling session<\\/strong> guided by professionals (subject to local association guidelines), offering a glimpse into the rich underwater life of the Andaman Sea.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"892\\\" data-start=\\\"737\\\">After the activity, return by boat to the Havelock jetty. Our team will be there to receive you and transfer you back to your hotel for a relaxing evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"976\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\"><em data-end=\\\"976\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\">Note: Our local team at Havelock will be available for any on-ground assistance.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure Day in Havelock \\u2013 Optional Activities\",\"date\":\"11-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"380\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">Today is a <strong data-end=\\\"207\\\" data-start=\\\"184\\\">free day at leisure<\\/strong>. You can relax at your resort, stroll along the beach, or explore the island at your own pace. This day is ideal for unwinding and soaking in the serene beauty of Havelock.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"698\\\" data-start=\\\"382\\\">\\ud83d\\udee5\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"415\\\" data-start=\\\"386\\\">Optional Tour Suggestion:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"418\\\" data-start=\\\"415\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"434\\\" data-start=\\\"418\\\">Scuba Diving<\\/strong> \\u2013 Explore the mesmerizing underwater world of the Andaman Sea. Havelock is one of the top diving destinations in India, perfect for both beginners and certified divers. You can book a guided diving session with professional instructors (additional charges apply).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"794\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\">Let us know if you\\u2019d like assistance in planning or booking any optional activity for the day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock to Neil Island \\u2013 Natural Rock Formation, Bharatpur Beach & Laxmanpur Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"12-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"389\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and head to the jetty to board a premium cruise to <strong data-end=\\\"292\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Neil Island<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, our representative will assist you with the transfer and check-in at your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"806\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\">Begin your exploration with a visit to the island\\u2019s unique <strong data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"450\\\">Natural Rock Formation<\\/strong>, a must-see attraction formed by years of erosion. Next, visit <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its shallow waters and vibrant marine life\\u2014perfect for swimming and optional water activities like <strong data-end=\\\"686\\\" data-start=\\\"670\\\">Scuba Diving<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"699\\\" data-start=\\\"688\\\">Jet Ski<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"731\\\" data-start=\\\"705\\\">Glass Bottom Boat Ride<\\/strong>. You\\u2019ll also find local food stalls to enjoy a light meal or refreshments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\">In the evening, visit the tranquil <strong data-end=\\\"862\\\" data-start=\\\"843\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, just 2 km from the jetty, to witness a mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"925\\\" data-start=\\\"915\\\">sunset<\\/strong> over the Arabian Sea. After this peaceful end to the day, return to your hotel for a relaxed overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island to Port Blair by Cruise \\u2013 Evening Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"13-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"228\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Neil Island jetty<\\/strong> to board your cruise back to <strong data-end=\\\"272\\\" data-start=\\\"258\\\">Port Blair<\\/strong>. On arrival, our representative will meet you at the jetty and assist with your transfer to the hotel for check-in and some rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"649\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">Later in the evening, head out for a <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"441\\\">local shopping tour<\\/strong>. Explore popular markets known for <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"500\\\">coral artifacts, handmade crafts, shell-based souvenirs<\\/strong>, and other unique items\\u2014perfect for picking up gifts and mementos for friends and family.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"651\\\">After a relaxed shopping experience, return to your hotel for your <strong data-end=\\\"756\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\">final overnight stay in Port Blair<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"14-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"81\\\">Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"550\\\" data-start=\\\"225\\\">Please note that hotels typically have an early check-out time. If your flight is scheduled for the afternoon, you can leave your luggage safely at the hotel reception kiosk. Should you wish to explore any attractions during your free time before your departure, please let us know\\u2014we\\u2019ll be happy to assist with arrangements.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Luxor\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/06\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Placid Garden Resort\",\"city\":\"Havelock\",\"room_type\":\"Areca Garden View Cottage Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/06\\/2025\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pearl Park Beach Resort (Private Beach & Pool Property) -\",\"city\":\"Neil Island\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe AC Room (Garden View)\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/06\\/2025\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"13\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Luxor\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":7}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation&nbsp;on<strong> Double sharing </strong>at given <strong>Hotels in&nbsp;Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at all respected Hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>Meet and greet </strong>service at airport.</li>\n	<li>All sightseeing by <strong>1 Private AC Vehicle</strong> at all the islands.</li>\n	<li>Transfer to <strong>Havelock Island/Neil Island</strong> in Nautika/Makruzz/Green Ocean.</li>\n	<li><strong>Full day tour with all transfers</strong> including airport pick up and drop.</li>\n	<li><strong>All entry tickets, ferry tickets</strong> and permit charges.</li>\n	<li><strong>Personal Tour Coordinators</strong> for one Point of Contact.</li>\n	<li><strong>Travel assistance by field executive at all the major entry exit points</strong> (Airport/Jetty/Jail/Water sports complex, Havelock / Neil etc).</li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle <strong>(Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) </strong>as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li><strong>Parking charge</strong>s.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<em><strong>Multi Zone Travel</strong></em>&nbsp;experts&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"141916\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":141916,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21287.4\",\"selling_price\":163203.39999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0690/062025', 163340, 21610, 16840, '2025-06-03 12:04:24', '2025-06-03 12:04:24', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(702, 'Mr Aashit Pandey', 'Franky', '8084448890', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2025-06-07', 7, 3, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Delhi\",\"date\":\"07-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"108\\\" data-start=\\\"81\\\">Depart from your hometown and arrive in Delhi. Upon arrival, proceed to your hotel for check-in. Take some time to relax and unwind after your journey. The rest of the day is free for you to explore at your own pace or enjoy the hotel\\u2019s amenities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"400\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"400\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Delhi.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi \\u2013 Manali via Kullu Valley\",\"date\":\"08-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"103\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\">After an early breakfast, check out from your hotel and begin your scenic drive to Manali. En route, pass through the picturesque Kullu Valley, known for its lush greenery, charming villages, and the flowing Beas River. Take short breaks along the way to admire the views or visit local handicraft centers in Kullu.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"495\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\">Upon arrival in Manali, check in to your hotel and relax for the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"539\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"539\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"09-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"495\\\" data-start=\\\"157\\\">After breakfast, set out to explore the scenic and cultural highlights of Manali. Visit the ancient <strong data-end=\\\"280\\\" data-start=\\\"257\\\">Hadimba Devi Temple<\\/strong>, surrounded by cedar forests, and the <strong data-end=\\\"334\\\" data-start=\\\"319\\\">Manu Temple<\\/strong>, which is accessible via a pleasant walk through the old town. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"434\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Vashisht Village<\\/strong>, renowned for its <strong data-end=\\\"482\\\" data-start=\\\"453\\\">natural hot water springs<\\/strong> and temples.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"752\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\">Later, unwind amidst nature at the peaceful <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"541\\\">Van Vihar park<\\/strong>, a perfect spot for a leisurely stroll. In the evening, head to <strong data-end=\\\"649\\\" data-start=\\\"624\\\">Manali\\u2019s local market<\\/strong> to shop for handicrafts, woolens, and souvenirs, and savor local Himachali cuisine at nearby eateries.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"796\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"796\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Excursion to Solang Valley\",\"date\":\"10-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"128\\\" data-start=\\\"82\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a day trip to the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"203\\\" data-start=\\\"186\\\">Solang Valley<\\/strong>, a paradise for adventure lovers and nature enthusiasts. Located about 13 km from Manali, the valley offers breathtaking views of snow-capped mountains and glaciers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"581\\\" data-start=\\\"371\\\">Enjoy optional adventure activities such as <strong data-end=\\\"430\\\" data-start=\\\"415\\\">paragliding<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"443\\\" data-start=\\\"432\\\">zorbing<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"445\\\">ropeway rides<\\/strong>, and in winter months, <strong data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"486\\\">skiing<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"516\\\" data-start=\\\"501\\\">snow tubing<\\/strong> (activities are subject to weather conditions and availability).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"653\\\" data-start=\\\"583\\\">Return to Manali by evening and spend the rest of the time at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"697\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"697\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Excursion to Rohtang Pass (Hire Local Union Taxi on OWN)\",\"date\":\"11-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"131\\\" data-start=\\\"86\\\">After an early breakfast, take a full-day trip to <strong data-end=\\\"199\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\">Rohtang Pass<\\/strong> (subject to weather and permit availability), located around 51 km from Manali. Enjoy the stunning views of snow-covered peaks and glaciers along the way. You may stop at <strong data-end=\\\"381\\\" data-start=\\\"371\\\">Gulaba<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"399\\\" data-start=\\\"383\\\">Rahala Falls<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"414\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\">Marhi<\\/strong> for sightseeing and photos.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"618\\\" data-start=\\\"444\\\">At Rohtang Pass, you can enjoy snow activities like <strong data-end=\\\"508\\\" data-start=\\\"496\\\">sledging<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"520\\\" data-start=\\\"510\\\">skiing<\\/strong>, or simply playing in the snow (seasonal). Warm clothes and gear are available for rent en route.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"658\\\" data-start=\\\"620\\\">Return to Manali by evening and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"660\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"660\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali to Delhi\",\"date\":\"12-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"87\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and begin your return journey to Delhi. Enjoy the scenic drive through the mountains and valleys, passing by charming villages and riversides along the way.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"460\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Upon arrival in Delhi, check in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"519\\\" data-start=\\\"462\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"519\\\" data-start=\\\"462\\\">Overnight stay in Delhi.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi \\u2013 Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"13-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"105\\\">Enjoy a relaxed day in Delhi at your own pace. You may choose to unwind at your hotel or explore the city on your own. Optional activities include visiting popular attractions like <strong data-end=\\\"300\\\" data-start=\\\"286\\\">India Gate<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"320\\\" data-start=\\\"302\\\">Humayun\\u2019s Tomb<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"338\\\" data-start=\\\"322\\\">Lotus Temple<\\/strong>, or shopping at markets such as <strong data-end=\\\"390\\\" data-start=\\\"371\\\">Connaught Place<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"403\\\" data-start=\\\"392\\\">Janpath<\\/strong>, or <strong data-end=\\\"426\\\" data-start=\\\"408\\\">Sarojini Nagar<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"471\\\" data-start=\\\"429\\\">Savor local Delhi cuisine at your leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"473\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"473\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Delhi.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi \\u2013 Last Minute Shopping & Departure\",\"date\":\"14-06-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"129\\\" data-start=\\\"78\\\">After breakfast, enjoy some <strong data-end=\\\"183\\\" data-start=\\\"159\\\">last-minute shopping<\\/strong> or explore nearby attractions, depending on your flight or train schedule. Pick up souvenirs, handicrafts, or local specialties from markets like <strong data-end=\\\"344\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">Dilli Haat<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"365\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">Connaught Place<\\/strong>, or <strong data-end=\\\"385\\\" data-start=\\\"370\\\">Khan Market<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"388\\\">Later, check out from the hotel and proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"469\\\" data-start=\\\"439\\\">airport<\\/strong>&nbsp;for your onward journey with wonderful memories of your trip.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">End of Tour.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1114\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"39469\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"48332\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DELHI (Mahipalpur)\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique Hotel\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Double Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"7500\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"08\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"check_out\":\"12\\/06\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Valley Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"69600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DELHI (Nehru Place)\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/06\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Muse Sarovar Portico\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"30379\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation 