(703, 'Mr. Shankar Kumar Vidyarthy', 'CO Ref: Shashi Argora', '7903109421', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Darjeeling', '2025-06-12', 3, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport - Darjeeling\",\"date\":\"12-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet and Greet on arrival at New Jalpaiguri Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra International Airport and transfer to Darjeeling (6,950 Ft.). On arrival check-in to the hotel and rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling Full Day Sightseeing with Tiger Hill\",\"date\":\"13-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning (4:00 AM) visit Tiger Hill (Subject to availability of Permit \\/ Token) and then back to hotel. After breakfast, starting at 8.30 AM, visit Himalayan Mountaineering Institute, P.N. Zoological Park (Thursday closed), Tenzing Rock, Ropeway, Tibetan Refugee self-help Centre (Sunday closed), Tea Garden (outer view), Japanese Temple. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Mirik\",\"date\":\"14-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast start for a full day excursion trip to Mirik (4,902 ft.), which is a small picturesque hill station with a beautiful lake surrounded by forested hills on all sides with the back drop of Mt Kanchenjunga. The road runs through some fascinating tea gardens, Orange Orchards, Cardamom plantations and pine forests. Visit Sumendu Lake, which is famous for it being one of the best man-made lakes. Enjoy horse ride and boating at the lake site on direct payment basis. On the way back to Darjeeling return via Pasupati Market, which is situated in Indo-Nepal border (Extra vehicle charges will be applicable for Nepal Border to Pasupati Market on direct payment basis). Evening back to hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Darjeeling.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Darjeeling - NJP Rly Station \\/ IXB Airport\",\"date\":\"15-06-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast Checkout from hotel and take, the departure transfers to New Jalpaiguri Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6893\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"fare\":36145},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6134\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1113\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Jun 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Jun 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"fare\":52495}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Darjeeling\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Orsino Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"16\\/06\\/2025\",\"nights\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>03 Nts Accomodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Orsino Resort at Derjeeling.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><em><strong>02 Rooms on DBL</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Meal Plan <em><strong>(Breakfast + Dinner).</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Exclusive Non-a/c vehicle&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span style=\"color:black\">Innova / Xylo / Similar</span></span></span></span> for transfers &amp; sightseeing .</li>\n	<li>Vehicle will not be at disposal it will be available as per itinerary only (point to point basis).</li>\n	<li>All permit fees &amp; hotel taxes.</li>\n	<li>GST inclusive**.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any costs arising out of unforeseen circumstances like landslides, road blocks, bad weather, Political Strike etc.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":88640,\"land_cost\":\"71060\",\"hotel_cost\":0},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":159700,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 23955\",\"selling_price\":183655,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0692/062025', 184140, 41460, 18300, '2025-06-09 06:21:52', '2025-06-09 06:34:13', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(704, 'Mr Sumit Kumar Dwivedi', 'Sanjay Arya Friend', '7991190649', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HIMACHAL', '2025-07-15', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh \\u2013 Shimla (Approx. 120 km \\/ 4 hrs)\",\"date\":\"15-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"207\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">Chandigarh Airport<\\/strong>, you will be met by our representative\\/driver. From there, begin your scenic drive to <strong data-end=\\\"304\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Shimla<\\/strong>, the former summer capital of British India, nestled in the Shivalik ranges of the Himalayas. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax. The rest of the day is at your leisure to explore the surroundings or unwind at the property.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"584\\\" data-start=\\\"542\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"584\\\" data-start=\\\"542\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Shimla.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Kufri Excursion & Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"16-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"465\\\" data-start=\\\"66\\\">After breakfast, head to <strong data-end=\\\"151\\\" data-start=\\\"142\\\">Kufri<\\/strong>, known for its <strong data-end=\\\"194\\\" data-start=\\\"167\\\">Himalayan National Park<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"214\\\" data-start=\\\"196\\\">pony\\/yak rides<\\/strong>, and stunning views of the Himalayas. Post-lunch, explore Shimla\'s key colonial-era landmarks: <strong data-end=\\\"327\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"310\\\">Shimla Mosque<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"349\\\" data-start=\\\"329\\\">Vice Regal Lodge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"368\\\" data-start=\\\"351\\\">Christ Church<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"388\\\" data-start=\\\"370\\\">Gaiety Theatre<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"408\\\" data-start=\\\"390\\\">Grindlays Bank<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"410\\\">Scandal Point<\\/strong>, and enjoy shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"451\\\">Mall Road<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Manali via Kullu Valley (Approx. 265 km \\/ 8 hrs)\",\"date\":\"17-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"527\\\" data-start=\\\"94\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for a beautiful drive to <strong data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">Manali<\\/strong>. En route, enjoy the breathtaking views of the <strong data-end=\\\"318\\\" data-start=\\\"302\\\">Kullu Valley<\\/strong>, known for its lush greenery, river views, and traditional Himachali culture. You may choose to stop for local sightseeing, shopping for woolens or try out river rafting in Kullu (optional, at your own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"661\\\" data-start=\\\"529\\\">Arrive in <strong data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"539\\\">Manali<\\/strong> by evening and check in to your hotel. Spend the evening at leisure or take a stroll through the local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"705\\\" data-start=\\\"663\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"705\\\" data-start=\\\"663\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"18-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"420\\\" data-start=\\\"64\\\">After breakfast, explore popular attractions in and around Manali including the ancient <strong data-end=\\\"203\\\" data-start=\\\"185\\\">Hadimba Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"220\\\" data-start=\\\"205\\\">Manu Temple<\\/strong> (accessible by walk), and the natural hot springs at <strong data-end=\\\"291\\\" data-start=\\\"274\\\">Vashisht Bath<\\/strong>. Stroll through the serene <strong data-end=\\\"332\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"319\\\">Van Vihar<\\/strong> park. In the evening, enjoy shopping and local cuisine at <strong data-end=\\\"419\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\">Manali\\u2019s bustling market<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"451\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"451\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Excursion to Solang Valley\",\"date\":\"19-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"65\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an exciting excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"178\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Solang Valley<\\/strong>, famous for its breathtaking views and adventure activities like paragliding, zorbing, and ropeway rides (activities optional &amp; at own cost). Spend time amidst snow-capped peaks and scenic landscapes before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"411\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"411\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Chandigarh (Approx. 320 km \\/ 8\\u20139 hrs)\",\"date\":\"20-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"446\\\" data-start=\\\"117\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"246\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">Chandigarh<\\/strong>, India\\u2019s first planned modern city, designed by French architect <strong data-end=\\\"328\\\" data-start=\\\"312\\\">Le Corbusier<\\/strong>. The city derives its name from the goddess <strong data-end=\\\"383\\\" data-start=\\\"373\\\">Chandi<\\/strong>, with the <strong data-end=\\\"416\\\" data-start=\\\"394\\\">Chandimandu Temple<\\/strong> being a significant landmark.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">Subject to time availability upon arrival, visit popular attractions such as the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"536\\\">Rock Garden<\\/strong> and the serene <strong data-end=\\\"582\\\" data-start=\\\"567\\\">Sukhna Lake<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\">Overnight stay at the hotel in Chandigarh.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chandigarh \\u2013 Departure\",\"date\":\"21-07-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for your <strong data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">transfer to Chandigarh Railway Station or Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey, carrying fond memories of your trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6485\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jul 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jul 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"fare\":22396},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2195\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jul 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jul 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"fare\":23848},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Patna (PAT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2695\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Jul 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Jul 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/07\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Valley Resorts\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/07\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"18326\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/07\\/2025\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Valley Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Garden View Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"20\\/07\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"21500\"