subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9},{\"age\":11}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare&nbsp;<em><strong>Ex-Kolkata.&nbsp;</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> accommodation&nbsp;at <strong>Hotel Amari Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Phuket&nbsp;Airport Pickup &amp; Drop.</strong></li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on <strong>Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Fantasea Show </strong>(Gold Seat) with Dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island Tour </strong>By CATAMARAN with Lunch - Includes NP Fee.</li>\n	<li><strong>James Bond &amp; Naka Island</strong> + Canoe by CATAMARAN with Lunch&nbsp;- Includes NP Fee.</li>\n	<li><strong>Tiger Park</strong> -Big or Smallest Any one Tiger.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":136800,\"land_cost\":\"185100\",\"hotel_cost\":160800},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":482700,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":551967,\"profit_figure\":\"69267\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"14.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0701/062025', 551966, 71747, 60742, '2025-06-25 06:27:33', '2025-07-30 10:18:49', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(713, 'Dr Aarti Jyoti', 'RamPyari Hospital', '9082911702', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'EUROPE', '2025-08-15', 9, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Budapest\",\"date\":\"15-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Budapest Airport, you\\u2019ll be greeted with a private transfer to your hotel. Take the day to relax or explore the nearby area at your leisure. You may enjoy a casual stroll along the Danube or discover a cozy Hungarian caf\\u00e9 to unwind.<br data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"424\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"427\\\">Overnight Stay: Budapest<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Budapest City Exploration\",\"date\":\"16-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Begin your Budapest adventure with a 1-day Hop-on-Hop-off bus pass covering the city\\u2019s key landmarks. Participate in a guided walking tour to explore Budapest\\u2019s historic core, followed by a serene Danube River Cruise offering picturesque views of the Parliament Building, Buda Castle, and Chain Bridge.<br data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"820\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"851\\\" data-start=\\\"823\\\">Overnight Stay: Budapest<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Evening Cruise on the Danube\",\"date\":\"17-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a leisurely day for personal exploration\\u2014perhaps visit Sz\\u00e9chenyi Thermal Baths, explore the Great Market Hall, or try chimney cake. In the evening, board the City Highlights Cruise for an hour-long ride with a welcome drink as you admire Budapest\\u2019s evening skyline.<br data-end=\\\"1191\\\" data-start=\\\"1188\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1219\\\" data-start=\\\"1191\\\">Overnight Stay: Budapest<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Flight to Berlin\",\"date\":\"18-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out and take a private transfer to Budapest Airport for your flight to Berlin. Upon arrival, a private transfer will take you to your hotel in Berlin. Enjoy the rest of the day at leisure\\u2014consider exploring Museum Island or dining at Hackescher Markt.<br data-end=\\\"1528\\\" data-start=\\\"1525\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1554\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\">Overnight Stay: Berlin<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Sachsenhausen Memorial Tour\",\"date\":\"19-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, embark on a 5-hour SIC tour to Sachsenhausen Concentration Camp Memorial for a thought-provoking experience into Germany\'s WWII history. Return to Berlin by afternoon and enjoy the rest of the day at your own pace.<br data-end=\\\"1843\\\" data-start=\\\"1840\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1869\\\" data-start=\\\"1843\\\">Overnight Stay: Berlin<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hop-on-Hop-off Berlin Tour\",\"date\":\"20-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Use your 24-hour Hop-on-Hop-off ticket to explore Berlin\\u2019s major highlights, including Brandenburg Gate, Berlin Cathedral, East Side Gallery, and Checkpoint Charlie. Customize your day with stops at museums, parks, or local food joints.<br data-end=\\\"2171\\\" data-start=\\\"2168\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2197\\\" data-start=\\\"2171\\\">Overnight Stay: Berlin<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Train Journey to Amsterdam\",\"date\":\"21-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2549\\\" data-start=\\\"2204\\\">After breakfast, take a private transfer to Berlin Train Station and board your direct train to Amsterdam (Dep. 10:06 \\u2013 Arr. 15:58). Upon arrival, a private transfer will escort you to your hotel. Enjoy a peaceful evening or walk along the charming canals.<br data-end=\\\"2520\\\" data-start=\\\"2517\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2549\\\" data-start=\\\"2520\\\">Overnight Stay: Amsterdam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dutch Countryside Tour\",\"date\":\"22-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Experience the scenic countryside on an 8-hour guided bus tour to Zaanse Schans, Edam, Volendam, and Marken. Witness iconic windmills, taste Dutch cheese, and explore traditional fishing villages for a delightful cultural experience.<br data-end=\\\"2845\\\" data-start=\\\"2842\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2874\\\" data-start=\\\"2845\\\">Overnight Stay: Amsterdam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 9\",\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Van Gogh Museum & Leisure Day\",\"date\":\"23-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, visit the renowned Van Gogh Museum with your entry ticket and admire his masterpieces. Spend the rest of the day enjoying Amsterdam at your own pace\\u2014consider visiting Jordaan, taking a canal cruise, or shopping at The Nine Streets.<br data-end=\\\"3182\\\" data-start=\\\"3179\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3211\\\" data-start=\\\"3182\\\">Overnight Stay: Amsterdam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 10\",\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Amsterdam\",\"date\":\"24-08-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3459\\\" data-start=\\\"3218\\\">After check-out, your private transfer will take you to Amsterdam Airport for your flight back home. Depart with beautiful memories of your Central European adventure.<br data-end=\\\"3444\\\" data-start=\\\"3441\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3459\\\" data-start=\\\"3444\\\">End of Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"EK-513\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jul 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"84000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Budapest (BUD)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"EK-111\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:20 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Budapest (BUD)\",\"to\":\"Berlin (BER)\",\"name\":\"Wizz Air\",\"fno\":\"W6-2315\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:05 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Aug 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"20600\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Berlin\",\"to\":\"Amsterdam\",\"name\":\"Train\",\"dep_time\":\"10:06 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"15:58 PM\",\"fno\":\"2nd Class\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Aug 2025\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Amsterdam (AMS)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"fare\":\"69000\",\"name\":\"Air India\",\"fno\":\"AI-156\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BUDAPEST\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel D8 or similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double \\/ Twin room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"18\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"32125\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BERLIN\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Zoe by Amano group or similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double \\/ Twin room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"48593\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"21\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"AMSTERDAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ibis Amsterdam Centre or similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double \\/ Twin room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"24\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"65017\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<h3 data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"1009\">✅ <strong data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"1015\">International Flight Tickets</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1049\">\n	<li data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1049\">\n	<p data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1051\">Delhi to Budapest</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1049\">\n	<p data-end=\"1070\" data-start=\"1051\">Budapest to Berlin <em><strong>(20 Kgs Checkin Baggage included)</strong></em></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1071\">\n	<p data-end=\"1091\" data-start=\"1073\">Amsterdam to Delhi</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"1093\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"940\" data-start=\"918\">✅ <strong data-end=\"940\" data-start=\"924\">Train Ticket</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"942\">\n	<li data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"942\">\n	<p data-end=\"1002\" data-start=\"944\">Berlin to Amsterdam – Direct Train (Second Class, Economy)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"913\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"1009\">✅&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">Accommodation&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1162\">\n	<li data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1162\">\n	<p data-end=\"1231\" data-start=\"1164\"><strong data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1164\">Budapest |&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">03 Nights&nbsp;</strong>: Hotel D8 or similar – 1 Double/Twin Room – <strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">Breakfast</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1315\" data-start=\"1232\">\n	<p data-end=\"1315\" data-start=\"1234\"><strong data-end=\"1244\" data-start=\"1234\">Berlin&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1164\">|&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">03 Nights&nbsp;</strong>: Hotel Zoe by Amano Group or similar – 1 Double/Twin Room – <strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">Breakfast</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1316\">\n	<p data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1318\"><strong data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1318\">Amsterdam&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1164\">|&nbsp;</strong><strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">03 Nights&nbsp;</strong>: Hotel Ibis Amsterdam Centre or similar – 1 Double/Twin Room – <strong data-end=\"1160\" data-start=\"1104\">Breakfast</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"913\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"163\" data-start=\"126\">✅ <strong data-end=\"161\" data-start=\"132\">Sightseeings on SIC Basis</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"164\"><em data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"164\">(From Departure/Meeting Point – No Hotel Pick-up/Drop-off Included)</em></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"235\">\n	<li data-end=\"277\" data-start=\"235\">\n	<p data-end=\"277\" data-start=\"237\">1-Day Hop-on-Hop-off Ticket (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"278\">\n	<p data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"280\">Guided Walking Tour (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"313\">\n	<p data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"315\">Danube River Cruise (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"348\">\n	<p data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"350\">City Highlights Evening Cruise with Welcome Drink (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"413\">\n	<p data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"415\">Sachsenhausen Concentration Camp Memorial Tour (Berlin)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"473\">\n	<p data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"475\">24-Hour Hop-on-Hop-off Ticket (Berlin)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"516\">\n	<p data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"518\">Zaanse Schans, Edam, Volendam &amp; Marken Bus Tour (Amsterdam)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"580\">\n	<p data-end=\"622\" data-start=\"582\">Van Gogh Museum Entry Ticket (Amsterdam)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"624\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"656\" data-start=\"629\">✅ <strong data-end=\"656\" data-start=\"635\">Private Transfers</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"658\">\n	<li data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"658\">\n	<p data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"660\">Airport to Hotel Transfer (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"699\">\n	<p data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"701\">Hotel to Airport Transfer (Budapest)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"740\">\n	<p data-end=\"778\" data-start=\"742\">Airport to Hotel Transfer (Berlin)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"779\">\n	<p data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"781\">Hotel to Train Station Transfer (Berlin)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"824\">\n	<p data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"826\">Train Station to Hotel Transfer (Amsterdam)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"872\">\n	<p data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"874\">Hotel to Airport Transfer (Amsterdam)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"1009\">&nbsp;</h3>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>5% GST &amp; 5% TCS Applicable.</strong></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":173600,\"land_cost\":\"118000\",\"hotel_cost\":145735},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":437335,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 69973.6\",\"selling_price\":507308.599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0702/072025', 499740, 249870, 0, '2025-07-02 14:16:45', '2025-07-02 14:52:34', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(714, 'Mr. Vikram Sharma', 'BNI | Explorers', '9608019901', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GOLDEN TRAINGLE', '2025-08-08', 3, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Delhi - Agra (250 km \\/5-6 hrs drive)\",\"date\":\"08-08-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Upon arrival in Delhi, meet our representative and begin your journey to Agra. Enjoy a scenic drive through the<em><strong> Yamuna Expressway<\\/strong><\\/em>. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and freshen up. Later, visit the iconic Taj Mahal, followed by the majestic Agra Fort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\"><em><strong>Overnight stay in Agra.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Agra to Vrindavan to Mathura (60Kms \\/ 1 Hrs Drive)\",\"date\":\"09-08-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"951\\\" data-start=\\\"576\\\">After breakfast, begin your sightseeing tour of Agra, including a visit to the world-famous <em><strong>Taj Mahal and the majestic Agra Fort.<\\/strong><\\/em> Post lunch, drive towards Mathura. <em><strong>En route, stop at the sacred Barsana Temples, associated with Radha Rani and Krishna Leela.<\\/strong><\\/em> Arrive in Mathura by evening and check in to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"951\\\" data-start=\\\"576\\\"><em><strong>Overnight stay in Vrindavan.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Vrindavan Darshan \\u2013 Drive Back to Delhi\",\"date\":\"10-08-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1086\\\">After breakfast, head for a full-day darshan in <strong data-end=\\\"1201\\\" data-start=\\\"1188\\\">Vrindavan<\\/strong>, one of the holiest cities associated with the life of Lord Krishna. Visit major temples such as <strong data-end=\\\"1322\\\" data-start=\\\"1299\\\">Banke Bihari Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1341\\\" data-start=\\\"1324\\\">ISKCON Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1365\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\">Radha Raman Temple<\\/strong>, and the beautifully illuminated <strong data-end=\\\"1414\\\" data-start=\\\"1399\\\">Prem Mandir<\\/strong> in the evening. Experience bhajans, aartis, and the deeply spiritual vibe of this divine town. By late evening, begin your return drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1563\\\" data-start=\\\"1554\\\">Delhi<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1596\\\" data-start=\\\"1568\\\"><em><strong data-end=\\\"1596\\\" data-start=\\\"1568\\\">Overnight stay in Delhi.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mathura to Delhi (200Kms\\/ 5-6 Hrs drive)\",\"date\":\"11-08-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"539\\\" data-start=\\\"121\\\">Enjoy breakfast at the hotel and head out for a short local sightseeing tour of <strong data-end=\\\"1742\\\" data-start=\\\"1733\\\">Delhi<\\/strong>, covering key attractions like <strong data-end=\\\"1788\\\" data-start=\\\"1774\\\">India Gate<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1806\\\" data-start=\\\"1790\\\">Lotus Temple<\\/strong>, or <strong data-end=\\\"1825\\\" data-start=\\\"1811\\\">Akshardham<\\/strong> (as per time and convenience). Later, check out and proceed to the airport or railway station for your onward journey, carrying with you the blessings and beautiful memories of this spiritual trip.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"539\\\" data-start=\\\"121\\\"><em><strong>Tour Ends with cherished memories and blessings of Lord Krishna<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5062\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"16818\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"15248\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"AGRA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Taj Resorts\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"3678\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"VRINDAVAN\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Tulsi Garden\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room +01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"4000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DELHI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"3500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Taj Resorts at AGRA.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp; Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Tulsi Garden&nbsp;at VRINDAVAN.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Lohmod - Boutique&nbsp;at DELHI.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing + 01 Extra Bed</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfasts at all respective Hotels.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing &amp; tour </strong>by Swift Dzire / Similar <strong>on PVT basis<em>.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"31\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":32066,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":11178,\"transport_cost\":\"14000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":57244,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 17745.64\",\"selling_price\":74989.639999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0703/072025', 75048, 25016, 0, '2025-07-03 05:37:15', '2025-07-15 12:58:03', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(715, 'Mr. Vijay Kumar Upadhyay', 'Dibadih', '9263638917', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Ujjain and Indore Special', '2025-09-28', 3, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Indore - Ujjain\",\"date\":\"28-09-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"109\\\">Arrive at Indore, where our driver\\/tour representative will receive you. Proceed to Ujjain and check in to your hotel. Spend the evening exploring the local market and soaking in the spiritual vibes of the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"422\\\" data-start=\\\"397\\\"><em><strong>Overnight stay in Ujjain.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ujjain \\u2013 Mahakaleshwar Darshan \\u2013 Transfer to Indore\",\"date\":\"29-09-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"351\\\" data-start=\\\"116\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and visit the sacred <strong><em data-end=\\\"266\\\" data-start=\\\"244\\\">Mahakaleshwar Temple<\\/em><\\/strong> for a peaceful morning darshan. Spend some time soaking in the spiritual ambiance.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"515\\\" data-start=\\\"353\\\">Later, begin your drive back to Indore. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax. Evening at leisure\\u2014explore nearby cafes or local markets at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"542\\\" data-start=\\\"517\\\"><em><strong>Overnight stay in Indore<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Indore Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"30-09-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"448\\\" data-start=\\\"90\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for a full day of local sightseeing in Indore. Explore the city\\u2019s rich cultural and historical heritage with visits to places like Kanch Mandir, Bada Ganapati, Chhatri Bagh, Rajwada, Annapurna Temple, Lal Bagh Palace, Old Palace, and Kamla Nehru Prani Sangrahalay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"527\\\" data-start=\\\"450\\\">After a fulfilling day, <em><strong>return to your hotel for an overnight stay in Indore.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure Indore\",\"date\":\"01-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"341\\\" data-start=\\\"130\\\">After enjoying a relaxed breakfast, check out from the hotel. With your heart full of divine blessings and wonderful memories, it\'s time to conclude your Indore Gateway tour.Our driver will drop you at the Indore Airport&nbsp; as per your departure schedule.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"488\\\" data-start=\\\"343\\\"><em><strong>Wishing you a safe and pleasant onward journey!<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"398\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"fare\":42860},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Indore (IDR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6915\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Indore (IDR)\",\"to\":\"Bhubaneshwar (BBI)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6332\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":41985},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bhubaneshwar (BBI)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7361\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ujjaini Or Similar\",\"city\":\"Ujjain\",\"room_type\":\"DBl Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"7600\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Indore\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Winway Or Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBl Room + 01 Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"01\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"16000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Ujjaini Or Similar at Ujjain.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp; Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Winway Or Similar&nbsp;at Indore.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing + 01 Extra Bed</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfasts at all respective Hotels.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;</strong><strong><strong>sightseeing&nbsp;</strong>and<strong>&nbsp;tours&nbsp;</strong>by Innova / Similar&nbsp;<strong>on a private</strong>&nbsp;basis<em>.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":84845,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":23600,\"transport_cost\":\"15000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":123445,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20985.65\",\"selling_price\":144430.64999999999417923390865325927734375}', 'MZQ/0704/072025', 144460, 28892, 0, '2025-07-14 08:48:20', '2025-07-14 10:33:07', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(716, 'Mr Rahul Kumar (Sudhir ji)', 'Ratan SAIL', '9934526861', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE & MALAYSIA', '2025-12-01', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Singapore & Night Safari\",\"date\":\"01-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arriving in Singapore, transfer to Hotel Mi Rochor and check-in. After some rest, head out in the evening for an adventurous Night Safari experience, which includes a guided tram ride through seven unique zones and a complimentary animal show, offering a thrilling introduction to Singapore\'s wildlife under the stars.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore City Tour + Sentosa Island\",\"date\":\"02-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Begin your day with a guided city tour covering iconic landmarks like Merlion Park, Suntec City, Little India, and Chinatown. Post lunch, proceed to Sentosa Island via a scenic cable car ride. Explore the Oceanarium (S.E.A. Aquarium), enjoy panoramic views from Sky Helix, and end the day with the spectacular \\\"Wings of Time\\\" night show \\u2014 a perfect blend of lights, water, and music.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gardens by the Bay & Marina Bay Sands\",\"date\":\"03-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Spend your day amidst nature and art at Gardens by the Bay. Visit the stunning Flower Dome featuring <em data-end=\\\"1167\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\">Impressions of Monet: The Experience<\\/em> and explore the misty wonders of the Cloud Forest. Later, head to the Marina Bay Sands SkyPark Observation Deck for breathtaking views of the Singapore skyline as the city lights come alive.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore\",\"date\":\"04-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Gear up for an action-packed day at Universal Studios Singapore. Enjoy thrilling rides, themed attractions, and shows across seven exciting zones like Sci-Fi City, Ancient Egypt, Far Far Away, and more. From adrenaline rushes to family fun, it\\u2019s a day full of unforgettable movie magic.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure to Kuala Lumpur by Coach\",\"date\":\"05-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from Hotel Mi Rochor and board your coach for a scenic journey to Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel and relax for a while. In the evening, head out for a vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"432\\\" data-start=\\\"405\\\">Kuala Lumpur Night Tour<\\/strong>, exploring the illuminated city landmarks and local culture. The highlight of the evening will be a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"575\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\">KL Tower Observation Deck<\\/strong>, offering panoramic night views of the dazzling Kuala Lumpur skyline.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Genting Highlands Day Tour via Batu Caves + Two-Way Cable Car\",\"date\":\"06-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"1897\\\" data-start=\\\"1859\\\">full-day tour to Genting Highlands<\\/strong>. En route, visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1940\\\" data-start=\\\"1926\\\">Batu Caves<\\/strong>, a Hindu temple set in a limestone hill. Later, enjoy a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"2030\\\" data-start=\\\"2004\\\">two-way cable car ride<\\/strong> to Genting, where you can explore the SkyWorlds theme park, casinos, and shopping options. Return to Kuala Lumpur in the evening.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping & Departure\",\"date\":\"07-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, the day is free for <strong data-end=\\\"2274\\\" data-start=\\\"2242\\\">shopping at your own leisure<\\/strong> \\u2013 explore malls like Pavilion, Suria KLCC, or Berjaya Times Square. Later, check out and transfer to the airport for your return flight, taking back wonderful memories from your Singapore-Malaysia journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7235\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"23119\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1015\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kualalumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Air Asia\",\"fno\":\"65\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Dec 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"21560\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7561\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Dec 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"9535\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"One Farrer Hotel\",\"room_type\":\"Mint Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"05\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"67800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KUALALUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Pullman Kuala Lumpur City Centre Hotel & Residences\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"16200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare Ranchi-Kolkata-Singapore-Kuala Lumpur-Kolkata-Ranchi<em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><em><strong>20 Kgs Check-in Baggage Per Pax&nbsp;</strong>for Air Asia Flights&nbsp;<strong>KUL-CCU.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers&nbsp;- PVT</strong><b>&nbsp;Basis.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>One Farrer Hotel</strong>, Singapore.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>Pullman Kuala Lumpur City Centre Hotel &amp; Residences</strong>, Kualalumpur.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore Guided City Tour&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Universal Studios&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Sentosa Island -&nbsp;</strong>Cable Car + WOT + Oceanarium + Sky Helix&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><b>Night Safari&nbsp;</b>(Complimentary Animal Show + Tram Ride)</li>\n	<li><strong>Gardens by the Bay -&nbsp;Flower Dome</strong> (Including Impressions of Monet: The Experience) + <strong>Cloud Forest&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Bay Sands</strong> SkyPark Observation Deck</li>\n	<li><strong>Full-Day Genting Tour </strong>with En-Route Batucaves + Two-Way Cable Car.</li>\n	<li><strong>Kuala Lumpur Night Tour</strong> with KL Tower Observation Deck.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>01 Coach Ticket Singapore- Kualalumpur.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong><em>All Tours on SIC (Seat in Coach) basis</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Malaysia &amp; Singapore Visa</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":54214,\"hotel_cost\":84000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"7500\",\"land_cost\":\"58380\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"KUL LAND\",\"amount\":\"18800\"},{\"name\":\"Singapore Hotel Refundable Diff\",\"amount\":6178},{\"name\":\"KUL Hotel Refundable Diff (Cancellable till 25 Nov)\",\"amount\":1980}],\"cost_price\":231052,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 41589.36\",\"selling_price\":272641.359999999986030161380767822265625}', 'MZQ/0705/072025', 276958, 138479, 117954, '2025-07-30 10:17:38', '2025-11-18 08:16:05', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(718, 'Mr TBA x 09', 'Basudeb Auto', '7903323272', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GOA', '2025-09-09', 3, 0, 9, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Goa & Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"09-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Goa and proceed to your hotel for check-in. Spend the rest of the day at leisure \\u2014 relax at the property, enjoy the nearby beach, or explore the local markets and cafes depending on your arrival time. Soak in the laid-back vibe that Goa is famous for. <strong data-end=\\\"452\\\" data-start=\\\"426\\\">Overnight stay in Goa.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure (Self Exploration)\",\"date\":\"10-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"845\\\" data-start=\\\"510\\\">Today is free for you to explore Goa at your own pace. Whether you prefer lounging on a beach, renting a bike to cruise through coconut-lined roads, caf\\u00e9 hopping, or shopping in flea markets, the day is yours to design. You can also opt for optional water sports or a sunset cruise (on direct payment basis). <strong data-end=\\\"845\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\">Overnight stay in Goa.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North Goa Sightseeing Tour\",\"date\":\"11-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"957\\\" data-start=\\\"927\\\">North Goa sightseeing tour<\\/strong>. Visit iconic spots such as <strong data-end=\\\"1001\\\" data-start=\\\"986\\\">Fort Aguada<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1022\\\" data-start=\\\"1003\\\">Calangute Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1038\\\" data-start=\\\"1024\\\">Baga Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"1040\\\">Anjuna Beach<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1074\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\">Candolim<\\/strong>. Soak in the coastal beauty, explore beachside shacks, and enjoy some light shopping or water activities. Return to the hotel in the evening. <strong data-end=\\\"1243\\\" data-start=\\\"1217\\\">Overnight stay in Goa.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Goa\",\"date\":\"12-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Depending on your departure schedule, you can enjoy a quick stroll at the beach or shop for last-minute souvenirs. Transfer to the airport or railway station for your onward journey, bidding goodbye to the beautiful state of Goa.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-398\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"59019\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Mopa (GOX)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-6682\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Mopa (GOX)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-6973\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"62034\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-186\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"09\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Bloomrooms @Calangute 3*\",\"city\":\"NORTH GOA\",\"room_type\":\"Value Room + 01 Standard Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"38400\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Bloomrooms @Calangute.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03 Double</strong> Value Rooms &amp; <strong>01 Double </strong>Standard Room + <strong>01 Extra Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of the Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi is available to all in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>Half Day North Goa Sightseeing on PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>RoundTrip Airport Transfers on PVT.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by <strong>13 Seater AC Tempo Traveller.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"24\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":121053,\"hotel_cost\":\"29465\",\"transport_cost\":\"14500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":165018,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39604.32\",\"selling_price\":204622.3200000000069849193096160888671875}', 'MZQ/0707/072025', 204210, 22690, 23600, '2025-07-31 11:10:02', '2025-09-01 12:32:42', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(719, 'Dr R K Maroo', 'BNI', '9234640525', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-09-26', 6, 0, 11, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Abu Dhabi \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"26-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"181\\\" data-start=\\\"146\\\">Abu Dhabi International Airport<\\/strong>, complete immigration formalities, and meet our local representative who will assist with your transfer to the hotel. Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"351\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Park Inn by Radisson Yas Island<\\/strong>, check in and unwind after your journey. The rest of the day is free at leisure to rest and recover.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"455\\\" data-start=\\\"452\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"511\\\" data-start=\\\"459\\\">Overnight at Hotel Park Inn by Radisson Yas Island<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"511\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"518\\\">Meals: None<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day at SeaWorld Abu Dhabi\",\"date\":\"27-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full day at the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"612\\\" data-start=\\\"590\\\">SeaWorld Abu Dhabi<\\/strong>, the region\'s largest marine theme park. Explore eight immersive realms featuring marine creatures, interactive exhibits, thrilling rides, and world-class shows. A perfect blend of fun, education, and awe-inspiring ocean experiences awaits. Return to the hotel by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"888\\\" data-start=\\\"885\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"938\\\" data-start=\\\"892\\\">Overnight at Park Inn by Radisson Yas Island<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"941\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"963\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\">Meals: Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ferrari World + Abu Dhabi City Tour + BAPS Temple + Transfer to Dubai\",\"date\":\"28-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"120\\\" data-start=\\\"75\\\">After breakfast, check out and head to <strong data-end=\\\"1123\\\" data-start=\\\"1096\\\">Ferrari World Abu Dhabi<\\/strong> to enjoy the world\\u2019s fastest roller coaster, Formula Rossa, along with various adrenaline-pumping rides and Ferrari-themed attractions. Later, embark on an <strong data-end=\\\"1303\\\" data-start=\\\"1280\\\">Abu Dhabi city tour<\\/strong>, visiting landmarks like the <strong data-end=\\\"1345\\\" data-start=\\\"1333\\\">Corniche<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1367\\\" data-start=\\\"1347\\\">Heritage Village<\\/strong>, and photo stops at Emirates Palace. En route to Dubai, visit the newly opened <strong data-end=\\\"1468\\\" data-start=\\\"1447\\\">BAPS Hindu Temple<\\/strong>, a spiritual and architectural marvel. Continue your journey to <strong data-end=\\\"1542\\\" data-start=\\\"1533\\\">Dubai<\\/strong> and check-in at <strong data-end=\\\"1591\\\" data-start=\\\"1559\\\">Hotel Royal Ascot, Bur Dubai<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"120\\\" data-start=\\\"75\\\"><br data-end=\\\"1595\\\" data-start=\\\"1592\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1638\\\" data-start=\\\"1599\\\">Overnight at Royal Ascot Hotel, Dubai<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"1641\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1663\\\" data-start=\\\"1645\\\">Meals: Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Atlantis Aquaventure & Lost Chambers Aquarium\",\"date\":\"29-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"512\\\" data-start=\\\"132\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"181\\\" data-start=\\\"160\\\">Atlantis The Palm<\\/strong> for a thrilling day at <strong data-end=\\\"230\\\" data-start=\\\"205\\\">Aquaventure Waterpark<\\/strong>, one of the largest and most exciting waterparks in the region. Enjoy high-speed slides, lazy rivers, and beachside relaxation. Later, explore the enchanting <strong data-end=\\\"415\\\" data-start=\\\"389\\\">Lost Chambers Aquarium<\\/strong>, home to over 65,000 marine animals and designed to resemble the mythical lost city of Atlantis.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"582\\\" data-start=\\\"514\\\"><br data-end=\\\"2119\\\" data-start=\\\"2116\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2162\\\" data-start=\\\"2123\\\">Overnight at Royal Ascot Hotel, Dubai<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2165\\\" data-start=\\\"2162\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2187\\\" data-start=\\\"2169\\\">Meals: Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Museum of the Future + Dubai Frame + Dhow Cruise\",\"date\":\"30-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"2317\\\" data-start=\\\"2293\\\">Museum of the Future<\\/strong>, where innovation and imagination come alive in futuristic exhibits and immersive technology. Next, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"2443\\\" data-start=\\\"2428\\\">Dubai Frame<\\/strong> for panoramic views of Old and New Dubai. In the evening, enjoy a relaxing <strong data-end=\\\"2534\\\" data-start=\\\"2519\\\">Dhow Cruise<\\/strong> with buffet dinner along the Dubai Creek, featuring live music and traditional entertainment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"2631\\\" data-start=\\\"2628\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2674\\\" data-start=\\\"2635\\\">Overnight at Royal Ascot Hotel, Dubai<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2677\\\" data-start=\\\"2674\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2707\\\" data-start=\\\"2681\\\">Meals: Breakfast, Dinner<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner & Entertainment\",\"date\":\"01-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"121\\\" data-start=\\\"69\\\">Spend the morning at leisure or explore&nbsp;the city at your own pace. Visit malls, souks, or relax. In the afternoon, embark on a thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"2864\\\" data-start=\\\"2847\\\">Desert Safari<\\/strong>. Enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"2888\\\" data-start=\\\"2872\\\">dune bashing<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2906\\\" data-start=\\\"2890\\\">camel riding<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2924\\\" data-start=\\\"2908\\\">sandboarding<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2948\\\" data-start=\\\"2930\\\">henna painting<\\/strong> in a traditional desert camp. In the evening, feast on a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3016\\\">BBQ dinner<\\/strong> accompanied by <strong data-end=\\\"3057\\\" data-start=\\\"3046\\\">Tanoura<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3074\\\" data-start=\\\"3059\\\">belly dance<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"3101\\\" data-start=\\\"3080\\\">fire performances<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"121\\\" data-start=\\\"69\\\"><br data-end=\\\"3105\\\" data-start=\\\"3102\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3148\\\" data-start=\\\"3109\\\">Overnight at Royal Ascot Hotel, Dubai<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"3151\\\" data-start=\\\"3148\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3181\\\" data-start=\\\"3155\\\">Meals: Breakfast, Dinner<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour & Departure\",\"date\":\"02-10-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"627\\\" data-start=\\\"119\\\">Begin your day with a <strong data-end=\\\"176\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\">half-day guided Dubai city tour<\\/strong>, covering renowned attractions such as <strong data-end=\\\"235\\\" data-start=\\\"216\\\">Jumeirah Mosque<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"253\\\" data-start=\\\"237\\\">Burj Al Arab<\\/strong> (photo stop), <strong data-end=\\\"285\\\" data-start=\\\"268\\\">Palm Jumeirah<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"308\\\" data-start=\\\"287\\\">Atlantis The Palm<\\/strong> (photo stop), and a scenic drive through <strong data-end=\\\"366\\\" data-start=\\\"350\\\">Dubai Marina<\\/strong>. In the afternoon, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">Dubai Mall<\\/strong> for some last-minute shopping or sightseeing. By <strong data-end=\\\"471\\\" data-start=\\\"460\\\">4:00 PM<\\/strong>, return to the hotel to collect your luggage and proceed to the airport for your onward journey, carrying unforgettable memories of your <strong data-end=\\\"626\\\" data-start=\\\"609\\\">UAE adventure<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"699\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"674\\\" data-start=\\\"633\\\">Check-out from Royal Ascot Hotel, Dubai<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"677\\\" data-start=\\\"674\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"699\\\" data-start=\\\"681\\\">Meals: Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-6654\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Sep 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"146579\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:40 PM\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1431\",\"to\":\"Abu Dhabi (AUH)\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Sep 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"12:25 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1466\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"158205\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-421\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Park Inn by Radisson Yas Island\",\"city\":\"ABU DHABI\",\"rate\":\"181223\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Plaza View\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"02\\/10\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":5,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Ascot Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"104000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"458\" data-start=\"179\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"182\">Return Airfare</strong> from Ranchi<br data-end=\"215\" data-start=\"212\" />\n🏨 <strong data-end=\"245\" data-start=\"218\">02 Nights Accommodation</strong> at <em data-end=\"277\" data-start=\"249\">Hotel Park Inn by Radisson</em>, Yas Island (Abu Dhabi)<br data-end=\"304\" data-start=\"301\" />\n🏨 <strong data-end=\"334\" data-start=\"307\">04 Nights Accommodation</strong> at <em data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"338\">Hotel Royal Ascot</em>, Bur Dubai (Dubai)<br data-end=\"379\" data-start=\"376\" />\n🍽️ <strong data-end=\"402\" data-start=\"383\">Daily Breakfast</strong> at the hotel<br data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"415\" />\n🚗 <strong data-end=\"458\" data-start=\"421\">Two-Way Private Airport Transfers</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"714\" data-start=\"460\">🏙️ <strong>Atlantis</strong>&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"498\">Aquaventure Water Park &amp; Lost Chamber</strong><br data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"545\" />\n🏜️ <strong data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"552\">Premium Desert Safari</strong> with BBQ Dinner &amp; Live Shows<br data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"606\" />\n⛵ <strong data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"611\">Deluxe Marina Dhow Cruise Dinner</strong><br data-end=\"650\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"647\" />\n🏛️ <strong data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"654\">Museum of the Future</strong> Entry<br data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"684\" />\n🖼️ <strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"691\">Dubai Frame</strong> Entry</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"714\" data-start=\"460\">🚌 <strong data-end=\"491\" data-start=\"463\">Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"826\" data-start=\"716\">🚘 <strong data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"719\">Abu Dhabi City Tour</strong> including<br data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"752\" />\n  – 🎢 Entry to <em data-end=\"786\" data-start=\"771\">Ferrari World</em><br data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"786\" />\n  – 🛕 Visit to <em data-end=\"824\" data-start=\"805\">BAPS Hindu Temple</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"828\">🐬 <strong data-end=\"872\" data-start=\"831\">Full Day Access to SeaWorld Abu Dhabi</strong><br data-end=\"875\" data-start=\"872\" />\n🚐 <strong data-end=\"903\" data-start=\"878\">All Tours &amp; Transfers</strong> on <strong data-end=\"924\" data-start=\"907\">Private Basis</strong><br data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"924\" />\n🛂 <strong data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"930\">Dubai Visa Included</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"23\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":304784,\"hotel_cost\":285223,\"land_cost\":\"242100\",\"visa_cost\":\"72600\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":904707,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 208082.61\",\"selling_price\":1112789.6099999998696148395538330078125}', 'MZQ/0708/082025', 1117490, 101590, 0, '2025-08-01 05:59:34', '2025-09-12 13:31:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(720, 'Mr. Vikram Sharma', 'BNI | Explorers', '7004518369', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'JAIPUR', '2025-08-28', 3, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ranchi \\u2708\\ufe0f Jaipur (Arrival)\",\"date\":\"28-08-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Depart from Ranchi Airport for Jaipur. Upon arrival at night, transfer to your hotel. Check-in and relax after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong data-end=\\\"320\\\" data-start=\\\"292\\\">Overnight stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Khatu Shyam Ji\",\"date\":\"29-08-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, proceed (without breakfast) for a spiritual visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"477\\\" data-start=\\\"448\\\">famous Khatu Shyam Temple<\\/strong>, one of the most revered pilgrimage sites in Rajasthan. Explore nearby attractions and return to Jaipur by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong data-end=\\\"626\\\" data-start=\\\"598\\\">Overnight stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur Sightseeing + Chokhi Dhani Experience\",\"date\":\"30-08-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a full-day tour of <strong data-end=\\\"755\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\">Jaipur<\\/strong>, covering iconic landmarks such as <strong data-end=\\\"849\\\" data-start=\\\"791\\\">Amber Fort, Hawa Mahal, Jantar Mantar, and City Palace<\\/strong>.In the evening, enjoy the vibrant cultural evening at <strong data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\">Chokhi Dhani<\\/strong>, where you will experience Rajasthani folk dances, music, and traditional cuisine. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong data-end=\\\"1079\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\">Overnight stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2708\\ufe0f Ranchi (Departure)\",\"date\":\"31-08-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to Jaipur Airport for your return flight to Ranchi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>\\u201cWith the divine blessings of Lord Khatu Shyam Ji, this journey concludes \\u2014 and you return back with long-lasting, unforgettable memories.\\u201d<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2219\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"19113\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Jaipur (JAI)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2042\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Jaipur (JAI)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"207\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"19877\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6152\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Aug 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Aug 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"JAIPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ramada by Wyndham\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"31\\/08\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"13700\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Hotel Ramada by Wyndham at JAIPUR.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing &amp; tour </strong>by Swift Dzire / Similar <strong>on PVT basis<em>.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"19\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":38990,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":13700,\"transport_cost\":\"8000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":60690,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11531.1\",\"selling_price\":72221.10000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0709/082025', 72481, 29532, 13417, '2025-08-01 07:15:17', '2025-08-16 08:29:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(721, 'Mr. Kumar Sushant', 'BNI E Aditya', '8540056535', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2025-11-30', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"30-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"01-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"02-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"03-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"04-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"05-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony palms Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"03\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sands Beach Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"04\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at given hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"55598\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":55598,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 8339.7\",\"selling_price\":63937.699999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0710/082025', 63960, 31980, 12480, '2025-08-02 08:07:01', '2025-08-02 08:07:01', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(722, 'Mr Manoj Arya', 'BNI', '9709100140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL GUJARAT', '2025-11-24', 5, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ahmedabad (Motera) \\u2192 Dwarka\",\"date\":\"24-11-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start your journey early from Ahmedabad (Motera) towards Dwarka (approx. 450 km \\/ 8 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"512\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, check in at your hotel and relax.<br data-end=\\\"560\\\" data-start=\\\"557\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"608\\\" data-start=\\\"586\\\">Dwarkadhish Temple<\\/strong> to attend the <strong data-end=\\\"632\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\">Aarti<\\/strong> and spend time at <strong data-end=\\\"665\\\" data-start=\\\"651\\\">Gomti Ghat<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"669\\\" data-start=\\\"666\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at Dwarka.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dwarka Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"25-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"811\\\" data-start=\\\"768\\\">After breakfast, proceed for sightseeing:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"990\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"841\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"841\\\" data-start=\\\"814\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"828\\\" data-start=\\\"814\\\">Bet Dwarka<\\/strong> (by ferry)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"878\\\" data-start=\\\"842\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"878\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"876\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\">Nageshwar Jyotirlinga Temple<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"990\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"990\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"904\\\" data-start=\\\"881\\\">Rukmini Devi Temple<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"907\\\" data-start=\\\"904\\\" \\/>\\n\\tEvening free for leisure or local market exploration.<br data-end=\\\"963\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\" \\/>\\n\\tOvernight stay at Dwarka.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dwarka \\u2192 Somnath \\u2192 Diu\",\"date\":\"26-11-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to Somnath (approx. 240 km \\/ 5 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"1127\\\" data-start=\\\"1124\\\" \\/>\\nVisit <strong data-end=\\\"1151\\\" data-start=\\\"1133\\\">Somnath Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1171\\\" data-start=\\\"1153\\\">Triveni Sangam<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1193\\\" data-start=\\\"1177\\\">Bhalka Tirth<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1197\\\" data-start=\\\"1194\\\" \\/>\\nLater continue your journey to Diu (approx. 90 km \\/ 2 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"1259\\\" data-start=\\\"1256\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at Diu.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Diu \\u2192 Sasan Gir\",\"date\":\"27-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1398\\\" data-start=\\\"1349\\\">Morning after breakfast, enjoy Diu sightseeing:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1399\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1399\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\">Diu Fort<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1430\\\" data-start=\\\"1415\\\">Naida Caves<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1453\\\" data-start=\\\"1432\\\">St. Paul\\u2019s Church<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1474\\\" data-start=\\\"1459\\\">Nagoa Beach<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1477\\\" data-start=\\\"1474\\\" \\/>\\n\\tPost lunch, drive to Sasan Gir (approx. 120 km \\/ 3 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"1536\\\" data-start=\\\"1533\\\" \\/>\\n\\tOvernight stay at Sasan Gir.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gir Jungle Safari & Drive to Vadodara\",\"date\":\"28-11-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1702\\\" data-start=\\\"1681\\\">Gir Jungle Safari<\\/strong> (at own cost).<br data-end=\\\"1720\\\" data-start=\\\"1717\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to the resort for breakfast and later drive to Vadodara (approx. 375 km \\/ 7 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"1811\\\" data-start=\\\"1808\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at Vadodara.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Vadodara \\u2192 Statue of Unity \\u2192 Ahmedabad (Motera)\",\"date\":\"29-11-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Afternoon, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1993\\\" data-start=\\\"1964\\\">Statue of Unity (Kevadia)<\\/strong> (approx. 90 km \\/ 2 hrs).<br data-end=\\\"2021\\\" data-start=\\\"2018\\\" \\/>\\nVisit the <strong data-end=\\\"2050\\\" data-start=\\\"2031\\\">Statue of Unity<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2073\\\" data-start=\\\"2052\\\">Valley of Flowers<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2101\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\">Sardar Sarovar Dam<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2105\\\" data-start=\\\"2102\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, proceed to Ahmedabad (approx. 200 km \\/ 4 hrs) for your onward journey.<br data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-start=\\\"2191\\\" \\/>\\nTour concludes with beautiful memories of Gujarat!<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/11\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel VITS Devbhumi\",\"city\":\"DWARKA\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"25200\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Praveg Beach Resort Diu Ghoghla Beach\",\"city\":\"DIU\",\"room_type\":\"Royal Cottage Sea View\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"22500\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"SASAN GIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Vanveda Resort by Nirvana\",\"room_type\":\"Vanveda Cottages\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"16500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavaila