 Twin Sharing.</li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu Breakfast.</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfers by <strong>07 Seater AC Innova Crysta.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Safari Jeep + Naturalist Cost to be paid directly @Jungle Safari</li>\n	<li>Any personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"45\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":64200,\"transport_cost\":\"41000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Statue of Unity Entry Tickets\",\"amount\":\"2280\"},{\"name\":\"GIR SAFARI PERMIT\",\"amount\":800}],\"cost_price\":108280,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 48726\",\"selling_price\":157006}', 'MZQ/0711/082025', 156948, 26158, 0, '2025-08-02 13:18:01', '2025-11-07 06:15:25', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(723, 'Mr. Rahul Sinha', 'BNI CELEB', '7320031162', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BADRINATH DHAM 4*', '2025-09-19', 4, 2, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Dehradun \\u2013 Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"19-09-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After checking out from your hotel, proceed to Dehradun. Post check-in and a bit of rest, enjoy a half-day local sightseeing tour. Explore <strong data-end=\\\"376\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\">Paltan Bazaar<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"396\\\" data-start=\\\"378\\\">Tibetan Market<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"417\\\" data-start=\\\"402\\\">Ghanta Ghar<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Dehradun.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dehradun \\u2192 Badrinath\",\"date\":\"20-09-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"575\\\" data-start=\\\"559\\\">Badrinath Ji<\\/strong>, one of India\\u2019s most sacred Char Dham pilgrimage sites. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel, relax, and enjoy a peaceful evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Dinner and overnight stay in Badrinath.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day in Badrinath\",\"date\":\"21-09-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today is dedicated to spiritual exploration in <strong data-end=\\\"898\\\" data-start=\\\"885\\\">Badrinath<\\/strong>. Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"937\\\" data-start=\\\"917\\\">Badrinath Temple<\\/strong>, nestled between the Nar and Narayan mountain ranges and beneath the <strong data-end=\\\"1025\\\" data-start=\\\"1007\\\">Neelkanth Peak<\\/strong>. Experience the serene vibes of <strong data-end=\\\"1074\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\">Vishal Badri<\\/strong>, the largest among the five Badris.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Badrinath.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Badrinath \\u2192 Haridwar\",\"date\":\"22-09-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p><strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1224\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> 312 km | <strong data-end=\\\"1263\\\" data-start=\\\"1247\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> Approx. 9 hrs 36 mins<br data-end=\\\"1288\\\" data-start=\\\"1285\\\" \\/>\\nAfter breakfast, check out and begin your drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1351\\\" data-start=\\\"1339\\\">Haridwar<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, check into your hotel. In the evening, attend the mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"1460\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Ganga Aarti at Har Ki Pauri<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Haridwar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Haridwar \\u2192 Delhi (Drop)\",\"date\":\"23-09-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1627\\\" data-start=\\\"1618\\\">Delhi<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>The tour concludes with beautiful memories of the Himalayan pilgrimage and sacred riverside rituals.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2219\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:15 PM\",\"fare\":54664},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dehradun (DED)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6582\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:05 PM\",\"fare\":41584}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Clarks Inn\",\"city\":\"Dehradun\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Rooms\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"21000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vijay Lord\'s palace Badrinath Luxury\",\"city\":\"Badrinath\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Rooms\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"54000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"22\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Haridwar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Godwin\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Rooms\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"21200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ranchi-Delhi-Dehradun&nbsp;&amp; Delhi-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Clarks Inn&nbsp; at Dehradun.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Vijay Lord\'s palace Badrinath Luxury at Badrinath.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in Well-Appointed Air-Conditioned Room at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Lakhdatar at KHATU.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>&amp;&nbsp;<b>Dinner </b>at&nbsp;all <b>Hotels.</b></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all our in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Sightseeing &amp; tour </strong>by <strong>Urbania / Similar</strong> on <strong>PVT basis<em>.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":96248,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":96200,\"transport_cost\":\"60000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":252448,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 30293.76\",\"selling_price\":282741.76000000000931322574615478515625}', 'MZQ/0712/082025', 282540, 42540, 13650, '2025-08-05 08:28:32', '2025-08-05 10:58:42', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(724, 'Mr Santosh', 'Garhwa', '9386910416', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BALI', '2025-11-16', 4, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Bali \\u2013 Transfer to Karma Kandara\",\"date\":\"16-11-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"413\\\">Ngurah Rai International Airport<\\/strong>, meet our local representative. Receive a warm welcome with a <strong data-end=\\\"542\\\" data-start=\\\"512\\\">traditional flower garland<\\/strong> and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"583\\\" data-start=\\\"555\\\">refreshing coconut drink<\\/strong>. Transfer to your luxury stay at <strong data-end=\\\"634\\\" data-start=\\\"617\\\">Karma Kandara<\\/strong>. Check-in at 15:00 hrs and enjoy the rest of the day at leisure.<br data-end=\\\"702\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\">Meals<\\/strong>: None<br data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"717\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"733\\\" data-start=\\\"720\\\">Overnight<\\/strong>: Karma Kandara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Water Sports & Uluwatu Sunset with Kecak Dance\",\"date\":\"17-11-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"915\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\">After breakfast, depart at 10:00 AM for an adventurous day at <strong data-end=\\\"907\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\">Tanjung Benoa Beach<\\/strong>. Enjoy:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1051\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"963\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"963\\\" data-start=\\\"918\\\">A <strong data-end=\\\"963\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\">Glass Bottom Boat ride to Turtle Island<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1051\\\" data-start=\\\"964\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1051\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\">1 round of Banana Boat ride<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1000\\\" data-start=\\\"997\\\" \\/>\\n\\t(Other water sports available at personal expense.)<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1351\\\" data-start=\\\"1053\\\">In the evening, visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"1104\\\" data-start=\\\"1086\\\">Uluwatu Temple<\\/strong>, perched on a cliff overlooking the Indian Ocean. Witness the mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"1206\\\" data-start=\\\"1179\\\">Kecak Dance performance<\\/strong> during sunset (Session 1: 18:00\\u201319:00 or Session 2: 19:00\\u201320:00, subject to availability).<br data-end=\\\"1300\\\" data-start=\\\"1297\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1309\\\" data-start=\\\"1300\\\">Meals<\\/strong>: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1323\\\" data-start=\\\"1320\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1336\\\" data-start=\\\"1323\\\">Overnight<\\/strong>: Karma Kandara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bali Safari Park & Tegenungan Waterfall\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1537\\\" data-start=\\\"1418\\\">After breakfast, depart at 08:30 AM for a day at <strong data-end=\\\"1496\\\" data-start=\\\"1467\\\">Bali Safari &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong> with a <strong data-end=\\\"1526\\\" data-start=\\\"1504\\\">Jungle Hopper Pass<\\/strong> including:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1615\\\" data-start=\\\"1538\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1558\\\" data-start=\\\"1538\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1558\\\" data-start=\\\"1540\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1558\\\" data-start=\\\"1540\\\">Safari Journey<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1559\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1561\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1561\\\">Animal Show<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1595\\\" data-start=\\\"1577\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1595\\\" data-start=\\\"1579\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1595\\\" data-start=\\\"1579\\\">Big Cat Show<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1615\\\" data-start=\\\"1596\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1615\\\" data-start=\\\"1598\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1615\\\" data-start=\\\"1598\\\">Elephant Show<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1801\\\" data-start=\\\"1617\\\">Post-safari, visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"1673\\\" data-start=\\\"1649\\\">Tegenungan Waterfall<\\/strong>, ideal for photos and a nature walk. Return to your hotel in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1750\\\" data-start=\\\"1747\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1759\\\" data-start=\\\"1750\\\">Meals<\\/strong>: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1773\\\" data-start=\\\"1770\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1786\\\" data-start=\\\"1773\\\">Overnight<\\/strong>: Karma Kandara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kintamani Volcano, Ubud & Rice Terraces\",\"date\":\"19-11-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1942\\\" data-start=\\\"1868\\\">After breakfast, head out at 08:30 AM for a full-day cultural tour. Visit:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"2322\\\" data-start=\\\"1943\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2025\\\" data-start=\\\"1943\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2025\\\" data-start=\\\"1945\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1969\\\" data-start=\\\"1945\\\">Kintamani View Point<\\/strong> for panoramic views of <strong data-end=\\\"2008\\\" data-start=\\\"1993\\\">Mount Batur<\\/strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\\\"2025\\\" data-start=\\\"2011\\\">Lake Batur<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2086\\\" data-start=\\\"2026\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2086\\\" data-start=\\\"2028\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2049\\\" data-start=\\\"2028\\\">Coffee Plantation<\\/strong> for traditional Luwak coffee tasting<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2146\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2146\\\" data-start=\\\"2089\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2116\\\" data-start=\\\"2089\\\">Tegalalang Rice Terrace<\\/strong> \\u2013 known for its scenic beauty<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2322\\\" data-start=\\\"2147\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2322\\\" data-start=\\\"2149\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2170\\\" data-start=\\\"2149\\\">Ubud Royal Palace<\\/strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\\\"2192\\\" data-start=\\\"2173\\\">Ubud Art Market<\\/strong> for cultural immersion and local shopping<br data-end=\\\"2237\\\" data-start=\\\"2234\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to the hotel by evening.<br data-end=\\\"2271\\\" data-start=\\\"2268\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"2280\\\" data-start=\\\"2271\\\">Meals<\\/strong>: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2294\\\" data-start=\\\"2291\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"2307\\\" data-start=\\\"2294\\\">Overnight<\\/strong>: Karma Kandara<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bali\",\"date\":\"20-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your breakfast and spend your free time at leisure until your <strong data-end=\\\"2467\\\" data-start=\\\"2437\\\">scheduled airport transfer<\\/strong>. Depart Bali with unforgettable memories.<br data-end=\\\"2512\\\" data-start=\\\"2509\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2521\\\" data-start=\\\"2512\\\">Meals<\\/strong>: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2535\\\" data-start=\\\"2532\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2554\\\" data-start=\\\"2535\\\">End of Services<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"75000\",\"hotel_cost\":0,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":75000,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15000\",\"selling_price\":90000}', 'MZQ/0713/082025', 90720, 15120, 4950, '2025-08-05 10:36:40', '2025-08-15 05:19:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(725, 'Mr Dewanshu x 03', 'BNI Josh', '9973737422', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-08-22', 7, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Origin\",\"date\":\"22-08-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Your dream getaway to Thailand begins today! Board your international flight from your home city and get ready for a journey filled with golden temples, turquoise waters, and endless tropical charm. Sit back, relax, and let the excitement build as you head toward the Land of Smiles.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Touch down in <strong data-end=\\\"791\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> around midnight and transfer to your hotel for some well-deserved rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"1087\\\" data-start=\\\"1069\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Bangkok \\u2013 City at Leisure\",\"date\":\"23-08-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Wake up to a delicious breakfast and spend the day relaxing at your own pace. You may choose to explore Bangkok\\u2019s vibrant street markets, try authentic Thai street food, or simply unwind at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1069\\\" data-start=\\\"1066\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1087\\\" data-start=\\\"1069\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok to Phuket \\u2013 Welcome to Paradise\",\"date\":\"24-08-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1161\\\">After breakfast, check out and head to the airport for your short flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1247\\\" data-start=\\\"1237\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s crown jewel of beach destinations.<br data-end=\\\"1297\\\" data-start=\\\"1294\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival, check into your hotel and enjoy the evening at leisure. Take a stroll along Patong Beach or enjoy Phuket\\u2019s bustling night markets.<br data-end=\\\"1444\\\" data-start=\\\"1441\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1462\\\" data-start=\\\"1444\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Adventure by Catamaran\",\"date\":\"25-08-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set off for a <strong data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1564\\\">full-day Phi Phi Island Tour by Catamaran<\\/strong> \\u2013 one of Thailand\\u2019s most iconic experiences.<br data-end=\\\"1657\\\" data-start=\\\"1654\\\" \\/>\\nSail across the sparkling Andaman Sea, stop for swimming and snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and enjoy a delicious lunch on board. Marvel at Maya Bay (famous from the movie <em data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-start=\\\"1834\\\">The Beach<\\/em>), relax on white sandy shores, and soak in postcard-perfect scenery.<br data-end=\\\"1917\\\" data-start=\\\"1914\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1935\\\" data-start=\\\"1917\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Yona Floating Beach Club \\u2013 Sunset Extravaganza\",\"date\":\"26-08-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, prepare for a luxurious experience like no other \\u2013 the <strong data-end=\\\"2111\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">Yona Sunset Day Pass<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2115\\\" data-start=\\\"2112\\\" \\/>\\nYona is a floating beach club in the middle of the sea, offering a pool, sun decks, cocktails, music, and uninterrupted views of the horizon. As the sun dips into the ocean, capture breathtaking memories with golden hues reflecting over the waves.<br data-end=\\\"2365\\\" data-start=\\\"2362\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2383\\\" data-start=\\\"2365\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket to Krabi \\u2013 Scenic Transfer\",\"date\":\"27-08-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2518\\\" data-start=\\\"2489\\\">private transfer to Krabi<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2519\\\" \\/>\\nThis picturesque journey takes you through lush landscapes and coastal views. Upon arrival, check into your hotel and relax. Spend the evening exploring Ao Nang\\u2019s charming shops and beachfront restaurants.<br data-end=\\\"2730\\\" data-start=\\\"2727\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2748\\\" data-start=\\\"2730\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Krabi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"4 Island Tour\",\"date\":\"28-08-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"138\\\" data-start=\\\"112\\\">4 Island Tour in Krabi<\\/strong> by speedboat. Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"200\\\" data-start=\\\"176\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach<\\/strong> with its dramatic limestone cliffs, discover the unique rock formation of <strong data-end=\\\"293\\\" data-start=\\\"275\\\">Chicken Island<\\/strong>, relax on the powdery white sands of <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\">Poda Island<\\/strong>, and enjoy snorkeling in the crystal-clear waters around <strong data-end=\\\"418\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">Tup Island<\\/strong>. A delicious <strong data-end=\\\"441\\\" data-start=\\\"432\\\">lunch<\\/strong> will be served during the tour. In the evening, return to the hotel, freshen up, and later check out. Proceed to Krabi Airport for your onward flight, carrying unforgettable memories of Thailand.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"2748\\\" data-start=\\\"2730\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Krabi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Farewell Thailand\",\"date\":\"29-08-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your final breakfast in paradise.<br data-end=\\\"2840\\\" data-start=\\\"2837\\\" \\/>\\nCheck out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2883\\\" data-start=\\\"2866\\\">Krabi Airport<\\/strong> for your return flight, carrying home unforgettable memories of Thailand\\u2019s islands, sunsets, and warm hospitality.<br data-end=\\\"3001\\\" data-start=\\\"2998\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3016\\\" data-start=\\\"3001\\\">End of Tour<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/08\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Grand Mercure Bangkok Atrium\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"15179\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"27\\/08\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Grand Mercure Phuket Patong\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"50192\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/08\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/08\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deevana Plaza Krabi Aonang\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"17928\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hot