(727, 'Ms Arushi', 'Shashi Dhar US', '9660803366', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-11-27', 3, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai \\u2013 Visit Museum of the Future\",\"date\":\"27-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"355\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"187\\\">Dubai International Airport<\\/strong>, where you will be warmly welcomed and transferred to your hotel. After check-in, take some time to rest and refresh after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"565\\\" data-start=\\\"357\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"369\\\" data-start=\\\"357\\\">Evening:<\\/strong> Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"418\\\" data-start=\\\"387\\\">Museum of the Future (MoTF)<\\/strong> \\u2013 a visionary architectural marvel that showcases cutting-edge innovations and futuristic concepts across science, technology, and sustainability.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"644\\\" data-start=\\\"567\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"590\\\" data-start=\\\"571\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Dubai<br data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"596\\\" \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Miracle Garden Visit & Premium Desert Safari\",\"date\":\"28-11-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"196\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\">Start your day with a delicious breakfast at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"382\\\" data-start=\\\"198\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"210\\\" data-start=\\\"198\\\">Morning:<\\/strong> Visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"258\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong>, home to over 150 million blooming flowers arranged in stunning designs and sculptures \\u2014 a truly magical floral experience.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"760\\\" data-start=\\\"384\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"409\\\" data-start=\\\"384\\\">Afternoon to Evening:<\\/strong> Embark on an unforgettable <strong data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"437\\\">Premium Desert Safari<\\/strong>. Experience the thrill of <strong data-end=\\\"505\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">dune bashing<\\/strong>, enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"528\\\" data-start=\\\"513\\\">camel rides<\\/strong>, try <strong data-end=\\\"552\\\" data-start=\\\"534\\\">henna painting<\\/strong>, and savor a <strong data-end=\\\"580\\\" data-start=\\\"566\\\">BBQ dinner<\\/strong> under the stars. The evening is filled with cultural entertainment including a mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"687\\\" data-start=\\\"672\\\">Belly Dance<\\/strong>, traditional <strong data-end=\\\"717\\\" data-start=\\\"701\\\">Tanoura Show<\\/strong>, and an exhilarating <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"739\\\">Fire Performance<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"839\\\" data-start=\\\"762\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"785\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Dubai<br data-end=\\\"794\\\" data-start=\\\"791\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"817\\\" data-start=\\\"798\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong>&nbsp;BBQ Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour & Burj Khalifa Experience\",\"date\":\"29-11-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"173\\\" data-start=\\\"121\\\">Begin your day with a hearty breakfast at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"444\\\" data-start=\\\"175\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"187\\\" data-start=\\\"175\\\">Morning:<\\/strong> Set out for a <strong data-end=\\\"240\\\" data-start=\\\"202\\\">half-day guided city tour of Dubai<\\/strong>, exploring its most iconic landmarks including the elegant <strong data-end=\\\"319\\\" data-start=\\\"300\\\">Jumeirah Mosque<\\/strong>, the luxurious <strong data-end=\\\"352\\\" data-start=\\\"335\\\">Palm Jumeirah<\\/strong> with a photo stop at <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"374\\\">Atlantis The Palm<\\/strong>, and a visit to the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"443\\\" data-start=\\\"429\\\">Dubai Mall<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"653\\\" data-start=\\\"446\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"460\\\" data-start=\\\"446\\\">Afternoon:<\\/strong> Head to the towering <strong data-end=\\\"498\\\" data-start=\\\"482\\\">Burj Khalifa<\\/strong>, the tallest building in the world. Ascend to the <strong data-end=\\\"573\\\" data-start=\\\"549\\\">124th &amp; 125th floors<\\/strong> for breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"652\\\" data-start=\\\"591\\\">panoramic views of Dubai\\u2019s skyline, desert, and coastline<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"678\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Dubai<br data-end=\\\"687\\\" data-start=\\\"684\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"710\\\" data-start=\\\"691\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong> NIL<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"30-11-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"230\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\">After enjoying your final breakfast at the hotel<\\/strong>, complete the check-out formalities. You will then be transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"203\\\" data-start=\\\"184\\\">Sharjah <\\/strong>for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"311\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"247\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\">Tour Ends<\\/strong> \\u2014 taking home unforgettable memories of your Dubai adventure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"342\\\" data-start=\\\"313\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"336\\\" data-start=\\\"317\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong> NIL<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accomm