>\n	<li data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"417\">\n	<p data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"419\"><strong data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"419\">All sightseeing tours</strong> and activities on a <strong data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"465\">private basis</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"518\" data-start=\"484\">🕌 <strong data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"487\">Sightseeing &amp; Experiences</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"519\">\n	<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"519\">\n	<p data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"521\"><strong data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"521\">Half-Day Dubai City Tour</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"554\">\n		<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"554\">\n		<p data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"556\">Photo stops at iconic attractions including:</p>\n\n		<ul data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"607\">\n			<li data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"607\">\n			<p data-end=\"680\" data-start=\"609\"><strong data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"609\">Burj Al Arab</strong>, <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"627\">Atlantis The Palm</strong>, <strong data-end=\"668\" data-start=\"650\">Jumeirah Beach</strong>, and more</p>\n			</li>\n		</ul>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"681\">\n	<p data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"683\"><strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"683\">Visit to Dubai Mall</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"709\">\n	<p data-end=\"757\" data-start=\"711\"><strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"711\">Entry to Burj Khalifa – Levels 124 &amp; 125</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"760\">\n		<li data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"760\">\n		<p data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"762\">Enjoy breathtaking views from the observation deck</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"815\">\n	<p data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"817\"><strong data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"817\">Visit to Museum of the Future</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"855\">\n		<li data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"855\">\n		<p data-end=\"921\" data-start=\"857\">A journey through futuristic innovation and immersive exhibits</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"922\">\n	<p data-end=\"953\" data-start=\"924\"><strong data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"924\">Visit to Miracle Garden</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"956\">\n		<li data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"956\">\n		<p data-end=\"1071\" data-start=\"958\">Explore the world’s largest natural flower garden, home to over 150 million blooms arranged in magical displays</p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1115\" data-start=\"1073\">🏜️ <strong data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1077\">Premium Desert Safari Experience</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1116\">\n	<li data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1116\">\n	<p data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1118\">Thrilling <strong data-end=\"1144\" data-start=\"1128\">dune bashing</strong> in the golden sands</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1167\">\n	<p data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1169\"><strong data-end=\"1183\" data-start=\"1169\">Camel ride</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1185\">henna painting</strong>, and optional <strong data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1218\">sandboarding</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1237\">\n	<p data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1239\">Lavish <strong data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1246\">BBQ dinner</strong> under the stars</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1279\">\n	<p data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1281\">Cultural &amp; live entertainment:</p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1316\">\n		<li data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1316\">\n		<p data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1318\"><strong data-end=\"1333\" data-start=\"1318\">Belly Dance</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1335\">Tanoura Show</strong>, and a spectacular <strong data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1371\">Fire Performance</strong></p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Tourism Dhirahm Fee.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"38\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"50200\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":50200,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19076\",\"selling_price\":69276}', 'MZQ/0716/082025', 71700, 35850, 0, '2025-08-15 10:24:08', '2025-08-15 10:24:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(728, 'Mr Gaurav Agarwal x 17', 'BNI', '9234608414', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-10-23', 5, 1, 16, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket + Evening Fantasea Show with Dinner\",\"date\":\"23-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Phuket and meet our representative for a private transfer to your hotel. After check-in and some relaxation, head out in the evening to experience the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"352\\\" data-start=\\\"328\\\">Phuket Fantasea Show<\\/strong>, a cultural theme park showcasing Thailand\\u2019s rich heritage with dazzling performances. Enjoy a lavish dinner before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"1935\\\" data-start=\\\"1917\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Adventure by Catamaran\",\"date\":\"24-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set off for a <strong data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1564\\\">full-day Phi Phi Island Tour by Catamaran<\\/strong> \\u2013 one of Thailand\\u2019s most iconic experiences.<br data-end=\\\"1657\\\" data-start=\\\"1654\\\" \\/>\\nSail across the sparkling Andaman Sea, stop for swimming and snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and enjoy a delicious lunch on board. Marvel at Maya Bay (famous from the movie <em data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-start=\\\"1834\\\">The Beach<\\/em>), relax on white sandy shores, and soak in postcard-perfect scenery.<br data-end=\\\"1917\\\" data-start=\\\"1914\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1935\\\" data-start=\\\"1917\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour + Tiger Encounter\",\"date\":\"25-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1161\\\">Begin your day with a guided <strong data-end=\\\"954\\\" data-start=\\\"934\\\">Phuket City Tour<\\/strong> visiting top attractions like <strong data-end=\\\"1007\\\" data-start=\\\"985\\\">Wat Chalong Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1029\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\">Karon View Point<\\/strong>, and the renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1064\\\" data-start=\\\"1048\\\">Gems Gallery<\\/strong>. Later, enjoy an exciting visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1121\\\" data-start=\\\"1100\\\">Phuket Tiger Park<\\/strong>, where you can interact with either a big or the smallest tiger (one category included). Return to your hotel for an evening at leisure.<br data-end=\\\"1917\\\" data-start=\\\"1914\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1935\\\" data-start=\\\"1917\\\">Overnight Stay<\\/strong>: Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Scenic Transfer from Phuket to Krabi\",\"date\":\"26-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your Phuket hotel and enjoy a picturesque drive to Krabi. On arrival, check in and relax at your hotel or explore the serene surroundings on your own.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"4 Island Tour by Speedboat with Lunch\",\"date\":\"27-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, set out for an exhilarating <strong data-end=\\\"1634\\\" data-start=\\\"1604\\\">4 Island Tour by speedboat<\\/strong>, visiting Poda Island, Chicken Island, Tup Island, and Phra Nang Cave Beach. Enjoy snorkeling in turquoise waters and a sumptuous lunch during the tour. Return to your hotel by evening for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Krabi\",\"date\":\"28-10-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to Krabi Airport for your flight back home, carrying unforgettable memories of your Thailand trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1087\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 Am\",\"fare\":\"215900\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1084\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 Am\",\"arv_time\":\"01:20 Pm\",\"fare\":\"297500\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"221\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"26\\/10\\/2025\",\"rooms\":6,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Express Phuket Patong Beach Central\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Garden View\",\"rate\":\"100100\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/10\\/2025\",\"rooms\":6,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Deevana Plaza Krabi Aonang\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"84800\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">Airfare <strong><em>Kolkata - Phuket</em></strong> &amp; <em><strong>Krabi&nbsp;- Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>03&nbsp;Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel&nbsp;Holiday Inn Express Phuket Patong Beach Central @ Phuket</strong>.</li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02 Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel&nbsp;Deevana Plaza Aonang @ Krabi.</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>06 Rooms </strong>on <strong>DBL Sharing basis.&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>All Children </strong>will be sharing the <strong>Parent Bed.</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Buffet Breakfast @All Hotels</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>Phi Phi Island Tour by Catamaran </strong>with Lunch <em>(Includes NP Fee)</em></li>\n	<li><strong>Phuket City Tour </strong>( Wat Chalong,karon view point,Gems Gallery ) + Phuket Tiger Park Big or Smallest Any one Tiger.</li>\n	<li><strong>FantaSea Show</strong> Entry Ticket with Indian Dinner.</li>\n	<li><strong>4 Island Tour</strong> Krabi by Speed Boat with Picnic Local Lunch <em>(Includes NP Fee)</em></li>\n	<li>Phuket (HKT) Airport → Phuket Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Phuket Hotel → Krabi Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Krabi Hotel&nbsp;→ Krabi (KBV) Airport</li>\n	<li>All tours &amp; transfers by <strong>02 Vans</strong> on a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"818\">private basis</strong>.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":513400,\"land_cost\":\"315000\",\"hotel_cost\":184900,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":1013300,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 121596\",\"selling_price\":1134896}', 'MZQ/0717/082025', 1135010, 67480, 55330, '2025-08-22 11:01:50', '2025-08-27 12:36:42', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(729, 'Mr Priyal Chaubey', 'Regular', '7992402440', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ITALY', '2025-11-10', 8, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Rome \\u2013 Check-in & Leisure\",\"date\":\"10-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Rome Airport, you will be greeted and transferred to your hotel. After check-in, the day is free for you to relax and explore the city at your own pace.<br data-end=\\\"338\\\" data-start=\\\"335\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"356\\\" data-start=\\\"338\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Villafranca (or similar) \\u2013 Double Room<br data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"401\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"414\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">Meals:<\\/strong>&nbsp;NIL<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hop-On Hop-Off City Tour + Ancient Rome Experience\",\"date\":\"11-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"615\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\">Start your day with a <strong data-end=\\\"567\\\" data-start=\\\"531\\\">48-hour Hop-On Hop-Off tour pass<\\/strong> to explore iconic landmarks at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"872\\\" data-start=\\\"616\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"872\\\" data-start=\\\"616\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"872\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"630\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">11:00 AM<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"688\\\" data-start=\\\"643\\\">Colosseum, Roman Forum, and Palatine Hill<\\/strong> (Entry Tickets only).<br data-end=\\\"713\\\" data-start=\\\"710\\\" \\/>\\n\\tContinue sightseeing with your Hop-On Hop-Off bus and enjoy Rome\'s historic charm.<br data-end=\\\"798\\\" data-start=\\\"795\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"816\\\" data-start=\\\"798\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Villafranca (or similar)<br data-end=\\\"850\\\" data-start=\\\"847\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"860\\\" data-start=\\\"850\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Rome \\u2013 Vatican Museums & Sistine Chapel Tour\",\"date\":\"12-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to the departure point for your guided tour of the <strong data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"1018\\\">Vatican Museums and Sistine Chapel<\\/strong> at <strong data-end=\\\"1072\\\" data-start=\\\"1060\\\">11:30 AM<\\/strong>. Witness masterpieces of art and history, including Michelangelo\'s famous frescoes.<br data-end=\\\"1159\\\" data-start=\\\"1156\\\" \\/>\\nEvening free to explore local cafes or enjoy an Italian dinner (on own).<br data-end=\\\"1234\\\" data-start=\\\"1231\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1252\\\" data-start=\\\"1234\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Villafranca (or similar)<br data-end=\\\"1286\\\" data-start=\\\"1283\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-start=\\\"1286\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Day at Leisure in Rome\",\"date\":\"13-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, the day is completely free for you to explore Rome at your own pace. You may stroll through the cobbled streets, enjoy shopping at Via del Corso, sip coffee at a charming piazza, or simply relax and soak in the vibrant Italian atmosphere. Enjoy a food &amp; wine experience, which can also be arranged.<br data-end=\\\"486\\\" data-start=\\\"483\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1252\\\" data-start=\\\"1234\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Villafranca (or similar)<br data-end=\\\"1286\\\" data-start=\\\"1283\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-start=\\\"1286\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Rome to Florence \\u2013 Arrival & Hop-On Hop-Off Tour\",\"date\":\"14-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Rome Termini Station for your train to Florence (10:25 AM \\u2013 12:01 PM). On arrival, check in at your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1534\\\" data-start=\\\"1531\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1573\\\" data-start=\\\"1542\\\">24-hour Hop-On Hop-Off tour<\\/strong>, discovering Florence\\u2019s artistic treasures and Renaissance architecture.<br data-end=\\\"1649\\\" data-start=\\\"1646\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1667\\\" data-start=\\\"1649\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Desiree (or similar) \\u2013 Double Room<br data-end=\\\"1711\\\" data-start=\\\"1708\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1721\\\" data-start=\\\"1711\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Florence \\u2013 Full-Day Excursion to Pisa, Siena & San Gimignano\",\"date\":\"15-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning pick-up at <strong data-end=\\\"1856\\\" data-start=\\\"1844\\\">07:30 AM<\\/strong> for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"1932\\\" data-start=\\\"1885\\\">Pisa, Siena, San Gimignano &amp; Chianti region<\\/strong> (on SIC).<br data-end=\\\"1945\\\" data-start=\\\"1942\\\" \\/>\\nExplore Pisa\\u2019s Leaning Tower, Siena\\u2019s historic center, and the medieval charm of San Gimignano, along with Tuscany\\u2019s scenic vineyards.<br data-end=\\\"2082\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2100\\\" data-start=\\\"2082\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Desiree (or similar)<br data-end=\\\"2130\\\" data-start=\\\"2127\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2140\\\" data-start=\\\"2130\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Florence to Venice \\u2013 Arrival & Leisure\",\"date\":\"16-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2718\\\" data-start=\\\"2607\\\">After breakfast, check out and proceed to Florence Station for your train to Venice Mestre (10:20 AM \\u2013 12:23 PM). Upon arrival, transfer to your hotel and spend the rest of the day exploring the magical canals of Venice at leisure.<br data-end=\\\"2450\\\" data-start=\\\"2447\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2468\\\" data-start=\\\"2450\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Aaron (or similar) \\u2013 Standard Room<br data-end=\\\"2512\\\" data-start=\\\"2509\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2512\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Venice \\u2013 Murano, Burano & Torcello Islands Tour\",\"date\":\"17-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2718\\\" data-start=\\\"2607\\\">After breakfast, embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"2656\\\" data-start=\\\"2636\\\">shared boat tour<\\/strong> to the enchanting islands of <strong data-end=\\\"2715\\\" data-start=\\\"2686\\\">Murano, Burano &amp; Torcello<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"2962\\\" data-start=\\\"2719\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2962\\\" data-start=\\\"2719\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2962\\\" data-start=\\\"2721\\\">Witness Murano\'s glass-making tradition, Burano\'s colorful houses &amp; lacework, and Torcello\'s peaceful charm.<br data-end=\\\"2832\\\" data-start=\\\"2829\\\" \\/>\\n\\tReturn to your hotel and enjoy your last evening in Venice.<br data-end=\\\"2894\\\" data-start=\\\"2891\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"2912\\\" data-start=\\\"2894\\\">Accommodation:<\\/strong> Hotel Aaron (or similar)<br data-end=\\\"2940\\\" data-start=\\\"2937\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"2950\\\" data-start=\\\"2940\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Venice\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Venice Airport for your flight back home, taking unforgettable memories of Italy with you.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5017\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 PM\",\"fare\":19628},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Munich (MUC)\",\"name\":\"Lufthansa\",\"fno\":\"LH-767\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 AM\",\"fare\":\"97845\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Munich (MUC)\",\"to\":\"Rome (FCO)\",\"name\":\"Lufthansa\",\"fno\":\"LH-1866\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"11:00 AM\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Lufthansa\",\"from\":\"Venice (VCE)\",\"to\":\"Munich (MUC)\",\"fno\":\"LH-9461\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:00 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"09:00 AM\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Munich (MUC)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"Lufthansa\",\"fno\":\"LH-766\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1237\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:15 AM\",\"fare\":13238}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Villafranca - or similar\",\"city\":\"ROME\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"14\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"14\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Desiree - or similar\",\"city\":\"FLORENCE\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/11\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"16\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Aaron - or similar\",\"city\":\"VENICE\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/11\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<h3 data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"183\">🛫<strong> Flights</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"200\">\n	<li data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"200\">\n	<p data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"202\">Return Airfare <strong><em>Ex-Ranchi</em></strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"272\" data-start=\"229\">🏨 <strong>Accommodation&nbsp;</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"273\">\n	<li data-end=\"342\" data-start=\"273\">\n	<p data-end=\"342\" data-start=\"275\"><strong>04&nbsp;Nights </strong>– Rome – <strong><em data-end=\"313\" data-start=\"294\">Hotel Villafranca</em> (or similar) </strong>– Double Room</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"343\">\n	<p data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"345\"><strong>02 Nights</strong> – Florence – <strong><em data-end=\"383\" data-start=\"368\">Hotel Desiree</em> (or similar)</strong> – Double Room</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"413\">\n	<p data-end=\"480\" data-start=\"415\"><strong>02 Nights</strong> – Venice – <strong><em data-end=\"449\" data-start=\"436\">Hotel Aaron</em> (or similar)</strong> – Standard Room</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"497\" data-start=\"482\">🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"498\">\n	<li data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"498\">\n	<p data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"500\">Daily Breakfast at Hotels</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"564\" data-start=\"529\">🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Experiences</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"565\"><strong data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"565\">Rome</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"576\">\n	<li data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"576\">\n	<p data-end=\"618\" data-start=\"578\">48 Hours Hop-On Hop-Off City Tour Pass</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"619\">\n	<p data-end=\"703\" data-start=\"621\">Entry Tickets: <em data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"636\">Colosseum, Roman Forum &amp; Palatine Hill</em> (Timed Entry – 11:00 AM)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"704\">\n	<p data-end=\"804\" data-start=\"706\">Guided Tour of <em data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"721\">Vatican Museums &amp; Sistine Chapel</em> (Shared Basis – 11:30 AM from departure point)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"806\"><strong data-end=\"818\" data-start=\"806\">Florence</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"821\">\n	<li data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"821\">\n	<p data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"823\">24 Hours Hop-On Hop-Off City Tour Pass</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"864\">\n	<p data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"866\">Full-Day Tour: <em data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"881\">Pisa, Siena, San Gimignano &amp; Chianti</em> (07:30 AM – SIC from departure point)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"973\" data-start=\"961\"><strong data-end=\"971\" data-start=\"961\">Venice</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"974\">\n	<li data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"974\">\n	<p data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"976\"><em data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"976\">Murano, Burano &amp; Torcello Islands</em> Boat Tour (SIC – from departure point)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"1054\">🚖 <strong>Transfers (Private Basis)</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1089\">\n	<li data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1089\">\n	<p data-end=\"1127\" data-start=\"1091\">Rome Airport → Rome Hotel transfer</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1128\">\n	<p data-end=\"1172\" data-start=\"1130\">Rome Hotel → Rome Train Station transfer</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1173\">\n	<p data-end=\"1259\" data-start=\"1175\">Florence Train Station → Florence Hotel (Self-walk 290m) &amp; Return to Train Station</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1260\">\n	<p data-end=\"1316\" data-start=\"1262\">Venice Train Station → Venice Hotel (Self-walk 500m)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1317\">\n	<p data-end=\"1359\" data-start=\"1319\">Venice Hotel → Venice Airport transfer</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1399\" data-start=\"1361\">🚆 <strong>Train Tickets (Economy Class)</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1400\">\n	<li data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1400\">\n	<p data-end=\"1462\" data-start=\"1402\">Rome → Florence (2nd Class | 10:25 AM – 12:01 PM | Direct)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1463\">\n	<p data-end=\"1534\" data-start=\"1465\">Florence → Venice Mestre (2nd Class | 10:20 AM – 12:23 PM | Direct)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1561\" data-start=\"1536\">📑 <strong>Visa &amp; Insurance</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1655\" data-start=\"1562\">\n	<li data-end=\"1634\" data-start=\"1562\">\n	<p data-end=\"1634\" data-start=\"1564\">Schengen Tourist Visa Assistance (Appointment fee + Service Charges)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1655\" data-start=\"1635\">\n	<p data-end=\"1655\" data-start=\"1637\">Travel Insurance</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Visa fee</strong><strong>: approximately 90 Euro per Person</strong>&nbsp;to be paid directly at the Visa Application Centre. (On Own)</li>\n	<li>Any personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":130711,\"land_cost\":\"180000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"11000\",\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"9000\",\"travel_insurance\":\"4000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":334711,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 66942.2\",\"selling_price\":401653.2000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0718/082025', 397720, 198860, 0, '2025-08-27 13:12:04', '2025-09-10 11:44:49', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(730, 'Ms Ritika', 'BNI Dewanshu', '9986197203', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-10-28', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket\",\"date\":\"28-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"231\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Arrive at Phuket International Airport and meet your representative.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"301\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\">Private transfer to your hotel and complete check-in formalities.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"304\\\">Rest of the day is free to relax and explore the vibrant nightlife of Phuket on your own.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"412\\\" data-start=\\\"397\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"407\\\" data-start=\\\"397\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> None<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Yona Floating Beach Club \\u2013 Sunset Extravaganza\",\"date\":\"29-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"528\\\" data-start=\\\"485\\\">Enjoy a leisurely breakfast at the hotel.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"612\\\" data-start=\\\"531\\\">Later, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"578\\\" data-start=\\\"550\\\">Yona Floating Beach Club<\\/strong> for a premium beach experience.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"716\\\" data-start=\\\"615\\\">Relax in style, swim, enjoy cocktails, or soak up the sun as the yacht sails along the Andaman Sea.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"800\\\" data-start=\\\"719\\\">Witness a spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"751\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\">sunset<\\/strong> over the ocean before returning to your hotel.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"824\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"812\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran with Sea Canoe (Includes National Park Fee)\",\"date\":\"30-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1028\\\" data-start=\\\"930\\\">After breakfast, embark on a thrilling speedboat tour to the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1025\\\" data-start=\\\"1004\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong>.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1085\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\">Enjoy sea canoeing through hidden lagoons and caves.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1154\\\" data-start=\\\"1088\\\">Visit Panak Island, Hong Island, and relax at Naka Island beach.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1187\\\" data-start=\\\"1157\\\">Return to Phuket by evening.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1219\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1199\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Scenic Transfer from Phuket to Krabi\",\"date\":\"31-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1331\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\">After breakfast, check out from your Phuket hotel.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1434\\\" data-start=\\\"1334\\\">Enjoy a scenic land transfer from <strong data-end=\\\"1387\\\" data-start=\\\"1368\\\">Phuket to Krabi<\\/strong>, passing lush landscapes and coastal beauty.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1437\\\">Check-in at your Krabi hotel and spend the evening at leisure.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1525\\\" data-start=\\\"1503\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-start=\\\"1503\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat\",\"date\":\"01-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li>After breakfast, set out for an exciting 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Explore the stunning islands of Phra Nang Cave, Chicken Island, Tup Island, and Poda Island.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Enjoy snorkeling, swimming, and soaking up the sun on crystal-clear beaches.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>A delicious lunch will be served during the tour. Return to your hotel by evening.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Krabi\",\"date\":\"02-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"2141\\\" data-start=\\\"2009\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2141\\\" data-start=\\\"2009\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2141\\\" data-start=\\\"2011\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2086\\\" data-start=\\\"2069\\\">Krabi Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey with unforgettable memories.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2165\\\" data-start=\\\"2143\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2153\\\" data-start=\\\"2143\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"31\\/10\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Express Phuket Patong Beach Central\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rate\":\"31900\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"31\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/11\\/2025\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Garden View Room\",\"rate\":\"24500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Holiday Inn Express Phuket Patong Beach Central @ Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort @ Krabi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms on DBL </strong>Sharing basis.</li>\n	<li><strong>Buffet Breakfast</strong>&nbsp;@All Hotels</li>\n	<li><strong>James Bond Island Tour</strong> <strong>by Catamaran with Lunch</strong> (Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li><strong>Yona Sunset Sofa</strong>&nbsp;- 04 Female (Credit to spend 12000 THB) <strong>- PVT</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat</strong> -SIC(Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li>Phuket (HKT) Airport → Phuket Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Phuket Hotel → Krabi Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Krabi Hotel → Krabi (KBV) Airport</li>\n	<li>All tours <strong>on SIC</strong> &amp; transfers<strong> on PVT.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"111200\",\"hotel_cost\":56400,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":167600,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20112\",\"selling_price\":187712}', 'MZQ/0719/082025', 188000, 47000, 55330, '2025-08-28 12:56:37', '2025-09-04 10:33:27', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(731, 'Mr. Kulwant Singh', 'Rana Manvendra', '7759965489', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2025-12-19', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"19-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"20-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"638\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":115745},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6306\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":117124},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hyderabad (HYD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"327\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony palms Beach Resort and Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Havelock Cottage + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sand\",\"room_type\":\"Casa Earth + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare&nbsp;<strong>Kolkata-Port Blair &amp; Port Blair-Ranchi.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing + 01 Extra Bed&nbsp;</strong>at given hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><em><strong>Child Cost:</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Child (5-11) |&nbsp;<em><strong>Rs. 67,635/-</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Child (5-11) |&nbsp;<em><strong>Rs. 67,635/-</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Child (0-4) |&nbsp;<em><strong>Rs. 45,410/-</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":232869,\"land_cost\":\"206838\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":439707,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 52764.84\",\"selling_price\":492471.839999999967403709888458251953125}', 'MZQ/0720/082025', 492564, 123141, 12480, '2025-08-29 07:40:22', '2025-08-29 08:03:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(732, 'Mr. Manoj Kumar Arya', 'BNI Avinash Sahu', '9709100140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2026-02-12', 5, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Port Blair | Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach & Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"12-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Airport Welcome:<\\/strong> Arrive at Veer Savarkar International Airport, Port Blair, where our representative will greet you and assist with a smooth transfer to your hotel. After check-in and refreshment, begin your journey of the islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"791\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"557\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach:<\\/strong> Spend the afternoon at Carbyn\\u2019s Cove, a picturesque palm-fringed beach just a short drive from the city. Walk along the shoreline, soak in the sea breeze, and relax by the turquoise waters \\u2013 a perfect start to your Andaman holiday.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"832\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\">Cellular Jail &amp; Light &amp; Sound Show:<\\/strong> Later, visit the iconic <em data-end=\\\"884\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\">Cellular Jail (Kala Pani)<\\/em>, where the corridors and galleries narrate the tale of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. In the evening, witness the moving <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Light &amp; Sound Show<\\/strong>, which brings history alive through music, narration, and lights.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair \\u2192 Havelock Island | Radhanagar Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"13-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1400\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\">Private Cruise to Havelock:<\\/strong> After breakfast, board a premium private cruise (<em data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\">Makruzz \\u2013 Premium Class<\\/em> \\/ <em data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">Nautika \\u2013 Luxury Class<\\/em>) for a scenic transfer from Port Blair to Havelock Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1470\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1421\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1493\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\">Radhanagar Beach:<\\/strong> In the afternoon, visit the world-renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1571\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\">Radhanagar Beach (Beach No. 7)<\\/strong>, voted one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches. Enjoy its pristine white sands, azure waters, and a spectacular sunset.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<br data-end=\\\"1721\\\" data-start=\\\"1718\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1802\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Note: Ferry timings and class upgrades can be requested at the time of booking.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Excursion with Snorkelling\",\"date\":\"14-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2060\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\">Hotel Pickup &amp; Boat Ride:<\\/strong> Begin your day with a hotel pickup and transfer to the jetty. Enjoy a 30-minute boat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"2012\\\" data-start=\\\"1994\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, famous for its coral reefs and clear waters.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2222\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2092\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\">Complimentary Snorkelling:<\\/strong> Experience the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock \\u2192 Neil Island | Natural Rock Formation & Laxmanpur Beach\",\"date\":\"15-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a private cruise from Havelock to Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2791\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2820\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\">Natural Rock Formation:<\\/strong> Visit Neil\\u2019s iconic Natural Rock Formation, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2883\\\">Howrah Bridge<\\/em>, a natural wonder created by centuries of coral formations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3099\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Laxmanpur Beach Sunset:<\\/strong> Spend the evening at <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3011\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its wide shoreline and mesmerizing golden sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3214\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Neil Island.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be updated by our team.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island \\u2192 Port Blair | Bharatpur Beach, Shopping\",\"date\":\"16-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3488\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">Bharatpur Beach:<\\/strong> Begin the morning at <strong data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3360\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, and optional water sports such as jet skiing and glass-bottom boat rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3614\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">Check Out &amp; Transfer:<\\/strong> Check out from the resort and transfer to Neil Jetty. Board a private cruise back to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3770\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3634\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Shopping Trip:<\\/strong> In the evening, enjoy shopping at Port Blair\\u2019s local markets for souvenirs like pearls, shell crafts, spices, and island handicrafts.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3772\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3982\\\" data-start=\\\"3963\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Port Blair\",\"date\":\"17-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your return flight. Carry back fond memories of your Andaman journey.<br data-end=\\\"4193\\\" data-start=\\\"4190\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"4368\\\" data-start=\\\"4193\\\">Note: Hotels usually have early check-out times. If your flight is in the afternoon, luggage can be kept at the reception. Extra sightseeing may be arranged if time permits.<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Villa\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"15\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Panorama\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"16\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Rooms Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at the given respected&nbsp;hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop-off.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by a Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;on all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"211587\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":211587,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35969.79\",\"selling_price\":247556.79000000000814907252788543701171875}', 'MZQ/0721/092025', 247584, 41264, 12480, '2025-09-02 06:58:09', '2026-01-26 13:21:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(733, 'MR SIMERJEET SINGH', 'BNI', '9431163323', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HONGKONG', '2025-10-24', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Night Tour\",\"date\":\"24-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Hong Kong International Airport and transfer to your Kowloon hotel. In the evening, embark on a night tour of Hong Kong. Take the Peak Tram to Sky Terrace for stunning views, visit Madame Tussauds, enjoy a Star Ferry ride, explore the Old Clock Tower, and end the night with the Symphony of Lights show at Victoria Harbour.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Disneyland Experience\",\"date\":\"25-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"687\\\" data-start=\\\"520\\\">After breakfast, head to the enchanting world of Hong Kong Disneyland. Enjoy fun rides, dazzling shows, and parades. Transfers are provided both ways for your comfort.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Leisure Day\",\"date\":\"26-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>This day is free for you to relax, shop, or explore Hong Kong at your own pace. You may choose to visit famous shopping districts like Tsim Sha Tsui or Causeway Bay, take a food tour, or enjoy a cruise at Victoria Harbour (optional activities can be arranged).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ocean Park Adventure\",\"date\":\"27-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1213\\\" data-start=\\\"953\\\">Visit Ocean Park for a mix of marine life exhibits, thrilling rides, and shows. See giant pandas and enjoy a full day of adventure before returning to your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Leisure Day\",\"date\":\"28-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"379\\\" data-start=\\\"163\\\">This day is free for you to relax, shop, or explore Hong Kong at your own pace. You may choose to visit famous shopping districts like Tsim Sha Tsui or Causeway Bay, take a food tour, or enjoy a cruise at Victoria Harbour (optional activities can be arranged).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping on Own + Departure from Hong Kong\",\"date\":\"29-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"379\\\" data-start=\\\"163\\\">After breakfast, enjoy free time for shopping or leisure (depending on your flight schedule). Later, complete check-out formalities and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"353\\\" data-start=\\\"311\\\">Hong Kong International Airport (HKIA)<\\/strong> for your return flight.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"453\\\" data-start=\\\"381\\\">\\u2728 Tour ends with wonderful memories of your Hong Kong &amp; Macau journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5024\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"173190\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"HONG KONG (HKG)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1707\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"HONG KONG (HKG)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1708\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5339\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"24\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HONGKONG\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Golden Mile\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"29\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"108934\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6},{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Air Fare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>05&nbsp;Nights </strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Holiday Inn Golden Mile @ HONG KONG</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Daily <strong>Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li>Return <strong>Airport Transfers.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Night tour </strong>of Hong Kong.</li>\n	<li>Full Day <strong>Ocean Park.</strong></li>\n	<li>Full Day <strong>Disneyland Park.</strong></li>\n	<li>All tours &amp; transfers on a <strong>private basis.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":173190,\"land_cost\":\"121256\",\"hotel_cost\":108934,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Flight Reschedulement\",\"amount\":13920}],\"cost_price\":417300,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 83460\",\"selling_price\":500760}', 'MZQ/0722/092025', 500280, 155295, 94845, '2025-09-02 11:02:34', '2025-10-16 06:09:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(734, 'Mr Premjeet Kumar', 'Prince Motors', '6287049999', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2025-10-11', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"11-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"12-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"13-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"14-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"15-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"16-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"263\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":24321},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"29682\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"11\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"12\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"12\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"14\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"14\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Panorama\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"15\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"15\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Air Fare <strong><em>Ex-Kolkata.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at given respected&nbsp;hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":54003,\"land_cost\":\"92264\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":146267,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21940.05\",\"selling_price\":168207.0499999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0723/092025', 168207, 73753, 20701, '2025-09-04 10:33:12', '2025-09-04 13:40:11', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(735, 'Mr Rahul Sinha', 'BNI | CELEB', '7320031162', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL GUJARAT', '2025-09-23', 7, 2, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Ahmedabad\",\"date\":\"23-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Ahmedabad Airport \\/ Railway Station. Transfer to hotel and check-in. Relax for the rest of the day, or you may explore Sabarmati Riverfront or Manek Chowk (local market) in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"360\\\" data-start=\\\"357\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>Overnight in Ahmedabad.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ahmedabad \\u2192 Dwarka\",\"date\":\"24-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"562\\\" data-start=\\\"442\\\">After breakfast, check out and drive towards Dwarka \\u2013 one of the Char Dham pilgrimage sites dedicated to Lord Krishna.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"578\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> ~440 km | <strong data-end=\\\"605\\\" data-start=\\\"589\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> ~8\\u20139 hrs<br data-end=\\\"617\\\" data-start=\\\"614\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, check in at the hotel and visit Dwarkadhish Temple for evening Aarti.<br data-end=\\\"701\\\" data-start=\\\"698\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Dwarka.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dwarka Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"25-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"823\\\" data-start=\\\"780\\\">After breakfast, proceed for sightseeing:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"856\\\" data-start=\\\"826\\\">Nageshwar Jyotirlinga Temple<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"881\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\">Bet Dwarka (by boat)<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"896\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\">Gopi Talav<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1005\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\">Rukmini Devi Temple<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1005\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\">Return in the evening to Dwarkadhish Temple for darshan.<br data-end=\\\"980\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Dwarka.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dwarka \\u2192 Somnath \\u2192 Gir\",\"date\":\"26-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1220\\\" data-start=\\\"1063\\\">After breakfast, drive to Somnath. Visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1145\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\">Somnath Jyotirlinga Temple<\\/strong> and attend the Aarti. Later, continue your journey to Gir National Park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1263\\\" data-start=\\\"1223\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1244\\\" data-start=\\\"1223\\\">Dwarka \\u2192 Somnath:<\\/strong> ~230 km | ~5 hrs<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1354\\\" data-start=\\\"1266\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1284\\\" data-start=\\\"1266\\\">Somnath \\u2192 Gir:<\\/strong> ~70 km | ~1.5 hrs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1354\\\" data-start=\\\"1266\\\">Check in at your resort.<br data-end=\\\"1332\\\" data-start=\\\"1329\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Gir.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gir Safari \\u2192 Diu\",\"date\":\"27-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1533\\\" data-start=\\\"1406\\\">Early morning, enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"1448\\\" data-start=\\\"1427\\\">Gir Jungle Safari<\\/strong> (home of Asiatic Lions). Return for breakfast at the resort and then drive to Diu.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1691\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1549\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> ~65 km | <strong data-end=\\\"1575\\\" data-start=\\\"1559\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> ~1.5\\u20132 hrs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1691\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">In Diu, relax at the beach or explore Diu Fort, Naida Caves, and Nagoa Beach.<br data-end=\\\"1669\\\" data-start=\\\"1666\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Diu.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Diu \\u2192 Statue of Unity (Kevadia)\",\"date\":\"28-09-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1870\\\" data-start=\\\"1758\\\">After breakfast, enjoy some leisure time in Diu. Around noon, start your journey to Kevadia (Statue of Unity).<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1994\\\" data-start=\\\"1873\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1886\\\" data-start=\\\"1873\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> ~540 km | <strong data-end=\\\"1913\\\" data-start=\\\"1897\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> ~9\\u201310 hrs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1994\\\" data-start=\\\"1873\\\">Check in to hotel near Statue of Unity.<br data-end=\\\"1968\\\" data-start=\\\"1965\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Kevadia.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Statue of Unity \\u2192 Ahmedabad\",\"date\":\"29-09-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2202\\\" data-start=\\\"2057\\\">In the morning, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"2102\\\" data-start=\\\"2083\\\">Statue of Unity<\\/strong>, Viewing Gallery, Valley of Flowers, and Laser Show (if time permits). Later, drive to Ahmedabad.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2205\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2218\\\" data-start=\\\"2205\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> ~200 km | <strong data-end=\\\"2245\\\" data-start=\\\"2229\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> ~4 hrs<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2205\\\">Check in to hotel and relax.<br data-end=\\\"2286\\\" data-start=\\\"2283\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Ahmedabad.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Ahmedabad\",\"date\":\"30-09-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to <em><strong>Ahmedabad Airport<\\/strong><\\/em> for onward journey with sweet memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6654\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":50072},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6493\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:25 PM\",\"fare\":62720}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/09\\/2025\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Carrefour\",\"city\":\"AHMEDABAD\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"24\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11200\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DWARKA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regenta Dwarka\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"22600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sarovar Portico Gir\",\"city\":\"SASAN GIR\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"13530\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"27\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DIU\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Grand Highness\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"12900\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"STATUE OF UNITY\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/09\\/2025\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"room_type\":\"Premium AC Tent\",\"hotel_name\":\"Praveg Tent City Narmada\",\"rate\":\"13900\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"29\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"AHMEDABAD\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regenta Central Antarim\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11300\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6},{\"age\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Ranchi.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Carrefour <em>@ Ahmedabad.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Nights</strong> Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Regenta <em>@ Dwarka.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Sarovar Portico Gir <em>@ Sasan Gir.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel The Grand Highness <em>@ DIU.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night </strong>Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Praveg Tent City Narmada <em>@ STATUE OF UNITY.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong> Accommodation in Air-Conditioned Room at <strong>Hotel Regenta Central Antarim&nbsp;<em>@ Ahmedabad.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on <strong>Twin Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li>Mocktail on Arrival.</li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li>Complimentary use of Tea/Coffee maker. (replenished once daily).</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all in-house guests.</li>\n	<li>All <strong>Tours &amp; Transfers by 10-12&nbsp;Seater AC Tempo Traveller.</strong></li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":112792,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":85430,\"transport_cost\":\"65000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":263222,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39483.3\",\"selling_price\":302705.2999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0724/092025', 303040, 41980, 25580, '2025-09-05 10:18:37', '2025-09-05 11:05:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(736, 'Mr Umang Bhadani', 'Dewanshu', '8699348926', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-09-26', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Phuket\",\"date\":\"26-09-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Phuket International Airport. Meet &amp; greet by our representative and transfer to your hotel. Check-in and relax. The rest of the day is at leisure to explore Phuket\\u2019s vibrant nightlife or relax at Patong Beach.<br data-end=\\\"334\\\" data-start=\\\"331\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"27-09-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a thrilling full-day excursion to the famous <strong data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong>, featured in <em data-end=\\\"594\\\" data-start=\\\"563\\\">\\u201cThe Man with the Golden Gun\\u201d<\\/em>. Enjoy sightseeing, sea canoeing, limestone caves, and turquoise lagoons. A delicious Thai lunch will be served onboard. Return to the hotel by evening.<br data-end=\\\"750\\\" data-start=\\\"747\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure in Phuket\",\"date\":\"28-09-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"151\\\" data-start=\\\"128\\\">full day at leisure<\\/strong> to explore Phuket at your own pace. You may relax at <strong data-end=\\\"221\\\" data-start=\\\"205\\\">Patong Beach<\\/strong>, stroll through the vibrant local markets, or indulge in shopping and caf\\u00e9 hopping. For adventure seekers, optional activities like water sports, spa treatments, or visiting night markets can be arranged. Evening free to enjoy Phuket\\u2019s lively nightlife.<br data-end=\\\"478\\\" data-start=\\\"475\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"29-09-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set out for the <strong data-end=\\\"1309\\\" data-start=\\\"1290\\\">Phi Phi Islands<\\/strong> by luxury Catamaran. Experience the crystal-clear waters, snorkeling, swimming, and relaxing on the pristine beaches. A sumptuous buffet lunch is included. Return to Phuket in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1498\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2192 Bangkok | Chao Phraya Cruise Dinner\",\"date\":\"30-09-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Phuket Airport for your flight to Bangkok. On arrival, transfer to the hotel and check in. In the evening, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1798\\\" data-start=\\\"1761\\\">romantic Chao Phraya River Cruise<\\/strong> with live music, cultural performances, and an international buffet dinner while admiring Bangkok\\u2019s illuminated skyline.<br data-end=\\\"1922\\\" data-start=\\\"1919\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"01-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2075\\\" data-start=\\\"2045\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong> \\u2013 Thailand\\u2019s most popular wildlife and entertainment park. Enjoy exciting shows like Dolphin Show, Orangutan Show, Sea Lion Show, and more. Relish a buffet lunch inside the park before returning to your hotel. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<br data-end=\\\"2326\\\" data-start=\\\"2323\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping on Own + Departure\",\"date\":\"02-10-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"182\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\">free time in the morning for shopping<\\/strong> at Bangkok\\u2019s famous malls and local markets like <strong data-end=\\\"282\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">MBK Center, Platinum Mall, or Chatuchak Market<\\/strong> (depending on your flight schedule). Later, check out from the hotel and transfer to Bangkok Airport for your return flight with unforgettable memories of Thailand.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1081\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Sep 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"46070\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD-9161\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"15675\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1054\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"38999\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"26\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Mercure Patong\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"30\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"33084\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"30\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Mercure Atrium\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"13912\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">Return Airfare<strong><em> Ex-Delhi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong><em>20 Kgs Check-In Baggage per Pax </em></strong><em>in </em><strong><em>Thai Air Asia Flights</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>04 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel&nbsp;Grand Mercure Phuket Patong @ Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel&nbsp;Grand Mercure Bangkok Atrium @ Bangkok</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>James Bond Island Tour</strong>&nbsp;<strong>by Catamaran with Lunch</strong>&nbsp;(Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island Tour by Catamaran&nbsp;</strong>with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World &amp; Marine Park</strong> with Lunch</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Cruise Dinner</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Phuket (HKT) Airport → Phuket Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Phuket Hotel → Phuket (HKT) Airport Transfer</li>\n	<li>Bangkok (BKK) Airport → Bangkok Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Bangkok Hotel → Bangkok (BKK) Airport Transfer</li>\n	<li>All tours &amp; transfers on a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"818\">private basis</strong>.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":100744,\"hotel_cost\":46996,\"land_cost\":\"82100\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":229840,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 39072.8\",\"selling_price\":268912.7999999999883584678173065185546875,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0725/092025', 268350, 89450, 35620, '2025-09-05 11:24:20', '2025-09-22 06:01:34', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(737, 'Mr. Tushar Patel', 'BNI Celeb Jigar Patel', '9033333611', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KERALA 5*', '2025-09-27', 6, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Cochin\",\"date\":\"27-09-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Cochin Airport. Meet and transfer to the hotel.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Cochin<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin \\u2013 Munnar (130 km \\/ 4 hrs)\",\"date\":\"28-09-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive through scenic landscapes to Munnar \\u2013<em><strong> the hill station of tea gardens. En route visit Cheeyappara &amp; Valara waterfalls<\\/strong><\\/em>. Check in at the hotel and relax. Evening free at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight in Munnar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"29-09-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore <em><strong>Eravikulam National Park, Mattupetty Dam, Echo Point, Kundala Lake, Tea Museum &amp; Blossom Garden.<\\/strong><\\/em> Enjoy panoramic views of the rolling green hills.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Munnar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey (Houseboat) (180 km \\/ 5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"30-09-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to Alleppey. Check in to your <em><strong>traditional houseboat <\\/strong><\\/em>for an overnight backwater cruise. Sail through serene canals, paddy fields, coconut groves and enjoy authentic Kerala meals on board.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight on the houseboat<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey \\u2013 Kovalam (160 km \\/ 4.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"01-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, disembark from the houseboat and proceed to Kovalam. On arrival, check in at the beach resort. Spend the evening at leisure along Lighthouse Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Kovalam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam & Trivandrum Excursion\",\"date\":\"02-10-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a day excursion to Trivandrum. Visit <em><strong>Padmanabhaswamy Temple, Napier Museum, Kuthiramalika Palace<\\/strong><\\/em> and other attractions. Return to Kovalam and relax by the beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight in Kovalam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam \\u2013 Trivandrum Airport (20 km \\/ 30 mins)\",\"date\":\"03-10-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to <em><strong>Trivandrum Airport for your onward journey with beautiful memories of Kerala.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"9689\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"32561\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"2517\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Sep 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Sep 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Trivandrum (TRV)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6169\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"38610\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6113\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/09\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Port Muziris, A Tribute Portfolio Hotel by Marriott\",\"city\":\"COCHIN\",\"room_type\":\"Guest Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"6000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"MUNNAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Scenic - IHCL SeleQtions\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/09\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"16800\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/09\\/2025\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Kerala Criuse Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Premium HB 01 BHK\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"12000\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"01\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KOVALAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Uday Samudra Leisure Beach\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room with Balcony\",\"rate\":\"27300\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/10\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare as mentioned above <strong><em>Ex-Ranchi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Cochin.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Munnar</strong><strong>.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Allepey.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Kovalam.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast @M</strong>unnar,Cochin &amp; Kovalam.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Meals&nbsp;@ </strong>Allepey HB.</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by PVT&nbsp;<strong>Swift Dzire&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary (A/C will be switched off during hilly drives).</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances</li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":71171,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":62100,\"transport_cost\":\"20500\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":153771,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 30754.2\",\"selling_price\":184525.2000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0726/092025', 184780, 79460, 25860, '2025-09-06 12:02:17', '2025-09-30 08:50:26', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(738, 'Mr Ankur Tulsyan', 'BNI CELEB', '7667224924', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-02-05', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Phuket \\u2192 Transfer to Krabi Hotel\",\"date\":\"05-02-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"340\\\" data-start=\\\"308\\\">Phuket International Airport<\\/strong> where our representative will greet you. Transfer by scenic road to <strong data-end=\\\"418\\\" data-start=\\\"409\\\">Krabi<\\/strong> and check in at your hotel. The rest of the day is free at leisure to relax or explore the surroundings.<br data-end=\\\"526\\\" data-start=\\\"523\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch\",\"date\":\"06-02-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set off on a <strong data-end=\\\"682\\\" data-start=\\\"643\\\">full-day 4 Island Tour by speedboat<\\/strong>. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"753\\\" data-start=\\\"690\\\">Phra Nang Cave, Tup Island, Chicken Island, and Poda Island<\\/strong>, where you can swim, snorkel, or simply relax on white sandy beaches. A delicious lunch is served during the tour. Return to the hotel by evening.<br data-end=\\\"903\\\" data-start=\\\"900\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi \\u2192 Phuket | Phuket City Tour with Tiger Kingdom\",\"date\":\"07-02-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1062\\\" data-start=\\\"1052\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>. En route, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1102\\\" data-start=\\\"1082\\\">Phuket City Tour<\\/strong>, covering <strong data-end=\\\"1159\\\" data-start=\\\"1113\\\">Wat Chalong, Karon Viewpoint, Gems Gallery<\\/strong>, and stop at <strong data-end=\\\"1190\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\">Tiger Kingdom<\\/strong> for an unforgettable close encounter with tigers. Later, check in to your Phuket hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1281\\\" data-start=\\\"1278\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Tour by SpeedBoat with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"08-02-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on an unforgettable day trip to the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1492\\\" data-start=\\\"1473\\\">Phi Phi Islands<\\/strong> by SpeedBoat. Discover turquoise waters, limestone cliffs, Maya Bay (photo stop), and colorful marine life while snorkeling and swimming. A buffet lunch is included. Return to the hotel in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1704\\\" data-start=\\\"1701\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2192 Bangkok | Chao Phraya Cruise Dinner\",\"date\":\"09-02-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1866\\\" data-start=\\\"1848\\\">Phuket Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1897\\\" data-start=\\\"1886\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, check in to your hotel. In the evening, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2005\\\" data-start=\\\"1961\\\">romantic Chao Phraya River Cruise Dinner<\\/strong> with live performances and an international buffet against the backdrop of Bangkok\\u2019s illuminated skyline.<br data-end=\\\"2114\\\" data-start=\\\"2111\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"10-02-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2268\\\" data-start=\\\"2238\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s most popular wildlife attraction. Experience the Safari Drive, Orangutan Show, Dolphin Show, and much more. A delicious buffet lunch is served inside the park. Evening free for shopping or leisure.<br data-end=\\\"2481\\\" data-start=\\\"2478\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping on Own + Departure\",\"date\":\"11-02-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy free time for <strong data-end=\\\"2628\\\" data-start=\\\"2604\\\">shopping on your own<\\/strong> at Bangkok\\u2019s famous malls and markets such as MBK Center, Platinum Mall, or Chatuchak (depending on your flight schedule). Later, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2804\\\" data-start=\\\"2785\\\">Bangkok Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight with unforgettable memories of Thailand.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-7251\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"55290\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1901\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:30 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"NOK AIR\",\"fno\":\"DD-525\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"16967\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"THAI VIETJET AIR\",\"fno\":\"VZ-770\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"38814\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7561\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"16200\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"31100\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Patong Paragon Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"35800\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/02\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"check_out\":\"11\\/02\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Centara Watergate Pavilion\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"rate\":\"29800\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">Return Airfare<strong><em>&nbsp;Ex-Ranchi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong><em>20 Kgs Check-In Baggage per Pax&nbsp;</em></strong><em>in&nbsp;</em><strong><em>Nok Air Flights.</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort @ KRABI.</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Patong Paragon Resort &amp; Spa @ PHUKET</strong>.</li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Centara Watergate Pavilion @ BANGKOK</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>04 Island Tour</strong> by Speed Boat&nbsp;<strong>with Lunch</strong>&nbsp;(Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi - Phi &amp; Khai Island tour</strong> by Speed Boat&nbsp;<strong>with Lunch</strong> (Includes NP Fee)</li>\n	<li><strong>Safari World &amp; Marine Park</strong>&nbsp;with Lunch</li>\n	<li><strong>Chaophraya Cruise Dinner</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Phuket (HKT) Airport to Krabi Hotel - Private Transfer</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Krabi Hotel to Phuket &nbsp;Hotel <strong>En-Route Phuket City Tour with Tiger Kingdom </strong>- Private Transfer</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Phuket Hotel to Phuket (HKT) Airport -Private Transfer</li>\n	<li>Transfer from &nbsp;DMK Airport to Bangkok Hotel - Private Transfer</li>\n	<li>Transfer from Bangkok Hotel to Suvarnabhumi (BKK) Airport &nbsp;-Private&nbsp;Transfer</li>\n	<li>All tours &amp; transfers on a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"818\">private basis</strong>.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":127271,\"land_cost\":\"98500\",\"hotel_cost\":96700,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":322471,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 48370.65\",\"selling_price\":370841.650000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0727/092025', 370880, 92720, 0, '2025-09-09 06:01:07', '2025-09-09 07:39:37', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(739, 'Mr Rahil Zafar', 'BNI', '9835714825', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-10-02', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"02 Oct | Arrival in Dubai\",\"date\":\"02-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f Arrive in Dubai from Ranchi. Meet &amp; Greet at the airport and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"343\\\" data-start=\\\"323\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"361\\\" data-start=\\\"358\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-in at <strong data-end=\\\"413\\\" data-start=\\\"373\\\">Hotel Park Regis Kris Kin, Bur Dubai<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"417\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\" \\/>\\nRest of the day free for leisure. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"03 Oct | Half-Day Dubai City Tour + Dubai Frame + Dubai Aquarium & Underwater Zoo\",\"date\":\"03-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"610\\\" data-start=\\\"607\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude90 Proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"655\\\" data-start=\\\"627\\\">Half-Day Dubai City Tour<\\/strong> covering iconic attractions like Jumeirah Mosque, Jumeirah Beach, Palm Jumeirah (Photo Stop), Atlantis Hotel, Sheikh Zayed Road, and more.<br data-end=\\\"797\\\" data-start=\\\"794\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udcf8 Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"825\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\">Dubai Frame<\\/strong> \\u2013 one of the city\\u2019s most iconic landmarks.<br data-end=\\\"871\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udc20 Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"900\\\" data-start=\\\"886\\\">Dubai Mall<\\/strong> and enjoy entry to <strong data-end=\\\"955\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\">Dubai Aquarium &amp; Underwater Zoo<\\/strong> (Regular Pass).<br data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-start=\\\"971\\\" \\/>\\nEvening free at Dubai Mall for shopping &amp; Dubai Fountain Show (optional).<br data-end=\\\"1050\\\" data-start=\\\"1047\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"04 Oct | Miracle Garden + Museum of the Future\",\"date\":\"04-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1174\\\" data-start=\\\"1171\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 Morning visit to the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1235\\\" data-start=\\\"1211\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong> (seasonal floral wonderland).<br data-end=\\\"1268\\\" data-start=\\\"1265\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f Afternoon: Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"1319\\\" data-start=\\\"1295\\\">Museum of the Future<\\/strong> (General Admission) with transfers included.<br data-end=\\\"1367\\\" data-start=\\\"1364\\\" \\/>\\nEvening free for leisure or optional activities.<br data-end=\\\"1418\\\" data-start=\\\"1415\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"05 Oct | Abu Dhabi City Tour with Yas Island (1 Day \\/ 1 Park)\",\"date\":\"05-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1455\\\">\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1557\\\" data-start=\\\"1554\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udd4c Full-day <strong data-end=\\\"1592\\\" data-start=\\\"1569\\\">Abu Dhabi City Tour<\\/strong> including the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"1645\\\" data-start=\\\"1616\\\">Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1649\\\" data-start=\\\"1646\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfa2 Continue to Yas Island for <strong data-end=\\\"1703\\\" data-start=\\\"1679\\\">1 Day \\/ 1 Park Entry<\\/strong> \\u2013 choose between <strong data-end=\\\"1738\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Ferrari World<\\/strong> (thrilling rides &amp; Formula 1 experiences) or <strong data-end=\\\"1805\\\" data-start=\\\"1784\\\">Warner Bros World<\\/strong> (themed attractions &amp; shows).<br data-end=\\\"1838\\\" data-start=\\\"1835\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Dubai in the evening. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"06 Oct | Aquaventure Water Park\",\"date\":\"06-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2217\\\" data-start=\\\"1907\\\">\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1979\\\" data-start=\\\"1976\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf0a Full-day fun at <strong data-end=\\\"2033\\\" data-start=\\\"1998\\\">Atlantis Aquaventure Water Park<\\/strong> \\u2013 enjoy thrilling water slides, wave pools, and relax at the beach.<br data-end=\\\"2104\\\" data-start=\\\"2101\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udc20 Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"2145\\\" data-start=\\\"2119\\\">Lost Chambers Aquarium<\\/strong> (optional add-on).<br data-end=\\\"2167\\\" data-start=\\\"2164\\\" \\/>\\nEvening at leisure. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"07 Oct | Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"07-10-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2294\\\" data-start=\\\"2291\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-out from <strong data-end=\\\"2338\\\" data-start=\\\"2309\\\">Hotel Park Regis Kris Kin<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2342\\\" data-start=\\\"2339\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude96 Private transfer to Dubai International Airport for your flight back to Ranchi with wonderful m<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-5062\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"15500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates Airlines\",\"fno\":\"EK-517\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"84500\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Emirates Airlines\",\"fno\":\"EK\\/FZ-2124\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:10 AM\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-2022\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"14000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"56200\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Park Regis Kris Kin Bur Dubai\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"07\\/10\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"151\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"154\">Flights :&nbsp;</strong>Return Airfare <strong data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"184\">Ex-Ranchi</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"151\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"205\">Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;:<strong> 05 Nights</strong> Stay at <strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"245\">Hotel Park Regis Kris Kin, Bur Dubai</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"697\" data-start=\"677\">🏙️ <strong data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"681\">City Tours</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"167\">\n	<li data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"698\">\n	<p data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"700\"><strong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"700\">Dubai City Tour</strong> with return transfer from Dubai Mall</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"759\">\n	<p data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"761\"><strong data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"761\">Abu Dhabi City Tour with Yas Island</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"805\">\n		<li data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"805\">\n		<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"807\">Choice of <strong data-end=\"836\" data-start=\"817\">1 Day / 1 Park:</strong> Ferrari World <em data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"851\">or</em> Warner Bros</p>\n		</li>\n		<li data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"872\">\n		<p data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"874\">Includes visit to the <strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"896\">Grand Mosque</strong></p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"393\">\n	<p data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"395\"><strong data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"493\">Museum of the Future</strong> (General Admission) with Transfers</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"555\">\n	<p data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"557\"><strong data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"557\">Dubai Aquarium &amp; Underwater Zoo</strong> (Regular Pass)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"675\" data-start=\"610\">\n	<p data-end=\"675\" data-start=\"612\"><strong data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"612\">Aquaventure Water Park</strong> (General Admission) with Transfers</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"448\">\n	<p data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"450\"><strong data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"450\">Miracle Garden</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"471\">\n	<p data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"473\"><strong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"473\">Dubai Frame</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"379\">📄 <strong data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"382\">Visa</strong>&nbsp;: Dubai <strong>Tourist Visa</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"307\" data-start=\"289\">🚖 <strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"292\">Transfers</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"167\">\n	<li data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"308\">\n	<p data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"310\"><strong>Two-Way Dubai Airport</strong> Transfers (Deira, Bur Dubai, SZR) – Private</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"308\">\n	<p data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"310\">Al;l Tours &amp; Transfers on <strong>Private basis.</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":114000,\"land_cost\":\"92000\",\"hotel_cost\":56200,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"13500\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":275700,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 38598\",\"selling_price\":314298}', 'MZQ/0728/092025', 314280, 157140, 0, '2025-09-19 12:15:51', '2025-09-23 11:10:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(740, 'Mr Shashi Dhar', 'Manoj Arya', '+151061018', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'UDAIPUR', '2025-11-03', 3, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival + Old City Highlights\",\"date\":\"03-11-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival in Udaipur, check into your hotel near Lake Pichola or in the Old City area. After settling in, begin your sightseeing with the <strong data-end=\\\"376\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">City Palace<\\/strong>, a masterpiece of Rajasthani architecture and history. Walk across to the nearby <strong data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Jagdish Temple<\\/strong>, known for its intricate carvings. Later, enjoy a leisurely lunch at a lakeside caf\\u00e9 such as Upr\\u00e9. In the evening, take a <strong data-end=\\\"628\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">boat ride on Lake Pichola<\\/strong>, stopping at <strong data-end=\\\"656\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\">Jag Mandir<\\/strong>, and then stroll along <strong data-end=\\\"695\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\">Ambrai Ghat<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"715\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\">Gangaur Ghat<\\/strong>. End your first day with a delightful dinner at Ambrai Restaurant, offering magnificent views of the illuminated <strong data-end=\\\"844\\\" data-start=\\\"829\\\">City Palace<\\/strong> across the lake.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Palaces, Culture & Folk Dance Show\",\"date\":\"04-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\">Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace)<\\/strong>, perched on a hilltop with breathtaking panoramic views of the city and its lakes. For nature lovers, the <strong data-end=\\\"1134\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\">Sajjangarh Biological Park<\\/strong> nearby makes for an enjoyable stop. Return to the city for lunch at Millets of Mewar or Hello Boho before heading to <strong data-end=\\\"1272\\\" data-start=\\\"1252\\\">Bagore Ki Haveli<\\/strong>, a historic haveli showcasing the region\\u2019s cultural heritage. In the evening, watch the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1368\\\">Dharohar Folk Dance Show<\\/strong> at the haveli, a colorful performance of traditional Rajasthani dance and music. Conclude the day with dinner at 1559 AD or Raaj Bagh near <strong data-end=\\\"1556\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Fateh Sagar Lake<\\/strong>, both known for their ambience and authentic cuisine.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur \\u2192 Kumbhalgarh  \\u2192 Udaipur\",\"date\":\"05-11-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast,&nbsp;drive through the scenic Aravalli hills to <strong data-end=\\\"1653\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\">Kumbhalgarh<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site famed for its grand fort and forested surroundings.<br data-end=\\\"1738\\\" data-start=\\\"1735\\\" \\/>\\nEn route, stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"1793\\\" data-start=\\\"1758\\\">rural pottery or tribal village<\\/strong> for an authentic local experience.<br data-end=\\\"1831\\\" data-start=\\\"1828\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival, check in to your resort nestled amidst the Aravalli wilderness. In the evening, enjoy leisure time by the pool or a guided nature walk.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"6th November: Shopping + Departure\",\"date\":\"06-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2812\\\" data-start=\\\"2392\\\">Enjoy a relaxed breakfast and check out from your hotel. Use the morning for some last-minute shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"2518\\\" data-start=\\\"2498\\\">Hathi Pol Bazaar<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"2537\\\" data-start=\\\"2522\\\">Bada Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll find <strong data-end=\\\"2618\\\" data-start=\\\"2557\\\">miniature paintings, textiles, mojris, and silver jewelry<\\/strong>. Stop for a quick coffee or light meal at <strong data-end=\\\"2679\\\" data-start=\\\"2661\\\">Caf\\u00e9 Edelweiss<\\/strong> before heading to the airport or railway station for your onward journey, taking along wonderful memories of your Udaipur getaway.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"03\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"UDAIPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Oberoi Udaivilas\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"06\\/11\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova Crysta</strong> as per the above Itinerary.</li>\n	<li>All Toll/Parking/Driver Allowances.</li>\n	<li>Taxes<br />\n	&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any Monument/Fort Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"31\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"18000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":18000,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5580\",\"selling_price\":23580}', 'MZQ/0729/092025', 23480, 11740, 0, '2025-09-22 10:35:47', '2025-10-05 06:46:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(741, 'Mr Norbert', 'Ladli Netherland', '9749006646', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GUJARAT', '2025-11-18', 2, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ahmedabad \\u2013 Dholavira (385 km \\/ 7\\u20138 hrs)\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"390\\\" data-start=\\\"369\\\">Ahmedabad Airport<\\/strong> and begin your journey towards <strong data-end=\\\"435\\\" data-start=\\\"422\\\">Dholavira<\\/strong>. En route, marvel at the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"470\\\">Modhera Sun Temple<\\/strong> \\ud83d\\uded5 dedicated to Surya, admire the UNESCO World Heritage site <strong data-end=\\\"569\\\" data-start=\\\"554\\\">Rani ki Vav<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udfdb at Patan, and pay homage at the spiritual <strong data-end=\\\"641\\\" data-start=\\\"615\\\">Panchasara Jain Temple<\\/strong>. Continue your drive through scenic landscapes and arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"716\\\" data-start=\\\"703\\\">Dholavira<\\/strong> by evening. Check in to your hotel and unwind. Overnight stay at Dholavira.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dholavira \\u2013 Little Rann of Kutch (255 km \\/ 6 hrs)\",\"date\":\"19-11-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the <strong data-end=\\\"933\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">archaeological site of Dholavira<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udffa, one of the most important sites of the <strong data-end=\\\"1006\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\">Indus Valley Civilization<\\/strong>. Discover ancient <strong data-end=\\\"1073\\\" data-start=\\\"1025\\\">seals, reservoirs, city ruins, and artefacts<\\/strong> that reflect the ingenuity of early civilizations. Later, drive to the rugged yet enchanting <strong data-end=\\\"1191\\\" data-start=\\\"1167\\\">Little Rann of Kutch<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udf05. Check in to your resort and spend a relaxed evening in the rustic charm of Kutch. Overnight stay at Little Rann.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Little Rann Safari \\u2013 Ahmedabad Drop (140 km \\/ 3 hrs)\",\"date\":\"20-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, embark on an adventurous <strong data-end=\\\"1465\\\" data-start=\\\"1427\\\">safari in the Little Rann of Kutch<\\/strong> \\ud83d\\udc06, spotting the rare <strong data-end=\\\"1508\\\" data-start=\\\"1488\\\">Asiatic Wild Ass<\\/strong> and migratory birds in their natural habitat. Visit nearby <strong data-end=\\\"1604\\\" data-start=\\\"1568\\\">Rabari &amp; Bharwad tribal villages<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udfa8 to experience their vibrant lifestyle, crafts, and traditions. After breakfast, drive back to <strong data-end=\\\"1715\\\" data-start=\\\"1702\\\">Ahmedabad<\\/strong>. On arrival, get dropped at <strong data-end=\\\"1773\\\" data-start=\\\"1744\\\">Ahmedabad Airport \\/ Hotel<\\/strong> for your onward journey with fond memories of Gujarat\\u2019s cultural &amp; natural heritage.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Rann Resort\",\"city\":\"Dholavira\",\"room_type\":\"AC Bhunga\",\"meal\":\"ap\",\"rooms\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/11\\/2025\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Fern Little Rann of Kutch\",\"city\":\"Bajana (LRK)\",\"room_type\":\"Winter Green Premium\",\"rooms\":2,\"check_out\":\"20\\/11\\/2025\",\"nights\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in <strong>Hotel Rann Resort </strong>@<strong>Dholavira.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation <strong>Hotel Fern Little Rann of Kutch</strong> @<strong>Munnar.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02 Rooms | 01 Room</strong> on <strong>Double Sharing + 01 Room </strong>on <strong>Single Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner @ </strong>all above <strong>Hotels</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Tours &amp; Transfer&nbsp;by <strong>01</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Innova Crysta SUV on Private&nbsp;</strong>as per the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Toll charges, Parking charges, Driver allowances.</li>\n	<li><strong>01 English speaking Guide</strong> throughout the tour.</li>\n	<li><strong>All Entrance Tickets.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Gir Safari Permit Charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Gir Safari Gypsy.</strong></li>\n	<li>All taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"40\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":\"44100\",\"transport_cost\":\"20000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Safari Jeep\",\"amount\":\"10000\"},{\"name\":\"Guide\",\"amount\":9000},{\"name\":\"Entrance Charges\",\"amount\":5000},{\"name\":\"Gir Permit\",\"amount\":18000}],\"cost_price\":106100,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 42440\",\"selling_price\":148540}', 'MZQ/0730/092025', 148560, 49520, 0, '2025-09-22 11:11:55', '2025-09-22 11:54:01', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(742, 'Mr. Kushal', 'BNI | SAKET SARAF', '7739101100', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2025-12-16', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Pickup. Later Carbyns Cove Beach and Light and Sound Show at Cellular Jail\",\"date\":\"16-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Port Blair in the morning\\/afternoon by flight and our representative will be waiting outside the airport holding a placard with your name on it. You will be taken to your hotel where you rest and relax. Later we proceed to Corbyn\'s Cove. Coastal drive to this beach is awesome, a stretch of around 4 Km with an open sea towards your left is a sight to experience. Take pit stops during this ride to click pictures and to explore the beauty. Later proceed to attend the enthralling Sound and Light Show at Cellular Jail - where the heroic saga of the Indian freedom struggle is brought alive. Enacting of freedom fighters and their struggle for India\\u2019s Independence is enacted during this trip. Post completion of this trip, we drop you back at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair To Havelock in Cruise. Later Radhanagar Beach visit Until Sunset\",\"date\":\"17-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today we depart to the Andaman Islands most amazing destination, Havelock Island. This destination is rated as the best island in India. Depart from Port Blair to Havelock Island on a ferry. Upon reaching Havelock, our representative attends you and will drop you at your hotel. Later we begin our journey to one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches, Radhanagar Beach. Explore this white sand beach and bask in the beauty of this natural wonder. You stay at this beach until sunset. Post this we drop you back to your resort where you relax and unwind.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Boat Ride Tour and Complimentary Snorkelling with Hotel Pickup and Drop\",\"date\":\"18-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Well, how about exploring something underwater. Today, we begin our journey to the most visited snorkeling destination in Havelock Island, Elephant Beach. Around 30 Minutes by boat, Elephant Beach flaunts one among the best reefs in Havelock Island. The great thing is that the reef here starts at a depth of less than a meter. Upon reaching Elephant beach, we rest and relax. Later, a guide takes you to provide a complimentary snorkeling session at Elephant Beach (Snorkeling at Havelock Island depends upon the association guidelines). After the trip, we return back from Elephant beach to the Havelock dock in a boat. At the dock, our team attends you and drops you at your hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock To Neil Island in Cruise Later Visit Laxmanpur Beach For Sunset\",\"date\":\"19-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel in Havelock Island and board a premium cruise to Neil Island, upon reaching Neil island our representative will assist you to your resort to check-in. Rest at the hotel and then proceed to visit Laxmanpur beach. This is a secluded beach that lies 2 km north of Neils jetty. Experience a magnificent sunset at this beach. Post this we drop you back to your hotel in Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Ferry Timing from Havelock to Neil Island is around 10:00 AM. Ferry timings are subject to change and our team will update you in case of such changes.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Natural Rock Formation and Bharatpur Beach Trip Later Neil to Port Blair in Cruise and Hotel Drop and Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"20-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Today, we begin our journey to visit Natural rock formation which is a major attraction at Neil. Post this we visit Bharatpur Beach where you can indulge yourself in swimming and water activities such as Scuba Diving, Glass bottom boat ride and Jet Ski ride. Food options are available at Bharatpur beach. Post completion of the trip we drop you back to Neil jetty to board a cruise to Port Blair. Upon reaching Port Blair our representative will attend you and will drop you to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later in the evening, we take a shopping tour to the best locations where coral artifacts are sold. Purchase gifts for your friends and family from these places. Post this tour we drop you back to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Do note that hotels have an early check-out time. Guest will need to keep their luggage in the reception kiosk if your scheduled flight is in the afternoon. If you wish to visit any attraction during your free time then do let us know.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"263\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"20000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"SpiceJet\",\"fno\":\"254\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"22000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Executive AC Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Lagoon\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Lagoon\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"20\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Executive AC Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"21\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-<strong>Kolkata.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at given hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast </strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by&nbsp;Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;</strong><em>(Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger)</em><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong>at all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":42000,\"land_cost\":\"83762\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":125762,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 17606.68\",\"selling_price\":143368.6799999999930150806903839111328125}', 'MZQ/0731/092025', 143880, 71940, 12480, '2025-09-23 05:33:52', '2025-09-23 10:13:29', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(743, 'Mr. Rohit Prasad', 'BNI CELEB', '9031771858', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM 5*', '2025-11-08', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG ARRIVAL \\u2013 HALF DAY CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"08-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"553\\\" data-start=\\\"397\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"446\\\" data-start=\\\"413\\\">Da Nang International Airport<\\/strong>, meet our friendly <strong data-end=\\\"491\\\" data-start=\\\"466\\\">tour guide and driver<\\/strong> for a warm welcome and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"613\\\" data-start=\\\"555\\\">Later, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"570\\\">half-day sightseeing tour<\\/strong> of Da Nang:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"864\\\" data-start=\\\"614\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"763\\\" data-start=\\\"614\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"763\\\" data-start=\\\"616\\\">Visit <strong data-end=\\\"641\\\" data-start=\\\"622\\\">Marble Mountain<\\/strong>, a cluster of five marble and limestone hills dotted with ancient pagodas, caves, and shrines offering panoramic views.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"864\\\" data-start=\\\"764\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"864\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\">Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"795\\\" data-start=\\\"778\\\">Dragon Bridge<\\/strong>, the city\\u2019s most iconic landmark symbolizing power and prosperity.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\">Return to your hotel for a relaxing evening at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1008\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"937\\\" data-start=\\\"925\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meal:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"945\\\" data-start=\\\"942\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"967\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"968\\\">Pullman Danang Beach Resort<\\/em>, Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY BA NA HILLS & GOLDEN BRIDGE TOUR\",\"date\":\"09-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1240\\\" data-start=\\\"1073\\\">After breakfast, depart for the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1127\\\" data-start=\\\"1112\\\">Ba Na Hills<\\/strong>, located about 25 km from Da Nang. En route, enjoy the scenic seaside drive along <strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1210\\\">Nguyen Tat Thanh Street<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1427\\\" data-start=\\\"1242\\\">Arrive at the <strong data-end=\\\"1283\\\" data-start=\\\"1256\\\">Ba Na Cable Car Station<\\/strong> and experience one of the world\\u2019s longest and highest cable car rides. Witness stunning aerial views of the lush mountains and valleys below.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1453\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Highlights of the day:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1869\\\" data-start=\\\"1454\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1454\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1456\\\">Walk across the <strong data-end=\\\"1489\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\">Golden Bridge<\\/strong>, a 150-meter-long structure held by two giant stone hands, offering breathtaking views.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1659\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1659\\\" data-start=\\\"1582\\\">Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1588\\\">Le Jardin d\\u2019Amour<\\/strong>, a charming French garden with colorful blooms.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1733\\\" data-start=\\\"1660\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1733\\\" data-start=\\\"1662\\\">See the <strong data-end=\\\"1689\\\" data-start=\\\"1670\\\">Ling Ung Pagoda<\\/strong> with its towering 27-meter Buddha statue.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1869\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1869\\\" data-start=\\\"1736\\\">Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"1766\\\" data-start=\\\"1748\\\">French Village<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1787\\\" data-start=\\\"1768\\\">Chua Mount Peak<\\/strong>, and scenic attractions like the <strong data-end=\\\"1842\\\" data-start=\\\"1821\\\">Rainbow Waterfall<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"1866\\\" data-start=\\\"1847\\\">Dreaming Stream<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1902\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\">Return to Da Nang by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1992\\\" data-start=\\\"1904\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1916\\\" data-start=\\\"1904\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1929\\\" data-start=\\\"1926\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1951\\\" data-start=\\\"1929\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"1981\\\" data-start=\\\"1952\\\">Pullman Danang Beach Resort<\\/em>, Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG \\u2013 PHU QUOC (BY FLIGHT)\",\"date\":\"10-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2156\\\" data-start=\\\"2046\\\">Enjoy breakfast at the hotel. Later, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2114\\\" data-start=\\\"2095\\\">Da Nang Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2153\\\" data-start=\\\"2134\\\">Phu Quoc Island<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2349\\\" data-start=\\\"2158\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-start=\\\"2174\\\">Phu Quoc Airport<\\/strong>, our driver will meet and transfer you to your resort for check-in. Spend the rest of the day at leisure, exploring the island or relaxing by the beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2448\\\" data-start=\\\"2351\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2363\\\" data-start=\\\"2351\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2376\\\" data-start=\\\"2373\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2398\\\" data-start=\\\"2376\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"2436\\\" data-start=\\\"2399\\\">Sheraton Phu Quoc Long Beach Resort<\\/em>, Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY VIN WONDER & GRAND WORLD\",\"date\":\"11-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2153\\\" data-start=\\\"2054\\\">After breakfast, transfer to the <strong data-end=\\\"2110\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">north of the island<\\/strong> for a fun-filled day at <strong data-end=\\\"2150\\\" data-start=\\\"2135\\\">Vin-complex<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2342\\\" data-start=\\\"2155\\\">Enjoy the day at <strong data-end=\\\"2195\\\" data-start=\\\"2172\\\">VinWonders Phu Quoc<\\/strong> \\u2013 Vietnam\\u2019s largest theme park, featuring thrilling rides, world-class performances, and record-breaking attractions that are among Asia\\u2019s best.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2528\\\" data-start=\\\"2344\\\">Later, explore <strong data-end=\\\"2383\\\" data-start=\\\"2359\\\">Grand World Phu Quoc<\\/strong> \\u2013 the sleepless entertainment city offering stunning Venetian-style canals, boutique shops, vibrant night markets, and spectacular live shows.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2568\\\" data-start=\\\"2530\\\">Return to your hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2667\\\" data-start=\\\"2570\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2583\\\" data-start=\\\"2570\\\">Included:<\\/strong> Transfers, entrance fees<br data-end=\\\"2611\\\" data-start=\\\"2608\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2620\\\" data-start=\\\"2611\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2633\\\" data-start=\\\"2630\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2647\\\" data-start=\\\"2633\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2921\\\" data-start=\\\"2824\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"STARFISH BEACH \\u2013 SUNSET TOWN \\u2013 KISS BRIDGE \\u2013 KISS OF THE SEA SHOW\",\"date\":\"12-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3195\\\" data-start=\\\"3010\\\">After breakfast, your guide will take you to the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"3087\\\" data-start=\\\"3069\\\">Starfish Beach<\\/strong>, known for its clear waters and abundance of vibrant starfish. Relax, swim, and enjoy the tropical vibes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3404\\\" data-start=\\\"3197\\\">In the afternoon, visit <strong data-end=\\\"3236\\\" data-start=\\\"3221\\\">Sunset Town<\\/strong>, a charming Mediterranean-style area filled with cafes, shops, and stunning viewpoints. Walk along the famous <strong data-end=\\\"3362\\\" data-start=\\\"3347\\\">Kiss Bridge<\\/strong>, an iconic spot for sunset photography.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3599\\\" data-start=\\\"3406\\\">In the evening, witness the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"3472\\\" data-start=\\\"3446\\\">\\u201cKiss of the Sea Show\\u201d<\\/strong> \\u2013 a world-class performance combining fireworks, lasers, water effects, and music that promises an unforgettable experience.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3698\\\" data-start=\\\"3601\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3613\\\" data-start=\\\"3601\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3626\\\" data-start=\\\"3623\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3648\\\" data-start=\\\"3626\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"3686\\\" data-start=\\\"3649\\\">Sheraton Phu Quoc Long Beach Resort<\\/em>, Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHU QUOC DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"13-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3935\\\" data-start=\\\"3740\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Depending on your flight schedule, spend some free time shopping or relaxing before your transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3904\\\" data-start=\\\"3884\\\">Phu Quoc Airport<\\/strong> for your return flight home.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3937\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3949\\\" data-start=\\\"3937\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"191\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"07:05 AM\",\"fare\":\"90000\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"fno\":\"746\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"10:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"00\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"1719\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:50 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"05:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"40000\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh City (SGN)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"1824\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:05 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"01:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"114700\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh City (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"977\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"10:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DA NANG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pullman Danang Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"10\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"80000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"10\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sheraton Phu Quoc Long Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"13\\/11\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"77500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"191\">Return airfare <strong><em data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"206\">Ex-Delhi.</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"246\"><strong data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"246\">02 Nights stay</strong> at <em data-end=\"297\" data-start=\"268\">Pullman Danang Beach Resort</em> (Deluxe Ocean View Room – Twin Sharing) @ <strong data-end=\"351\" data-start=\"340\">DA NANG</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"356\"><strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"356\">03 Nights stay</strong> at <em data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"378\">Sheraton Phu Quoc Long Beach Resort</em> (Deluxe Ocean View Room – Twin Sharing) @ <strong data-end=\"470\" data-start=\"458\">PHU QUOC</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"526\" data-start=\"490\">Daily <strong data-end=\"510\" data-start=\"496\">Breakfasts</strong> at the hotels.</li>\n	<li><strong>02 Days Experienced English-speaking guide in Da Nang</strong> as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"618\">All <strong data-end=\"643\" data-start=\"622\">Airport Transfers</strong> and <strong data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"648\">Tours</strong> by <strong data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"661\">Private Air-Conditioned Vehicle</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"788\"><strong data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"788\">Mineral Water</strong>&nbsp;is provided daily during tours and transfers</li>\n	<li data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"868\"><strong data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"868\">Vietnam Tourist e-VISA</strong></li>\n	<li style=\"display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -9999px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;\">&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"19\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":244700,\"land_cost\":\"101192\",\"hotel_cost\":157500,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"14000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":517392,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 98304.48\",\"selling_price\":615696.4799999999813735485076904296875}', 'MZQ/0732/092025', 615680, 153920, 0, '2025-09-23 09:50:04', '2025-10-09 12:23:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(744, 'Ms. Sushmita Ghosh', 'DAV Bariatu', '9546775858', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HONGKONG & MACAU', '2025-10-21', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Macau via HZMB Transfer\",\"date\":\"21-10-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Hong Kong International Airport and proceed to the HZMB (Macau Port) under the MGTO promotion for a one-way direct bus transfer to Macau (subject to availability). No immigration is required in Hong Kong. Exchange your voucher at the E2 counter and board the scheduled bus. On arrival at Macau Port, complete immigration formalities. You will be picked up from the Border Gate (Zhuhai Exit) by a private driver holding a placard. Proceed for a smooth private transfer (approx. 15\\u201325 mins) to your <em><strong>Macau hotel.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Macau City Tour\",\"date\":\"22-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a morning shared city tour of Macau on a SIC (Seat-in-Coach) basis with fixed timings. The tour includes major landmarks like the Ruins of St. Paul\\u2019s Church, Na Cha Temple, Golden Lotus Square, the Fortress, and Fisherman\\u2019s Wharf. After the tour, <em><strong>return to your hotel.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer to Hong Kong\",\"date\":\"23-10-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from your Macau hotel and transfer to Taipa Ferry Pier. Board a Cotai Class ferry for a day sailing to Hong Kong Ferry Pier. On arrival, a private transfer will take you from the ferry terminal to your hotel in Kowloon.<em><strong> Check in and relax for the day.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Disneyland Tour (SIC)\",\"date\":\"24-10-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a magical day at Hong Kong Disneyland. The package includes entry tickets and return SIC transfers at fixed timings. Spend the day enjoying thrilling rides, parades, and attractions before returning to your hotel in the evening<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hong Kong Night Tour\",\"date\":\"25-10-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the evening, head out on a shared night tour of Hong Kong. Visit Victoria Peak via one-way Peak Tram, explore Madame Tussauds Wax Museum, take a one-way Star Ferry ride, and see the Old Clock Tower and local night market. SIC return transfer included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ocean Park Tour\",\"date\":\"26-10-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Spend the day at Ocean Park Hong Kong with entry tickets and SIC return transfers included. Explore its exciting rides, animal exhibits, and marine attractions. Return to your hotel after a fun-filled day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Hong Kong\",\"date\":\"27-10-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from your hotel and meet your driver in the lobby for your private transfer to Hong Kong International Airport.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Proceed with your departure flight as per schedule.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Macau\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Crowne Plaza\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room +01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Hong Kong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Regal Kowloon\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room +01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"27\\/10\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><em><strong>02 Nights</strong></em> accommodation in <em><strong>Hotel Crowne Plaza&nbsp;@Macau.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><em><strong>04 Nights&nbsp;</strong></em> accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Regal Kowloon&nbsp;@Hong Kong</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Accommodation with <em><strong>daily breakfast.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></em></li>\n	<li>All tours on <em><strong>SIC basis </strong></em>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>All transfers are private in <em><strong>Hong Kong &amp; Macau</strong></em> &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Point-to-point transfers only with a maximum waiting time of 15 minutes &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Airport transfers operate between 08:00 – 20:00 &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Surcharges will apply for <strong>services outside these hours &nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>Includes 01 piece of baggage per person (L+W+H = max 202 cm) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Vehicle: MPV with boot space approx. 1000 x 1200 mm<br />\n	&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"237036\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":237036,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35555.4\",\"selling_price\":272591.400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0733/092025', 273090, 91030, 0, '2025-09-23 14:34:02', '2025-09-23 14:54:00', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(745, 'Ms Ritika Bhadani', 'BNI', '9986197203', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2025-12-21', 6, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"516\\\" data-start=\\\"280\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f Arrive at Dubai International Airport. Meet &amp; Greet followed by <strong data-end=\\\"457\\\" data-start=\\\"437\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to Hotel Ascot, Bur Dubai.<br data-end=\\\"487\\\" data-start=\\\"484\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-in and relax. Evening free for leisure or optional shopping at Meena Bazaar.<br data-end=\\\"572\\\" data-start=\\\"569\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour + Dubai Frame + Burj Khalifa (124\\u2013125 Floors)\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"710\\\" data-start=\\\"707\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude90 Morning <strong data-end=\\\"740\\\" data-start=\\\"721\\\">Dubai City Tour<\\/strong> covering Jumeirah Mosque, Jumeirah Beach, Sheikh Zayed Road, Palm Jumeirah (photo stop), Atlantis The Palm, and other landmarks.<br data-end=\\\"872\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udcf8 Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"907\\\" data-start=\\\"892\\\">Dubai Frame<\\/strong>, offering stunning panoramic views of Old &amp; New Dubai.<br data-end=\\\"965\\\" data-start=\\\"962\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf06 Evening: Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"1043\\\" data-start=\\\"987\\\">Burj Khalifa (124th &amp; 125th Floors \\u2013 Non Prime Time)<\\/strong> to witness breathtaking skyline views.<br data-end=\\\"1085\\\" data-start=\\\"1082\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Museum of the Future + Dhow Cruise\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1206\\\" data-start=\\\"1203\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f Explore the futuristic <strong data-end=\\\"1257\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\">Museum of the Future<\\/strong> (General Admission) with transfers.<br data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-start=\\\"1293\\\" \\/>\\n\\u26f5 Evening: Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1360\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">Deluxe Dhow Cruise Dinner at Dubai Marina<\\/strong> with international buffet and live entertainment.<br data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-start=\\\"1410\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Abu Dhabi City Tour + Yas Island (1 Day \\/ 1 Park)\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1455\\\">\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1549\\\" data-start=\\\"1546\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udd4c Full-day <strong data-end=\\\"1584\\\" data-start=\\\"1561\\\">Abu Dhabi City Tour<\\/strong> \\u2013 visit the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"1635\\\" data-start=\\\"1606\\\">Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque<\\/strong>, Corniche, and city highlights.<br data-end=\\\"1670\\\" data-start=\\\"1667\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfa2 Afternoon: <strong data-end=\\\"1708\\\" data-start=\\\"1684\\\">1 Day \\/ 1 Park Entry<\\/strong> at Yas Island \\u2013 choose between <strong data-end=\\\"1757\\\" data-start=\\\"1740\\\">Ferrari World<\\/strong> (thrill rides, Formula 1) or <strong data-end=\\\"1808\\\" data-start=\\\"1787\\\">Warner Bros World<\\/strong> (family-friendly attractions).<br data-end=\\\"1842\\\" data-start=\\\"1839\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Dubai in the evening. Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Miracle Garden + Global Village\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2217\\\" data-start=\\\"1907\\\">\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1992\\\" data-start=\\\"1989\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 Morning visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"2040\\\" data-start=\\\"2016\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong>, a breathtaking floral wonderland.<br data-end=\\\"2078\\\" data-start=\\\"2075\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf0d Evening proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2118\\\" data-start=\\\"2100\\\">Global Village<\\/strong>, a cultural, shopping &amp; entertainment hub with international pavilions and live shows.<br data-end=\\\"2208\\\" data-start=\\\"2205\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Premium Desert Safari Experience\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2327\\\" data-start=\\\"2324\\\" \\/>\\nMorning free at leisure for shopping at Dubai Mall \\/ Gold Souk (optional).<br data-end=\\\"2404\\\" data-start=\\\"2401\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfdc\\ufe0f Afternoon proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"2457\\\" data-start=\\\"2432\\\">Premium Desert Safari<\\/strong> \\u2013 dune bashing, camel rides, henna painting, BBQ dinner, belly dance &amp; live cultural shows.<br data-end=\\\"2552\\\" data-start=\\\"2549\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay at the hotel.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2802\\\" data-start=\\\"2589\\\">\\ud83c\\udf74 Breakfast at hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2659\\\" data-start=\\\"2656\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-out from Hotel Ascot, Bur Dubai.<br data-end=\\\"2700\\\" data-start=\\\"2697\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude96 Private transfer to Dubai International Airport for your flight back with unforgettable memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rate\":\"38500\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ascot Bur Dubai\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"27\\/12\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6}]', '<p data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"151\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"205\">Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;:<strong> 06&nbsp;Nights</strong> Stay at <strong data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"245\">Hotel Ascot, Bur Dubai</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"697\" data-start=\"677\">🏙️ <strong data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"681\">City Tours</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"167\">\n	<li data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"698\">\n	<p data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"700\"><strong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"700\">Dubai City Tour</strong>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<b>Burj Khalifa</b> (124th and 125th floors)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"759\">\n	<p data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"761\"><strong data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"761\">Abu Dhabi City Tour with Yas Island</strong></p>\n\n	<ul data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"805\">\n		<li data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"805\">\n		<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"807\">Choice of <strong data-end=\"836\" data-start=\"817\">1 Day / 1 Park:</strong> Ferrari World <em data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"851\">or</em> Warner Bros</p>\n		</li>\n		<li data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"805\">\n		<p data-end=\"869\" data-start=\"807\"><strong>BAPS Hindu Temple</strong></p>\n		</li>\n		<li data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"872\">\n		<p data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"874\">Includes visit to the <strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"896\">Grand Mosque</strong></p>\n		</li>\n	</ul>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"393\">\n	<p data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"395\"><strong data-end=\"517\" data-start=\"493\">Museum of the Future</strong> (General Admission) with Transfers</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"393\">\n	<p data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"395\"><strong>Deluxe Dhow Cruise</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"393\">\n	<p data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"395\"><strong>Premium Desert Safari</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"555\">\n	<p data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"557\"><strong data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"450\">Miracle Garden + Global Village</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"471\">\n	<p data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"473\"><strong data-end=\"488\" data-start=\"473\">Dubai Frame</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"379\">📄 <strong data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"382\">Visa</strong>&nbsp;: Dubai <strong>Tourist Visa</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"307\" data-start=\"289\">🚖 <strong data-end=\"305\" data-start=\"292\">Transfers</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"167\">\n	<li data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"308\">\n	<p data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"310\"><strong>Two-Way Dubai Airport</strong> Transfers (Deira, Bur Dubai, SZR) – Private</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"308\">\n	<p data-end=\"377\" data-start=\"310\">Al;l Tours &amp; Transfers on <strong>Private basis.</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"92000\",\"hotel_cost\":38500,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"15000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":145500,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 20370\",\"selling_price\":165870}', 'MZQ/0734/092025', 166450, 62900, 40650, '2025-09-23 14:37:51', '2025-09-23 14:58:49', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(746, 'Mr Rakesh Kumar', 'Jijoo Gomoh', '9431093001', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-10-08', 6, 0, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok \\u2192 Transfer to Pattaya\",\"date\":\"08-10-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"326\\\" data-start=\\\"307\\\">Bangkok Airport<\\/strong> in the early morning and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"407\\\" data-start=\\\"364\\\">Sunshine Hotel &amp; Residences, Pattaya \\ud83c\\udfe8<\\/strong>. After check-in, the day is free at leisure. You may relax at the hotel, explore <strong data-end=\\\"506\\\" data-start=\\\"489\\\">Pattaya Beach<\\/strong>, stroll around <strong data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"522\\\">Walking Street<\\/strong>, or shop at <strong data-end=\\\"573\\\" data-start=\\\"553\\\">Terminal 21 Mall<\\/strong>. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"604\\\" data-start=\\\"593\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2192 Bangkok\",\"date\":\"09-10-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer back to <strong data-end=\\\"718\\\" data-start=\\\"707\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax. The evening is free to explore <strong data-end=\\\"824\\\" data-start=\\\"797\\\">Bangkok\\u2019s shopping hubs<\\/strong> or enjoy an optional <strong data-end=\\\"881\\\" data-start=\\\"846\\\">Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"912\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure in Bangkok\",\"date\":\"10-10-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast at your hotel. Today is kept free for you to explore Bangkok at your own pace. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1117\\\" data-start=\\\"1069\\\">The Grand Palace, Wat Pho &amp; Wat Arun Temples<\\/strong>, experience a <strong data-end=\\\"1156\\\" data-start=\\\"1132\\\">floating market tour<\\/strong>, or indulge in shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"1242\\\" data-start=\\\"1184\\\">MBK Center, Platinum Mall, or Chatuchak Weekend Market<\\/strong>. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"1273\\\" data-start=\\\"1262\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok \\u2192 Phuket\",\"date\":\"11-10-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1401\\\" data-start=\\\"1370\\\">Don Mueang (DMK) Airport \\ud83d\\udeeb<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1431\\\" data-start=\\\"1421\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>. On arrival, transfer to your hotel and check in. The evening is free to relax or explore <strong data-end=\\\"1538\\\" data-start=\\\"1522\\\">Patong Beach<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"1568\\\" data-start=\\\"1543\\\">Bangla Road nightlife<\\/strong>. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"1598\\\" data-start=\\\"1588\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour\",\"date\":\"12-10-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a full-day <strong data-end=\\\"1779\\\" data-start=\\\"1696\\\">James Bond Island Tour by Speedboat \\ud83d\\udee5\\ufe0f with Lunch (Includes National Park Fee)<\\/strong>. Explore the dramatic limestone cliffs of <strong data-end=\\\"1839\\\" data-start=\\\"1822\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1896\\\" data-start=\\\"1858\\\">Khao Phing Kan (James Bond Island)<\\/strong>, and enjoy canoeing through sea caves and lagoons. Return to Phuket in the evening. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"2009\\\" data-start=\\\"1999\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Tour\",\"date\":\"13-10-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After an early breakfast, set off on a <strong data-end=\\\"2185\\\" data-start=\\\"2105\\\">Phi Phi Island Tour by Speedboat \\ud83d\\udee5\\ufe0f with Lunch (Includes National Park Fee)<\\/strong>. Discover <strong data-end=\\\"2208\\\" data-start=\\\"2196\\\">Maya Bay<\\/strong> (made famous by \\u201cThe Beach\\u201d), snorkel in crystal-clear waters at <strong data-end=\\\"2306\\\" data-start=\\\"2274\\\">Loh Samah Bay &amp; Pileh Lagoon<\\/strong>, and relax on the pristine beaches of <strong data-end=\\\"2360\\\" data-start=\\\"2345\\\">Phi Phi Don<\\/strong>. Return to Phuket in the evening. Overnight stay in <strong data-end=\\\"2423\\\" data-start=\\\"2413\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour + Departure\",\"date\":\"14-10-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your hotel. Proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"2571\\\" data-start=\\\"2547\\\">Phuket City Tour \\ud83c\\udfdd\\ufe0f<\\/strong>, covering attractions such as <strong data-end=\\\"2657\\\" data-start=\\\"2602\\\">Karon Viewpoint, Big Buddha, and Wat Chalong Temple<\\/strong>. Later, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2699\\\" data-start=\\\"2678\\\">Phuket Airport \\ud83d\\udeeb<\\/strong> for your onward flight, carrying wonderful memories of Thailand.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD-3017\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"9697\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD-3018\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Oct 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:55 PM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"07\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel SUNSHINE HOTEL AND RESIDENCES\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"5338\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"11\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Citrus Patong By Compass Hospitality\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Balcony\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"14\\/10\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"9447\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">Airfare<strong><em>&nbsp;BKK-HKT-BKK.</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong><em>20 Kgs Check-In Baggage per Pax&nbsp;</em></strong><em>in&nbsp;</em><strong><em>Thai Air Asia Flights</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel SUNSHINE HOTEL AND RESIDENCES @ Pattaya</strong>.</li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>03 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Citrus Patong By Compass Hospitality @ Phuket.</strong></li>\n	<li data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><strong>James Bond Island Tour</strong>&nbsp;by <strong>Speed Boat / Big Boat with Local Lunch</strong> (Includes NP Fee)SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Phi Phi Island Tour </strong>by<strong> Speed Boat with Local Lunch</strong> (Includes NP Fee)SIC</li>\n	<li><strong>Phuket City Tour </strong>( Wat Chalong, Karon view point, Gems Gallery ) - Private Transfer (4 Hours)</li>\n	<li>Bangkok (BKK) Airport → Pattaya Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Pattaya Hotel&nbsp;→ Bangkok Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Bangkok Hotel → Bangkok (BKK) Airport Transfer</li>\n	<li>Phuket (HKT) Airport → Phuket Hotel Transfer</li>\n	<li>Phuket Hotel → Phuket (HKT) Airport Transfer</li>\n	<li>All tours on <strong>SIC</strong> &amp; transfers on a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"835\" data-start=\"818\">private basis</strong>.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":9697,\"hotel_cost\":14785,\"land_cost\":\"24400\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":48882,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5377.02\",\"selling_price\":54259.020000000004074536263942718505859375}', 'MZQ/0735/092025', 54820, 54820, 0, '2025-09-25 12:35:26', '2025-10-11 05:55:58', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(750, 'Mr Dewanshu x 03', 'BNI Josh', '9973737422', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SRILANKA 4*', '2025-11-14', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Airport Arrival \\u2013 Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage \\u2013 Transfer to Nuwara Eliya\",\"date\":\"14-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at the airport, meet and greet your driver and begin your journey to <strong data-end=\\\"447\\\" data-start=\\\"431\\\">Nuwara Eliya<\\/strong>, the charming \\u201cLittle England\\u201d of Sri Lanka. En route, visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"552\\\" data-start=\\\"520\\\">Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage<\\/strong>, home to over 70 elephants, including the world-famous twin elephants born after 80 years. Witness their playful feeding and bathing sessions along the river. Later, continue your scenic drive to Nuwara Eliya, surrounded by lush tea plantations, misty mountains, and colonial-style cottages. Check in to your hotel and relax for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"897\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"906\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"914\\\" data-start=\\\"911\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"928\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Nuwara Eliya<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nuwara Eliya Sightseeing \\u2013 Seetha Amman Temple, Hakgala Botanical Garden, Gregory Lake & Victoria Park\",\"date\":\"15-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1661\\\" data-start=\\\"1077\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a full-day exploration of Nuwara Eliya. Visit the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"1180\\\" data-start=\\\"1157\\\">Seetha Amman Temple<\\/strong>, a revered site from the Ramayana Trail believed to be where Goddess Sita was held captive. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"1313\\\" data-start=\\\"1285\\\">Hakgala Botanical Garden<\\/strong>, known for its rare flora and serene atmosphere. Later, visit <strong data-end=\\\"1392\\\" data-start=\\\"1376\\\">Gregory Lake<\\/strong>, where you can enjoy boating, pony rides, or simply relax by the water. End the day with a peaceful stroll through <strong data-end=\\\"1525\\\" data-start=\\\"1508\\\">Victoria Park<\\/strong>, a beautifully landscaped garden ideal for birdwatching and photography.<br data-end=\\\"1601\\\" data-start=\\\"1598\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1610\\\" data-start=\\\"1601\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1623\\\" data-start=\\\"1620\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"1637\\\" data-start=\\\"1623\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Nuwara Eliya<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nuwara Eliya \\u2013 Ramboda Falls \\u2013 Tea Plantation \\u2013 Hanuman Temple \\u2013 Transfer to Kandy\",\"date\":\"16-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1161\\\">After breakfast, drive towards <strong data-end=\\\"1806\\\" data-start=\\\"1797\\\">Kandy<\\/strong>, the last royal capital of Sri Lanka. En route, stop at a lush <strong data-end=\\\"1902\\\" data-start=\\\"1870\\\">Tea Plantation &amp; Tea Factory<\\/strong> to witness the traditional process of tea making and enjoy a cup of world-famous Ceylon tea. Visit the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"2032\\\" data-start=\\\"2015\\\">Ramboda Falls<\\/strong>, one of Sri Lanka\\u2019s highest waterfalls, before proceeding to the revered <strong data-end=\\\"2135\\\" data-start=\\\"2106\\\">Hanuman Temple in Ramboda<\\/strong>, where a 16-foot black granite idol of Lord Hanuman overlooks the stunning Kotmale Valley. Later, continue to Kandy and check in at your hotel for an overnight stay.<br data-end=\\\"2304\\\" data-start=\\\"2301\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2313\\\" data-start=\\\"2304\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2326\\\" data-start=\\\"2323\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"2340\\\" data-start=\\\"2326\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Kandy<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kandy City Tour \\u2013 Temple of the Tooth, Peradeniya Botanical Garden, Gem Gallery & Cultural Show\",\"date\":\"17-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3075\\\" data-start=\\\"2475\\\">Enjoy breakfast and start your sightseeing in <strong data-end=\\\"2530\\\" data-start=\\\"2521\\\">Kandy<\\/strong>, the cultural heart of Sri Lanka. Visit the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"2623\\\" data-start=\\\"2582\\\">Temple of the Tooth (Dalada Maligawa)<\\/strong>, which enshrines the Buddha\\u2019s tooth relic. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"2724\\\" data-start=\\\"2683\\\">Royal Botanical Gardens of Peradeniya<\\/strong>, home to over 4,000 species of exotic plants, orchids, and spices. Visit a <strong data-end=\\\"2824\\\" data-start=\\\"2800\\\">Gem Museum &amp; Gallery<\\/strong> to learn about Sri Lanka\\u2019s precious stones and jewelry craftsmanship. In the evening, witness the colorful <strong data-end=\\\"2961\\\" data-start=\\\"2932\\\">Kandy Cultural Dance Show<\\/strong>, showcasing traditional Sri Lankan music and dance forms.<br data-end=\\\"3022\\\" data-start=\\\"3019\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3031\\\" data-start=\\\"3022\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3044\\\" data-start=\\\"3041\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"3058\\\" data-start=\\\"3044\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Kandy<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kandy \\u2013 Bentota via Spice Garden \\u2013 Turtle Hatchery \\u2013 Madu Ganga River Safari \\u2013 Water Sports\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, depart for the coastal town of <strong data-end=\\\"3248\\\" data-start=\\\"3237\\\">Bentota<\\/strong>, known for its beaches and water sports. En route, visit a <strong data-end=\\\"3337\\\" data-start=\\\"3308\\\">Spice Garden in Mawanella<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll learn about Sri Lanka\\u2019s aromatic spices and their culinary and medicinal uses. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"3470\\\" data-start=\\\"3443\\\">Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery<\\/strong>, where you can see endangered turtle species and witness the conservation process. Later, enjoy a serene <strong data-end=\\\"3602\\\" data-start=\\\"3576\\\">Madu Ganga Boat Safari<\\/strong>, gliding through mangrove forests and small islands teeming with wildlife. On arrival in Bentota, check in to your hotel and spend the afternoon enjoying thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"3783\\\" data-start=\\\"3767\\\">water sports<\\/strong> or relaxing by the beach.<br data-end=\\\"3812\\\" data-start=\\\"3809\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3821\\\" data-start=\\\"3812\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3834\\\" data-start=\\\"3831\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"3848\\\" data-start=\\\"3834\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Bentota<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"19-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"3990\\\" data-start=\\\"3957\\\">Colombo International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey, carrying wonderful memories of your Sri Lankan adventure.<br data-end=\\\"4076\\\" data-start=\\\"4073\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"4085\\\" data-start=\\\"4076\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"14\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"NUWARA ELIYA\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel High Garden\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"KANDY\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"18\\/11\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Kandyan\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"BENTOTA\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/11\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Morven\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"275\" data-start=\"222\"><strong data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"222\">02 Nights</strong> at <em data-end=\"258\" data-start=\"239\">Hotel High Garden</em> – Nuwara Eliya</li>\n	<li data-end=\"326\" data-start=\"278\"><strong data-end=\"291\" data-start=\"278\">02 Nights</strong> at <em data-end=\"316\" data-start=\"295\">Hotel Royal Kandyan</em> – Kandy</li>\n	<li data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"329\"><strong data-end=\"341\" data-start=\"329\">01 Night</strong> at <em data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"345\">Hotel Morven</em> – Bentota</li>\n	<li data-end=\"519\" data-start=\"450\"><strong data-end=\"460\" data-start=\"450\">Meals:</strong> Daily <strong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"467\">05 Breakfasts</strong> and <strong data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"489\">05 Dinners</strong> at the hotels</li>\n	<li data-end=\"611\" data-start=\"565\">Complimentary <strong data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"579\">Gem Gallery Visit</strong> in Kandy</li>\n	<li data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"614\">Complimentary entry to the <strong data-end=\"664\" data-start=\"641\">Kandy Cultural Show</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"614\"><em data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"669\">(Note: Visit to the Gem Gallery is mandatory to obtain the complimentary Cultural Show coupon)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"826\" data-start=\"770\">Complimentary <strong data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"784\">Spice Garden Visit</strong> en route to Kandy</li>\n	<li data-end=\"961\" data-start=\"874\">All transfers and sightseeing by <strong data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"907\">Air-Conditioned Sedan Car</strong> on a <strong data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"942\">Private Basis</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"964\">Services of a <strong data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"978\">professional English-speaking chauffeur driver</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1082\" data-start=\"1033\"><strong data-end=\"1055\" data-start=\"1033\">Airport assistance</strong> on arrival and departure</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1122\"><strong data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"1122\">City Tour &amp; Shopping</strong> experience as per itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1179\">All <strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1183\">applicable taxes</strong> (excluding GST &amp; bank charges)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<h2 data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"204\"><strong data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"207\">🌟 Value Additions by Multi Zone Travels&nbsp;– Sri Lanka</strong></h2>\n\n<p data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"266\">Enjoy exclusive complimentary services and thoughtful touches designed to make your journey more comfortable and memorable:</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"393\">💧 <strong data-end=\"454\" data-start=\"396\">02 Bottles (500ml) of Mineral Water per person per day</strong> throughout the tour</li>\n	<li data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"479\">🛍️ <strong data-end=\"515\" data-start=\"483\">5% Discount Voucher for ODEL</strong> – Sri Lanka’s premier lifestyle store</li>\n	<li data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"558\">📱 <strong data-end=\"598\" data-start=\"561\">Complimentary SIM Card on arrival</strong> <em data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"599\">(Top-up charges to be borne by guest)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"643\">♿ <strong data-end=\"670\" data-start=\"645\">Wheelchair assistance</strong> available for differently-abled travelers <em data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"713\">(to be notified prior to arrival)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"844\" data-start=\"753\">🥥 <strong data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"756\">Complimentary King Coconut drink</strong> per person on a selected day during the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"847\">🌿 <strong data-end=\"902\" data-start=\"850\">Complimentary visit to a recognized Spice Garden</strong> at Mawanella with</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"847\">→ Relaxing <strong data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"936\">Head &amp; Shoulder Massage</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"847\">→ Refreshing <strong data-end=\"1006\" data-start=\"981\">Herbal Tea experience</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>\n	<h2 data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"165\"><strong data-end=\"222\" data-start=\"168\">💰 Supplement for Entrance Fees (Optional Add-Ons)</strong></h2>\n	</li>\n	<li><em data-end=\"270\" data-start=\"225\">(Applicable only if booked prior to travel)</em></li>\n	<li>\n	<h3 data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"274\"><strong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"278\">📍 Pinnawala</strong></h3>\n	</li>\n	<li><strong data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"297\">Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage</strong> – USD 12 per person</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3 data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"358\"><strong data-end=\"374\" data-start=\"362\">📍 Kandy</strong></h3>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"377\"><strong data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"377\">Temple of the Tooth (Kandy Temple)</strong> – USD 07 per person</li>\n	<li data-end=\"493\" data-start=\"440\"><strong data-end=\"471\" data-start=\"440\">Peradeniya Botanical Garden</strong> – USD 12 per person</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3 data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"500\"><strong data-end=\"523\" data-start=\"504\">Nuwara Eliya</strong></h3>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"526\"><strong data-end=\"551\" data-start=\"526\">Gregory Lake Entrance</strong> – USD 03 per person</li>\n	<li data-end=\"647\" data-start=\"576\"><strong data-end=\"602\" data-start=\"576\">Gregory Lake Boat Ride</strong> – USD 30 per boat <em data-end=\"645\" data-start=\"621\">(max. 06 pax per boat)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"700\" data-start=\"650\"><strong data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"650\">Hakgala Botanical Garden</strong> – USD 12 per person</li>\n	<li>\n	<h3 data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"707\"><strong data-end=\"725\" data-start=\"711\">📍 Bentota</strong></h3>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"728\"><strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"728\">Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery</strong> – USD 05 per person</li>\n	<li data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"780\"><strong data-end=\"805\" data-start=\"780\">Madhu Ganga Boat Ride</strong> – USD 30 per boat <em data-end=\"848\" data-start=\"824\">(max. 06 pax per boat)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"853\"><strong data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"853\">Bentota Water Sports (Jet Ski, Banana Ride, Tube Ride)</strong> – USD 30 per person</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2 data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"940\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"943\">🛂 Visa Information (For Indian Nationals)</strong></h2>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1044\" data-start=\"994\"><strong data-end=\"1208\" data-start=\"1189\">Visa on Arrival</strong> is available <strong data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1222\">free of charge</strong> for Indian citizens.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1174\">Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"68796\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":68796,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 12383.28\",\"selling_price\":81179.27999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0736/0102025', 81180, 27060, 0, '2025-10-07 13:40:17', '2025-10-07 13:47:37', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(751, 'Mr Rohit Tulsyan', 'BNI', '9304475550', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-12-22', 7, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Hanoi \\u2013 Rest & Relaxation\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to <strong data-end=\\\"226\\\" data-start=\\\"217\\\">Hanoi<\\/strong>, the charming capital of Vietnam! Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"310\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, meet your local representative and transfer to your hotel in the city (approx. 50\\u201360 minutes drive). Complete check-in formalities and take the day to <strong data-end=\\\"501\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\">rest and recover from your journey<\\/strong>. You may explore nearby caf\\u00e9s or enjoy a peaceful walk around the neighborhood to get a first glimpse of Hanoi\\u2019s vibrant street life.<br data-end=\\\"638\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"650\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\">Meals:<\\/em> None<br data-end=\\\"658\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"690\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\">Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi \\u2013 Ha Long Bay Excursion (La Casta Day Cruise)\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, board the shuttle (07:30\\u201308:00 AM) for your full-day trip to <strong data-end=\\\"1224\\\" data-start=\\\"1209\\\">Ha Long Bay<\\/strong>, one of the New 7 Wonders of Nature. Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-start=\\\"1278\\\">Tuan Chau Port<\\/strong>, check in to the luxurious <strong data-end=\\\"1351\\\" data-start=\\\"1324\\\">La Casta Day Cruise \\ud83d\\udef3\\ufe0f<\\/strong>. Sail through breathtaking limestone formations such as <strong data-end=\\\"1475\\\" data-start=\\\"1408\\\">Hon Cho Da, Hon Vit Da, and Hon Ga Choi (Fighting Cocks Islets)<\\/strong>. Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1510\\\" data-start=\\\"1485\\\">buffet lunch on board<\\/strong> featuring fresh seafood and Vietnamese cuisine.<br data-end=\\\"1561\\\" data-start=\\\"1558\\\" \\/>\\nIn the afternoon, visit the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"1629\\\" data-start=\\\"1601\\\">Sung Sot (Surprise) Cave<\\/strong> and explore <strong data-end=\\\"1655\\\" data-start=\\\"1642\\\">Luon Cave<\\/strong> by kayak or bamboo boat. Relax at <strong data-end=\\\"1706\\\" data-start=\\\"1690\\\">Titov Island<\\/strong>, where you can swim or hike to the viewpoint for panoramic bay views. Return to the cruise for a <strong data-end=\\\"1827\\\" data-start=\\\"1804\\\">sunset tea party \\ud83c\\udf75<\\/strong>, and enjoy the scenic sail back to the port. Arrive in Hanoi around 20:30\\u201321:00 hrs.<br data-end=\\\"1915\\\" data-start=\\\"1912\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1927\\\" data-start=\\\"1919\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast, Lunch on Cruise<br data-end=\\\"1957\\\" data-start=\\\"1954\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"1980\\\" data-start=\\\"1960\\\">Overnight in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi \\u2192 Phu Quoc (Flight)\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy leisure time before transferring to the airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2149\\\" data-start=\\\"2126\\\">Phu Quoc Island \\ud83c\\udfdd\\ufe0f<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, meet your driver and transfer to the hotel for check-in and relaxation. Spend the rest of the day enjoying the beach or resort facilities.<br data-end=\\\"2306\\\" data-start=\\\"2303\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2318\\\" data-start=\\\"2310\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2331\\\" data-start=\\\"2328\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"2357\\\" data-start=\\\"2334\\\">Overnight in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phu Quoc \\u2013 VinWonders & Safari Adventure\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"2485\\\" data-start=\\\"2457\\\">north of Phu Quoc Island<\\/strong> to explore the <strong data-end=\\\"2516\\\" data-start=\\\"2501\\\">Vin-complex<\\/strong>. Begin your day at <strong data-end=\\\"2564\\\" data-start=\\\"2536\\\">VinWonders Theme Park \\ud83c\\udfa1<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s largest amusement park, featuring thrilling rides, water coasters, and record-breaking attractions. Later, experience a <strong data-end=\\\"2718\\\" data-start=\\\"2696\\\">wildlife adventure<\\/strong> at <strong data-end=\\\"2744\\\" data-start=\\\"2722\\\">Vinpearl Safari \\ud83e\\udd81<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s first open zoo, where animals roam freely while visitors stay safely inside safari vehicles. Enjoy the engaging <strong data-end=\\\"2884\\\" data-start=\\\"2868\\\">Bird Show \\ud83d\\udc26<\\/strong>, spreading a message of wildlife conservation.<br data-end=\\\"2934\\\" data-start=\\\"2931\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2946\\\" data-start=\\\"2938\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2959\\\" data-start=\\\"2956\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"2985\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Overnight in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phu Quoc \\u2013 3 Island Trip & Cable Car Ride\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"3122\\\" data-start=\\\"3086\\\">shared island-hopping tour (SIC)<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"3126\\\" data-start=\\\"3123\\\" \\/>\\nCruise to <strong data-end=\\\"3154\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Gam Ghi Island<\\/strong> for snorkeling over vibrant coral reefs \\ud83c\\udf0a. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"3235\\\" data-start=\\\"3211\\\">May Rut Trong Island<\\/strong>, where you can swim in crystal lagoons, enjoy water sports, and relax at the beach bar. Enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"3347\\\" data-start=\\\"3330\\\">lunch onboard<\\/strong> before heading to <strong data-end=\\\"3381\\\" data-start=\\\"3366\\\">Thom Island<\\/strong>, home to the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"3432\\\" data-start=\\\"3405\\\">Aquatopia Water Park \\ud83d\\udca6<\\/strong>. End the day with a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"3491\\\" data-start=\\\"3460\\\">25-minute cable car ride \\ud83d\\udea1<\\/strong>, the longest in the world, offering stunning sunset views over Phu Quoc\\u2019s archipelago.<br data-end=\\\"3581\\\" data-start=\\\"3578\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3593\\\" data-start=\\\"3585\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast, Lunch<br data-end=\\\"3613\\\" data-start=\\\"3610\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"3639\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Overnight in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phu Quoc \\u2192 Da Nang \\u2013 Hoi An Evening Tour & Lantern Release\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"3802\\\" data-start=\\\"3788\\\">Da Nang \\u2708\\ufe0f<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, meet your guide and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3857\\\" data-start=\\\"3847\\\">Hoi An<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage town. Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"3928\\\" data-start=\\\"3901\\\">Japanese Covered Bridge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3958\\\" data-start=\\\"3930\\\">Museum of Trade Ceramics<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3984\\\" data-start=\\\"3960\\\">Tan Ky Ancient House<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"4004\\\" data-start=\\\"3990\\\">Ong Temple<\\/strong>. Wander through <strong data-end=\\\"4038\\\" data-start=\\\"4021\\\">Hoi An Market<\\/strong>, then enjoy a serene <strong data-end=\\\"4087\\\" data-start=\\\"4060\\\">boat ride on Hoai River<\\/strong>, releasing lanterns \\ud83c\\udf86 for good luck.<br data-end=\\\"4128\\\" data-start=\\\"4125\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"4140\\\" data-start=\\\"4132\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"4153\\\" data-start=\\\"4150\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"4178\\\" data-start=\\\"4156\\\">Overnight in Da Nang<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ba Na Hills & Golden Bridge Excursion\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, depart for <strong data-end=\\\"4289\\\" data-start=\\\"4274\\\">Ba Na Hills<\\/strong>, one of Vietnam\\u2019s top mountain resorts. Ride the <strong data-end=\\\"4371\\\" data-start=\\\"4339\\\">record-breaking cable car \\ud83d\\udea0<\\/strong>, enjoying sweeping views of Da Nang. Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"4445\\\" data-start=\\\"4426\\\">Golden Bridge \\u2728<\\/strong>, a stunning 150-meter-long walkway held by two giant stone hands. Explore <strong data-end=\\\"4549\\\" data-start=\\\"4520\\\">Le Jardin d\\u2019Amour Gardens<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"4570\\\" data-start=\\\"4551\\\">Ling Ung Pagoda<\\/strong>, and the <strong data-end=\\\"4598\\\" data-start=\\\"4580\\\">French Village<\\/strong>. Continue to the summit for panoramic views, waterfalls, and the <strong data-end=\\\"4695\\\" data-start=\\\"4664\\\">Fantasy Park amusement zone<\\/strong>. Return to Da Nang by evening.<br data-end=\\\"4729\\\" data-start=\\\"4726\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"4741\\\" data-start=\\\"4733\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"4754\\\" data-start=\\\"4751\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"4779\\\" data-start=\\\"4757\\\">Overnight in Da Nang<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Da Nang\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your final breakfast in Vietnam. Spend the morning at leisure before transferring to <strong data-end=\\\"4942\\\" data-start=\\\"4923\\\">Da Nang Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight, carrying unforgettable memories of Vietnam\\u2019s beauty, culture, and hospitality.<br data-end=\\\"5048\\\" data-start=\\\"5045\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"5060\\\" data-start=\\\"5052\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-7562\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"125000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1631\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:25 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"VN-6401\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"25600\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"VJ-1718\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"52000\"},{\"id\":5,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh City (SGN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"VJ-637\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"30000\"},{\"id\":6,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh City (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"fno\":\"6E-1642\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"118000\"},{\"id\":7,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"30 Dec 2025\",\"fno\":\"6E-7674\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"FLOWER GARDEN HOTEL\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"HA NOI\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/10\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"AMARIN RESORT & SPA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Ocean View\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"27\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/10\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"CICILIA HOTEL & SPA\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Partial Ocean\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/10\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DA NANG\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare&nbsp;<b><i>Ex-Ranchi</i></b>.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel FLOWER GARDEN HOTEL&nbsp;@HA NOI&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel AMARIN RESORT &amp; SPA&nbsp;@ PHU QUOC&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel CICILIA HOTEL &amp; SPA&nbsp;@DA NANG&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>One day cruise on Ha Long Bay </strong>with two ways transfer by shuttle bus</li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers (except SIC Tour)</li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Vietnam VISA.</strong></em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"line-height:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">Tipping policy: 5 USD per person per day</span></span></b></span></span></span></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":350600,\"land_cost\":\"265500\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"14000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":630100,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 94515\",\"selling_price\":724615}', 'MZQ/0737/0102025', 724800, 181200, 0, '2025-10-08 12:51:27', '2025-10-08 13:27:49', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(752, 'Mr Nikhil Agarwal', 'BNI', '7004454291', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-01-25', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi Arrival \\u2013 Half Day City Tour\",\"date\":\"25-01-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\\u2019s Noi Bai International Airport, you will be warmly greeted by our representative and transferred to your hotel for check-in (standard time 14:00). Later, embark on a half-day city tour beginning with the <strong data-end=\\\"646\\\" data-start=\\\"622\\\">Temple of Literature<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s first university, built in 1070 to honor Confucius and Vietnamese scholars. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"764\\\" data-start=\\\"746\\\">Hoan Kiem Lake<\\/strong> and the <strong data-end=\\\"792\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\">Ngoc Son Temple<\\/strong>, beautifully set on an islet, followed by a relaxing cup of traditional Vietnamese coffee at a local caf\\u00e9 as you watch Hanoi\\u2019s vibrant street life.<br data-end=\\\"943\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"952\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"960\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-start=\\\"960\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Excursion to Ha Long Bay \\u2013 La Casta Day Cruise\",\"date\":\"26-01-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer by shuttle bus to <strong data-end=\\\"1133\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\">Tuan Chau Port<\\/strong> for your <strong data-end=\\\"1162\\\" data-start=\\\"1143\\\">La Casta Cruise<\\/strong> on the magnificent Ha Long Bay. Sail through scenic limestone formations such as <strong data-end=\\\"1258\\\" data-start=\\\"1244\\\">Hon Cho Da<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1274\\\" data-start=\\\"1260\\\">Hon Vit Da<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1295\\\" data-start=\\\"1280\\\">Hon Ga Choi<\\/strong>, the symbol of Ha Long. Enjoy a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"1354\\\" data-start=\\\"1338\\\">buffet lunch<\\/strong> onboard featuring local seafood. In the afternoon, visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"1442\\\" data-start=\\\"1425\\\">Sung Sot Cave<\\/strong>, go kayaking at <strong data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1459\\\">Hang Luon<\\/strong>, and relax or swim at <strong data-end=\\\"1511\\\" data-start=\\\"1495\\\">Titop Island<\\/strong>. Later, unwind with a <strong data-end=\\\"1554\\\" data-start=\\\"1534\\\">sunset tea party<\\/strong> and jacuzzi session as you admire the breathtaking sunset over the bay before returning to Hanoi in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1670\\\" data-start=\\\"1667\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1679\\\" data-start=\\\"1670\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Lunch on Cruise<br data-end=\\\"1698\\\" data-start=\\\"1695\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"1712\\\" data-start=\\\"1698\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Hanoi<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi Departure \\u2013 Arrival in Phu Quoc (No Guide)\",\"date\":\"27-01-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to the airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1881\\\" data-start=\\\"1862\\\">Phu Quoc Island<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, meet your driver and proceed to your hotel for check-in and relaxation. The rest of the day is free at leisure to unwind on the tropical beaches or explore nearby areas on your own.<br data-end=\\\"2081\\\" data-start=\\\"2078\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2090\\\" data-start=\\\"2081\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2103\\\" data-start=\\\"2100\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"2117\\\" data-start=\\\"2103\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North of Island \\u2013 Vin Wonders & Safari\",\"date\":\"28-01-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day excursion to the <strong data-end=\\\"2285\\\" data-start=\\\"2251\\\">Vinpearl Entertainment Complex<\\/strong> in the north of Phu Quoc. Explore <strong data-end=\\\"2335\\\" data-start=\\\"2320\\\">Vin Wonders<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s largest theme park, home to record-breaking rides and attractions. Continue to the <strong data-end=\\\"2454\\\" data-start=\\\"2430\\\">Vinpearl Safari Park<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll experience an exciting open-vehicle tour surrounded by freely roaming wildlife. Don\\u2019t miss the fascinating <strong data-end=\\\"2591\\\" data-start=\\\"2576\\\">Animal Show<\\/strong>, highlighting the importance of environmental conservation.<br data-end=\\\"2654\\\" data-start=\\\"2651\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2663\\\" data-start=\\\"2654\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2676\\\" data-start=\\\"2673\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"2690\\\" data-start=\\\"2676\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day South of Island Tour\",\"date\":\"29-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set out to explore the southern part of Phu Quoc. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"2855\\\" data-start=\\\"2841\\\">Pearl Farm<\\/strong> to learn about pearl cultivation, stop by a <strong data-end=\\\"2920\\\" data-start=\\\"2900\\\">Sim Wine Factory<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"2940\\\" data-start=\\\"2925\\\">Pepper Farm<\\/strong>, then relax at the pristine <strong data-end=\\\"2982\\\" data-start=\\\"2969\\\">Sao Beach<\\/strong>. Later, enjoy a scenic walk through <strong data-end=\\\"3034\\\" data-start=\\\"3019\\\">Sunset Town<\\/strong>, capture photos at the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"3080\\\" data-start=\\\"3065\\\">Kiss Bridge<\\/strong>, and visit <strong data-end=\\\"3117\\\" data-start=\\\"3092\\\">Vui Fest Night Market<\\/strong> for local food and shopping.<br data-end=\\\"3149\\\" data-start=\\\"3146\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3158\\\" data-start=\\\"3149\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3171\\\" data-start=\\\"3168\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"3185\\\" data-start=\\\"3171\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cable Car & 4 Islands Trip by Speed Boat (SIC Tour)\",\"date\":\"30-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3769\\\" data-start=\\\"3281\\\">After breakfast, embark on an exciting island-hopping adventure. Explore <strong data-end=\\\"3370\\\" data-start=\\\"3354\\\">Xuong Island<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"3393\\\" data-start=\\\"3375\\\">Gam Ghi Island<\\/strong> for snorkeling among colorful coral reefs, then relax and enjoy lunch on <strong data-end=\\\"3491\\\" data-start=\\\"3467\\\">May Rut Trong Island<\\/strong>. Later, visit <strong data-end=\\\"3521\\\" data-start=\\\"3506\\\">Thom Island<\\/strong> for unlimited fun at <strong data-end=\\\"3567\\\" data-start=\\\"3543\\\">Aquatopia Water Park<\\/strong> and enjoy a spectacular ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"3633\\\" data-start=\\\"3604\\\">world\\u2019s longest cable car<\\/strong>, offering panoramic views of the turquoise sea and fishing villages below.<br data-end=\\\"3711\\\" data-start=\\\"3708\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3720\\\" data-start=\\\"3711\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Local Lunch<br data-end=\\\"3735\\\" data-start=\\\"3732\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"3749\\\" data-start=\\\"3735\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Hotel in Phu Quoc<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phu Quoc Departure\",\"date\":\"31-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your final breakfast at the hotel. Free at leisure until your transfer to <em><strong>Phu Quoc Airport for your onward flight.<\\/strong><\\/em><br data-end=\\\"3935\\\" data-start=\\\"3932\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong data-end=\\\"3944\\\" data-start=\\\"3935\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-7562\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"27500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1631\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:25 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"PHU Quoc (PQC)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Airlines\",\"fno\":\"VJ-441\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"11100\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"PHU Quoc (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Airlines\",\"fno\":\"VJ-442\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"13400\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"fno\":\"6E-1632\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"26200\"},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jan 2026\",\"fno\":\"6E-7674\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HA NOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hanoi Emerald Waters Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Junior Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"12000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC (South)\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sunset Beach Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"16600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"29\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC (North)\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Vinholidays Fiesta Phu Quoc\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return airfare<em><strong> <em data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"199\">Ex-Ranchi</em></strong></em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"341\" data-start=\"239\"><strong data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"239\">02 Nights</strong> at <em data-end=\"285\" data-start=\"256\">Hotel&nbsp;Emerald Waters &amp; Spa</em> <em><strong>@HA NOI.</strong></em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"344\"><strong data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"344\">02&nbsp;Nights</strong> at <em data-end=\"398\" data-start=\"361\">Hotel Sunset Beach Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;</em>@ <strong data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"441\">PHU QUOC (South)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"344\"><strong data-end=\"357\" data-start=\"344\">02&nbsp;Nights</strong> at <em data-end=\"398\" data-start=\"361\">Hotel Vinholidays Fiesta&nbsp;</em>@ <strong data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"441\">PHU QUOC (North)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"568\" data-start=\"532\">Daily <strong data-end=\"552\" data-start=\"538\">Breakfasts</strong> at the hotels</li>\n	<li data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"571\">Additional <strong data-end=\"601\" data-start=\"582\">Lunches/Dinners</strong> as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"768\" data-start=\"674\">All <strong data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"678\">airport transfers and tours</strong> by <strong data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"713\">private air-conditioned vehicle</strong> (except SIC tour)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"771\">Services of a <strong data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"785\">professional driver</strong> throughout the trip</li>\n	<li data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"874\"><strong data-end=\"912\" data-start=\"874\">Experienced English-speaking guide</strong> as per the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"998\" data-start=\"938\"><strong data-end=\"955\" data-start=\"938\">Entrance fees</strong> for all visits and attractions mentioned</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1088\" data-start=\"1026\"><strong data-end=\"1043\" data-start=\"1026\">Mineral water</strong>&nbsp;is available daily during tours and transfers&nbsp;</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1115\"><strong data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1115\">Vietnam EVisa.</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":78200,\"land_cost\":\"74000\",\"hotel_cost\":38800,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"7000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":198000,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21780\",\"selling_price\":219780}', 'MZQ/0738/0102025', 219800, 109900, 0, '2025-10-09 11:25:54', '2025-10-09 12:32:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(753, 'Dr Soumya Sinha', 'BNI', '9323936253', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2026-03-23', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Singapore \\u2013 Evening Night Safari Adventure\",\"date\":\"23-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to <strong data-end=\\\"541\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\">Singapore<\\/strong>, the \\u201cLion City\\u201d! Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"608\\\" data-start=\\\"576\\\">Changi International Airport<\\/strong>, meet your local representative and transfer to your hotel. After check-in, relax and freshen up.<br data-end=\\\"709\\\" data-start=\\\"706\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, embark on the world\\u2019s first <strong data-end=\\\"769\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\">Night Safari<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udf19 \\u2013 a unique wildlife experience set in a rainforest. Enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"848\\\" data-start=\\\"835\\\">Tram Ride<\\/strong> through different zones, spot nocturnal animals in their natural habitat, and don\\u2019t miss the <strong data-end=\\\"971\\\" data-start=\\\"942\\\">Complimentary Animal Show<\\/strong> that highlights fascinating animal behaviors.<br data-end=\\\"1020\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1042\\\" data-start=\\\"1020\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Village Hotel Bugis<br data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1065\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gardens by the Bay & Marina Bay Sands SkyPark\",\"date\":\"24-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1540\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\">After a delicious breakfast, get ready for a day amidst nature and futuristic architecture. Visit the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"1313\\\" data-start=\\\"1291\\\">Gardens by the Bay<\\/strong>, home to the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1334\\\">Flower Dome<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udf3a and <strong data-end=\\\"1373\\\" data-start=\\\"1357\\\">Cloud Forest<\\/strong>, where lush greenery and cascading waterfalls create a magical ambiance.<br data-end=\\\"1449\\\" data-start=\\\"1446\\\" \\/>\\nLater, head to the <strong data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-start=\\\"1468\\\">Marina Bay Sands SkyPark Observation Deck<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udf06 for breathtaking panoramic views of Singapore\\u2019s glittering skyline \\u2013 a perfect photo opportunity as the city comes alive at sunset.<br data-end=\\\"1651\\\" data-start=\\\"1648\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1673\\\" data-start=\\\"1651\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Village Hotel Bugis<br data-end=\\\"1696\\\" data-start=\\\"1693\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1709\\\" data-start=\\\"1696\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Experiential Singapore City Tour\",\"date\":\"25-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2475\\\" data-start=\\\"1940\\\">Post breakfast, embark on an <strong data-end=\\\"1851\\\" data-start=\\\"1825\\\">Experiential City Tour<\\/strong> with a licensed guide from STB (Singapore Tourism Board). Discover Singapore\\u2019s rich culture and heritage as you drive past <strong data-end=\\\"2039\\\" data-start=\\\"1975\\\">Bras Basah Road, the Cathedral of the Good Shepherd, CHIJMES<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2062\\\" data-start=\\\"2045\\\">Raffles Hotel<\\/strong>. Visit landmarks like the <strong data-end=\\\"2105\\\" data-start=\\\"2089\\\">Merlion Park<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2126\\\" data-start=\\\"2107\\\">Singapore Flyer<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2156\\\" data-start=\\\"2132\\\">War Memorial of WWII<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2160\\\" data-start=\\\"2157\\\" \\/>\\nWitness the vibrant diversity at <strong data-end=\\\"2206\\\" data-start=\\\"2193\\\">Chinatown<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2224\\\" data-start=\\\"2208\\\">Little India<\\/strong>, and the <strong data-end=\\\"2252\\\" data-start=\\\"2234\\\">Civic District<\\/strong>, along with a drive through <strong data-end=\\\"2297\\\" data-start=\\\"2281\\\">Orchard Road<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2299\\\">Suntec City<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2342\\\" data-start=\\\"2320\\\">Fountain of Wealth<\\/strong> \\u2013 blending history, culture, and modern charm.<br data-end=\\\"2392\\\" data-start=\\\"2389\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2414\\\" data-start=\\\"2392\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Village Hotel Bugis<br data-end=\\\"2437\\\" data-start=\\\"2434\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2450\\\" data-start=\\\"2437\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Sentosa Island Experience\",\"date\":\"26-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2590\\\" data-start=\\\"2568\\\">Sentosa Island \\ud83c\\udfdd\\ufe0f<\\/strong> for a fun-filled day of adventure and relaxation. Enjoy a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"2693\\\" data-start=\\\"2656\\\">Cable Car Ride (Mount Faber Line)<\\/strong> offering breathtaking aerial views of the city and harbor. Visit the <strong data-end=\\\"2790\\\" data-start=\\\"2763\\\">Singapore Oceanarium \\ud83d\\udc20<\\/strong>, featuring diverse marine life. As the sun sets, witness the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"2896\\\" data-start=\\\"2864\\\">Wings of Time Show (7:40 PM)<\\/strong>\\u2014a dazzling display of lights, water, and music. Don\\u2019t miss the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"2993\\\" data-start=\\\"2970\\\">SkyHelix Sentosa \\ud83c\\udfa1<\\/strong>, an open-air rotating gondola offering 360\\u00b0 views of the coastline.<br data-end=\\\"3064\\\" data-start=\\\"3061\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3076\\\" data-start=\\\"3068\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3089\\\" data-start=\\\"3086\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"3116\\\" data-start=\\\"3092\\\">Overnight in Singapore<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore\",\"date\":\"27-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, gear up for a full day of fun at <strong data-end=\\\"3258\\\" data-start=\\\"3224\\\">Universal Studios Singapore \\ud83c\\udfa0<\\/strong>\\u2014the region\\u2019s premier theme park. Explore seven exciting themed zones including Hollywood, Sci-Fi City, Ancient Egypt, and Jurassic Park. Enjoy adrenaline-pumping rides, 4D shows, and meet your favorite movie characters. Evening free for leisure or optional shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"3545\\\" data-start=\\\"3528\\\">VivoCity Mall<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"3549\\\" data-start=\\\"3546\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3561\\\" data-start=\\\"3553\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3574\\\" data-start=\\\"3571\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <em data-end=\\\"3601\\\" data-start=\\\"3577\\\">Overnight in Singapore<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Singapore\",\"date\":\"28-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. You\\u2019ll be transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"3756\\\" data-start=\\\"3724\\\">Changi International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight, taking back wonderful memories of your Singapore holiday.<br data-end=\\\"3841\\\" data-start=\\\"3838\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3853\\\" data-start=\\\"3845\\\">Meals:<\\/em> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Mar 2026\",\"fno\":\"6E-7235\",\"dep_time\":\"08:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"54000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2026\",\"fno\":\"6E-1015\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1016\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"44800\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-6152\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:05 PM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Village Hotel Bugis by Far East Hospitality\",\"room_type\":\"Family Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"28\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"98600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":12}]', '<h3 data-end=\"259\" data-start=\"235\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"259\" data-start=\"242\">Accommodation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"260\">\n	<li data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"260\">\n	<p data-end=\"426\" data-start=\"262\"><strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"262\">05 Nights Stay</strong> at <em data-end=\"329\" data-start=\"284\">Village Hotel Bugis by Far East Hospitality</em><br data-end=\"332\" data-start=\"329\" />\n	→ Room Category: Family Room<br data-end=\"378\" data-start=\"375\" />\n	→ <strong data-end=\"396\" data-start=\"382\">Meal Plan:</strong> Daily Breakfast Included 🍳</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"431\" data-start=\"428\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"433\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"440\">Flights</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"452\">\n	<li data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"452\">\n	<p data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"454\"><strong data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"454\">Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi</strong> ✈️</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"296\">\n	<p data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"298\"><strong data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"298\">Infant Flight Ticket Cost</strong> is <strong data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"331\">included in the adult fare</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"364\">\n	<p data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"366\">All other services for the <strong data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"393\">infant will be on FOC (Free of Cost)</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"489\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"543\" data-start=\"494\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"541\" data-start=\"502\">Tours &amp; Sightseeing (Private Basis)</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"544\">\n	<li data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"544\">\n	<p data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"546\"><strong data-end=\"572\" data-start=\"546\">Night Safari Adventure</strong> 🐅<br data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"575\" />\n	→ Includes Tram Ride &amp; Complimentary Animal Show</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"631\">\n	<p data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"633\"><strong data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"633\">Experiential Singapore City Tour</strong> 🏛️<br data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"673\" />\n	→ Guided Tour with <em data-end=\"717\" data-start=\"697\">STB Licensed Guide</em> covering cultural, historical, and modern landmarks</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"772\">\n	<p data-end=\"941\" data-start=\"774\"><strong data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"774\">Gardens by the Bay + Marina Bay Sands SkyPark Combo</strong> 🌸🌆<br data-end=\"837\" data-start=\"834\" />\n	→ Entry to <em data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"850\">Flower Dome</em>, <em data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"865\">Cloud Forest (Jurassic World Experience)</em>, and <em data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"913\">SkyPark Observation Deck</em></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"942\">\n	<p data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"944\"><strong data-end=\"976\" data-start=\"944\">Full Day Sentosa Island Tour</strong> 🏖️<br data-end=\"983\" data-start=\"980\" />\n	→ Includes <em data-end=\"1026\" data-start=\"996\">Cable Car (Mount Faber Line)</em>, <em data-end=\"1050\" data-start=\"1028\">Singapore Oceanarium</em>, <em data-end=\"1082\" data-start=\"1052\">Wings of Time Show (7:40 PM)</em> &amp; <em data-end=\"1103\" data-start=\"1085\">SkyHelix Sentosa</em></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"1106\">\n	<p data-end=\"1169\" data-start=\"1108\"><strong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1108\">Universal Studios Singapore</strong> 🎢<br data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1142\" />\n	→ 01 Day Entry</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1174\" data-start=\"1171\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1176\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"1212\" data-start=\"1183\">Transfers (Private Basis)</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1215\">\n	<li data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1215\">\n	<p data-end=\"1265\" data-start=\"1217\">Arrival Transfer (Changi Airport → Hotel)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1318\" data-start=\"1266\">\n	<p data-end=\"1318\" data-start=\"1268\">Departure Transfer (Hotel → Changi Airport)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1319\">\n	<p data-end=\"1381\" data-start=\"1321\">Tour Transfers for all above sightseeing &amp; excursions</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1365\">🪪 <strong data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1372\">Visa Fees &amp; Documentation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1397\">\n	<li data-end=\"1453\" data-start=\"1397\">\n	<p data-end=\"1453\" data-start=\"1399\"><strong data-end=\"1425\" data-start=\"1399\">Singapore Tourist Visa</strong> (Assistance + Processing)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":98800,\"land_cost\":\"101220\",\"hotel_cost\":98600,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"14000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":312620,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46893\",\"selling_price\":359513}', 'MZQ/0739/0102025', 359540, 127960, 103620, '2025-10-10 13:04:15', '2025-10-11 07:26:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(754, 'Mr Jeet', 'Walk In', '7764835382', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-11-15', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Suvarnabhumi Airport \\u2192 Pattaya Transfer\",\"date\":\"15-11-2025 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"937\\\" data-start=\\\"586\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"634\\\" data-start=\\\"602\\\">Bangkok Suvarnabhumi Airport<\\/strong>, meet your local representative for a warm welcome. After completing immigration and baggage formalities, transfer to your <strong data-end=\\\"778\\\" data-start=\\\"758\\\">hotel in Pattaya<\\/strong> by a private vehicle. Check in and relax for the day. Spend the evening exploring the local markets or beaches on your own.<br data-end=\\\"905\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"927\\\" data-start=\\\"905\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat with Indian Lunch\",\"date\":\"16-11-2025 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast at the hotel, get ready for an exciting <strong data-end=\\\"1115\\\" data-start=\\\"1094\\\">Coral Island Tour<\\/strong>. Travel by <strong data-end=\\\"1147\\\" data-start=\\\"1127\\\">joined speedboat<\\/strong> across the clear blue waters of the Gulf of Thailand to reach the vibrant Coral Island. Enjoy activities like parasailing, jet skiing, or snorkeling (on a personal account). Later, savor a <strong data-end=\\\"1363\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\">delicious Indian lunch<\\/strong> before returning to the hotel. Spend the evening at leisure or explore the Pattaya nightlife.<br data-end=\\\"1460\\\" data-start=\\\"1457\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1473\\\" data-start=\\\"1460\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Indian Lunch<br data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1498\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1523\\\" data-start=\\\"1501\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Free Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"17-11-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy a relaxed breakfast and spend the day at leisure. You can explore <strong data-end=\\\"1669\\\" data-start=\\\"1623\\\">Pattaya\\u2019s local markets, caf\\u00e9s, or beaches<\\/strong>, or opt for optional tours such as the <strong data-end=\\\"1731\\\" data-start=\\\"1709\\\">Nong Nooch Village<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"1761\\\" data-start=\\\"1735\\\">The Sanctuary of Truth<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1765\\\" data-start=\\\"1762\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1778\\\" data-start=\\\"1765\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1791\\\" data-start=\\\"1788\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1813\\\" data-start=\\\"1791\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya to Bangkok + Chaophraya Princess Cruise Dinner\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your Pattaya hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1716\\\" data-start=\\\"1705\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> by private vehicle. Upon arrival, check into your hotel and freshen up.<br data-end=\\\"1791\\\" data-start=\\\"1788\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, experience an unforgettable <strong data-end=\\\"1872\\\" data-start=\\\"1835\\\">Chaophraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> \\u2014 enjoy a luxurious buffet dinner with live music while sailing along the illuminated Bangkok skyline.<br data-end=\\\"1978\\\" data-start=\\\"1975\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1991\\\" data-start=\\\"1978\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Indian Dinner (on Cruise)<br data-end=\\\"2032\\\" data-start=\\\"2029\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2054\\\" data-start=\\\"2032\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dream World with Snow Town + Lunch\",\"date\":\"19-11-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, get ready for a fun-filled day at <strong data-end=\\\"2231\\\" data-start=\\\"2201\\\">Dream World Amusement Park<\\/strong>. Experience thrilling rides, family attractions, and fantasy shows. Step into the <strong data-end=\\\"2327\\\" data-start=\\\"2314\\\">Snow Town<\\/strong>, where you can play in real snow \\u2014 a unique experience in tropical Thailand! Enjoy an <strong data-end=\\\"2430\\\" data-start=\\\"2414\\\">Indian lunch<\\/strong> inside the park before returning to your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2481\\\" data-start=\\\"2478\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2494\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Indian Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2519\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2544\\\" data-start=\\\"2522\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"20-11-2025 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2711\\\" data-start=\\\"2687\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport<\\/strong> for your return flight, carrying unforgettable memories of Thailand\\u2019s beaches, city lights, and adventures.<br data-end=\\\"2822\\\" data-start=\\\"2819\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2835\\\" data-start=\\\"2822\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"Thai Lion Air\",\"fno\":\"SL-243\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:35 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"26000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai Lion Air\",\"fno\":\"SL-242\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"12:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"2