ck <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<h3 data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2884\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2891\">Flights</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"2958\" data-start=\"2903\">\n	<li data-end=\"2958\" data-start=\"2903\">\n	<p data-end=\"2958\" data-start=\"2905\">Return Airfare (Ex-Ranchi or as per your requirement)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"2984\" data-start=\"2960\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"2984\" data-start=\"2967\">Accommodation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"3158\" data-start=\"2985\">\n	<li data-end=\"3058\" data-start=\"2985\">\n	<p data-end=\"3058\" data-start=\"2987\">03 Nights in <strong data-end=\"3011\" data-start=\"3000\">Pattaya</strong> – <em data-end=\"3056\" data-start=\"3014\">Hotel Sunbeam Hotel Pattaya (or similar)</em></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3129\" data-start=\"3059\">\n	<p data-end=\"3129\" data-start=\"3061\">01 Night&nbsp;in <strong data-end=\"3085\" data-start=\"3074\">Bangkok</strong> – <em data-end=\"3127\" data-start=\"3088\">Hotel Royal Benja Hotel Sukhumvit 5 (or similar)</em></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3158\" data-start=\"3130\">\n	<p data-end=\"3158\" data-start=\"3132\">Daily Breakfast Included</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3160\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3168\">Tours &amp; Activities</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"3419\" data-start=\"3191\">\n	<li data-end=\"3267\" data-start=\"3191\">\n	<p data-end=\"3267\" data-start=\"3193\"><strong data-end=\"3214\" data-start=\"3193\">Coral Island Tour</strong> by Speed Boat with <strong data-end=\"3250\" data-start=\"3234\">Indian Lunch</strong> (Shared Basis)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3343\" data-start=\"3268\">\n	<p data-end=\"3343\" data-start=\"3270\"><strong data-end=\"3307\" data-start=\"3270\">Chaophraya Princess Dinner Cruise</strong> with Indian Dinner (Shared Basis)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3419\" data-start=\"3344\">\n	<p data-end=\"3419\" data-start=\"3346\"><strong data-end=\"3372\" data-start=\"3346\">Dream World Super Visa</strong> with Snow Town + Indian Lunch (Shared Basis)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"3457\" data-start=\"3421\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"3457\" data-start=\"3428\">Transfers (Private Basis)</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"3625\" data-start=\"3458\">\n	<li data-end=\"3512\" data-start=\"3458\">\n	<p data-end=\"3512\" data-start=\"3460\">Bangkok Airport → Pattaya Hotel (Private Transfer)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3565\" data-start=\"3513\">\n	<p data-end=\"3565\" data-start=\"3515\">Pattaya Hotel → Bangkok Hotel (Private Transfer)</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"3625\" data-start=\"3566\">\n	<p data-end=\"3625\" data-start=\"3568\">Bangkok Hotel → Suvarnabhumi Airport (Private Transfer)</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"3653\" data-start=\"3627\">🪪 <strong data-end=\"3653\" data-start=\"3634\">Visa Assistance</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"3699\" data-start=\"3654\">\n	<li data-end=\"3699\" data-start=\"3654\">\n	<p data-end=\"3699\" data-start=\"3656\">Thailand Arrival Card&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":50000,\"land_cost\":\"33700\",\"hotel_cost\":36000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":119700,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16758\",\"selling_price\":136458}', 'MZQ/0740/0102025', 136410, 45470, 0, '2025-10-10 13:36:56', '2025-10-10 14:17:40', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(755, 'Dr Saumya', 'BNI', '9323936253', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-03-25', 4, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Krabi \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"25-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"173\\\" data-start=\\\"142\\\">Krabi International Airport<\\/strong>, where you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival, complete the check-in formalities and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is free at leisure to unwind or explore the nearby surroundings on your own.<br data-end=\\\"833\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"855\\\" data-start=\\\"833\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Krabi<br data-end=\\\"864\\\" data-start=\\\"861\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"877\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"26-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set out for a thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"1047\\\" data-start=\\\"1030\\\">4 Island Tour<\\/strong> by speed boat \\u26f5. Visit some of Krabi\\u2019s most iconic beaches and limestone islands \\u2013 <strong data-end=\\\"1155\\\" data-start=\\\"1131\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1171\\\" data-start=\\\"1157\\\">Tup Island<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1191\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\">Chicken Island<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1212\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\">Poda Island<\\/strong>. Enjoy snorkeling, swimming, and sunbathing on pristine white sands surrounded by turquoise waters. A <strong data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">delicious Thai lunch<\\/strong> will be served on the tour. Return to the hotel in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1406\\\" data-start=\\\"1403\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1428\\\" data-start=\\\"1406\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Krabi<br data-end=\\\"1437\\\" data-start=\\\"1434\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1450\\\" data-start=\\\"1437\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi to Phuket Transfer \\u2013 En-Route Phuket City Tour with Tiger Park\",\"date\":\"27-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, check out and transfer from <strong data-end=\\\"1643\\\" data-start=\\\"1624\\\">Krabi to Phuket<\\/strong> (approx. 3 hours). En route, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1681\\\">Phuket City Tour<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f covering highlights such as <strong data-end=\\\"1754\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\">Karon View Point<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1778\\\" data-start=\\\"1756\\\">Wat Chalong Temple<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1800\\\" data-start=\\\"1784\\\">Gems Gallery<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1801\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"1851\\\" data-start=\\\"1830\\\">Phuket Tiger Park<\\/strong>, where you can safely interact and click photos with majestic tigers (optional experience). Upon arrival in Phuket, check in to your hotel and relax.<br data-end=\\\"2004\\\" data-start=\\\"2001\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2026\\\" data-start=\\\"2004\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br data-end=\\\"2036\\\" data-start=\\\"2033\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2049\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"28-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, depart for a full-day <strong data-end=\\\"2233\\\" data-start=\\\"2207\\\">James Bond Island Tour<\\/strong> by luxurious <strong data-end=\\\"2260\\\" data-start=\\\"2247\\\">Catamaran<\\/strong>. Cruise through the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"2307\\\" data-start=\\\"2290\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, known for its dramatic limestone cliffs and emerald-green waters. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"2399\\\" data-start=\\\"2381\\\">Khao Phing Kan<\\/strong>, famously featured in the James Bond movie <em data-end=\\\"2475\\\" data-start=\\\"2443\\\">\\u201cThe Man with the Golden Gun.\\u201d<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2478\\\" data-start=\\\"2475\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy <strong data-end=\\\"2500\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">sea canoeing<\\/strong> through limestone caves and lagoons, relax on board, and savor a <strong data-end=\\\"2592\\\" data-start=\\\"2566\\\">delicious buffet lunch<\\/strong> before returning to Phuket.<br data-end=\\\"2623\\\" data-start=\\\"2620\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2623\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br data-end=\\\"2655\\\" data-start=\\\"2652\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2668\\\" data-start=\\\"2655\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket Departure\",\"date\":\"29-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3287\\\" data-start=\\\"3255\\\">Phuket International Airport<\\/strong> for your flight back home. Depart with beautiful memories of Thailand\\u2019s beaches, islands, and warm hospitality.<br data-end=\\\"3402\\\" data-start=\\\"3399\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3415\\\" data-start=\\\"3402\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3068\\\" data-start=\\\"3065\\\" \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5017\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":38360},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1085\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1088\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":48903},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7674\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"27\\/03\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sea Seeker Krabi Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Limestone Cliff View\",\"rate\":\"26800\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"27\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/03\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Grand Mercure Phuket Patong\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"38500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeu