ve Beach, Tup Island, Chicken Island &amp; Poda Island.</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1147\" data-start=\"967\">🛥️ <strong data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"971\">James Bond Island Tour</strong> by Catamaran with Lunch <em data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1022\">(Includes National Park Fee)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1147\" data-start=\"967\">→ Explore Phang Nga Bay, Sea Canoeing &amp; Khao Phing Kan – the famous “James Bond Island.”</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2 data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1299\">🚗 <strong data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1305\">Transfers (All on Private Basis)</strong></h2>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1403\" data-start=\"1345\">🚖 Krabi (KBV) Airport → Krabi Hotel (Arrival Transfer)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1406\">🚗 Krabi Hotel → Phuket Hotel <strong><em data-end=\"1481\" data-start=\"1436\">(En-route Phuket City Tour with Tiger Park)</em></strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1547\" data-start=\"1486\">✈️ Phuket Hotel → Phuket (HKT) Airport (Departure Transfer)</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2 data-end=\"1573\" data-start=\"1554\">🍽 <strong data-end=\"1573\" data-start=\"1560\">Meal Plan</strong></h2>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1619\" data-start=\"1577\">Daily <strong data-end=\"1603\" data-start=\"1583\">Buffet Breakfast</strong> at all hotels</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1657\" data-start=\"1622\"><strong data-end=\"1635\" data-start=\"1622\">2 Lunches</strong> during island tours</li>\n	<li>\n	<h2 data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1702\">💎 <strong data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1708\">Highlights</strong></h2>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1724\">✅ Private tours &amp; transfers for a seamless experience</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1724\">✅ National Park Fees included in all island tours</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1724\">✅ Perfect blend of leisure, culture &amp; adventure</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1724\">✅ Premium accommodations in central locations</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":87263,\"land_cost\":\"63600\",\"hotel_cost\":65300,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":216163,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 34586.08\",\"selling_price\":250749.0800000000162981450557708740234375}', 'MZQ/0741/0102025', 250720, 86890, 76940, '2025-10-11 11:07:40', '2026-01-15 11:58:03', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
