":177100,\"hotel_cost\":181224},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":358324,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 57331.84\",\"selling_price\":415655.839999999967403709888458251953125}', 'MZQ/0742/0102025', 415653, 138551, 0, '2025-10-14 07:07:31', '2025-10-14 07:08:39', 0, 1, '\"<ol>\\n\\t<li>\\n\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t<li>Check In time is 15:00 hours.Check Out time is 12:00 hours.For Guaranteed Early Check. In &amp; Late Check. Out, 60% of the room rate will be charged.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Unexpected departure - 100% fee on unused nights &amp; No Show - 100% fee on whole stay<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li>Child Policy\\u2022 Child 0-3 years will be provided complimentary Breakfast.\\u2022 Child 4-11 Years old is chargeable.<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Complimentary Water Sports at the hotel: Snorkelling, Paddle Boats, Kayaking.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>City tax and Resort fee are to be paid directly at hotel if applicable.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\"', 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(757, 'Mr. Ashish', NULL, '9709400140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR 3*', '2025-12-04', 5, NULL, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Srinagar Airport & Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"04-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to the <strong data-end=\\\"661\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\">Heaven on Earth \\u2013 Kashmir!<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"664\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"700\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong>, meet our representative who will assist with your transfer to the hotel. After check-in and some relaxation, begin your <strong data-end=\\\"857\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\">Srinagar local sightseeing tour<\\/strong>, visiting the famous <strong data-end=\\\"897\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\">Mughal Gardens<\\/strong> \\u2013 <strong data-end=\\\"915\\\" data-start=\\\"900\\\">Nishat Bagh<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"934\\\" data-start=\\\"917\\\">Shalimar Bagh<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"957\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\">Chashme Shahi<\\/strong> \\ud83d\\udc90 (union vehicle required for last 1 km).<br data-end=\\\"1003\\\" data-start=\\\"1000\\\" \\/>\\nContinue to the scenic <strong data-end=\\\"1040\\\" data-start=\\\"1026\\\">Pari Mahal<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"1070\\\" data-start=\\\"1045\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>, offering panoramic views of the valley and Dal Lake.<br data-end=\\\"1127\\\" data-start=\\\"1124\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1149\\\" data-start=\\\"1127\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Sonmarg\",\"date\":\"05-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1300\\\" data-start=\\\"1289\\\">Sonmarg<\\/strong>, meaning \\u201cMeadow of Gold,\\u201d surrounded by snow-capped peaks and alpine meadows. Enjoy the picturesque drive along the <strong data-end=\\\"1433\\\" data-start=\\\"1418\\\">Sindh River<\\/strong>, where you can also try <strong data-end=\\\"1475\\\" data-start=\\\"1458\\\">river rafting<\\/strong> (optional).<br data-end=\\\"1490\\\" data-start=\\\"1487\\\" \\/>\\nAt Sonmarg, you may take a <strong data-end=\\\"1550\\\" data-start=\\\"1517\\\">pony ride to Thajiwas Glacier<\\/strong> or visit <strong data-end=\\\"1574\\\" data-start=\\\"1560\\\">Zero Point<\\/strong> by union vehicle (own cost) \\u2013 both offering breathtaking snowy landscapes. In the evening, return to Srinagar.<br data-end=\\\"1688\\\" data-start=\\\"1685\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1710\\\" data-start=\\\"1688\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar to Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"06-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to the \\u201c<strong data-end=\\\"1868\\\" data-start=\\\"1845\\\">Valley of Shepherds<\\/strong>\\u201d \\u2013 <strong data-end=\\\"1884\\\" data-start=\\\"1872\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong>. En route, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"1935\\\" data-start=\\\"1906\\\">Saffron fields of Pampore<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1957\\\" data-start=\\\"1937\\\">Awantipura Ruins<\\/strong> (11th-century Vishnu Temple), <strong data-end=\\\"2005\\\" data-start=\\\"1988\\\">Mattan Temple<\\/strong>, and scenic apple orchards \\ud83c\\udf4e.<br data-end=\\\"2039\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\" \\/>\\nIn Pahalgam, stroll along the <strong data-end=\\\"2085\\\" data-start=\\\"2069\\\">Lidder River<\\/strong>, and optionally enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"2133\\\" data-start=\\\"2108\\\">rafting or pony rides<\\/strong> to <strong data-end=\\\"2156\\\" data-start=\\\"2137\\\">Baisaran Valley<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2175\\\" data-start=\\\"2158\\\">Dubian Valley<\\/strong>, or <strong data-end=\\\"2198\\\" data-start=\\\"2180\\\">Kashmir Valley<\\/strong> (own cost).<br data-end=\\\"2213\\\" data-start=\\\"2210\\\" \\/>\\nYou can also hire a <strong data-end=\\\"2250\\\" data-start=\\\"2233\\\">union vehicle<\\/strong> to explore <strong data-end=\\\"2277\\\" data-start=\\\"2262\\\">Chandanwadi<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2293\\\" data-start=\\\"2279\\\">Aru Valley<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2316\\\" data-start=\\\"2299\\\">Betaab Valley<\\/strong> (own cost \\u2013 1 hr halt at each spot).<br data-end=\\\"2356\\\" data-start=\\\"2353\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2378\\\" data-start=\\\"2356\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hotel in Pahalgam<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam to Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"07-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"2518\\\" data-start=\\\"2507\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong>, famously known as the \\u201c<strong data-end=\\\"2564\\\" data-start=\\\"2543\\\">Meadow of Flowers<\\/strong>,\\u201d located at an altitude of 2,730 meters. On arrival, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"2648\\\" data-start=\\\"2629\\\">Drung Waterfall<\\/strong> near Tangmarg (union vehicle required, own cost).<br data-end=\\\"2701\\\" data-start=\\\"2698\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy optional activities like <strong data-end=\\\"2762\\\" data-start=\\\"2732\\\">Asia\\u2019s highest Golf Course<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2774\\\" data-start=\\\"2764\\\">Skiing<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2819\\\" data-start=\\\"2780\\\">shopping at the Handicraft Emporium<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2823\\\" data-start=\\\"2820\\\" \\/>\\nDon\\u2019t miss the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"2877\\\" data-start=\\\"2851\\\">Gondola Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udfa2 (own cost) \\u2013 one of Asia\\u2019s highest, offering panoramic views from <strong data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2947\\\">Kongdoori<\\/strong> to <strong data-end=\\\"2981\\\" data-start=\\\"2964\\\">Apharwat Peak<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2985\\\" data-start=\\\"2982\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3109\\\" data-start=\\\"2985\\\">(Note: In case of heavy snowfall, local chain-block vehicles from Tangmarg to Gulmarg &amp; back will be required \\u2013 own cost.)<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"3112\\\" data-start=\\\"3109\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3134\\\" data-start=\\\"3112\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hotel in Gulmarg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg to Srinagar \\u2013 Houseboat Stay & Shikara Ride\",\"date\":\"08-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive back to Srinagar and check in to your <strong data-end=\\\"3341\\\" data-start=\\\"3309\\\">deluxe houseboat on Dal Lake<\\/strong>. In the evening, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"3404\\\" data-start=\\\"3367\\\">complimentary 1-hour Shikara Ride<\\/strong> \\u26f5 across the serene waters of Dal Lake, surrounded by floating gardens and mountains.<br data-end=\\\"3493\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3493\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Houseboat in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Srinagar Airport\",\"date\":\"09-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your houseboat and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"3696\\\" data-start=\\\"3676\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey with heartwarming memories of Kashmir\\u2019s beauty, serenity, and hospitality.<br data-end=\\\"3798\\\" data-start=\\\"3795\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3811\\\" data-start=\\\"3798\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"check_out\":\"06\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel City Residency\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"06\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"check_out\":\"07\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lidder View Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"07\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":3,\"check_out\":\"08\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Pine palace Resort\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"08\\/12\\/2025\",\"check_out\":\"09\\/12\\/2025\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel City Residency\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel City Residencyt at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Lidder View Resort at&nbsp;<strong>Pahalgam</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel Pine palace Resort at&nbsp;<strong>Gulmarg</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;accommodation</strong> at Hotel City Residency at&nbsp;<strong>Srinagar</strong>.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Double Rooms.</strong></li>\n	<li>CP (<strong>Breakfas)</strong></li>\n	<li>Srinagar&nbsp;<strong>Airport Pickup &amp; Drop</strong>.</li>\n	<li><strong>Innova//Similar</strong><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18.6667px\"><i>&nbsp;</i></span></font></font>for transfers &amp; Sightseeing as per Itinerary.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong>&nbsp;in Dal lake</li>\n	<li>Medical Kit in Taxi</li>\n	<li>Driver Charges, Toll, and Parking included&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Meeting &amp; Assistance on Arrival&nbsp;/Departure.</li>\n	<li>All applicable taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"53200\",\"hotel_cost\":0},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":53200,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 10640\",\"selling_price\":63840}', 'MZQ/0743/0102025', 63840, 10640, NULL, '2025-10-18 08:16:35', '2025-10-18 09:05:40', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(758, 'Mr Naveen', 'Manoj Arya', '+184756773', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'UDAIPUR', '2025-11-18', 3, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival + Old City Highlights\",\"date\":\"18-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival in Udaipur, check into your hotel near Lake Pichola or in the Old City area. After settling in, begin your sightseeing with the <strong data-end=\\\"376\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">City Palace<\\/strong>, a masterpiece of Rajasthani architecture and history. Walk across to the nearby <strong data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">Jagdish Temple<\\/strong>, known for its intricate carvings. Later, enjoy a leisurely lunch at a lakeside caf\\u00e9 such as Upr\\u00e9. In the evening, take a <strong data-end=\\\"628\\\" data-start=\\\"599\\\">boat ride on Lake Pichola<\\/strong>, stopping at <strong data-end=\\\"656\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\">Jag Mandir<\\/strong>, and then stroll along <strong data-end=\\\"695\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\">Ambrai Ghat<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"715\\\" data-start=\\\"699\\\">Gangaur Ghat<\\/strong>. End your first day with a delightful dinner at Ambrai Restaurant, offering magnificent views of the illuminated <strong data-end=\\\"844\\\" data-start=\\\"829\\\">City Palace<\\/strong> across the lake.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Palaces, Culture & Folk Dance Show\",\"date\":\"19-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\">Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace)<\\/strong>, perched on a hilltop with breathtaking panoramic views of the city and its lakes. For nature lovers, the <strong data-end=\\\"1134\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\">Sajjangarh Biological Park<\\/strong> nearby makes for an enjoyable stop. Return to the city for lunch at Millets of Mewar or Hello Boho before heading to <strong data-end=\\\"1272\\\" data-start=\\\"1252\\\">Bagore Ki Haveli<\\/strong>, a historic haveli showcasing the region\\u2019s cultural heritage. In the evening, watch the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1368\\\">Dharohar Folk Dance Show<\\/strong> at the haveli, a colorful performance of traditional Rajasthani dance and music. Conclude the day with dinner at 1559 AD or Raaj Bagh near <strong data-end=\\\"1556\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Fateh Sagar Lake<\\/strong>, both known for their ambience and authentic cuisine.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur \\u2192 Kumbhalgarh  \\u2192 Udaipur\",\"date\":\"20-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast,&nbsp;drive through the scenic Aravalli hills to <strong data-end=\\\"1653\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\">Kumbhalgarh<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site famed for its grand fort and forested surroundings.<br data-end=\\\"1738\\\" data-start=\\\"1735\\\" \\/>\\nEn route, stop at a <strong data-end=\\\"1793\\\" data-start=\\\"1758\\\">rural pottery or tribal village<\\/strong> for an authentic local experience.<br data-end=\\\"1831\\\" data-start=\\\"1828\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival, check in to your resort nestled amidst the Aravalli wilderness. In the evening, enjoy leisure time by the pool or a guided nature walk.<br \\/>\\nOR<br \\/>\\nYou can explore the <strong>local Udaipur town <\\/strong>at your convenience.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping + Departure\",\"date\":\"21-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2812\\\" data-start=\\\"2392\\\">Enjoy a relaxed breakfast and check out from your hotel. Use the morning for some last-minute shopping (If time permits) at <strong data-end=\\\"2518\\\" data-start=\\\"2498\\\">Hathi Pol Bazaar<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"2537\\\" data-start=\\\"2522\\\">Bada Bazaar<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll find <strong data-end=\\\"2618\\\" data-start=\\\"2557\\\">miniature paintings, textiles, mojris, and silver jewelry<\\/strong>. Stop for a quick coffee or light meal at <strong data-end=\\\"2679\\\" data-start=\\\"2661\\\">Caf\\u00e9 Edelweiss<\\/strong> before heading to the airport or railway station for your onward journey, taking along wonderful memories of your Udaipur getaway.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"UDAIPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Oberoi Udaivilas\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/11\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>01 Innova Crysta</strong> as per the above Itinerary.</li>\n	<li><strong>Usage allowed : 10 Hrs / 100 Kms</strong>&nbsp;per day.</li>\n	<li>All Toll/Parking/Driver Allowances.</li>\n	<li>Taxes<br />\n	&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Extra Km @20/- Per Km + Extra Hr @250/- Per Hr</strong></li>\n	<li>Any Monument/Fort Entry Charges.</li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"31\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"18000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":18000,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5580\",\"selling_price\":23580}', 'MZQ/0744/0102025', 23480, 11740, 0, '2025-10-29 05:53:22', '2025-11-12 06:38:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(759, 'MR NITIN SARAWGI', 'BNI', '6200638259', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'RAJASTHAN', '2026-01-22', 7, 0, 2, '[]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"JAIPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Fern Habitat\",\"room_type\":\"Winter Green Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"25\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"16500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"25\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"JAISALMER\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Antra Inn\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"4400\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"26\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"JAISALMER\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Kafila Desert Camp\",\"rate\":\"14500\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Suite\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/01\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"27\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"JAISALMER\",\"hotel_name\":\"Gaji Hotel\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"2417\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"28\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"JODHPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Indana Palace\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"8280\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation&nbsp;at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel The Fern Habitat&nbsp;<em>@ Jaipur.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Antra Inn&nbsp;<em>@ Jaisalmer.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>The Kafila Desert Camp | Private Pool &amp; Dune Views&nbsp;<em>@ Jaisalmer.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Gaji Hotel&nbsp;<em>@ Jaisalmer.</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Night</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Indana Palace&nbsp;<em>@ Jodhpur.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Accommodation on&nbsp;<strong>Double Sharing.</strong></li>\n	<li>Two bottles of mineral water every day.</li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Buffet/Fixed Menu Breakfast.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01 Day Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Jaisalmer Kamp</strong></li>\n	<li>Free Wi-Fi to all in-house guests.</li>\n	<li><strong>05 Transfers</strong> by <strong>Innova Crysta.</strong></li>\n	<li>22nd&nbsp;Jan | Jaipur Airport - Jaipur Hotel</li>\n	<li>25th&nbsp;Jan | Jaipur Hotel - Jaipur Airport</li>\n	<li>25th&nbsp;Jan | Jaisalmer Airport - Jaisalmer Hotel.</li>\n	<li>28th Jan | 08:55 Pm Jodhpur Railway station -&nbsp;Hotel Indana Palace.&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>29th Jan | 11:00&nbsp;Pm Hotel Indana Palace -Jodhpur Railway station.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"176\">\n	<li data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"176\">\n	<p data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"178\"><strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"178\">50% Advance Payment</strong> by <strong data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"205\">03 November 2025</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"228\">\n	<p data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"230\"><strong data-end=\"253\" data-start=\"230\">Balance 50% Payment</strong> by <strong data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"257\">10 January 2026</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"313\">\n	<li data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"313\">\n	<p data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"315\"><strong data-end=\"322\" data-start=\"315\">10%</strong> deduction if cancelled <strong data-end=\"365\" data-start=\"346\">15 days or more</strong> prior to the tour</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"386\">\n	<p data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"388\"><strong data-end=\"395\" data-start=\"388\">50%</strong> deduction if cancelled <strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"419\">7–15 days</strong> prior to the tour</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"453\">\n	<p data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"455\"><strong data-end=\"463\" data-start=\"455\">100%</strong> deduction if cancelled <strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"487\">within 7 days</strong> of the tour</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":46097,\"transport_cost\":\"10600\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":56697,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 5669.7\",\"selling_price\":62366.699999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0745/0102025', 62760, 31380, 0, '2025-10-30 14:23:12', '2026-01-22 07:07:30', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(760, 'MR BINIT AGARWAL', 'BNI', '8603815340', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2025-12-01', 8, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Hanoi \\u2013 Half Day City Tour\",\"date\":\"01-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"941\\\" data-start=\\\"729\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"778\\\" data-start=\\\"745\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, meet your local guide holding a placard with your name. Enjoy a comfortable transfer (approx. 50\\u201360 mins) to your hotel and check-in (standard time 14:00 hrs).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1335\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\">In the afternoon, explore the historical charm of <strong data-end=\\\"1002\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\">Hanoi<\\/strong>:<br data-end=\\\"1006\\\" data-start=\\\"1003\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"1010\\\">Temple of Literature<\\/strong> \\u2013 Vietnam\\u2019s first university, built in 1070 to honor Confucius.<br data-end=\\\"1101\\\" data-start=\\\"1098\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf0a <strong data-end=\\\"1140\\\" data-start=\\\"1104\\\">Hoan Kiem Lake &amp; Ngoc Son Temple<\\/strong> \\u2013 a serene lake at the heart of the city, rich with legend and spirituality.<br data-end=\\\"1220\\\" data-start=\\\"1217\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2615 Conclude with traditional <strong data-end=\\\"1269\\\" data-start=\\\"1248\\\">Vietnamese coffee<\\/strong> at a local caf\\u00e9 while watching the rhythm of daily life unfold.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1388\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1350\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"1358\\\" data-start=\\\"1355\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1380\\\" data-start=\\\"1358\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Tam Coc \\u2013 Bich Dong \\u2013 Hoa Lu\",\"date\":\"02-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1563\\\" data-start=\\\"1452\\\">After breakfast, embark on a scenic 2-hour drive to&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1526\\\" data-start=\\\"1504\\\">Ninh Binh Province<\\/strong>, known as&nbsp;<em data-end=\\\"1561\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\">\\u201cHa Long Bay on land.\\u201d<\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1993\\\" data-start=\\\"1565\\\">Highlights include:<br data-end=\\\"1587\\\" data-start=\\\"1584\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfef&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1616\\\" data-start=\\\"1590\\\">Hoa Lu Ancient Citadel<\\/strong>&nbsp;\\u2013 The first capital of Vietnam under the Dinh and Le dynasties, featuring timeworn temples and ancient architecture.<br data-end=\\\"1736\\\" data-start=\\\"1733\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udd4d&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1759\\\" data-start=\\\"1739\\\">Bich Dong Pagoda<\\/strong>&nbsp;\\u2013 A 3-tiered cave pagoda set amid karst mountains, offering panoramic views.<br data-end=\\\"1839\\\" data-start=\\\"1836\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udef6&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1867\\\" data-start=\\\"1842\\\">Tam Coc Sampan Cruise<\\/strong>&nbsp;\\u2013 Glide along the Hoang Long River through emerald waters, rice paddies, and limestone caves (Tam Coc means \\u201cThree Caves\\u201d).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2051\\\" data-start=\\\"1995\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2008\\\" data-start=\\\"1995\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2021\\\" data-start=\\\"2018\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2043\\\" data-start=\\\"2021\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi \\u2013 Ha Long Bay Overnight Cruise (by Shuttle Bus)\",\"date\":\"03-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2385\\\" data-start=\\\"2132\\\">After breakfast, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2176\\\" data-start=\\\"2161\\\">Ha Long Bay<\\/strong> (approx. 2.5 hours). Board your luxury cruise, enjoy a welcome drink, and settle into your cabin.<br data-end=\\\"2277\\\" data-start=\\\"2274\\\" \\/>\\nSail through thousands of limestone islands dotting the emerald waters of this UNESCO World Heritage site.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2583\\\" data-start=\\\"2387\\\">Afternoon activities include swimming, kayaking, or exploring caves (depending on your cruise itinerary).<br data-end=\\\"2495\\\" data-start=\\\"2492\\\" \\/>\\nAs the sun sets over the bay, enjoy dinner on board and relax under a canopy of stars.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2679\\\" data-start=\\\"2585\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2598\\\" data-start=\\\"2585\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch &amp; Dinner<br data-end=\\\"2627\\\" data-start=\\\"2624\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2649\\\" data-start=\\\"2627\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Onboard Cruise, Ha Long Bay<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ha Long \\u2192 Hanoi \\u2192 Da Nang (By Flight)\",\"date\":\"04-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2890\\\" data-start=\\\"2743\\\">Wake up to the gentle waves of Ha Long Bay. After breakfast or brunch onboard, cruise back toward the port as you enjoy the last panoramic views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3039\\\" data-start=\\\"2892\\\">Transfer to Hanoi Airport for your onward flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2955\\\" data-start=\\\"2944\\\">Da Nang<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2959\\\" data-start=\\\"2956\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, meet your driver and transfer to your hotel for check-in and rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3118\\\" data-start=\\\"3041\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3054\\\" data-start=\\\"3041\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch (or Brunch)<br data-end=\\\"3086\\\" data-start=\\\"3083\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3108\\\" data-start=\\\"3086\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Excursion to Ba Na Hills & Golden Bridge\",\"date\":\"05-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3311\\\" data-start=\\\"3194\\\">After breakfast, embark on a scenic drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3254\\\" data-start=\\\"3239\\\">Ba Na Hills<\\/strong>, a French-inspired hill station and amusement complex.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3729\\\" data-start=\\\"3313\\\">Highlights:<br data-end=\\\"3327\\\" data-start=\\\"3324\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udea1 <strong data-end=\\\"3364\\\" data-start=\\\"3330\\\">World\\u2019s Longest Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> \\u2013 Marvel at sweeping views of Da Nang\\u2019s lush landscapes.<br data-end=\\\"3424\\\" data-start=\\\"3421\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf09 <strong data-end=\\\"3444\\\" data-start=\\\"3427\\\">Golden Bridge<\\/strong> \\u2013 The iconic hand-held bridge suspended above the clouds.<br data-end=\\\"3505\\\" data-start=\\\"3502\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf38 <strong data-end=\\\"3529\\\" data-start=\\\"3508\\\">Le Jardin D\\u2019Amour<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3548\\\" data-start=\\\"3531\\\">French Villas<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"3573\\\" data-start=\\\"3554\\\">Linh Ung Pagoda<\\/strong> \\u2013 Tranquil gardens and a towering Buddha statue.<br data-end=\\\"3625\\\" data-start=\\\"3622\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udc12 Spot playful monkeys, visit waterfalls, and enjoy cool mountain air before descending by cable car.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3789\\\" data-start=\\\"3731\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3744\\\" data-start=\\\"3731\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3757\\\" data-start=\\\"3754\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3779\\\" data-start=\\\"3757\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half-Day Hoi An Ancient Town \\u2013 Fly to Phu Quoc\",\"date\":\"06-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3967\\\" data-start=\\\"3862\\\">After breakfast, drive to the UNESCO-listed <strong data-end=\\\"3929\\\" data-start=\\\"3906\\\">Hoi An Ancient Town<\\/strong>, a charming blend of East and West.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4166\\\" data-start=\\\"3969\\\">Explore:<br data-end=\\\"3980\\\" data-start=\\\"3977\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfef <strong data-end=\\\"4010\\\" data-start=\\\"3983\\\">Japanese Covered Bridge<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"4013\\\" data-start=\\\"4010\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe0 <strong data-end=\\\"4040\\\" data-start=\\\"4016\\\">Tan Ky Ancient House<\\/strong> (200 years old)<br data-end=\\\"4059\\\" data-start=\\\"4056\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\uded5 <strong data-end=\\\"4103\\\" data-start=\\\"4062\\\">Ong Temple &amp; Museum of Trade Ceramics<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"4106\\\" data-start=\\\"4103\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecd\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4127\\\" data-start=\\\"4110\\\">Hoi An Market<\\/strong> \\u2013 perfect for souvenirs and lanterns<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4314\\\" data-start=\\\"4168\\\">Later, transfer to Da Nang Airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"4241\\\" data-start=\\\"4222\\\">Phu Quoc Island<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"4245\\\" data-start=\\\"4242\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, meet your driver and check in to your beachfront hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4375\\\" data-start=\\\"4316\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4329\\\" data-start=\\\"4316\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"4342\\\" data-start=\\\"4339\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"4364\\\" data-start=\\\"4342\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"North of Phu Quoc \\u2013 Safari & VinWonders\",\"date\":\"07-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"4543\\\" data-start=\\\"4441\\\">After breakfast, transfer to the <strong data-end=\\\"4496\\\" data-start=\\\"4474\\\">VinWonders Complex<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s largest amusement and theme park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4808\\\" data-start=\\\"4545\\\">Highlights:<br data-end=\\\"4559\\\" data-start=\\\"4556\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfa0 Thrilling rides, shows &amp; record-breaking attractions at <strong data-end=\\\"4632\\\" data-start=\\\"4618\\\">VinWonders<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"4635\\\" data-start=\\\"4632\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83e\\udd81 Wildlife encounters in the <strong data-end=\\\"4689\\\" data-start=\\\"4665\\\">Phu Quoc Safari Park<\\/strong> \\u2013 see animals roam freely in natural habitats<br data-end=\\\"4738\\\" data-start=\\\"4735\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udc26 Enjoy the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"4772\\\" data-start=\\\"4759\\\">bird show<\\/strong> promoting environmental awareness<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4869\\\" data-start=\\\"4810\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"4823\\\" data-start=\\\"4810\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"4836\\\" data-start=\\\"4833\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"4858\\\" data-start=\\\"4836\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phu Quoc Cable Car & 3 Island Adventure (SIC Tour)\",\"date\":\"08-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"5364\\\" data-start=\\\"4947\\\">After breakfast, experience an island-hopping adventure:<br data-end=\\\"5006\\\" data-start=\\\"5003\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf0a <strong data-end=\\\"5027\\\" data-start=\\\"5009\\\">Gam Ghi Island<\\/strong> \\u2013 Snorkel among colorful coral reefs<br data-end=\\\"5067\\\" data-start=\\\"5064\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfd6\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"5095\\\" data-start=\\\"5071\\\">May Rut Trong Island<\\/strong> \\u2013 Relax on powdery sands &amp; enjoy water sports<br data-end=\\\"5144\\\" data-start=\\\"5141\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"5166\\\" data-start=\\\"5148\\\">Lunch on board<\\/strong> the boat<br data-end=\\\"5178\\\" data-start=\\\"5175\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfa2 <strong data-end=\\\"5219\\\" data-start=\\\"5181\\\">Thom Island &amp; Aquatopia Water Park<\\/strong> \\u2013 20+ world-class slides and rides<br data-end=\\\"5257\\\" data-start=\\\"5254\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udea1 <strong data-end=\\\"5287\\\" data-start=\\\"5260\\\">Hon Thom Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> \\u2013 The world\\u2019s longest sea-crossing cable car with spectacular sunset views<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"5432\\\" data-start=\\\"5366\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"5379\\\" data-start=\\\"5366\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch<br data-end=\\\"5399\\\" data-start=\\\"5396\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"5421\\\" data-start=\\\"5399\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phu Quoc<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 9\",\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Phu Quoc\",\"date\":\"09-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"5637\\\" data-start=\\\"5482\\\">Enjoy a leisurely breakfast and some free time before your airport transfer.<br data-end=\\\"5561\\\" data-start=\\\"5558\\\" \\/>\\nBid farewell to the tropical charm of Vietnam with unforgettable memories!<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"5664\\\" data-start=\\\"5639\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"5652\\\" data-start=\\\"5639\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"64\",\"dep_date\":\"30 Nov 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"45000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"543\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phu Quoc (PQC)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"440\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"11050\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1632\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:15 AM\",\"fare\":68918}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"30\\/11\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"LE JARDIN HOTEL & SPA\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe City View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"6000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"LA REGINA ROYAL CRUISE\",\"city\":\"HA LONG\",\"room_type\":\"Noble Suite\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"0\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"04\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"DA NANG\",\"hotel_name\":\"CICILIA HOTEL & SPA\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Deluxe Partial Ocean View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"0\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"06\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHU QUOC\",\"hotel_name\":\"WYNDHAM GARDEN GRANDWORLD PHU QUOC\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Garden View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"09\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"0\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airfare&nbsp;<b><i>Ex-Ranchi</i></b>.</li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel LE JARDIN HOTEL &amp; SPA&nbsp;@HA NOI&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel LA REGINA ROYAL CRUISE&nbsp;@HA LONG&nbsp;</strong></em>with <strong>All Meals<strong>.</strong></strong></li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel CICILIA HOTEL &amp; SPA&nbsp;@DA NANG&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel WYNDHAM GARDEN GRANDWORLD PHU QUOC&nbsp;@PHU QUOC&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong><em><strong>.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Vietnam VISA.</strong></em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":124968,\"land_cost\":\"176722\",\"hotel_cost\":6000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"5200\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":312890,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 40675.7\",\"selling_price\":353565.7000000000116415321826934814453125}', 'MZQ/0746/0102025', 348000, 174000, 0, '2025-10-31 07:03:49', '2025-11-19 11:39:40', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(761, 'Mr Shailesh', 'BNI Dewanshu', '7070454222', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-11-12', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Phuket Airport (HKT) \\u2192 Hotel Transfer\",\"date\":\"12-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"480\\\" data-start=\\\"399\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"748\\\" data-start=\\\"417\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"465\\\" data-start=\\\"433\\\">Phuket International Airport<\\/strong>, meet our local representative and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"529\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to your hotel for check-in. The rest of the day is free at leisure to relax or explore nearby beaches and markets.<br data-end=\\\"717\\\" data-start=\\\"714\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong>\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"748\\\" data-start=\\\"721\\\">Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island by Catamaran (Incl. National Park Fee)\",\"date\":\"13-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<ul data-end=\\\"1418\\\" data-start=\\\"820\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"927\\\" data-start=\\\"820\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"927\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\">Get ready for an exciting day trip to <strong data-end=\\\"909\\\" data-start=\\\"892\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, featuring the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"959\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"983\\\" data-start=\\\"964\\\">Naka Yai Island<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"987\\\" data-start=\\\"984\\\" \\/>\\n\\tStart your journey with a transfer to the pier and embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"1080\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\">luxurious Catamaran cruise<\\/strong>. Enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"1115\\\" data-start=\\\"1088\\\">canoeing at Hong Island<\\/strong>, a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1149\\\" data-start=\\\"1128\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong>, and a scenic stop at <strong data-end=\\\"1188\\\" data-start=\\\"1172\\\">Panyi Island<\\/strong> for lunch. Later, unwind at <strong data-end=\\\"1233\\\" data-start=\\\"1217\\\">Panak Island<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1247\\\" data-start=\\\"1235\\\">Naka Yai<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1273\\\" data-start=\\\"1253\\\">Rang Yai Islands<\\/strong> before returning to the pier.<br data-end=\\\"1306\\\" data-start=\\\"1303\\\" \\/>\\n\\t\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1326\\\" data-start=\\\"1310\\\">Tour Includes:<\\/em> Catamaran Cruise, Canoeing, Lunch, National Park Fees<br data-end=\\\"1460\\\" data-start=\\\"1457\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"1491\\\" data-start=\\\"1464\\\">Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tiger Park Experience + Phuket City Tour\",\"date\":\"14-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1636\\\" data-start=\\\"1615\\\">Phuket Tiger Park<\\/strong> for a thrilling and safe encounter with magnificent tigers.<br data-end=\\\"1699\\\" data-start=\\\"1696\\\" \\/>\\nChoose between the <strong data-end=\\\"1734\\\" data-start=\\\"1718\\\">Medium Tiger<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"1753\\\" data-start=\\\"1738\\\">Small Tiger<\\/strong> package for a 10\\u201315 minute supervised interaction session under expert trainer guidance.<br data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-start=\\\"1842\\\" \\/>\\nPost-visit, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2108\\\" data-start=\\\"2073\\\">5-hour private Phuket City Tour<\\/strong>, covering highlights such as <strong data-end=\\\"2157\\\" data-start=\\\"2138\\\">Karon Viewpoint<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2173\\\" data-start=\\\"2159\\\">Big Buddha<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2190\\\" data-start=\\\"2175\\\">Wat Chalong<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2211\\\" data-start=\\\"2192\\\">Old Phuket Town<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2234\\\" data-start=\\\"2217\\\">local markets<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2311\\\" data-start=\\\"2308\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2342\\\" data-start=\\\"2315\\\">Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2192 Bangkok Transfer\",\"date\":\"15-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2232\\\">After breakfast, check out and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2476\\\" data-start=\\\"2456\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to Phuket Airport for your onward flight to Bangkok.<br data-end=\\\"2532\\\" data-start=\\\"2529\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"2578\\\" data-start=\\\"2548\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong>, meet our driver and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<br data-end=\\\"2786\\\" data-start=\\\"2783\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"2818\\\" data-start=\\\"2790\\\">Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park (With Indian Lunch)\",\"date\":\"16-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2745\\\" data-start=\\\"2646\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a full-day visit to <strong data-end=\\\"2985\\\" data-start=\\\"2955\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>, Bangkok\\u2019s most popular family attraction.<br data-end=\\\"3031\\\" data-start=\\\"3028\\\" \\/>\\nExperience an exciting <strong data-end=\\\"3078\\\" data-start=\\\"3054\\\">drive-through safari<\\/strong> featuring giraffes, zebras, and lions, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"3151\\\" data-start=\\\"3130\\\">Marine Park shows<\\/strong> like dolphin, orangutan boxing, bird show, and more.<br data-end=\\\"3207\\\" data-start=\\\"3204\\\" \\/>\\nA delicious <strong data-end=\\\"3242\\\" data-start=\\\"3219\\\">Indian buffet lunch<\\/strong> will be served at the park.<br data-end=\\\"3417\\\" data-start=\\\"3414\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f <em data-end=\\\"3449\\\" data-start=\\\"3421\\\">Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"17-11-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3734\\\" data-start=\\\"3519\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"3594\\\" data-start=\\\"3574\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to <strong data-end=\\\"3628\\\" data-start=\\\"3598\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong> for your flight back home.<br data-end=\\\"3658\\\" data-start=\\\"3655\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udeeb <strong data-end=\\\"3779\\\" data-start=\\\"3739\\\">End of a Wonderful Thailand Holiday!<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3734\\\" data-start=\\\"3519\\\"><br data-end=\\\"3782\\\" data-start=\\\"3779\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>\\u2728 <em data-end=\\\"3846\\\" data-start=\\\"3784\\\">We hope you had a memorable journey with Multi Zone Travels!<\\/em> \\u2728<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E 1087\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"45402\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD 4113\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"05:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"24942\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"TG 313\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Nov 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Nov 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"12:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"65552\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/11\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Deevana Plaza Patong\",\"room_type\":\