>✈️ Return Airfare – <strong>Ex-Kolkata </strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🏨 <strong>03 Nights </strong>at <strong>Hotel Deevana Plaza Patong</strong></li>\n	<li>🏨 <strong>02 Nights</strong> at <strong>Hotel Grand Mercure Bangkok Atrium</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🛏️ <strong>02 Rooms</strong> on Double Sharing Basis &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🍽️ Daily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels</li>\n	<li>📍 Phuket Airport → Hotel – Private One-Way Transfer &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🛥 James Bond Island by Catamaran (Incl. National Park Fee) with Private Transfers &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🏙️ Phuket City Tour&nbsp; + 🐯 Tiger Park Visit&nbsp;&nbsp;– 5 Hours with Private Transfers &nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🚖 BKK Airport → Hotel – One-Way Private Transfer &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🦁 Safari World &amp; Marine Park Entry&nbsp;with Private Transfers</li>\n	<li>🚖 Hotel → BKK Airport – One-Way Private Transfer&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":135896,\"land_cost\":\"73200\",\"hotel_cost\":67148,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":276244,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 38674.16\",\"selling_price\":314918.160000000032596290111541748046875}', 'MZQ/0747/0112025', 315000, 78750, 88920, '2025-11-05 11:05:09', '2025-11-05 12:49:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(762, 'Mr Om', 'BNI Dewanshu', '9431224476', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'PHUKET', '2025-12-29', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"886\\\" data-start=\\\"609\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"676\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\">Phuket International Airport (HKT)<\\/strong>, where our representative will greet you and assist with your <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"739\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> to the hotel. Check in and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is free for leisure \\u2014 explore nearby caf\\u00e9s, Patong Beach, or indulge in local shopping.<br data-end=\\\"923\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"941\\\" data-start=\\\"923\\\">\\ud83d\\udece Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private Airport to Hotel Transfer, Hotel Accommodation, Breakfast (next morning)<br data-end=\\\"1025\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1038\\\" data-start=\\\"1025\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"1046\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1077\\\" data-start=\\\"1046\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1408\\\" data-start=\\\"968\\\">After breakfast, set out on an unforgettable <strong data-end=\\\"1272\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\">James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran<\\/strong> through the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"1314\\\" data-start=\\\"1297\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>. Witness the stunning limestone cliffs and visit the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1402\\\" data-start=\\\"1381\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong>, featured in <em data-end=\\\"1445\\\" data-start=\\\"1416\\\">The Man with the Golden Gun<\\/em>. Enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"1480\\\" data-start=\\\"1453\\\">canoeing at Hong Island<\\/strong>, sightseeing at <strong data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-start=\\\"1497\\\">Panyi Island<\\/strong>, and relax at <strong data-end=\\\"1547\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\">Naka Yai Island<\\/strong> before cruising back.<br data-end=\\\"1572\\\" data-start=\\\"1569\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1590\\\" data-start=\\\"1572\\\">\\ud83d\\udece Inclusions:<\\/strong> Tour by Catamaran, Lunch on Board, National Park Fee, Hotel Accommodation<br data-end=\\\"1667\\\" data-start=\\\"1664\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-start=\\\"1667\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch<br data-end=\\\"1700\\\" data-start=\\\"1697\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1731\\\" data-start=\\\"1700\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour with Tiger Park\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast at the hotel before heading out for a <strong data-end=\\\"1892\\\" data-start=\\\"1864\\\">private Phuket City Tour<\\/strong>. Visit iconic landmarks such as the <strong data-end=\\\"1943\\\" data-start=\\\"1929\\\">Big Buddha<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1967\\\" data-start=\\\"1945\\\">Wat Chalong Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1988\\\" data-start=\\\"1969\\\">Old Phuket Town<\\/strong>, and scenic viewpoints overlooking the Andaman Sea. Later, visit <strong data-end=\\\"2075\\\" data-start=\\\"2054\\\">Tiger Park Phuket<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll get a once-in-a-lifetime chance to safely interact with tigers and capture incredible photos under expert supervision.<br data-end=\\\"2211\\\" data-start=\\\"2208\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2229\\\" data-start=\\\"2211\\\">\\ud83d\\udece Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private City Tour, Tiger Park Entry, Transfers, Hotel Accommodation<br data-end=\\\"2300\\\" data-start=\\\"2297\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2313\\\" data-start=\\\"2300\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2326\\\" data-start=\\\"2323\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2357\\\" data-start=\\\"2326\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi & Khai Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a <strong data-end=\\\"2528\\\" data-start=\\\"2501\\\">full-day Catamaran tour<\\/strong> to the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"2568\\\" data-start=\\\"2549\\\">Phi Phi Islands<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"2588\\\" data-start=\\\"2573\\\">Khai Island<\\/strong>. Swim in turquoise lagoons, snorkel among coral reefs, and relax on stunning white sand beaches. A <strong data-end=\\\"2709\\\" data-start=\\\"2688\\\">Thai buffet lunch<\\/strong> will be served onboard as you enjoy the breathtaking seascapes.<br data-end=\\\"2776\\\" data-start=\\\"2773\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2794\\\" data-start=\\\"2776\\\">\\ud83d\\udece Inclusions:<\\/strong> Phi Phi &amp; Khai Island Tour by Catamaran, National Park Fee, Lunch, Hotel Accommodation<br data-end=\\\"2884\\\" data-start=\\\"2881\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2897\\\" data-start=\\\"2884\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2917\\\" data-start=\\\"2914\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2948\\\" data-start=\\\"2917\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Phuket\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3342\\\" data-start=\\\"3016\\\">Enjoy breakfast at your hotel and some leisure time before check-out. Later, a <strong data-end=\\\"3115\\\" data-start=\\\"3095\\\">private transfer<\\/strong> will take you to <strong data-end=\\\"3171\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\">Phuket International Airport (HKT)<\\/strong> for your return flight home.<br data-end=\\\"3203\\\" data-start=\\\"3200\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3221\\\" data-start=\\\"3203\\\">\\ud83d\\udece Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private Hotel to Airport Transfer, Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3269\\\" data-start=\\\"3266\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3282\\\" data-start=\\\"3269\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3295\\\" data-start=\\\"3292\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3342\\\" data-start=\\\"3295\\\">\\ud83c\\udfc1 Tour Ends with Sweet Memories of Phuket!<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Gaya (GAY)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"fno\":\"FD-123\",\"dep_time\":\"11:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"68400\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Dec 2025\",\"fno\":\"FD-3013\",\"dep_time\":\"08:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD-3016\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"88600\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (DMK)\",\"to\":\"Gaya (GAY)\",\"name\":\"Thai AirAsia\",\"fno\":\"FD-122\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:50 AM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"check_out\":\"02\\/01\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Patong Bay Hill Resort\",\"room_type\":\"One Bedroom Suite Pool Access Seaview\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"125000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.