</strong><br />\n🚖 Phuket (HKT) Airport → Hotel Transfer (Private)<br />\n🚖 Phuket Hotel → Phuket (HKT) Airport Transfer (Private)<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Meal Plan</strong><br />\n🍽 Daily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels<br />\n🍽 02 Lunches during island tours<br />\n<br />\n<strong>💎 Highlights</strong><br />\n✅ Private tours &amp; transfers for a seamless experience<br />\n✅ National Park Fees included in all island tours<br />\n✅ Perfect blend of leisure, culture &amp; adventure</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":157000,\"land_cost\":\"80000\",\"hotel_cost\":125000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"20 Kgs Baggage (4700+4500) x 04\",\"amount\":36800}],\"cost_price\":398800,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 43868\",\"selling_price\":442668}', 'MZQ/0748/0112025', 442720, 110680, 0, '2025-11-07 10:35:59', '2025-11-07 11:29:58', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(763, 'Mr Sushant Agarwal', 'WalkIN', '7764835382', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2026-01-01', 4, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Singapore + Night Safari Adventure\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"606\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">Singapore Changi International Airport<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll be greeted by our representative and transferred to your hotel. Check in and unwind after your flight.<br data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, embark on the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"781\\\" data-start=\\\"765\\\">Night Safari<\\/strong>, the world\\u2019s first nocturnal wildlife park. Enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"849\\\" data-start=\\\"836\\\">Tram Ride<\\/strong> through various animal habitats, followed by the <strong data-end=\\\"914\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\">Animal Show<\\/strong>, offering an up-close view of fascinating nocturnal creatures.<br data-end=\\\"980\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"993\\\" data-start=\\\"980\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"1021\\\" data-start=\\\"1018\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1040\\\" data-start=\\\"1021\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private Airport Transfer, Night Safari (Tram Ride + Animal Show)<br data-end=\\\"1108\\\" data-start=\\\"1105\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1130\\\" data-start=\\\"1108\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"City Tour + Gardens by the Bay + Marina Bay Sands SkyPark\",\"date\":\"02-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1295\\\" data-start=\\\"1273\\\">Merlion City Drive<\\/strong>, covering Singapore\\u2019s iconic landmarks:<br data-end=\\\"1338\\\" data-start=\\\"1335\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1572\\\" data-start=\\\"1338\\\">Arts Museum, CBD area, Chinatown, Civic District, Civilian War Memorial, Dhoby Ghaut, Esplanade Theatre by the Bay, Helix Bridge, Istana (Orchard), Marina Floating Bay, Plaza Singapura, Raffles Hotel, Suntec City, Swiss\\u00f4tel Stamford<\\/em>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1607\\\" data-start=\\\"1578\\\">Merlion Park (Photo Stop)<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1611\\\" data-start=\\\"1608\\\" \\/>\\nContinue to <strong data-end=\\\"1645\\\" data-start=\\\"1623\\\">Gardens by the Bay<\\/strong>, a nature park with futuristic conservatories \\u2014 <strong data-end=\\\"1710\\\" data-start=\\\"1694\\\">Cloud Forest<\\/strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\\\"1728\\\" data-start=\\\"1713\\\">Flower Dome<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1732\\\" data-start=\\\"1729\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"1777\\\" data-start=\\\"1749\\\">Marina Bay Sands SkyPark<\\/strong>, offering panoramic skyline views.<br data-end=\\\"1815\\\" data-start=\\\"1812\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1828\\\" data-start=\\\"1815\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1841\\\" data-start=\\\"1838\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1860\\\" data-start=\\\"1841\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> City Tour (as listed), Gardens by the Bay (2 Conservatories), Marina Bay Sands SkyPark<br data-end=\\\"1950\\\" data-start=\\\"1947\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1972\\\" data-start=\\\"1950\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Sentosa Island Experience\",\"date\":\"03-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2112\\\" data-start=\\\"2094\\\">Sentosa Island<\\/strong> for a full day of fun and adventure. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"2175\\\" data-start=\\\"2156\\\">S.E.A. Aquarium<\\/strong>, home to over 100,000 marine animals, take a scenic ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"2253\\\" data-start=\\\"2240\\\">Cable Car<\\/strong>, and witness the dazzling <strong data-end=\\\"2297\\\" data-start=\\\"2280\\\">Wings of Time<\\/strong> evening show. Don\\u2019t miss the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"2357\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\">SkyHelix Sentosa<\\/strong> experience \\u2014 Singapore\\u2019s highest open-air panoramic ride.<br data-end=\\\"2418\\\" data-start=\\\"2415\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2431\\\" data-start=\\\"2418\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2444\\\" data-start=\\\"2441\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2463\\\" data-start=\\\"2444\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Full Day Sentosa Tour (S.E.A. Aquarium + Cable Car + Wings of Time + SkyHelix)<br data-end=\\\"2545\\\" data-start=\\\"2542\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2567\\\" data-start=\\\"2545\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore\",\"date\":\"04-01-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day visit to <strong data-end=\\\"2727\\\" data-start=\\\"2696\\\">Universal Studios Singapore<\\/strong>, Southeast Asia\\u2019s only Universal theme park. Explore seven themed zones, enjoy thrilling rides like <em data-end=\\\"2850\\\" data-start=\\\"2828\\\">Battlestar Galactica<\\/em>, <em data-end=\\\"2866\\\" data-start=\\\"2852\\\">Transformers<\\/em>, <em data-end=\\\"2890\\\" data-start=\\\"2868\\\">Revenge of the Mummy<\\/em>, and watch spectacular live shows.<br data-end=\\\"2928\\\" data-start=\\\"2925\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2941\\\" data-start=\\\"2928\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2954\\\" data-start=\\\"2951\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2973\\\" data-start=\\\"2954\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Full Day Universal Studios (Non-Peak Entry Ticket)<br data-end=\\\"3027\\\" data-start=\\\"3024\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"3027\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Singapore\",\"date\":\"05-01-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast at your hotel, then spend some leisure time shopping or exploring on your own before checking out. Later, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3294\\\" data-start=\\\"3266\\\">Singapore Changi Airport<\\/strong> for your flight back home, carrying beautiful memories of your Singapore getaway.<br data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3376\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3392\\\" data-start=\\\"3379\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3405\\\" data-start=\\\"3402\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3424\\\" data-start=\\\"3405\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private Airport Departure Transfer<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-5017\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"73800\"},{\"id\":2,\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1021\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:15 AM\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-1016\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"30700\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/01\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel York\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Triple Sharing\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"05\\/01\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"76200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</