"2222\" data-start=\"2179\">\n	<p data-end=\"2222\" data-start=\"2181\">⛴️ <strong data-end=\"2220\" data-start=\"2184\">Deluxe Marina Dhow Cruise Dinner</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2261\" data-start=\"2223\">\n	<p data-end=\"2261\" data-start=\"2225\">🏛️ <strong data-end=\"2253\" data-start=\"2229\">Museum of the Future</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2285\" data-start=\"2262\">\n	<p data-end=\"2285\" data-start=\"2264\">🖼️ <strong data-end=\"2283\" data-start=\"2268\">Dubai Frame</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2286\">\n	<p data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2288\">🐬 <strong data-end=\"2314\" data-start=\"2291\">Dolphin &amp; Seal Show</strong> at <strong>Dubai Dolphinarium</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2429\" data-start=\"2339\">\n	<p data-end=\"2429\" data-start=\"2341\">🕌 <strong data-end=\"2367\" data-start=\"2344\">Abu Dhabi City Tour</strong> with <strong data-end=\"2390\" data-start=\"2373\">Ferrari World</strong>, <strong data-end=\"2408\" data-start=\"2392\">Grand Mosque</strong>, &amp; <strong data-end=\"2427\" data-start=\"2412\">BAPS Temple</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2491\" data-start=\"2430\">\n	<p data-end=\"2491\" data-start=\"2432\">🚗 All Tours &amp; Transfers on <strong data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2579\">Private Basis.</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2549\">\n	<p data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2551\"><strong data-end=\"2596\" data-start=\"2579\">Dubai Visa</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong><em>Tourism Dhiram Fee (to be paid directly at the Hotel).</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong><em>3.5 Years CHILD Entry Fees to all sightseeing can be directly paid over the counter if applicable.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Any personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":168000,\"hotel_cost\":78900,\"land_cost\":\"127440\",\"visa_cost\":\"29000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":403340,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 56467.6\",\"selling_price\":459807.599999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0750/0112025', 460120, 105080, 39800, '2025-11-07 11:53:45', '2025-11-08 12:16:26', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(765, 'Mrs. Manisha Barnwal', 'Sonu Gaya', '7001647936', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2026-01-16', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Late-Night Arrival in Dubai\",\"date\":\"16-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"381\\\" data-start=\\\"170\\\">Arrive <strong data-end=\\\"191\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">late night<\\/strong> at Dubai International Airport. After completing immigration and baggage collection, meet our representative at the arrival area. You will be transferred to your hotel in a private vehicle.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"489\\\" data-start=\\\"383\\\">Since it\\u2019s a late-night arrival, check-in, settle into your room, and rest comfortably after your journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"549\\\" data-start=\\\"491\\\">No activities are scheduled today due to the late arrival.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"595\\\" data-start=\\\"551\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"569\\\" data-start=\\\"551\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: None<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"572\\\" data-start=\\\"569\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"595\\\" data-start=\\\"572\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half-Day Dubai City Tour + Burj Khalifa 124th Floor\",\"date\":\"17-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1073\\\" data-start=\\\"771\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"830\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\">Half-Day Dubai City Tour<\\/strong>, covering major attractions such as:<br data-end=\\\"870\\\" data-start=\\\"867\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Jumeirah Mosque<br data-end=\\\"890\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Jumeirah Beach<br data-end=\\\"909\\\" data-start=\\\"906\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Palm Jumeirah (Photo Stop at Atlantis)<br data-end=\\\"952\\\" data-start=\\\"949\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Dubai Marina<br data-end=\\\"969\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Sheikh Zayed Road Skyline<br data-end=\\\"999\\\" data-start=\\\"996\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Dubai Frame (Drive Past)<br data-end=\\\"1028\\\" data-start=\\\"1025\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Bur Dubai &amp; Deira Gold Souk drive-through<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1236\\\" data-start=\\\"1075\\\">In the afternoon, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"1159\\\" data-start=\\\"1103\\\">Burj Khalifa \\u2013 124th &amp; 125th Floor (Non-Prime Hours)<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1163\\\" data-start=\\\"1160\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy stunning panoramic views of Dubai\\u2019s skyline, desert, and coastline.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1287\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1261\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1264\\\" data-start=\\\"1261\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1287\\\" data-start=\\\"1264\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Miracle Garden + Global Village\",\"date\":\"18-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1443\\\" data-start=\\\"1358\\\">After breakfast, get ready to visit two of Dubai\\u2019s most popular seasonal attractions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1600\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\">\\ud83c\\udf38 <strong data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1448\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1475\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\" \\/>\\nStroll through the world\\u2019s largest natural flower garden featuring over 150 million blooms arranged in extraordinary designs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1798\\\" data-start=\\\"1602\\\">\\ud83c\\udf0d <strong data-end=\\\"1623\\\" data-start=\\\"1605\\\">Global Village<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1626\\\" data-start=\\\"1623\\\" \\/>\\nExperience a multicultural world fair showcasing 70+ countries, live performances, food stalls, and themed pavilions \\u2014 a perfect blend of culture, shopping &amp; entertainment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1800\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1823\\\" data-start=\\\"1800\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1826\\\" data-start=\\\"1823\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1826\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Premium Desert Safari\",\"date\":\"19-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1974\\\" data-start=\\\"1910\\\">Enjoy breakfast at the hotel and spend the morning at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2248\\\" data-start=\\\"1976\\\">In the afternoon, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"2033\\\" data-start=\\\"2008\\\">Premium Desert Safari<\\/strong>, including:<br data-end=\\\"2048\\\" data-start=\\\"2045\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Thrilling Dune Bashing<br data-end=\\\"2075\\\" data-start=\\\"2072\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Camel Ride<br data-end=\\\"2090\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Henna Painting<br data-end=\\\"2109\\\" data-start=\\\"2106\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Sunset Photography<br data-end=\\\"2132\\\" data-start=\\\"2129\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Fire Show, Tanoura Show &amp; Belly Dance<br data-end=\\\"2174\\\" data-start=\\\"2171\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 BBQ Dinner (Veg\\/Non-Veg)<br data-end=\\\"2203\\\" data-start=\\\"2200\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Premium Camp Seating<br data-end=\\\"2228\\\" data-start=\\\"2225\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Private Transfer<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2288\\\" data-start=\\\"2250\\\">Return to the hotel by late evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2351\\\" data-start=\\\"2290\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2325\\\" data-start=\\\"2290\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast, BBQ Dinner<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2328\\\" data-start=\\\"2325\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2351\\\" data-start=\\\"2328\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"1-Hour Evening Yacht Ride\",\"date\":\"20-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2498\\\" data-start=\\\"2416\\\">Have a relaxed morning after breakfast. Optional: explore Marina Mall or JBR Walk.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2683\\\" data-start=\\\"2500\\\">In the evening, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2555\\\" data-start=\\\"2524\\\">luxurious 1-Hour Yacht Ride<\\/strong> from Dubai Marina.<br data-end=\\\"2577\\\" data-start=\\\"2574\\\" \\/>\\nWitness the illuminated skyline including Ain Dubai, JBR, and Bluewaters Island while cruising in comfort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2734\\\" data-start=\\\"2685\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2708\\\" data-start=\\\"2685\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2711\\\" data-start=\\\"2708\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2734\\\" data-start=\\\"2711\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Abu Dhabi City Tour + SeaWorld + BAPS Hindu Temple\",\"date\":\"21-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2883\\\" data-start=\\\"2824\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"2882\\\" data-start=\\\"2855\\\">Full-Day Abu Dhabi Tour<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3063\\\" data-start=\\\"2885\\\">\\ud83c\\udfd9\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2922\\\" data-start=\\\"2889\\\">Abu Dhabi City Tour Includes:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2925\\\" data-start=\\\"2922\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque<br data-end=\\\"2955\\\" data-start=\\\"2952\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Emirates Palace (Photo Stop)<br data-end=\\\"2988\\\" data-start=\\\"2985\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Etihad Towers<br data-end=\\\"3006\\\" data-start=\\\"3003\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Corniche Drive<br data-end=\\\"3025\\\" data-start=\\\"3022\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Presidential Palace (Outside view)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3207\\\" data-start=\\\"3065\\\">\\ud83d\\udc2c <strong data-end=\\\"3090\\\" data-start=\\\"3068\\\">SeaWorld Abu Dhabi<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3093\\\" data-start=\\\"3090\\\" \\/>\\nExperience the region\\u2019s largest marine life theme park with immersive rides, shows, habitats &amp; ocean-themed zones.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3332\\\" data-start=\\\"3209\\\">\\ud83d\\udd4c <strong data-end=\\\"3233\\\" data-start=\\\"3212\\\">BAPS Hindu Mandir<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3236\\\" data-start=\\\"3233\\\" \\/>\\nVisit the stunning traditional stone temple \\u2014 a serene landmark showcasing Indian craftsmanship.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3367\\\" data-start=\\\"3334\\\">Return to Dubai in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3418\\\" data-start=\\\"3369\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3392\\\" data-start=\\\"3369\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"3395\\\" data-start=\\\"3392\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3418\\\" data-start=\\\"3395\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Dubai<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Dubai\",\"date\":\"22-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3652\\\" data-start=\\\"3478\\\">Enjoy your breakfast, check out from your hotel, and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"3573\\\" data-start=\\\"3542\\\">Dubai International Airport<\\/strong> for your return flight.<br data-end=\\\"3600\\\" data-start=\\\"3597\\\" \\/>\\nYour Dubai holiday ends with unforgettable memories.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3677\\\" data-start=\\\"3654\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3677\\\" data-start=\\\"3654\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/01\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Howard Johnson by Wyndham Bur Dubai\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"rate\":\"95000\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":6,\"check_out\":\"22\\/01\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>🏨 <strong>06 Nights</strong> Stay at <em><strong>Hotel Howard Johnson by Wyndham Bur Dubai</strong></em></li>\n	<li>🏨&nbsp;<em><strong>02 Rooms on Double Occupancy in Standard Double Room.</strong></em></li>\n	<li>🚐 Two-way <strong>Airport Transfers &nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>🌆 <strong>Half-Day Dubai City Tour </strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🏙️ Burj Khalifa – <strong>124th &amp; 125th Floor <em>(For 03 Pax)</em></strong></li>\n	<li>🏜️ <strong>Premium Desert Safari </strong>with BBQ Dinner &amp; Entertainment &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>⛴️ <b>01 Hr Private Yacht</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🏛️&nbsp;🌸 <strong>Miracle Garden </strong>&amp; <strong>Global Village </strong>Visit &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🕌 <strong>Abu Dhabi City Tour</strong></li>\n	<li>🕌 <strong>Sea&nbsp;World &amp; BAPS Hindu Mandir</strong></li>\n	<li>All <b>Tours &amp; Transfers on&nbsp;</b><strong>Private </strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Dubai Tourist Visa</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All Taxes</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong><em>Tourism Dhiram Fee (to be paid directly at the Hotel).</em></strong></li>\n	<li><strong><em>3.5 Years CHILD Entry Fees to all sightseeing can be directly paid over the counter if applicable.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>Any personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"176\">\n	<li data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"176\">\n	<p data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"178\"><strong data-end=\"201\" data-start=\"178\">50% Advance Payment</strong>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"225\" data-start=\"205\">29 November 2025</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"228\">\n	<p data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"230\"><strong data-end=\"253\" data-start=\"230\">Balance 50% Payment</strong>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"276\" data-start=\"257\">08 January 2026</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"313\">\n	<li data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"313\">\n	<p data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"315\"><strong data-end=\"322\" data-start=\"315\">10%</strong>&nbsp;deduction if cancelled&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"365\" data-start=\"346\">15 days or more</strong>&nbsp;prior to the tour</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"386\">\n	<p data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"388\"><strong data-end=\"395\" data-start=\"388\">50%</strong>&nbsp;deduction if cancelled&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"419\">7–15 days</strong>&nbsp;prior to the tour</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"453\">\n	<p data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"455\"><strong data-end=\"463\" data-start=\"455\">100%</strong>&nbsp;deduction if cancelled&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"487\">within 7 days</strong>&nbsp;of the tour</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":95000,\"land_cost\":\"116844\",\"visa_cost\":\"30000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":241844,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24184.4\",\"selling_price\":266028.400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0751/0112025', 265000, 66250, 42020, '2025-11-10 11:09:40', '2025-12-03 06:05:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(766, 'Mr Shakti', 'Amit Rupesh Friend', '9879900555', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE', '2026-02-25', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Singapore + Night Safari Adventure\",\"date\":\"25-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"606\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">Singapore Changi International Airport<\\/strong>, where you\\u2019ll be greeted by our representative and transferred to your hotel. Check in and unwind after your flight.<br data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, embark on the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"781\\\" data-start=\\\"765\\\">Night Safari<\\/strong>, the world\\u2019s first nocturnal wildlife park. Enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"849\\\" data-start=\\\"836\\\">Tram Ride<\\/strong> through various animal habitats, followed by the <strong data-end=\\\"914\\\" data-start=\\\"899\\\">Animal Show<\\/strong>, offering an up-close view of fascinating nocturnal creatures.<br data-end=\\\"980\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"993\\\" data-start=\\\"980\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"1021\\\" data-start=\\\"1018\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1040\\\" data-start=\\\"1021\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Private Airport Transfer, Night Safari (Tram Ride + Animal Show)<br data-end=\\\"1108\\\" data-start=\\\"1105\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1130\\\" data-start=\\\"1108\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"City Tour + Gardens by the Bay + Marina Bay Sands SkyPark\",\"date\":\"26-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1295\\\" data-start=\\\"1273\\\">Merlion City Drive<\\/strong>, covering Singapore\\u2019s iconic landmarks:<br data-end=\\\"1338\\\" data-start=\\\"1335\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1572\\\" data-start=\\\"1338\\\">Arts Museum, CBD area, Chinatown, Civic District, Civilian War Memorial, Dhoby Ghaut, Esplanade Theatre by the Bay, Helix Bridge, Istana (Orchard), Marina Floating Bay, Plaza Singapura, Raffles Hotel, Suntec City, Swiss\\u00f4tel Stamford<\\/em>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1607\\\" data-start=\\\"1578\\\">Merlion Park (Photo Stop)<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1611\\\" data-start=\\\"1608\\\" \\/>\\nContinue to <strong data-end=\\\"1645\\\" data-start=\\\"1623\\\">Gardens by the Bay<\\/strong>, a nature park with futuristic conservatories \\u2014 <strong data-end=\\\"1710\\\" data-start=\\\"1694\\\">Cloud Forest<\\/strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\\\"1728\\\" data-start=\\\"1713\\\">Flower Dome<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1732\\\" data-start=\\\"1729\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the <strong data-end=\\\"1777\\\" data-start=\\\"1749\\\">Marina Bay Sands SkyPark<\\/strong>, offering panoramic skyline views.<br data-end=\\\"1815\\\" data-start=\\\"1812\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1828\\\" data-start=\\\"1815\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1841\\\" data-start=\\\"1838\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1860\\\" data-start=\\\"1841\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> City Tour (as listed), Gardens by the Bay (2 Conservatories), Marina Bay Sands SkyPark<br data-end=\\\"1950\\\" data-start=\\\"1947\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1972\\\" data-start=\\\"1950\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Sentosa Island Experience\",\"date\":\"27-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2112\\\" data-start=\\\"2094\\\">Sentosa Island<\\/strong> for a full day of fun and adventure. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"2175\\\" data-start=\\\"2156\\\">S.E.A. Aquarium<\\/strong>, home to over 100,000 marine animals, take a scenic ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"2253\\\" data-start=\\\"2240\\\">Cable Car<\\/strong>, and witness the dazzling <strong data-end=\\\"2297\\\" data-start=\\\"2280\\\">Wings of Time<\\/strong> evening show. Don\\u2019t miss the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"2357\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\">SkyHelix Sentosa<\\/strong> experience \\u2014 Singapore\\u2019s highest open-air panoramic ride.<br data-end=\\\"2418\\\" data-start=\\\"2415\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2431\\\" data-start=\\\"2418\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2444\\\" data-start=\\\"2441\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2463\\\" data-start=\\\"2444\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Full Day Sentosa Tour (S.E.A. Aquarium + Cable Car + Wings of Time + SkyHelix)<br data-end=\\\"2545\\\" data-start=\\\"2542\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2567\\\" data-start=\\\"2545\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore\",\"date\":\"28-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day visit to <strong data-end=\\\"2727\\\" data-start=\\\"2696\\\">Universal Studios Singapore<\\/strong>, Southeast Asia\\u2019s only Universal theme park. Explore seven themed zones, enjoy thrilling rides like <em data-end=\\\"2850\\\" data-start=\\\"2828\\\">Battlestar Galactica<\\/em>, <em data-end=\\\"2866\\\" data-start=\\\"2852\\\">Transformers<\\/em>, <em data-end=\\\"2890\\\" data-start=\\\"2868\\\">Revenge of the Mummy<\\/em>, and watch spectacular live shows.<br data-end=\\\"2928\\\" data-start=\\\"2925\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2941\\\" data-start=\\\"2928\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2954\\\" data-start=\\\"2951\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2973\\\" data-start=\\\"2954\\\">\\ud83c\\udf9f\\ufe0f Inclusions:<\\/strong> Full Day Universal Studios (Non-Peak Entry Ticket)<br data-end=\\\"3027\\\" data-start=\\\"3024\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"3027\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Singapore<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore \\u2192 Kuala Lumpur \\u2013 Kuala Lumpur Night Tour + KL Tower Observation Deck\",\"date\":\"01-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Kuala Lumpur by private coach.<br data-end=\\\"2669\\\" data-start=\\\"2666\\\" \\/>\\nOn arrival, check into your hotel and relax. In the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"2767\\\" data-start=\\\"2740\\\">Kuala Lumpur Night Tour<\\/strong> including a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"2818\\\" data-start=\\\"2789\\\">KL Tower Observation Deck<\\/strong> for panoramic views, and a photo stop at the glittering <strong data-end=\\\"2899\\\" data-start=\\\"2875\\\">Petronas Twin Towers<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2903\\\" data-start=\\\"2900\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2941\\\" data-start=\\\"2928\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2916\\\" data-start=\\\"2906\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast&nbsp;<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"3027\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2943\\\" data-start=\\\"2929\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Kuala Lumpur<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Genting Highlands Day Trip + Batu Caves + Cable Car Ride\",\"date\":\"02-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3431\\\" data-start=\\\"3040\\\">After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3087\\\" data-start=\\\"3066\\\">Genting Highlands<\\/strong>, en route visiting the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"3139\\\" data-start=\\\"3118\\\">Batu Caves Temple<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"3143\\\" data-start=\\\"3140\\\" \\/>\\nContinue the journey via <strong data-end=\\\"3194\\\" data-start=\\\"3168\\\">two-way Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> to the mountaintop resort filled with entertainment, casinos, shopping, and dining. Return to Kuala Lumpur by evening.<br data-end=\\\"3316\\\" data-start=\\\"3313\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3373\\\" data-start=\\\"3316\\\">(Note: SkyWorld Outdoor Theme Park closed on Tuesdays.)<\\/em><br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2941\\\" data-start=\\\"2928\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2916\\\" data-start=\\\"2906\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast&nbsp;<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"3027\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2943\\\" data-start=\\\"2929\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Kuala Lumpur<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Kuala Lumpur\",\"date\":\"03-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy your final breakfast at the hotel. Depending on flight schedule, free time for shopping or local exploration before being transferred to the airport for your onward journey.<br data-end=\\\"3666\\\" data-start=\\\"3663\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf73 <strong data-end=\\\"3679\\\" data-start=\\\"3669\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1021\",\"dep_date\":\"25 Feb 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Feb 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"01:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:15 AM\",\"fare\":33717},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airlines\",\"fno\":\"194\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:35 PM\",\"fare\":59598}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"25\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SINGAPORE\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel One Farrer\",\"room_type\":\"Mint Den With Sofa Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"01\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"72200\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KUALALUMPUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royale Chulan\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room + Extra Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"11900\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul data-end=\"1126\" data-start=\"293\">\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-<em><strong>Mumbai.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>All Airport Transfers&nbsp;- PVT</strong><b>&nbsp;Basis.</b></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel One Farrer</strong>, Singapore.</li>\n	<li><strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation in&nbsp;<strong>Hotel Royale Chulan,&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;Kualalumpur.</li>\n	<li>All&nbsp;<strong>Breakfasts.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Singapore Guided City Tour&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Universal Studios&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><b>Night Safari&nbsp;</b>(Complimentary Animal Show + Tram Ride)</li>\n	<li><strong>Gardens by the Bay -&nbsp;Flower Dome</strong>&nbsp;(Including Impressions of Monet: The Experience) +&nbsp;<strong>Cloud Forest&nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Sentosa Island -&nbsp;</strong>Cable Car + WOT + S.E.A Aquarium + Sky Helix&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>Marina Bay Sands</strong>&nbsp;SkyPark Observation Deck</li>\n	<li><strong>Kuala Lumpur Night Tour</strong>&nbsp;with KL Tower Observation Deck.</li>\n	<li><strong>Full-Day Genting Tour&nbsp;</strong>with En-Route Batucaves + Two-Way Cable Car.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>01 Coach Ticket Singapore- Kualalumpur.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>Malaysia &amp; Singapore Visa</strong>.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":93315,\"land_cost\":\"82000\",\"hotel_cost\":84100,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"12000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"KUL LAND\",\"amount\":24570}],\"cost_price\":295985,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 41437.9\",\"selling_price\":337422.900000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0752/0112025', 335940, 111980, 0, '2025-11-11 11:49:34', '2026-01-19 14:27:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
