greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop-off.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by a Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;on all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":30008,\"land_cost\":\"74235\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":104243,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15636.45\",\"selling_price\":119879.449999999997089616954326629638671875}', 'MZQ/0760/0112025', 119680, 59840, 12480, '2025-11-22 05:56:58', '2025-11-22 05:56:58', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(775, 'Mr. Ashish Sahu', 'Argora', '7004498123', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-12-19', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket \\u2192 Transfer to Krabi\",\"date\":\"19-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"747\\\" data-start=\\\"435\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"483\\\" data-start=\\\"445\\\">Phuket International Airport (HKT)<\\/strong>, complete immigration, and meet your driver.<br data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"587\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\">private transfer from Phuket to Krabi<\\/strong>, passing coastal roads, cliffs, and lush greenery.<br data-end=\\\"641\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\" \\/>\\nCheck in to your Krabi hotel and spend the rest of the day relaxing on your own.<br data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-start=\\\"721\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"747\\\" data-start=\\\"724\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Krabi<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour by Long Tail Boat (With Lunch)\",\"date\":\"20-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"824\\\">After breakfast, get ready for Krabi\\u2019s most iconic island-hopping experience.<br data-end=\\\"904\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\" \\/>\\nJoin the <strong data-end=\\\"936\\\" data-start=\\\"913\\\">4 Island Tour (SIC)<\\/strong> and explore:<br data-end=\\\"952\\\" data-start=\\\"949\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"978\\\" data-start=\\\"954\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"981\\\" data-start=\\\"978\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1001\\\" data-start=\\\"983\\\">Chicken Island<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1004\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1020\\\" data-start=\\\"1006\\\">Tup Island<\\/strong> (Famous sandbank walk)<br data-end=\\\"1046\\\" data-start=\\\"1043\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1063\\\" data-start=\\\"1048\\\">Poda Island<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1239\\\" data-start=\\\"1067\\\">Enjoy swimming, snorkeling, relaxing on pristine beaches, and lunch on the island.<br data-end=\\\"1152\\\" data-start=\\\"1149\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to your hotel by evening.<br data-end=\\\"1187\\\" data-start=\\\"1184\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1239\\\" data-start=\\\"1187\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast, Lunch \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Krabi<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Transfer from Krabi to Phuket (PVT)\",\"date\":\"21-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast and some leisure time.<br data-end=\\\"1342\\\" data-start=\\\"1339\\\" \\/>\\nLater, check out and enjoy a comfortable <strong data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-start=\\\"1383\\\">private transfer to Phuket<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1417\\\" data-start=\\\"1414\\\" \\/>\\nCheck in to your Phuket hotel and relax for the rest of the day \\u2014 explore Patong Beach or enjoy the nightlife at your own pace.<br data-end=\\\"1547\\\" data-start=\\\"1544\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1593\\\" data-start=\\\"1547\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Speedboat with Sea Canoe (SIC)\",\"date\":\"22-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1931\\\" data-start=\\\"1676\\\">After breakfast, join the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1741\\\" data-start=\\\"1709\\\">James Bond Island Tour (SIC)<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1745\\\" data-start=\\\"1742\\\" \\/>\\nThe tour covers:<br data-end=\\\"1764\\\" data-start=\\\"1761\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Phang Nga Bay<br data-end=\\\"1782\\\" data-start=\\\"1779\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 James Bond Island (Khao Phing Kan)<br data-end=\\\"1821\\\" data-start=\\\"1818\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Sea Canoeing through caves &amp; limestone formations<br data-end=\\\"1875\\\" data-start=\\\"1872\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Koh Panyee Village<br data-end=\\\"1898\\\" data-start=\\\"1895\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Lagoon &amp; Mangrove exploration<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2014\\\" data-start=\\\"1933\\\">Return to your hotel by evening.<br data-end=\\\"1968\\\" data-start=\\\"1965\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2014\\\" data-start=\\\"1968\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi + Khai Island Tour by Speedboat (SIC)\",\"date\":\"23-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2352\\\" data-start=\\\"2088\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"2166\\\" data-start=\\\"2129\\\">Phi Phi Island + Khai Island Tour<\\/strong> (National Park Fee extra).<br data-end=\\\"2196\\\" data-start=\\\"2193\\\" \\/>\\nTour Highlights:<br data-end=\\\"2215\\\" data-start=\\\"2212\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Phi Phi Don<br data-end=\\\"2231\\\" data-start=\\\"2228\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Phi Phi Leh<br data-end=\\\"2247\\\" data-start=\\\"2244\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Maya Bay (Viewpoint \\u2013 subject to regulation)<br data-end=\\\"2296\\\" data-start=\\\"2293\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Monkey Beach<br data-end=\\\"2313\\\" data-start=\\\"2310\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Khai Island \\u2014 snorkeling &amp; swimming<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2354\\\">Return to Phuket in the late afternoon.<br data-end=\\\"2396\\\" data-start=\\\"2393\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2396\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2192 Bangkok\",\"date\":\"24-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2710\\\" data-start=\\\"2538\\\">Check out early and take your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2589\\\" data-start=\\\"2578\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>&nbsp;<br data-end=\\\"2616\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"2647\\\" data-start=\\\"2632\\\">DMK Airport<\\/strong>, your driver will greet you and transfer you to Bangkok Hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2939\\\" data-start=\\\"2712\\\"><br data-end=\\\"2971\\\" data-start=\\\"2968\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3025\\\" data-start=\\\"2971\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast, Lunch \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park\",\"date\":\"25-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3257\\\" data-start=\\\"3124\\\">Enjoy a lavish&nbsp;breakfast.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2939\\\" data-start=\\\"2712\\\">Later, head for <strong data-end=\\\"2764\\\" data-start=\\\"2728\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park&nbsp;<\\/strong>\\u2014 Thailand\\u2019s most popular wildlife attraction.<br data-end=\\\"2814\\\" data-start=\\\"2811\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy:<br data-end=\\\"2823\\\" data-start=\\\"2820\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Safari Drive<br data-end=\\\"2840\\\" data-start=\\\"2837\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Dolphin Show<br data-end=\\\"2857\\\" data-start=\\\"2854\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Bird Show<br data-end=\\\"2871\\\" data-start=\\\"2868\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Spy War &amp; Action Stunts<br data-end=\\\"2899\\\" data-start=\\\"2896\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Marine Park Animals<br data-end=\\\"2923\\\" data-start=\\\"2920\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Lunch Buffet<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3025\\\" data-start=\\\"2941\\\">Return to hotel by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3559\\\" data-start=\\\"3474\\\">Private transfers included.<br data-end=\\\"3504\\\" data-start=\\\"3501\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3559\\\" data-start=\\\"3504\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast, Dinner \\u2022 \\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight: Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chaophraya Princess Dinner Cruise + Departure from Bangkok\",\"date\":\"26-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel &amp; move for Shopping<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"3322\\\" data-start=\\\"3285\\\">Chaophraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> with Indian buffet.<br data-end=\\\"3345\\\" data-start=\\\"3342\\\" \\/>\\nSail along the Chao Phraya River with live music and stunning views of:<br data-end=\\\"3419\\\" data-start=\\\"3416\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Wat Arun<br data-end=\\\"3432\\\" data-start=\\\"3429\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Grand Palace<br data-end=\\\"3449\\\" data-start=\\\"3446\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Riverside landmarks<br data-end=\\\"3653\\\" data-start=\\\"3650\\\" \\/>\\nYou will be driven to <strong data-end=\\\"3699\\\" data-start=\\\"3675\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight.<br data-end=\\\"3726\\\" data-start=\\\"3723\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3749\\\" data-start=\\\"3726\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7251\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:20 PM\",\"fare\":\"10292\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1087\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"29911\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"341\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"fare\":\"9202\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1058\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"05:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"31661\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Citrus Patong by compass hospitality\",\"city\":\"Phuket\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"22\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"22817\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"22\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Krabi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel AVA Sea Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"20607\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Bangkok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Benja Hotel Sukhumvit 5\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room with Bathtub\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"11700\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️ Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Kolkata &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n<br />\n🛏️ 03 Nights – <em><strong>Hotel&nbsp;Sunset Beach Resort, Phuket </strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🛏️ 02 Nights – <em><strong>Hotel&nbsp;AVA Sea Resort, Krabi &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🛏️ 02 Nights – <em><strong>Hotel&nbsp;Royal Benja Hotel Sukhumvit 5, Bangkok &nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>🚤 <em><strong>Tours &amp; Activities: &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🌴<em><strong> James Bond Island </strong></em>Tour by Speedboat <em>(Excludes National Park Fee) </em>with Sea Canoe – SIC &nbsp;<br />\n🏝️<em><strong> Phi Phi + Khai Island </strong></em>Tour by Speedboat <em>(Excludes National Park Fee)</em> – SIC &nbsp;<br />\n🏖️<em><strong> Krabi 4 Islands </strong></em>Tour with Lunch by Long Tail Boat <em>(Excludes National Park Fee) </em>– SIC &nbsp;<br />\n🦁<em><strong> Safari World + Marine</strong></em> Park with Lunch – SIC &nbsp;<br />\n🍽️ <em><strong>Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise</strong></em> (Indian Buffet) –&nbsp;SIC</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <em><strong>Private Transfers: </strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🔹 Phuket (HKT) Airport ➝ Phuket Hotel &nbsp;<br />\n🔹 Phuket Hotel ➝&nbsp;Krabi Hotel &nbsp;<br />\n🔹 Krabi Hotel➝ Krabi (KBV) Airport &nbsp;<br />\n🔹 Suvarnabhumi Airport ➝ Bangkok Hotel &nbsp;<br />\n🔹 Bangkok Hotel ➝&nbsp;DMK Airport</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"26\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":81066,\"land_cost\":\"43600\",\"hotel_cost\":55124,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":179790,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 46745.4\",\"selling_price\":226535.39999999999417923390865325927734375,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0761/0112025', 225000, 112500, 0, '2025-11-25 08:26:10', '2025-12-17 14:58:31', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(776, 'Mr. Shiva Nand Gupta', 'Maa Niwas', '9431170208', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Kerala', '2026-01-15', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Cochin\",\"date\":\"15-01-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Cochin Airport\\/Railway Station where you will be welcomed and transferred to your hotel. After check-in, enjoy the rest of the day at leisure\\u2014explore Marine Drive, Lulu Mall or nearby markets.<br data-end=\\\"758\\\" data-start=\\\"755\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"768\\\" data-start=\\\"758\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<br data-end=\\\"776\\\" data-start=\\\"773\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"805\\\" data-start=\\\"776\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Cochin<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin \\u2192 Munnar\",\"date\":\"16-01-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Enjoy breakfast at the hotel and check out for a scenic drive to Munnar. En route, stop at the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"1001\\\" data-start=\\\"966\\\">Cheeyappara &amp; Valara Waterfalls<\\/strong> and lush green valleys. On arrival, check in to your Munnar hotel and relax for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1097\\\" data-start=\\\"1094\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1107\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<br data-end=\\\"1129\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1158\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Munnar<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"17-01-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1458\\\" data-start=\\\"1218\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day Munnar sightseeing tour including:<br data-end=\\\"1295\\\" data-start=\\\"1292\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1337\\\" data-start=\\\"1297\\\">Eravikulam National Park (Rajamalai)<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1340\\\" data-start=\\\"1337\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1373\\\" data-start=\\\"1342\\\">Tea Museum &amp; Tea Plantation<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1376\\\" data-start=\\\"1373\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1378\\\">Mattupetty Dam<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1399\\\" data-start=\\\"1396\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1415\\\" data-start=\\\"1401\\\">Echo Point<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1418\\\" data-start=\\\"1415\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1436\\\" data-start=\\\"1420\\\">Kundala Lake<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1439\\\" data-start=\\\"1436\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"1456\\\" data-start=\\\"1441\\\">Photo Point<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1564\\\" data-start=\\\"1460\\\">Return to hotel in the evening to relax.<br data-end=\\\"1503\\\" data-start=\\\"1500\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-start=\\\"1503\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<br data-end=\\\"1535\\\" data-start=\\\"1532\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1564\\\" data-start=\\\"1535\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Munnar<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar \\u2192 Alleppey\",\"date\":\"18-01-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, check out and drive to the beautiful backwaters of Alleppey. Check in to your houseboat\\/resort and enjoy cruising through serene canals, paddy fields, and village life. A peaceful and charming Kerala experience awaits you.<br data-end=\\\"1864\\\" data-start=\\\"1861\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1874\\\" data-start=\\\"1864\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner (Houseboat: Lunch also included)<br data-end=\\\"1929\\\" data-start=\\\"1926\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1960\\\" data-start=\\\"1929\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Alleppey<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey \\u2192 Kovalam\",\"date\":\"19-01-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive to Kovalam, famous for its pristine beaches. Check in to your hotel and enjoy the evening at leisure on <strong data-end=\\\"2181\\\" data-start=\\\"2161\\\">Lighthouse Beach<\\/strong> or <strong data-end=\\\"2202\\\" data-start=\\\"2185\\\">Kovalam Beach<\\/strong>, followed by a relaxing dinner at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2250\\\" data-start=\\\"2247\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2260\\\" data-start=\\\"2250\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<br data-end=\\\"2282\\\" data-start=\\\"2279\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2312\\\" data-start=\\\"2282\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Kovalam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"20-01-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2564\\\" data-start=\\\"2379\\\">After breakfast, explore Kovalam\\u2019s nearby attractions including:<br data-end=\\\"2446\\\" data-start=\\\"2443\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"2477\\\" data-start=\\\"2448\\\">Vizhinjam Marine Aquarium<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2480\\\" data-start=\\\"2477\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"2506\\\" data-start=\\\"2482\\\">Rock Cut Cave Temple<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2509\\\" data-start=\\\"2506\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"2543\\\" data-start=\\\"2511\\\">Kovalam Lighthouse Viewpoint<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2546\\\" data-start=\\\"2543\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 <strong data-end=\\\"2562\\\" data-start=\\\"2548\\\">Hawa Beach<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2721\\\" data-start=\\\"2566\\\">Spend your evening enjoying the sunset or opt for an Ayurvedic massage session (optional).<br data-end=\\\"2659\\\" data-start=\\\"2656\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2669\\\" data-start=\\\"2659\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<br data-end=\\\"2691\\\" data-start=\\\"2688\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2721\\\" data-start=\\\"2691\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay: Kovalam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\