end=\"699\" data-start=\"681\">01 Local Lunch</strong> during Nusa Penida tour</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"726\">\n	<p data-end=\"776\" data-start=\"728\">Complimentary <strong data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"742\">Fresh Coconut Drink</strong> on arrival</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"781\" data-start=\"778\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"783\"><strong data-end=\"813\" data-start=\"787\">🎟️ Tours &amp; Activities</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"814\">\n	<li data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"814\">\n	<p data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"816\">All tours, excursions, and sightseeing <strong data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"855\">as per the itinerary</strong></p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"880\">\n	<p data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"882\">Entrance tickets to all mentioned attractions</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"928\">\n	<p data-end=\"951\" data-start=\"930\">Parking fees included</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"953\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"958\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"962\">🎁 Special Arrangements</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"990\">\n	<li data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"990\">\n	<p data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"992\"><strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"992\">Welcome Flower Garland</strong> on arrival</p>\n	</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1032\">\n	<p data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1034\"><strong data-end=\"1080\" data-start=\"1034\">1 Bottle (600 ml) Mineral Water per person</strong> during tours</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1100\" data-start=\"1097\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1102\"><strong data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"1106\">🧾 Taxes</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1119\">\n	<li data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1119\">\n	<p data-end=\"1167\" data-start=\"1121\">All applicable <strong data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1136\">Government Taxes</strong> included</p>\n	</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"34\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59800,\"land_cost\":\"46000\",\"hotel_cost\":51600,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":157400,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 53516\",\"selling_price\":210916}', 'MZQ/0765/0112025', 211300, 105650, 0, '2025-11-29 08:04:52', '2025-12-04 12:54:21', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(780, 'Mr Premjeet Kumar', 'Prince Motors', '6287049999', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KASHMIR 4*', '2025-12-11', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar Airport \\u2192 Srinagar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"11-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at Srinagar Airport, you will be welcomed by our representative who will assist you and transfer you to your hotel. After freshening up, proceed for local sightseeing of Srinagar, visiting the famous Mughal Gardens \\u2013 <strong data-end=\\\"701\\\" data-start=\\\"653\\\">Nishat Bagh, Shalimar Bagh, and Cheshmashahi<\\/strong> (union vehicle required for the last 1 km). Later visit <strong data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"758\\\">Pari Mahal<\\/strong> and the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"813\\\" data-start=\\\"788\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>, offering panoramic views of the city.<br data-end=\\\"855\\\" data-start=\\\"852\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"892\\\" data-start=\\\"855\\\">Dinner &amp; Overnight Stay: Srinagar<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2192 Sonmarg Excursion \\u2192 Back to Srinagar\",\"date\":\"12-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1045\\\" data-start=\\\"1034\\\">Sonmarg<\\/strong>, one of the most scenic places in Kashmir, known as the \\u201cMeadow of Gold.\\u201d The 85 km drive (approx. 2\\u20132.5 hours) offers beautiful views of snow-capped mountains and the Sindh River.<br data-end=\\\"1229\\\" data-start=\\\"1226\\\" \\/>\\nYou may enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"1260\\\" data-start=\\\"1243\\\">river rafting<\\/strong> (own cost) and take a <strong data-end=\\\"1316\\\" data-start=\\\"1283\\\">pony ride to Thajiwas Glacier<\\/strong> (own cost). A visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1354\\\" data-start=\\\"1340\\\">Zero Point<\\/strong> requires a union vehicle (own cost). Return to Srinagar in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1429\\\" data-start=\\\"1426\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1466\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Breakfast + Dinner &amp; Overnight Stay: Srinagar<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2192 Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"13-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1895\\\" data-start=\\\"1552\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1591\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong>, the \\u201cMeadow of Flowers,\\u201d located at an altitude of 2730m (approx. 2 hours drive). Gulmarg is famous for its ski slopes and the world\\u2019s highest 18-hole golf course.<br data-end=\\\"1759\\\" data-start=\\\"1756\\\" \\/>\\nVisit <strong data-end=\\\"1796\\\" data-start=\\\"1765\\\">Kashmir Handicraft Emporium<\\/strong> for shopping. Enjoy the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1860\\\" data-start=\\\"1834\\\">Gondola Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> (own cost), the highest in Asia:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1975\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1932\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1932\\\" data-start=\\\"1898\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1910\\\" data-start=\\\"1898\\\">Phase 1:<\\/strong> Gulmarg \\u2192 Kongdoori<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1975\\\" data-start=\\\"1933\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"1975\\\" data-start=\\\"1935\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1947\\\" data-start=\\\"1935\\\">Phase 2:<\\/strong> Kongdoori \\u2192 Apharwat Peak<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2168\\\" data-start=\\\"1977\\\">If weather permits, enjoy a spectacular view of the mighty <strong data-end=\\\"2052\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\">Nanga Parbat<\\/strong>. You may also visit <strong data-end=\\\"2092\\\" data-start=\\\"2073\\\">Drung Waterfall<\\/strong> (union vehicle required \\u2013 own cost).<br data-end=\\\"2132\\\" data-start=\\\"2129\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1466\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Breakfast + Dinner &amp; Overnight Stay:<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2168\\\" data-start=\\\"2132\\\"> Gulmarg<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2335\\\" data-start=\\\"2170\\\">\\ud83d\\udd14 <em data-end=\\\"2335\\\" data-start=\\\"2173\\\">Note: During heavy snowfall, outside vehicles may not be allowed to proceed to Gulmarg. Guests must hire a chain-block taxi from Tangmarg to Gulmarg (own cost).<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg \\u2192 Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"14-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2420\\\" data-start=\\\"2377\\\">Gulmarg \\u2192 Pahalgam (Night Stay: Pahalgam)**<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2697\\\" data-start=\\\"2422\\\">After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"2460\\\" data-start=\\\"2448\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong>, the \\u201cValley of Shepherds\\u201d (140 km \\/ approx. 3\\u20133.5 hours). En route visit:<br data-end=\\\"2538\\\" data-start=\\\"2535\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Saffron fields of Pampore<br data-end=\\\"2568\\\" data-start=\\\"2565\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Awantipora Ruins (1100-year-old Vishnu Temple)<br data-end=\\\"2619\\\" data-start=\\\"2616\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 National Highway Bat Market<br data-end=\\\"2651\\\" data-start=\\\"2648\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Mattan Temple<br data-end=\\\"2669\\\" data-start=\\\"2666\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Apple Gardens (seasonal)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3028\\\" data-start=\\\"2699\\\">On arrival, enjoy the natural beauty of the <strong data-end=\\\"2759\\\" data-start=\\\"2743\\\">Lidder River<\\/strong> and pine forests. You may enjoy pony rides (own cost) to <strong data-end=\\\"2869\\\" data-start=\\\"2817\\\">Baisaran Valley, Kashmir Valley or Dubian Valley<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2873\\\" data-start=\\\"2870\\\" \\/>\\nFor <strong data-end=\\\"2920\\\" data-start=\\\"2877\\\">Chandanwari, Betaab Valley &amp; Aru Valley<\\/strong>, a union vehicle is required (own cost; 1-hour halt at each point).<br data-end=\\\"2991\\\" data-start=\\\"2988\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1466\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Breakfast + Dinner &amp; Overnight Stay:<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"3028\\\" data-start=\\\"2991\\\"> Pahalgam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam \\u2192 Srinagar + Shikara Ride\",\"date\":\"15-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, return back to Srinagar. Later, enjoy a relaxing <strong data-end=\\\"3232\\\" data-start=\\\"3197\\\">1-hour Shikara Ride on Dal Lake<\\/strong> (included), admiring the floating gardens and tranquil waters of Kashmir.<br data-end=\\\"3309\\\" data-start=\\\"3306\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1466\\\" data-start=\\\"1429\\\">Breakfast + Dinner &amp; Overnight Stay:<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"3346\\\" data-start=\\\"3309\\\"> Srinagar<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport Drop\",\"date\":\"16-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Srinagar Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"3527\\\" data-start=\\\"3524\\\" \\/>\\n<em><strong>Your tour concludes with beautiful memories of Kashmir\\u2019s natural charm and hospitality.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7014\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"08:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:40 AM\",\"fare\":26364},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6961\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6266\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"25040\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Ahmedabad (AMD)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6493\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"03:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:50 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"11\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Meerz \\/ Snowland \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"13\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gulmarg\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"check_out\":\"14\\/12\\/2025\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hilltop \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"14\\/12\\/2025\",\"check_out\":\"15\\/12\\/2025\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"city\":\"Pahalgam\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Hilton \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"15\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Meerz \\/ Snowland \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/12\\/2025\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>✅ Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Ranchi </strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 02 Nights at <em><strong>Hotel Meerz / Snowland / Similar – Srinagar </strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at<em><strong> Hotel Hilltop / Similar – Gulmarg </strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at <em><strong>Hotel Royal Hilton / Similar – Pahalgam</strong></em> &nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at<em><strong> Hotel Meerz / Snowland / Similar – Srinagar &nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>🍽 Meal Plan: <em><strong>MAP (Breakfast &amp; Dinner)</strong></em> &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>🍽Accommodation on <em><strong>01 Double Room Basis</strong></em><br />\n🚗 Private Transfers: <em><strong>Innova/Similar for full itinerary &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🛶<em><strong> 01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal Lake &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🧰 Medical Kit in Taxi &nbsp;<br />\n👨‍✈️ Driver Charges, Toll, Parking Included &nbsp;<br />\n🤝 Meet &amp; Assist on Arrival/Departure &nbsp;<br />\n🛬 Srinagar Airport Pickup &amp; Drop &nbsp;<br />\n✅ All <em><strong>Applicable Taxes</strong></em> &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"28\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":51404,\"land_cost\":\"68860\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":120264,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 33673.92\",\"selling_price\":153937.9199999999837018549442291259765625}', 'MZQ/0766/0112025', 152590, 66310, 19970, '2025-11-29 10:07:36', '2025-12-05 10:35:45', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(781, 'Mr. Shailesh', 'Dewanshu', '7070454222', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2025-12-27', 6, 0, 8, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket (Late Evening)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"545\\\" data-start=\\\"298\\\">Arrive at Phuket International Airport, complete immigration formalities, and meet your representative. Transfer to your hotel in Patong and check in. Rest of the evening is free for relaxation after your long journey.<br data-end=\\\"519\\\" data-start=\\\"516\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"545\\\" data-start=\\\"519\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi + Khai Island Tour by Speedboat\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"824\\\">After breakfast, get ready for a spectacular island-hopping day. Enjoy a full-day <strong data-end=\\\"739\\\" data-start=\\\"696\\\">Phi Phi &amp; Khai Island Tour by Speedboat<\\/strong>, including National Park Fee.<br data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"769\\\" \\/>\\nSpend the day swimming, snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, relaxing on white-sand beaches, and exploring stunning tropical landscapes.<br data-end=\\\"910\\\" data-start=\\\"907\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"945\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Lunch Included<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"948\\\" data-start=\\\"945\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-start=\\\"948\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half-Day Phuket City Tour + Tiger Park\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, proceed for your <strong data-end=\\\"1104\\\" data-start=\\\"1075\\\">Half-Day Phuket City Tour<\\/strong>, covering top highlights like:<br data-end=\\\"1138\\\" data-start=\\\"1135\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Karon Viewpoint<br data-end=\\\"1158\\\" data-start=\\\"1155\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Big Buddha<br data-end=\\\"1173\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Chalong Temple<br data-end=\\\"1192\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Phuket Old Town<br data-end=\\\"1212\\\" data-start=\\\"1209\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit <strong data-end=\\\"1246\\\" data-start=\\\"1225\\\">Tiger Park Phuket<\\/strong> for an unforgettable encounter &amp; photo experience (package as selected).<br data-end=\\\"1322\\\" data-start=\\\"1319\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to the hotel and relax.<br data-end=\\\"1355\\\" data-start=\\\"1352\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1381\\\" data-start=\\\"1355\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Checkout + James Bond Island Tour + Travel to Bangkok\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1740\\\" data-start=\\\"1464\\\">After breakfast, checkout from the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1508\\\" data-start=\\\"1505\\\" \\/>\\nProceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"1578\\\" data-start=\\\"1524\\\">James Bond Island Tour by Speedboat with Sea Canoe<\\/strong>, exploring:<br data-end=\\\"1593\\\" data-start=\\\"1590\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Phang Nga Bay<br data-end=\\\"1611\\\" data-start=\\\"1608\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 James Bond Island (Nail Rock Viewpoint)<br data-end=\\\"1655\\\" data-start=\\\"1652\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Sea Canoeing through limestone caves &amp; lagoon<br data-end=\\\"1705\\\" data-start=\\\"1702\\\" \\/>\\nAfter the tour, proceed to Hotel &amp; collect your Luggage &amp; you will be transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"1812\\\" data-start=\\\"1794\\\">Phuket Airport<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1843\\\" data-start=\\\"1832\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>Arrive and check in at your Bangkok hotel.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong data-end=\\\"945\\\" data-start=\\\"910\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Lunch Included<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong data-end=\\\"1919\\\" data-start=\\\"1892\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Morning Free + Evening Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2125\\\" data-start=\\\"2006\\\">Enjoy breakfast at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2038\\\" data-start=\\\"2035\\\" \\/>\\nThe morning is free to explore Bangkok on your own\\u2014shopping, caf\\u00e9 hopping, or Thai spa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2339\\\" data-start=\\\"2127\\\">In the evening, board the <strong data-end=\\\"2191\\\" data-start=\\\"2153\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> with a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"2226\\\" data-start=\\\"2209\\\">Indian Buffet<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2230\\\" data-start=\\\"2227\\\" \\/>\\nSail along the river, enjoy live music, night views of Wat Arun &amp; Grand Palace.<br data-end=\\\"2312\\\" data-start=\\\"2309\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2339\\\" data-start=\\\"2312\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World + Marine Park\",\"date\":\"01-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2710\\\" data-start=\\\"2538\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"2478\\\" data-start=\\\"2448\\\">Safari World + Marine Park<\\/strong> on private transfer.<br data-end=\\\"2502\\\" data-start=\\\"2499\\\" \\/>\\nExperience wildlife shows, marine performances, jungle safari drive, and a delicious buffet lunch.<br data-end=\\\"2603\\\" data-start=\\\"2600\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2624\\\" data-start=\\\"2603\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Lunch Included<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2627\\\" data-start=\\\"2624\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2654\\\" data-start=\\\"2627\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",