ps, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":57498,\"hotel_cost\":55000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"8000\",\"land_cost\":\"64155\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":184653,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 29544.48\",\"selling_price\":214197.48000000001047737896442413330078125}', 'MZQ/0768/0122025', 214900, 107450, 117954, '2025-12-08 08:46:30', '2025-12-08 10:47:51', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(783, 'Mr Niraj Kumar', 'Jijoo Madehpura', '9431247809', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SINGAPORE & MALAYSIA', '2026-01-14', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Singapore + Night Safari\",\"date\":\"14-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Singapore Changi Airport, meet your representative, and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<br data-end=\\\"341\\\" data-start=\\\"338\\\" \\/>\\nAfter some rest, get ready for an exciting evening at the <strong data-end=\\\"415\\\" data-start=\\\"399\\\">Night Safari<\\/strong>, the world\\u2019s first nocturnal wildlife park.<br data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"459\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"485\\\" data-start=\\\"472\\\">Tram Ride<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"487\\\">Creatures of the Night Show<\\/strong>, and explore the walking trails to see animals in their natural nighttime habitat.<br data-end=\\\"604\\\" data-start=\\\"601\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"604\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Singapore<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore City Tour + Half Day Sentosa Island Tour\",\"date\":\"15-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"759\\\" data-start=\\\"727\\\">Half-Day Singapore City Tour<\\/strong> covering:<br data-end=\\\"772\\\" data-start=\\\"769\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Merlion Park<br data-end=\\\"789\\\" data-start=\\\"786\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Esplanade Theatre<br data-end=\\\"811\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Civic District<br data-end=\\\"830\\\" data-start=\\\"827\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Suntec City<br data-end=\\\"846\\\" data-start=\\\"843\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Orchard Road<br data-end=\\\"863\\\" data-start=\\\"860\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Marina Bay<br data-end=\\\"878\\\" data-start=\\\"875\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Little India &amp; Chinatown<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"907\\\" data-start=\\\"904\\\" \\/>\\nLater, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2016\\\" data-start=\\\"1998\\\">Sentosa Island<\\/strong> for a fun-filled day.<br data-end=\\\"2041\\\" data-start=\\\"2038\\\" \\/>\\nYour tour includes:<br data-end=\\\"2063\\\" data-start=\\\"2060\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Cable Car Ride<br data-end=\\\"2082\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 S.E.A. Aquarium (One of the world\\u2019s largest oceanariums)<br data-end=\\\"2143\\\" data-start=\\\"2140\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 SkyHelix Sentosa<br data-end=\\\"2164\\\" data-start=\\\"2161\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2714 Wings of Time Show (Evening)<br data-end=\\\"2197\\\" data-start=\\\"2194\\\" \\/>\\nSpend the rest of your time relaxing at the beach or exploring additional attractions.<br data-end=\\\"2286\\\" data-start=\\\"2283\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2315\\\" data-start=\\\"2286\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1044\\\" data-start=\\\"1041\\\" \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore + Evening Singapore River Cruise\",\"date\":\"16-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, spend a full day at <strong data-end=\\\"1208\\\" data-start=\\\"1177\\\">Universal Studios Singapore<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1212\\\" data-start=\\\"1209\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy thrilling rides, live shows, themed attractions, and the magical world of Hollywood, Sci-Fi City, Ancient Egypt, Lost World, Far Far Away, and Madagascar.<br data-end=\\\"1375\\\" data-start=\\\"1372\\\" \\/>\\nPerfect for adventure lovers and families!<br \\/>\\nIn the evening, enjoy a relaxing <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"545\\\">Singapore River Cruise<\\/strong>, offering beautiful views of the city\\u2019s illuminated skyline and iconic landmarks along the river. Return to the hotel with wonderful memories of an exciting day.<br data-end=\\\"1420\\\" data-start=\\\"1417\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1449\\\" data-start=\\\"1420\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Singapore<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Marina Bay Sands SkyPark + Gardens by the Bay (2 Domes)\",\"date\":\"17-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start your day with breakfast at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1576\\\" \\/>\\nVisit the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"1643\\\" data-start=\\\"1598\\\">Marina Bay Sands SkyPark Observation Deck<\\/strong>, offering panoramic views of Singapore\\u2019s skyline.<br data-end=\\\"1696\\\" data-start=\\\"1693\\\" \\/>\\nNext, explore <strong data-end=\\\"1732\\\" data-start=\\\"1710\\\">Gardens by the Bay<\\/strong>, including the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"1773\\\" data-start=\\\"1757\\\">Cloud Forest<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"1793\\\" data-start=\\\"1778\\\">Flower Dome<\\/strong>, featuring breathtaking indoor gardens, cool misty environments, and iconic Supertrees.<br data-end=\\\"1884\\\" data-start=\\\"1881\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1913\\\" data-start=\\\"1884\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in Singapore<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore \\u2192 Kuala Lumpur (By A\\/C Coach) + KL Night Tour with KL Tower\",\"date\":\"18-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and travel to Kuala Lumpur by A\\/C coach. On arrival, check in at your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"238\\\" data-start=\\\"235\\\" \\/>\\nIn the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"281\\\" data-start=\\\"264\\\">KL Night Tour<\\/strong>, including photo stops at the Petronas Twin Towers and Independence Square, followed by a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"414\\\" data-start=\\\"385\\\">KL Tower Observation Deck<\\/strong> for stunning night views of the city.<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2315\\\" data-start=\\\"2286\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in <\\/strong><strong>Kuala Lumpur<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Genting Highlands Tour (Via Batu Caves) + Two-Way Cable Car\",\"date\":\"19-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2534\\\" data-start=\\\"2368\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day tour to <strong data-end=\\\"658\\\" data-start=\\\"637\\\">Genting Highlands<\\/strong>. En route, stop at the famous <strong data-end=\\\"703\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">Batu Caves<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"707\\\" data-start=\\\"704\\\" \\/>\\nContinue to Genting and enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"767\\\" data-start=\\\"741\\\">Two-Way Cable Car Ride<\\/strong>, with free time to explore entertainment, shopping, and attractions at your leisure.<br \\/>\\nIn the evening, return to Kuala Lumpur and unwind with a <strong data-end=\\\"394\\\" data-start=\\\"349\\\">premium Indian dinner at Nawab Restaurant<\\/strong>, renowned for its rich flavors and elegant dining experience.<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2315\\\" data-start=\\\"2286\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight in <\\/strong><strong>Kuala Lumpur<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shopping & Departure from Kuala Lumpur\",\"date\":\"20-01-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and enjoy some last-minute shopping at your leisure. Later, proceed to Kuala Lumpur International Airport for your onward journey, carrying back beautiful memories of your Singapore &amp; Malaysia trip.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"292\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"25370\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1015\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Jan 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Jan 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",