ce the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kalapathar Beach | Havelock \\u2192 Port Blair Shopping\",\"date\":\"08-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a cruise from Havelock to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"104\\\" data-start=\\\"44\\\">Hotel pickup and visit to Kalapathar Beach, known for its black rocks and scenic shoreline. Later, check out and board a private cruise to Port Blair. Enjoy local shopping for coral artifacts and souvenirs, followed by hotel drop for an overnight stay.<\\/h3>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"501\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\">Note: Early hotel check-out is around 8:00 AM. If the ferry is in the afternoon, optional water activities at Havelock can be arranged.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be u