(787, 'Mr Vijay Kumar Upadhyay', 'Dibadih', '9263638917', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok', '2025-12-28', 3, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Transfer to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"28-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"627\\\" data-start=\\\"335\\\">On arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"391\\\" data-start=\\\"349\\\">NJP Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra Airport<\\/strong>, meet our representative and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"441\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">Gangtok<\\/strong> (approx. 4\\u20135 hours). Enjoy the picturesque journey along the Teesta River.<br data-end=\\\"519\\\" data-start=\\\"516\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival, check in to the hotel and relax. In the evening, you may explore <strong data-end=\\\"609\\\" data-start=\\\"598\\\">MG Marg<\\/strong> at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"680\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight Stay: Gangtok<br data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"656\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong data-end=\\\"680\\\" data-start=\\\"670\\\">Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir Excursion\",\"date\":\"29-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"981\\\" data-start=\\\"752\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"821\\\" data-start=\\\"797\\\">Tsomgo (Changu) Lake<\\/strong>, a stunning high-altitude lake at 12,400 ft. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"910\\\" data-start=\\\"879\\\">Baba Harbhajan Singh Mandir<\\/strong>, a sacred and historic site.<br data-end=\\\"942\\\" data-start=\\\"939\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Gangtok by evening and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1048\\\" data-start=\\\"983\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight Stay: Gangtok<br data-end=\\\"1013\\\" data-start=\\\"1010\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong data-end=\\\"1046\\\" data-start=\\\"1024\\\">Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1111\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\"><strong><em data-end=\\\"1111\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\">(Nathula Pass visit subject to permit &amp; weather conditions)<\\/em><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"30-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1472\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\">Post breakfast, enjoy a half-day local sightseeing tour covering <strong data-end=\\\"1258\\\" data-start=\\\"1238\\\">Tashi View Point<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1274\\\" data-start=\\\"1260\\\">Ganesh Tok<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1291\\\" data-start=\\\"1276\\\">Hanuman Tok<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"1293\\\">Do Drul Chorten<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1314\\\">Namgyal Institute of Tibetology<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1379\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\">Flower Exhibition Centre<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1418\\\" data-start=\\\"1385\\\">Handicrafts &amp; Handloom Centre<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1422\\\" data-start=\\\"1419\\\" \\/>\\nAfternoon free for shopping or leisure activities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1537\\\" data-start=\\\"1474\\\">\\ud83d\\udecf\\ufe0f Overnight Stay: Gangtok<br data-end=\\\"1504\\\" data-start=\\\"1501\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong data-end=\\\"1537\\\" data-start=\\\"1515\\\">Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"31-12-2025\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1708\\\" data-start=\\\"1583\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1683\\\" data-start=\\\"1641\\\">NJP Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1785\\\" data-start=\\\"1710\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong data-end=\\\"1734\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Breakfast<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1737\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"1783\\\" data-start=\\\"1739\\\">Tour Ends with Sweet Memories of Gangtok<\\/strong> \\u2728<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"Bus Bharat Benz\",\"fno\":\"Bus\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Dec 2025\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"4510\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6786\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"fare\":\"37577\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7317\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Dec 2025\",\"dep_time\":\"02:55 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/12\\/2025\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Summit Norling Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"31\\/12\\/2025\",\"rate\":\"26640\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>🚌 <strong>Ranchi to Bagdogra (Siliguri) – By Bus </strong>&nbsp;<br />\n✈️ <strong>Return Airfare: Bagdogra (IXB) to Ranchi (IXR)</strong> &nbsp;<br />\n🏨 <strong>03 Nights Stay @ Hotel Summit Norling Resort &amp; Spa Gangtok</strong></p>\n\n<p>Inclusions: &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ 03 Nights in well-appointed rooms &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ All transfers &amp; sightseeing by Private AC Vehicle &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Pick-up &amp; Drop: Bagdogra/NJP &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Excursion to Tsomgo Lake &amp; Baba Mandir (subject to permit/weather) &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Local sightseeing in Gangtok &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Parking, Toll, Driver Allowance &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Inner Line Permits for Sikkim (Indian Nationals) &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Experienced local driver throughout the trip &nbsp;<br />\n✔️ All applicable Govt. taxes</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":42087,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":26640,\"transport_cost\":\"18500\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":87227,\"profit_figure\":\"36273\",\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 0\",\"selling_price\":123500,\"percent_of_amount\":\"41.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0773/0122025', 123500, 30875, 0, '2025-12-16 09:05:10', '2025-12-31 06:03:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
