(800, 'Mr. Ritika Bhadani', 'Dewanshu', '7250820809', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2026-02-11', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Port Blair | Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach & Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"11-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Airport Welcome:<\\/strong> Arrive at Veer Savarkar International Airport, Port Blair, where our representative will greet you and assist with a smooth transfer to your hotel. After check-in and refreshment, begin your journey of the islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"791\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"557\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach:<\\/strong> Spend the afternoon at Carbyn\\u2019s Cove, a picturesque palm-fringed beach just a short drive from the city. Walk along the shoreline, soak in the sea breeze, and relax by the turquoise waters \\u2013 a perfect start to your Andaman holiday.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"832\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\">Cellular Jail &amp; Light &amp; Sound Show:<\\/strong> Later, visit the iconic <em data-end=\\\"884\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\">Cellular Jail (Kala Pani)<\\/em>, where the corridors and galleries narrate the tale of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. In the evening, witness the moving <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Light &amp; Sound Show<\\/strong>, which brings history alive through music, narration, and lights.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair \\u2192 Havelock Island | Radhanagar Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"12-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1400\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\">Private Cruise to Havelock:<\\/strong> After breakfast, board a premium private cruise (<em data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\">Makruzz \\u2013 Premium Class<\\/em> \\/ <em data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">Nautika \\u2013 Luxury Class<\\/em>) for a scenic transfer from Port Blair to Havelock Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1470\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1421\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1493\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\">Radhanagar Beach:<\\/strong> In the afternoon, visit the world-renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1571\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\">Radhanagar Beach (Beach No. 7)<\\/strong>, voted one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches. Enjoy its pristine white sands, azure waters, and a spectacular sunset.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<br data-end=\\\"1721\\\" data-start=\\\"1718\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1802\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Note: Ferry timings and class upgrades can be requested at the time of booking.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Excursion with Snorkelling\",\"date\":\"13-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2060\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\">Hotel Pickup &amp; Boat Ride:<\\/strong> Begin your day with a hotel pickup and transfer to the jetty. Enjoy a 30-minute boat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"2012\\\" data-start=\\\"1994\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, famous for its coral reefs and clear waters.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2222\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2092\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\">Complimentary Snorkelling:<\\/strong> Experience the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock \\u2192 Neil Island | Natural Rock Formation & Laxmanpur Beach\",\"date\":\"14-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a private cruise from Havelock to Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2791\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2820\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\">Natural Rock Formation:<\\/strong> Visit Neil\\u2019s iconic Natural Rock Formation, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2883\\\">Howrah Bridge<\\/em>, a natural wonder created by centuries of coral formations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3099\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Laxmanpur Beach Sunset:<\\/strong> Spend the evening at <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3011\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its wide shoreline and mesmerizing golden sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3214\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Neil Island.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be updated by our team.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island \\u2192 Port Blair | Bharatpur Beach, Shopping\",\"date\":\"15-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3488\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">Bharatpur Beach:<\\/strong> Begin the morning at <strong data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3360\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, and optional water sports such as jet skiing and glass-bottom boat rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3614\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">Check Out &amp; Transfer:<\\/strong> Check out from the resort and transfer to Neil Jetty. Board a private cruise back to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3770\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3634\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Shopping Trip:<\\/strong> In the evening, enjoy shopping at Port Blair\\u2019s local markets for souvenirs like pearls, shell crafts, spices, and island handicrafts.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3772\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3982\\\" data-start=\\\"3963\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Port Blair\",\"date\":\"16-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your return flight. Carry back fond memories of your Andaman journey.<br data-end=\\\"4193\\\" data-start=\\\"4190\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"4368\\\" data-start=\\