rong> Experience the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock \\u2192 Neil Island | Natural Rock Formation & Laxmanpur Beach\",\"date\":\"15-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a private cruise from Havelock to Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2791\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2820\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\">Natural Rock Formation:<\\/strong> Visit Neil\\u2019s iconic Natural Rock Formation, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2883\\\">Howrah Bridge<\\/em>, a natural wonder created by centuries of coral formations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3099\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Laxmanpur Beach Sunset:<\\/strong> Spend the evening at <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3011\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its wide shoreline and mesmerizing golden sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3214\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Neil Island.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be updated by our team.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island \\u2192 Port Blair | Bharatpur Beach, Shopping\",\"date\":\"16-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3488\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">Bharatpur Beach:<\\/strong> Begin the morning at <strong data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3360\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, and optional water sports such as jet skiing and glass-bottom boat rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3614\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">Check Out &amp; Transfer:<\\/strong> Check out from the resort and transfer to Neil Jetty. Board a private cruise back to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3770\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3634\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Shopping Trip:<\\/strong> In the evening, enjoy shopping at Port Blair\\u2019s local markets for souvenirs like pearls, shell crafts, spices, and island handicrafts.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3772\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3982\\\" data-start=\\\"3963\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Port Blair\",\"date\":\"17-02-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your return flight. Carry back fond memories of your Andaman journey.<br data-end=\\\"4193\\\" data-start=\\\"4190\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"4368\\\" data-start=\\\"4193\\\">Note: Hotels usually have early check-out times. If your flight is in the afternoon, luggage can be kept at the reception. Extra sightseeing may be arranged if time permits.<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sea Shell\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Andaman Villa\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"15\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Sand Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Neil Panorama\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"16\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/02\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>03&nbsp;Rooms Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at the given respected&nbsp;hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast&nbsp;</strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop-off.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by a Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;on all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"211587\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":211587,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 35969.79\",\"selling_price\":247556.79000000000814907252788543701171875}', 'MZQ/0787/022026', 247584, 41264, 12480, '2026-02-03 13:27:50', '2026-02-03 13:27:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
