AC Vehicle&nbsp;on all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":43188,\"land_cost\":\"69525\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":112713,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18034.08\",\"selling_price\":130747.080000000001746229827404022216796875}', 'MZQ/0788/022026', 130750, 65375, 12480, '2026-02-03 13:28:02', '2026-03-21 11:11:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(803, 'MR Abadat Ansari', 'Nitin Sarawgi', '9835083598', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-07-27', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Hanoi\",\"date\":\"27-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1377\\\" data-start=\\\"1096\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"1145\\\" data-start=\\\"1112\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, Hanoi, you will be met by our local representative and transferred to your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1231\\\" data-start=\\\"1228\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-in at the hotel (early check-in subject to availability).<br data-end=\\\"1297\\\" data-start=\\\"1294\\\" \\/>\\nRest of the day is free to relax or explore the nearby Old Quarter at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1404\\\" data-start=\\\"1379\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1398\\\" data-start=\\\"1379\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ha Long Bay Cruise\",\"date\":\"28-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1822\\\" data-start=\\\"1456\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"1524\\\" data-start=\\\"1487\\\">full-day excursion to Ha Long Bay<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.<br data-end=\\\"1558\\\" data-start=\\\"1555\\\" \\/>\\nBoard a traditional cruise and sail through emerald waters surrounded by thousands of limestone karsts.<br data-end=\\\"1664\\\" data-start=\\\"1661\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy activities such as visiting caves, scenic viewpoints, and a freshly prepared lunch onboard (as per cruise inclusions).<br data-end=\\\"1791\\\" data-start=\\\"1788\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Hanoi in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"1843\\\" data-start=\\\"1824\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8Overnight Stay in Hanoi<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7dMeal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ninh Binh \\u2013 Hoa Lu \\u2013 Tam Coc \\u2013 Bich Dong\",\"date\":\"29-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2292\\\" data-start=\\\"1923\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1973\\\" data-start=\\\"1951\\\">Ninh Binh Province<\\/strong>, famously known as <em data-end=\\\"2017\\\" data-start=\\\"1993\\\">\\u201cHa Long Bay on Land.\\u201d<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2020\\\" data-start=\\\"2017\\\" \\/>\\nVisit the historic <strong data-end=\\\"2065\\\" data-start=\\\"2039\\\">Hoa Lu Ancient Capital<\\/strong>, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"2099\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\">Bich Dong Pagoda<\\/strong>, nestled amidst scenic limestone hills.<br data-end=\\\"2142\\\" data-start=\\\"2139\\\" \\/>\\nLater, enjoy a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"2200\\\" data-start=\\\"2169\\\">sampan boat ride at Tam Coc<\\/strong>, passing through caves, rice fields, and dramatic landscapes.<br data-end=\\\"2265\\\" data-start=\\\"2262\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Hanoi by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2319\\\" data-start=\\\"2294\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1843\\\" data-start=\\\"1824\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8Overnight Stay in Hanoi<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7dMeal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi at Leisure\",\"date\":\"30-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1491\\\" data-start=\\\"1446\\\">After breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure to explore Hanoi at your own pace. You may stroll through the charming streets of the Old Quarter, visit local caf\\u00e9s, shop for souvenirs, or indulge in authentic Vietnamese cuisine. You can also opt for optional sightseeing or simply relax and enjoy the city\'s vibrant atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1491\\\" data-start=\\\"1446\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1843\\\" data-start=\\\"1824\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8Overnight Stay in Hanoi<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7dMeal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Hanoi\",\"date\":\"31-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2690\\\" data-start=\\\"2657\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong> to board your return flight to Kolkata, carrying wonderful memories of Vietnam.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1631\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"34643\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1632\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/07\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Little Diamond\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"7703\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></em></li>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Little Diamond&nbsp;@HA NOI&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong></li>\n	<li>Airport Transfers <strong>on PVT</strong><br />\n	All Tours <strong>on SIC</strong></li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Vietnam VISA.</strong></em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":34643,\"land_cost\":\"28000\",\"hotel_cost\":7703,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"5200\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":75546,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16620.12\",\"selling_price\":92166.119999999995343387126922607421875}', 'MZQ/0789/022026', 95960, 47980, 0, '2026-02-10 14:45:52', '2026-07-16 10:37:49', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(804, 'Mr. Arpit Kumar', 'Pinky Di', '7488871940', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-04-11', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\u2708\\ufe0f Arrival at Bangkok Airport \\u279d Transfer to Pattaya Hotel\",\"date\":\"11-04-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"535\\\" data-start=\\\"311\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"327\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong>, complete immigration and baggage formalities. Meet and greet with our local representative and proceed for a comfortable transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"503\\\" data-start=\\\"492\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> (approx. 2 \\u2013 2.5 hours\\u2019 drive).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"713\\\" data-start=\\\"537\\\">Upon arrival, check in at your hotel and relax after your journey. The evening is free at leisure. You may explore Pattaya Beach, Walking Street, or nearby markets on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"745\\\" data-start=\\\"715\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"745\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\">Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\ud83d\\udc2f Tiger Park & Alcazar Show\",\"date\":\"12-04-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1048\\\" data-start=\\\"802\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, proceed to visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"882\\\" data-start=\\\"860\\\">Tiger Park Pattaya<\\/strong>, where you will have the opportunity to see and take photographs with tigers in a safe and controlled environment (interaction packages subject to booking category).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1259\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\">Later in the evening, enjoy the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"1118\\\" data-start=\\\"1094\\\">Alcazar Cabaret Show<\\/strong>, one of Thailand\\u2019s most famous cabaret performances featuring vibrant costumes, dazzling stage setups, and international dance performances.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1296\\\" data-start=\\\"1261\\\">Return to the hotel after the show.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1328\\\" data-start=\\\"1298\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1328\\\" data-start=\\\"1301\\\">Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\ud83c\\udfdd\\ufe0f Coral Island Tour (Koh Larn)\",\"date\":\"13-04-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1455\\\" data-start=\\\"1389\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"1454\\\" data-start=\\\"1420\\\">Coral Island Tour by speedboat<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1742\\\" data-start=\\\"1457\\\">Enjoy a scenic ride across the Gulf of Thailand to <strong data-end=\\\"1535\\\" data-start=\\\"1508\\\">Koh Larn (Coral Island)<\\/strong>, known for its crystal-clear waters and white sandy beaches. You may relax on the beach or opt for various water sports activities such as parasailing, jet skiing, or banana boat rides (at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1845\\\" data-start=\\\"1744\\\">Spend leisure time soaking in the tropical surroundings before returning to Pattaya in the afternoon.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1877\\\" data-start=\\\"1847\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1877\\\" data-start=\\\"1850\\\">Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\ud83d\\ude90 Pattaya \\u279d Bangkok + \\ud83d\\udea2 Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise (Indian Buffet)\",\"date\":\"14-04-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2060\\\" data-start=\\\"1982\\\">After breakfast, check out from the Pattaya hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2059\\\" data-start=\\\"2048\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2117\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\">Upon arrival, check in at your Bangkok hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2397\\\" data-start=\\\"2119\\\">In the evening, proceed for the elegant <strong data-end=\\\"2197\\\" data-start=\\\"2159\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>. Enjoy a scenic cruise along the Chao Phraya River while witnessing illuminated landmarks such as the Grand Palace and Wat Arun. Relish a delicious <strong data-end=\\\"2370\\\" data-start=\\\"2346\\\">Indian buffet dinner<\\/strong> accompanied by live music.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2436\\\" data-start=\\\"2399\\\">Return to the hotel after the cruise.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2468\\\" data-start=\\\"2438\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2468\\\" data-start=\\\"2441\\\">Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\ud83e\\udd81 Safari World + Marine Park (Buffet Lunch Included)\",\"date\":\"15-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2653\\\" data-start=\\\"2550\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2608\\\" data-start=\\\"2578\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>, one of Thailand\\u2019s most popular attractions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2661\\\" data-start=\\\"2655\\\">Enjoy:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"2803\\\" data-start=\\\"2662\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2715\\\" data-start=\\\"2662\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2715\\\" data-start=\\\"2664\\\">The open-air Safari Park drive-through experience<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2803\\\" data-start=\\\"2716\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"2803\\\" data-start=\\\"2718\\\">Marine Park shows featuring dolphins, sea lions, orangutans, and stunt performances<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2846\\\" data-start=\\\"2805\\\">Enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"2845\\\" data-start=\\\"2813\\\">buffet lunch inside the park<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2883\\\" data-start=\\\"2848\\\">Return to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2915\\\" data-start=\\\"2885\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2915\\\" data-start=\\\"2888\\\">Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\ud83c\\udf06 Manhattan Skywalk + Shopping at Leisure\",\"date\":\"16-04-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3252\\\" data-start=\\\"2986\\\">After breakfast, visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"3075\\\" data-start=\\\"3022\\\">King Power Mahanakhon Skywalk (Manhattan Skywalk)<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s highest observation deck offering breathtaking panoramic views of Bangkok city. Experience the thrilling glass-floor skywalk for an unforgettable photo opportunity.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3315\\\" data-start=\\\"3254\\\">Later, enjoy free time for shopping at popular malls such as:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"3386\\\" data-start=\\\"3316\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"3330\\\" data-start=\\\"3316\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"3330\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">MBK Center<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"3356\\\" data-start=\\\"3331\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"3356\\\" data-start=\\\"3333\\\">Platinum Fashion Mall<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"3373\\\" data-start=\\\"3357\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"3373\\\" data-start=\\\"3359\\\">Siam Paragon<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"3386\\\" data-start=\\\"3374\\\">\\n\\t<p data-end=\\\"3386\\\" data-start=\\\"3376\\\">ICONSIAM<\\/p>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3418\\\" data-start=\\\"3388\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3418\\\" data-start=\\\"3391\\\">Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"\\u2708\\ufe0f Departure\",\"date\":\"17-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3599\\\" data-start=\\\"3459\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3539\\\" data-start=\\\"3514\\\">Bangkok Airport (BKK)<\\/strong> for your onward flight with wonderful memories of Thailand.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3616\\\" data-start=\\\"3601\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"3616\\\" data-start=\\\"3603\\\">Tour Ends<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Patna (PA