ternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>&nbsp;03 Nights accommodation as per itinerary</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Daily Breakfast (CP Plan)</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;All transfers &amp; sightseeing by private Innova</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Driver allowance, toll tax &amp; parking charges</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;Airport pick-up &amp; drop as mentioned</li>\n	<li>&nbsp;All applicable hotel taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"India\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"India\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":\"India\",\"visa_cost\":\"India\",\"travel_insurance\":\"India\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":0,\"profit_figure\":\"India\"}', 'MZQ/0791/022026', 63040, 15760, 0, '2026-02-16 13:04:03', '2026-02-16 13:45:43', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(806, 'Mr AK Rai', NULL, '7004685160', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical Jaipur', '2026-02-20', 4, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Delhi to Jaipur | Check-in & Chokhi Dhani\",\"date\":\"20-02-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Pick-up from Delhi Hotel and proceed to Jaipur by surface (approx. 5\\u20136 hours).<br \\/>\\nUpon arrival in Jaipur, transfer to the hotel and complete the check-in formalities. Relax for some time after the<br \\/>\\njourney.<br \\/>\\nIn the evening, proceed to visit <strong>Chokhi Dhani,<\\/strong> an ethnic Rajasthani village resort offering traditional folk<br \\/>\\nperformances, cultural activities, camel rides, and authentic Rajasthani dinner experience (dinner at additional cost<br \\/>\\nunless specified).<br \\/>\\nReturn to the hotel.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2013 Pushkar \\u2013 Jaipur\",\"date\":\"21-02-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a day excursion to <strong>Pushkar <\\/strong>(approx. 2\\u20132.5 hrs one way).<br \\/>\\nVisit:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>Brahma Temple<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Pushkar Lake<\\/strong> &amp; Ghats<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Local market exploration<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>Later, return to Jaipur by evening.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2013 Khatu Shyam Ji + Balaji Salasar Day Trip\",\"date\":\"22-02-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After early breakfast, proceed for a full-day pilgrimage tour covering:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li>&nbsp;<strong>Shri Khatu Shyam Ji Temple<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>&nbsp;Salasar Balaji Temple<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>&nbsp;Mehandipur Balaji Temple<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>Seek blessings at these revered temples of Rajasthan.<br \\/>\\nLater in the evening, return to Jaipur.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"23-02-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for full-day sightseeing of Jaipur covering:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>&nbsp;Amber Fort<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Jal Mahal <\\/strong>(photo stop)<\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>City Palace, Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Jantar Mantar, Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Hawa Mahal <\\/strong>(photo stop)<\\/li>\\n\\t<li>Local market shopping (Johari \\/ Bapu Bazaar)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p>Return to hotel.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Jaipur.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"24-02-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Jaipur Airport \\/ Railway Station for your onward journey.<br \\/>\\n\\udbc0\\udc00 <strong>Tour Ends with Divine Blessings &amp; Royal Memories of Jaipur<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Jaipur\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Royal Gm Plaza\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"24\\/02\\/2026\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"17600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation in well-appointed rooms on <strong>DBL Sharing basis</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Daily Breakfast </strong>at the hotel</li>\n	<li>Exclusive <strong>INNOVA CRYSTA </strong>private vehicle at disposal for all transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Services of an experienced, professional driver</li>\n	<li>All parking charges, toll taxes, interstate taxes, and driver allowances included</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"hotel_cost\":17600},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":17600}', 'MZQ/0792/022026', 54520, 13630, 0, '2026-02-16 13:14:09', '2026-02-16 13:41:49', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
