(807, 'Mr Abhishek Agarwal', 'Suresh Kayal (Keshav Jain)', '9006429439', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-03-11', 6, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"11-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"173\\\" data-start=\\\"142\\\">Phuket International Airport<\\/strong>, where you will be met by our representative and transferred to your hotel. Upon arrival, complete the check-in formalities and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is free at leisure to unwind or explore the nearby surroundings on your own.<br data-end=\\\"833\\\" data-start=\\\"830\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"855\\\" data-start=\\\"833\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br data-end=\\\"864\\\" data-start=\\\"861\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"877\\\" data-start=\\\"864\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> None<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour with Tiger Park\",\"date\":\"12-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, proceed for&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1681\\\">Phuket City Tour<\\/strong> \\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f covering highlights such as <strong data-end=\\\"1754\\\" data-start=\\\"1734\\\">Karon View Point<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1778\\\" data-start=\\\"1756\\\">Wat Chalong Temple<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1800\\\" data-start=\\\"1784\\\">Gems Gallery<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1801\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"1851\\\" data-start=\\\"1830\\\">Phuket Tiger Park<\\/strong>, where you can safely interact and click photos with majestic tigers (optional experience).<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2026\\\" data-start=\\\"2004\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br data-end=\\\"2036\\\" data-start=\\\"2033\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2049\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran with Lunch (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"13-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, depart for a full-day <strong data-end=\\\"2233\\\" data-start=\\\"2207\\\">James Bond Island Tour<\\/strong> by luxurious <strong data-end=\\\"2260\\\" data-start=\\\"2247\\\">Catamaran<\\/strong>. Cruise through the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"2307\\\" data-start=\\\"2290\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, known for its dramatic limestone cliffs and emerald-green waters. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"2399\\\" data-start=\\\"2381\\\">Khao Phing Kan<\\/strong>, famously featured in the James Bond movie <em data-end=\\\"2475\\\" data-start=\\\"2443\\\">\\u201cThe Man with the Golden Gun.\\u201d<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2478\\\" data-start=\\\"2475\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy <strong data-end=\\\"2500\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">sea canoeing<\\/strong> through limestone caves and lagoons, relax on board, and savor a <strong data-end=\\\"2592\\\" data-start=\\\"2566\\\">delicious buffet lunch<\\/strong> before returning to Phuket.<br data-end=\\\"2623\\\" data-start=\\\"2620\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2623\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br data-end=\\\"2655\\\" data-start=\\\"2652\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2668\\\" data-start=\\\"2655\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure in Phuket\",\"date\":\"14-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"200\\\" data-start=\\\"110\\\">After breakfast, the day is free for leisure in <strong data-end=\\\"199\\\" data-start=\\\"158\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"410\\\" data-start=\\\"202\\\">You may relax at the beach, explore local markets, enjoy water sports, or opt for optional excursions such as Phi Phi Island tour, Coral Island tour, or a traditional Thai spa experience (at additional cost).<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2623\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuket<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2049\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2013 Krabi \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"15-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"193\\\" data-start=\\\"50\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, check out and proceed by surface transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"166\\\" data-start=\\\"125\\\">Krabi<\\/strong> (approx. 3\\u20134 hours drive).<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nEnjoy the scenic journey along the coastal route. Upon arrival in Krabi, check in to your hotel and relax.<br \\/>\\nThe rest of the day is at leisure to explore nearby beaches or local markets at your own pace.<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2623\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Krabi<br \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2049\\\" data-start=\\\"2036\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat (Includes NP Fee)\",\"date\":\"16-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, set out for a thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"1047\\\" data-start=\\\"1030\\\">4 Island Tour<\\/strong> by speed boat \\u26f5. Visit some of Krabi\\u2019s most iconic beaches and limestone islands \\u2013 <strong data-end=\\\"1155\\\" data-start=\\\"1131\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1171\\\" data-start=\\\"1157\\\">Tup Island<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1191\\\" data-start=\\\"1173\\\">Chicken Island<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1212\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\">Poda Island<\\/strong>. Enjoy snorkeling, swimming, and sunbathing on pristine white sands surrounded by turquoise waters. A <strong data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">delicious Thai lunch<\\/strong> will be served on the tour. Return to the hotel in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"1406\\\" data-start=\\\"1403\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1428\\\" data-start=\\\"1406\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Krabi<br data-end=\\\"1437\\\" data-start=\\\"1434\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1450\\\" data-start=\\\"1437\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi Departure\",\"date\":\"17-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3287\\\" data-start=\\\"3255\\\">Krabi International Airport<\\/strong> for your flight back home. Depart with beautiful memories of Thailand\\u2019s beaches, islands, and warm hospitality.<br data-end=\\\"3402\\\" data-start=\\\"3399\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3415\\\" data-start=\\\"3402\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"576\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":75702},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1081\",\"dep_date\":\"11 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"11 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1070\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:35 PM\",\"fare\":63982},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5339\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"11\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"15\\/03\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Amari Phuket\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Ocean Front Balcony King\",\"rate\":\"87000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/03\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sofitel Krabi Phokeethra Golf & Spa Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room, 1 King Bed (Pool and Garden View)\",\"rate\":\"87000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":3}]', '<p>✈️ Return Airfare in Economy Class&nbsp;<em><strong>Ex-Ranchi .</strong></em><br />\n🏨 <strong>04 Nights </strong>Accommodation at <em><strong>Hotel Amari, Phuket</strong></em><br />\n🏨 <strong>02&nbsp;Nights</strong> Accommodation at <em><strong>Hotel Sofitel Krabi Phokeethra Golf &amp; Spa Resort, Krabi</strong></em><br />\n🛏 01 Room on <em><strong>DBL Sharing + 01 Extra Bed</strong></em><br />\n🍳 <em><strong>Buffet Breakfast</strong></em> at all hotels</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<em><strong>🎟️ Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong></em><br />\n🏝️ <strong>Krabi 4 Island Tour</strong> with Lunch by Speed Boat (Includes National Park Fee)<br />\n→ Visit Phra Nang Cave Beach, Tup Island, Chicken Island &amp; Poda Island.<br />\n🛥️ <strong>James Bond Island Tour by Catamaran</strong> with Lunch (Includes National Park Fee)<br />\n→ Explore Phang Nga Bay, Sea Canoeing &amp; Khao Phing Kan – the famous “James Bond Island.”<br />\n🌆 <strong>Phuket City Tour</strong><br />\n→ Visit Tiger Park Phuket &amp; Phuket highlights &amp; viewpoints<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<strong>🚗 Transfers (All on Private Basis)</strong><br />\n🚖 Phuket (HKT) Airport → Phuket Hotel (Arrival Transfer)<br />\n🚗 Phuket Hotel → Krabi Hotel&nbsp;<br />\n✈️ Krabi Hotel → Krabi (KBV) Airport (Departure Transfer)<br />\n<br />\n<strong>🍽 Meal Plan</strong><br />\nDaily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels<br />\n<strong>2 Lunches</strong> during island tours</p>\n\n<p><br />\n<em><strong>💎 Highlights</strong></em><br />\n✅ Private tours &amp; transfers for a seamless experience<br />\n✅ National Park Fees included in all island tours<br />\n✅ Perfect blend of leisure, culture &amp; adventure<br />\n✅ Premium accommodations in central locations</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":139684,\"land_cost\":\"85000\",\"hotel_cost\":174000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":398684,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 79736.8\",\"selling_price\":478420.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0793/022026', 478360, 137020, 102160, '2026-02-18 07:00:08', '2026-02-18 12:04:00', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(808, 'Mr Abhishek Agarwal', 'Suresh Kayal (Keshav Jain)', '9006429439', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DUBAI', '2026-03-12', 7, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Dubai\",\"date\":\"12-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"294\\\" data-start=\\\"157\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"219\\\" data-start=\\\"178\\\">Dubai<\\/strong> International Airport. Meet &amp; greet by our representative and transfer to the hotel. Check-in and relax after your journey.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dubai City Tour + Burj Khalifa\",\"date\":\"13-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"481\\\" data-start=\\\"416\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a half-day Dubai City Tour covering Jumeirah Beach with a photo stop at <strong data-end=\\\"566\\\" data-start=\\\"525\\\">Burj Al Arab<\\/strong>, drive through <strong data-end=\\\"623\\\" data-start=\\\"582\\\">Palm Jumeirah<\\/strong>, Dubai Marina, and the Al Fahidi Historical District. Later visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"742\\\" data-start=\\\"701\\\">Burj Khalifa<\\/strong> (124th\\/125th Floor \\u2013 At The Top) for panoramic city views.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Miracle Garden + Premium Desert Safari\",\"date\":\"14-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"951\\\" data-start=\\\"870\\\">After breakfast, visit the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"968\\\" data-start=\\\"927\\\">Dubai Miracle Garden<\\/strong>, famous for its vibrant floral displays. In the afternoon, proceed for a Premium Desert Safari experience including dune bashing in a 4x4 vehicle, camel ride, cultural entertainment (Tanoura &amp; Belly Dance), and a delicious BBQ dinner under the stars.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Abu Dhabi City Tour + SeaWorld & BAPS Hindu Mandir\",\"date\":\"15-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1328\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1389\\\" data-start=\\\"1348\\\">Abu Dhabi<\\/strong> for a full-day city tour. Visit the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"1479\\\" data-start=\\\"1438\\\">Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque<\\/strong>, drive along the Corniche, and explore the newly inaugurated <strong data-end=\\\"1582\\\" data-start=\\\"1541\\\">BAPS Hindu Mandir Abu Dhabi<\\/strong>. Later enjoy thrilling marine experiences at <strong data-end=\\\"1669\\\" data-start=\\\"1628\\\">SeaWorld Abu Dhabi<\\/strong> located on Yas Island.<br \\/>\\nReturn to Dubai for overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day at Leisure\",\"date\":\"16-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1625\\\" data-start=\\\"1602\\\">After breakfast, the day is free for leisure. You may explore shopping destinations like <strong data-end=\\\"1898\\\" data-start=\\\"1857\\\">Dubai Mall<\\/strong>, relax at the beach, or opt for optional experiences at additional cost.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Inter Hotel Transfer\",\"date\":\"17-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1963\\\" data-start=\\\"1855\\\">After breakfast, check out and transfer to another hotel within Dubai.<br \\/>\\nCheck-in and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2010\\\" data-start=\\\"1986\\\">Overnight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Aquaventure & Lost Chambers\",\"date\":\"18-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2069\\\" data-start=\\\"2050\\\">After breakfast, proceed to Atlantis The Palm to enjoy thrilling water rides at <strong data-end=\\\"2393\\\" data-start=\\\"2350\\\">Aquaventure Waterpark<\\/strong> and explore the fascinating marine life at <strong data-end=\\\"2480\\\" data-start=\\\"2437\\\">The Lost Chambers Aquarium<\\/strong>. Enjoy a fun-filled day with family and friends.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Dubai.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Check-out + Dubai Frame & Departure\",\"date\":\"19-03-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2219\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel.<br \\/>\\nVisit Dubai Frame. Later transfer to Dubai International Airport for your onward flight.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2453\\\" data-start=\\\"2402\\\">\\u2728 Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of UAE<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"576\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":31184},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"515\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"205500\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Dubai (DXB)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Emirates\",\"fno\":\"512\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:10 AM\",\"fare\":null},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6287\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:35 AM\",\"fare\":22344}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Park Regis Kris Kin Hotel Bur Dubai\",\"room_type\":\"Junior Suite - Triple Beds\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":5,\"check_out\":\"17\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"78000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"DUBAI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Atlantis, The Palm\",\"room_type\":\"Palm King Room\",\"check_out\":\"19\\/03\\/2026\",\"nights\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"130000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":10},{\"age\":3}]', '<h2 data-end=\"147\" data-start=\"132\">✈️ Flights</h2>\n\n<ul data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"148\">\n	<li data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"148\">\n	<p data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"150\"><strong data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"150\">Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi</strong></p>\n	</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-e