(810, 'Mr Vishnu Kumar Modi', 'Sanjeev Chitlangia', '9431170167', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KASHMIR 4*', '2026-03-04', 5, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar \\u2013 Local Sightseeing + Houseboat Stay\",\"date\":\"04-03-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1007\\\" data-start=\\\"375\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"386\\\">Srinagar International Airport<\\/strong>, where you will be received by our representative and transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"538\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\">Srinagar House Boat<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<br \\/>\\nDay at leisure for relaxation.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Dinner at Houseboat<br data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Houseboat in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"05-03-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1673\\\" data-start=\\\"1132\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1201\\\" data-start=\\\"1160\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong> (approx. 89 km \\/ 2\\u20132.5 hrs), known as the \\u201cValley of Shepherds.\\u201d Enroute visit Pampore saffron fields and <strong data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1308\\\">Awantipora Ruins<\\/strong>. Enjoy scenic countryside views, Mattan Temple, apple orchards, and the Lidder River. Optional activities include rafting and pony rides (own cost). Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1548\\\" data-start=\\\"1505\\\">Chandanwari<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1593\\\" data-start=\\\"1550\\\">Betaab Valley<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1642\\\" data-start=\\\"1599\\\">Aru Valley<\\/strong> by union vehicle (own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1748\\\" data-start=\\\"1675\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"1708\\\" data-start=\\\"1705\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam \\u2013 Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"06-03-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"1801\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1872\\\" data-start=\\\"1829\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong> (approx. 140 km \\/ 3\\u20133.5 hrs), the \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d at 2730 meters above sea level. Gulmarg is famous for skiing and the world\\u2019s highest golf course (activities at own cost). Enjoy optional visit to Drung Waterfall (union vehicle at own cost) and experience the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2187\\\" data-start=\\\"2144\\\">Gulmarg Gondola<\\/strong> cable car ride (not included). Visit handicraft emporiums for shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2335\\\" data-start=\\\"2263\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"2296\\\" data-start=\\\"2293\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2443\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2346\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\">Note:<\\/strong> During heavy snowfall, transfer from Tangmarg to Gulmarg may require a chain vehicle (own cost).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"07-03-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2627\\\" data-start=\\\"2496\\\">After breakfast, drive back to <strong data-end=\\\"2570\\\" data-start=\\\"2527\\\">Srinagar<\\/strong>. After Check-in, proceed for local sightseeing covering the famous Mughal Gardens including <strong data-end=\\\"677\\\" data-start=\\\"636\\\">Nishat Bagh<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"679\\\">Shalimar Bagh<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"767\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\">Chashme Shahi<\\/strong>. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"816\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Pari Mahal<\\/strong> (union vehicle required for last 1 km) and <strong data-end=\\\"901\\\" data-start=\\\"860\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>.<br \\/>\\nLater enjoy a 01-hour Shikara ride on the famous <strong data-end=\\\"993\\\" data-start=\\\"952\\\">Dal Lake<\\/strong> (included)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2702\\\" data-start=\\\"2629\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"2662\\\" data-start=\\\"2659\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"08-03-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3161\\\" data-start=\\\"2766\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"2862\\\" data-start=\\\"2819\\\">Sonmarg<\\/strong> (approx. 104 km \\/ 2\\u20132.5 hrs). Enjoy scenic views of the Sindh River and optional rafting (own cost). Take a pony ride to <strong data-end=\\\"3027\\\" data-start=\\\"2984\\\">Thajiwas Glacier<\\/strong> (own cost) and visit Zero Point by union vehicle (own cost), where snow remains throughout the year. Return to Srinagar by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3236\\\" data-start=\\\"3163\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"3196\\\" data-start=\\\"3193\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport Drop\",\"date\":\"09-03-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3496\\\" data-start=\\\"3292\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3393\\\" data-start=\\\"3350\\\">Srinagar International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. Guests are advised to reach the airport at least 2 hours prior to departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3592\\\" data-start=\\\"3498\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast Included<br data-end=\\\"3522\\\" data-start=\\\"3519\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"3592\\\" data-start=\\\"3524\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful &amp; Long-Lasting Memories of Kashmir<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"576\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":29544},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5106\",\"dep_date\":\"04 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"04 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1017\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"fare\":24228},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1050\",\"dep_date\":\"09 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"09 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:55 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"04\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Young Bombay House Boat\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Heritage\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Chinar Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room With Balcony\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"06\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolahoi Green Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"07\\/02\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Dewan by Royal Naqash\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"09\\/02\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️Return Flight <strong><em>Ex- Ranchi.</em></strong><br />\n<br />\n🏨 01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;at&nbsp;<em><strong>Young Bombay House Boat&nbsp; – Srinagar&nbsp;</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Chinar Resort &amp; Spa&nbsp;– Sonmarg</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 02&nbsp;Nights at<em><strong>&nbsp;Hotel Kolahoi Green Resort – Gulmarg&nbsp;</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at<em><strong>&nbsp;Hotel The Dewan by Royal Naqash – Srinagar &nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>🍽 Meal Plan:&nbsp;<em><strong>MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>🍽Accommodation on&nbsp;<em><strong>02&nbsp;Double Room Basis</strong></em><br />\n🚗 Private Transfers:&nbsp;<strong>Innova//Similar&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>for full itinerary &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🛶<em><strong>&nbsp;01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal Lake &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🧰 Medical Kit in Taxi &nbsp;<br />\n👨‍✈️ Driver Charges, Toll, Parking Included &nbsp;<br />\n🤝 Meet &amp; Assist on Arrival/Departure &nbsp;<br />\n🛬 Srinagar Airport Pickup &amp; Drop &nbsp;<br />\n✅ All&nbsp;<em><strong>Applicable Taxes</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":53772,\"land_cost\":\"90200\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":143972,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 23035.52\",\"selling_price\":167007.51999999998952262103557586669921875}', 'MZQ/0796/022026', 167440, 41860, 0, '2026-02-21 09:19:42', '2026-02-21 09:38:33', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(811, 'Mr Sumit Agrawal', 'Chetan agarwal', '7070454222', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-03-01', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Krabi \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"01-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"240\\\" data-start=\\\"199\\\">Krabi<\\/strong> Airport. Meet &amp; greet by our representative and transfer to your hotel. Check-in and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is free at leisure to explore nearby beaches or enjoy hotel facilities.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat\",\"date\":\"02-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for the famous 4 Island Tour by speed boat (National Park Fee included). Visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"696\\\" data-start=\\\"655\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach<\\/strong>, the scenic sandbank at <strong data-end=\\\"762\\\" data-start=\\\"721\\\">Tup Island<\\/strong>, the unique rock formation at <strong data-end=\\\"834\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\">Chicken Island<\\/strong>, and relax at the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"904\\\" data-start=\\\"863\\\">Poda Island<\\/strong>. Enjoy lunch during the tour. Return to hotel by evening.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Krabi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi \\u2013 Phuket | Enroute Phuket City Tour + Tiger Park\",\"date\":\"03-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and proceed by road to <strong data-end=\\\"1158\\\" data-start=\\\"1117\\\">Phuket<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, enjoy a Phuket City Tour covering major viewpoints, Old Phuket Town, and local attractions. Visit Tiger Park for an exciting wildlife interaction experience. Later check-in at your hotel.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by SpeedBoat with Lunch\",\"date\":\"04-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2232\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the famous James Bond Island Tour by SpeedBoat (National Park Fee included). Explore the spectacular limestone cliffs of <strong data-end=\\\"1650\\\" data-start=\\\"1609\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, enjoy sea canoeing through caves and lagoons, and visit <strong data-end=\\\"1749\\\" data-start=\\\"1708\\\">James Bond Island<\\/strong> (Khao Phing Kan), made famous by a Hollywood movie. Lunch will be served during the tour. Return to Phuket in the evening.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"hi Phi Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch\",\"date\":\"05-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2745\\\" data-start=\\\"2646\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day Phi Phi Island Tour by speed boat (National Park Fee included). Visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"2132\\\" data-start=\\\"2091\\\">Phi Phi Islands<\\/strong>, enjoy sightseeing at Maya Bay (subject to regulations), snorkeling in crystal-clear waters, and relax on white sandy beaches. Lunch will be provided during the tour. Return to hotel in the evening.<br \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Phuket.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Phuket\",\"date\":\"06-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2527\\\" data-start=\\\"2404\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2462\\\">Phuket International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2585\\\" data-start=\\\"2529\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"2585\\\" data-start=\\\"2531\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Thailand<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5017\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"35200\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1071\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:05 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1074\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"30100\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5339\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:30 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ibis Styles Krabi Ao Nang\",\"room_type\":\"Junior Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"04\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"23800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Andakira\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"07\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"23600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>✈️ Return Airfare – <strong>Ex- Ranchi</strong></li>\n	<li>🏨 <strong>02 Nights</strong> at <strong>Hotel Ibis Styles Ao Nang</strong>&nbsp;@<strong>Krabi </strong></li>\n	<li>🏨 <strong>03 Nights </strong>at <strong>Hotel Andakira</strong>&nbsp;@<strong>Phuket</strong></li>\n	<li>🛏️ <strong>01&nbsp;Room</strong>&nbsp;on Double Sharing Basis &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🏝️<strong> Krabi 4 Island Tour </strong>with Lunch by Speed Boat <em>(Including National Park Fee) on SIC</em></li>\n	<li>🛥️ <strong>James Bond Island Tour </strong>by Speed Boat with Lunch&nbsp;<em>(Including National Park Fee)&nbsp;on SIC</em></li>\n	<li>🛥️ <strong>Phi Phi Island Tour</strong> by Speed Boat with Lunch&nbsp;<em>(Including National Park Fee)&nbsp;on SIC</em><br />\n	&nbsp;</li>\n	<li><strong>🚗 Transfers (All on Private Basis)</strong></li>\n	<li>🚖 Krabi (KBV) Airport → Krabi Hotel (Arrival Transfer)</li>\n	<li>🚗 Krabi Hotel → Phuket Hotel <em>(En-route Phuket City Tour with Tiger Park)</em></li>\n	<li>✈️ Phuket Hotel → Phuket (HKT) Airport (Departure Transfer)</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":65300,\"land_cost\":\"53200\",\"hotel_cost\":47400,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":165900,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 23226\",\"selling_price\":189126}', 'MZQ/0797/022026', 190120, 95060, 88920, '2026-02-24 06:54:52', '2026-02-24 06:56:28', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(812, 'Ms Farha', 'Ritika Bhadani', '9971405019', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-05-06', 6, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL \\u2013 HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"06-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"263\\\" data-start=\\\"230\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, meet our guide holding a placard with your name and proceed to your hotel (transfer time approx. 50\\u201360 minutes). Standard check-in time is <strong data-end=\\\"417\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">14:00 hrs<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"421\\\" data-start=\\\"418\\\" \\/>\\nLater, begin your half-day Hanoi city tour with a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"508\\\" data-start=\\\"484\\\">Temple of Literature<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s first university built in 1070. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"582\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">Hoan Kiem Lake<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"606\\\" data-start=\\\"587\\\">Ngoc Son Temple<\\/strong>, located on a small island in the heart of the city. Enjoy the tranquil surroundings and learn about the famous legend of the Returned Sword. End the tour with a cup of traditional Vietnamese coffee at a street-side caf\\u00e9, observing the everyday life of Hanoi.<br data-end=\\\"869\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"879\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"887\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"906\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY TAM COC \\u2013 BICH DONG \\u2013 HOA LU\",\"date\":\"07-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Ninh Binh Province<\\/strong>. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1041\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\">Hoa Lu<\\/strong>, the ancient capital of Vietnam from the 10th century, and explore the historic temples dedicated to King Dinh Tien Hoang and King Le Dai Hanh. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"1218\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\">Bich Dong Pagoda<\\/strong>, a beautiful cave pagoda nestled into the limestone mountains.<br data-end=\\\"1284\\\" data-start=\\\"1281\\\" \\/>\\nIn the afternoon, enjoy a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"1348\\\" data-start=\\\"1317\\\">sampan boat ride at Tam Coc<\\/strong>, cruising through emerald rice fields and limestone caves, often referred to as the \\u201cInland Ha Long Bay.\\u201d<br data-end=\\\"1457\\\" data-start=\\\"1454\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1467\\\" data-start=\\\"1457\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1480\\\" data-start=\\\"1477\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1499\\\" data-start=\\\"1480\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI \\u2013 HA LONG BAY | OVERNIGHT CRUISE\",\"date\":\"08-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, depart for <strong data-end=\\\"1612\\\" data-start=\\\"1597\\\">Ha Long Bay<\\/strong> (approx. 2.5 hours\\u2019 drive). Upon arrival, board your cruise and enjoy a welcome drink followed by lunch while sailing through the spectacular limestone karsts. Spend the afternoon exploring caves, kayaking, or relaxing on the sundeck as per cruise itinerary. Dinner is served onboard while the cruise anchors overnight in the bay.<br data-end=\\\"1946\\\" data-start=\\\"1943\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1956\\\" data-start=\\\"1946\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch, Dinner<br data-end=\\\"1984\\\" data-start=\\\"1981\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2003\\\" data-start=\\\"1984\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Ha Long Bay Cruise<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HA LONG \\u2013 HANOI \\u2013 DA NANG\",\"date\":\"09-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Wake up to a serene sunrise over Ha Long Bay. Enjoy breakfast or brunch onboard while cruising back to the harbor. Disembark and transfer back to <strong data-end=\\\"2228\\\" data-start=\\\"2219\\\">Hanoi<\\/strong>. Later, proceed to Noi Bai Airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2294\\\" data-start=\\\"2283\\\">Da Nang<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2298\\\" data-start=\\\"2295\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival in Da Nang, meet our local guide and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<br data-end=\\\"2387\\\" data-start=\\\"2384\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2397\\\" data-start=\\\"2387\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch \\/ Brunch<br data-end=\\\"2426\\\" data-start=\\\"2423\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2445\\\" data-start=\\\"2426\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAM THANH COCONUT VILLAGE \\u2013 HOI AN CITY TOUR & LANTERN RELEASE\",\"date\":\"10-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2598\\\" data-start=\\\"2569\\\">Cam Thanh Coconut Village<\\/strong>. Experience a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2625\\\">basket boat ride<\\/strong>, learn local fishing techniques, and paddle through coconut palm waterways once used during the war.<br data-end=\\\"2749\\\" data-start=\\\"2746\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the charming ancient town of <strong data-end=\\\"2801\\\" data-start=\\\"2791\\\">Hoi An<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"2872\\\" data-start=\\\"2845\\\">Japanese Covered Bridge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2894\\\" data-start=\\\"2874\\\">Tan Ky Old House<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2910\\\" data-start=\\\"2896\\\">Ong Temple<\\/strong>, Museum of Trade Ceramics, and the vibrant local market. In the evening, enjoy a peaceful boat ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"3032\\\" data-start=\\\"3018\\\">Hoai River<\\/strong> and release lanterns for good luck.<br data-end=\\\"3071\\\" data-start=\\\"3068\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3081\\\" data-start=\\\"3071\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3094\\\" data-start=\\\"3091\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3113\\\" data-start=\\\"3094\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY BA NA HILLS \\u2013 GOLDEN BRIDGE\",\"date\":\"11-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3224\\\" data-start=\\\"3209\\\">Ba Na Hills<\\/strong> via scenic coastal roads. Ride the world-famous cable car holding Guinness World Records for height and length. Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"3371\\\" data-start=\\\"3354\\\">Golden Bridge<\\/strong>, supported by giant stone hands, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"3438\\\" data-start=\\\"3417\\\">Le Jardin d\\u2019Amour<\\/strong>, French village remains, and <strong data-end=\\\"3487\\\" data-start=\\\"3468\\\">Linh Ung Pagoda<\\/strong>. Continue to the peak of <strong data-end=\\\"3530\\\" data-start=\\\"3513\\\">Chua Mountain<\\/strong> for panoramic views of Da Nang city before returning by cable car.<br data-end=\\\"3600\\\" data-start=\\\"3597\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3610\\\" data-start=\\\"3600\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3623\\\" data-start=\\\"3620\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3642\\\" data-start=\\\"3623\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"12-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy free time until transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3777\\\" data-start=\\\"3744\\\">Da Nang International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey, carrying beautiful memories of Vietnam.<br data-end=\\\"3845\\\" data-start=\\\"3842\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3855\\\" data-start=\\\"3845\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1633\",\"dep_date\"