(813, 'Mr Vinayak Toppo', 'Harmu', '9971405019', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-05-06', 6, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL \\u2013 HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"06-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>On arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"263\\\" data-start=\\\"230\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, meet our guide holding a placard with your name and proceed to your hotel (transfer time approx. 50\\u201360 minutes). Standard check-in time is <strong data-end=\\\"417\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">14:00 hrs<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"421\\\" data-start=\\\"418\\\" \\/>\\nLater, begin your half-day Hanoi city tour with a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"508\\\" data-start=\\\"484\\\">Temple of Literature<\\/strong>, Vietnam\\u2019s first university built in 1070. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"582\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">Hoan Kiem Lake<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"606\\\" data-start=\\\"587\\\">Ngoc Son Temple<\\/strong>, located on a small island in the heart of the city. Enjoy the tranquil surroundings and learn about the famous legend of the Returned Sword. End the tour with a cup of traditional Vietnamese coffee at a street-side caf\\u00e9, observing the everyday life of Hanoi.<br data-end=\\\"869\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"879\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> None<br data-end=\\\"887\\\" data-start=\\\"884\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"906\\\" data-start=\\\"887\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY TAM COC \\u2013 BICH DONG \\u2013 HOA LU\",\"date\":\"07-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Ninh Binh Province<\\/strong>. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1041\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\">Hoa Lu<\\/strong>, the ancient capital of Vietnam from the 10th century, and e