ile cruising back to the harbor. Disembark and transfer back to <strong data-end=\\\"2228\\\" data-start=\\\"2219\\\">Hanoi<\\/strong>. Later, proceed to Noi Bai Airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"2294\\\" data-start=\\\"2283\\\">Da Nang<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"2298\\\" data-start=\\\"2295\\\" \\/>\\nUpon arrival in Da Nang, meet our local guide and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<br data-end=\\\"2387\\\" data-start=\\\"2384\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2397\\\" data-start=\\\"2387\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast, Lunch \\/ Brunch<br data-end=\\\"2426\\\" data-start=\\\"2423\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2445\\\" data-start=\\\"2426\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"CAM THANH COCONUT VILLAGE \\u2013 HOI AN CITY TOUR & LANTERN RELEASE\",\"date\":\"10-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"2598\\\" data-start=\\\"2569\\\">Cam Thanh Coconut Village<\\/strong>. Experience a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2625\\\">basket boat ride<\\/strong>, learn local fishing techniques, and paddle through coconut palm waterways once used during the war.<br data-end=\\\"2749\\\" data-start=\\\"2746\\\" \\/>\\nLater, visit the charming ancient town of <strong data-end=\\\"2801\\\" data-start=\\\"2791\\\">Hoi An<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Explore the <strong data-end=\\\"2872\\\" data-start=\\\"2845\\\">Japanese Covered Bridge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2894\\\" data-start=\\\"2874\\\">Tan Ky Old House<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2910\\\" data-start=\\\"2896\\\">Ong Temple<\\/strong>, Museum of Trade Ceramics, and the vibrant local market. In the evening, enjoy a peaceful boat ride on the <strong data-end=\\\"3032\\\" data-start=\\\"3018\\\">Hoai River<\\/strong> and release lanterns for good luck.<br data-end=\\\"3071\\\" data-start=\\\"3068\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3081\\\" data-start=\\\"3071\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3094\\\" data-start=\\\"3091\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3113\\\" data-start=\\\"3094\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY BA NA HILLS \\u2013 GOLDEN BRIDGE\",\"date\":\"11-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3224\\\" data-start=\\\"3209\\\">Ba Na Hills<\\/strong> via scenic coastal roads. Ride the world-famous cable car holding Guinness World Records for height and length. Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"3371\\\" data-start=\\\"3354\\\">Golden Bridge<\\/strong>, supported by giant stone hands, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"3438\\\" data-start=\\\"3417\\\">Le Jardin d\\u2019Amour<\\/strong>, French village remains, and <strong data-end=\\\"3487\\\" data-start=\\\"3468\\\">Linh Ung Pagoda<\\/strong>. Continue to the peak of <strong data-end=\\\"3530\\\" data-start=\\\"3513\\\">Chua Mountain<\\/strong> for panoramic views of Da Nang city before returning by cable car.<br data-end=\\\"3600\\\" data-start=\\\"3597\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3610\\\" data-start=\\\"3600\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3623\\\" data-start=\\\"3620\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3642\\\" data-start=\\\"3623\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DA NANG DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"12-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy free time until transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3777\\\" data-start=\\\"3744\\\">Da Nang International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey, carrying beautiful memories of Vietnam.<br data-end=\\\"3845\\\" data-start=\\\"3842\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"3855\\\" data-start=\\\"3845\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1633\",\"dep_date\":\"06 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"06 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":60876},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"6071\",\"dep_date\":\"09 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"09 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"28000\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Da Nang (DAD)\",\"to\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"6037\",\"dep_date\":\"12 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"64000\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Ho Chi Minh (SGN)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Vietnam Airlines\",\"fno\":\"977\",\"dep_date\":\"12 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"06\\/05\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL TK123\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"room_type\":\"Family Suite\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"08\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HALONG BAY\",\"hotel_name\":\"VERDURE LOTUS CLASSIC\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe 1st floor\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"09\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"DA NANG\",\"hotel_name\":\"HOTEL COSMOS\",\"room_type\":\"Grand Deluxe Ocean view\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"12\\/05\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9},{\"age\":9}]', NULL, '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":152876,\"land_cost\":\"203412\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"10400\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":366688,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 47669.44\",\"selling_price\":414357.4400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0799/022026', 414580, 113770, 93520, '2026-02-25 06:51:48', '2026-02-25 06:51:48', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(814, 'Mr KC Dey', 'Shanky', '7781000140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KASHMIR 3*', '2026-04-08', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar \\u2013 Local Sightseeing + Houseboat Stay\",\"date\":\"08-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1007\\\" data-start=\\\"375\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"427\\\" data-start=\\\"386\\\">Srinagar International Airport<\\/strong>, where you will be received by our representative and transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"538\\\" data-start=\\\"497\\\">Srinagar House Boat<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<br \\/>\\nDay at leisure for relaxation.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1009\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Dinner at Houseboat<br data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"1031\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Houseboat in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"09-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1673\\\" data-start=\\\"1132\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1201\\\" data-start=\\\"1160\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong> (approx. 89 km \\/ 2\\u20132.5 hrs), known as the \\u201cValley of Shepherds.\\u201d Enroute visit Pampore saffron fields and <strong data-end=\\\"1349\\\" data-start=\\\"1308\\\">Awantipora Ruins<\\/strong>. Enjoy scenic countryside views, Mattan Temple, apple orchards, and the Lidder River. Optional activities include rafting and pony rides (own cost). Visit <strong data-end=\\\"1548\\\" data-start=\\\"1505\\\">Chandanwari<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1593\\\" data-start=\\\"1550\\\">Betaab Valley<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1642\\\" data-start=\\\"1599\\\">Aru Valley<\\/strong> by union vehicle (own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1748\\\" data-start=\\\"1675\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"1708\\\" data-start=\\\"1705\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Pahalgam<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam \\u2013 Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"10-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"1801\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1872\\\" data-start=\\\"1829\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong> (approx. 140 km \\/ 3\\u20133.5 hrs), the \\u201cMeadow of Flowers\\u201d at 2730 meters above sea level. Gulmarg is famous for skiing and the world\\u2019s highest golf course (activities at own cost). Enjoy optional visit to Drung Waterfall (union vehicle at own cost) and experience the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2187\\\" data-start=\\\"2144\\\">Gulmarg Gondola<\\/strong> cable car ride (not included). Visit handicraft emporiums for shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2335\\\" data-start=\\\"2263\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"2296\\\" data-start=\\\"2293\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Gulmarg<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2443\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2346\\\" data-start=\\\"2337\\\">Note:<\\/strong> During heavy snowfall, transfer from Tangmarg to Gulmarg may require a chain vehicle (own cost).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"11-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2627\\\" data-start=\\\"2496\\\">After breakfast, drive back to <strong data-end=\\\"2570\\\" data-start=\\\"2527\\\">Srinagar<\\/strong>. After Check-in, proceed for local sightseeing covering the famous Mughal Gardens including <strong data-end=\\\"677\\\" data-start=\\\"636\\\">Nishat Bagh<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"679\\\">Shalimar Bagh<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"767\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\">Chashme Shahi<\\/strong>. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"816\\\" data-start=\\\"775\\\">Pari Mahal<\\/strong> (union vehicle required for last 1 km) and <strong data-end=\\\"901\\\" data-start=\\\"860\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>.<br \\/>\\nLater enjoy a 01-hour Shikara ride on the famous <strong data-end=\\\"993\\\" data-start=\\\"952\\\">Dal Lake<\\/strong> (included)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2702\\\" data-start=\\\"2629\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"2662\\\" data-start=\\\"2659\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"12-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3161\\\" data-start=\\\"2766\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"2862\\\" data-start=\\\"2819\\\">Sonmarg<\\/strong> (approx. 104 km \\/ 2\\u20132.5 hrs). Enjoy scenic views of the Sindh River and optional rafting (own cost). Take a pony ride to <strong data-end=\\\"3027\\\" data-start=\\\"2984\\\">Thajiwas Glacier<\\/strong> (own cost) and visit Zero Point by union vehicle (own cost), where snow remains throughout the year. Return to Srinagar by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3236\\\" data-start=\\\"3163\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast &amp; Dinner at Hotel<br data-end=\\\"3196\\\" data-start=\\\"3193\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udecf Overnight Stay at Hotel in Srinagar<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Airport Drop\",\"date\":\"13-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3496\\\" data-start=\\\"3292\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"3393\\\" data-start=\\\"3350\\\">Srinagar International Airport<\\/strong> for your onward flight. Guests are advised to reach the airport at least 2 hours prior to departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3592\\\" data-start=\\\"3498\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d Breakfast Included<br data-end=\\\"3522\\\" data-start=\\\"3519\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"3592\\\" data-start=\\\"3524\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful &amp; Long-Lasting Memories of Kashmir<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1047\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":20724},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1017\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6042\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"fare\":18556},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"08\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Houseboat Young Morning Star \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"09\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"09\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Queens Park \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"10\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"10\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Zahgeer Continental \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"11\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"11\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Shelter Heritage \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"13\\/04\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️Return Flight&nbsp;<strong><em>Ex- Ranchi.</em></strong><br />\n<br />\n🏨 01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;at&nbsp;<em><strong>Houseboat Young Morning Star&nbsp; – Srinagar&nbsp;</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01 Night at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Queens Park&nbsp;– Pahalgam</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;at<em><strong>&nbsp;Hotel Zahgeer Continental – Gulmarg&nbsp;</strong></em>&nbsp;<br />\n🏨 02&nbsp;Nights at<em><strong>&nbsp;Hotel Shelter Heritage – Srinagar &nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n\n<p>🍽 Meal Plan:&nbsp;<em><strong>MAP (Breakfast + Dinner)</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>🍽Accommodation on&nbsp;<em><strong>01&nbsp;Double Room Basis</strong></em><br />\n🚗 Private Transfers:&nbsp;<strong>Etios/Similar&nbsp;</strong><em><strong>for full itinerary &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🛶<em><strong>&nbsp;01 Hour Shikara Ride in Dal Lake &nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🧰 Medical Kit in Taxi &nbsp;<br />\n👨‍✈️ Driver Charges, Toll, Parking Included &nbsp;<br />\n🤝 Meet &amp; Assist on Arrival/Departure &nbsp;<br />\n🛬 Srinagar Airport Pickup &amp; Drop &nbsp;<br />\n✅ All&nbsp;<em><strong>Applicable Taxes</strong></em>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":39280,\"land_cost\":\"37700\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":76980,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15396\",\"selling_price\":92376}', 'MZQ/0800/022026', 92920, 46460, 0, '2026-02-26 12:02:28', '2026-03-28 06:23:12', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(815, 'Mr. Rishi', 'VK Barnwal | SBI', '9955135345', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Andaman 4*', '2026-04-17', 7, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Port Blair \\u2013 Corbyn\\u2019s Cove & Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"17-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"359\\\" data-start=\\\"141\\\">Arrive at Port Blair Airport, where our representative will greet you and assist with your hotel transfer. After check-in and some rest, head out to <strong data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"290\\\">Corbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach<\\/strong> for a relaxing coastal drive and photo stops.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"551\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">In the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"426\\\" data-start=\\\"387\\\">Sound &amp; Light Show at Cellular Jail<\\/strong>, which narrates the inspiring story of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. After the show, return to your hotel for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair to Havelock Island \\u2013 Visit Radhanagar Beach\",\"date\":\"18-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"344\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">Today, we head to one of the most stunning destinations in the Andaman Islands \\u2013 <em data-end=\\\"254\\\" data-start=\\\"237\\\">Havelock Island<\\/em>, often ranked as the best island in India. Transfer by ferry from Port Blair to Havelock.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"596\\\" data-start=\\\"346\\\">On arrival, our local representative will receive you and assist with your hotel check-in. After some rest, visit the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"497\\\" data-start=\\\"477\\\">Radhanagar Beach<\\/strong>, known for its pristine white sands and turquoise waters \\u2013 often listed among Asia\\u2019s best beaches.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"724\\\" data-start=\\\"598\\\">Spend time here soaking in the beauty and stay until sunset before returning to your resort to relax and unwind for the night.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock Island \\u2013 Excursion to Elephant Beach with Snorkeling\",\"date\":\"19-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"485\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">After breakfast, gear up for an exciting adventure to <strong data-end=\\\"234\\\" data-start=\\\"216\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, one of Havelock Island\\u2019s most popular spots for water activities. A scenic 30-minute boat ride brings you to this vibrant beach, home to one of the island\\u2019s best coral reefs. The reef begins at just a meter in depth, making it perfect for beginners.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"735\\\" data-start=\\\"487\\\">Relax on the beach and enjoy the tropical surroundings. Later, experience a <strong data-end=\\\"599\\\" data-start=\\\"563\\\">complimentary snorkeling session<\\/strong> guided by professionals (subject to local association guidelines), offering a glimpse into the rich underwater life of the Andaman Sea.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"892\\\" data-start=\\\"737\\\">After the activity, return by boat to the Havelock jetty. Our team will be there to receive you and transfer you back to your hotel for a relaxing evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"976\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\"><em data-end=\\\"976\\\" data-start=\\\"894\\\">Note: Our local team at Havelock will be available for any on-ground assistance.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure Day in Havelock \\u2013 Optional Activities\",\"date\":\"20-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"380\\\" data-start=\\\"173\\\">Today is a <strong data-end=\\\"207\\\" data-start=\\\"184\\\">free day at leisure<\\/strong>. You can relax at your resort, stroll along the beach, or explore the island at your own pace. This day is ideal for unwinding and soaking in the serene beauty of Havelock.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"698\\\" data-start=\\\"382\\\">\\ud83d\\udee5\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"415\\\" data-start=\\\"386\\\">Optional Tour Suggestion:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"418\\\" data-start=\\\"415\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"434\\\" data-start=\\\"418\\\">Scuba Diving<\\/strong> \\u2013 Explore the mesmerizing underwater world of the Andaman Sea. Havelock is one of the top diving destinations in India, perfect for both beginners and certified divers. You can book a guided diving session with professional instructors (additional charges apply).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"794\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\">Let us know if you\\u2019d like assistance in planning or booking any optional activity for the day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock to Neil Island \\u2013 Natural Rock Formation, Bharatpur Beach & Laxmanpur Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"21-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"389\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and head to the jetty to board a premium cruise to <strong data-end=\\\"292\\\" data-start=\\\"277\\\">Neil Island<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, our representative will assist you with the transfer and check-in at your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"806\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\">Begin your exploration with a visit to the island\\u2019s unique <strong data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"450\\\">Natural Rock Formation<\\/strong>, a must-see attraction formed by years of erosion. Next, visit <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"540\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its shallow waters and vibrant marine life\\u2014perfect for swimming and optional water activities like <strong data-end=\\\"686\\\" data-start=\\\"670\\\">Scuba Diving<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"699\\\" data-start=\\\"688\\\">Jet Ski<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"731\\\" data-start=\\\"705\\\">Glass Bottom Boat Ride<\\/strong>. You\\u2019ll also find local food stalls to enjoy a light meal or refreshments.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1034\\\" data-start=\\\"808\\\">In the evening, visit the tranquil <strong data-end=\\\"862\\\" data-start=\\\"843\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, just 2 km from the jetty, to witness a mesmerizing <strong data-end=\\\"925\\\" data-start=\\\"915\\\">sunset<\\/strong> over the Arabian Sea. After this peaceful end to the day, return to your hotel for a relaxed overnight stay.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island to Port Blair by Cruise \\u2013 Evening Local Shopping Experience\",\"date\":\"22-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"402\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">After breakfast, check out from your hotel and proceed to the <strong data-end=\\\"228\\\" data-start=\\\"207\\\">Neil Island jetty<\\/strong> to board your cruise back to <strong data-end=\\\"272\\\" data-start=\\\"258\\\">Port Blair<\\/strong>. On arrival, our representative will meet you at the jetty and assist with your transfer to the hotel for check-in and some rest.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"649\\\" data-start=\\\"404\\\">Later in the evening, head out for a <strong data-end=\\\"464\\\" data-start=\\\"441\\\">local shopping tour<\\/strong>. Explore popular markets known for <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"500\\\">coral artifacts, handmade crafts, shell-based souvenirs<\\/strong>, and other unique items\\u2014perfect for picking up gifts and mementos for friends and family.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"651\\\">After a relaxed shopping experience, return to your hotel for your <strong data-end=\\\"756\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\">overnight stay in Port Blair<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ross Island Boat Ride Tour\",\"date\":\"23-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"342\\\" data-start=\\\"87\\\">Begin the day with a pickup from your hotel in <strong data-end=\\\"175\\\" data-start=\\\"134\\\">Port Blair<\\/strong> and transfer to the jetty. Proceed on a short boat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"276\\\" data-start=\\\"235\\\">Ross Island<\\/strong>, officially known as <strong data-end=\\\"339\\\" data-start=\\\"298\\\">Netaji Subhash Chandra Bose Island<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"344\\\">Explore the historic ruins of the former British administrative headquarters, including old churches, cemeteries, colonial buildings, and bakeries\\u2014now beautifully entwined with roots and greenery. The island is also home to friendly spotted deer and peacocks, adding to its scenic charm.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"717\\\" data-start=\\\"635\\\">After sightseeing, return by boat to Port Blair and transfer back to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"775\\\" data-start=\\\"719\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Drop to the Airport\",\"date\":\"24-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"223\\\" data-start=\\\"81\\\">Check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport to return home with sweet memories of this exotic destination.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"550\\\" data-start=\\\"225\\\">Please note that hotels typically have an early check-out time. If your flight is scheduled for the afternoon, you can leave your luggage safely at the hotel reception kiosk. Should you wish to explore any attractions during your free time before your departure, please let us know\\u2014we\\u2019ll be happy to assist with arrangements.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6356\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:20 PM\",\"fare\":24153},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2793\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"38100\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Bay Walk By Sea Side\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel De Havelock Queen\",\"city\":\"Havelock\",\"room_type\":\"Coastal Pool View\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"21\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Silver Pearl Beach Resort\",\"city\":\"Neil Island\",\"room_type\":\"Sea View Deluxe Cottage\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/04\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Port Blair\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Bay Walk By Sea Side\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/04\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<ul>\n	<li>✈️ Return Airfare<em><strong> Ex-Bengaluru</strong></em></li>\n	<li>🏨 Accommodation in <em><strong>Port Blair, Havelock &amp; Neil &nbsp;</strong></em></li>\n	<li>🛏 1 Double Sharing Room&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🍽 <em><strong>Daily Breakfast</strong></em> (except arrival day) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🤿 <strong>Complimentary Snorkeling at Havelock &nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>🍽 <strong>10% Off at Sea View Restaurant </strong>- Seafood Delights (Top 3 Casual Dining in India) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>👋 <strong>Meet &amp; Greet at Airport</strong> &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🚖 <strong>All Sightseeing in Private AC Vehicle</strong> – Point to Point &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>⛴ <strong>Private Catamaran Transfers</strong> – Nautika (Luxury) / Makruzz (Premium) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🕐<strong> Ferry Timings: 7:30 / 8:00 / 8:30 AM </strong>(subject to availability) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🛬 <strong>Airport Pick-up &amp; Drop included </strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>🎟 All Entry, <strong>Ferry &amp; Permit Charges &nbsp;</strong></li>\n	<li>🥡 <strong>Packed Breakfast for early departures </strong>&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>👤<strong> Dedicated Tour Coordinator &amp; On-Ground Assistance&nbsp; by Multi Zone Travels</strong></li>\n	<li>🚗 Vehicle Type: Hyryder / Ertiga / Xylo / Scorpio / Winger (AC, Point to Point) &nbsp;</li>\n	<li>✅ <strong>All Taxes included &nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":62253,\"land_cost\":\"78141\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":140394,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 21059.1\",\"selling_price\":161453.10000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0801/022026', 161520, 57770, 45980, '2026-02-27 13:35:59', '2026-03-05 11:13:39', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(816, 'Dr Sabita', 'Sumit Dwivedi', '9850869140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL THAILAND', '2026-06-01', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok + Evening Chao Phraya Cruise Dinner\",\"date\":\"01-06-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"335\\\" data-start=\\\"166\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> Airport. After completing immigration formalities, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel for check-in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"626\\\" data-start=\\\"337\\\">In the evening, proceed for a memorable dinner cruise on the <strong data-end=\\\"439\\\" data-start=\\\"398\\\">Chao Phraya River<\\/strong> aboard the <strong data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"451\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>. Enjoy a delicious buffet dinner while cruising past beautifully illuminated landmarks of Bangkok with live music and scenic views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"676\\\" data-start=\\\"628\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Dinner<br data-end=\\\"648\\\" data-start=\\\"645\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"02-06-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1898\\\" data-start=\\\"1778\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1806\\\">Safari World<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s popular open zoo and leisure park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1910\\\" data-start=\\\"1900\\\">Explore:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1982\\\" data-start=\\\"1913\\\">Safari Park \\u2013 drive through and witness animals in natural habitats<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2085\\\" data-start=\\\"1985\\\">Marine Park \\u2013 enjoy entertaining shows including dolphins, sea lions, stunt performances, and more<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2143\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">Enjoy lunch at the park before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2204\\\" data-start=\\\"2145\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2176\\\" data-start=\\\"2173\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Half Day Bangkok City Tour \\u2013 Pattaya Arrival in Evening\",\"date\":\"03-06-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1617\\\" data-start=\\\"1333\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a half-day city tour of <strong data-end=\\\"1427\\\" data-start=\\\"1386\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. Visit famous temples including <strong data-end=\\\"1501\\\" data-start=\\\"1460\\\">Wat Traimit<\\/strong> (Temple of the Golden Buddha) and <strong data-end=\\\"1577\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Wat Pho<\\/strong>, home to the famous Reclining Buddha.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1759\\\" data-start=\\\"1619\\\">Later, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1681\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> (approx. 2\\u20132.5 hours drive). Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1812\\\" data-start=\\\"1761\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1784\\\" data-start=\\\"1781\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure Day in Pattaya\",\"date\":\"04-06-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2243\\\" data-start=\\\"1904\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a day at leisure in <strong data-end=\\\"1990\\\" data-start=\\\"1947\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong>. Relax at Pattaya Beach, explore local caf\\u00e9s, or enjoy shopping at <strong data-end=\\\"2101\\\" data-start=\\\"2058\\\">Central Festival Pattaya<\\/strong>. In the evening, you may explore the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2189\\\" data-start=\\\"2146\\\">Walking Street Pattaya<\\/strong>, known for its vibrant nightlife and entertainment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2296\\\" data-start=\\\"2245\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2268\\\" data-start=\\\"2265\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour with Lunch\",\"date\":\"05-06-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"918\\\" data-start=\\\"636\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an exciting tour to <strong data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"685\\\">Coral Island<\\/strong> (Koh Larn) by speedboat. Enjoy the crystal-clear waters and white sandy beaches. You may opt for water sports activities such as parasailing, jet skiing, or banana boat rides (at own cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1020\\\" data-start=\\\"920\\\">Later, enjoy a delicious Indian\\/Local lunch before returning to Pattaya. Evening free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1081\\\" data-start=\\\"1022\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<br data-end=\\\"1053\\\" data-start=\\\"1050\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Leisure Day in Pattaya\",\"date\":\"06-06-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3203\\\" data-start=\\\"2892\\\">After breakfast, enjoy another day at leisure in <strong data-end=\\\"2984\\\" data-start=\\\"2941\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong>. You may explore attractions such as <strong data-end=\\\"3065\\\" data-start=\\\"3022\\\">Sanctuary of Truth<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3110\\\" data-start=\\\"3067\\\">Nong Nooch Tropical Garden<\\/strong>, or the <strong data-end=\\\"3162\\\" data-start=\\\"3119\\\">Pattaya Floating Market<\\/strong> (all optional and at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3256\\\" data-start=\\\"3205\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3228\\\" data-start=\\\"3225\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2937\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2850\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok Airport Departure\",\"date\":\"07-06-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3493\\\" data-start=\\\"3361\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"3466\\\" data-start=\\\"3423\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3553\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"3495\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"3551\\\" data-start=\\\"3497\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Thailand<\\/strong> \\u2728<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1051\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:40 AM\",\"fare\":38520},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1052\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"01:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"fare\":38400}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Grand Mercure Bangkok Atrium\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sunbeam Hotel Pattaya\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"07\\/06\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"28600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️ Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Mumbai .</strong></em><br />\n🏨&nbsp;<strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Grand Mercure Bangkok Atrium.</strong></em><br />\n🏨&nbsp;<strong>04&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Sunbeam, Pattaya.</strong></em><br />\n🛏 01 Room on&nbsp;<em><strong>DBL Sharing</strong></em></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🎟️</span> Sightseeing &amp; Activities</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span