(817, 'MR SIMERJEET SINGH', 'Hazaribagh', '9431163323', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL THAILAND', '2026-03-26', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok \\u2013 Pattaya\",\"date\":\"26-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"140\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"192\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> Airport. After immigration formalities, meet our representative and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"273\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> (approx. 2\\u20132.5 hours drive). Upon arrival, check-in at the hotel and relax. The evening is free at leisure to explore Pattaya Beach or enjoy the vibrant nightlife on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: None<br data-end=\\\"512\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure in Pattaya\",\"date\":\"27-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"609\\\" data-start=\\\"85\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, the day is free for you to relax and explore&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"201\\\" data-start=\\\"160\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong>&nbsp;at your own pace. You may unwind at Pattaya Beach, enjoy water activities, explore local caf\\u00e9s, or indulge in shopping at popular malls like Central Festival. In the evening, you can visit the famous Walking Street for vibrant nightlife, entertainment shows, and seaside dining experiences. Optional activities such as Alcazar Show, Tiffany Show, or spa treatments can also be arranged at additional cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"660\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"634\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok\",\"date\":\"28-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1913\\\" data-start=\\\"1702\\\">After breakfast, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1786\\\" data-start=\\\"1745\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, check-in at the hotel. The remaining day is free to relax or explore nearby shopping malls and local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1966\\\" data-start=\\\"1915\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1938\\\" data-start=\\\"1935\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure + Shopping\",\"date\":\"29-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"575\\\" data-start=\\\"95\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, the day is free to explore <strong data-end=\\\"193\\\" data-start=\\\"152\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> at your own pace. You may indulge in shopping at world-class malls like <strong data-end=\\\"307\\\" data-start=\\\"266\\\">ICONSIAM<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"353\\\" data-start=\\\"312\\\">MBK Center<\\/strong>, offering a mix of luxury brands and local bargains. If you\\u2019re visiting over the weekend, the famous <strong data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"455\\\">Chatuchak Weekend Market<\\/strong> is perfect for souvenirs, fashion, handicrafts, and street food experiences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">You may also explore local street markets, enjoy a traditional Thai massage, or relax at a caf\\u00e9 while soaking in the vibrant city atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"771\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"722\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"745\\\" data-start=\\\"742\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"30-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1898\\\" data-start=\\\"1778\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1806\\\">Safari World<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s popular open zoo and leisure park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1910\\\" data-start=\\\"1900\\\">Explore:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1982\\\" data-start=\\\"1913\\\">Safari Park \\u2013 drive through and witness animals in natural habitats<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2085\\\" data-start=\\\"1985\\\">Marine Park \\u2013 enjoy entertaining shows including dolphins, sea lions, stunt performances, and more<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2143\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">Enjoy lunch at the park before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2204\\\" data-start=\\\"2145\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2176\\\" data-start=\\\"2173\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure + Shopping (Bangkok)\",\"date\":\"31-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2766\\\" data-start=\\\"2666\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Bangkok Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2790\\\" data-start=\\\"2768\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2848\\\" data-start=\\\"2792\\\">\\u2728 Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Thailand \\u2728<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2937\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2850\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Gaya (GAY)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"328\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:15 PM\",\"fare\":66536},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai\",\"fno\":\"313\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 PM