nces</span></span></span></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":\"109000\",\"land_cost\":\"29100\",\"hotel_cost\":149761,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":287861,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 37421.93\",\"selling_price\":325282.9299999999930150806903839111328125}', 'MZQ/0803/032026', 341540, 108880, 61890, '2026-03-03 07:57:28', '2026-03-05 11:09:00', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(818, 'Mr. Vivek Kishore', 'Shankar Vidhayrthi', '8271096699', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL North 4*', '2026-03-19', 4, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Transfer to Gangtok\",\"date\":\"19-03-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, you will be received and transferred to <strong data-end=\\\"152\\\" data-start=\\\"111\\\">Gangtok<\\/strong>, the beautiful capital of Sikkim. The scenic drive passes through winding mountain roads, lush green valleys, and alongside the Teesta River, offering a pleasant introduction to the natural beauty of the region. After reaching Gangtok, check in at the hotel and take some time to relax after the journey. In the evening, you may enjoy a leisurely walk along <strong data-end=\\\"552\\\" data-start=\\\"511\\\">MG Marg<\\/strong>, the vibrant heart of the city known for its caf\\u00e9s, restaurants, and local shops.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Gangtok.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok to Lachung\",\"date\":\"20-03-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, begin your journey towards <strong data-end=\\\"794\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\">Lachung<\\/strong>, a picturesque mountain village located in North Sikkim at an altitude of around 8,600 feet. The drive takes you through breathtaking Himalayan landscapes, dense forests, and charming mountain villages. Along the way, stop at <strong data-end=\\\"1062\\\" data-start=\\\"1021\\\">Singhik Viewpoint<\\/strong>, which offers spectacular panoramic views of the surrounding snow-covered peaks. Continue to visit the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"1217\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1176\\\">Seven Sisters Waterfalls<\\/strong> and the serene <strong data-end=\\\"1274\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\">Naga Waterfalls<\\/strong>, both known for their scenic beauty and perfect photo opportunities. Upon arrival in Lachung, check in at the hotel and enjoy the peaceful mountain surroundings.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Lachung.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Lachung \\u2192 Yumthang Valley \\u2192 Zero Point \\u2192 Lachung\",\"date\":\"21-03-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early in the morning, proceed for an excursion to the breathtaking <strong data-end=\\\"1682\\\" data-start=\\\"1641\\\">Yumthang Valley<\\/strong>, famously known as the \\u201cValley of Flowers.\\u201d Located at an altitude of about 12,000 feet, the valley is surrounded by snow-capped peaks, alpine meadows, and pristine natural beauty. The area is well known for its colorful rhododendron blooms during the flowering season and offers magnificent views of the Himalayan landscape. After exploring Yumthang Valley, continue further towards <strong data-end=\\\"2108\\\" data-start=\\\"2067\\\">Zero Point<\\/strong>, situated at approximately 15,300 feet above sea level. This high-altitude destination is famous for its snow-covered surroundings, dramatic mountain scenery, and breathtaking panoramic views, making it one of the highlights of a North Sikkim trip. After enjoying the stunning landscapes and capturing memorable photographs, return to Lachung and spend the evening relaxing amidst the peaceful mountain environment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Lachung.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Lachung \\u2192 Siliguri\",\"date\":\"22-03-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, begin the drive back from <strong data-end=\\\"2486\\\" data-start=\\\"2445\\\">Lachung<\\/strong> to <strong data-end=\\\"2531\\\" data-start=\\\"2490\\\">Siliguri<\\/strong>, enjoying the scenic Himalayan landscapes along the way. The journey offers beautiful views of valleys, rivers, waterfalls, and traditional villages nestled in the mountains. Upon reaching Gangtok, continue your journey towards <strong data-end=\\\"2803\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2760\\\">Siliguri<\\/strong>, gradually descending from the cool mountain region into the plains. The drive offers changing scenery with lush greenery, tea gardens, and river valleys along the route. Upon arrival in Siliguri, check in at the hotel and relax for the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Siliguri.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Siliguri to Departure\",\"date\":\"23-03-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"4178\\\" data-start=\\\"4129\\\">New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP)<\\/strong> for your onward journey.&nbsp;As you depart, take back unforgettable memories of the majestic mountains, serene valleys, and the pristine beauty of Sikkim that you experienced over the past five days.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Tour concludes with beautiful memories of your trip to the Eastern Himalayas.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2026\",\"check_out\":\"20\\/03\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Summit Norling Resort\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room+ 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"rate\":\"10600\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"20\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Lachung\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Jewel Kongchen\",\"rate\":\"23400\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room+ 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/03\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Saffron Crest\",\"city\":\"Siliguri\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Room+ 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"8500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":12},{\"age\":10}]', '<p style=\"display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -9999px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><em><strong>🏨 Accommodation:</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>1 Night&nbsp;Gangtok @ <strong data-end=\"1727\" data-start=\"1696\">Summit Norling Resort &amp; Spa</strong></li>\n	<li>2 Nights Lachung @ <strong data-end=\"1793\" data-start=\"1755\">Hotel Jewel Kongchen Retreat &amp; Spa</strong></li>\n	<li>1 Night Siliguri @ <strong data-end=\"1842\" data-start=\"1819\">Hotel Saffron Crest</strong></li>\n	<li>🍽️ Daily <strong data-end=\"1879\" data-start=\"1857\">Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1935\" data-start=\"1884\"><em><strong>🚗 All transfers &amp; sightseeing by private vehicle</strong></em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"250\" data-start=\"165\">Private&nbsp;for all transfers &amp; sightseeing as per itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"282\" data-start=\"253\">Experienced driver included</li>\n	<li data-end=\"324\" data-start=\"285\">Fuel, parking &amp; toll charges included</li>\n	<li data-end=\"438\" data-start=\"349\">All sightseeing &amp; excursions as per itinerary (Gangtok, Lachung, Yumthang Valley, etc.)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"557\">From&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"592\">New Jalpaiguri Railway Station (NJP)</strong> at start &amp; end of tour</li>\n	<li data-end=\"737\" data-start=\"705\"><em><strong data-end=\"735\" data-start=\"705\">Taxes &amp; Service Charges</strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"display: block; width: 0px; height: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; margin: 0px; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -9999px; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;\">&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"0\",\"hotel_cost\":42500,\"transport_cost\":\"35500\",\"visa_cost\":\"0\",\"travel_insurance\":\"0\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":78000,\"profit_figure\":\"00\",\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11700\",\"selling_price\":89700,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0804/032026', 89440, 34840, 9880, '2026-03-03 08:38:39', '2026-03-10 14:16:10', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(819, 'Ms Farha', 'Ritika Bhadani', '9971405019', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KARNATAKA', '2026-05-02', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangalore \\u2013 Coorg (Approx. 300 kms \\/ 6.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"02-05-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"606\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"212\\\" data-start=\\\"171\\\">Bangalore<\\/strong> Airport or Railway Station and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"296\\\" data-start=\\\"255\\\">Coorg<\\/strong>, a mesmerizing hill station nestled in the lush greenery of the Western Ghats. Also known as Kodagu, this beautiful destination lies at an altitude of around 1452 meters above sea level and is famous worldwide for its aromatic coffee plantations. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax for the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"608\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: As per plan<br data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"630\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Coorg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg \\u2013 Madikeri Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"03-05-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\">After breakfast, proceed for sightseeing in <strong data-end=\\\"838\\\" data-start=\\\"797\\\">Madikeri<\\/strong>. Visit the historic <strong data-end=\\\"900\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\">Omkareshwara Temple<\\/strong>, known for its unique blend of Gothic and Islamic architecture. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"1018\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\">Madikeri Fort<\\/strong> and the scenic <strong data-end=\\\"1075\\\" data-start=\\\"1034\\\">Abbey Falls<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1477\\\" data-start=\\\"1080\\\">Later, visit a coffee plantation such as Mercara Gold Estate or Pappy\\u2019s Coffee Plantation to learn about coffee cultivation and processing. You may also visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1291\\\" data-start=\\\"1250\\\">Coorg Glass Bridge<\\/strong> located inside the plantation area. End the day at <strong data-end=\\\"1384\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\">Raja\'s Seat<\\/strong>, one of the best viewpoints in Coorg offering spectacular sunset views. Return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1530\\\" data-start=\\\"1479\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: As per plan<br data-end=\\\"1504\\\" data-start=\\\"1501\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Coorg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"04-05-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1818\\\" data-start=\\\"1615\\\">After breakfast, proceed to visit <strong data-end=\\\"1692\\\" data-start=\\\"1649\\\">Dubare Elephant Camp<\\/strong>, where you can observe elephants and participate in activities such as feeding, bathing, and grooming (at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2157\\\" data-start=\\\"1820\\\">Later visit <strong data-end=\\\"1875\\\" data-start=\\\"1832\\\">Kaveri Nisargadhama<\\/strong>, a scenic island formed by the River Cauvery and surrounded by lush bamboo groves, making it a popular picnic spot. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"2047\\\" data-start=\\\"2004\\\">Namdroling Monastery<\\/strong>, also known as the Golden Temple, one of the largest Tibetan settlements in South India. Return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2210\\\" data-start=\\\"2159\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: As per plan<br data-end=\\\"2184\\\" data-start=\\\"2181\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Coorg<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg \\u2013 Wayanad (Approx. 130 kms \\/ 3.5 hrs)\",\"date\":\"05-05-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2534\\\" data-start=\\\"2321\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive to <strong data-end=\\\"2419\\\" data-start=\\\"2376\\\">Wayanad<\\/strong>, a picturesque destination known for its waterfalls, wildlife sanctuaries, spice plantations, and ancient caves.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2818\\\" data-start=\\\"2536\\\">En route visit <strong data-end=\\\"2594\\\" data-start=\\\"2551\\\">Banasura Sagar Dam<\\/strong>, the largest earthen dam in India and the second largest in Asia. From the viewpoint at the top, enjoy breathtaking views of the reservoir and surrounding mountains. Upon arrival in Wayanad, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2873\\\" data-start=\\\"2820\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: As per plan<br data-end=\\\"2845\\\" data-start=\\\"2842\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Wayanad<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Wayanad Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"06-05-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3315\\\" data-start=\\\"2960\\\">After breakfast, proceed to visit the ancient <strong data-end=\\\"3049\\\" data-start=\\\"3006\\\">Jain Temple Sulthan Bathery<\\/strong>, built in the 13th century. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"3133\\\" data-start=\\\"3090\\\">Edakkal Caves<\\/strong>, located at an altitude of about 1000 meters on Ambukuthi Hill. The caves are famous for prehistoric carvings believed to be over 5000 years old and require a short trek to reach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3556\\\" data-start=\\\"3317\\\">Later visit <strong data-end=\\\"3372\\\" data-start=\\\"3329\\\">Muthanga Wildlife Sanctuary<\\/strong>, part of the Wayanad Wildlife Sanctuary, where you can enjoy an exciting jeep safari (direct payment basis) and spot wildlife such as elephants, deer, gaur, and occasionally tigers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3732\\\" data-start=\\\"3558\\\">Optional activities include visiting 900 Kandi for an off-road jeep safari, zip-lining at Karlad Lake, paragliding, or trekking (all at additional cost). Return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3787\\\" data-start=\\\"3734\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: As per plan<br data-end=\\\"3759\\\" data-start=\\\"3756\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Wayanad<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Wayanad \\u2013 Bangalore Departure (Approx. 320 kms \\/ 7 hrs)\",\"date\":\"07-05-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<article data-scroll-anchor=\\\"true\\\" data-testid=\\\"conversation-turn-564\\\" data-turn=\\\"assistant\\\" data-turn-id=\\\"2d701673-22b9-49c5-b58b-b3cd98130721\\\" dir=\\\"auto\\\" tabindex=\\\"-1\\\">\\n<p data-end=\\\"4045\\\" data-start=\\\"3910\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"4010\\\" data-start=\\\"3967\\\">Bangalore<\\/strong> Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4107\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"4047\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"4105\\\" data-start=\\\"4049\\\">Tour Ends with Wonderful Memories of Coorg &amp; Wayanad<\\/strong> \\u2728<\\/p>\\n<\\/article>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"810\",\"dep_date\":\"02 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"fare\":29800},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"870\",\"dep_date\":\"07 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:15 PM\",\"fare\":29840}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"COORG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Gokulam Grand\",\"room_type\":\"CANEPHORA ROOM\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"05\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"WAYANAD\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Jungle Bay Resorts & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Pavilion Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/05\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9},{\"age\":7}]', '<p data-end=\"100\" data-start=\"68\">✈ <strong data-end=\"100\" data-start=\"70\">Return Airfare – Ex Ranchi</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"102\">🌿 <strong data-end=\"126\" data-start=\"105\">Coorg – 03&nbsp;Nights</strong><br data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"126\" />\n🏨 <em data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"132\">Hotel Gokulam Grand</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"164\">🌄 <strong data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"167\">Wayanad – 02 Nights</strong><br data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"187\" />\n🏨 <em data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"193\">Hotel Jungle Bay Resorts &amp; Spa</em></p>\n\n<p>🛏 <strong data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"118\">01 Room – Double Sharing</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>➕ 01 Child <em data-end=\"188\" data-start=\"161\">with Extra Bed / Mattress</em></li>\n	<li>➕ 01 Child <em data-end=\"232\" data-start=\"202\">without Extra Bed / Mattress</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"278\">🍳 <strong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"281\">Meal Plan</strong> ✔<br data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"296\" />\n• Daily Breakfast at all hotels<br data-end=\"333\" data-start=\"330\" />\n<em data-end=\"350\" data-start=\"333\">(Except Day 01)</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"354\">🚗 <strong data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"357\">Transfers &amp; Sightseeing</strong> ✔<br data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"386\" />\n• Private AC Vehicle – <em data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"412\">Ertiga</em><br data-end=\"436\" data-start=\"433\" />\n<em data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"436\">(Bangalore to Bangalore)</em><br data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"462\" />\n• Driver Allowance Included<br data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"492\" />\n• Toll, Parking &amp; Fuel Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":59640,\"land_cost\":\"75600\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":135240,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18933.6\",\"selling_price\":154173.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0805/032026', 154400, 49890, 27310, '2026-03-09 13:25:30', '2026-03-09 13:40:10', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(820, 'Ms Shalinee', 'Prabhakar Ramgarh', '9873171167', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BLISSFUL SOUTH', '2026-03-19', 3, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangalore Airport Arrival \\u2013 Coorg \\ud83d\\ude97 Distance: Approx. 270 kms | Travel Time: 5.5 \\u2013 6 Hours\",\"date\":\"19-03-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"564\\\" data-start=\\\"223\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"275\\\" data-start=\\\"234\\\">Bangalore<\\/strong> Airport where you will meet our representative and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"343\\\">Coorg<\\/strong>, one of the most beautiful hill stations in the Western Ghats, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"485\\\" data-start=\\\"466\\\">Scotland of India<\\/em>. The drive takes you through scenic countryside and lush coffee plantations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"786\\\" data-start=\\\"566\\\">Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax. Later you may visit nearby attractions like <strong data-end=\\\"698\\\" data-start=\\\"657\\\">Abbey Falls<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"744\\\" data-start=\\\"703\\\">Raja\'s Seat<\\/strong>, famous for its panoramic sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"839\\\" data-start=\\\"788\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong>Dinner<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"813\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: <strong>Coorg<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"20-03-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1225\\\" data-start=\\\"930\\\">After breakfast, proceed for full-day sightseeing in <strong data-end=\\\"1024\\\" data-start=\\\"983\\\">Coorg<\\/strong>. Visit the historic <strong data-end=\\\"1086\\\" data-start=\\\"1045\\\">Omkareshwara Temple<\\/strong>, followed by a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1152\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\">Dubare Elephant Camp<\\/strong> where you can interact with elephants (activities at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1457\\\" data-start=\\\"1227\\\">Later visit <strong data-end=\\\"1280\\\" data-start=\\\"1239\\\">Kaveri Nisargadhama<\\/strong>, a scenic island formed by the River Cauvery, and the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1385\\\" data-start=\\\"1342\\\">Namdroling Monastery<\\/strong>, also known as the Golden Temple. Return to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1510\\\" data-start=\\\"1459\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong>Breakfast &amp;&nbsp;Dinner<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1484\\\" data-start=\\\"1481\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: <strong>Coorg<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coorg \\u2013 Chikmagalur \\ud83d\\ude97 Distance: Approx. 150 kms | Travel Time: 4 \\u2013 5 Hours\",\"date\":\"21-03-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1860\\\" data-start=\\\"1665\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"1770\\\" data-start=\\\"1727\\\">Chikmagalur<\\/strong>, a charming hill town famous for its coffee plantations and scenic mountain landscapes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2124\\\" data-start=\\\"1862\\\">Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and later explore local attractions such as <strong data-end=\\\"1985\\\" data-start=\\\"1942\\\">Mullayanagiri<\\/strong>, the highest peak in Karnataka, <strong data-end=\\\"2061\\\" data-start=\\\"2018\\\">Baba Budangiri<\\/strong>, and the serene <strong data-end=\\\"2121\\\" data-start=\\\"2078\\\">Hirekolale Lake<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2183\\\" data-start=\\\"2126\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong>Breakfast &amp;&nbsp;Dinner<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2151\\\" data-start=\\\"2148\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: <strong>Chikmagalur<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chikmagalur \\u2013 Bangalore Airport Departure \\ud83d\\ude97 Distance: Approx. 245 kms | Travel Time: 5 \\u2013 6 Hours\",\"date\":\"22-03-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2500\\\" data-start=\\\"2360\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"2465\\\" data-start=\\\"2422\\\">Bangalore<\\/strong> Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2571\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2502\\\">\\u2728 <strong data-end=\\\"2569\\\" data-start=\\\"2504\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Coorg &amp; Chikmagalur<\\/strong> \\u2728<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2571\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2502\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: <strong>Breakfast&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5296\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"10500\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5295\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:05 AM\",\"fare\":15852}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"19\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"COORG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Greenpark Resort and Spa, Madikeri\",\"room_type\":\"Forest View Cottage\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"38300\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"CHIKMAGALUR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Gateway Chikmagalur\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"17400\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"100\" data-start=\"68\">✈&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"100\" data-start=\"70\">Return Airfare – <em>Ex Mumbai</em></strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"102\">🌿&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"126\" data-start=\"105\">Coorg – 02&nbsp;Nights</strong><br data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"126\" />\n🏨&nbsp;<em data-end=\"160\" data-start=\"132\">Hotel Greenpark Resort and Spa, Madikeri</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"164\">🌄&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"167\">Chikmagalur – 01&nbsp;Night</strong><br data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"187\" />\n🏨&nbsp;<em data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"193\">Hotel Gateway Chikmagalur</em></p>\n\n<p>🛏&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"118\">01 Room – Double Sharing</strong><br />\n<br />\n🍳&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"281\">Meal Plan</strong>&nbsp;✔</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"278\">• Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;at all hotels<br data-end=\"333\" data-start=\"330\" />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"354\">🚗&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"357\">Transfers &amp; Sightseeing</strong>&nbsp;✔<br data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"386\" />\n• Private AC Vehicle –&nbsp;<em data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"412\">Ertiga</em><br data-end=\"436\" data-start=\"433\" />\n<em data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"436\">(Bangalore to Bangalore)</em><br data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"462\" />\n• Driver Allowance Included<br data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"492\" />\n• Toll, Parking &amp; Fuel Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":26352,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":55700,\"transport_cost\":\"20000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":102052,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 15307.8\",\"selling_price\":117359.800000000002910383045673370361328125}', 'MZQ/0806/032026', 116040, 58020, 0, '2026-03-10 12:57:51', '2026-03-13 05:06:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(821, 'Ms Ritika Bhadani', 'BNI Dewanshu', '9986197203', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'DO DHAM + 02 NTS AULI', '2026-04-28', 7, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dehradun \\u2013 Guptkashi (240 Km \\/ 9 to 10 hrs.)\",\"date\":\"28-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"563\\\" data-start=\\\"55\\\">After breakfast, proceed towards Guptkashi, enjoying a scenic drive through the beautiful confluences and spiritual towns of Uttarakhand. En route, witness the sacred confluence at <strong data-end=\\\"284\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"271\\\">Devprayag<\\/strong>, where the Alaknanda and Bhagirathi rivers meet, followed by visits to <strong data-end=\\\"370\\\" data-start=\\\"356\\\">Dhari Devi<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"387\\\" data-start=\\\"372\\\">Rudraprayag<\\/strong> (the confluence of Alaknanda and Mandakini rivers), and <strong data-end=\\\"458\\\" data-start=\\\"444\\\">Augustmuni<\\/strong>. Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"489\\\" data-start=\\\"476\\\">Guptkashi<\\/strong>, check in at the hotel\\/camp and relax.<br data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"563\\\" data-start=\\\"531\\\">Overnight stay in Guptkashi.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"781\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"585\\\" data-start=\\\"565\\\">About Guptkashi:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"588\\\" data-start=\\\"585\\\" \\/>\\nLocated around <strong data-end=\\\"635\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"603\\\">47 km from Shri Kedarnath Ji<\\/strong>, Guptkashi is a revered pilgrimage town known for its spiritual significance and ancient temples, especially the famous <strong data-end=\\\"780\\\" data-start=\\\"756\\\">Ardhnareshwar Temple<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guptkashi \\u2013 Sonprayag \\u2013 Gaurikund \\u2013 Kedarnath\",\"date\":\"29-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"432\\\" data-start=\\\"41\\\">Early morning, after breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive towards <strong data-end=\\\"189\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"176\\\">Sonprayag<\\/strong>. From here, take a <strong data-end=\\\"245\\\" data-start=\\\"209\\\">shared shuttle taxi to Gaurikund<\\/strong> at your own cost, as private vehicles are not permitted beyond Sonprayag due to local authority regulations. Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"384\\\" data-start=\\\"371\\\">Gaurikund<\\/strong>, begin the <strong data-end=\\\"431\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">18 km trek to Shri Kedarnath Ji<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"917\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"434\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"454\\\" data-start=\\\"434\\\">About Kedarnath:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"457\\\" data-start=\\\"454\\\" \\/>\\nShri Kedarnath Temple, dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"507\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"493\\\">Lord Shiva<\\/strong>, is one of the most sacred pilgrimage sites in India. Pilgrims may complete the trek on foot or hire a <strong data-end=\\\"627\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\">pony \\/ palki<\\/strong> on direct payment basis. The route offers breathtaking views of <strong data-end=\\\"758\\\" data-start=\\\"692\\\">snow-capped peaks, waterfalls, and scenic Himalayan landscapes<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in at the <strong data-end=\\\"831\\\" data-start=\\\"788\\\">government camps \\/ lodges \\/ dharamshala<\\/strong> providing <strong data-end=\\\"881\\\" data-start=\\\"842\\\">basic dormitory-style accommodation<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"885\\\" data-start=\\\"882\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"917\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"885\\\">Overnight stay in Kedarnath.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kedarnath \\u2013 Gaurikund \\u2013 Sonprayag \\u2013 Guptkashi\",\"date\":\"30-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"298\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">Early in the morning, attend the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"159\\\" data-start=\\\"100\\\">Abhishek and \\u092a\\u0942\\u091c\\u093e \\/ darshan at Shri Kedarnath Ji Temple<\\/strong>. After darshan, you may also visit the <strong data-end=\\\"217\\\" data-start=\\\"199\\\">Bhairav Temple<\\/strong>, located about <strong data-end=\\\"243\\\" data-start=\\\"233\\\">1.5 km<\\/strong> from Kedarnath, before returning to your camp \\/ lodge.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"642\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"300\\\">Later, begin your trek back from <strong data-end=\\\"359\\\" data-start=\\\"333\\\">Kedarnath to Gaurikund<\\/strong>. On arrival, take the <strong data-end=\\\"433\\\" data-start=\\\"382\\\">shared shuttle taxi from Gaurikund to Sonprayag<\\/strong> at your own cost, as per local transport regulations. From <strong data-end=\\\"506\\\" data-start=\\\"493\\\">Sonprayag<\\/strong>, meet your vehicle and proceed back to <strong data-end=\\\"559\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\">Guptkashi<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax.<br data-end=\\\"610\\\" data-start=\\\"607\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"642\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Overnight stay in Guptkashi.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guptkashi \\u2013 Chopta \\u2013 Badrinath (190 Km \\/ 7 to 8 hrs.)\",\"date\":\"01-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"393\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"123\\\" data-start=\\\"107\\\">Badrinath Ji<\\/strong> via the scenic <strong data-end=\\\"156\\\" data-start=\\\"139\\\">Chopta Valley<\\/strong>, known as the base of <strong data-end=\\\"194\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"179\\\">Tungnath Ji<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"213\\\" data-start=\\\"200\\\">Joshimath<\\/strong>, where you may visit the revered <strong data-end=\\\"266\\\" data-start=\\\"247\\\">Narsingh Temple<\\/strong> en route. Enjoy the beautiful Himalayan drive as you continue towards one of the most sacred pilgrimage destinations in India.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"611\\\" data-start=\\\"395\\\">Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"424\\\" data-start=\\\"411\\\">Badrinath<\\/strong>, check in at the hotel and relax for some time. Later, proceed for <strong data-end=\\\"528\\\" data-start=\\\"492\\\">darshan at Shri Badrinath Temple<\\/strong>. After darshan, return to the hotel for dinner.<br data-end=\\\"579\\\" data-start=\\\"576\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"611\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">Overnight stay in Badrinath.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"857\\\" data-start=\\\"613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"633\\\" data-start=\\\"613\\\">About Badrinath:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"636\\\" data-start=\\\"633\\\" \\/>\\nShri Badrinath Temple, dedicated to <strong data-end=\\\"687\\\" data-start=\\\"672\\\">Lord Vishnu<\\/strong>, is one of the most important pilgrimage sites for both <strong data-end=\\\"768\\\" data-start=\\\"744\\\">Hindus and Buddhists<\\/strong>. The temple is located at an altitude of approximately <strong data-end=\\\"840\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"824\\\">3,133 meters<\\/strong> above sea level.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1246\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"898\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\">Important Attractions in Badrinath:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"901\\\" data-start=\\\"898\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"915\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\">Tapt Kund:<\\/strong> A natural thermal spring on the banks of the <strong data-end=\\\"980\\\" data-start=\\\"961\\\">Alaknanda River<\\/strong>, where pilgrims traditionally take a holy bath before entering the temple.<br data-end=\\\"1058\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1075\\\" data-start=\\\"1058\\\">Mana Village:<\\/strong> Known as the <strong data-end=\\\"1136\\\" data-start=\\\"1089\\\">last Indian village before the Tibet border<\\/strong>, this quaint village is inhabited by an Indo-Mongolian community and holds immense mythological significance.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1495\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1248\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1265\\\" data-start=\\\"1248\\\">Weather Note:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1268\\\" data-start=\\\"1265\\\" \\/>\\nBadrinath generally experiences cool weather throughout the year, and travelers are advised to carry <strong data-end=\\\"1398\\\" data-start=\\\"1369\\\">warm and woollen clothing<\\/strong>. Due to extreme weather conditions and snowfall, the shrine remains closed during winter months.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Badrinath \\u2013 Auli | Transfer & Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"02-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<div>\\n<p data-end=\\\"381\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"83\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\">Approx. Distance:<\\/strong> 53 km<br data-end=\\\"92\\\" data-start=\\\"89\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"118\\\" data-start=\\\"92\\\">Estimated Travel Time:<\\/strong> 2 hrs 02 mins<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nAfter breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"206\\\" data-start=\\\"198\\\">Auli<\\/strong>, one of Uttarakhand\\u2019s most picturesque hill destinations, known for its stunning Himalayan views and peaceful surroundings. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax. Spend the remaining day enjoying the scenic beauty of Auli and its serene atmosphere.<br data-end=\\\"466\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"493\\\" data-start=\\\"466\\\">Overnight stay in Auli.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n<p><strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"495\\\">Important Note:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"517\\\" data-start=\\\"514\\\" \\/>\\nThe vehicle will go only up to the <strong data-end=\\\"591\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"552\\\">GMVN Ropeway \\/ Lower TV Tower point<\\/strong> in Auli. Guests are required to reach the <strong data-end=\\\"668\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\">GMVN Ropeway point by 04:00 PM<\\/strong> to board the <strong data-end=\\\"722\\\" data-start=\\\"682\\\">chair car \\/ ropeway to Clifftop Auli<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\">Chair car \\/ ropeway tickets<\\/strong> are to be paid directly by the guests on direct payment basis.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Auli - Fullday Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"03-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"525\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full day sightseeing tour of <strong data-end=\\\"110\\\" data-start=\\\"102\\\">Auli<\\/strong>, a beautiful hill destination known for its breathtaking views of the Himalayas and peaceful natural surroundings. Visit popular attractions including the <strong data-end=\\\"282\\\" data-start=\\\"266\\\">Auli Ropeway<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"325\\\" data-start=\\\"283\\\">(up to GMVN point, subject to operation)<\\/em>, <strong data-end=\\\"351\\\" data-start=\\\"327\\\">Auli Artificial Lake<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"374\\\" data-start=\\\"357\\\">Gorson Bugyal<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"414\\\" data-start=\\\"375\\\">(accessible by trek or ropeway route)<\\/em>. You can also enjoy stunning panoramic views of famous Himalayan peaks such as <strong data-end=\\\"508\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">Nanda Devi<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"524\\\" data-start=\\\"513\\\">Trishul<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"668\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"527\\\">Spend quality time at leisure amidst the scenic beauty of Auli. In the evening, return to the hotel for dinner.<br data-end=\\\"641\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"668\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"641\\\">Overnight stay in Auli.<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"668\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"527\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"495\\\">Important Note:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"517\\\" data-start=\\\"514\\\" \\/>\\nThe vehicle will go only up to the <strong data-end=\\\"591\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"552\\\">GMVN Ropeway \\/ Lower TV Tower point<\\/strong> in Auli. Guests are required to reach the <strong data-end=\\\"668\\\" data-start=\\\"634\\\">GMVN Ropeway point by 04:00 PM<\\/strong> to board the <strong data-end=\\\"722\\\" data-start=\\\"682\\\">chair car \\/ ropeway to Clifftop Auli<\\/strong>.<br data-end=\\\"726\\\" data-start=\\\"723\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"726\\\">Chair car \\/ ropeway tickets<\\/strong> are to be paid directly by the guests on direct payment basis.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Auli to Rudraprayag - Transfer\",\"date\":\"04-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p><strong data-end=\\\"65\\\" data-start=\\\"44\\\">Approx. Distance:<\\/strong> 130 km<br data-end=\\\"75\\\" data-start=\\\"72\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"101\\\" data-start=\\\"75\\\">Estimated Travel Time:<\\/strong> 6 hrs 10 mins<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\nAfter breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"196\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">Rudraprayag<\\/strong>. Nestled amidst the divine beauty of Uttarakhand, Rudraprayag is one of the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"296\\\" data-start=\\\"280\\\">Panch Prayag<\\/strong> of the <strong data-end=\\\"323\\\" data-start=\\\"304\\\">Alaknanda River<\\/strong> and marks the holy confluence of the <strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"361\\\">Alaknanda and Mandakini rivers<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in at the hotel and relax. Spend the rest of the day at leisure, soaking in the tranquil surroundings. Dinner will be served at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"556\\\" data-start=\\\"553\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"590\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"556\\\">Overnight stay in Rudraprayag.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Rudraprayag \\u2013 Dehradun | Departure\",\"date\":\"05-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive towards <strong data-end=\\\"121\\\" data-start=\\\"109\\\">Dehradun<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, you will be dropped at your desired location.<br data-end=\\\"185\\\" data-start=\\\"182\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"235\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"185\\\">Tour concludes with sweet and divine memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guptkashi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Amritara Sun Inn\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Kedarnath\",\"hotel_name\":\"Basic Accommodation\",\"meal\":\"ep\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Basic Shared Bed\",\"check_out\":\"30\\/04\\/2026\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guptkashi\",\"hotel_name\":\"Char Machan\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Premium Cottage Valley Facing\",\"check_out\":\"01\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"01\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Badrinath\",\"hotel_name\":\"Amritara The Avadh\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Executive Room\",\"check_out\":\"02\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":1},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"02\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Auli\",\"hotel_name\":\"Blue Poppy Resort\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Double Occupancy Hut\",\"check_out\":\"04\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"04\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Srinagar\",\"hotel_name\":\"River Side Resort\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"check_out\":\"05\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":1}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation in a well-appointed room in base category.</li>\n	<li>Meals as Mentioned in the Hotels Section.</li>\n	<li>Welcome drink on arrival.</li>\n	<li>All transfers and sightseeing as per the itinerary by <strong><em>Innova Crysta.</em></strong></li>\n	<li>All Toll taxes, one-time parking at each destination, state tax, and driver allowance.</li>\n	<li>Hotel check-in &amp; check-out time as per the hotel.</li>\n	<li>Vehicle will be provided 7:00 am to 7:00 pm.</li>\n	<li>Only Veg Meal Provided.</li>\n	<li>In Kedarnath, we will provide bedding systems like 2 Bed room , Triple bed room, four bed room, five bed, Six bed room etc.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>All personal expenses, optional tours and extra meals.</li>\n	<li>Camera fees, Any entry fee for Monument , alcoholic/non alcoholic beverages and starters.</li>\n	<li>Vehicle service on leisure days for sightseeing not included in the itinerary Medical and travel insurance.</li>\n	<li>Ac room will not be provided in hill area.</li>\n	<li>A/C will not work on hills.</li>\n	<li>Entry fee for any monument will pay by client directly.</li>\n	<li>Tempo Traveler and large vehicle will not enter in Nainital. Guest will arrange local Sightseeing by Own</li>\n	<li>Vehicle is as per itinerary and not on disposal. Additional sightseeing or transfer which are not mentioned in itinerary is payable to the driver directly</li>\n	<li>Please&nbsp; Check All the Hotels Before Confirming the Same , We Cannot Guarantee Services and&nbsp; Amenities of Dham Hotels ..How ever we regularly Use these hotels for Dham Sector.</li>\n	<li>Vehicle will run morning to till 7 PM in Hill area as per govt rule. kindly advise your client.</li>\n	<li>The above rate are tentative basis. please reconfirm the rates before confirmation.</li>\n	<li>Sightseeing does not include Lakhamandal, Kalimath, and Triyoginarayan.</li>\n	<li>NOTE: Anything not mentioned in the inclusions is excluded.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"113400\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":113400,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11340\",\"selling_price\":124740}', 'MZQ/0807/032026', 125040, 62520, 0, '2026-03-17 12:23:39', '2026-03-24 07:10:08', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(822, 'Mr. Santosh Kumar', 'Ghadwa', '943110678', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2026-03-31', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Port Blair | Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach & Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"31-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Airport Welcome:<\\/strong> Arrive at Veer Savarkar International Airport, Port Blair, where our representative will greet you and assist with a smooth transfer to your hotel. After check-in and refreshment, begin your journey of the islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"791\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"557\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach:<\\/strong> Spend the afternoon at Carbyn\\u2019s Cove, a picturesque palm-fringed beach just a short drive from the city. Walk along the shoreline, soak in the sea breeze, and relax by the turquoise waters \\u2013 a perfect start to your Andaman holiday.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"832\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\">Cellular Jail &amp; Light &amp; Sound Show:<\\/strong> Later, visit the iconic <em data-end=\\\"884\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\">Cellular Jail (Kala Pani)<\\/em>, where the corridors and galleries narrate the tale of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. In the evening, witness the moving <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Light &amp; Sound Show<\\/strong>, which brings history alive through music, narration, and lights.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair \\u2192 Havelock Island | Radhanagar Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"01-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1400\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\">Private Cruise to Havelock:<\\/strong> After breakfast, board a premium private cruise (<em data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\">Makruzz \\u2013 Premium Class<\\/em> \\/ <em data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">Nautika \\u2013 Luxury Class<\\/em>) for a scenic transfer from Port Blair to Havelock Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1470\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1421\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1493\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\">Radhanagar Beach:<\\/strong> In the afternoon, visit the world-renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1571\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\">Radhanagar Beach (Beach No. 7)<\\/strong>, voted one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches. Enjoy its pristine white sands, azure waters, and a spectacular sunset.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<br data-end=\\\"1721\\\" data-start=\\\"1718\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1802\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Note: Ferry timings and class upgrades can be requested at the time of booking.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Excursion with Snorkelling\",\"date\":\"02-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2060\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\">Hotel Pickup &amp; Boat Ride:<\\/strong> Begin your day with a hotel pickup and transfer to the jetty. Enjoy a 30-minute boat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"2012\\\" data-start=\\\"1994\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, famous for its coral reefs and clear waters.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2222\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2092\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\">Complimentary Snorkelling:<\\/strong> Experience the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock \\u2192 Neil Island | Natural Rock Formation & Laxmanpur Beach\",\"date\":\"03-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a private cruise from Havelock to Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2791\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2820\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\">Natural Rock Formation:<\\/strong> Visit Neil\\u2019s iconic Natural Rock Formation, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2883\\\">Howrah Bridge<\\/em>, a natural wonder created by centuries of coral formations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3099\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Laxmanpur Beach Sunset:<\\/strong> Spend the evening at <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3011\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its wide shoreline and mesmerizing golden sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3214\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Neil Island.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be updated by our team.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island \\u2192 Port Blair | Bharatpur Beach, Shopping\",\"date\":\"04-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3488\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">Bharatpur Beach:<\\/strong> Begin the morning at <strong data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3360\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, and optional water sports such as jet skiing and glass-bottom boat rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3614\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">Check Out &amp; Transfer:<\\/strong> Check out from the resort and transfer to Neil Jetty. Board a private cruise back to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3770\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3634\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Shopping Trip:<\\/strong> In the evening, enjoy shopping at Port Blair\\u2019s local markets for souvenirs like pearls, shell crafts, spices, and island handicrafts.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3772\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3982\\\" data-start=\\\"3963\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Port Blair\",\"date\":\"05-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your return flight. Carry back fond memories of your Andaman journey.<br data-end=\\\"4193\\\" data-start=\\\"4190\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"4368\\\" data-start=\\\"4193\\\">Note: Hotels usually have early check-out times. If your flight is in the afternoon, luggage can be kept at the reception. Extra sightseeing may be arranged if time permits.<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2782\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 AM\",\"fare\":\"14755\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5043\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"30921\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7317\",\"dep_date\":\"05 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"05 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"31\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Aquays Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Lagoon Plaza\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"03\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sand\",\"room_type\":\"Casa Earth\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"04\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"04\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mansha Regency\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"05\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare<strong>&nbsp;Kolkata-Portblair (IXZ) &amp;&nbsp;Portblair (IXZ) to&nbsp;Ranchi (IXR).</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>01&nbsp;Room&nbsp;Accommodation</strong>&nbsp;on <strong>Double sharing </strong>at the given respected&nbsp;hotels in&nbsp;<strong>Port Blair, Havelock, and Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner&nbsp;</strong>at all respective hotels.</li>\n	<li>Meet and greet service&nbsp;at the airport.</li>\n	<li><strong>Airport&nbsp;pickup and drop-off.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All sightseeing by a Private AC Vehicle&nbsp;on all the islands.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All side&nbsp;Ferry Tickets&nbsp;Included&nbsp;03 Side Cruises&nbsp;to Havelock &amp; Neil.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>All&nbsp;entry tickets, ferry tickets, and permit charges.</strong></li>\n	<li><strong>One session for snorkeling&nbsp;is complimentary.</strong></li>\n	<li>All dedicated vehicle charges (Toyota Hyryder/Ertiga/Xylo/Scorpio/Tata Winger) as per itinerary in AC and not at disposal.</li>\n	<li>Parking charges.</li>\n	<li>Travel assistance&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Multi Zone Travel&nbsp;experts</strong>&nbsp;in all the islands.</li>\n	<li>All Taxes</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":45676,\"land_cost\":\"69525\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sand Room upgrade\",\"amount\":1800},{\"name\":\"Cruise Premium Class\",\"amount\":2400}],\"cost_price\":119401,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16716.14\",\"selling_price\":136117.140000000013969838619232177734375}', 'MZQ/0808/032026', 136450, 68225, 12480, '2026-03-23 10:33:08', '2026-03-28 09:48:18', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(823, 'Mr. Rohit Prasad', 'BNI', '9031771858', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Majestic China', '2026-04-23', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Guangzhou (On Own)\",\"date\":\"23-04-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Guangzhou Baiyun International Airport, you will be warmly received by our local representative and transferred to your premium hotel in a private luxury vehicle. After a smooth check-in, the rest of the day is at leisure to relax and recover from your journey or explore nearby areas at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Guangzhou.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Canton Fair Experience (On Own)\",\"date\":\"24-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a full-day visit to the world-renowned Canton Fair, the largest international trade exhibition showcasing a vast range of products and global business opportunities. Engage in business meetings, explore various exhibition halls, and network with international suppliers. Return to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Guangzhou.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Canton Fair Experience (On Own)\",\"date\":\"25-04-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Begin your day with breakfast and continue your visit to the Canton Fair. Utilize this day for focused business interactions, supplier meetings, and sourcing opportunities. The fair provides excellent exposure to international markets and innovations. After a productive day, return to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Guangzhou.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Canton Fair Experience (On Own)\",\"date\":\"26-04-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, head for your final day at the Canton Fair. Complete your meetings, finalize business discussions, and explore any remaining sections of interest. Later, return to your hotel and enjoy a relaxed evening at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Guangzhou.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guangzhou to Beijing\",\"date\":\"27-04-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, check out from your hotel and transfer to the airport for your domestic flight to Beijing. Upon arrival, you will be assisted with a private transfer to your hotel. Check in and spend the evening at leisure, relaxing or exploring the vibrant surroundings of the capital city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Beijing Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"28-04-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a <strong>full-day guided tour of Beijing\\u2019s iconic landmarks.<\\/strong> Visit the magnificent <strong>Great Wall of China<\\/strong>, followed by exploration of the historic Forbidden City and <strong>the vast Tiananmen Square.<\\/strong> Experience the rich cultural heritage and architectural grandeur of China\\u2019s capital. Return to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"29-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport for your return flight to Delhi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Depart with successful business engagements and wonderful memories of your China journey.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Guangzhou (CAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1703\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"24 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 AM\",\"fare\":69860},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Guangzhou (CAN)\",\"to\":\"Beijing (PKX)\",\"name\":\"China Eastern Airlines\",\"fno\":\"6298\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"86000\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Beijing (PEK)\",\"to\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"name\":\"Cathay Pacific\",\"fno\":\"347\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"96752\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Cathay Pacific\",\"fno\":\"665\",\"dep_date\":\"29 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"29 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"23\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Baiyun\",\"city\":\"Guangzhou\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"27\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"112000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"27\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Hilton Wangfujing\",\"city\":\"Beijing\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"49000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"355\" data-start=\"92\"><em><strong>✈️ International airfare:</strong></em><br data-end=\"120\" data-start=\"117\" />\nEx- Kolkata (CCU) – Guangzhou (CAN)<br data-end=\"216\" data-start=\"213\" />\n&amp; Beijing (PEK) – Hong Kong (HKG) – Delhi (DEL)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"357\">✈️ <strong>Domestic </strong>flight from Guangzhou to Beijing</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"405\">🏨 04 Nights accommodation at 5★ <em data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"438\">Hotel Baiyun</em> in Guangzhou<br data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"465\" />\n🏨 02 Nights accommodation at 5★ <em data-end=\"520\" data-start=\"501\">Hilton Wangfujing</em> in Beijing</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"535\">🍽️<strong> Daily buffet breakfast</strong> at the respected Hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"699\" data-start=\"578\">🚘 Private luxury airport transfers (arrival &amp; departure)<br data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"635\" />\n🚐 All ground transfers in premium air-conditioned vehicles</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"886\" data-start=\"701\">🏛️ Private guided sightseeing tour in Beijing including:<br data-end=\"761\" data-start=\"758\" />\n• Great Wall of China<br data-end=\"803\" data-start=\"800\" />\n• Forbidden City<br data-end=\"845\" data-start=\"842\" />\n• Tiananmen Square</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"942\" data-start=\"888\">🧑‍💼 Professional English-speaking local assistance</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"968\" data-start=\"944\">🛂 China visa included</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1031\" data-start=\"970\">💎 All applicable taxes, driver allowances, tolls &amp; parking</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":252612,\"land_cost\":\"30000\",\"hotel_cost\":161000,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"26000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":469612,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 56353.44\",\"selling_price\":525965.4399999999441206455230712890625}', 'MZQ/0809/032026', 526300, 263150, 0, '2026-03-24 10:25:32', '2026-03-25 07:52:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
