(824, 'Mr Prakhar', 'Rajdhani Motors', '7979754501', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL HIMACHAL', '2026-03-26', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day 01: Arrival Chandigarh \\u2013 Shimla\",\"date\":\"26-03-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"172\\\" data-start=\\\"57\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"120\\\" data-start=\\\"99\\\">Approx. Distance:<\\/strong> 110 km<br data-end=\\\"130\\\" data-start=\\\"127\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"156\\\" data-start=\\\"130\\\">Estimated Travel Time:<\\/strong> 3 hrs 30 mins<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"478\\\" data-start=\\\"174\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"224\\\" data-start=\\\"184\\\">Chandigarh Airport \\/ Railway Station<\\/strong> and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"255\\\" data-start=\\\"245\\\">Shimla<\\/strong>, enjoying a scenic drive through the beautiful hills of Himachal Pradesh. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax. The rest of the day is free to unwind and enjoy the pleasant weather of this charming hill station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"480\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"509\\\" data-start=\\\"480\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"512\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"522\\\" data-start=\\\"512\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"704\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"550\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">About Shimla:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"553\\\" data-start=\\\"550\\\" \\/>\\nShimla, the capital of Himachal Pradesh, is a popular hill station known for its colonial charm, pleasant weather, scenic beauty, and lively Mall Road.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"27-03-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"406\\\" data-start=\\\"40\\\">After breakfast, proceed to explore the charming attractions of <strong data-end=\\\"114\\\" data-start=\\\"104\\\">Shimla<\\/strong>. Visit popular highlights including <strong data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Kufri<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"181\\\" data-start=\\\"162\\\">Viceregal Lodge<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"200\\\" data-start=\\\"183\\\">Christ Church<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"220\\\" data-start=\\\"202\\\">Gaiety Theatre<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"239\\\" data-start=\\\"222\\\">Scandal Point<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"259\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">Grindlays Bank<\\/strong>, and the lively <strong data-end=\\\"289\\\" data-start=\\\"276\\\">Mall Road<\\/strong>. Spend the day enjoying the colonial charm, scenic beauty, and pleasant atmosphere of this beautiful hill station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"469\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"408\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"437\\\" data-start=\\\"408\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"437\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"450\\\" data-start=\\\"440\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Manali\",\"date\":\"28-03-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"95\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"51\\\" data-start=\\\"30\\\">Approx. Distance:<\\/strong> 265 km<br data-end=\\\"61\\\" data-start=\\\"58\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"87\\\" data-start=\\\"61\\\">Estimated Travel Time:<\\/strong> 8 hrs<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"392\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"169\\\" data-start=\\\"159\\\">Manali<\\/strong>, enjoying a scenic drive through the beautiful valleys of Himachal Pradesh. En route, visit <strong data-end=\\\"278\\\" data-start=\\\"262\\\">Sunder Nagar<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"294\\\" data-start=\\\"280\\\">Pandoh Dam<\\/strong>, and the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"332\\\" data-start=\\\"316\\\">Kullu Valley<\\/strong>. Upon arrival in Manali, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"457\\\" data-start=\\\"394\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"423\\\" data-start=\\\"394\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"426\\\" data-start=\\\"423\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"436\\\" data-start=\\\"426\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"605\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"459\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"459\\\">About Manali:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"479\\\" data-start=\\\"476\\\" \\/>\\nManali is a beautiful hill station known for its snow-capped mountains, scenic valleys, flowing rivers, and adventurous charm.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"29-03-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"360\\\" data-start=\\\"40\\\">After breakfast, proceed to explore the popular attractions of <strong data-end=\\\"113\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">Manali<\\/strong>, including <strong data-end=\\\"143\\\" data-start=\\\"125\\\">Hadimba Temple<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"160\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">Manu Temple<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"172\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">(by walk)<\\/em>, <strong data-end=\\\"191\\\" data-start=\\\"174\\\">Vashisht Bath<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"210\\\" data-start=\\\"197\\\">Van Vihar<\\/strong>. You may also opt for a short <strong data-end=\\\"272\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\">trek \\/ walk to Jogini Falls<\\/strong>. In the evening, enjoy leisure time and shopping at the <strong data-end=\\\"357\\\" data-start=\\\"329\\\">local market \\/ Mall Road<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"423\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"391\\\" data-start=\\\"362\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"394\\\" data-start=\\\"391\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"404\\\" data-start=\\\"394\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Solang Valley Day Trip\",\"date\":\"30-03-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"461\\\" data-start=\\\"38\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an exciting excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"109\\\" data-start=\\\"92\\\">Solang Valley<\\/strong>, one of the most popular attractions near Manali, known for its stunning mountain views and adventure activities. Later, enjoy a scenic drive through the <strong data-end=\\\"279\\\" data-start=\\\"264\\\">Atal Tunnel<\\/strong> towards the <strong data-end=\\\"321\\\" data-start=\\\"292\\\">North Portal \\/ Sissu side<\\/strong> <em data-end=\\\"364\\\" data-start=\\\"322\\\">(subject to weather and road conditions)<\\/em>. Spend the day amidst breathtaking Himalayan landscapes before returning to Manali by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"526\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"495\\\" data-start=\\\"492\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"505\\\" data-start=\\\"495\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"820\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"552\\\" data-start=\\\"528\\\">About Solang Valley:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"555\\\" data-start=\\\"552\\\" \\/>\\nSolang Valley is a scenic adventure destination near Manali, famous for its panoramic views, snow activities, and thrilling experiences. The <strong data-end=\\\"711\\\" data-start=\\\"696\\\">Atal Tunnel<\\/strong>, one of the highest and longest highway tunnels in the world, adds to the charm of this memorable excursion.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"31-03-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"101\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"55\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">Approx. Distance:<\\/strong> 300 km<br data-end=\\\"65\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"91\\\" data-start=\\\"65\\\">Estimated Travel Time:<\\/strong> 7\\u20138 hrs<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"347\\\" data-start=\\\"103\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"179\\\" data-start=\\\"165\\\">Chandigarh<\\/strong>, enjoying a comfortable drive through the scenic route. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel. Later, you may enjoy some leisure time or a little shopping in the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"414\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"349\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"382\\\" data-start=\\\"349\\\">Overnight stay in Chandigarh.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"385\\\" data-start=\\\"382\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"395\\\" data-start=\\\"385\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"01-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"164\\\" data-start=\\\"41\\\">Early morning, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"137\\\" data-start=\\\"97\\\">Chandigarh Airport \\/ Railway Station<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"252\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"166\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"229\\\" data-start=\\\"166\\\">Tour concludes with beautiful memories of Himachal Pradesh.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"232\\\" data-start=\\\"229\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"242\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"576\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Mar 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Mar 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\",\"fare\":36177},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigar