(825, 'Mr. Nishid Dhan', 'Dibadih', '7488794768', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical Kerala 3*', '2026-04-22', 7, 0, 15, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ernakulam Junction \\u2192 Munnar\",\"date\":\"22-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start your journey from <strong data-end=\\\"307\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">Ernakulam Junction<\\/strong> and enjoy a scenic drive through lush greenery and winding roads to <strong data-end=\\\"386\\\" data-start=\\\"376\\\">Munnar<\\/strong>, the picturesque hill station of Kerala. On the way, visit the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"494\\\" data-start=\\\"459\\\">Valara &amp; Cheeyappara Waterfalls<\\/strong>, perfect for photographs and nature lovers. Check-in at <strong data-end=\\\"571\\\" data-start=\\\"551\\\">Hotel Tea Castle<\\/strong> and visit the <strong data-end=\\\"614\\\" data-start=\\\"586\\\">Eravikulam National Park<\\/strong> to spot the rare Nilgiri Tahr, followed by the <strong data-end=\\\"676\\\" data-start=\\\"662\\\">Tea Museum<\\/strong>, where you can learn about the fascinating history of tea plantations in the region. Spend your evening soaking in the serene hill station ambiance and enjoy the fresh mountain air.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay at Munnar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"23-04-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a full-day sightseeing tour of Munnar. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"979\\\">Mattupetty Dam<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1013\\\" data-start=\\\"999\\\">Echo Point<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1030\\\" data-start=\\\"1015\\\">Kundala Dam<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"1056\\\" data-start=\\\"1032\\\">Pothamedu View Point<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\">Blossom Park<\\/strong>, capturing panoramic views of rolling hills and sprawling tea estates. Take some time for shopping local tea, spices, and handicrafts. Enjoy the cool climate and scenic landscapes, making it a perfect day for photography and nature walks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Return to <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"1082\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\">Hotel<\\/strong><strong><strong data-end=\\\"1082\\\" data-start=\\\"1062\\\">&nbsp;<\\/strong>for an overnight stay.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar \\u2192 Thekkady\",\"date\":\"24-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Post breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"1450\\\" data-start=\\\"1438\\\">Thekkady<\\/strong>, famous for its wildlife sanctuary and spice plantations. Check-in at <strong data-end=\\\"1544\\\" data-start=\\\"1521\\\">Hotel Holiday Vista<\\/strong> and explore the <strong data-end=\\\"1591\\\" data-start=\\\"1561\\\">Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary<\\/strong>, home to elephants, deer, and exotic birds. Enjoy an optional <strong data-end=\\\"1683\\\" data-start=\\\"1654\\\">boat ride on Periyar Lake<\\/strong> for an up-close wildlife experience. Visit a local <strong data-end=\\\"1755\\\" data-start=\\\"1735\\\">spice plantation<\\/strong> to witness the aromatic spices that Kerala is known for. Spend the evening at leisure, absorbing the tranquil surroundings.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Thekkady.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thekkady \\u2192 Kovalam\",\"date\":\"25-04-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a scenic drive to the coastal town of <strong data-end=\\\"2032\\\" data-start=\\\"2021\\\">Kovalam<\\/strong>, renowned for its golden beaches and palm-lined shores. Check-in at <strong data-end=\\\"2130\\\" data-start=\\\"2101\\\">Hotel Sagara Beach Resort<\\/strong> and spend the evening strolling along <strong data-end=\\\"2189\\\" data-start=\\\"2169\\\">Lighthouse Beach<\\/strong>, enjoying the sea breeze, golden sands, and sunset views. Relax and unwind at the resort, embracing the serene coastal charm.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Kovalam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam & Trivandrum Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"26-04-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Spend a full day enjoying the sun, sand, and sea at <strong data-end=\\\"2459\\\" data-start=\\\"2442\\\">Kovalam Beach<\\/strong>. Relax on the golden sands, take a dip in the Arabian Sea, or indulge in optional water activities. Evening at leisure to enjoy the vibrant beachside ambience, local cafes, and souvenir shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Kovalam.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam Beach Day \\/ Leisure\",\"date\":\"27-04-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Explore the cultural side of Kerala with a full-day sightseeing tour of <strong data-end=\\\"2862\\\" data-start=\\\"2848\\\">Trivandrum<\\/strong>, visiting the majestic <strong data-end=\\\"2912\\\" data-start=\\\"2886\\\">Padmanabhaswamy Temple<\\/strong>, the historical <strong data-end=\\\"2946\\\" data-start=\\\"2929\\\">Napier Museum<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2978\\\" data-start=\\\"2952\\\">Sri Chitra Art Gallery<\\/strong>, home to unique paintings and artifacts. Return to Kovalam in the evening for some leisure time on the beach, enjoying the sunset and relaxing by the waves.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay at <\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2470\\\" data-start=\\\"2441\\\">Hotel<\\/strong><strong><strong data-end=\\\"2470\\\" data-start=\\\"2441\\\"> <\\/strong><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam \\u2192 Kumarakom\",\"date\":\"28-04-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong data-end=\\\"3282\\\" data-start=\\\"3269\\\">Kumarakom<\\/strong>, a tranquil backwater paradise. Check-in at <strong data-end=\\\"3345\\\" data-start=\\\"3327\\\">Hotel Lakesong<\\/strong> and explore <strong data-end=\\\"3375\\\" data-start=\\\"3358\\\">Vembanad Lake<\\/strong>, one of the largest lakes in Kerala. Visit <strong data-end=\\\"3447\\\" data-start=\\\"3419\\\">Kumarakom Bird Sanctuary<\\/strong> to spot migratory birds and enjoy an optional <strong data-end=\\\"3517\\\" data-start=\\\"3494\\\">backwater boat ride<\\/strong> through serene canals and local villages, experiencing traditional Kerala life. Evening at leisure to enjoy the peaceful surroundings.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Kumarakom.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kumarakom \\u2192 Ernakulam Junction (Departure)\",\"date\":\"29-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check-out from the hotel and drive back to <strong data-end=\\\"3819\\\" data-start=\\\"3797\\\">Ernakulam Junction<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Depart with cherished memories of Kerala\\u2019s lush hills, tranquil backwaters, vibrant culture, wildlife, and scenic beauty, marking the perfect end to a rejuvenating and unforgettable holiday.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Munnar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Tea Castle\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room+ 05 EB\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"40000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Thekkady\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Holiday Vista\",\"room_type\":\"Gold Jewel Room+ 05 EB\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"21100\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Kovalam\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sagara Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room+ 05 EB\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"28\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"78400\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"28\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Kumarakom\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lakesong\",\"room_type\":\"Punnamada Room+ 05 EB\",\"rooms\":5,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"42200\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"137\" data-start=\"114\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"135\" data-start=\"117\">Accommodation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"293\" data-start=\"138\">\n	<li data-end=\"172\" data-section-id=\"1b3oghi\" data-start=\"138\">02N – Hotel Tea Castle, Munnar</li>\n	<li data-end=\"212\" data-section-id=\"uh0tcw\" data-start=\"173\">01N – Hotel Holiday Vista, Thekkady</li>\n	<li data-end=\"257\" data-section-id=\"d1wff8\" data-start=\"213\">03N – Hotel Sagara Beach Resort, Kovalam</li>\n	<li data-end=\"293\" data-section-id=\"15xqbj0\" data-start=\"258\">01N – Hotel Lakesong, Kumarakom</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"349\" data-start=\"295\">🍽 <strong data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"298\">Meal Plan:</strong> Breakfast at all respective hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"430\" data-start=\"351\">🚘 <strong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"354\">Transfers &amp; Sightseeing:</strong> By 20-seater Tempo Traveller as per itinerary</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"432\">💰 <strong data-end=\"455\" data-start=\"435\">Vehicle Charges:</strong> Driver’s allowance, tolls, parking, fuel &amp; driver night halt (if vehicle included)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"542\">❄️ <strong data-end=\"562\" data-start=\"545\">AC Transport:</strong> All transfers &amp; sightseeing by AC vehicle, inclusive of toll, parking &amp; driver’s bata.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"772\" data-start=\"683\">🧾 <strong data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"686\">Taxes:</strong> All presently applicable government taxes (unless mentioned as exclusive)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"863\" data-start=\"774\">🏛 <strong data-end=\"806\" data-start=\"777\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities:</strong> As per itinerary including entry fees where applicable</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"865\">🧑‍💼 <strong data-end=\"899\" data-start=\"871\">Professional Assistance:</strong> Experienced driver &amp; local support during sightseeing &amp; transfers</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":\"243000\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":243000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 24300\",\"selling_price\":267300}', 'MZQ/0811/032026', 267600, 17840, 0, '2026-03-25 07:11:08', '2026-03-25 07:46:42', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(826, 'Mr. Kumud Ranjan', 'Anil Rai', '9431360022', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Royal Rajasthan', '2026-04-03', 6, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kota \\u2192 Jaipur (Approx. 250 kms | 5\\u20136 hrs)\",\"date\":\"03-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive at Kota Railway Station and meet your driver\\/representative. Begin your scenic drive to Jaipur, the Pink City, covering approximately 250 kms in 5\\u20136 hours. En route, enjoy glimpses of Rajasthan\\u2019s semi-arid landscapes, small towns, and rustic villages that reflect the state\\u2019s rich culture. Upon arrival, check-in at your hotel and refresh. In the evening, visit the serene <strong data-end=\\\"777\\\" data-start=\\\"761\\\">Birla Temple<\\/strong>, dedicated to Lord Vishnu and Goddess Lakshmi, and explore Jaipur\\u2019s bustling local markets, known for traditional handicrafts, textiles, jewellery, and souvenirs. Soak in the vibrant Rajasthani atmosphere before returning to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Jaipur.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur Sightseeing (Local Travel | Approx. 40\\u201350 kms | 6\\u20137 hrs)\",\"date\":\"04-04-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After a hearty breakfast, embark on a full-day sightseeing tour of Jaipur, covering approximately 40\\u201350 kms across the city in 6\\u20137 hours. Start with the grand Amber Fort, perched on a hilltop with magnificent Rajput architecture and panoramic views. Next, stop at the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"1450\\\" data-start=\\\"1437\\\">Jal Mahal<\\/strong>, the Water Palace, for photographs. Continue to the royal City Palace, a splendid blend of Rajput and Mughal architecture, and then to the fascinating Jantar Mantar, an astronomical observatory showcasing ancient scientific brilliance. In the evening, stroll through Johari Bazaar &amp; Bapu Bazaar for local shopping, handicrafts, and souvenirs.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Jaipur.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2192 Pushkar (Approx. 150 kms | 3\\u20134 hrs)\",\"date\":\"05-04-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive approximately 150 kms to the holy town of Pushkar in 3\\u20134 hours. The journey passes through the scenic Aravalli ranges and small Rajasthani villages, giving glimpses of traditional rural life. Upon arrival, check-in at your hotel and refresh. Visit the sacred Brahma Temple, one of the very few temples in the world dedicated to Lord Brahma. Take a peaceful walk along the ghats of Pushkar Lake and experience the spiritual ambience. Later, explore the colorful local bazaars filled with handicrafts, souvenirs, and vibrant textiles.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Pushkar.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pushkar \\u2192 Udaipur (Approx. 280 kms | 5\\u20136 hrs)\",\"date\":\"06-04-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, embark on a scenic drive of approximately 280 kms to Udaipur, the City of Lakes, taking around 5\\u20136 hours. Enjoy picturesque views of the Aravalli hills, golden plains, and charming villages along the way. Upon arrival, check-in at the hotel and relax. In the evening, enjoy an optional boat ride at <strong data-end=\\\"3059\\\" data-start=\\\"3043\\\">Lake Pichola<\\/strong>, witnessing stunning sunset views, the majestic City Palace, and the beautiful ghats along the lake.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Udaipur.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Sightseeing (Local Travel | Approx. 30\\u201340 kms | 5\\u20136 hrs)\",\"date\":\"07-04-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore Udaipur\\u2019s royal and cultural attractions with local travel of 30\\u201340 kms across the city. Visit the magnificent City Palace, a beautiful complex overlooking Lake Pichola, then explore Jagdish Temple, an iconic 17th-century Hindu temple. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"3621\\\" data-start=\\\"3600\\\">Saheliyon Ki Bari<\\/strong>, a charming garden with fountains and marble pavilions, and <strong data-end=\\\"3702\\\" data-start=\\\"3682\\\">Fateh Sagar Lake<\\/strong>, perfect for a leisurely stroll or photography. Evening free for optional cultural programs, traditional music, or shopping at local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Udaipur.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Leisure \\/ Local Exploration (Approx. 20\\u201330 kms)\",\"date\":\"08-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Spend a relaxed day in Udaipur to explore at your own pace. You can visit <strong data-end=\\\"4047\\\" data-start=\\\"4027\\\">Bagore Ki Haveli<\\/strong>, a historic mansion showcasing royal artifacts, enjoy a second boat ride on Lake Pichola, or stroll through the vibrant markets for souvenirs. Enjoy the city\\u2019s lakes, palaces, and serene ambiance at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Overnight stay in Udaipur.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur \\u2192 Kota (Approx. 285 kms | 5\\u20136 hrs)\",\"date\":\"09-04-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check-out and drive back to Kota, covering approximately 285 kms in 5\\u20136 hours through scenic countryside, small towns, and rural landscapes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Arrive at Kota Railway Station, concluding your Rajasthan journey with rich memories of royal heritage, spiritual experiences, and picturesque landscapes<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"03\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Royal GM Plaza\",\"city\":\"Jaipur\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"9926\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"05\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Pushkar\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sterling\",\"room_type\":\"Classic Room +01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10600\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"06\\/04\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Keys Select by Lemon Tree\",\"city\":\"Udaipur\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room +01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"09\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"24552\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"106\" data-start=\"83\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"104\" data-start=\"86\">Accommodation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"251\" data-start=\"107\">\n	<li data-end=\"155\" data-section-id=\"1ykf7pl\" data-start=\"107\">02 Nights – Hotel The Royal GM Plaza, Jaipur</li>\n	<li data-end=\"194\" data-section-id=\"1qwfmay\" data-start=\"156\">01 Night – Hotel Sterling, Pushkar</li>\n	<li data-end=\"251\" data-section-id=\"1uq637f\" data-start=\"195\">03 Nights – Hotel Keys Select by Lemon Tree, Udaipur</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"313\" data-start=\"253\">🍽 <strong data-end=\"270\" data-start=\"256\">Meal Plan:</strong> Daily breakfast at all respective hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"434\" data-start=\"315\">🚘 <strong data-end=\"346\" data-start=\"318\">Transfers &amp; Sightseeing:</strong> Private <strong data-end=\"379\" data-start=\"355\">Toyota Innova Crysta</strong> for all transfers &amp; sightseeing <em data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"412\">(Kota to Kota)</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"436\">💰 <strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"439\">Vehicle Charges:</strong> Driver allowance, fuel, toll tax, parking &amp; driver night halt included</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"643\" data-start=\"534\">❄️ <strong data-end=\"554\" data-start=\"537\">AC Transport:</strong> All transfers &amp; sightseeing by AC <strong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"589\">Innova Crysta.</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"709\" data-start=\"645\">🏛 <strong data-end=\"664\" data-start=\"648\">Sightseeing:</strong> All major attractions as per the itinerary</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"711\">🧾 <strong data-end=\"724\" data-start=\"714\">Taxes:</strong> All applicable government taxes included</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"769\">🧑‍💼 <strong data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"775\">Assistance:</strong> Experienced driver with good local knowledge for a smooth travel experience</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":null,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":45078,\"transport_cost\":\"43000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":88078,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19377.16\",\"selling_price\":107455.16000000000349245965480804443359375}', 'MZQ/0812/032026', 109190, 21838, 0, '2026-03-25 12:54:59', '2026-03-25 13:30:35', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(827, 'MR NIKHIL  AGARWAL', 'BNI JOSH', '7004454291', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'AMAZING THAILAND', '2026-04-02', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"02-04-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"342\\\" data-start=\\\"132\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"166\\\" data-start=\\\"148\\\">Phuket Airport<\\/strong>, meet our representative and transfer to your hotel. Check in and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is at leisure to explore nearby areas or unwind at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"375\\\" data-start=\\\"344\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"373\\\" data-start=\\\"344\\\">Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"James Bond Island Tour by Speed Boat with Lunch\",\"date\":\"03-04-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"752\\\" data-start=\\\"452\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the famous <strong data-end=\\\"518\\\" data-start=\\\"492\\\">James Bond Island Tour<\\/strong> by speed boat. Explore the stunning <strong data-end=\\\"572\\\" data-start=\\\"555\\\">Phang Nga Bay<\\/strong>, enjoy scenic limestone cliffs, caves, and lagoons. Visit the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"680\\\" data-start=\\\"642\\\">Khao Phing Kan (James Bond Island)<\\/strong> and enjoy canoeing experiences. Lunch will be served during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"816\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"783\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\">Overnight stay in Phuket.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"786\\\" data-start=\\\"783\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"796\\\" data-start=\\\"786\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2013 Krabi (En-route Phuket City Tour + Tiger Park)\",\"date\":\"04-04-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"901\\\">After breakfast, check out and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"957\\\" data-start=\\\"948\\\">Krabi<\\/strong>. En route, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"997\\\" data-start=\\\"977\\\">Phuket City Tour<\\/strong> covering major attractions along with a visit to the <strong data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"1051\\\">Tiger Park<\\/strong>. Continue your journey to Krabi and check in at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1181\\\" data-start=\\\"1128\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1156\\\" data-start=\\\"1128\\\">Overnight stay in Krabi.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1159\\\" data-start=\\\"1156\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1169\\\" data-start=\\\"1159\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 4 Island Tour with Lunch by Speed Boat\",\"date\":\"05-04-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1534\\\" data-start=\\\"1255\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the exciting <strong data-end=\\\"1314\\\" data-start=\\\"1297\\\">4 Island Tour<\\/strong> by speed boat. Visit popular islands such as <strong data-end=\\\"1429\\\" data-start=\\\"1360\\\">Phra Nang Cave Beach, Chicken Island, Tup Island, and Poda Island<\\/strong>. Enjoy swimming, snorkeling, and relaxing on pristine beaches. Lunch will be provided during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1597\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1564\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Overnight stay in Krabi.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1567\\\" data-start=\\\"1564\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"1577\\\" data-start=\\\"1567\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi \\u2013 Bangkok (Flight) + Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"06-04-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1844\\\" data-start=\\\"1679\\\">After breakfast, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1745\\\" data-start=\\\"1722\\\">Krabi Airport (KBV)<\\/strong> for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1790\\\" data-start=\\\"1765\\\">Bangkok (DMK Airport)<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, transfer to your hotel and check in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2022\\\" data-start=\\\"1846\\\">In the evening, enjoy a luxurious <strong data-end=\\\"1918\\\" data-start=\\\"1880\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> with an Indian buffet, cruising along the iconic river with views of Bangkok\\u2019s illuminated landmarks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2088\\\" data-start=\\\"2024\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2054\\\" data-start=\\\"2024\\\">Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2057\\\" data-start=\\\"2054\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2067\\\" data-start=\\\"2057\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"07-04-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2344\\\" data-start=\\\"2155\\\">After breakfast, proceed to visit <strong data-end=\\\"2219\\\" data-start=\\\"2189\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>. Enjoy thrilling wildlife encounters, live shows, and explore the open zoo. A buffet lunch will be served inside the park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2409\\\" data-start=\\\"2346\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2376\\\" data-start=\\\"2346\\\">Overnight stay in Bangkok.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2379\\\" data-start=\\\"2376\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2389\\\" data-start=\\\"2379\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure \\u2013 Shopping & Airport Transfer\",\"date\":\"08-04-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2651\\\" data-start=\\\"2478\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Enjoy some free time for <strong data-end=\\\"2569\\\" data-start=\\\"2546\\\">shopping in Bangkok<\\/strong> before your transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2624\\\" data-start=\\\"2594\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong> for your return journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2733\\\" data-start=\\\"2653\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2708\\\" data-start=\\\"2653\\\">Tour concludes with wonderful memories of Thailand.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2711\\\" data-start=\\\"2708\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2721\\\" data-start=\\\"2711\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1087\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"80000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Krabi (KBV)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"341\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:25 AM\",\"fare\":29684},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"Thai VietJet Air\",\"fno\":\"770\",\"dep_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"08 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:50 PM\",\"fare\":56372}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"02\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Patong Paragon Resort & Spa\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"04\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"24700\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Centara Life Phu Pano Krabi\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Mountain View\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"19800\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"06\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Royal Benja Hotel Sukhumvit 5\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room with Bathtub\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"08\\/03\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"18000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<h3 data-end=\"140\" data-section-id=\"1q00896\" data-start=\"122\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"129\">Flights</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"141\">\n	<li data-end=\"189\" data-section-id=\"16ktg6y\" data-start=\"141\">Return Airfare in Economy Class <strong data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"175\">Ex-Kolkata</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"194\" data-start=\"191\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"220\" data-section-id=\"7g538q\" data-start=\"196\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"203\">Accommodation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"221\">\n	<li data-end=\"282\" data-section-id=\"1e6yra2\" data-start=\"221\">02 Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"241\">Patong Paragon Resort &amp; Spa, Phuket</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"337\" data-section-id=\"15v18lh\" data-start=\"283\">02 Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"335\" data-start=\"303\">Centara Life Phu Pano, Krabi</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"402\" data-section-id=\"10wjzv8\" data-start=\"338\">02 Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"400\" data-start=\"358\">Royal Benja Hotel Sukhumvit 5, Bangkok</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"459\" data-section-id=\"1w49qn3\" data-start=\"403\"><strong data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"405\">02 Rooms on Double Sharing</strong> <em data-end=\"457\" data-start=\"436\">(01 King + 01 Twin)</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"461\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"502\" data-section-id=\"1noctlh\" data-start=\"466\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"502\" data-start=\"474\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"503\">\n	<li data-end=\"562\" data-section-id=\"10a7noz\" data-start=\"503\">🛥️ <strong data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"509\">James Bond Island Tour by Speed Boat</strong> with Lunch&nbsp;<em>(Excluding National Park Fee)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"619\" data-section-id=\"15nu76i\" data-start=\"563\">🏝️ <strong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"569\">Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat</strong> with Lunch&nbsp;<em>(Excluding National Park Fee)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"675\" data-section-id=\"rwvx2p\" data-start=\"620\">🦁 <strong data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"625\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park</strong> with Buffet Lunch</li>\n	<li data-end=\"740\" data-section-id=\"1qs3owy\" data-start=\"676\">🌃 <strong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"681\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise</strong> with Indian Buffet</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"742\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"767\" data-section-id=\"l6qhh0\" data-start=\"747\">🚗 <strong data-end=\"767\" data-start=\"754\">Transfers</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1080\" data-start=\"768\">\n	<li data-end=\"831\" data-section-id=\"1t9iwm1\" data-start=\"768\">🚖 Phuket Airport (HKT) → Phuket Hotel <em data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"809\">(Private Transfer)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"902\" data-section-id=\"1fdqhci\" data-start=\"832\">🚗 Phuket → Krabi Hotel <em data-end=\"900\" data-start=\"858\">(En-route Phuket City Tour + Tiger Park)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"966\" data-section-id=\"1lr9f3d\" data-start=\"903\">🚗 Krabi Hotel → Krabi Airport (KBV) <em data-end=\"964\" data-start=\"942\">(Departure Transfer)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1022\" data-section-id=\"n16pi2\" data-start=\"967\">✈️ DMK Airport → Bangkok Hotel <em data-end=\"1020\" data-start=\"1000\">(Arrival Transfer)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1080\" data-section-id=\"1h5z3u9\" data-start=\"1023\">🚖 Bangkok Hotel → BKK Airport <em data-end=\"1078\" data-start=\"1056\">(Departure Transfer)</em></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1082\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1104\" data-section-id=\"146w8ce\" data-start=\"1087\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1095\">Meals</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1245\" data-start=\"1105\">\n	<li data-end=\"1145\" data-section-id=\"u1lh5h\" data-start=\"1105\">Daily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1180\" data-section-id=\"g022dt\" data-start=\"1146\">02 Lunches during island tours</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1209\" data-section-id=\"yjwe8c\" data-start=\"1181\">01 Lunch at Safari World</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1245\" data-section-id=\"1szh3zz\" data-start=\"1210\">01 Dinner on Chao Phraya Cruise</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1247\" />\n<h2 data-end=\"1280\" data-section-id=\"1s2kyy7\" data-start=\"1252\">💎 <strong data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1258\">Package Highlights</strong></h2>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1560\" data-start=\"1281\">\n	<li data-end=\"1336\" data-section-id=\"bh099r\" data-start=\"1281\">✅ Perfect blend of <strong data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1302\">leisure, culture &amp; adventure</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1388\" data-section-id=\"194rg47\" data-start=\"1337\">✅ Premium accommodations in <strong data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1367\">prime locations</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1451\" data-section-id=\"z74m5c\" data-start=\"1389\">✅ Comfortable <strong data-end=\"1449\" data-start=\"1405\">private transfers throughout the journey</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1501\" data-section-id=\"ht9aeg\" data-start=\"1452\">✅ Well-planned sightseeing with <strong data-end=\"1499\" data-start=\"1486\">SIC tours</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"1560\" data-section-id=\"9h6asp\" data-start=\"1502\">✅ Ideal itinerary covering <strong data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1531\">Phuket, Krabi &amp; Bangkok</strong></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":166056,\"land_cost\":\"77300\",\"hotel_cost\":62500,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":305856,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 36702.72\",\"selling_price\":342558.71999999997206032276153564453125}', 'MZQ/0813/032026', 342560, 85640, 0, '2026-03-27 10:10:22', '2026-03-27 10:10:22', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(828, 'Mr. Premjeet Kumar', 'Prince Motors', '943110678', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'ANDAMAN 4*', '2026-04-28', 5, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival at Port Blair | Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach & Cellular Jail Light & Sound Show\",\"date\":\"28-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"531\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"294\\\">Airport Welcome:<\\/strong> Arrive at Veer Savarkar International Airport, Port Blair, where our representative will greet you and assist with a smooth transfer to your hotel. After check-in and refreshment, begin your journey of the islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"791\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"557\\\" data-start=\\\"533\\\">Carbyn\\u2019s Cove Beach:<\\/strong> Spend the afternoon at Carbyn\\u2019s Cove, a picturesque palm-fringed beach just a short drive from the city. Walk along the shoreline, soak in the sea breeze, and relax by the turquoise waters \\u2013 a perfect start to your Andaman holiday.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"832\\\" data-start=\\\"793\\\">Cellular Jail &amp; Light &amp; Sound Show:<\\/strong> Later, visit the iconic <em data-end=\\\"884\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\">Cellular Jail (Kala Pani)<\\/em>, where the corridors and galleries narrate the tale of India\\u2019s freedom struggle. In the evening, witness the moving <strong data-end=\\\"1023\\\" data-start=\\\"1001\\\">Light &amp; Sound Show<\\/strong>, which brings history alive through music, narration, and lights.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1112\\\" data-start=\\\"1093\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Blair \\u2192 Havelock Island | Radhanagar Beach Sunset\",\"date\":\"29-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1400\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\">Private Cruise to Havelock:<\\/strong> After breakfast, board a premium private cruise (<em data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"1287\\\">Makruzz \\u2013 Premium Class<\\/em> \\/ <em data-end=\\\"1339\\\" data-start=\\\"1315\\\">Nautika \\u2013 Luxury Class<\\/em>) for a scenic transfer from Port Blair to Havelock Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1470\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1421\\\" data-start=\\\"1402\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1493\\\" data-start=\\\"1472\\\">Radhanagar Beach:<\\/strong> In the afternoon, visit the world-renowned <strong data-end=\\\"1571\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\">Radhanagar Beach (Beach No. 7)<\\/strong>, voted one of Asia\\u2019s best beaches. Enjoy its pristine white sands, azure waters, and a spectacular sunset.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1701\\\" data-start=\\\"1682\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<br data-end=\\\"1721\\\" data-start=\\\"1718\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"1802\\\" data-start=\\\"1721\\\">Note: Ferry timings and class upgrades can be requested at the time of booking.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Elephant Beach Excursion with Snorkelling\",\"date\":\"30-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2060\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1900\\\" data-start=\\\"1871\\\">Hotel Pickup &amp; Boat Ride:<\\/strong> Begin your day with a hotel pickup and transfer to the jetty. Enjoy a 30-minute boat ride to <strong data-end=\\\"2012\\\" data-start=\\\"1994\\\">Elephant Beach<\\/strong>, famous for its coral reefs and clear waters.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2222\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2092\\\" data-start=\\\"2062\\\">Complimentary Snorkelling:<\\/strong> Experience the vibrant marine world through a complimentary snorkelling session (subject to weather and government guidelines).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2425\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2261\\\" data-start=\\\"2224\\\">Beach Time &amp; Optional Activities:<\\/strong> Spend time relaxing on the beach or enjoy optional activities such as Sea Walking, Parasailing, Banana Ride, Sofa Ride, or Sea Scooter (on direct payment basis).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2522\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2442\\\" data-start=\\\"2427\\\">Hotel Drop:<\\/strong> Return to your resort for the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2484\\\" data-start=\\\"2481\\\" \\/>\\n<strong data-end=\\\"2503\\\" data-start=\\\"2484\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Havelock Island.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Havelock \\u2192 Neil Island | Natural Rock Formation & Laxmanpur Beach\",\"date\":\"01-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2731\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2613\\\">Check Out &amp; Cruise Transfer:<\\/strong> After breakfast, check out and board a private cruise from Havelock to Neil Island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2791\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2752\\\" data-start=\\\"2733\\\">Hotel Check-in:<\\/strong> On arrival, transfer to your resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2960\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2820\\\" data-start=\\\"2793\\\">Natural Rock Formation:<\\/strong> Visit Neil\\u2019s iconic Natural Rock Formation, also known as the <em data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2883\\\">Howrah Bridge<\\/em>, a natural wonder created by centuries of coral formations.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3099\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2989\\\" data-start=\\\"2962\\\">Laxmanpur Beach Sunset:<\\/strong> Spend the evening at <strong data-end=\\\"3030\\\" data-start=\\\"3011\\\">Laxmanpur Beach<\\/strong>, known for its wide shoreline and mesmerizing golden sunset views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3214\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3120\\\" data-start=\\\"3101\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Neil Island.<br data-end=\\\"3136\\\" data-start=\\\"3133\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"3212\\\" data-start=\\\"3136\\\">Note: Ferry timings are subject to change and will be updated by our team.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Neil Island \\u2192 Port Blair | Bharatpur Beach, Shopping\",\"date\":\"02-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3488\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3338\\\" data-start=\\\"3318\\\">Bharatpur Beach:<\\/strong> Begin the morning at <strong data-end=\\\"3379\\\" data-start=\\\"3360\\\">Bharatpur Beach<\\/strong>, ideal for swimming, sunbathing, and optional water sports such as jet skiing and glass-bottom boat rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3614\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3515\\\" data-start=\\\"3490\\\">Check Out &amp; Transfer:<\\/strong> Check out from the resort and transfer to Neil Jetty. Board a private cruise back to Port Blair.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3770\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3634\\\" data-start=\\\"3616\\\">Shopping Trip:<\\/strong> In the evening, enjoy shopping at Port Blair\\u2019s local markets for souvenirs like pearls, shell crafts, spices, and island handicrafts.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3961\\\" data-start=\\\"3772\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"3982\\\" data-start=\\\"3963\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Port Blair.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Port Blair\",\"date\":\"03-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your return flight. Carry back fond memories of your Andaman journey.<br data-end=\\\"4193\\\" data-start=\\\"4190\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"4368\\\" data-start=\\\"4193\\\">Note: Hotels usually have early check-out times. If your flight is in the afternoon, luggage can be kept at the reception. Extra sightseeing may be arranged if time permits.<\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"2782\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:25 AM\",\"fare\":19881},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Portblair (IXZ)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6396\",\"dep_date\":\"03 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"fare\":60240},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7325\",\"dep_date\":\"03 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/04\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HAVELOCK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Sandy Waves Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"01\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"01\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"NEIL\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Symphony Summer Sand\",\"room_type\":\"Casa Earth\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"02\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"02\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PORTBLAIR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lemon Tree\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"03\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<p data-end=\"184\" data-start=\"99\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"121\" data-start=\"102\">Return Airfare:</strong> Kolkata → Port Blair (IXZ) &amp; Port Blair (IXZ) → Ranchi (IXR)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"353\" data-start=\"186\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"207\" data-start=\"189\">Accommodation:</strong><br data-end=\"210\" data-start=\"207\" />\n• 02 Nts – Hotel Lemon Tree <strong>@Port Blair</strong><br data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"258\" />\n• 02 Nts – Hotel Sandy Waves Beach Resort&nbsp;<strong>@Havelock</strong><br data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"307\" />\n• 01 Nt – Hotel Symphony Summer Sand<strong> @Neil</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"355\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"369\" data-start=\"359\">Meals:</strong> Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"412\">🤿 Complimentary snorkeling session at Havelock<br data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"459\" />\n✈️ Meet &amp; greet service at the airport<br data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"500\" />\n🚗 Private AC vehicle for all sightseeing (point-to-point basis)<br data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"567\" />\n⛴️ Inter-island ferry transfers – Nautika (Luxury) / Makruzz (Premium) <em data-end=\"669\" data-start=\"641\">(seat upgrades chargeable)</em><br data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"669\" />\n🕖 Ferry timings: 7:30 AM / 8:00 AM / 8:30 AM <em data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"718\">(subject to availability)</em></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"749\">📅 Full-day tours with all transfers including airport pick-up &amp; drop<br data-end=\"821\" data-start=\"818\" />\n🎟️ All entry tickets, ferry tickets &amp; permits included<br data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"876\" />\n🥪 Packed breakfast for early morning departures</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1087\" data-start=\"931\">👤 Dedicated tour coordinator (single point of contact)<br data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"986\" />\n🛠️ Assistance at all major points (Airport, Jetty, Jail, Water Sports Complex, Havelock &amp; Neil)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1200\" data-start=\"1089\">🚙 All vehicle charges included <em data-end=\"1170\" data-start=\"1121\">(AC vehicles as per itinerary, not at disposal)</em><br data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1170\" />\n💰 <strong data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1176\">All taxes included</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1295\" data-start=\"1202\">⚠️ <em data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1205\">Note: Complimentary activities are non-refundable in case of unforeseen cancellations.</em></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":80121,\"land_cost\":\"103519\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":183640,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 31218.8\",\"selling_price\":214858.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0814/042026', 214858, 91999, 30860, '2026-04-07 11:00:17', '2026-04-07 11:41:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(829, 'Mrs. Shalini Sharma', 'MZT', '9709400140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BALI 4*', '2026-06-20', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Bali\",\"date\":\"20-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in <strong data-end=\\\"90\\\" data-start=\\\"49\\\">Bali<\\/strong>, you will be warmly welcomed by a representative with a traditional flower garland and a refreshing coconut drink. After the meet and greet, you will be transferred to your hotel for check-in (standard check-in time is 15:00). The rest of the day is free for you to relax and settle in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meals are not included on this day.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Watersports & Candlelight Dinner\",\"date\":\"21-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1192\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, you will be picked up at 10:00 AM for an exciting watersports experience at <strong data-end=\\\"612\\\" data-start=\\\"571\\\">Tanjung Benoa<\\/strong>, where you will enjoy parasailing, jet skiing, and a banana boat ride. Additional activities can be availed at your own expense. After returning to the hotel and relaxing, you will be picked up again in the evening for a romantic candlelight dinner at an Indian restaurant. Later, you will be transferred back to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1192\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\">Breakfast and dinner are included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ATV Ride, Waterfall & Swing\",\"date\":\"22-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2133\\\" data-start=\\\"1780\\\">Following breakfast, you will be picked up at 09:00 AM and driven to <strong data-end=\\\"1129\\\" data-start=\\\"1088\\\">Silakarang Village<\\/strong> for an adventurous ATV tandem ride through scenic landscapes including villages, rice fields, muddy tracks, rivers, and caves. After the ride, you will visit the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"1343\\\" data-start=\\\"1302\\\">Tegenungan Waterfall<\\/strong> and then head to <strong data-end=\\\"1402\\\" data-start=\\\"1361\\\">Alas Harum Tegalalang<\\/strong>, where you can enjoy an extreme swing (one swing included; other activities at your own cost). After a fun-filled day, you will return to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2133\\\" data-start=\\\"1780\\\">Breakfast is included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Nusa Penida Island Tour\",\"date\":\"23-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>You will start early with breakfast or a pre-arranged breakfast box before being picked up at 07:00 AM for transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1779\\\" data-start=\\\"1738\\\">Sanur Port<\\/strong>. From there, you will take a shared speedboat to <strong data-end=\\\"1870\\\" data-start=\\\"1829\\\">Nusa Penida<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, you will embark on a full-day tour covering both East and West highlights, including <strong data-end=\\\"2012\\\" data-start=\\\"1971\\\">Diamond Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2055\\\" data-start=\\\"2014\\\">Angel\'s Billabong<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2098\\\" data-start=\\\"2057\\\">Broken Beach<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"2143\\\" data-start=\\\"2100\\\">Kelingking Cliff<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"2192\\\" data-start=\\\"2149\\\">Rumah Pohon<\\/strong>. A local lunch will be provided during the tour. In the late afternoon, you will return by boat to Sanur and then transfer back to your hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Breakfast and lunch are included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ubud Exploration\",\"date\":\"24-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3526\\\" data-start=\\\"3079\\\">After breakfast, you will check out from your hotel and be picked up at 12:00 PM. You will visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2557\\\" data-start=\\\"2514\\\">Ubud Palace<\\/strong> and explore the nearby <strong data-end=\\\"2624\\\" data-start=\\\"2581\\\">Ubud Art Market<\\/strong>, known for local handicrafts and souvenirs. Afterward, you will be transferred to your next hotel for check-in. The rest of the day is free for leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3526\\\" data-start=\\\"3079\\\">Breakfast is included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mount Batur Sunrise Jeep Tour\",\"date\":\"25-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"4119\\\" data-start=\\\"3795\\\">An early morning adventure awaits as you receive a breakfast box and are picked up between 02:30\\u201303:00 AM. You will be transferred to Pineh Base Camp and then switch to a 4WD jeep around 04:00 AM. The journey continues over rugged terrain to reach a sunrise viewpoint at <strong data-end=\\\"3163\\\" data-start=\\\"3120\\\">Mount Batur<\\/strong>, where you can witness a stunning sunrise (weather permitting). After sunrise, you will explore the fascinating black lava formations before returning to the base camp and heading back to your hotel, arriving around 09:30\\u201310:00 AM. The rest of the day is free to relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4119\\\" data-start=\\\"3795\\\">Breakfast is included.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"26-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy some free time at your leisure until your scheduled pick-up. You will then be transferred to the airport as per your flight timing for your onward journey,<em><strong> carrying with you beautiful memories of Bali\\u2019s scenic landscapes, cultural heritage, and unforgettable experiences.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1607\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:15 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:40 PM\",\"fare\":48996},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Mumbai (BOM)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1608\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"12:10 AM\",\"fare\":55224}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BALI KUTA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fairfield by Marriott Bali Legian\",\"room_type\":\"King Bed\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"24\\/06\\/2026\",\"nights\":4,\"rate\":\"19100\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"24\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BALI UBUD\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Maar Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Bed Room Pool Villa\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"20700\",\"check_out\":\"26\\/06\\/2026\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️ <strong data-end=\"21\" data-start=\"3\">Return Airfare</strong> Ex–Mumbai<br data-end=\"34\" data-start=\"31\" />\n🏨 <strong data-end=\"50\" data-start=\"37\">04 Nights</strong> – <strong data-end=\"90\" data-start=\"53\">Fairfield by Marriott Bali Legian</strong><br data-end=\"93\" data-start=\"90\" />\n🌿🏨 <strong data-end=\"111\" data-start=\"98\">02 Nights</strong> – <strong data-end=\"134\" data-start=\"114\">Maar Resort Ubud</strong><br data-end=\"137\" data-start=\"134\" />\n🍽️ <strong data-end=\"167\" data-start=\"141\">Meals as per itinerary</strong> (Breakfast, Lunch, and Dinner as mentioned)</p>\n\n<p><br data-end=\"214\" data-start=\"211\" />\n🌊 <strong data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"220\">1x Indian Candlelight Dinner</strong> by the Beach<br data-end=\"268\" data-start=\"265\" />\n🚗❄️ <strong data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"273\">Private Air-Conditioned Vehicle</strong> (Toyota Avanza / Daihatsu Xenia / Suzuki APV) for all transfers &amp; tours<br data-end=\"383\" data-start=\"380\" />\n🗣️ <strong data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"387\">English-Speaking Driver</strong> throughout the trip<br data-end=\"437\" data-start=\"434\" />\n🚙🌋 <strong data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"442\">4x4 WD Jeep Experience at Mount Batur</strong> for sunrise tour<br data-end=\"503\" data-start=\"500\" />\n🗺️ <strong data-end=\"532\" data-start=\"507\">Complete Tour Program</strong> as per itinerary<br data-end=\"552\" data-start=\"549\" />\n🎟️🅿️ <strong data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"559\">All Entrance Tickets &amp; Parking Fees included</strong><br data-end=\"610\" data-start=\"607\" />\n🌺🥥 <strong data-end=\"663\" data-start=\"615\">Welcome Flower Garland &amp; Fresh Coconut Drink</strong> on arrival at the airport<br data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"689\" />\n💧 <strong data-end=\"721\" data-start=\"695\">Mineral Water (600 ml)</strong> per person per day during tours<br data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\" />\n🏛️ <strong data-end=\"789\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"760\">Government Taxes included</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":104220,\"land_cost\":\"48000\",\"hotel_cost\":39800,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":192020,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 28803\",\"selling_price\":220823}', 'MZQ/0815/042026', 220822, 110411, 0, '2026-04-08 13:09:05', '2026-04-10 08:42:04', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(830, 'Mrs. Sangeeta Singh', 'Akshat Mom', '8986630884', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL KASHMIR 4*', '2026-03-22', 5, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Srinagar\",\"date\":\"22-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1007\\\" data-start=\\\"375\\\">Upon your arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"175\\\" data-start=\\\"134\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong>, you will be warmly welcomed by our representative, who will assist you with your transfer to the hotel in <strong data-end=\\\"324\\\" data-start=\\\"283\\\">Srinagar<\\/strong>. As you drive through the city, you will get your first glimpse of Kashmir\\u2019s breathtaking landscapes, surrounded by mountains and serene beauty. After reaching the hotel, complete the check-in formalities and take some time to freshen up and relax after your journey. The rest of the day is at leisure, allowing you to unwind or explore nearby areas at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1007\\\" data-start=\\\"375\\\">In the evening, enjoy a delicious dinner followed by a comfortable <strong>overnight stay at the hotel in Srinagar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Sonmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"23-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1312\\\" data-start=\\\"868\\\">After a hearty breakfast, set out for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"971\\\" data-start=\\\"930\\\">Sonmarg<\\/strong>, famously known as the \\u201cMeadow of Gold.\\u201d The journey itself is incredibly scenic, offering mesmerizing views of lush valleys, snow-capped peaks, and the sparkling <strong data-end=\\\"1176\\\" data-start=\\\"1135\\\">Sindh River<\\/strong> flowing alongside the road. Sonmarg, located at an altitude of around 2692 meters, is a paradise for nature lovers and photographers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1918\\\" data-start=\\\"1314\\\">Upon arrival, you can soak in the beauty of vast meadows and glaciers. Adventure enthusiasts may opt for river rafting in the Sindh River (at their own cost). You can also take a pony ride to the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"1563\\\" data-start=\\\"1522\\\">Thajiwas Glacier<\\/strong>, where snow can be found almost throughout the year. Another optional excursion is visiting <strong data-end=\\\"1697\\\" data-start=\\\"1656\\\">Zero Point<\\/strong>, known for its year-round snow and dramatic mountain views (accessible by union vehicle at extra cost). After spending quality time amidst nature, return to Srinagar by evening for dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1918\\\" data-start=\\\"1314\\\"><strong>Overnight stay at the hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"24-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2579\\\" data-start=\\\"1975\\\">After breakfast, begin your scenic drive towards <strong data-end=\\\"2065\\\" data-start=\\\"2024\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong>, one of the most beautiful destinations in Kashmir, often referred to as the \\u201cValley of Shepherds.\\u201d The journey to Pahalgam is equally enchanting, passing through charming countryside landscapes and historic sites. En route, visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2349\\\" data-start=\\\"2308\\\">Pampore Saffron Fields<\\/strong>, where the world-renowned saffron is cultivated, and explore the ancient <strong data-end=\\\"2464\\\" data-start=\\\"2423\\\">Awantipora Ruins<\\/strong>, which date back over a thousand years. You may also visit the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"2576\\\" data-start=\\\"2535\\\">Mattan Temple<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3359\\\" data-start=\\\"2581\\\">Upon arrival in Pahalgam, you will be greeted by fresh mountain air and stunning views of pine forests and the flowing <strong data-end=\\\"2743\\\" data-start=\\\"2700\\\">Lidder River<\\/strong>. You can enjoy leisurely walks along the riverside or opt for rafting (at your own cost). For further exploration, you may hire a local union vehicle (at extra cost) to visit famous nearby attractions such as <strong data-end=\\\"2996\\\" data-start=\\\"2953\\\">Betaab Valley<\\/strong>, <strong data-end=\\\"3041\\\" data-start=\\\"2998\\\">Aru Valley<\\/strong>, and <strong data-end=\\\"3090\\\" data-start=\\\"3047\\\">Chandanwari<\\/strong>. You can also take a pony ride to the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"3184\\\" data-start=\\\"3141\\\">Baisaran Valley<\\/strong>, often referred to as \\u201cMini Switzerland\\u201d due to its lush green meadows and panoramic views. After a fulfilling day, enjoy dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3359\\\" data-start=\\\"2581\\\"><strong>Overnight stay at your hotel in Pahalgam.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam \\u2013 Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"25-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3747\\\" data-start=\\\"3415\\\">After breakfast, proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"3491\\\" data-start=\\\"3448\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong>, a world-famous destination known for its scenic beauty, lush green meadows, and snow-covered landscapes. Situated at an altitude of approximately 2730 meters, Gulmarg is also home to one of the highest golf courses and premier ski resorts in the world.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4403\\\" data-start=\\\"3749\\\">On arrival, you can enjoy the pristine surroundings or indulge in optional activities. A visit to the beautiful <strong data-end=\\\"3904\\\" data-start=\\\"3861\\\">Drung Waterfall<\\/strong> is highly recommended (accessible via union vehicle at extra cost). One of the major highlights here is the <strong data-end=\\\"4056\\\" data-start=\\\"4013\\\">Gulmarg Gondola<\\/strong>, one of the highest cable car rides in Asia, offering breathtaking views as it takes you up to Kongdoori and further towards Apharwat Peak (tickets not included). You may also explore local markets and handicraft shops for souvenirs. After enjoying the day in this winter wonderland, return to your hotel for dinner.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4403\\\" data-start=\\\"3749\\\"><strong>Overnight stay in Gulmarg.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg \\u2013 Srinagar Sightseeing + Houseboat Stay\",\"date\":\"26-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"5030\\\" data-start=\\\"4488\\\">After breakfast, drive back to Srinagar for a full day of local sightseeing. Visit the magnificent Mughal gardens, starting with <strong data-end=\\\"4660\\\" data-start=\\\"4617\\\">Nishat Garden<\\/strong>, known for its terraced lawns and stunning views of Dal Lake, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"4778\\\" data-start=\\\"4735\\\">Shalimar Garden<\\/strong>, a beautifully designed garden built by Emperor Jahangir. Continue to <strong data-end=\\\"4892\\\" data-start=\\\"4849\\\">Chashme Shahi<\\/strong>, famous for its natural spring, and the historic <strong data-end=\\\"4985\\\" data-start=\\\"4942\\\">Pari Mahal<\\/strong>, which offers panoramic views of the city.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"5527\\\" data-start=\\\"5032\\\">You will also visit the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"5107\\\" data-start=\\\"5064\\\">Tulip Garden Srinagar<\\/strong> (seasonal) and the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"5177\\\" data-start=\\\"5134\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>, perched atop a hill with breathtaking views of the valley. In the evening, enjoy a peaceful and relaxing Shikara ride on the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"5354\\\" data-start=\\\"5311\\\">Dal Lake<\\/strong>, where you can witness the beauty of floating gardens and traditional houseboats. Later, check in to a houseboat for a uniqu.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"5527\\\" data-start=\\\"5032\\\"><strong>Overnight stay experience, followed by dinner.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Srinagar\",\"date\":\"27-03-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3496\\\" data-start=\\\"3292\\\">After breakfast, check out from the houseboat and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"4011\\\" data-start=\\\"3991\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey. Guests are advised to reach the airport at least 2 hours prior to departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3496\\\" data-start=\\\"3292\\\"><em><strong>Your tour concludes with beautiful and long-lasting memories of Kashmir\\u2019s scenic beauty, serene landscapes, and unforgettable experiences.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1047\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"fare\":71508},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1017\",\"dep_date\":\"22 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:15 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2137\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":57828},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2614\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Apr 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"22\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fortune Resort Heevan\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PAHALGAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Heevan\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe River View\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"25\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"GULMARG\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Khyber Himalayan\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/03\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"26\\/03\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SRINAGAR\",\"hotel_name\":\"Houseboat Mughal Sheraton\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Executive Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/03\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"123\" data-start=\"89\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"110\" data-start=\"92\">Return Flights</strong>: Ex–Ranchi</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"341\" data-start=\"125\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"145\" data-start=\"128\">Accommodation</strong>:<br data-end=\"149\" data-start=\"146\" />\n<strong data-end=\"162\" data-start=\"149\">02 Nights</strong> – Fortune Resort Heevan @SRINAGAR<br data-end=\"198\" data-start=\"195\" />\n<strong data-end=\"210\" data-start=\"198\">01 Night</strong> – Hotel Heevan @PAHALGAM<br data-end=\"240\" data-start=\"237\" />\n<strong data-end=\"252\" data-start=\"240\">01 Night</strong> – The Khyber Himalayan Resort &amp; Spa @GULMARG<br data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"296\" />\n<strong data-end=\"311\" data-start=\"299\">01 Night</strong> – Houseboat Mughal Sheraton @SRINAGAR</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"429\" data-start=\"343\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"360\" data-start=\"347\">Meal Plan</strong>: MAP (<strong data-end=\"389\" data-start=\"367\">Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong>)<br data-end=\"393\" data-start=\"390\" />\n🛏️ <strong data-end=\"406\" data-start=\"397\">Rooms</strong>: <strong data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"408\">03 Double Rooms</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"431\">🚗 <strong data-end=\"452\" data-start=\"434\">Transportation</strong>: Private <strong data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"462\">Innova Crysta</strong> for all transfers &amp; sightseeing<br data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"511\" />\n🛶 <strong data-end=\"531\" data-start=\"517\">Experience</strong>: <strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"533\">01 Hour Shikara Ride</strong> on Dal Lake</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"829\" data-start=\"602\">🧰 <strong data-end=\"630\" data-start=\"605\">Medical Kit available</strong> in vehicle<br data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"641\" />\n👨‍✈️ <strong data-end=\"693\" data-start=\"650\">Driver charges, toll &amp; parking included</strong><br data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"693\" />\n🤝 <strong data-end=\"716\" data-start=\"699\">Meet &amp; Assist</strong> on arrival &amp; departure<br data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"739\" />\n🛬 <strong data-end=\"788\" data-start=\"745\">Srinagar Airport Pickup &amp; Drop included</strong><br data-end=\"791\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"788\" />\n💰 <strong data-end=\"827\" data-start=\"794\">All applicable taxes included</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":129336,\"land_cost\":\"320800\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":450136,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 54016.32\",\"selling_price\":504152.3200000000069849193096160888671875}', 'MZQ/0816/042026', 504150, 84025, 0, '2026-04-09 06:53:02', '2026-04-11 06:51:16', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(831, 'Dr. Garima Singh', 'Harmu', '9936190006', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-04-21', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Hanoi\",\"date\":\"21-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"472\\\" data-start=\\\"134\\\">Upon arrival at Noi Bai International Airport in Hanoi, you will be warmly welcomed by our representative holding a placard with your name. Thereafter, transfer to your hotel (approx. 45\\u201360 minutes) and complete the check-in formalities. Standard check-in time is from 02:00 PM onwards.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"536\\\" data-start=\\\"474\\\">After some relaxation, you can explore the city on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"546\\\" data-start=\\\"538\\\">Later, enjoy a cup of traditional Vietnamese coffee at a local caf\\u00e9 while experiencing the lively atmosphere of Hanoi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"969\\\" data-start=\\\"939\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"961\\\" data-start=\\\"942\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ha Long Bay \\u2013 Ambassador Day Cruise\",\"date\":\"22-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1146\\\" data-start=\\\"976\\\">Early morning, depart from Hanoi by shuttle bus for an unforgettable cruise experience in Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1158\\\" data-start=\\\"1148\\\">Timings:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1322\\\" data-start=\\\"1159\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1225\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1yghugv\\\" data-start=\\\"1159\\\">05:00 \\u2013 05:30 AM: Pick-up from your hotel in Hanoi Old Quarter<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1322\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1e76zoa\\\" data-start=\\\"1226\\\">08:00 \\u2013 08:45 AM: Check-in at Ambassador Lounge and board the luxurious Ambassador Cruise II<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1445\\\" data-start=\\\"1324\\\">Enjoy a light breakfast as the cruise sails through the spectacular limestone islands of Ha Long Bay and Bai Tu Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1482\\\" data-start=\\\"1447\\\">Places covered during the cruise:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1790\\\" data-start=\\\"1483\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-section-id=\\\"19rpsb3\\\" data-start=\\\"1483\\\">Sung Sot Cave \\u2013 the largest and most magnificent cave in the bay.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1680\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1b4wd2b\\\" data-start=\\\"1577\\\">Ti Top Island \\u2013 relax on the beach or climb to the top for panoramic views.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1790\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1rf5zod\\\" data-start=\\\"1681\\\">Luon Cave \\u2013 enjoy optional bamboo boat ride or kayaking (at additional cost).<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1894\\\" data-start=\\\"1792\\\">A premium lunch will be served onboard while cruising past the breathtaking landscapes of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2002\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\">In the afternoon, relax with tea and live music on the sundeck before disembarking and returning to Hanoi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2066\\\" data-start=\\\"2004\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2027\\\" data-start=\\\"2008\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong> Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2036\\\" data-start=\\\"2033\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2058\\\" data-start=\\\"2039\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi \\u2013 Da Nang\",\"date\":\"23-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2206\\\" data-start=\\\"2073\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport for your flight to Da Nang.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2314\\\" data-start=\\\"2208\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"3161\\\" data-start=\\\"3128\\\">Da Nang International Airport<\\/strong>, you will be received and transferred to your hotel. The rest of the evening is free for leisure where you can relax or explore the nearby beachside areas.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2384\\\" data-start=\\\"2316\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2339\\\" data-start=\\\"2320\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"2352\\\" data-start=\\\"2349\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2374\\\" data-start=\\\"2355\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ba Na Hills & Golden Bridge Tour\",\"date\":\"24-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3110\\\" data-start=\\\"2769\\\">Wake up early to witness a mesmerizing sunrise over <strong data-end=\\\"2889\\\" data-start=\\\"2874\\\">Ha Long Bay<\\/strong>, a truly unforgettable experience. Enjoy breakfast (or brunch) while cruising back through the limestone formations. After disembarkation, return to <strong data-end=\\\"3048\\\" data-start=\\\"3039\\\">Hanoi<\\/strong> and transfer to the airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"3107\\\" data-start=\\\"3096\\\">Da Nang<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3359\\\" data-start=\\\"3112\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"3161\\\" data-start=\\\"3128\\\">Da Nang International Airport<\\/strong>, you will be received and transferred to your hotel. The rest of the evening is free for leisure where you can relax or explore the nearby beachside areas.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2547\\\" data-start=\\\"2391\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to Ba Na Hills.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2645\\\" data-start=\\\"2549\\\">Travel through one of Da Nang\\u2019s most scenic coastal roads before reaching the cable car station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2768\\\" data-start=\\\"2647\\\">Experience the famous Ba Na Hills cable car, recognized for being one of the world\\u2019s longest and highest cable car rides.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2794\\\" data-start=\\\"2770\\\">At Ba Na Hills, visit:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"3035\\\" data-start=\\\"2795\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2888\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1dcgmkc\\\" data-start=\\\"2795\\\">Golden Bridge \\u2013 the iconic bridge supported by giant stone hands.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2930\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1upsd79\\\" data-start=\\\"2889\\\">Le Jardin d\'Amour<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2972\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1xaspf9\\\" data-start=\\\"2931\\\">Linh Ung Pagoda<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"3035\\\" data-section-id=\\\"14uosp4\\\" data-start=\\\"2973\\\">Peak of Chua Mountain for panoramic views of Da Nang City.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3113\\\" data-start=\\\"3037\\\">You may also enjoy time at Fantasy Park (selected games at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3140\\\" data-start=\\\"3115\\\">Later, return to Da Nang.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3174\\\" data-start=\\\"3142\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3164\\\" data-start=\\\"3145\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Da Nang<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3359\\\" data-start=\\\"3112\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Da Nang \\u2013 Ho Chi Minh City\",\"date\":\"25-04-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3350\\\" data-start=\\\"3181\\\">After breakfast, enjoy free time until your scheduled transfer to Da Nang Airport for your flight to Ho Chi Minh City.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3468\\\" data-start=\\\"3352\\\">Upon arrival at Tan Son Nhat International Airport, meet our representative and transfer to your hotel for check-in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3509\\\" data-start=\\\"3470\\\">The remainder of the day is at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3588\\\" data-start=\\\"3511\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3534\\\" data-start=\\\"3515\\\">Meals Included:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"3547\\\" data-start=\\\"3544\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3569\\\" data-start=\\\"3550\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Ho Chi Minh City<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"im