(832, 'Mr. Vibhor Agarwal', 'BNI', '9234608415', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'GUJARAT', '2026-06-27', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Surat to Saputara \\ud83d\\ude98\\ud83c\\udf04\",\"date\":\"27-06-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"381\\\" data-start=\\\"235\\\">Pick up from <strong data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"304\\\">Surat<\\/strong> and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"346\\\" data-start=\\\"334\\\">Saputara<\\/strong>, the only hill station of Gujarat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"481\\\" data-start=\\\"383\\\">Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax. After freshening up, proceed for local sightseeing:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"608\\\" data-start=\\\"483\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"524\\\" data-section-id=\\\"15bg0k5\\\" data-start=\\\"483\\\">Gira Waterfalls<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"566\\\" data-section-id=\\\"17wgcs5\\\" data-start=\\\"525\\\">Waghai Botanical Garden<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"608\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1gcjogl\\\" data-start=\\\"567\\\">Sunset Point Saputara<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"655\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\">Enjoy the scenic beauty and pleasant weather.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"690\\\" data-start=\\\"657\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"679\\\" data-start=\\\"660\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Saputara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Saputara to Vadodara \\ud83d\\ude98\",\"date\":\"28-06-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"817\\\" data-start=\\\"697\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"767\\\" data-start=\\\"754\\\">Distance:<\\/strong> Approx. 295 km | <strong data-end=\\\"801\\\" data-start=\\\"785\\\">Travel Time:<\\/strong> 5 hrs 10 mins<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"889\\\" data-start=\\\"819\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"888\\\" data-start=\\\"876\\\">Vadodara<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"948\\\" data-start=\\\"891\\\">Upon arrival, check in at the pre-booked hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"983\\\" data-start=\\\"950\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"972\\\" data-start=\\\"953\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Vadodara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Kevadia \\u2013 Statue of Unity \\ud83d\\uddfd\\ud83c\\udf3f\",\"date\":\"29-06-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1127\\\" data-start=\\\"990\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"1126\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\">Kevadia<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1164\\\" data-start=\\\"1129\\\">Visit the world\\u2019s tallest statue:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1206\\\" data-start=\\\"1165\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1206\\\" data-section-id=\\\"cgv1px\\\" data-start=\\\"1165\\\">Statue of Unity<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1253\\\" data-start=\\\"1208\\\">Enjoy nearby attractions (subject to time):<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1304\\\" data-start=\\\"1254\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1278\\\" data-section-id=\\\"pw36rc\\\" data-start=\\\"1254\\\">Valley of Flowers \\ud83c\\udf38<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1304\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1xhjxpn\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\">Sardar Sarovar Dam \\ud83c\\udf0a<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1452\\\" data-start=\\\"1306\\\">\\ud83d\\udc49 <strong data-end=\\\"1318\\\" data-start=\\\"1309\\\">Note:<\\/strong> Entry &amp; activity tickets are not included and must be purchased directly.<br data-end=\\\"1395\\\" data-start=\\\"1392\\\" \\/>\\nGuests can also book tickets online via official website.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1495\\\" data-start=\\\"1454\\\">Distance: Approx. 80 km (one way | 2 hrs)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1531\\\" data-start=\\\"1497\\\">Return to Vadodara in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1566\\\" data-start=\\\"1533\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1555\\\" data-start=\\\"1536\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Vadodara<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\