\"189\">Accommodation:</strong><br data-end=\"210\" data-start=\"207\" />\n• 01&nbsp;Nt&nbsp;– Hotel Daksh The Valley Resort&nbsp;<strong>@Saputara</strong><br data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"258\" />\n• 02 Nts – Hotel Regenta Inn&nbsp;<strong>@Vadodara</strong><br data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"307\" />\n• 01 Nt – Hotel Sarovar Portico kalupur<strong>&nbsp;@Ahmedabad<br />\n01 Bedroom for 04 Pax</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"410\" data-start=\"355\">🍽️&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"369\" data-start=\"359\">Meals:</strong>&nbsp;Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"412\">🚗 Private AC vehicle Ertiga for all sightseeing&nbsp;<br data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"567\" />\n🚙 All vehicle charges included&nbsp;<br data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1170\" />\n💰&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1176\">All taxes included</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"60000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":60000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9000\",\"selling_price\":69000}', 'MZQ/0818/042026', 69140, 34570, 0, '2026-04-15 09:21:36', '2026-04-15 09:54:03', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
