(833, 'Mr. Priyesh Mayank', 'Any Time Fitness', '7004801814', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'AMAZING THAILAND', '2026-05-10', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Phuket \\u2013 Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"10-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in Phuket, meet our representative and transfer to your hotel for check-in. The rest of the day is free to relax or explore nearby areas at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2013 Fantasea Show (Evening Tour)\",\"date\":\"11-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy your day at leisure. In the evening, proceed for the famous Phuket FantaSea show, a spectacular cultural theme show featuring Thai traditions, performances, and entertainment.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2013 Optional James Bond Island Tour\",\"date\":\"12-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, the day is free for leisure or you may opt for an exciting tour to James Bond Island (at additional cost), known for its stunning limestone cliffs and scenic beauty.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket \\u2013 Krabi Transfer & Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"13-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from your hotel and proceed to Krabi by road. Upon arrival, check in at your hotel and relax for the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Krabi<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi \\u2013 7 Islands Sunset Tour\",\"date\":\"14-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure. In the afternoon, proceed for the popular&nbsp;<strong>7 Islands Sunset Tour<\\/strong>, where you will visit beautiful islands, enjoy snorkeling, and witness a stunning sunset over the Andaman Sea.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Krabi<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi \\u2013 Phuket Transfer & Hotel Check-in\",\"date\":\"15-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer back to Phuket. Upon arrival, check in at your hotel and enjoy the rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Phuket<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Check-out and Departure Transfer\",\"date\":\"16-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2651\\\" data-start=\\\"2478\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2733\\\" data-start=\\\"2653\\\"><br data-end=\\\"2711\\\" data-start=\\\"2708\\\" \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7235\",\"dep_date\":\"09 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"09 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"35596\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1087\",\"dep_date\":\"10 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"10 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1088\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"35476\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7325\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Amari\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Ocean Front\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"13\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"36736\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KRABI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Amari Vogue\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe King\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"23615\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PHUKET\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand Mercure Patong\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Pool Access\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"16\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"13500\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<h3 data-end=\"140\" data-section-id=\"1q00896\" data-start=\"122\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"129\">Flights</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"141\">\n	<li data-end=\"189\" data-section-id=\"16ktg6y\" data-start=\"141\">Return Airfare <strong data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"175\">Ex-Ranchi</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"194\" data-start=\"191\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"220\" data-section-id=\"7g538q\" data-start=\"196\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"203\">Accommodation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"221\">\n	<li data-end=\"282\" data-section-id=\"1e6yra2\" data-start=\"221\">03&nbsp;Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"280\" data-start=\"241\">Hotel Amari @Phuket</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"337\" data-section-id=\"15v18lh\" data-start=\"283\">02 Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"335\" data-start=\"303\">Hotel Amari Vogue @Krabi</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"402\" data-section-id=\"10wjzv8\" data-start=\"338\">01&nbsp;Nights stay at <strong data-end=\"400\" data-start=\"358\">Hotel Grand Mercure Phuket Patong @Phuket </strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"459\" data-section-id=\"1w49qn3\" data-start=\"403\"><strong data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"405\">01&nbsp;Rooms on Double Sharing</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"461\" />\n<p data-end=\"39\" data-start=\"0\">🎟️ <em data-end=\"39\" data-start=\"4\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities Included</em></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"116\" data-start=\"41\">🛥️ <strong>Krabi </strong>– 4 Island Tour by <strong>Meka Catamaran</strong>&nbsp;<strong>+ Dinner&nbsp;</strong><em>(Including National Park Fee)</em></li>\n	<li data-end=\"179\" data-start=\"118\">🍽️ <strong>Phuket </strong>– FantaSea Show (Dinner Included)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"280\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"181\">🚤 <strong>Phuket </strong>– James Bond &amp; Naka Island by <strong>Catamaran + Sea Canoe + Lunch</strong> <strong>(Including National Park Fee)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"742\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"112\" data-section-id=\"1boyqk3\" data-start=\"92\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"112\" data-start=\"99\">Transfers</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"457\" data-start=\"113\">\n	<li data-end=\"181\" data-section-id=\"15t3ckx\" data-start=\"113\">All Transfers – <strong data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"153\">Private Sedan (2-seater)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1085\" data-start=\"1082\" />\n<h3 data-end=\"1104\" data-section-id=\"146w8ce\" data-start=\"1087\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1095\">Meals</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1245\" data-start=\"1105\">\n	<li data-end=\"1145\" data-section-id=\"u1lh5h\" data-start=\"1105\">Daily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1145\" data-section-id=\"u1lh5h\" data-start=\"1105\">Onboard dinner during the Krabi 4 Island sunset cruise</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1256\" data-section-id=\"ceexzn\" data-start=\"1214\">Buffet dinner at Phuket FantaSea&nbsp;</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1318\" data-section-id=\"oantl1\" data-start=\"1257\">Lunch during Phang Nga Bay / James Bond Island tour&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1247\" />\n<h2 data-end=\"1280\" data-section-id=\"1s2kyy7\" data-start=\"1252\">💎 <strong data-end=\"1280\" data-start=\"1258\">Package Highlights</strong></h2>\n\n<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"102\" data-start=\"25\">✈️ Seamless private airport &amp; intercity transfers (Phuket ⇄ Krabi ⇄ Phuket)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"194\" data-start=\"104\">🏝️ Krabi 4 Island Tour – Poda Island, Chicken Island, Tup Island &amp; Phra Nang Cave Beach</li>\n	<li data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"196\">🚤 James Bond Island &amp; Phang Nga Bay Catamaran Tour with canoeing &amp; floating village visit</li>\n	<li data-end=\"355\" data-start=\"290\">🍽️ Phuket FantaSea cultural show with buffet dinner experience</li>\n	<li data-end=\"415\" data-start=\"357\">🌅 Sunset cruise experience in Krabi with onboard dining</li>\n	<li data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"417\">🧭 All major National Park fees included</li>\n	<li data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"461\">🚗 Comfortable private sedan transfers throughout the trip</li>\n	<li data-end=\"606\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"523\">👨‍👩‍👧 Package designed for 2 adults with fully organized sightseeing &amp; transfers</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"26\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":71072,\"land_cost\":\"45300\",\"hotel_cost\":\"73851\",\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":190223,\"profit_figure\":\"00\",\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 49457.98\",\"selling_price\":239680.98000000001047737896442413330078125,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0819/042026', 238560, 119280, 0, '2026-04-15 11:31:44', '2026-05-08 14:10:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(834, 'Dr. Ankur Sriwastava', 'BNI', '9035347904', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Delightful North', '2026-05-16', 7, 1, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati Arrival \\u2708\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"16-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"684\\\" data-start=\\\"0\\\">Welcome to the captivating land of Assam! Upon arrival at Guwahati Airport or Railway Station, you will be warmly received by our representative and transferred to your hotel for check-in. After some relaxation, explore the cultural highlights of the city including Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra and Assam State Film Museum. Enjoy authentic tea tasting at GTAC Tea Lounge and visit Mahabahu Brahmaputra River Heritage Centre along with the scenic Brahmaputra Riverfront. In the evening, you may opt for a Brahmaputra River Cruise (at additional cost) or explore local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"743\\\" data-start=\\\"686\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"708\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Guwahati<br data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"717\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"733\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"724\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> No Meal<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati \\u2013 Shillong \\u2013 Mawsynram Excursion \\ud83d\\ude98\\ud83c\\udf27\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"17-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1327\\\" data-start=\\\"817\\\">Early morning, drive towards Shillong. En route, stop at the picturesque Umiam Lake (Barapani), where you can enjoy optional water sports. Continue to Mawsynram, known as one of the wettest places on Earth, and explore the serene Mawphlang Sacred Grove. Visit a Khasi Model Village to experience the local culture before returning to Shillong in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1388\\\" data-start=\\\"1329\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1351\\\" data-start=\\\"1332\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Shillong<br data-end=\\\"1363\\\" data-start=\\\"1360\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1376\\\" data-start=\\\"1367\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong \\u2013 Krang Suri Falls \\u2013 Dawki \\ud83c\\udf0a\\ud83d\\udc8e\",\"date\":\"18-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1816\\\" data-start=\\\"1395\\\">After breakfast, proceed to the breathtaking Krang Suri Falls, one of Meghalaya\\u2019s most beautiful waterfalls, where you can enjoy the natural pool and scenic surroundings. Later, drive to Dawki and enjoy boating in the crystal-clear Umgot River. Check in at your hotel in Dawki for an overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1874\\\" data-start=\\\"1818\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1840\\\" data-start=\\\"1821\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Dawki<br data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1846\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1862\\\" data-start=\\\"1853\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dawki \\u2013 Mawlynnong \\u2013 Cherrapunji \\ud83c\\udf3f\\ud83c\\udfe1\",\"date\":\"19-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2227\\\" data-start=\\\"1881\\\">After breakfast, visit Mawlynnong Village, renowned as the cleanest village in Asia (closed on Sundays). Explore the Living Root Bridge and nearby attractions before proceeding to Cherrapunji. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax amidst nature.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2291\\\" data-start=\\\"2229\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2251\\\" data-start=\\\"2232\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Cherrapunji<br data-end=\\\"2266\\\" data-start=\\\"2263\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2279\\\" data-start=\\\"2270\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cherrapunji Local Sightseeing \\ud83c\\udf27\\ufe0f\\ud83c\\udf04\",\"date\":\"20-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2874\\\" data-start=\\\"2298\\\">Wake up to the refreshing environment of Cherrapunji and proceed for a full day of sightseeing. Visit Garden of Caves, Eco Park Cherrapunji (closed Wednesdays), Dainthlen Falls, Nohkalikai Falls, Seven Sisters Falls, Mawsmai Cave and Thangkharang Park (closed Wednesdays). After a day filled with waterfalls and scenic beauty, return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2938\\\" data-start=\\\"2876\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2898\\\" data-start=\\\"2879\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Cherrapunji<br data-end=\\\"2913\\\" data-start=\\\"2910\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2926\\\" data-start=\\\"2917\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cherrapunji \\u2013 Shillong + Local Sightseeing \\ud83c\\udfde\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"21-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3523\\\" data-start=\\\"2945\\\">After breakfast, drive back to Shillong. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and proceed for local sightseeing including Ward\'s Lake (closed Sunday), Lady Hydari Park, Cathedral of Mary Help of Christians, Don Bosco Museum, Shillong Peak and Elephant Falls (closed Sunday). In the evening, explore Police Bazar for shopping and local cuisine.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"3584\\\" data-start=\\\"3525\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3547\\\" data-start=\\\"3528\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Shillong<br data-end=\\\"3559\\\" data-start=\\\"3556\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3572\\\" data-start=\\\"3563\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong \\u2013 Guwahati \\ud83d\\ude98\",\"date\":\"22-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3955\\\" data-start=\\\"3591\\\">After breakfast, proceed to Guwahati. Upon arrival, you may revisit or explore Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra, enjoy tea at GTAC Tea Lounge, or relax at Brahmaputra Riverfront. In the evening, you may opt for a Brahmaputra River Cruise (at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"4016\\\" data-start=\\\"3957\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3979\\\" data-start=\\\"3960\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Guwahati<br data-end=\\\"3991\\\" data-start=\\\"3988\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4004\\\" data-start=\\\"3995\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Guwahati \\ud83d\\ude98\\u2708\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"23-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to Guwahati Airport or Railway Station for your onward journey, carrying unforgettable memories of Northeast India<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em><strong>Depending on your departure time, you may also explore nearby attractions before proceeding to the airport or railway station for your onward journey with wonderful memories.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p><br data-end=\\\"4614\\\" data-start=\\\"4611\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4628\\\" data-start=\\\"4618\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guwahati\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Greenwood\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"17\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Shillong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Polo Towers\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"18\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Dawki\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Ka Bri War Resort\",\"room_type\":\"2 Cottage & 01 Executive\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"19\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Cherrapunji\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Jiva Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Montara Suite\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Shillong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Polo Towers\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"22\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guwahati\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Greenwood\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":9}]', '<h2 data-end=\"199\" data-section-id=\"19ycaxm\" data-start=\"171\"><strong data-end=\"199\" data-start=\"174\">🏨 Accommodation</strong></h2>\n\n<ul data-end=\"420\" data-start=\"201\">\n	<li data-end=\"253\" data-section-id=\"d3hxfr\" data-start=\"201\">🌆 <strong data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"369\">01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;– Hotel Greenwood Resort (Guwahati)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"253\" data-section-id=\"d3hxfr\" data-start=\"201\">🏙️ <strong data-end=\"251\" data-start=\"207\">01 Night&nbsp;– Hotel Polo Towers (Shillong)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"301\" data-section-id=\"1p0jomz\" data-start=\"254\">🌊 <strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"259\">01 Night – Ka Bri War Resort (Dawki)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"363\" data-section-id=\"yzrj3\" data-start=\"302\">🌄 <strong data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"307\">02 Nights – Jiva Resort Cherrapunjee (Cherrapunji)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"363\" data-section-id=\"yzrj3\" data-start=\"302\">🏙️ <strong data-end=\"251\" data-start=\"207\">01 Night&nbsp;– Hotel Polo Towers (Shillong)</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"420\" data-section-id=\"193mef6\" data-start=\"364\">🌆 <strong data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"369\">01&nbsp;Night&nbsp;– Hotel Greenwood Resort (Guwahati)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"422\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"426\">Meal Plan: Daily Breakfast Included</strong></p>\n\n<h1 data-end=\"125\" data-section-id=\"1rflv3j\" data-start=\"85\">🚗 <strong data-end=\"125\" data-start=\"90\">Transport &amp; Vehicle Arrangement</strong></h1>\n\n<ul data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"127\">\n	<li data-end=\"224\" data-section-id=\"1i4ahqf\" data-start=\"127\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"202\" data-start=\"132\">09 Seater Tempo Traveller (TT Maharaja)</strong> for the entire tour</li>\n	<li data-end=\"322\" data-section-id=\"v27mz0\" data-start=\"225\">👨‍✈️ Same vehicle &amp; same experienced driver throughout the journey for comfort &amp; consistency</li>\n	<li data-end=\"405\" data-section-id=\"1r7tfbn\" data-start=\"323\">🧭 Local experienced driver for safe hill driving, route guidance &amp; assistance</li>\n	<li data-end=\"461\" data-section-id=\"f0fv0g\" data-start=\"406\">🕗 Driver service available daily up to <strong data-end=\"459\" data-start=\"448\">8:00 PM</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"542\" data-section-id=\"qft68v\" data-start=\"462\">🚨 Backup support vehicle &amp; local emergency assistance available if required</li>\n	<li data-end=\"614\" data-section-id=\"x5pvj6\" data-start=\"543\">🗺️ Flexible sightseeing timings for comfort and weather conditions</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1 data-end=\"1023\" data-section-id=\"spo4i6\" data-start=\"986\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"992\">Inclusions &amp; Travel Support</strong></h1>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1444\" data-start=\"1025\">\n	<li data-end=\"1093\" data-section-id=\"1evcw2z\" data-start=\"1025\">🅿️ All parking charges, toll taxes &amp; driver allowances included</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1164\" data-section-id=\"19yjbws\" data-start=\"1094\">🧾 Complete itinerary planning &amp; coordination from start to finish</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1230\" data-section-id=\"kddhfw\" data-start=\"1165\">🛂 Assistance for permits &amp; local arrangements where required</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1354\" data-section-id=\"uerrz\" data-start=\"1294\">🧳 Smooth travel execution with curated sightseeing flow</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h1 data-end=\"1474\" data-section-id=\"yf5wu8\" data-start=\"1451\">📍 <strong data-end=\"1474\" data-start=\"1456\">Important Note</strong></h1>\n\n<p data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1476\">⚠️ This is a <strong data-end=\"1515\" data-start=\"1489\">curated travel package</strong>, designed for:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1642\" data-start=\"1531\">\n	<li data-end=\"1555\" data-section-id=\"1uc79qk\" data-start=\"1531\">Hassle-free planning</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1590\" data-section-id=\"1l0gdq5\" data-start=\"1556\">Local expertise &amp; coordination</li>\n	<li data-end=\"1642\" data-section-id=\"lx3dlc\" data-start=\"1591\">Smooth on-ground support throughout the journey</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"1746\" data-start=\"1644\">💡 Rates include planning, assistance, transport management &amp; service support, not just accommodation.</p>', '<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"166\" data-section-id=\"14uldd7\" data-start=\"93\">🍽️ Meals unless specifically mentioned and included in the itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"224\" data-section-id=\"uqsvhv\" data-start=\"167\">🔥 Room heater charges (if required at hill stations)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"304\" data-section-id=\"1v8vflv\" data-start=\"225\">🧳 Personal expenses such as laundry, telephone calls, tips, and gratuities</li>\n	<li data-end=\"372\" data-section-id=\"gelnir\" data-start=\"305\">🥤 Mineral water, soft drinks, hard drinks, and other beverages</li>\n	<li data-end=\"472\" data-section-id=\"3llgfv\" data-start=\"373\">🚗 Any additional sightseeing, extra usage of vehicle, or services beyond the planned itinerary</li>\n	<li data-end=\"552\" data-section-id=\"1j197k5\" data-start=\"473\">🎥 Camera fees, guide charges, tour escort charges, and entry/monument fees</li>\n	<li data-end=\"718\" data-section-id=\"llzm7e\" data-start=\"553\">🌧️ Expenses arising due to natural calamities such as landslides, road blockage, strikes, or political disturbances (payable directly by the client on the spot)</li>\n	<li data-end=\"846\" data-section-id=\"vli2hg\" data-start=\"719\">⛽ Any increase in fuel prices, taxes, or government levies affecting transportation or land arrangements prior to departure</li>\n	<li data-end=\"978\" data-section-id=\"gv9tqr\" data-start=\"899\">🚫 Any item or service not explicitly mentioned in the “Inclusions” section</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"320000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":320000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 70400\",\"selling_price\":390400}', 'MZQ/0820/042026', 390240, 60670, 26220, '2026-04-16 05:59:41', '2026-04-20 11:46:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(835, 'Mr Pawan Kumar', 'TBA', '9288539812', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Nepal Nature & Adventure', '2026-05-20', 3, 0, 20, '[{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Kathmandu \\u2708\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"20-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"422\\\" data-start=\\\"204\\\">Upon arrival at Kathmandu Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel for check-in. Rest of the day is at leisure to relax or explore nearby areas on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"481\\\" data-start=\\\"424\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"446\\\" data-start=\\\"427\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Kathmandu<br data-end=\\\"459\\\" data-start=\\\"456\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"472\\\" data-start=\\\"463\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"629\\\" data-start=\\\"579\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kathmandu Sightseeing \\ud83d\\uded5\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"21-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1092\\\" data-start=\\\"488\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day sightseeing tour of Kathmandu. Visit Pashupatinath Temple, one of the most sacred Hindu temples dedicated to Lord Shiva. Continue to Boudhanath Stupa, a major Buddhist pilgrimage site known for its iconic white dome and spiritual ambiance. Later, visit Budhanilkantha Temple, famous for the reclining statue of Lord Vishnu. Conclude your day with a visit to Patan Durbar Square, renowned for its exquisite architecture, temples, and courtyards.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1163\\\" data-start=\\\"1094\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1116\\\" data-start=\\\"1097\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Kathmandu<br data-end=\\\"1129\\\" data-start=\\\"1126\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1142\\\" data-start=\\\"1133\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kathmandu \\u2013 Chandragiri Hills & Swayambhunath \\ud83c\\udf04\",\"date\":\"22-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1631\\\" data-start=\\\"1170\\\">After breakfast, proceed to visit Chandragiri Hills, located around 15 km from the city. Enjoy a scenic cable car ride (direct payment basis) and witness mesmerizing panoramic views of the Himalayas. Later, visit Swayambhunath Stupa, also known as the Monkey Temple, offering spectacular views of the Kathmandu Valley and a peaceful spiritual atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1702\\\" data-start=\\\"1633\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1655\\\" data-start=\\\"1636\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Kathmandu<br data-end=\\\"1668\\\" data-start=\\\"1665\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1681\\\" data-start=\\\"1672\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kathmandu Departure \\u2708\\ufe0f\",\"date\":\"23-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1846\\\" data-start=\\\"1709\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1873\\\" data-start=\\\"1848\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1861\\\" data-start=\\\"1852\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Kathmandu (KTM)\",\"name\":\"Hahn Air\",\"fno\":\"X1\\/B3-407\",\"dep_date\":\"20 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:55 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"20 May 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"fare\":\"203280\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kathmandu (KTM)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"dep_date\":\"23 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"23 May 2026\",\"name\":\"Royal Nepal Airlines\",\"fno\":\"RA-217\",\"dep_time\":\"01:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"273400\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"20\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Kathmandu\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Grand \\/ Similar\",\"check_out\":\"23\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"room_type\":\"DBL Room\",\"rooms\":10}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"271\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"274\">Flights:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"347\" data-start=\"289\">\n	<li data-end=\"347\" data-section-id=\"g8qnec\" data-start=\"289\"><b>Return Airfare Delhi (DEL)&nbsp;-&nbsp;Kathmandu (KTM) &amp;&nbsp;Kathmandu (KTM)-Delhi (DEL)</b></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"142\" data-start=\"119\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"122\">Accommodation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"260\" data-start=\"143\">\n	<li data-end=\"260\" data-section-id=\"671bea\" data-start=\"203\">03&nbsp;Nights stay in <strong data-end=\"234\" data-start=\"223\">Kathmandu&nbsp;</strong>with Breakfast &amp; Dinner</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"385\" data-start=\"349\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"383\" data-start=\"352\">Transfers &amp; Transportation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"506\" data-start=\"386\">\n	<li data-end=\"438\" data-section-id=\"1qrzvgn\" data-start=\"386\">All airport transfers on <strong data-end=\"436\" data-start=\"413\">Private (PVT) basis</strong></li>\n	<li data-end=\"506\" data-section-id=\"iv2z88\" data-start=\"439\">All intercity transfers and local travel on <strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"485\">Private Vehicle</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"508\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"511\">Sightseeing:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"625\" data-start=\"530\">\n	<li data-end=\"625\" data-section-id=\"1scytge\" data-start=\"530\">Complete sightseeing in <strong data-end=\"579\" data-start=\"556\">Kathmandu </strong>as per itinerary on <strong data-end=\"623\" data-start=\"600\">Private (PVT) basis</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"627\">✔️ <strong data-end=\"648\" data-start=\"630\">Vehicle Usage:</strong></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"651\">\n	<li data-end=\"741\" data-section-id=\"1vi1577\" data-start=\"651\">Vehicle will operate on <strong data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"677\">point-to-point basis only</strong> <em data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"707\">(no disposal / not at leisure)</em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li data-end=\"177\" data-section-id=\"2s0ewd\" data-start=\"116\">Any services not specifically mentioned in the inclusions</li>\n	<li data-end=\"248\" data-section-id=\"s79vs4\" data-start=\"178\">Entrance fees at monuments, temples, parks, and sightseeing places</li>\n	<li data-end=\"285\" data-section-id=\"19bw6h6\" data-start=\"249\">Guide charges during sightseeing</li>\n	<li data-end=\"362\" data-section-id=\"3mkg1i\" data-start=\"286\">Personal expenses such as tips, laundry, telephone calls, shopping, etc.</li>\n	<li data-end=\"600\" data-section-id=\"rwu6ue\" data-start=\"463\">Any additional expenses due to unforeseen circumstances like flight delays, natural calamities, roadblocks, or political disturbances</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":476680,\"land_cost\":\"199500\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":676180,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 87903.4\",\"selling_price\":764083.400000000023283064365386962890625}', 'MZQ/0821/042026', 770800, 38540, 0, '2026-04-17 11:20:15', '2026-04-23 13:12:39', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(836, 'Mrs. Anita Kumari', 'Dibadih', '9031741775', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical Bhutan', '2026-05-16', 6, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Transfer to Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"16-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Bagdogra Airport or New Jalpaiguri Railway Station, meet our representative and begin a scenic drive towards Phuentsholing, the gateway to Bhutan located at the foothills of the Eastern Himalayas. The drive offers beautiful landscapes, rivers, and greenery along the Indo-Bhutan border. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax after the journey. Evening is free for leisure and acclimatization.<br data-end=\\\"797\\\" data-start=\\\"794\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"819\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuentsholing<br data-end=\\\"836\\\" data-start=\\\"833\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"850\\\" data-start=\\\"840\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuentsholing to Thimphu\",\"date\":\"17-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, complete immigration formalities and proceed towards Thimphu, the charming capital city known for its culture and modern Bhutanese lifestyle blended with tradition. En route, visit the sacred Sangye Migyur Ling Lhakhang, a spiritual landmark dedicated to Milarepa. Stop at the beautifully designed Gedu Stupa and enjoy a refreshing break near the scenic Chukha Waterfall. Also stop at the famous Chuzom Confluence where three rivers meet and three different stupas stand beautifully. On arrival in Thimphu, check in and relax.<br data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1573\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1598\\\" data-start=\\\"1579\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Thimphu<br data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1606\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1623\\\" data-start=\\\"1613\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu to Dochula Pass & Punakha Excursion\",\"date\":\"18-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to the breathtaking Dochula Pass (3,150m), one of Bhutan\\u2019s most scenic viewpoints offering panoramic Himalayan views and 108 memorial stupas surrounded by prayer flags. Continue your journey to Punakha, a beautiful valley known for its rivers and ancient monasteries. Visit the magnificent Punakha Dzong, located at the confluence of the Pho Chhu River and Mo Chhu River. Explore the sacred Chimi Lhakhang, a popular pilgrimage site. Also enjoy the scenic suspension bridge walk over the river. Return to Thimphu by evening.<br data-end=\\\"2433\\\" data-start=\\\"2430\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2455\\\" data-start=\\\"2436\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Thimphu<br data-end=\\\"2466\\\" data-start=\\\"2463\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2480\\\" data-start=\\\"2470\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu Sightseeing & Transfer to Paro\",\"date\":\"19-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the cultural capital of Bhutan starting with the iconic Buddha Dordenma, a massive golden statue overlooking the Thimphu valley. Continue to the spiritual National Memorial Chorten, where locals gather for prayers. Enjoy a short hike to Wangditse Lhakhang offering peaceful forest surroundings. Later visit the Nunnery, BBS Tower, National Library Bhutan, and the lively Centenary Farmers Market where local produce and handicrafts are displayed. Also view the majestic Tashichho Dzong before proceeding to Paro.<br data-end=\\\"3297\\\" data-start=\\\"3294\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3319\\\" data-start=\\\"3300\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Paro<br data-end=\\\"3327\\\" data-start=\\\"3324\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3341\\\" data-start=\\\"3331\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro \\u2013 Tiger\\u2019s Nest Monastery Excursion\",\"date\":\"20-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, prepare for one of the most iconic experiences in Bhutan\\u2014a hike to Tiger\'s Nest Monastery. Perched dramatically on a cliff 900 meters above the valley floor, this sacred monastery offers breathtaking views and deep spiritual significance. The trek passes through pine forests, prayer flags, and scenic viewpoints. Later, if time permits, visit Drukgyel Dzong, an ancient fortress showcasing Bhutan\\u2019s history.<br data-end=\\\"3910\\\" data-start=\\\"3907\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3932\\\" data-start=\\\"3913\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Paro<br data-end=\\\"3940\\\" data-start=\\\"3937\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3954\\\" data-start=\\\"3944\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro to Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"21-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the beauty of Paro valley starting with the scenic Paro Airport View Point, offering stunning views of aircraft landing between mountains. Visit the cultural treasure Ta Dzong, followed by the historic Rinpung Dzong, known for its impressive architecture. Also explore the unique Museum of Lights showcasing Bhutan\\u2019s modernization journey. Later, drive back to Phuentsholing and check in. Evening free for relaxation.<br data-end=\\\"4602\\\" data-start=\\\"4599\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"4624\\\" data-start=\\\"4605\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuentsholing<br data-end=\\\"4641\\\" data-start=\\\"4638\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4655\\\" data-start=\\\"4645\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bhutan\",\"date\":\"22-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Bagdogra Airport or New Jalpaiguri Railway Station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Carry unforgettable memories of Bhutan\\u2019s monasteries, valleys, and Himalayan beauty.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"4974\\\" data-start=\\\"4971\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4988\\\" data-start=\\\"4978\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"to\":\"Howrah (HWH)\",\"name\":\"KRIYA YOGA EXP\",\"fno\":\"18616\",\"dep_date\":\"15 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:20 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 AM\",\"fare\":\"7000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"AirIndiaExpress\",\"fno\":\"1256\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"24100\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"308\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"fare\":37836},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7674\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Tashi Namgay Grand Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Thimphu\",\"hotel_name\":\"Pelyang Boutique\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"19\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Paro\",\"hotel_name\":\"Resort Thim-Dorji @ Paro Riverfront\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Tashi Namgay Grand Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"22\\/05\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong>:<br />\nKolkata (CCU) – Bagdogra (IXB) &amp; Bagdogra (IXB) – Kolkata (CCU) – Ranchi (IXR)</p>\n\n<p>🚆 <strong>Train Fare</strong>:<br />\nRanchi (RNC) – Howrah (HWH) | 01 AC</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong>:<br />\n• 01 Night at Hotel Tashi Namgay Grand Resort – Phuentsholing&nbsp;<br />\n• 02 Nights at Hotel Pelyang Boutique&nbsp;– Thimphu<br />\n• 02 Nights at Hotel Resort Thim-Dorji @ Paro Riverfront – Paro<br />\n• 01 Night at Hotel Tashi Namgay Grand Resort – Phuentsholing&nbsp;<br />\n✔️ Accommodation with Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all respective hotels</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transport &amp; Services</strong>:<br />\n• Accommodation on twin sharing basis as per itinerary<br />\n• Meal plan as per hotel selection (as suggested in the package)<br />\n• All transfers &amp; sightseeing by exclusive Non-AC vehicle (point-to-point service)<br />\n• All necessary permit assistance for Bhutan entry &amp; travel formalities<br />\n• One experienced guide for Bhutan sector only (as per itinerary coverage)</p>\n\n<p>📍 <strong>Pickup &amp; Drop Included From</strong>:<br />\n• Bagdogra Airport<br />\n&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"23\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":68936,\"land_cost\":\"165000\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":233936,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 53805.28\",\"selling_price\":287741.28000000002793967723846435546875}', 'MZQ/0822/042026', 287880, 71970, 0, '2026-04-17 12:20:13', '2026-04-23 10:04:14', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
