a-start=\"648\">Ha Long Bay</strong> with two-way shuttle bus transfer</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"701\">🚗 Private air-conditioned vehicle for all tours &amp; transfers<br data-end=\"764\" data-start=\"761\" />\n🧑‍✈️ Experienced English-speaking guide as per itinerary</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"918\" data-start=\"825\">🎟️ All entrance fees as mentioned in the itinerary<br data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"876\" />\n🍽️ Meals as specified in the program</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"920\">💧 Complimentary mineral water during tours<br data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"963\" />\n<strong>🛂 Vietnam visa</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"19\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":100600,\"land_cost\":\"56240\",\"hotel_cost\":49100,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"5000\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":210940,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 40078.6\",\"selling_price\":251018.60000000000582076609134674072265625}', 'MZQ/0825/052026', 263360, 131680, 93520, '2026-05-01 06:57:06', '2026-05-01 06:57:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(841, 'MS POOJA SHARMA', 'BNI EXPLORERS', '9204055682', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical North East', '2026-05-16', 6, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati Arrival\",\"date\":\"16-05-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India. Upon arrival at the airport or railway station, you will be warmly received by our representative and transferred to your hotel for check-in. Later, explore the cultural richness of the city with a visit to Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra and Assam State Film Museum. Enjoy a refreshing tea experience at GTAC Tea Lounge. Continue to Mahabahu Brahmaputra River Heritage Centre and the scenic Brahmaputra Riverfront. In the evening, you may opt for a river cruise on the Brahmaputra River or explore local markets famous for Assam Silk and handicrafts.<br data-end=\\\"839\\\" data-start=\\\"836\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Guwahati.<br data-end=\\\"869\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\" \\/>\\n<em data-end=\\\"905\\\" data-start=\\\"869\\\">Transfer: Innova Crysta (7 Seater)<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kamakhya Mandir Darshan\",\"date\":\"17-05-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"476\\\" data-start=\\\"43\\\">After an early breakfast, proceed for a spiritual visit to the sacred <strong data-end=\\\"154\\\" data-start=\\\"113\\\">Kamakhya Temple<\\/strong>, one of the most revered Shakti Peethas in India, located atop the Nilachal Hills. Seek blessings and experience the divine atmosphere of this ancient temple dedicated to Goddess Kamakhya. After darshan, return to the hotel for some relaxation. The rest of the day is at leisure or you may explore nearby local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"534\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"478\\\">Overnight stay in Guwahati.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati \\u2013 Shillong\",\"date\":\"18-05-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the sacred Kamakhya Temple. Later, proceed on a scenic drive to Shillong, popularly known as the \\u201cScotland of the East.\\u201d En route, stop at the picturesque Umiam Lake for photos and optional water activities. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel. In the evening, explore Police Bazar for shopping and local cuisine.<br data-end=\\\"1410\\\" data-start=\\\"1407\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong \\u2013 Cherrapunji \\u2013 Shillong\",\"date\":\"19-05-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to Cherrapunji, one of the wettest places on earth. Visit natural attractions like Garden of Caves, Eco Park, Dainthlen Falls, Nohkalikai Falls, Seven Sisters Falls, Mawsmai Cave, and Thangkharang Park. On return, visit Elephant Falls and Shillong Peak for panoramic views.<br data-end=\\\"2080\\\" data-start=\\\"2077\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong \\u2013 Dawki \\u2013 Mawlynnong \\u2013 Shillong\",\"date\":\"20-05-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"3027\\\" data-start=\\\"2634\\\">After breakfast, drive to Mawlynnong Village, known as the cleanest village in India, and explore the Living Root Bridge. Later proceed to Dawki, located at the Indo-Bangladesh border, and enjoy boating on the crystal-clear Umngot River. Return to Shillong in the evening.<br data-end=\\\"2546\\\" data-start=\\\"2543\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Shillong.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shillong \\u2013 Guwahati\",\"date\":\"21-05-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore local attractions of Shillong including Laitlum Canyon, Don Bosco Museum, Ward\'s Lake, Cathedral of Mary Help of Christians, and Lady Hydari Park. Later, drive back to Guwahati and check in at the hotel.<br data-end=\\\"2998\\\" data-start=\\\"2995\\\" \\/>\\nOvernight stay in Guwahati.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Guwahati Departure\",\"date\":\"22-05-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. If time permits, visit prominent attractions such as Purva Tirupati Shri Balaji Temple, Navagraha Temple, Umananda Temple, Assam State Museum, and Assam State Zoo Cum Botanical Garden. Later, transfer to the airport or railway station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7251\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":60885},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Guwahati(gauhati) (GAU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6663\",\"dep_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"16 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:35 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Guwahati(gauhati) (GAU)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"201\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 AM\",\"fare\":42450},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7317\",\"dep_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"22 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"16\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guwahati\",\"hotel_name\":\"Mayflower\",\"room_type\":\"Irish Red\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"18\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":2},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"18\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Shillong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Club Heritage Tripura Castle\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":3},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"21\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Guwahati\",\"hotel_name\":\"Mayflow