ll transfers &amp; sightseeing<br />\n• Same vehicle &amp; driver throughout the tour<br />\n• Experienced local driver for safe travel &amp; guidance<br />\n• Driver service available up to 8:00 PM daily<br />\n• Backup vehicle &amp; local emergency support available</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p>🧭 <em>TRAVEL SUPPORT &amp; SERVICES</em><br />\n• Complete itinerary planning &amp; coordination<br />\n• 24x7 real-time assistance during the trip<br />\n• Flexible sightseeing timings as per comfort &amp; weather<br />\n• Assistance for permits &amp; local arrangements</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><em>INCLUSIONS</em><br />\n• All parking charges<br />\n• Toll taxes<br />\n• Driver allowances</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><em>ℹ️ IMPORTANT NOTE</em><br />\n• This is a curated travel package including planning, coordination, local expertise &amp; on-ground support</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":103335,\"land_cost\":\"140000\",\"hotel_cost\":\"16000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":259335,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 33713.55\",\"selling_price\":293048.5499999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0827/052026', 293050, 58610, 0, '2026-05-05 12:55:13', '2026-05-05 13:33:29', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(842, 'Mr. Vibhor Agarwal', 'BNI', '9234608415', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Spiritual Gujrat', '2026-06-28', 3, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Somnath\",\"date\":\"28-06-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival, you will be received and transferred to your hotel for check-in. After some relaxation, you may explore nearby areas or visit the local market. In the evening, you can attend the aarti at the sacred Somnath Temple (optional), offering a peaceful spiritual experience by the Arabian Sea.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Somnath<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Somnath Darshan \\u2013 Dwarka Transfer\",\"date\":\"29-06-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for darshan at the revered Somnath Temple, one of the 12 Jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva. Later, drive towards Dwarka, one of the Char Dham pilgrimage sites associated with Lord Krishna. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Dwarka<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dwarka Darshan \\u2013 Rajkot Transfer\",\"date\":\"30-06-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the famous Dwarkadhish Temple, also known as Jagat Mandir. You may also explore nearby temples if time permits. Later, proceed towards Rajkot. On arrival, check in at your hotel and unwind.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Rajkot<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Rajkot Departure\",\"date\":\"01-07-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the hotel and proceed for your onward journey from Rajkot with divine blessings and wonderful memories.<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"28\\/06\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Lords Inn Somnath - Pure Veg\",\"city\":\"Somnath\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"29\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10800\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/06\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Enrise by Sayaji Dwarka\",\"city\":\"Dwarka\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Grand\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"13000\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/05\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Lords Inn Rajkot - Pure Veg\",\"city\":\"Rajkot\",\"room_type\":\"Studio Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"11700\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[{\"age\":8}]', '<p><strong><em>🏨 ACCOMMODATION</em></strong></p>\n\n<p><em>Somnath – 01 Night</em><br />\n<strong>• Lords Inn Somnath <em>(Pure Veg Hotel)</em></strong></p>\n\n<p><em>Dwarka – 01 Night</em><br />\n<strong>• Enrise by Sayaji Dwarka</strong></p>\n\n<p><em>Rajkot – 01 Night</em><br />\n<strong>• Lords Inn Rajkot - Pure Veg</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><em>🍽️ MEAL PLAN</em></strong><br />\n• Breakfast &amp; Dinner included (except last day – no meal)</p>\n\n<p><strong><em>🚗 VEHICLE DETAILS</em></strong><br />\n• Toyota Innova Crysta for all transfers &amp; sightseeing<br />\n• Comfortable, spacious vehicle ideal for long journeys</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"0\",\"hotel_cost\":35500,\"transport_cost\":\"20400\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":55900,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9503\",\"selling_price\":65403}', 'MZQ/0828/052026', 65440, 14890, 5880, '2026-05-06 12:56:38', '2026-05-11 14:13:53', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(843, 'Mr. Sudhir Kumar', 'Ratan Ji SAIL', '9934526861', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL Himachal  4*', '2026-06-01', 6, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Chandigarh & Transfer to Shimla\",\"date\":\"01-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival in Chandigarh, meet our representative and proceed towards the beautiful hill station of Shimla. Enjoy the scenic drive through the hills and valleys of Himachal Pradesh. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Shimla<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kufri Excursion + Shimla Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"02-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to Kufri, known for its picturesque landscapes and adventure activities. Later, return to Shimla and explore local attractions including Mall Road, The Ridge, Christ Church and Lakkar Bazaar. Enjoy the pleasant evening weather and colonial charm of Shimla.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Shimla<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Manali\",\"date\":\"03-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and proceed towards Manali. Enjoy the scenic journey passing through beautiful valleys, rivers and mountain landscapes. Upon arrival in Manali, check in at the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Manali<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local Sightseeing + Solang Valley\",\"date\":\"04-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing in Manali including attractions such as Hadimba Devi Temple, Vashisht Temple and Mall Road. Later, visit the scenic Solang Valley, famous for adventure activities and stunning Himalayan views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Manali<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Rohtang Pass\",\"date\":\"05-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an exciting excursion to Rohtang Pass (subject to permit and weather conditions), famous for its snow-covered landscapes and breathtaking mountain views. Enjoy snow activities and sightseeing before returning to Manali.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Manali<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><em>Note:<\\/em> Rohtang Pass sightseeing will be operated through a local union vehicle on direct payment basis, as outside vehicles are not permitted beyond a certain point as per local administration regulations.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"06-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive back to Chandigarh. Upon arrival, check in at the hotel and relax after the long yet scenic journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Overnight stay in Chandigarh<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"07-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast,<em><strong> check out from the hotel and proceed for your onward journey with wonderful memories of your Himachal holiday.<\\/strong><\\/em><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2370\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"54072\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5038\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:00 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"1862\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:55 AM\",\"fare\":\"30630\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2259\",\"dep_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:15 PM\",\"fare\":\"38870\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Orchid\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"nights\":2,\"rate\":\"34500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Snow Valley Heights\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"06\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"70380\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"06\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"CHANDIGARH\",\"hotel_name\":\"Orchid  Zirakpur\",\"room_type\":\"Premier Room\",\"rooms\":3,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"07\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"18300\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone T