nt basis, as outside vehicles are not permitted beyond a certain point as per local administration regulations.</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><strong>✔️ <em>PACKAGE INCLUDES</em></strong><br />\n• Accommodation as mentioned above<br />\n• Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner<br />\n• Return airfare Ex–Ranchi<br />\n• Private vehicle for complete tour<br />\n• All applicable taxes included</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"27\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":123572,\"land_cost\":\"00\",\"hotel_cost\":123180,\"transport_cost\":\"42000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":288752,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 77963.04\",\"selling_price\":366715.0399999999790452420711517333984375}', 'MZQ/0829/052026', 365952, 60992, 0, '2026-05-08 14:36:59', '2026-05-11 08:31:48', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(845, 'MR SIMERJEET SINGH', 'Hazaribagh', '9431163323', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL THAILAND', '2026-06-01', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok \\u2013 Pattaya\",\"date\":\"01-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"492\\\" data-start=\\\"140\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"192\\\" data-start=\\\"151\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> Airport. After immigration formalities, meet our representative and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"314\\\" data-start=\\\"273\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> (approx. 2\\u20132.5 hours drive). Upon arrival, check-in at the hotel and relax. The evening is free at leisure to explore Pattaya Beach or enjoy the vibrant nightlife on your own.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"494\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: None<br data-end=\\\"512\\\" data-start=\\\"509\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure in Pattaya\",\"date\":\"02-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"609\\\" data-start=\\\"85\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, the day is free for you to relax and explore&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"201\\\" data-start=\\\"160\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong>&nbsp;at your own pace. You may unwind at Pattaya Beach, enjoy water activities, explore local caf\\u00e9s, or indulge in shopping at popular malls like Central Festival. In the evening, you can visit the famous Walking Street for vibrant nightlife, entertainment shows, and seaside dining experiences. Optional activities such as Alcazar Show, Tiffany Show, or spa treatments can also be arranged at additional cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"660\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"634\\\" data-start=\\\"631\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok\",\"date\":\"03-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1913\\\" data-start=\\\"1702\\\">After breakfast, check out and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"1786\\\" data-start=\\\"1745\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, check-in at the hotel. The remaining day is free to relax or explore nearby shopping malls and local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1966\\\" data-start=\\\"1915\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"1938\\\" data-start=\\\"1935\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure + Shopping\",\"date\":\"04-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"575\\\" data-start=\\\"95\\\">After breakfast at the hotel, the day is free to explore <strong data-end=\\\"193\\\" data-start=\\\"152\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong> at your own pace. You may indulge in shopping at world-class malls like <strong data-end=\\\"307\\\" data-start=\\\"266\\\">ICONSIAM<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"353\\\" data-start=\\\"312\\\">MBK Center<\\/strong>, offering a mix of luxury brands and local bargains. If you\\u2019re visiting over the weekend, the famous <strong data-end=\\\"496\\\" data-start=\\\"455\\\">Chatuchak Weekend Market<\\/strong> is perfect for souvenirs, fashion, handicrafts, and street food experiences.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"720\\\" data-start=\\\"577\\\">You may also explore local street markets, enjoy a traditional Thai massage, or relax at a caf\\u00e9 while soaking in the vibrant city atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"771\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"722\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<br data-end=\\\"745\\\" data-start=\\\"742\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park with Lunch\",\"date\":\"05-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1898\\\" data-start=\\\"1778\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1806\\\">Safari World<\\/strong>, Thailand\\u2019s popular open zoo and leisure park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1910\\\" data-start=\\\"1900\\\">Explore:<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1982\\\" data-start=\\\"1913\\\">Safari Park \\u2013 drive through and witness animals in natural habitats<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2085\\\" data-start=\\\"1985\\\">Marine Park \\u2013 enjoy entertaining shows including dolphins, sea lions, stunt performances, and more<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2143\\\" data-start=\\\"2087\\\">Enjoy lunch at the park before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2204\\\" data-start=\\\"2145\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<br data-end=\\\"2176\\\" data-start=\\\"2173\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Day @ Leisure + Shopping (Bangkok)\",\"date\":\"06-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2766\\\" data-start=\\\"2666\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Bangkok Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2790\\\" data-start=\\\"2768\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meals: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2848\\\" data-start=\\\"2792\\\">\\u2728 Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Thailand \\u2728<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2937\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2850\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7326\",\"dep_date\":\"31 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"31 May 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":82952},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1057\",\"dep_date\":\"31 May 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:45 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bangkok (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1062\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:25 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 AM\",\"fare\":86208},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6113\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Explorer Twin\",\"hotel_name\":\"Centara Grand Mirage Beach Resort\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"70500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Shangri-La Wing Deluxe 2 Twin\",\"hotel_name\":\"Shangri-La Hotel\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"06\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"51600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":7},{\"age\":7}]', '<p>✈️ Airfare <em><strong>GAYA-BKK-CCU .</strong></em><br />\n🏨&nbsp;<strong>02 Nights&nbsp;</strong>Accommodation at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Centara Grand Mirage Beach Resort, Pattaya</strong></em><br />\n🏨&nbsp;<strong>03&nbsp;Nights</strong>&nbsp;Accommodation at&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Shangri-La,&nbsp;Bangkok&nbsp;</strong></em><br />\n🛏 <strong>01 Room</strong> on&nbsp;<em><strong>Quad Sharing/ 01 DBL + 01 Extra Bed</strong></em></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🎟️</span> Sightseeing &amp; Activities&nbsp;(All on Private Basis)</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b>Safari World + Marine Park</b> with Buffet Lunch&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🚗</span> Transfers (All on Private Basis)</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🚖</span> Bangkok (BKK) Airport → Pattaya Hotel (Arrival Transfer)</span></span></span></span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🚗</span> Pattaya Hotel → Bangkok Hotel</span></span></span></span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">✈️</span> Bangkok Hotel → Bangkok (BKK) Airport (Departure Transfer)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">🍽️</span> Meal Plan</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Daily Buffet Breakfast at all hotels</span></span></span></span></li>\n	<li><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">01&nbsp;Lunch&nbsp;during tour</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">💎</span> Package Highlights</b></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:11px\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">✅</span> Perfect blend of leisure, culture &amp; adventure<br />\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">✅</span> Premium accommodations in prime locations<br />\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">✅</span> Private transfers for comfort &amp; convenience<br />\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">✅</span> Handpicked sightseeing experiences</span></span></span></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":169160,\"land_cost\":\"29100\",\"hotel_cost\":122100,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":320360,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 48054\",\"selling_price\":368414}', 'MZQ/0830/052026', 368640, 117540, 66780, '2026-05-14 12:01:08', '2026-05-14 12:20:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(846, 'Mr Shashi Sahu', 'Argora', '7903109421', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical Bhutan', '2026-06-12', 6, 4, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival & Transfer to Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"12-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Bagdogra Airport or New Jalpaiguri Railway Station, meet our representative and begin a scenic drive towards Phuentsholing, the gateway to Bhutan located at the foothills of the Eastern Himalayas. The drive offers beautiful landscapes, rivers, and greenery along the Indo-Bhutan border. On arrival, check in to your hotel and relax after the journey. Evening is free for leisure and acclimatization.<br data-end=\\\"797\\\" data-start=\\\"794\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"819\\\" data-start=\\\"800\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuentsholing<br data-end=\\\"836\\\" data-start=\\\"833\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"850\\\" data-start=\\\"840\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuentsholing to Thimphu\",\"date\":\"13-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, complete immigration formalities and proceed towards Thimphu, the charming capital city known for its culture and modern Bhutanese lifestyle blended with tradition. En route, visit the sacred Sangye Migyur Ling Lhakhang, a spiritual landmark dedicated to Milarepa. Stop at the beautifully designed Gedu Stupa and enjoy a refreshing break near the scenic Chukha Waterfall. Also stop at the famous Chuzom Confluence where three rivers meet and three different stupas stand beautifully. On arrival in Thimphu, check in and relax.<br data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1573\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1598\\\" data-start=\\\"1579\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Thimphu<br data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1606\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1623\\\" data-start=\\\"1613\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu to Dochula Pass & Punakha Excursion\",\"date\":\"14-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to the breathtaking Dochula Pass (3,150m), one of Bhutan\\u2019s most scenic viewpoints offering panoramic Himalayan views and 108 memorial stupas surrounded by prayer flags. Continue your journey to Punakha, a beautiful valley known for its rivers and ancient monasteries. Visit the magnificent Punakha Dzong, located at the confluence of the Pho Chhu River and Mo Chhu River. Explore the sacred Chimi Lhakhang, a popular pilgrimage site. Also enjoy the scenic suspension bridge walk over the river. Return to Thimphu by evening.<br data-end=\\\"2433\\\" data-start=\\\"2430\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2455\\\" data-start=\\\"2436\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Thimphu<br data-end=\\\"2466\\\" data-start=\\\"2463\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2480\\\" data-start=\\\"2470\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu Sightseeing & Transfer to Paro\",\"date\":\"15-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the cultural capital of Bhutan starting with the iconic Buddha Dordenma, a massive golden statue overlooking the Thimphu valley. Continue to the spiritual National Memorial Chorten, where locals gather for prayers. Enjoy a short hike to Wangditse Lhakhang offering peaceful forest surroundings. Later visit the Nunnery, BBS Tower, National Library Bhutan, and the lively Centenary Farmers Market where local produce and handicrafts are displayed. Also view the majestic Tashichho Dzong before proceeding to Paro.<br data-end=\\\"3297\\\" data-start=\\\"3294\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3319\\\" data-start=\\\"3300\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Paro<br data-end=\\\"3327\\\" data-start=\\\"3324\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3341\\\" data-start=\\\"3331\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro \\u2013 Tiger\\u2019s Nest Monastery Excursion\",\"date\":\"16-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, prepare for one of the most iconic experiences in Bhutan\\u2014a hike to Tiger\'s Nest Monastery. Perched dramatically on a cliff 900 meters above the valley floor, this sacred monastery offers breathtaking views and deep spiritual significance. The trek passes through pine forests, prayer flags, and scenic viewpoints. Later, if time permits, visit Drukgyel Dzong, an ancient fortress showcasing Bhutan\\u2019s history.<br data-end=\\\"3910\\\" data-start=\\\"3907\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"3932\\\" data-start=\\\"3913\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Paro<br data-end=\\\"3940\\\" data-start=\\\"3937\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"3954\\\" data-start=\\\"3944\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro to Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"17-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the beauty of Paro valley starting with the scenic Paro Airport View Point, offering stunning views of aircraft landing between mountains. Visit the cultural treasure Ta Dzong, followed by the historic Rinpung Dzong, known for its impressive architecture. Also explore the unique Museum of Lights showcasing Bhutan\\u2019s modernization journey. Later, drive back to Phuentsholing and check in. Evening free for relaxation.<br data-end=\\\"4602\\\" data-start=\\\"4599\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"4624\\\" data-start=\\\"4605\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Phuentsholing<br data-end=\\\"4641\\\" data-start=\\\"4638\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4655\\\" data-start=\\\"4645\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Bhutan\",\"date\":\"18-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Bagdogra Airport or New Jalpaiguri Railway Station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Carry unforgettable memories of Bhutan\\u2019s monasteries, valleys, and Himalayan beauty.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"4974\\\" data-start=\\\"4971\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"4988\\\" data-start=\\\"4978\\\">Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7562\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"fare\":62264},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"751\",\"dep_date\":\"12 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"12 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:40 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"292\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":70240},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7674\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room + 02 EB\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"13\\/06\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Thimphu\",\"hotel_name\":\"Pelyang Boutique \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"15\\/06\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"15\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Paro\",\"hotel_name\":\"Paro Grand \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Deluxe Room + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"17\\/06\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"17\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room + 02 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/06\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6},{\"age\":6},{\"age\":3},{\"age\":3}]', '<h3 data-end=\"25\" data-section-id=\"1btkzu4\" data-start=\"14\"><strong>Airfare</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"26\">\n	<li data-end=\"62\" data-section-id=\"17nhftr\" data-start=\"26\">Round-trip Airfare Ex-Ranchi (IXR)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"81\" data-section-id=\"5xnwym\" data-start=\"64\"><strong>Accommodation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"312\" data-start=\"82\">\n	<li data-end=\"143\" data-section-id=\"s2dx41\" data-start=\"82\">01 Night at Hotel Bhutan Ga Me Ga / Similar – Phuentsholing</li>\n	<li data-end=\"201\" data-section-id=\"1uvyzxq\" data-start=\"144\">02 Nights at Hotel Pelyang Boutique / Similar – Thimphu</li>\n	<li data-end=\"250\" data-section-id=\"it3lk9\" data-start=\"202\">02 Nights at Hotel Paro Grand / Similar – Paro</li>\n	<li data-end=\"312\" data-section-id=\"s2dx41\" data-start=\"251\">01 Night at Hotel Bhutan Ga Me Ga / Similar – Phuentsholing</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"327\" data-section-id=\"1s0p9tc\" data-start=\"314\"><strong>Meal Plan</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"368\" data-start=\"328\">\n	<li data-end=\"368\" data-section-id=\"1k2qgbz\" data-start=\"328\">Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at all hotels</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"388\" data-section-id=\"mrmm0\" data-start=\"370\"><strong>Transportation</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"389\">\n	<li data-end=\"449\" data-section-id=\"lvml4n\" data-start=\"389\">For India Sector: Innova / Xylo / Ertiga / Similar Vehicle</li>\n	<li data-end=\"480\" data-section-id=\"rzzhcj\" data-start=\"450\">For Bhutan Sector: Hiace Bus</li>\n	<li data-end=\"562\" data-section-id=\"8h3ojc\" data-start=\"481\">All transfers &amp; sightseeing by exclusive Non-AC vehicle on point-to-point basis</li>\n	<li data-end=\"604\" data-section-id=\"osr2z7\" data-start=\"563\">Bagdogra Airport Pickup &amp; Drop Included</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"630\" data-section-id=\"18a3p9e\" data-start=\"606\"><strong>Permits &amp; Assistance</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"631\">\n	<li data-end=\"685\" data-section-id=\"h8q43h\" data-start=\"631\">Bhutan entry permits &amp; travel formalities assistance</li>\n	<li data-end=\"751\" data-section-id=\"1fnvzc8\" data-start=\"686\">One experienced guide for Bhutan sector only (as per itinerary)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"777\" data-section-id=\"1pmexh5\" data-start=\"753\"><strong>Additional Inclusion</strong></h3>\n\n<ul data-end=\"900\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"778\">\n	<li data-end=\"900\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-section-id=\"1sencuo\" data-start=\"778\">Daily Bhutan SDF (Sustainable Development Fee) surcharge of INR 1,200 per person per night included in the package cost.</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":132504,\"land_cost\":\"207770\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":340274,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 51041.1\",\"selling_price\":391315.099999999976716935634613037109375}', 'MZQ/0831/052026', 391440, 62470, 35390, '2026-05-18 05:59:05', '2026-05-18 05:59:05', 0, 1, '\"<h1 data-end=\\\"880\\\" data-section-id=\\\"x6fwl9\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\">REQUIREMENTS FOR ENTRY INTO BHUTAN<\\/h1>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"896\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1q839vq\\\" data-start=\\\"882\\\">For Adults<\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"949\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1f6xww4\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">Passport with minimum 6 months validity<br data-end=\\\"941\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"949\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\">OR<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1kkuotu\\\" data-start=\\\"950\\\">Original Voter ID Card<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"992\\\" data-section-id=\\\"kn7lpq\\\" data-start=\\\"976\\\">For Children<\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1045\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1f6xww4\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\">Passport with minimum 6 months validity<br data-end=\\\"1037\\\" data-start=\\\"1034\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"1045\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\">OR<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1b734u0\\\" data-start=\\\"1046\\\">Birth Certificate<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"1091\\\" data-section-id=\\\"n02tc3\\\" data-start=\\\"1067\\\">Additional Documents<\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1195\\\" data-start=\\\"1092\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1123\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1whii9z\\\" data-start=\\\"1092\\\">Covid Vaccination Certificate<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1150\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1a6hgrp\\\" data-start=\\\"1124\\\">Passport Size Photograph<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1195\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1gaqur0\\\" data-start=\\\"1151\\\">Details of previous Bhutan visits (if any)<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1325\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1206\\\" data-start=\\\"1197\\\">Note:<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1209\\\" data-start=\\\"1206\\\" \\/>\\nGuests are advised to share all required documents at the time of booking confirmation for smooth permit processing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<hr data-end=\\\"1330\\\" data-start=\\\"1327\\\" \\/>\\n<h1 data-end=\\\"1356\\\" data-section-id=\\\"qpkiyj\\\" data-start=\\\"1332\\\">IMPORTANT TRAVEL NOTES<\\/h1>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"2816\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1358\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1532\\\" data-section-id=\\\"13jmbum\\\" data-start=\\\"1358\\\">Our representative will receive guests at:\\n\\t<ul data-end=\\\"1532\\\" data-start=\\\"1405\\\">\\n\\t\\t<li data-end=\\\"1433\\\" data-section-id=\\\"rcxxrb\\\" data-start=\\\"1405\\\">Bagdogra Airport Exit Gate<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li data-end=\\\"1471\\\" data-section-id=\\\"w0uyno\\\" data-start=\\\"1436\\\">NJP Railway Station New Exit Gate<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li data-end=\\\"1510\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1x4cge8\\\" data-start=\\\"1474\\\">Alipurduar \\/ Hasimara Station Exit<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t<li data-end=\\\"1532\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1cra9lz\\\" data-start=\\\"1513\\\">Paro Airport Exit<\\/li>\\n\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1698\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1losk7m\\\" data-start=\\\"1534\\\">Guests arriving late night or early morning at railway stations are advised to rest in the waiting\\/retiring room before continuing the journey for safety reasons.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1818\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1s5m8jt\\\" data-start=\\\"1700\\\">Hotels mentioned are subject to availability. In case of non-availability, similar category hotels will be provided.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1893\\\" data-section-id=\\\"v6pe73\\\" data-start=\\\"1820\\\">Service standards in hilly regions may differ from metropolitan cities.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1970\\\" data-section-id=\\\"lbwrz\\\" data-start=\\\"1895\\\">Sightseeing tours start early due to shorter daylight hours in the hills.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2114\\\" data-section-id=\\\"evurbe\\\" data-start=\\\"1972\\\">In case of bad weather, road blockage, strikes, landslides or unforeseen situations, sightseeing points or itinerary may change accordingly.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2236\\\" data-section-id=\\\"12yxbn8\\\" data-start=\\\"2116\\\">Additional expenses due to road blockage, snowfall, landslides or route diversion will be borne directly by the guest.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2321\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1lz38sj\\\" data-start=\\\"2238\\\">Guests are requested to take full responsibility for their luggage and valuables.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2433\\\" data-section-id=\\\"t6z6c9\\\" data-start=\\\"2323\\\">Even during summer months, weather in Bhutan and hill areas remains cool. Carry sufficient woollen clothing.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2583\\\" data-section-id=\\\"zwqubv\\\" data-start=\\\"2435\\\">Any request for minor sightseeing changes must be informed one day prior before 02:00 PM. Requests after this time may attract additional charges.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2816\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1c3ti7m\\\" data-start=\\\"2585\\\">Some high-altitude areas have low oxygen levels. Guests with heart issues, blood pressure problems, knee problems, senior citizens, and children below 5 years are advised to avoid such locations due to limited medical facilities.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(847, 'Rishu Chauparan', 'HAZARIBAGH', '7004269469', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL Himachal  4*', '2026-05-29', 5, 2, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Delhi Airport \\u2013 Shimla\",\"date\":\"29-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"76\\\">Upon arrival at Delhi Airport, meet our representative and proceed towards Shimla, the beautiful capital of Himachal Pradesh. Enjoy the scenic drive through hills and picturesque landscapes. Upon arrival, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"355\\\" data-start=\\\"315\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<br data-end=\\\"343\\\" data-start=\\\"340\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kufri Tour Shimla + Evening Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"30-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"758\\\" data-start=\\\"430\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to Kufri, one of the most popular hill destinations near Shimla known for its scenic beauty and mountain views. Enjoy the pleasant surroundings and optional activities. Later return to Shimla and explore local attractions including Mall Road, Christ Church, The Ridge and Lakkar Bazaar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"812\\\" data-start=\\\"760\\\">Overnight stay in Shimla.<br data-end=\\\"788\\\" data-start=\\\"785\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shimla \\u2013 Manali\",\"date\":\"31-05-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1053\\\" data-start=\\\"857\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards Manali. En route enjoy the beautiful valleys, rivers and mountain landscapes. Upon arrival in Manali, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1107\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<br data-end=\\\"1083\\\" data-start=\\\"1080\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali Local Sightseeing + Solang Valley\",\"date\":\"01-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1484\\\" data-start=\\\"1178\\\">After breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing of Manali covering Hadimba Devi Temple, Vashisht Temple, Tibetan Monastery and Mall Road. Later continue towards Solang Valley, famous for its breathtaking mountain scenery and adventure activities like paragliding, zipline and ATV rides (at additional cost).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1538\\\" data-start=\\\"1486\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<br data-end=\\\"1514\\\" data-start=\\\"1511\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Excursion to Rohtang Pass\",\"date\":\"02-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1840\\\" data-start=\\\"1594\\\">After breakfast, proceed for an exciting excursion to Rohtang Pass (subject to permit and weather conditions), famous for its snow-covered landscapes and panoramic Himalayan views. Enjoy snow activities and sightseeing before returning to Manali.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1894\\\" data-start=\\\"1842\\\">Overnight stay in Manali.<br data-end=\\\"1870\\\" data-start=\\\"1867\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2104\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1905\\\" data-start=\\\"1896\\\">Note:<\\/strong> Rohtang Pass sightseeing will be operated through a local union vehicle on direct payment basis, as outside vehicles are not permitted beyond a certain point as per local administration regulations.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Manali \\u2013 Chandigarh\",\"date\":\"03-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2298\\\" data-start=\\\"2154\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and drive towards Chandigarh.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2356\\\" data-start=\\\"2300\\\">Overnight stay in Chandigarh.<br data-end=\\\"2332\\\" data-start=\\\"2329\\\" \\/>\\nMeal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"29\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SHIMLA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Snow Lotus\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe Room( Valley View )\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"check_out\":\"31\\/05\\/2026\",\"nights\":2,\"rate\":\"10000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"31\\/05\\/2026\",\"city\":\"MANALI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Manali Grand\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"15600\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[{\"age\":5},{\"age\":12}]', '<p><strong>🏨 <em>ACCOMMODATION</em></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>📍 <em>Shimla – 02 Nights</em></strong><br />\n• Hotel Snow Lotus&nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>📍 <em>Manali – 03 Nights</em></strong><br />\n• Hotel Manali Grand<br />\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><strong>🍽️ <em>MEAL PLAN</em></strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><strong>🚗 <em>TRANSPORTATION</em></strong><br />\n• <em><strong>01 Toyota Rumion </strong></em>for all transfers &amp; sightseeing on disposal basis<br />\n• Toll taxes, parking charges, driver bata, road tax &amp; fuel charges included</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><strong>ℹ️ <em>IMPORTANT NOTE</em></strong><br />\n• <em><strong>Rohtang Pass sightseeing will be operated through a local union vehicle on direct payment basis,</strong></em> as outside vehicles are not permitted beyond a certain point as per local administration regulations.</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<p><strong>✔️ <em>PACKAGE INCLUDES</em></strong><br />\n• Accommodation as mentioned above<br />\n• Daily Breakfast<br />\n• Private vehicle for complete tour<br />\n• All applicable taxes included</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"00\",\"hotel_cost\":25600,\"transport_cost\":\"30000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":55600,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11676\",\"selling_price\":67276}', 'MZQ/0832/052026', 67460, 29420, 4310, '2026-05-18 06:52:04', '2026-05-28 12:23:44', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
