(848, 'Mr. Deepak Lamba & Family', 'Rajan Bhaiya', '9893825599', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL CHINA', '2026-06-22', 8, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Beijing\",\"date\":\"22-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"238\\\" data-start=\\\"44\\\">Upon arrival at Beijing Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel for check-in. Relax for some time after check-in and later in the afternoon proceed for a city tour of Beijing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"354\\\" data-start=\\\"240\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"265\\\" data-start=\\\"240\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Beijing Airport to Hotel Transfer<br data-end=\\\"304\\\" data-start=\\\"301\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 POPLAND Theme Park<br data-end=\\\"327\\\" data-start=\\\"324\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 POPLAND Entrance Ticket<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"413\\\" data-start=\\\"356\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"389\\\" data-start=\\\"359\\\">Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"392\\\" data-start=\\\"389\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"413\\\" data-start=\\\"396\\\">Meal: No Meal<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Beijing\",\"date\":\"23-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"568\\\" data-start=\\\"493\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full day visit to Universal Studios Beijing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"696\\\" data-start=\\\"570\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"595\\\" data-start=\\\"570\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Universal Studios Beijing<br data-end=\\\"626\\\" data-start=\\\"623\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Wizarding World of Harry Potter<br data-end=\\\"662\\\" data-start=\\\"659\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Universal Studios Entry Ticket<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"698\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"731\\\" data-start=\\\"701\\\">Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"734\\\" data-start=\\\"731\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"757\\\" data-start=\\\"738\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Great Wall of China & Summer Palace\",\"date\":\"24-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"935\\\" data-start=\\\"847\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full day excursion covering Beijing\\u2019s iconic attractions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1123\\\" data-start=\\\"937\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"962\\\" data-start=\\\"937\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Juyongguan Great Wall<br data-end=\\\"989\\\" data-start=\\\"986\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Great Wall Entrance Ticket<br data-end=\\\"1020\\\" data-start=\\\"1017\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Pearl Shop Visit<br data-end=\\\"1041\\\" data-start=\\\"1038\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Bird\'s Nest Stadium (Photo Stop)<br data-end=\\\"1078\\\" data-start=\\\"1075\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Water Cube (Photo Stop)<br data-end=\\\"1106\\\" data-start=\\\"1103\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Summer Palace<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1184\\\" data-start=\\\"1125\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1158\\\" data-start=\\\"1128\\\">Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1161\\\" data-start=\\\"1158\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1184\\\" data-start=\\\"1165\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Beijing \\u2013 Shanghai\",\"date\":\"25-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1386\\\" data-start=\\\"1257\\\">After breakfast, proceed for sightseeing in Beijing. Later transfer to the railway station for your high-speed train to Shanghai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1570\\\" data-start=\\\"1388\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1413\\\" data-start=\\\"1388\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tiananmen Square<br data-end=\\\"1435\\\" data-start=\\\"1432\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Forbidden City<br data-end=\\\"1454\\\" data-start=\\\"1451\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Beijing Railway Station Transfer<br data-end=\\\"1491\\\" data-start=\\\"1488\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 High Speed Train (2nd Class)<br data-end=\\\"1524\\\" data-start=\\\"1521\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Shanghai Railway Station to Hotel Transfer<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1632\\\" data-start=\\\"1572\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1606\\\" data-start=\\\"1575\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1609\\\" data-start=\\\"1606\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1632\\\" data-start=\\\"1613\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shanghai Disneyland\",\"date\":\"26-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1783\\\" data-start=\\\"1706\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a magical full day visit to Shanghai Disneyland.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1880\\\" data-start=\\\"1785\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1810\\\" data-start=\\\"1785\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Shanghai Disneyland Full Day Tour<br data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1846\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Disneyland Admission Ticket<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1942\\\" data-start=\\\"1882\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1916\\\" data-start=\\\"1885\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1919\\\" data-start=\\\"1916\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1942\\\" data-start=\\\"1923\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shanghai City Tour\",\"date\":\"27-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2071\\\" data-start=\\\"2015\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a full day city tour of Shanghai.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2237\\\" data-start=\\\"2073\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2098\\\" data-start=\\\"2073\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Jade Buddha Temple<br data-end=\\\"2122\\\" data-start=\\\"2119\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Yu Garden<br data-end=\\\"2136\\\" data-start=\\\"2133\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Yu Market<br data-end=\\\"2150\\\" data-start=\\\"2147\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Silk Shop<br data-end=\\\"2164\\\" data-start=\\\"2161\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Nanjing Road<br data-end=\\\"2181\\\" data-start=\\\"2178\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 The Bund<br data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-start=\\\"2191\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 ERA Intersection of Time Acrobatic Show<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2299\\\" data-start=\\\"2239\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2273\\\" data-start=\\\"2242\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2276\\\" data-start=\\\"2273\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2299\\\" data-start=\\\"2280\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shanghai \\u2013 Guangzhou\",\"date\":\"28-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2552\\\" data-start=\\\"2374\\\">After breakfast, check out and transfer to the railway station for your high-speed train to Guangzhou. Upon arrival, transfer to the hotel and later enjoy the Pearl River Cruise.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2709\\\" data-start=\\\"2554\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"2579\\\" data-start=\\\"2554\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 High Speed Train (2nd Class)<br data-end=\\\"2613\\\" data-start=\\\"2610\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Shanghai to Guangzhou<br data-end=\\\"2639\\\" data-start=\\\"2636\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Guangzhou Railway Station to Hotel Transfer<br data-end=\\\"2687\\\" data-start=\\\"2684\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Pearl River Cruise<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2772\\\" data-start=\\\"2711\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2746\\\" data-start=\\\"2714\\\">Overnight stay in Guangzhou.<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2749\\\" data-start=\\\"2746\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2772\\\" data-start=\\\"2753\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 8\",\"index\"