ter-spacing:-.1pt\\\">apply<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"margin-top:3px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:14.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\">Mandatory Tip : USD 2 Per Person Per Day payable directly to <span style=\\\"letter-spacing:-.1pt\\\">Driver<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"margin-top:3px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:14.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\">Hotel Security Deposit is mandatory at check-in and refundable at check-<span style=\\\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\\\">out<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"margin-top:3px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:14.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\">Standard Hotel Check-In : 15:00 <span style=\\\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\\\">Hrs<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n\\t<li style=\\\"margin-top:3px\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt\\\"><span style=\\\"tab-stops:14.0pt\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\\\">Standard Hotel Check-Out : 11:00 <span style=\\\"letter-spacing:-.25pt\\\">Hrs<\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(849, 'Mr Vinayak Toppo', NULL, '9971405019', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-06-17', 7, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"17-06-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\'s Noi Bai International Airport, you will be welcomed by our driver holding a sign with your name on it. After approximately 50 minutes to 1 hour transfer, you will be at your hotel for check-in<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Meal: None<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HOA LU - TAM COC (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"18-06-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter between 07:15 AM \\u2013 07:45 AM and proceed towards Ninh Binh Province.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit the ancient capital of Hoa Lu and explore the historic Dinh &amp; Le Temples. Later enjoy a local Vietnamese lunch at a restaurant.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the afternoon, enjoy a scenic sampan boat ride at Tam Coc, famous for its limestone caves, rice fields, peaceful rivers, and beautiful countryside landscapes. Optional biking activity can also be enjoyed during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Around 03:30 PM, return back to Hanoi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 SIC Transfers by AC Vehicle<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Hotel Pickup &amp; Drop (Old Quarter Area)<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tam Coc Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 English Speaking Guide<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Mineral Water<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast + Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Hanoi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY HANOI - HA LONG ON AMBROSE DAY CRUISE (SHUTTLE BUS TRANSFER) - TRAIN TO SAPA (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"19-06-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter and proceed towards Ha Long Bay by shuttle bus.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Board the Ambrose Day Cruise and enjoy a scenic cruise through the breathtaking limestone islands of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing Includes:<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Ha Long Bay Cruise<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sung Sot (Surprising) Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Luon Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Kayaking \\/ Bamboo Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Titov Island<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Panoramic View Point<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sunset Party on Cruise<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy a buffet lunch onboard featuring Vietnamese &amp; seafood cuisine.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening, return to Hanoi and transfer to the Bus station for overnight Sleeper Bus to Sapa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast &amp; Lunch&nbsp;<br \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude86 Overnight Train to Sapa.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA ARRIVAL - HALF DAY MOANA CAFE & CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"20-06-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, arrive at Lao Cai Train Station. Pick up by our tour guide &amp; driver then transfer to Sapa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Afternoon, meet our tour guide at hotel for a tour. Visit Moana Cafe. Moana Sapa is a popular scenic attraction offering breathtaking views of Sapa\\u2019s mountains and terraced valleys. Designed as a creative photo destination, it features iconic check-in spots such as the Bali-style gate, infinity swing, giant statue, and panoramic viewpoints. With its stunning landscapes and relaxing atmosphere, it\\u2019s a perfect place to capture memorable photos and enjoy the beauty of Northern Vietnam. Transfer back to city center to have a quick stop at Stone Church - one of the most iconic land mark of Sapa. Then, walk around Sapa Market for some shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Sapa<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DISCOVER FANSIPAN MOUNTAIN\",\"date\":\"21-06-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start the tour to the Cable Car station where you will get on cabin and take a 15-minute ride by cable car. At 6292,5m long, this is the longest non-stop three rope cable car in the world. Continue to take the Funicular Train to reach the summit of Mount Fansipan. Spend time to admire the beautiful natural landscape of Sapa, Hoang Lien Son, Muong Hoa valley and the magnificent Hoang Lien Son Mountain range (2 ways Fansipan Peak Funicular Train included). After tour, back to your hotel and free for the rest of the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Sapa<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA - TRANSFER BACK TO HANOI BY SHARING LIMOUSINE\",\"date\":\"22-06-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer back to Hanoi on highway road. It takes 05 hours drive. Arrival Hanoi in late afternoon, check in hotel &amp; free for the night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Ha Noi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"23-06-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning free at leisure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>PM: 14.00-14.15: Continue to visit the Temple of Literature \\u2013 the first university of Vietnam, established in the 11th century<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>15.15: Leave for Hoa Lo Prison Museum which was originally used by the French colonists in Indochina for political prisoners, and later by North Vietnam for U.S. prisoners of war during the Vietnam War. During this later period, it was known to American POWs as the \\\"Hanoi Hilton\\\"<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>16.15 -16.30: Tour finishes. Back to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer to Noi Bai International airport for flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Marigold \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"11600\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SAPA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lacasa \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"3500\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SAPA\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lacasa \\/ Similar\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/06\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"12900\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/06\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TK123 \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"12000\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation as mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>02 Rooms on DBL Sharing</li>\n	<li>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers (except SIC Tours)</li>\n	<li>Sapa To Hanoi By Sharing Limousine</li>\n	<li>Sleeper Bus ticket from Hanoi to Sapa.</li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li>Vietnam Tourist Visa&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>International &amp; Domestic flight tickets</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in double/twin room with daily breakfast</li>\n	<li>Personal expenses, such as laundry, telephone, drinks, etc. All other services not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meals, if not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Travel insurance (we highly recommend that you purchase adequate insurance)</li>\n	<li>Tips for guides and drivers&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Visa stamping fee at the airport or Evisa</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"135840\",\"hotel_cost\":40000,\"visa_cost\":\"12500\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":188340,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 22600.8\",\"selling_price\":210940.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0834/052026', 210960, 52740, 0, '2026-05-29 11:32:02', '2026-06-01 06:50:07', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(850, 'Mr Chetan Poddar', 'BNI | CELEB', '9709030304', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-06-15', 4, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"15-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\'s Noi Bai International Airport, you will be welcomed by our driver holding a sign with your name on it. After approximately 50 minutes to 1 hour transfer, you will be at your hotel for check-in<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Meal: None<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HOA LU - TAM COC (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"16-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter between 07:15 AM \\u2013 07:45 AM and proceed towards Ninh Binh Province.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit the ancient capital of Hoa Lu and explore the historic Dinh &amp; Le Temples. Later enjoy a local Vietnamese lunch at a restaurant.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the afternoon, enjoy a scenic sampan boat ride at Tam Coc, famous for its limestone caves, rice fields, peaceful rivers, and beautiful countryside landscapes. Optional biking activity can also be enjoyed during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Around 03:30 PM, return back to Hanoi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 SIC Transfers by AC Vehicle<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Hotel Pickup &amp; Drop (Old Quarter Area)<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tam Coc Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 English Speaking Guide<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Mineral Water<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast + Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Hanoi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY HANOI - HA LONG ON AMBROSE DAY CRUISE (SHUTTLE BUS TRANSFER) - TRAIN TO SAPA (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"17-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter and proceed towards Ha Long Bay by shuttle bus.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Board the Ambrose Day Cruise and enjoy a scenic cruise through the breathtaking limestone islands of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing Includes:<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Ha Long Bay Cruise<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sung Sot (Surprising) Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Luon Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Kayaking \\/ Bamboo Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Titov Island<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Panoramic View Point<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sunset Party on Cruise<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy a buffet lunch onboard featuring Vietnamese &amp; seafood cuisine.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening, return to Hanoi and transfer to the Bus station for overnight Sleeper Bus to Sapa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast &amp; Lunch&nbsp;<br \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude86 Overnight Train to Sapa.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"18-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning free at leisure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>PM: 14.00-14.15: Continue to visit the Temple of Literature \\u2013 the first university of Vietnam, established in the 11th century<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>15.15: Leave for Hoa Lo Prison Museum which was originally used by the French colonists in Indochina for political prisoners, and later by North Vietnam for U.S. prisoners of war during the Vietnam War. During this later period, it was known to American POWs as the \\\"Hanoi Hilton\\\"<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>16.15 -16.30: Tour finishes. Back to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"19-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer to Noi Bai International airport for flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1631\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:35 PM\",\"fare\":\"73000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Hanoi (HAN)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1632\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:10 PM\",\"fare\":null}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Marigold \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"19\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"11300\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare Ex-Kolkata.</li>\n	<li>Accommodation as mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>01 Room&nbsp;on DBL Sharing</li>\n	<li>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers (except SIC Tours)</li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li>Vietnam Tourist Visa&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>International &amp; Domestic flight tickets</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in double/twin room with daily breakfast</li>\n	<li>Personal expenses, such as laundry, telephone, drinks, etc. All other services not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meals, if not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Travel insurance (we highly recommend that you purchase adequate insurance)</li>\n	<li>Tips for guides and drivers&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Visa stamping fee at the airport or Evisa</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"12\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":73000,\"land_cost\":\"30000\",\"hotel_cost\":11300,\"visa_cost\":\"5000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":119300,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 14316\",\"selling_price\":133616}', 'MZQ/0835/062026', 133720, 66860, 0, '2026-06-01 08:42:19', '2026-06-01 08:42:19', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(851, 'Mr. Akshat Kumar', 'Rana Manvendra', '7759965489', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Gangtok 4*', '2026-06-12', 3, 0, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Gangtok\",\"date\":\"12-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Arrive in Gangtok by your own car. Check in to the hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Gangtok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gangtok Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"13-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for local sightseeing in Gangtok.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing Includes:<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tashi View Point<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Ganesh Tok<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Hanuman Tok<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Flower Exhibition Centre<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Do Drul Chorten<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Namgyal Institute of Tibetology<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Bakthang Waterfall<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Gangtok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tsomgo Lake & Baba Mandir Excursion\",\"date\":\"14-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to the famous Tsomgo Lake and Baba Harbhajan Singh Mandir.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing Includes:<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tsomgo Lake<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Baba Mandir<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>(Optional: Nathula Pass visit subject to permit availability and additional charges.)<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Gangtok<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"15-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for your onward journey by your own car.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>\\u2708\\ufe0f Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"12\\/06\\/2026\",\"check_out\":\"15\\/06\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Mid Town 4*\",\"city\":\"Gangtok\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"rate\":\"40000\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<p><strong>🏨 Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 03 Nights Stay in Gangtok<br />\n• Accommodation as per the Hotel Mentioned<br />\n• 01 Extra Bed Included.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🍽️ Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at the Hotel</p>\n\n<p><strong>🎟️ Sightseeing</strong><br />\n• Gangtok Local Sightseeing<br />\n• Tsomgo Lake Excursion<br />\n• Baba Mandir Excursion</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"17\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":40000,\"transport_cost\":\"28000\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":68000,\"profit_figure\":\"00\",\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 11560\",\"selling_price\":79560,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0836/062026', 79600, 15920, NULL, '2026-06-01 12:36:39', '2026-06-10 06:06:41', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
