within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[{\"age\":8}]', '<p data-end=\"124\" data-start=\"27\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"41\" data-start=\"30\">Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare <strong data-end=\"91\" data-start=\"59\">Ranchi ➝ Kolkata ➝ Guangzhou</strong> &amp; <strong data-end=\"124\" data-start=\"94\">Hong Kong ➝ Delhi ➝ Ranchi</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"372\" data-start=\"126\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"129\">Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 04 Nights Accommodation at <strong data-end=\"272\" data-start=\"237\">Hotel </strong><strong data-end=\"207\" data-start=\"176\">Hilton Foshan Guangzhou</strong><br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation at <strong data-end=\"272\" data-start=\"237\">Hotel Dorsett Mongkok Hong Kong</strong><br />\n• 01 Night Accommodation at <strong data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"301\">Hotel Pride Plaza Aerocity, Delhi</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast at All Hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"607\" data-start=\"374\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"390\" data-start=\"377\">Transfers</strong><br />\n• Guangzhou Airport to Hotel Transfer<br />\n• Guangzhou Hotel to Railway Station Transfer<br />\n• Hong Kong Railway Station to Hotel Transfer<br />\n• Hong Kong Hotel to Airport Transfer<br />\n• Private Sightseeing Transfers as Per Itinerary</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"696\" data-start=\"609\">🚄 <strong data-end=\"629\" data-start=\"612\">Train Tickets</strong><br />\n• High Speed Bullet Train Tickets – 2nd Class (<strong data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"670\">Guangzhou ➝ Hong Kong</strong>)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"810\" data-start=\"698\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"730\" data-start=\"702\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Hong Kong Disneyland Admission Ticket<br />\n• Ocean Park Hong Kong Admission Ticket</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"812\">👨‍💼 <strong data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"818\">Services</strong><br />\n• On-Ground Assistance Throughout the Tour</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1001\" data-start=\"934\">🛂 <strong data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"937\">Visa</strong><br />\n• China Tourist Visa&nbsp;<br />\n• Hong Kong Visa&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"1003\">💰 <strong data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"1006\">Taxes</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included</p>', '<h3><strong>📌 IMPORTANT NOTE</strong></h3>\n\n<p>• China Visa will be processed through the China Visa Office.<br />\n• Visa documents will be dispatched via DHL Courier after processing.<br />\n• Visa approval is subject to the discretion of the Chinese Authorities.</p>\n\n<p>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</p>\n\n<h3><strong>❌ PACKAGE EXCLUSIONS</strong></h3>\n\n<p>• Travel Insurance<br />\n• Hotel Security Deposits (If Applicable)<br />\n• Personal Expenses such as Laundry, Telephone, Mini Bar, Porterage, etc.<br />\n• Meals Other Than Mentioned Above<br />\n• Optional Tours &amp; Activities<br />\n• Early Check-In / Late Check-Out Charges<br />\n• Camera Fees, Guide Fees &amp; Telephone Charges<br />\n• Any Kind of Personal Expenses<br />\n• Anything Not Specifically Mentioned Under \"Package Inclusions\"</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":268759,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":116915,\"visa_cost\":null},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"China Land\",\"amount\":\"112277\"},{\"name\":\"Hong Kong Land\",\"amount\":\"98050\"}],\"cost_price\":596001,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 77480.13\",\"selling_price\":673481.130000000004656612873077392578125}', 'MZQ/0838/062026', 688574, 145796, 105390, '2026-06-04 09:15:49', '2026-06-26 11:37:16', 0, 1, '\"<h3><strong>CHINA TOURIST VISA<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<h3><strong>\\ud83d\\udcc4 VISA REQUIREMENTS<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udc65 Minimum 02 Passengers Traveling Together<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udcd8 Passport<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Passport First &amp; Last Page Scan<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Minimum 06 Months Validity from the Date of Travel<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udcf8 Passport Size Photograph<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 White Background<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 80% Face Coverage<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Recent Photograph<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Confirmed Hotel Vouchers<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f Confirmed Return Air Tickets<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\uddd3\\ufe0f Complete Travel Itinerary<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"', 0, 0),
(854, 'Mr. Ashish', 'Walk In', '7004810752', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'MAGICAL THAILAND', '2026-06-18', 5, 2, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Phuket + Phuket Fantasea Show\",\"date\":\"18-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"247\\\" data-start=\\\"80\\\">Upon arrival at Phuket Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel for check-in. In the evening, proceed to enjoy the world-famous Phuket Fantasea Show.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"369\\\" data-start=\\\"249\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"274\\\" data-start=\\\"249\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Phuket Airport to Hotel Transfer<br data-end=\\\"312\\\" data-start=\\\"309\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Phuket Fantasea Show<br data-end=\\\"337\\\" data-start=\\\"334\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Cultural Theme Park Experience<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"398\\\" data-start=\\\"371\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phi Phi Island Tour\",\"date\":\"19-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"541\\\" data-start=\\\"458\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to the beautiful Phi Phi Islands.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"701\\\" data-start=\\\"543\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"568\\\" data-start=\\\"543\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Phi Phi Island Tour<br data-end=\\\"593\\\" data-start=\\\"590\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Maya Bay (subject to regulations)<br data-end=\\\"631\\\" data-start=\\\"628\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Viking Cave<br data-end=\\\"647\\\" data-start=\\\"644\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Monkey Beach<br data-end=\\\"664\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Snorkeling &amp; Swimming Opportunities<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"716\\\" data-start=\\\"703\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"745\\\" data-start=\\\"718\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket at Leisure\",\"date\":\"20-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"900\\\" data-start=\\\"803\\\">After breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure for shopping, beach activities, or optional excursions.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"915\\\" data-start=\\\"902\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"944\\\" data-start=\\\"917\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Phuket<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuket City Tour + Tiger Park + Transfer to Krabi\",\"date\":\"21-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1180\\\" data-start=\\\"1034\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for a Phuket City Tour. Visit the famous Tiger Park before continuing your journey to Krabi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1376\\\" data-start=\\\"1182\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1207\\\" data-start=\\\"1182\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Phuket City Tour<br data-end=\\\"1229\\\" data-start=\\\"1226\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Big Buddha View Point (subject to accessibility)<br data-end=\\\"1282\\\" data-start=\\\"1279\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Karon View Point<br data-end=\\\"1303\\\" data-start=\\\"1300\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Old Phuket Town<br data-end=\\\"1323\\\" data-start=\\\"1320\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tiger Park Phuket<br data-end=\\\"1345\\\" data-start=\\\"1342\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Transfer from Phuket to Krabi<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1391\\\" data-start=\\\"1378\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1419\\\" data-start=\\\"1393\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Krabi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Krabi 04 Island Tour\",\"date\":\"22-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1552\\\" data-start=\\\"1480\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the famous Four Island Tour by shared boat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1692\\\" data-start=\\\"1554\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1554\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Phra Nang Cave Beach<br data-end=\\\"1605\\\" data-start=\\\"1602\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Chicken Island<br data-end=\\\"1624\\\" data-start=\\\"1621\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tup Island<br data-end=\\\"1639\\\" data-start=\\\"1636\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Poda Island<br data-end=\\\"1655\\\" data-start=\\\"1652\\\" \\/>\\n\\u2022 Swimming &amp; Snorkeling Opportunities<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1707\\\" data-start=\\\"1694\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1735\\\" data-start=\\\"1709\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay in Krabi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure Phuket\",\"date\":\"23-06-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"175\\\" data-start=\\\"31\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and enjoy free time at leisure until your scheduled transfer to Phuket Airport for your onward flight.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"237\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\"><strong data-end=\\\"202\\\" data-start=\\\"177\\\">Sightseeing Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Hotel to Phuket Airport Transfer<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"252\\\" data-start=\\\"239\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"278\\\" data-start=\\\"254\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f Departure from Phuket<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"334\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"280\\\">\\u2728 Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories of Thailand \\u2728<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2937\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2850\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7235\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:45 PM\",\"fare\":115482},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1493\",\"dep_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"18 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Phuket (HKT)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"1076\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"fare\":127512},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"221\",\"dep_date\":\"23 Jun 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"23 Jun 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:10 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"18\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"21\\/06\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Grand Mercure Phuket Patong\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"40300\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"21\\/06\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"17600\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":6},{\"age\":5}]', '<p data-end=\"88\" data-start=\"27\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"41\" data-start=\"30\">Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"213\" data-start=\"90\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"110\" data-start=\"93\">Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 03 Nights Accommodation @Grand Mercure Phuket Patong in Phuket<br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation @Holiday Style Ao Nang Beach Resort in Krabi<br />\n• Daily Breakfast at All Hotels</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"365\" data-start=\"215\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"218\">Transfers</strong><br />\n• Phuket Airport to Hotel Transfer<br />\n• Phuket to Krabi Intercity Transfer<br />\n• Krabi to Phuket Transfer<br />\n• Phuket Hotel to Airport Transfer</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"367\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"371\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Phuket Fantasea Show Ticket<br />\n• Phi Phi Island Tour<br />\n• Phuket City Tour<br />\n• Tiger Park Visit<br />\n• Krabi Four Island Tour</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"516\">🚤 <strong data-end=\"528\" data-start=\"519\">Tours</strong><br />\n• All Tours &amp; Transfers on Private Basis (As Mentioned in Itinerary)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"605\">👨‍💼 <strong data-end=\"623\" data-start=\"611\">Services</strong><br />\n• On-Ground Assistance<br />\n• Local Tour Coordination</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"674\">💰 <strong data-end=\"686\" data-start=\"677\">Taxes</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"11\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":242994,\"land_cost\":\"104370\",\"hotel_cost\":57900,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":405264,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 44579.04\",\"selling_price\":449843.0399999999790452420711517333984375}', 'MZQ/0839/062026', 449880, 80330, 64280, '2026-06-04 13:43:38', '2026-06-04 13:43:38', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(855, 'Mrs. Ekta', 'CDG', '9810621916', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KERALA', '2026-07-27', 6, 1, 5, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Cochin to Munnar - Arrival & Transfer\",\"date\":\"27-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"203\\\">Arrival at Cochin airport\\/ railway station, meet and assistance.Transfer to Munnar . Munnar is 1800 mts above sea level and also the place of South India\'s highest peak (Anamudi - 2695 mts). On the way visit Valara, Cheeyappara waterfalls.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"514\\\" data-start=\\\"203\\\"><strong>Overnight at the hotel.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar - Full Day Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"28-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"788\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\">Morning after breakfast full day visit to Munnar. Mattupetty dam, Echo Point, Kundala Dam, Pothamedu View Point, Blossom Park etc are some of the highlights of the sightseeing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"788\\\" data-start=\\\"618\\\"><strong>Shopping &amp; overnight at the hotel in Munnar.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Munnar to Thekkady - Transfer & sightseeing\",\"date\":\"29-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast checkout from the hotel and drive to Thekkady , on arrival check in to the hotel. Proceed for local Sightseeing (if time permits) else day at leisure or own activities and overnight stay at Thekkady. One of the world\'s most fascinating wildlife reserves. The Periyar wildlife sanctuary in Thekkady is spread across 777 sq km of which 360 sq km is thick evergreen forest. Noted for its geomorphology, diversity of wildlife and scenic beauty, the sanctuary was declared a Tiger Reserve in 1978. Sightseeing in Thekkady: Periyar Wild Life Sanctuary, Spice Plantation.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Periyar boating guests can directly book through this link:<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.periyartigerreserve.org\\/ProgramView\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">https:\\/\\/www.periyartigerreserve.org\\/ProgramView<\\/a>.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thekkady to Alleppey - Transfer & Houseboat Stay\",\"date\":\"30-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Check out from the resort and drive to Alleppey. Arrive at Alleppey and board the houseboat at noon for a backwater cruise and for an overnight stay. While cruising in these floating luxury- villas, let your eyes settle for the rare and the unusual - skim past Chinese fishing nets, bowed- down paddy fields, and local inhabitants engaged in making coir products, rustic homes, and ancient temples and swaying coconut groves. Overnight stay in a houseboat.<\\/p>\\n\\n<ul>\\n\\t<li><strong>Notes<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Houseboat Check-in Time Is 13:00 Hours and check out Time is 09:00 Hours Next Day.<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li><strong>Houseboat Sails Between 13:00 Hours To 17;00 Hours &amp; Next Day 08:00 Hours To 09:00 Hours.<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Alleppey to Kovalam - Transfer & Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"31-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1692\\\" data-start=\\\"1523\\\">After breakfast checkout from hotel \\/ Houseboat (As per your stay )and drive to Kovalam, on arrival check in to the hotel. Proceed for local Sightseeing (if time permits) else day at leisure or own activities and overnight stay at Kovalam.Kovalam is an internationally renowned beach with three adjacent crescent beaches. It has been a favourite haunt of tourists, especially Europeans, since the 1930s. A massive rocky promontory on the beach has created a beautiful bay of calm waters ideal for sea bathing. The leisure options at this beach are plenty and diverse-sunbathing, swimming, herbal body toning massages, special cultural programmes, Catamaran cruising etc. Sightseeing : Padmanabha Swami Temple, Kuthira Maligai Palace, Zoo, Art Gallery (All places close on Monday except Padmanabha Swami Temple).<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam - Trivandrum Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"01-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"218\\\">Start your day with a sightseeing tour of Trivandrum, (Thiruvananthapuram) literally means \'the abode of Anantha\', the snake God. The main attraction of the city is the Sri Padmanabhaswamy Temple dedicated to Vishnu (also known as Padmanabha) reclining on the snake Anantha. The imposing gopuram (gateway tower) and intricate sculptures of the temple make it a very popular tourist attraction. Later visit Napier Museum, an art and natural history museum which houses a collection of archaeological and historic artifacts, bronze idols, ancient ornaments, a temple chariot and ivory carvings. Sri Chitra Art Gallery (Closed on Mondays &amp; Wednesday forenoons) displays the original paintings of Raja Ravi Varma which houses a collection of paintings from the Rajput, Mughal and Tanjore schools. The collection also includes unique copies of Indian mural paintings from prehistoric times down to the 18th century.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"540\\\" data-start=\\\"218\\\"><strong>Overnight stay at Kovalam<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kovalam to Trivandrum - Departure\",\"date\":\"02-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2436\\\" data-start=\\\"2225\\\"><strong>Check out from the hotel and drive to Trivandrum Airport \\/ Railway Station for departure.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6634\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:15 AM\",\"fare\":53562},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Cochin (COK)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2138\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:50 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:50 PM\",\"fare\":0},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Trivandrum\",\"to\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6428\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"01:35 PM\",\"fare\":70350},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Bangalore (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Chandigarh (IXC)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"851\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:20 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"COCHIN\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel The Leaf\",\"room_type\":\"Green leaf Room + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"00\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"THEKKADY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Elephant Court\",\"room_type\":\"Patio Room  + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"30\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"00\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"ALLEPPY\",\"hotel_name\":\"Passing Show Houseboat\",\"room_type\":\"Premium HB  + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"00\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"31\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"KOVALAM\",\"hotel_name\":\"Gokulam Grand  Beach Resort\",\"room_type\":\"Jasmine Room  + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/09\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"00\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":4}]', '<p>✈️ Return<strong> Airfare Ex-Chandigarh</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>🏨 Accommodation</strong><br />\n• Accommodation in the hotels mentioned in the hotel section.<br />\n• Meal Plan as mentioned in the hotel section.<br />\n• Daily <strong>Breakfast &amp; Dinner</strong> at the Hotels.<br />\n• All Meals at the Houseboat.</p>\n\n<p><strong>🚐 Transportation</strong><br />\n• Transportation Used: <strong>01 AC Innova Crysta.</strong><br />\n• Transfers and sightseeing by the chosen vehicle as per the itinerary.<br />\n• All transfers and sightseeing by Air-Conditioned transport as per the itinerary.<br />\n• Driver\'s Bata, Toll Tax, Parking Charges, Fuel Charges &amp; Driver Night Halt Charges.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong>🎟️ Sightseeing</strong><br />\n• Sightseeing and entrance tickets as specifically mentioned in the package.</p>\n\n<p>💰 Taxes<br />\n• All presently applicable Government Taxes (unless specifically mentioned as extra).</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":123912,\"land_cost\":\"162000\",\"hotel_cost\":0,\"transport_cost\":\"0\",\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":285912,\"profit_figure\":\"0\",\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 28591.2\",\"selling_price\":314503.2000000000116415321826934814453125,\"percent_of_amount\":\"0.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0840/062026', 314660, 57240, 28460, '2026-06-06 05:38:46', '2026-06-06 06:15:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(857, 'Mr Vinayak Toppo', NULL, '9971405019', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-06-17', 7, 0, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI ARRIVAL (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"17-06-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hanoi\'s Noi Bai International Airport, you will be welcomed by our driver holding a sign with your name on it. After approximately 50 minutes to 1 hour transfer, you will be at your hotel for check-in<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Meal: None<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HOA LU - TAM COC (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"18-06-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter between 07:15 AM \\u2013 07:45 AM and proceed towards Ninh Binh Province.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Visit the ancient capital of Hoa Lu and explore the historic Dinh &amp; Le Temples. Later enjoy a local Vietnamese lunch at a restaurant.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the afternoon, enjoy a scenic sampan boat ride at Tam Coc, famous for its limestone caves, rice fields, peaceful rivers, and beautiful countryside landscapes. Optional biking activity can also be enjoyed during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Around 03:30 PM, return back to Hanoi.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>Tour Includes:<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\u2022 SIC Transfers by AC Vehicle<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Hotel Pickup &amp; Drop (Old Quarter Area)<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Tam Coc Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 English Speaking Guide<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Mineral Water<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast + Local Lunch<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight stay in Hanoi.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"FULL DAY HANOI - HA LONG ON AMBROSE DAY CRUISE (SHUTTLE BUS TRANSFER) - TRAIN TO SAPA (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"19-06-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning pickup from Hanoi Old Quarter and proceed towards Ha Long Bay by shuttle bus.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Board the Ambrose Day Cruise and enjoy a scenic cruise through the breathtaking limestone islands of Ha Long Bay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Sightseeing Includes:<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Ha Long Bay Cruise<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sung Sot (Surprising) Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Luon Cave<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Kayaking \\/ Bamboo Boat Ride<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Titov Island<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Panoramic View Point<br \\/>\\n\\u2022 Sunset Party on Cruise<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy a buffet lunch onboard featuring Vietnamese &amp; seafood cuisine.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>In the evening, return to Hanoi and transfer to the Bus station for an overnight Train to Sapa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast &amp; Lunch&nbsp;<br \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\ude86 Overnight Train to Sapa.<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA ARRIVAL - HALF DAY MOANA CAFE & CITY TOUR\",\"date\":\"20-06-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, arrive at Lao Cai Train Station. Pick up by our tour guide &amp; driver then transfer to Sapa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;Afternoon, meet our tour guide at hotel for a tour. Visit Moana Cafe. Moana Sapa is a popular scenic attraction offering breathtaking views of Sapa\\u2019s mountains and terraced valleys. Designed as a creative photo destination, it features iconic check-in spots such as the Bali-style gate, infinity swing, giant statue, and panoramic viewpoints. With its stunning landscapes and relaxing atmosphere, it\\u2019s a perfect place to capture memorable photos and enjoy the beauty of Northern Vietnam. Transfer back to city center to have a quick stop at Stone Church - one of the most iconic land mark of Sapa. Then, walk around Sapa Market for some shopping.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Sapa<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"DISCOVER FANSIPAN MOUNTAIN\",\"date\":\"21-06-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Start the tour to the Cable Car station where you will get on cabin and take a 15-minute ride by cable car. At 6292,5m long, this is the longest non-stop three rope cable car in the world. Continue to take the Funicular Train to reach the summit of Mount Fansipan. Spend time to admire the beautiful natural landscape of Sapa, Hoang Lien Son, Muong Hoa valley and the magnificent Hoang Lien Son Mountain range (2 ways Fansipan Peak Funicular Train included). After tour, back to your hotel and free for the rest of the day.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Sapa<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"SAPA - TRANSFER BACK TO HANOI BY SHARING LIMOUSINE\",\"date\":\"22-06-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer back to Hanoi on highway road. It takes 05 hours drive. Arrival Hanoi in late afternoon, check in hotel &amp; free for the night.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Ha Noi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HALF DAY HANOI CITY TOUR (SIC TOUR)\",\"date\":\"23-06-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Morning free at leisure<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>PM: 14.00-14.15: Continue to visit the Temple of Literature \\u2013 the first university of Vietnam, established in the 11th century<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>15.15: Leave for Hoa Lo Prison Museum which was originally used by the French colonists in Indochina for political prisoners, and later by North Vietnam for U.S. prisoners of war during the Vietnam War. During this later period, it was known to American POWs as the \\\"Hanoi Hilton\\\"<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>16.15 -16.30: Tour finishes. Back to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Overnight at hotel in Hanoi<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"HANOI DEPARTURE (NO GUIDE)\",\"date\":\"24-06-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Free at leisure until transfer to Noi Bai International airport for flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meal: Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"17\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TK123\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10390\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"19\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SAPA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lacasa\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/06\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"2800\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"20\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"SAPA\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Lacasa\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"22\\/06\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"10815\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"22\\/06\\/2026\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"24\\/06\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel TK123\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rate\":\"10390\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li>Accommodation as mentioned above.</li>\n	<li>02 Rooms on DBL Sharing</li>\n	<li>Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Services of a driver and private air-conditioned vehicle during all tours and transfers (except SIC Tours)</li>\n	<li>Sapa To Hanoi By Sharing Limousine</li>\n	<li>Train&nbsp;ticket from Hanoi to Sapa.</li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Mineral water is available as complimentary</li>\n	<li>Vietnam Tourist Visa&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>International &amp; Domestic flight tickets</li>\n	<li>Accommodation in double/twin room with daily breakfast</li>\n	<li>Personal expenses, such as laundry, telephone, drinks, etc. All other services not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meals, if not specified in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Travel insurance (we highly recommend that you purchase adequate insurance)</li>\n	<li>Tips for guides and drivers&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n	<li>Visa stamping fee at the airport or Evisa</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"21\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"135840\",\"hotel_cost\":34395,\"visa_cost\":\"12245\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":182480,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 38320.8\",\"selling_price\":220800.7999999999883584678173065185546875}', 'MZQ/0842/062026', 219760, 54940, 0, '2026-06-08 06:05:09', '2026-06-08 11:31:06', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(858, 'Mr Nishant Modi', 'BNI', '7870477591', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'SRILANKA', '2026-08-03', 8, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Sri Lanka | Journey to the Misty Hills\",\"date\":\"03-08-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Airport \\u2013 Pinnawala \\u2013 Ramboda \\u2013 Nuwara Eliya<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Ayubowan! Welcome to Sri Lanka.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Meet your chauffeur guide at the airport and begin your scenic journey towards the beautiful hill country.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Highlights Along the Way:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udc18 Visit the world-famous Pinnawala Elephant Orphanage and witness rescued elephants bathing in the river.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udca6 Stop at the breathtaking Ramboda Falls, one of Sri Lanka\'s tallest waterfalls.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf3f Continue through winding mountain roads surrounded by lush tea plantations and mist-covered valleys.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Nuwara Eliya<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Discover Little England\",\"date\":\"04-08-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Nuwara Eliya Sightseeing<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy a leisurely day exploring Sri Lanka\'s charming hill station.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Today\'s Experiences:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf3a Visit the beautiful Hakgala Botanical Garden, home to exotic flowers and rare plant species.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf33 Take a relaxing stroll through Victoria Park.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\uded5 Visit the sacred Seetha Amman Temple, linked to the epic Ramayana.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udea4 Enjoy the cool climate and lakeside atmosphere at Gregory Lake.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Nuwara Eliya<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Scenic Mountain Adventure to Ella\",\"date\":\"05-08-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Nuwara Eliya \\u2013 Ella<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast, travel to the picturesque mountain town of Ella.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Highlights:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udca6 Visit the famous Ravana Falls.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\ude86 Admire the iconic Nine Arches Bridge, one of Sri Lanka\'s most photographed landmarks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83e\\udd7e Hike to Little Adam\'s Peak and enjoy spectacular panoramic views of the surrounding mountains and tea estates.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Ella<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Journey to the Southern Coast\",\"date\":\"06-08-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Ella \\u2013 Mirissa<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast, descend from the hill country towards Sri Lanka\'s stunning southern coastline.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Arrive in Mirissa and spend the remainder of the day relaxing by the Indian Ocean.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf34 Enjoy the tropical atmosphere, golden beaches, and gentle sea breeze.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Mirissa<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mirissa Beach Escape\",\"date\":\"07-08-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Mirissa<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>A day dedicated to enjoying some of the most beautiful beaches in Sri Lanka.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Highlights:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf34 Visit the famous Coconut Tree Hill for breathtaking ocean views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfd6\\ufe0f Relax at the secluded Secret Beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf0a Unwind at the tranquil Kurumba Bay and enjoy the coastal scenery.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2600\\ufe0f&nbsp;Spend the rest of the day relaxing on the beach or enjoying optional water activities.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Mirissa<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coastal Retreat at Thalpe\",\"date\":\"08-08-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Mirissa \\u2013 Thalpe<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast, proceed to the peaceful beach village of Thalpe.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Spend the day at leisure enjoying the beautiful coastline, beach caf\\u00e9s, and relaxed atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfd6\\ufe0f Relax by the beach or your hotel pool.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Thalpe<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Galle Heritage Excursion\",\"date\":\"09-08-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Thalpe \\u2013 Galle \\u2013 Thalpe<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Enjoy an excursion to Sri Lanka\'s historic southern capital.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Highlights:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udff0 Explore the UNESCO-listed Galle Fort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udcf8 Walk along the ancient ramparts overlooking the Indian Ocean.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udecd\\ufe0f Discover charming boutiques, colonial architecture, galleries, and caf\\u00e9s.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udeb6 Wander through the picturesque streets filled with history and culture.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Return to Thalpe for a relaxing evening by the beach.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Thalpe<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Colombo City Experience\",\"date\":\"10-08-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Thalpe \\u2013 Colombo<\\/b><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>After breakfast, travel to Sri Lanka\'s vibrant commercial capital.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><b>Evening City Sightseeing:<\\/b><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfdb\\ufe0f Explore the city\'s colonial and modern landmarks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83d\\udecd\\ufe0f Visit popular shopping districts and local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf0a Drive along the scenic oceanfront promenade.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf06 Experience Colombo\'s lively atmosphere, blending heritage and contemporary lifestyles.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 Overnight Stay:&nbsp;<b>Colombo<\\/b><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"11-08-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p><b>Colombo \\u2013 Airport