(862, 'Mr Sanjeev Mishra', 'Bobby (Astha Hospital)', '9431117302', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Royal Rajasthan', '2026-12-21', 12, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Delhi \\u2013 Agra (230 km | 4\\u20135 Hours)\",\"date\":\"21-12-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Delhi Airport\\/Railway Station, meet our representative and proceed to Agra. On arrival, check in to the hotel. Later, visit Agra Fort and explore the local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Agra<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Agra Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"22-12-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning visit the iconic Taj Mahal (subject to opening timings). After breakfast, visit Itmad-ud-Daulah (Baby Taj) and Mehtab Bagh before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Agra<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Agra \\u2013 Jaipur (240 km | 4.5\\u20135 Hours)\",\"date\":\"23-12-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive towards Jaipur. En route, visit the UNESCO World Heritage Site of Fatehpur Sikri. Continue to Jaipur and check in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"24-12-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit Amber Fort, Jal Mahal (Photo Stop), City Palace, Jantar Mantar, Hawa Mahal (Photo Stop) and Birla Temple. Spend the evening exploring the local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2013 Jodhpur (350 km | 6\\u20137 Hours)\",\"date\":\"25-12-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and drive to Jodhpur. Upon arrival, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jodhpur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jodhpur \\u2013 Jaisalmer (285 km | 5\\u20135.5 Hours)\",\"date\":\"26-12-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit Mehrangarh Fort and Jaswant Thada before proceeding to Jaisalmer. In the evening, enjoy the Sam Sand Dunes and cultural performances (if included).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jodhpur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast&nbsp;&amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaisalmer \\u2013 Jodhpur (285 km | 5\\u20135.5 Hours)\",\"date\":\"27-12-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit Jaisalmer Fort, Patwon Ki Haveli and Gadisar Lake before driving back to Jodhpur.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jaisalmer<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jodhpur \\u2013 Udaipur (250 km | 4.5\\u20135 Hours)\",\"date\":\"28-12-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed towards Udaipur. En route, visit the famous Ranakpur Jain Temple (subject to time availability). Upon arrival, check in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jodhpur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"29-12-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit City Palace, Jagdish Temple, Saheliyon Ki Bari, Fateh Sagar Lake and enjoy an optional boat ride on Lake Pichola.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Udaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":10,\"index\":9,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"30-12-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit Sajjangarh (Monsoon Palace), Vintage Car Museum and enjoy shopping in the local markets.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Udaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":11,\"index\":10,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Udaipur \\u2013 Jaipur (395 km | 7\\u20138 Hours)\",\"date\":\"31-12-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to Jaipur. Upon arrival, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Udaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":12,\"index\":11,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur Sightseeing \\/ Leisure\",\"date\":\"01-01-2027 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the day exploring Jaipur at your own pace. You may visit Nahargarh Fort, Albert Hall Museum, Patrika Gate, or spend time shopping at Bapu Bazaar and Johari Bazaar.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Jaipur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":13,\"index\":12,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Jaipur \\u2013 Delhi \\u2013 Departure (280 km | 5.5\\u20136 Hours)\",\"date\":\"02-01-2027 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to Delhi Airport\\/Railway Station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong>Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2038\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Dec 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Dec 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:50 AM\",\"fare\":\"42627\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Jan 2027\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Jan 2027\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:55 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"21\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Taj Vilas\",\"city\":\"Agra\",\"room_type\":\"Executive Deluxe Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"23\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"11000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"23\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"V Sarovar Portico MI Road\",\"city\":\"Jaipur\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"25\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"14400\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"25\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"VEGA BY THE OZONE HOTELS\",\"room_type\":\"Ozone Deluxe + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"7800\",\"city\":\"Jodhpur\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"26\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Golden Star Desert Camps & Resort\",\"city\":\"Jaisalmer\",\"room_type\":\"Luxury Swiss Tents + 01 EB\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ap\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"27\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"14000\"},{\"id\":4,\"check_in\":\"27\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"VEGA BY THE OZONE HOTELS\",\"room_type\":\"Ozone Deluxe + 01 EB\",\"city\":\"Jodhpur\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"28\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"7800\"},{\"id\":5,\"check_in\":\"28\\/12\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Udaipur\",\"hotel_name\":\"Sterling Balicha\",\"room_type\":\"Classic Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"31\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"20800\"},{\"id\":6,\"check_in\":\"31\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Vesta International\",\"city\":\"Jaipur\",\"room_type\":\"Royal Deluxe\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/01\\/2027\",\"rate\":\"27600\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<p><strong>Flight</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li>Return Airfare <strong>Ex-Ranchi</strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• <strong>12 Nights </strong>Accommodation as Per the Hotels Mentioned Below:<br />\n• 02&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;at <strong>The Taj Vilas, Agra</strong><br />\n• 02&nbsp;Night at <strong>V Sarovar Portico MI Road, Jaipur</strong><br />\n• 01 Night at <strong>VEGA BY THE OZONE HOTELS, Jodhpur</strong><br />\n• 01 Night at <strong>Golden Star Desert Camps &amp; Resort, Jaisalmer</strong><br />\n• 01 Night at <strong>VEGA BY THE OZONE HOTELS, Jodhpur</strong><br />\n• 03 Nights at <strong>Sterling Balicha, Udaipur</strong><br />\n• 02&nbsp;Night&nbsp;at <strong>Vesta International, Jaipur</strong><br />\n<br />\n🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast at All Hotels<br />\n• Breakfast &amp; Dinner at <strong>Golden Star Desert Camps &amp; Resort, Jaisalmer</strong></p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transportation</strong><br />\n• <strong>01 Private AC INNOVA CRYSTA</strong> for All Transfers &amp; Sightseeing<br />\n• Delhi Airport Pickup &amp; Drop<br />\n• Driver Allowance, Toll Tax, Parking Charges &amp; Fuel Charges Included</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing</strong><br />\n• Jaipur Local Sightseeing<br />\n• Jodhpur Local Sightseeing<br />\n• Jaisalmer Local Sightseeing<br />\n• Sam Sand Dunes Visit<br />\n• Udaipur Local Sightseeing<br />\n• Agra Local Sightseeing<br />\n• En-route Sightseeing as Per the Itinerary<br />\n<br />\n⚠️ <strong>Note:</strong><br />\n<strong>Christmas Eve (24th December) Mandatory Gala Dinner charges</strong> are <strong>directly payable at the hotel</strong>.<br />\nApprox<strong>&nbsp;: Rs 4000/- Per pax</strong></p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":42627,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":103400,\"transport_cost\":\"93000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":239027,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 33463.78\",\"selling_price\":272490.78}', 'MZQ/0847/062026', 283680, 94560, 0, '2026-06-29 10:24:37', '2026-08-24 18:01:05', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(863, 'Mr Sami', 'Nitin Sarawgi', '6207777568', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'VIETNAM', '2026-07-27', 4, 0, 1, '[{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Hanoi\",\"date\":\"27-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1377\\\" data-start=\\\"1096\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"1145\\\" data-start=\\\"1112\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong>, Hanoi, you will be met by our local representative and transferred to your hotel.<br data-end=\\\"1231\\\" data-start=\\\"1228\\\" \\/>\\nCheck-in at the hotel (early check-in subject to availability).<br data-end=\\\"1297\\\" data-start=\\\"1294\\\" \\/>\\nRest of the day is free to relax or explore the nearby Old Quarter at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1404\\\" data-start=\\\"1379\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hanoi<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ha Long Bay Cruise\",\"date\":\"28-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1822\\\" data-start=\\\"1456\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a <strong data-end=\\\"1524\\\" data-start=\\\"1487\\\">full-day excursion to Ha Long Bay<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site.<br data-end=\\\"1558\\\" data-start=\\\"1555\\\" \\/>\\nBoard a traditional cruise and sail through emerald waters surrounded by thousands of limestone karsts.<br data-end=\\\"1664\\\" data-start=\\\"1661\\\" \\/>\\nEnjoy activities such as visiting caves, scenic viewpoints, and a freshly prepared lunch onboard (as per cruise inclusions).<br data-end=\\\"1791\\\" data-start=\\\"1788\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Hanoi in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1849\\\" data-start=\\\"1824\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hanoi<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Ninh Binh \\u2013 Hoa Lu \\u2013 Tam Coc \\u2013 Bich Dong\",\"date\":\"29-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2292\\\" data-start=\\\"1923\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1973\\\" data-start=\\\"1951\\\">Ninh Binh Province<\\/strong>, famously known as <em data-end=\\\"2017\\\" data-start=\\\"1993\\\">\\u201cHa Long Bay on Land.\\u201d<\\/em><br data-end=\\\"2020\\\" data-start=\\\"2017\\\" \\/>\\nVisit the historic <strong data-end=\\\"2065\\\" data-start=\\\"2039\\\">Hoa Lu Ancient Capital<\\/strong>, followed by <strong data-end=\\\"2099\\\" data-start=\\\"2079\\\">Bich Dong Pagoda<\\/strong>, nestled amidst scenic limestone hills.<br data-end=\\\"2142\\\" data-start=\\\"2139\\\" \\/>\\nLater, enjoy a traditional <strong data-end=\\\"2200\\\" data-start=\\\"2169\\\">sampan boat ride at Tam Coc<\\/strong>, passing through caves, rice fields, and dramatic landscapes.<br data-end=\\\"2265\\\" data-start=\\\"2262\\\" \\/>\\nReturn to Hanoi by evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2319\\\" data-start=\\\"2294\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hanoi<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hanoi at Leisure\",\"date\":\"30-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure to explore Hanoi at your own pace. You may stroll through the charming streets of the Old Quarter, visit local caf\\u00e9s, shop for souvenirs, or indulge in authentic Vietnamese cuisine. You can also opt for optional sightseeing or simply relax and enjoy the city\'s vibrant atmosphere.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hanoi<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure from Hanoi\",\"date\":\"31-07-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2690\\\" data-start=\\\"2657\\\">Noi Bai International Airport<\\/strong> to board your return flight to Kolkata, carrying wonderful memories of Vietnam.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/07\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Little Diamond\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Twin Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"4500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Little Diamond\",\"city\":\"HANOI\",\"room_type\":\"Junior Double Suite\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rate\":\"4600\",\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"nights\":2}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[]', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>04&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</strong>accommodation in&nbsp;<em><strong>Hotel Little Diamond&nbsp;@HA NOI&nbsp;</strong></em>with&nbsp;<strong>Breakfast</strong></li>\n	<li>Airport Transfers <strong>on PVT</strong><br />\n	All Tours <strong>on SIC</strong></li>\n	<li>Experienced English-speaking guide on as mentioned in itinerary</li>\n	<li>Entrance fees for all visits as mentioned in the itinerary</li>\n	<li>Meal as specified in the itinerary.</li>\n	<li><em><strong>Vietnam VISA.</strong></em></li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"25\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"14000\",\"hotel_cost\":9100,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":\"2600\",\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":25700,\"profit_figure\":null,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 6425\",\"selling_price\":32125}', 'MZQ/0848/072026', 32240, 32240, 0, '2026-07-16 10:04:27', '2026-07-16 10:12:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(864, 'Dr Ashwini', 'BNI', '9472709589', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BHUTAN 4*', '2026-09-15', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival NJP \\/ Bagdogra \\u2013 Phuentsholing (170 km | 5 Hours)\",\"date\":\"15-09-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at NJP Railway Station or Bagdogra Airport, meet our representative and proceed towards Phuentsholing, the gateway to Bhutan and a bustling commercial town on the Indo-Bhutan border. Upon arrival, check in to the hotel and relax for the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Phuentsholing<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuentsholing \\u2013 Thimphu (176 km | 6 Hours)\",\"date\":\"16-09-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, complete the Bhutan immigration formalities and proceed towards Thimphu, the capital city of Bhutan. En route, visit <strong>Sangye Migyur Ling Lhakhang (Milarepa Tower)<\\/strong>, the <strong>Eight Dharma Kaya Stupas at Gedu<\\/strong>, the picturesque <strong>Roadside Waterfall<\\/strong>, and <strong>Chuzom<\\/strong>, where the three rivers meet. Upon arrival, check in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Thimphu<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu to Paro - Sightseeing and transfer\",\"date\":\"17-09-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast visit outer view Kuensel Phodrang (Buddha Statue), Hindu Temple, Outer view of National Memorial Chorten (Monument) and Wagdi tse Lhakhanag (short hike of 40 mins). Afternoon visit Nunnery, BBS Tower, National Library, Centenary Farmer Market ( Handicraft product and Local product can be Found here. In the evening the Tashichhoe Dzong Outer view (Fortress of the Glorious Religion). Craft Bazar for shopping can be seen here. Later drive to Paro. Evening Leisure. Overnight stay at Paro.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Thimphu<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro - Excursion to Tiger\'s Nest\",\"date\":\"18-09-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast visit Taktsang Monastery - called \\u201cTiger\'s Nest\\u201d and later if time permits visit Drukgyel Dzong. Overnight stay will be at Paro.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Paro<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro to Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"date\":\"19-09-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast drive to Paro and on the way visit near river side and, Airport View , Ta Dzong \\u2013 National Museum with an excellent collection of arts, relics, religious thangka. RinpungDzong Meaning \\\"fortress of the heap of jewels , Visit Muesume of Lights ( To display the country\\u2019s journey before the arrival of electricity and the present) \\\" transfer to Phuentsholing. On arrival check in at the hotel. Overnight stay at Phuentsholing.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Paro<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon to Siliguri \\/ Bagdogra Airport \\/ NJP Railway Station - Drop\",\"date\":\"20-09-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast check out from the hotel and transfer to NJP Train Station \\/ IXBAirport for departure<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"15\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"16\\/09\\/2026\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"16\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Thimphu\",\"hotel_name\":\"Lemon Tree Resort \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"17\\/09\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"17\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Paro\",\"hotel_name\":\"Resort Thim-Dorji \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"19\\/09\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"19\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"20\\/09\\/2026\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• Rooms on Twin Sharing Basis</p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at All Hotels</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transportation</strong><br />\n• All Transfers &amp; Sightseeing by Exclusive Private Non-AC Vehicle<br />\n• Pickup &amp; Drop from NJP Railway Station / Bagdogra Airport / Alipurduar Railway Station / Hasimara Railway Station / Paro Airport</p>\n\n<p>🧑‍💼 <strong>Guide Services</strong><br />\n• One English-Speaking Guide for All Sightseeing (Bhutan Portion Only)</p>\n\n<p>🛂 <strong>Permits</strong><br />\n• All Bhutan Permit Assistance Included</p>\n\n<p>💰 <strong>Additional Charges Included</strong><br />\n• Daily Surcharge of ₹1,200 Per Person Per Night Included<br />\n<br />\n📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"92000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":92000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 16560\",\"selling_price\":108560}', 'MZQ/0849/072026', 108540, 54270, 0, '2026-07-20 08:17:07', '2026-07-27 13:15:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(865, 'Mr Bikas Kumar', 'OAK GROVE', '9955208900', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'HONGKONG & MACAU', '2026-07-27', 5, 2, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Hong Kong \\u2013 Night City Tour\",\"date\":\"27-07-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Hong Kong International Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. After check-in and some time at leisure, proceed for the famous <strong>Hong Kong Night Tour<\\/strong> covering <strong>Victoria Peak<\\/strong> with <strong>One-Way Peak Tram Ride<\\/strong>, <strong>One-Way Star Ferry Ride<\\/strong>, <strong>Symphony of Lights Show<\\/strong> from the Tsim Sha Tsui Promenade and the historic <strong>Old Clock Tower<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hong Kong<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Ocean Park Hong Kong\",\"date\":\"28-07-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a full-day visit to <strong>Ocean Park Hong Kong<\\/strong>, one of Asia\'s most popular marine-themed parks featuring thrilling rides, animal exhibits, aquariums and exciting entertainment. Later, return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hong Kong<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hong Kong \\u2013 Macau by Ferry\",\"date\":\"29-07-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the Hong Kong Ferry Terminal. Board the ferry to Macau. Upon arrival, meet our representative and transfer to the hotel. The remaining day is free for leisure to explore Macau at your own pace.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Macau<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Macau City Tour\",\"date\":\"30-07-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a half-day city tour of Macau covering <strong>Lotus Square<\\/strong>, <strong>A-Ma Temple<\\/strong>, the iconic <strong>Ruins of St. Paul\'s Church<\\/strong>, <strong>Fisherman\'s Wharf<\\/strong>, and an outside photo stop at the famous <strong>Macau Tower<\\/strong>. The remaining day is at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Macau<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Macau \\u2013 Hong Kong by Ferry & Disneyland\",\"date\":\"31-07-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to the Macau Ferry Terminal. Board the ferry back to Hong Kong. Upon arrival, transfer to <strong>Hong Kong Disneyland<\\/strong> for a full-day magical experience. Later, transfer to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Hong Kong<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Hong Kong Departure\",\"date\":\"01-08-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Hong Kong International Airport for your onward journey with wonderful memories.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong>Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2286\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"05:05 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"37000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"name\":\"AirIndia\",\"fno\":\"314\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Jul 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"102000\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Hong Kong (HKG)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Cathay Pacific\",\"fno\":\"665\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Aug 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:10 PM\",\"fare\":\"185000\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"5023\",\"dep_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"02 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:10 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"08:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"37000\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"27\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Hong Kong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Harbour Plaza 8 Degrees\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"56000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"29\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Macau\",\"hotel_name\":\"The Venetian Macao\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Royale Deluxe Suite\",\"rate\":\"121625\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Hong Kong\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Golden Mile\",\"room_type\":\"Premium Room\",\"rooms\":2,\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"02\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"47000\",\"meal\":\"cp\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[{\"age\":8},{\"age\":2}]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare Ex-Ranchi</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Hong Kong<br />\n• 03 Nights Accommodation in Macau<br />\n• 01 Night Accommodation in Hong Kong</p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast at HKG Hotels</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transfers</strong><br />\n• Return Airport Transfers<br />\n• Ferry Terminal Transfers in Hong Kong &amp; Macau<br />\n• All Tours &amp; Transfers on Private Basis</p>\n\n<p>⛴️ <strong>Ferry Tickets</strong><br />\n• 02-Way Ferry Tickets (Hong Kong ↔ Macau)</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Hong Kong Night Tour<br />\n• Victoria Peak with One-Way Peak Tram Ride<br />\n• One-Way Star Ferry Ride<br />\n• Symphony of Lights Show<br />\n• Old Clock Tower Visit<br />\n• Full-Day Ocean Park Hong Kong<br />\n• Half-Day Macau City Tour<br />\n• Full-Day Hong Kong Disneyland</p>\n\n<p>📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included<br />\n• On-Ground Assistance Throughout the Tour</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":361000,\"land_cost\":\"220000\",\"hotel_cost\":224625},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":805625,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 104731.25\",\"selling_price\":910356.25}', 'MZQ/0850/072026', 910880, 178760, 97920, '2026-07-20 11:11:15', '2026-07-20 11:45:41', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(866, 'Mr Diptanshu Shekhar', 'BNI JOSH', '7061336377', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Kuala-lumpur + Bali', '2026-09-26', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Kuala Lumpur \\u2013 Half Day City Tour with KL Tower\",\"date\":\"26-09-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Kuala Lumpur International Airport, meet our representative and transfer to the city. Proceed for a <strong>Half-Day Kuala Lumpur City Tour<\\/strong> covering the city\'s major attractions along with admission to the <strong>KL Tower Observation Deck<\\/strong>. Later, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuala Lumpur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Genting Highlands & Batu Caves\",\"date\":\"27-09-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to <strong>Genting Highlands<\\/strong>. En route, visit the famous <strong>Batu Caves<\\/strong> before returning to Kuala Lumpur.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuala Lumpur<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kuala Lumpur \\u2013 Bali (Ubud Private Villa)\",\"date\":\"28-09-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and proceed to the airport for your flight to Bali. Upon arrival, receive a warm welcome with a <strong>Flower Garland<\\/strong> and <strong>Mineral Water<\\/strong>, followed by a transfer to your <strong>Private Villa in Ubud<\\/strong>. Check in and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Ubud Private Villa<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mount Batur Sunrise Jeep Tour & Bali Swing\",\"date\":\"29-09-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, enjoy the <strong>Mount Batur Sunrise Jeep Tour<\\/strong>. Later, visit <strong>Bali Sidan Swing<\\/strong> and experience its exciting swings, nests and panoramic viewpoints before returning to the villa.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Ubud Private Villa<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ATV Adventure & Inter Hotel Transfer\",\"date\":\"30-09-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for an exciting <strong>ATV Tandem Adventure (5 KM Trail)<\\/strong> through scenic countryside tracks. After the activity, transfer to your hotel and check in.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Nusa Penida Island Tour\",\"date\":\"01-10-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to <strong>Sanur Harbour<\\/strong> and board a shared speedboat to <strong>Nusa Penida Island<\\/strong>. Visit <strong>Angel\'s Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Beach,<\\/strong> and <strong>Crystal Beach<\\/strong>. Enjoy a local lunch before returning to Kuta.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Evening Kecak Dance Performance\",\"date\":\"02-10-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy the day at leisure. In the evening, visit the famous <strong>Kecak Dance Performance<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bali Departure\",\"date\":\"03-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to Ngurah Rai International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airline\",\"fno\":\"MH-185\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Sep 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"36394\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"name\":\"Batik Air\",\"fno\":\"OD-193\",\"dep_date\":\"28 Sep 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"28 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 PM\",\"fare\":\"25581\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-377\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Oct 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"06:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"55810\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kuala-lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"AirAsia Airways\",\"fno\":\"AK-63\",\"dep_date\":\"03 Oct 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"03 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:20 PM\",\"fare\":0}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"26\\/09\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Verdant Hill\",\"city\":\"KUALA LUMPUR\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Queen Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"28\\/09\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"10000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"28\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BALI | Ubud\",\"room_type\":\"Asmara Pool Villa\",\"hotel_name\":\"Kenran Resort\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"30\\/09\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"36782\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"30\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BALI | Kuta\",\"hotel_name\":\"Fairfield by Marriot sunset road\",\"room_type\":\"Guest Queen Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"03\\/10\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"12600\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare <em><strong>Ex-Kolkata.</strong></em><br />\n• <strong>20 Kgs Check-in Baggage</strong>&nbsp;for <strong>01 Pax</strong> in All Flights.</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Kuala Lumpur<br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Ubud, Bali<br />\n• 03 Nights Accommodation in Kuta, Bali<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast at All Hotels<br />\n• 01 Local Lunch During Nusa Penida Island Tour</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transfers</strong><br />\n• Return Airport Transfers in Kuala Lumpur<br />\n• Return Airport Transfers in Bali<br />\n• All Sightseeing Transfers on Private Basis (Except Shared Speed Boat to Nusa Penida)</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Kuala Lumpur Night Tour<br />\n• Full-Day Genting Highlands Tour<br />\n• Batu Caves Visit<br />\n• Kecak Dance Performance<br />\n• Full-Day Nusa Penida Island Tour<br />\n• Kelingking Cliff<br />\n• Crystal Bay Beach<br />\n• Bali Swing<br />\n&nbsp;</p>', '<ul>\n	<li><strong>Bali E-visa + Levy</strong>@ <em><strong>4300/- Per pax&nbsp;</strong></em></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"16\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":117785,\"land_cost\":\"33000\",\"hotel_cost\":59382,\"visa_cost\":\"7000\"},\"extra\":[{\"name\":\"KUL LAND\",\"amount\":23300}],\"cost_price\":240467,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 38474.72\",\"selling_price\":278941.72}', 'MZQ/0851/072026', 278000, 139000, 0, '2026-07-22 08:53:15', '2026-08-18 19:05:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(867, 'Mr Bikas Kumar', 'OAK GROVE', '9955208900', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'THAILAND', '2026-08-01', 5, 1, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok \\u2013 Transfer to Pattaya\",\"date\":\"01-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Bangkok International Airport, meet our representative and transfer to Pattaya. Check in to the hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour\",\"date\":\"02-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for the <strong>Coral Island Tour<\\/strong> by speedboat. Enjoy the beautiful beaches, optional water sports, and a delicious <strong>Indian Lunch<\\/strong> before returning to Pattaya.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tiger Park Experience\",\"date\":\"03-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the famous <strong>Tiger Park Pattaya<\\/strong> for an exciting wildlife experience. Later, return to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok & Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"04-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer to Bangkok. Check in to the hotel. In the evening, enjoy a delightful <strong>Chao Phraya River Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> with beautiful views of Bangkok\'s illuminated skyline.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n<strong>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dream World Bangkok\",\"date\":\"05-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a fun-filled day at <strong>Dream World Bangkok<\\/strong>, enjoying its exciting rides, attractions, and entertainment before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok Departure\",\"date\":\"06-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Spend free time at leisure until your scheduled evening transfer to Bangkok International Airport for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p><strong>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata\",\"to\":\"Bangkok\",\"name\":\"Thai Airways\",\"dep_date\":\"01 Aug 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"01 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:00 Am\",\"arv_time\":\"06:10 Am\",\"fare\":\"145338\",\"fno\":\"TG-314\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Bangkok\",\"to\":\"Kolkata\",\"name\":\"Thai Airways\",\"fno\":\"TG-313\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 Pm\",\"arv_date\":\"07 Aug 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 Am\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"01\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Pattaya, an IHG Hotel\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Sea View Bay Tower\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"04\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"85000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"04\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"BANGKOK\",\"hotel_name\":\"Amari Bangkok\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"06\\/08\\/2026\",\"room_type\":\"Grand Deluxe Skyline View\",\"rate\":\"64000\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[{\"age\":8}]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare Ex-Kolkata</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 03 Nights Accommodation in Pattaya<br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Bangkok<br />\n<br />\n🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Activities&nbsp;</strong><strong>(All on Private Basis)</strong>✈️ Bangkok (BKK) Airport ➝ Pattaya Hotel Transfer<br />\n🏝️ Coral Island Tour with Indian Lunch<br />\n🐅 Tiger Park Pattaya Visit<br />\n🚗 Pattaya Hotel ➝ Bangkok Hotel Transfer<br />\n🚢 Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise<br />\n🎢 Full Day Dream World Bangkok&nbsp;with Lunch<br />\n✈️ Bangkok Hotel ➝ Bangkok (BKK) Airport Transfer</p>\n\n<p>📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included<br />\n• On-Ground Assistance Throughout the Tour</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"14\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":145338,\"land_cost\":\"70900\",\"hotel_cost\":149000},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":365238,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 51133.32\",\"selling_price\":416371.32}', 'MZQ/0852/072026', 417130, 91310, 51890, '2026-07-26 22:39:16', '2026-07-27 16:35:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(868, 'Mr Premjeet Kumar', 'Prince Motors', '6287049999', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Magical Bhutan', '2026-07-31', 6, 1, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Siliguri \\u2013 Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"31-07-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Meet at Siliguri and transfer to <strong>Phuentsholing<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in to the hotel and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Phuentsholing<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Phuentsholing \\u2013 Thimphu\",\"date\":\"01-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, complete immigration formalities and drive to <strong>Thimphu<\\/strong>. En route, visit <strong>Milarepa Tower<\\/strong>, <strong>Eight Dharma Kaya Stupas<\\/strong>, <strong>Roadside Waterfall<\\/strong>, and <strong>Chuzum Confluence<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Thimphu<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Dochula Pass & Punakha Excursion\",\"date\":\"02-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day excursion to <strong>Dochula Pass<\\/strong> and <strong>Punakha<\\/strong>, visiting <strong>Pho Chhu &amp; Mo Chhu Rivers<\\/strong>, <strong>Punakha Dzong<\\/strong>, <strong>Chimi Lhakhang<\\/strong>, and the <strong>Suspension Bridge<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Thimphu<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Thimphu \\u2013 Paro\",\"date\":\"03-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit <strong>Buddha Dordenma<\\/strong>, <strong>Memorial Chorten<\\/strong>, <strong>BBS Tower<\\/strong>, <strong>Centenary Farmers Market<\\/strong>, and <strong>Tashichho Dzong (Outer View)<\\/strong> before driving to <strong>Paro<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Paro<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chele La Pass Excursion\",\"date\":\"04-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to <strong>Chele La Pass<\\/strong>, the highest motorable road in Bhutan. In the evening, enjoy shopping and experience Bhutanese traditional attire (optional).<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Paro<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Paro \\u2013 Phuentsholing\",\"date\":\"05-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit <strong>Paro Airport View Point<\\/strong>, <strong>Ta Dzong (National Museum)<\\/strong>, <strong>Rinpung Dzong<\\/strong>, and the <strong>Museum of Lights<\\/strong> before driving back to <strong>Phuentsholing<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Phuentsholing<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"06-08-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong>Siliguri \\/ NJP Railway Station \\/ Bagdogra Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong>Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7562\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"08:30 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"41400\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"751\",\"dep_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:40 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"31 Jul 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"01:45 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Bagdogra (IXB)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"292\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:25 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Aug 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"03:25 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"},{\"id\":4,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"7674\",\"dep_date\":\"06 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:50 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"06 Aug 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"09:05 PM\",\"fare\":\"00\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"31\\/07\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"meal\":\"map\",\"rooms\":1,\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"01\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"01\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Thimphu\",\"hotel_name\":\"Lemon Tree Resort  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"03\\/08\\/2026\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"03\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Paro\",\"hotel_name\":\"Tashi Namgay Resort  \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"05\\/08\\/2026\"},{\"id\":3,\"check_in\":\"05\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Phuentsholing\\/Jaigaon\",\"hotel_name\":\"Bhutan Ga Me Ga \\/ Similar\",\"room_type\":\"Double Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"map\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"06\\/08\\/2026\"}]', '<ul>\n	<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li>\n	<li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li>\n	<li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li>\n	<li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li>\n	<li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li>\n	<li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li>\n	<li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li>\n	<li>For more details click <a href=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></li>\n</ul>', '[{\"age\":5}]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong><br />\n• Round-trip Airfare Ex-Ranchi (IXR)</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transportation</strong><br />\n• Pickup &amp; Drop from Bagdogra Airport.<br />\n• All Transfers &amp; Sightseeing by Exclusive Non-AC Vehicle</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 06 Nights Accommodation at the Hotels Mentioned<br />\n• Double&nbsp;Sharing Room</p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast &amp; Dinner at All Hotels</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing</strong><br />\n• Phuentsholing, Thimphu, Punakha &amp; Paro Sightseeing as per the Itinerary<br />\n• Dochula Pass Excursion<br />\n• Chele La Pass Excursion</p>\n\n<p>👨‍💼 <strong>Guide &amp; Permits</strong><br />\n• English-Speaking Guide for Bhutan Sightseeing<br />\n• Bhutan SDF (Sustainable Development Fee) for 04 Nights<br />\n• All Bhutan Permit Assistance</p>\n\n<p>📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• Arrival &amp; Departure Assistance<br />\n• All Presently Applicable Government Taxes Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"20\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":41400,\"land_cost\":\"118000\",\"hotel_cost\":null,\"transport_cost\":null,\"visa_cost\":null,\"travel_insurance\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":159400,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 31880\",\"selling_price\":191280}', 'MZQ/0853/072026', 191280, 85350, 20580, '2026-07-28 18:01:06', '2026-07-28 18:16:20', 0, 0, '\"<h1 data-end=\\\"880\\\" data-section-id=\\\"x6fwl9\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\">REQUIREMENTS FOR ENTRY INTO BHUTAN<\\/h1>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"896\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1q839vq\\\" data-start=\\\"882\\\">For Adults<\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"949\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1f6xww4\\\" data-start=\\\"897\\\">Passport with minimum 6 months validity<br data-end=\\\"941\\\" data-start=\\\"938\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"949\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\">OR<\\/strong><\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"974\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1kkuotu\\\" data-start=\\\"950\\\">Original Voter ID Card<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\\n<h3 data-end=\\\"992\\\" data-section-id=\\\"kn7lpq\\\" data-start=\\\"976\\\">For Children<\\/h3>\\n\\n<ul data-end=\\\"1065\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\">\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1045\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1f6xww4\\\" data-start=\\\"993\\\">Passport with minimum 6 months validity<br data-end=\\\"1037\\\" data-start=\\\"1034\\\" \\/>\\n\\t<strong data-end=\\\"1045\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\">OR<\\/str