<li data-end=\\\"1698\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1losk7m\\\" data-start=\\\"1534\\\">Guests arriving late night or early morning at railway stations are advised to rest in the waiting\\/retiring room before continuing the journey for safety reasons.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1818\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1s5m8jt\\\" data-start=\\\"1700\\\">Hotels mentioned are subject to availability. In case of non-availability, similar category hotels will be provided.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1893\\\" data-section-id=\\\"v6pe73\\\" data-start=\\\"1820\\\">Service standards in hilly regions may differ from metropolitan cities.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"1970\\\" data-section-id=\\\"lbwrz\\\" data-start=\\\"1895\\\">Sightseeing tours start early due to shorter daylight hours in the hills.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2114\\\" data-section-id=\\\"evurbe\\\" data-start=\\\"1972\\\">In case of bad weather, road blockage, strikes, landslides or unforeseen situations, sightseeing points or itinerary may change accordingly.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2236\\\" data-section-id=\\\"12yxbn8\\\" data-start=\\\"2116\\\">Additional expenses due to road blockage, snowfall, landslides or route diversion will be borne directly by the guest.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2321\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1lz38sj\\\" data-start=\\\"2238\\\">Guests are requested to take full responsibility for their luggage and valuables.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2433\\\" data-section-id=\\\"t6z6c9\\\" data-start=\\\"2323\\\">Even during summer months, weather in Bhutan and hill areas remains cool. Carry sufficient woollen clothing.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2583\\\" data-section-id=\\\"zwqubv\\\" data-start=\\\"2435\\\">Any request for minor sightseeing changes must be informed one day prior before 02:00 PM. Requests after this time may attract additional charges.<\\/li>\\n\\t<li data-end=\\\"2816\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-section-id=\\\"1c3ti7m\\\" data-start=\\\"2585\\\">Some high-altitude areas have low oxygen levels. Guests with heart issues, blood pressure problems, knee problems, senior citizens, and children below 5 years are advised to avoid such locations due to limited medical facilities.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"', 0, 0),
(869, 'MR AVISHEK', 'NEHA BILASPUR UNCLE', '7838619443', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BALI', '2026-12-20', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bali \\u2013 Kuta\",\"date\":\"20-12-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at Ngurah Rai International Airport, meet our representative with a <strong>Flower Garland &amp; Mineral Water<\\/strong>. Transfer to your hotel in <strong>Kuta<\\/strong>, check in, and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Water Sports, Uluwatu Temple & Romantic Candle Light Dinner\",\"date\":\"21-12-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy exciting <strong>Water Sports<\\/strong> including <strong>Jet Ski, Parasailing Adventure &amp; Banana Boat Ride<\\/strong>. Later, visit the magnificent <strong>Uluwatu Temple<\\/strong> followed by a romantic <strong>Candle Light Dinner<\\/strong> with <em>\\\"I Love You\\\"<\\/em> flower d\\u00e9cor and wine\\/soft drinks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full-Day Nusa Penida Island Tour\",\"date\":\"22-12-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After an early breakfast, transfer to <strong>Sanur Harbour<\\/strong> and board a shared speedboat to <strong>Nusa Penida Island<\\/strong>. Visit <strong>Angel\'s Billabong, Broken Beach, Kelingking Beach,<\\/strong> and <strong>Crystal Beach<\\/strong>, followed by a local lunch before returning to Kuta.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bedugul, Handara Gate & Tanah Lot Temple\",\"date\":\"23-12-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, visit the picturesque <strong>Ulun Danu Beratan Temple<\\/strong>, the iconic <strong>Handara Gate<\\/strong>, and conclude the day with a visit to the famous <strong>Tanah Lot Temple<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kintamani, Rice Terrace, Waterfall & Bali Swing\",\"date\":\"24-12-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day tour covering <strong>Kintamani (Mount Batur View Point)<\\/strong>, <strong>Tegalalang Rice Terrace<\\/strong>, <strong>Tegenungan Waterfall<\\/strong>, and the famous <strong>Bali Sidan Swing<\\/strong> experience.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ATV Adventure & White Water Rafting\",\"date\":\"25-12-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, experience an exciting <strong>60-Minute ATV Tandem Adventure<\\/strong> followed by an exhilarating <strong>White Water Rafting<\\/strong> experience through Bali\'s scenic river landscapes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kuta<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bali Departure\",\"date\":\"26-12-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. At the scheduled time, transfer to <strong>Ngurah Rai International Airport (DPS)<\\/strong> for your onward journey. Guests are advised to reach the airport <strong>3\\u20134 hours prior<\\/strong> to flight departure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Bengaluru (BLR)\",\"to\":\"Kuala Lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airline\",\"fno\":\"MH-193\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Dec 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"12:20 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Dec 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"07:15 AM\",\"fare\":\"116026\"},{\"id\":2,\"to\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"from\":\"Kuala Lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airline\",\"fno\":\"MH-715\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Dec 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:00 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"20 Dec 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"12:05 PM\"},{\"id\":3,\"fno\":\"MH-852\",\"dep_date\":\"26 Dec 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"26 Dec 2026\",\"from\":\"Denpasar Bali (DPS)\",\"to\":\"Kuala Lumpur (KUL)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airline\",\"dep_time\":\"07:15 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:15 PM\"},{\"id\":4,\"fno\":\"MH-104\",\"dep_date\":\"27 Dec 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"27 Dec 2026\",\"from\":\"Kuala Lumpur (KUL)\",\"to\":\"Bengaluru (BLR)\",\"name\":\"Malaysia Airline\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:55 AM\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"20\\/12\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Kuta Central Park Hotel\",\"city\":\"Kuta\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"24\\/12\\/2026\",\"rate\":null},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"24\\/12\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":1,\"city\":\"Ubud\",\"hotel_name\":\"Villa Rosavelle by Buktiyasa International\",\"room_type\":\"BR Pool Villa\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"26\\/12\\/2026\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<p>✈️ <strong>Airfare</strong><br />\n• Return Airfare Ex-Bangalore</p>\n\n<p>🏨 <strong>Accommodation</strong><br />\n• 04 Nights Accommodation in Kuta, Bali<br />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Ubud, Bali</p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast<br />\n• 01 Local Lunch during Nusa Penida Island Tour<br />\n• 01 Romantic Candle Light Dinner with <em>\"I Love You\"</em> Flower Décor &amp; Wine/Soft Drinks</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transfers</strong><br />\n• Bali Airport – Kuta Hotel Transfer<br />\n• Kuta Hotel – Sanur Harbour – Kuta Hotel Transfers<br />\n• Kuta Hotel – Ubud Hotel Transfer<br />\n• Ubud Hotel – Bali Airport Transfer<br />\n• Private Transfers for All Sightseeing as per the Itinerary</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Jet Ski, Parasailing Adventure &amp; Banana Boat Ride<br />\n• Uluwatu Temple Visit<br />\n• Full-Day Nusa Penida West Island Tour with Shared Speed Boat<br />\n• Ulun Danu Beratan Temple<br />\n• Handara Gate<br />\n• Tanah Lot Temple<br />\n• Kintamani (Mount Batur View Point)<br />\n• Tegalalang Rice Terrace<br />\n• Tegenungan Waterfall<br />\n• Bali Sidan Swing<br />\n• 60-Minute ATV Tandem Adventure<br />\n• White Water Rafting Experience</p>\n\n<p>📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• Flower Garland &amp; Mineral Water on Arrival<br />\n• All Entrance Fees as Mentioned in the Itinerary<br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included</p>', '<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;🛂 <strong>Visa</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n	<li><strong>Bali E-Visa &amp; Tourism Levy</strong> – <em>₹4,300 per person</em></li>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>📌 <strong>Important Note</strong></p>\n\n<p>• <strong>Christmas Gala Dinner Charges (24th/25th December)</strong> are <strong>TBA (To Be Advised)</strong> by the hotel.<br />\n• The applicable Gala Dinner charges are <strong>mandatory</strong> and must be <strong>paid directly at the hotel during check-in</strong>, if applicable.</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"13\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":116026,\"land_cost\":\"78000\",\"hotel_cost\":null},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":194026,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 25223.38\",\"selling_price\":219249.38}', 'MZQ/0854/072026', 219640, 109820, 0, '2026-07-31 12:47:58', '2026-07-31 12:54:50', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(870, 'MR ADITYA', NULL, '9709400140', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'BANGKOK', '2026-08-10', 5, 2, 4, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Bangkok \\u2013 Transfer to Pattaya\",\"date\":\"10-08-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at <strong>Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong>, meet our representative and enjoy a private transfer to your hotel in <strong>Pattaya<\\/strong>. Check in and spend the rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tiger Park Pattaya\",\"date\":\"11-08-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed to <strong>Tiger Park Pattaya<\\/strong> with private round-trip transfers. Enjoy an unforgettable experience with your choice of <strong>Big or Small Tiger Entry<\\/strong> before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour\",\"date\":\"12-08-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for the <strong>Coral Island Tour<\\/strong> by speedboat. Enjoy the beautiful beaches, optional water sports, and an included lunch before returning to Pattaya.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok & Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"13-08-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and transfer privately to your hotel in <strong>Bangkok<\\/strong>. In the evening, enjoy the <strong>Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>, featuring a delicious dinner while cruising past Bangkok\'s illuminated landmarks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Safari World & Marine Park\",\"date\":\"14-08-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day excursion to <strong>Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>, including entrance tickets and lunch. Experience exciting wildlife encounters and entertaining animal shows before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meals:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok Departure\",\"date\":\"15-08-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and enjoy a private transfer to <strong>Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong>Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"BANGKOK (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai Vietjet Air\",\"fno\":\"VZ-771\",\"dep_date\":\"10 Aug 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"01:00 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"10 Aug 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"05:00 AM\",\"fare\":\"75423\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"BANGKOK (BKK)\",\"to\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Jul 2026\",\"name\":\"Thai Airways Intl\",\"fno\":\"TG-313\",\"dep_time\":\"11:45 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"16 Jul 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"12:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"87324\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"10\\/08\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Holiday Inn Express\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"city\":\"PATTAYA\",\"rooms\":2,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"13\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"30000\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"13\\/08\\/2026\",\"ho