p>\n\n<p>🍽️ <strong>Meals</strong><br />\n• Daily Breakfast<br />\n• 02 Lunches (Coral Island Tour &amp; Safari World)<br />\n• 01 Dinner on Chao Phraya Princess Cruise</p>\n\n<p>🚐 <strong>Transfers</strong><br />\n• Bangkok Airport ➝ Pattaya Hotel (Private)<br />\n• Pattaya Hotel ➝ Bangkok Hotel (Private)<br />\n• Bangkok Hotel ➝ Bangkok Airport (Private)</p>\n\n<p>🎟️ <strong>Sightseeing &amp; Activities</strong><br />\n• Tiger Park Entry Ticket (Big or Small Tiger – Any One)<br />\n• Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat<br />\n• Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<br />\n• Safari World &amp; Marine Park</p>\n\n<p>📋 <strong>Additional Benefits</strong><br />\n• All Applicable Taxes Included</p>', '<ul>\n	<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li>\n	<li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee &amp; Camera Fee.</li>\n	<li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":162747,\"land_cost\":\"70000\",\"hotel_cost\":129500},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":362247,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 54337.05\",\"selling_price\":416584.05}', 'MZQ/0855/072026', 416580, 69430, 69430, '2026-07-31 18:38:20', '2026-07-31 18:38:20', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(871, 'Mr Bablu Sahu', 'Argora', '9031267643', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Ujjain + Indore', '2026-08-05', 5, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Indore \\u2013 Transfer to Ujjain\",\"date\":\"05-08-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at <strong>Indore Airport\\/Railway Station<\\/strong>, meet our representative and proceed to <strong>Ujjain<\\/strong>. Check in to the hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Ujjain<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga & Harsiddhi Mata Darshan\",\"date\":\"06-08-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Early morning, proceed for the sacred <strong>Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga Darshan<\\/strong> followed by <strong>Harsiddhi Mata Temple Darshan<\\/strong>. Spend the remaining day at leisure or explore the nearby temple area.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Ujjain<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kal Bhairav Darshan \\u2013 Transfer to Indore\",\"date\":\"07-08-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and visit the sacred <strong>Kal Bhairav Temple<\\/strong>. Later, proceed to <strong>Indore<\\/strong> and check in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Indore<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Indore Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"08-08-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for a local sightseeing tour of <strong>Indore<\\/strong>, covering the city\'s major attractions. Later, return to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Indore<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Omkareshwar Day Excursion\",\"date\":\"09-08-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, enjoy a full-day excursion to the holy town of <strong>Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga Temple<\\/strong> for darshan and sightseeing. Return to Indore in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Indore<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Indore Departure\",\"date\":\"10-08-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong>Indore Airport\\/Railway Station<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"05\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Ujjain\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Abika Elite\",\"room_type\":\"Super Deluxe\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"ep\",\"nights\":2,\"check_out\":\"07\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"13610\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"07\\/08\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Indore\",\"hotel_name\":\"Ramada Encore by Wyndham Indore Nipania\",\"room_type\":\"Deluxe Twin Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":3,\"check_out\":\"10\\/08\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"13304\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not incl