Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"22\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":26914,\"transport_cost\":\"15000\",\"travel_insurance\":\"1100\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":43014,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 9463.08\",\"selling_price\":52477.08}', 'MZQ/0856/082026', 52480, 26240, 0, '2026-08-03 18:43:01', '2026-08-05 13:11:23', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(872, 'MR AKRAM ANSARI', 'BNI J', '8018132259', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'CHINA', '2026-10-17', 8, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival in Beijing | Forbidden City\",\"date\":\"17-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"318\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">Beijing International Airport<\\/strong> at <strong data-end=\\\"335\\\" data-start=\\\"322\\\">07:40 hrs<\\/strong>, meet your local representative and transfer to the city. Begin your China holiday with a visit to the magnificent <strong data-end=\\\"469\\\" data-start=\\\"451\\\">Forbidden City<\\/strong>, the former imperial palace of the Ming and Qing Dynasties and one of the world\'s most iconic historical landmarks. Later, proceed to the hotel for check-in. Spend the evening at leisure and relax after your journey.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"717\\\" data-start=\\\"687\\\">Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Mutianyu Great Wall of China\",\"date\":\"18-10-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to the <strong data-end=\\\"856\\\" data-start=\\\"824\\\">Mutianyu Great Wall of China<\\/strong>, one of the most scenic and well-preserved sections of the Great Wall. Enjoy breathtaking mountain views while exploring this UNESCO World Heritage Site and experience the thrilling <strong data-end=\\\"1057\\\" data-start=\\\"1039\\\">Toboggan Slide<\\/strong> on your descent. Return to Beijing in the evening.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1139\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\">Overnight stay in Beijing.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"19th Oct \\u2013 Beijing \\u2013 Zhangjiajie (Morning Flight) | Glass Bridge & Furong Ancient Town\",\"date\":\"19-10-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After an early breakfast, transfer to Beijing Airport to board your morning flight to Zhangjiajie. Upon arrival, visit the world-famous <strong data-end=\\\"1408\\\" data-start=\\\"1380\\\">Zhangjiajie Glass Bridge<\\/strong>, suspended high above a spectacular canyon offering breathtaking panoramic views. Later, continue to the picturesque <strong data-end=\\\"1549\\\" data-start=\\\"1526\\\">Furong Ancient Town<\\/strong>, a charming riverside village renowned for its ancient architecture and stunning waterfall. After sightseeing, check in to the hotel.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"1718\\\" data-start=\\\"1684\\\">Overnight stay in Zhangjiajie.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Zhangjiajie National Forest Park\",\"date\":\"20-10-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>Following breakfast, enjoy a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"1867\\\" data-start=\\\"1831\\\">Zhangjiajie National Forest Park<\\/strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site renowned for its towering sandstone pillars that inspired the floating mountains in the movie <em data-end=\\\"2000\\\" data-start=\\\"1992\\\">Avatar<\\/em>. Visit the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"2044\\\" data-start=\\\"2024\\\">Avatar Mountains<\\/strong> and experience the world\'s tallest outdoor <strong data-end=\\\"2108\\\" data-start=\\\"2088\\\">Bailong Elevator<\\/strong>, offering incredible panoramic views of this natural wonder. Return to the hotel.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"2225\\\" data-start=\\\"2191\\\">Overnight stay in Zhangjiajie.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Zhangjiajie \\u2013 Chongqing (Morning High-Speed Train)\",\"date\":\"21-10-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2370\\\" data-start=\\\"2334\\\">Zhangjiajie West Railway Station<\\/strong> to board the morning high-speed train to <strong data-end=\\\"2430\\\" data-start=\\\"2412\\\">Chongqing East<\\/strong>. Upon arrival, visit the famous <strong data-end=\\\"2481\\\" data-start=\\\"2463\\\">Liziba Station<\\/strong>, where the monorail remarkably passes through a residential building, followed by the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"2599\\\" data-start=\\\"2575\\\">Multi-Level Building<\\/strong>. Later, explore the vibrant <strong data-end=\\\"2643\\\" data-start=\\\"2628\\\">Hongya Cave<\\/strong>, known for its traditional stilt architecture and lively atmosphere. In the evening, enjoy a scenic <strong data-end=\\\"2771\\\" data-start=\\\"2744\\\">Two Rivers Night Cruise<\\/strong>, offering spectacular views of Chongqing\'s dazzling skyline.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"2865\\\" data-start=\\\"2833\\\">Overnight stay in Chongqing.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Chongqing \\u2013 Shanghai\",\"date\":\"22-10-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, transfer to Chongqing Airport to board your flight to Shanghai. Upon arrival, transfer to the hotel and check in. The remainder of the day is at leisure for shopping, relaxation, or exploring the city at your own pace.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"3182\\\" data-start=\\\"3151\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shanghai Disneyland\",\"date\":\"23-10-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, spend a magical full day at <strong data-end=\\\"3299\\\" data-start=\\\"3276\\\">Shanghai Disneyland<\\/strong>, enjoying world-class attractions, immersive themed lands, thrilling rides, spectacular parades, and live entertainment. In the evening, witness the enchanting <strong data-end=\\\"3497\\\" data-start=\\\"3460\\\">Illuminate! Nighttime Castle Show<\\/strong>, featuring dazzling projections, music, lights, and fireworks, making your Disney experience truly unforgettable.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"3643\\\" data-start=\\\"3612\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Shanghai City Tour\",\"date\":\"24-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, explore the highlights of Shanghai with a visit to the iconic <strong data-end=\\\"3782\\\" data-start=\\\"3770\\\">The Bund<\\/strong>, offering stunning views of the city\'s historic waterfront and modern skyline. Continue with a leisurely walk along the famous <strong data-end=\\\"3926\\\" data-start=\\\"3910\\\">Nanjing Road<\\/strong>, one of China\'s premier shopping streets, followed by a relaxing <strong data-end=\\\"4016\\\" data-start=\\\"3992\\\">Huangpu River Cruise<\\/strong>, showcasing Shanghai\'s spectacular skyline from the water.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8&nbsp;<strong data-end=\\\"4107\\\" data-start=\\\"4076\\\">Overnight stay in Shanghai.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":9,\"index\":8,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Departure\",\"date\":\"25-10-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p>In the early morning, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"4250\\\" data-start=\\\"4209\\\">Shanghai Pudong International Airport<\\/strong> to board your return flight to <strong data-end=\\\"4293\\\" data-start=\\\"4282\\\">Kolkata<\\/strong>, bringing home unforgettable memories of your incredible journey through China.<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Beijing (PEK)\",\"name\":\"Air China\",\"fno\":\"CA 948\",\"dep_date\":\"16 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"10:50 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Oct 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"07:40 AM\",\"fare\":\"54880\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Beijing (PEK)\",\"to\":\"Zhangjiajie (DYG)\",\"name\":\"Air China\",\"fno\":\"CA 9659\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:00 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Oct 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"09:35 AM\",\"fare\":\"45030\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Zhangjiajie West\",\"to\":