 hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, closure of / entry restrictions at a place of visit, etc. While we will do our best to make suitable alternate arrangements, we would not be held liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', NULL, '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"10\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":204405,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":70004},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":274409,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 27440.9\",\"selling_price\":301849.9,\"profit_figure\":null,\"percent_of_amount\":\"49.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0857/082026', 224844, 112422, 0, '2026-08-05 12:49:10', '2026-08-05 17:08:32', 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
INSERT INTO `quotation` (`id`, `guest_name`, `ref_name`, `mobile_no`, `email`, `destination`, `tentative_date`, `nights`, `children`, `adults`, `itineraries`, `flights`, `trains`, `hotels`, `terms_conditions`, `children_ages`, `inclusion`, `exclusion`, `payment_policy`, `cancellation_policy`, `costing`, `ref_id`, `total`, `adult_cost`, `child_cost`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `is_confirmed`, `hide_note`, `other_details`, `is_feedback_sent`, `is_feedback_received`) VALUES
(874, 'Mr Dilip', 'RANJEET BHAIYA HAZARIBAGH', '9031671085', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Thailand', '2026-09-08', 6, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok \\u2013 Pattaya & Alcazar Show\",\"date\":\"08-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"328\\\" data-start=\\\"116\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"159\\\" data-start=\\\"126\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport, Bangkok<\\/strong> and proceed by private transfer to Pattaya. Check in to the hotel and, in the evening, enjoy the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"293\\\" data-start=\\\"269\\\">Alcazar Cabaret Show<\\/strong> with private round-trip transfers.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"388\\\" data-start=\\\"330\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"362\\\" data-start=\\\"333\\\">Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Coral Island Tour\",\"date\":\"09-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"627\\\" data-start=\\\"434\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day <strong data-end=\\\"509\\\" data-start=\\\"474\\\">Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat<\\/strong>. Enjoy the beautiful beaches, turquoise waters and leisure time on the island. <strong data-end=\\\"610\\\" data-start=\\\"589\\\">Lunch is included<\\/strong> during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"696\\\" data-start=\\\"629\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"661\\\" data-start=\\\"632\\\">Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"664\\\" data-start=\\\"661\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"696\\\" data-start=\\\"668\\\">Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Tiger Park Pattaya\",\"date\":\"10-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"938\\\" data-start=\\\"743\\\">After breakfast, visit <strong data-end=\\\"788\\\" data-start=\\\"766\\\">Tiger Park Pattaya<\\/strong> for a close-up experience with a <strong data-end=\\\"847\\\" data-start=\\\"822\\\">Medium or Small Tiger<\\/strong>, under professional supervision. Private round-trip transfers from the hotel are included.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"998\\\" data-start=\\\"940\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"972\\\" data-start=\\\"943\\\">Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"975\\\" data-start=\\\"972\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"998\\\" data-start=\\\"979\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya at Leisure\",\"date\":\"11-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"227\\\" data-start=\\\"34\\\">After breakfast, enjoy a <strong data-end=\\\"93\\\" data-start=\\\"59\\\">full day at leisure in Pattaya<\\/strong>. Relax at the hotel, explore the nearby beaches, shopping areas and local attractions, or enjoy optional activities at your own cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"287\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"229\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"261\\\" data-start=\\\"232\\\">Overnight Stay in Pattaya<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"264\\\" data-start=\\\"261\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"287\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"268\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pattaya \\u2013 Bangkok & Evening Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise\",\"date\":\"12-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1217\\\" data-start=\\\"1044\\\">After breakfast, check out from the Pattaya hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1140\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\">Bangkok by private transfer<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in to the hotel and spend the rest of the day at leisure.<br \\/>\\nIn the evening, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"1795\\\" data-start=\\\"1757\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong> and enjoy a buffet dinner with live music and entertainment while cruising along the Chao Phraya River.<br \\/>\\n<br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1251\\\" data-start=\\\"1222\\\">Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1254\\\" data-start=\\\"1251\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1277\\\" data-start=\\\"1258\\\">Meal: Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Full Day Safari World & Marine Park\",\"date\":\"13-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1542\\\" data-start=\\\"1341\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day excursion to <strong data-end=\\\"1424\\\" data-start=\\\"1394\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>. Enjoy the Safari Park, Marine Park and exciting wildlife shows. <strong data-end=\\\"1513\\\" data-start=\\\"1490\\\">Indian buffet lunch<\\/strong> is included during the tour.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1611\\\" data-start=\\\"1544\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1576\\\" data-start=\\\"1547\\\">Overnight Stay in Bangkok<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1579\\\" data-start=\\\"1576\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1611\\\" data-start=\\\"1583\\\">Meals: Breakfast &amp; Lunch<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Bangkok Departure\",\"date\":\"14-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2147\\\" data-start=\\\"2015\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed by <strong data-end=\\\"2122\\\" data-start=\\\"2072\\\">private transfer to Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2172\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2149\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2172\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2153\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Kolkata (CCU)\",\"to\":\"BANGKOK (BKK)\",\"name\":\"Thai Vietjet Air\",\"fno\":\"VZ-771\",\"dep_dat