liable for any refunds/compensation claims arising out of this.</li><li>In case a flight gets cancelled, Multi Zone Travels will not be liable to provide any alternate flights within the same cost, any additional cost incurred for the same shall be borne by the traveller.</li><li>For more details click <a href=\'https://res.cloudinary.com/anilsam90/image/upload/v1534070888/terms.pdf\' target=\'_blank\'>here</a></li>', '[]', '<p data-end=\"79\" data-start=\"31\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"45\" data-start=\"34\">Airfare</strong><br data-end=\"48\" data-start=\"45\" />\n• Return Airfare <strong data-end=\"79\" data-start=\"65\">Ex-Kolkata&nbsp;</strong><br />\n<strong data-end=\"79\" data-start=\"65\">&nbsp; </strong><strong data-end=\"79\" data-start=\"65\">(2 Tickets without Baggage &amp; 1 Ticket with 20 Kgs Baggage)</strong><br />\n<br />\n🏨 <strong data-end=\"101\" data-start=\"84\">Accommodation</strong><br data-end=\"104\" data-start=\"101\" />\n• 04 Nights Accommodation in Pattaya – <strong data-end=\"155\" data-start=\"143\">02 Rooms</strong><br data-end=\"158\" data-start=\"155\" />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in Bangkok – <strong data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"197\">02 Rooms</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"395\" data-start=\"211\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"224\" data-start=\"215\">Meals</strong><br data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"224\" />\n• Daily Breakfast at All Hotels<br data-end=\"261\" data-start=\"258\" />\n• Lunch during Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat<br data-end=\"310\" data-start=\"307\" />\n• Dinner during Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise<br data-end=\"354\" data-start=\"351\" />\n• Lunch during Safari World &amp; Marine Park</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"397\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"421\" data-start=\"400\">Private Transfers</strong><br data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"421\" />\n• DMK Airport ➝ Pattaya Hotel – <strong data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"456\">Private Transfer</strong><br data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"476\" />\n• Pattaya Hotel ➝ Bangkok Hotel – <strong data-end=\"533\" data-start=\"513\">Private Transfer</strong><br data-end=\"536\" data-start=\"533\" />\n• Bangkok Hotel ➝ Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK) – <strong data-end=\"603\" data-start=\"583\">Private Transfer</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"605\">🎟️ <strong data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"609\">Sightseeing &amp; Activities on SIC Basis</strong><br data-end=\"653\" data-start=\"650\" />\n• Alcazar Cabaret Show<br data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"675\" />\n• Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat<br data-end=\"714\" data-start=\"711\" />\n• Tiger Park – Medium or Small Tiger Entry<br data-end=\"759\" data-start=\"756\" />\n• Chao Phraya Dinner Cruise<br data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"786\" />\n• Safari World &amp; Marine Park<br data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"817\" />\n• All Sightseeing &amp; Activities as Mentioned in the Itinerary</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"882\">📋 <strong data-end=\"908\" data-start=\"885\">Additional Benefits</strong><br data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"908\" />\n• Arrival &amp; Departure Assistance<br data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"943\" />\n• All Applicable Taxes &amp; Service Charges Included</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":null,\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":67148,\"land_cost\":\"45400\",\"hotel_cost\":37826},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":150374,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 19104\",\"selling_price\":168174,\"profit_figure\":\"17800\",\"percent_of_amount\":\"11.00%\"}', 'MZQ/0859/082026', 177000, 59000, 0, '2026-08-13 18:21:56', '2026-08-24 17:16:36', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(875, 'Dr. Garima Singh', 'Delhi', '9936190006', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KAZAKHSTAN', '2026-09-13', 6, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Sunday\",\"day\":\"Day 1\",\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Almaty\",\"date\":\"13-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>Welcome to Almaty, Kazakhstan! Upon arrival, complete immigration and baggage formalities. Meet your driver at the arrivals hall and proceed to the hotel. Check in and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Almaty<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Monday\",\"day\":\"Day 2\",\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Almaty City Tour & Kok Tobe\",\"date\":\"14-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an <strong>Almaty City Tour<\\/strong> covering Republic Square, Independence Monument, Panfilov Park, Astana Square, Abai Square, Presidential Park and other major landmarks. Later, visit <strong>Kok Tobe<\\/strong> and enjoy the scenic cable car ride with panoramic city and mountain views.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Almaty<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Tuesday\",\"day\":\"Day 3\",\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Medeo & Shymbulak\",\"date\":\"15-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, drive to <strong>Medeo Gorge<\\/strong>, surrounded by beautiful alpine scenery. Continue by cable car to <strong>Shymbulak Ski Resort<\\/strong> and enjoy spectacular views of the Tian Shan Mountains along with leisure time at the resort.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Almaty<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Wednesday\",\"day\":\"Day 4\",\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Almarasan Gorge\",\"date\":\"16-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for an excursion to <strong>Almarasan Gorge<\\/strong>, a scenic mountain valley known for its lush surroundings, fresh mountain air and natural beauty. Enjoy time amidst nature before returning to Almaty.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Almaty<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Thursday\",\"day\":\"Day 5\",\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Charyn Canyon \\u2013 Kolsai Lakes\",\"date\":\"17-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and proceed towards <strong>Charyn Canyon<\\/strong>, famous for its dramatic cliffs and the spectacular <strong>Valley of Castles<\\/strong>. Later, continue to <strong>Kolsai Lakes<\\/strong>, one of the most beautiful natural attractions of Kazakhstan.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Kolsai<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Friday\",\"day\":\"Day 6\",\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Kolsai \\u2013 Almaty\",\"date\":\"18-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out and proceed back to <strong>Almaty<\\/strong>. On arrival, check in to the hotel and spend the remaining day at leisure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay in Almaty<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Saturday\",\"day\":\"Day 7\",\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Almaty Departure\",\"date\":\"19-09-2026\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, check out from the hotel. Our driver will transfer you to the airport for your onward flight.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong>Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"KC 908\",\"dep_date\":\"13 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"11:35 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"13 Sep 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"fare\":\"144640\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Almaty (ALA)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"Air Astana\",\"fno\":\"KC 907\",\"dep_date\":\"19 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"06:45 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:35 AM\",\"arv_date\":\"19 Sep 2026\",\"fare\":\"00\"}]', '[]', '[{\"id\":0,\"check_in\":\"13\\/09\\/2026\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"city\":\"Almaty\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kazzhol Almaty\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Queen Room with Two Queen Beds\",\"nights\":4,\"check_out\":\"17\\/09\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"55500\"},{\"id\":1,\"check_in\":\"17\\/09\\/2026\",\"city\":\"Kolsay\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kolsai Lake Town\",\"room_type\":\"Standard Room\",\"rooms\":1,\"meal\":\"cp\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"18\\/09\\/2026\",\"rate\":\"00\"},{\"id\":2,\"check_in\":\"18\\/09\\/2026\",\"hotel_name\":\"Hotel Kazzhol Almaty\",\"city\":\"Almaty\",\"room_type\":\"Superior Queen Room with Two Queen Beds\",\"nights\":1,\"check_out\":\"19\\/09\\/2026\",\"meal\":\"cp\",\"rooms\":1,\"rate\":\"14300\"}]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flights, 