(876, 'Mr Rakesh Kumar', 'Shanky', '7004459426', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'KASHMIR', '2026-09-15', 5, 1, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Srinagar \\u2013 Houseboat & Shikara Ride\",\"date\":\"15-09-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"374\\\" data-start=\\\"145\\\">Upon arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"181\\\" data-start=\\\"161\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong>, meet our representative and transfer to the houseboat. After freshening up, enjoy a relaxing <strong data-end=\\\"311\\\" data-start=\\\"276\\\">1-Hour Shikara Ride on Dal Lake<\\/strong>. Later, return to the houseboat for dinner and overnight stay.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"440\\\" data-start=\\\"376\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"398\\\" data-start=\\\"379\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Srinagar Houseboat<br data-end=\\\"420\\\" data-start=\\\"417\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"433\\\" data-start=\\\"424\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar \\u2013 Pahalgam\",\"date\":\"16-09-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"826\\\" data-start=\\\"504\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"544\\\" data-start=\\\"532\\\">Pahalgam<\\/strong>, the beautiful Valley of Shepherds. En route, visit <strong data-end=\\\"656\\\" data-start=\\\"597\\\">Pampore Saffron Fields, Awantipura Ruins, Mattan Temple<\\/strong> and enjoy the scenic countryside. On arrival, explore <strong data-end=\\\"755\\\" data-start=\\\"711\\\">Lidder River, Betaab Valley &amp; Aru Valley<\\/strong>. Union vehicle for Betaab &amp; Aru Valley is on an additional cost basis.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"894\\\" data-start=\\\"828\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"850\\\" data-start=\\\"831\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Pahalgam<br data-end=\\\"862\\\" data-start=\\\"859\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"875\\\" data-start=\\\"866\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Pahalgam \\u2013 Gulmarg\",\"date\":\"17-09-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1202\\\" data-start=\\\"957\\\">After breakfast, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"996\\\" data-start=\\\"985\\\">Gulmarg<\\/strong>, the famous Meadow of Flowers. Enjoy the scenic drive and explore the beautiful surroundings. Optional activities such as <strong data-end=\\\"1164\\\" data-start=\\\"1119\\\">Gondola Ride, Golfing and Drung Waterfall<\\/strong> can be enjoyed at an additional cost.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1269\\\" data-start=\\\"1204\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1226\\\" data-start=\\\"1207\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Gulmarg<br data-end=\\\"1237\\\" data-start=\\\"1234\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1250\\\" data-start=\\\"1241\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gulmarg \\u2013 Srinagar\",\"date\":\"18-09-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1504\\\" data-start=\\\"1332\\\">After breakfast, enjoy the morning in Gulmarg. You may opt for the famous <strong data-end=\\\"1432\\\" data-start=\\\"1406\\\">Gondola Cable Car Ride<\\/strong> at your own cost. Later, proceed to Srinagar and check in to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1572\\\" data-start=\\\"1506\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1528\\\" data-start=\\\"1509\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Srinagar<br data-end=\\\"1540\\\" data-start=\\\"1537\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1553\\\" data-start=\\\"1544\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Local Sightseeing\",\"date\":\"19-09-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1841\\\" data-start=\\\"1643\\\">After breakfast, proceed for <strong data-end=\\\"1702\\\" data-start=\\\"1672\\\">Srinagar Local Sightseeing<\\/strong>, covering the famous Mughal Gardens including <strong data-end=\\\"1810\\\" data-start=\\\"1749\\\">Nishat Garden, Shalimar Garden, Cheshma Shahi, Pari Mahal<\\/strong> and <strong data-end=\\\"1840\\\" data-start=\\\"1815\\\">Shankaracharya Temple<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1909\\\" data-start=\\\"1843\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1865\\\" data-start=\\\"1846\\\">Overnight Stay:<\\/strong> Srinagar<br data-end=\\\"1877\\\" data-start=\\\"1874\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1890\\\" data-start=\\\"1881\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast &amp; Dinner<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Srinagar Departure\",\"date\":\"20-09-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2075\\\" data-start=\\\"1972\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and transfer to <strong data-end=\\\"2050\\\" data-start=\\\"2030\\\">Srinagar Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2100\\\" data-start=\\\"2077\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2090\\\" data-start=\\\"2081\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2148\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2102\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2148\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2105\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Sep 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:20 AM\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"IX 1047\",\"fare\":\"99000\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"to\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Sep 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"02:30 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:00 PM\",\"name\":\"Air India Express\",\"fno\":\"IX 1017\"},{\"id\":3,\"from\":\"Srinagar (SXR)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E 6112\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Sep 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"