(878, 'MR AKRAM ANSARI', 'BNI', '8018132259', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Singapore + Malaysia', '2026-10-14', 7, 0, 2, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore Arrival \\u2013 Night Safari\",\"date\":\"14-10-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"449\\\" data-start=\\\"210\\\">Arrive in Singapore and proceed with the private airport transfer to the hotel. After check-in and some time to relax, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"374\\\" data-start=\\\"345\\\">Night Safari on SIC basis<\\/strong>, including the <strong data-end=\\\"448\\\" data-start=\\\"390\\\">Tram Ride, Animal Show and Thumbuakar Fire Performance<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"509\\\" data-start=\\\"451\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"483\\\" data-start=\\\"454\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"486\\\" data-start=\\\"483\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"499\\\" data-start=\\\"490\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gardens by the Bay & Sands SkyPark\",\"date\":\"15-10-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"898\\\" data-start=\\\"597\\\">After breakfast, visit <strong data-end=\\\"659\\\" data-start=\\\"620\\\">Gardens by the Bay \\u2013 Floral Fantasy<\\/strong>. Later, proceed on a <strong data-end=\\\"698\\\" data-start=\\\"681\\\">private basis<\\/strong> for <strong data-end=\\\"741\\\" data-start=\\\"703\\\">Gardens by the Bay &amp; Sands SkyPark<\\/strong>, including <strong data-end=\\\"853\\\" data-start=\\\"753\\\">Cloud Forest with Jurassic World: The Experience, Flower Dome and Sands SkyPark Observation Deck<\\/strong>.<br \\/>\\nThe SkyPark visit should be before 4:00 PM.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"958\\\" data-start=\\\"900\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"932\\\" data-start=\\\"903\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"935\\\" data-start=\\\"932\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"948\\\" data-start=\\\"939\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore Oceanarium, ArtScience Museum & Harry Potter\",\"date\":\"16-10-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1273\\\" data-start=\\\"1066\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1130\\\" data-start=\\\"1106\\\">Singapore Oceanarium<\\/strong>. Later, explore <strong data-end=\\\"1183\\\" data-start=\\\"1147\\\">ArtScience Museum \\u2013 Future World<\\/strong> and enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1225\\\" data-start=\\\"1198\\\">Harry Potter experience<\\/strong> with the included admission ticket and voucher.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1333\\\" data-start=\\\"1275\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1307\\\" data-start=\\\"1278\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1310\\\" data-start=\\\"1307\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1323\\\" data-start=\\\"1314\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios Singapore\",\"date\":\"17-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1603\\\" data-start=\\\"1414\\\">After breakfast, proceed on <strong data-end=\\\"1486\\\" data-start=\\\"1442\\\">SIC basis to Universal Studios Singapore<\\/strong>. Enjoy a full day of thrilling rides, themed attractions and entertainment with the included <strong data-end=\\\"1602\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\">Basic Express Pass<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1663\\\" data-start=\\\"1605\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1637\\\" data-start=\\\"1608\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1640\\\" data-start=\\\"1637\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1653\\\" data-start=\\\"1644\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Merlion City Drive Singapore \\u2013 Genting Dream Cruise\",\"date\":\"18-10-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2004\\\" data-start=\\\"1759\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"1856\\\" data-start=\\\"1821\\\">Merlion City Drive on SIC basis<\\/strong>, covering major landmarks including <strong data-end=\\\"2003\\\" data-start=\\\"1893\\\">Merlion, Singapore Flyer, Chinatown, Civic District, Orchard Road, Suntec City, Helix Bridge and Esplanade<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2099\\\" data-start=\\\"2006\\\">Later, proceed towards Malaysia via <strong data-end=\\\"2059\\\" data-start=\\\"2042\\\">Genting Dream<\\/strong> as per the planned travel arrangements.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2167\\\" data-start=\\\"2101\\\">\\ud83d\\udea2 <strong data-end=\\\"557\\\" data-start=\\\"546\\\">Cruise:<\\/strong> Genting Dream RWC<br data-end=\\\"578\\\" data-start=\\\"575\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udcc5 <strong data-end=\\\"598\\\" data-start=\\\"581\\\">Sailing Date:<\\/strong> 18 Oct 2026<br data-end=\\\"613\\\" data-start=\\\"610\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf19 <strong data-end=\\\"629\\\" data-start=\\\"616\\\">Duration:<\\/strong> 01 Night<br data-end=\\\"641\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83d\\udd57 <strong data-end=\\\"658\\\" data-start=\\\"644\\\">Departure:<\\/strong> Singapore \\u2013 20:00 hrs<br data-end=\\\"683\\\" data-start=\\\"680\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"700\\\" data-start=\\\"686\\\">Overnight:<\\/strong> Genting Dream Cruise<\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Port Klang \\u2013 Kuala Lumpur\",\"date\":\"19-10-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"218\\\" data-start=\\\"77\\\">Arrive at <strong data-end=\\\"124\\\" data-start=\\\"87\\\">Port Klang, Malaysia at 08:00 hrs<\\/strong> and complete the disembarkation formalities. Proceed by <strong data-end=\\\"217\\\" data-start=\\\"181\\\">private transfer to Kuala Lumpur<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"654\\\" data-start=\