\"432\" data-start=\"409\">Additional Benefits</strong><br data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"432\" />\n• All Transfers as Mentioned Above<br data-end=\"472\" data-start=\"469\" />\n• All Applicable Taxes &amp; Service Charges Included</p>', '<li>Any kind of personal expenses.</li><li>Tips, Insurance, Laundry, Phone Calls, Guide Fee & Camera Fee.</li><li>Anything not mentioned in the inclusions above.</li>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"15\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":57800,\"land_cost\":null,\"hotel_cost\":58200,\"transport_cost\":\"7000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":123000,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 18450\",\"selling_price\":141450}', 'MZQ/0864/082026', 141460, 70730, 0, '2026-08-18 12:48:18', '2026-08-18 13:34:57', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0),
(880, 'Mr Bob Minz', NULL, '9431107071', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Singapore', '2026-10-15', 5, 0, 3, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Arrival Singapore \\u2013 Night Safari\",\"date\":\"15-10-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"444\\\" data-start=\\\"197\\\">Arrive in Singapore and meet our representative at the airport. Proceed to the hotel by <strong data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"285\\\">private airport transfer<\\/strong> and complete check-in. In the evening, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"398\\\" data-start=\\\"369\\\">Night Safari on SIC basis<\\/strong>, including the <strong data-end=\\\"443\\\" data-start=\\\"414\\\">Tram Ride and Animal Show<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"504\\\" data-start=\\\"446\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"478\\\" data-start=\\\"449\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"481\\\" data-start=\\\"478\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"494\\\" data-start=\\\"485\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Merlion City Drive & Singapore River Cruise\",\"date\":\"16-10-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for the Merlion City Drive on SIC basis, covering Singapore\'s major landmarks including Chinatown, Civic District, Orchard Road, Suntec City, Helix Bridge, Esplanade, Singapore Flyer and Merlion, along with designated photo stops.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>Later, enjoy a Singapore River Cruise on Private Basis, offering scenic views of Singapore\'s iconic riverside landmarks.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f<strong> Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Sentosa Island \\u2013 Cable Car, SkyHelix & Wings of Time\",\"date\":\"17-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1398\\\" data-start=\\\"1156\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"1221\\\" data-start=\\\"1189\\\">Sentosa Starter on SIC basis<\\/strong>. Enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1258\\\" data-start=\\\"1233\\\">Mount Faber Cable Car<\\/strong> ride followed by the spectacular <strong data-end=\\\"1314\\\" data-start=\\\"1292\\\">Wings of Time Show<\\/strong> at 7:40 PM. Also experience <strong data-end=\\\"1363\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\">SkyHelix Sentosa<\\/strong> for panoramic views of the island.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1458\\\" data-start=\\\"1400\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1432\\\" data-start=\\\"1403\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1435\\\" data-start=\\\"1432\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1448\\\" data-start=\\\"1439\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Universal Studios & Singapore Oceanarium\",\"date\":\"18-10-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1754\\\" data-start=\\\"1552\\\">After breakfast, proceed on <strong data-end=\\\"1650\\\" data-start=\\\"1580\\\">SIC basis for Universal Studios Singapore and Singapore Oceanarium<\\/strong>. Spend the day enjoying thrilling rides, themed attractions and exploring the fascinating marine world.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1814\\\" data-start=\\\"1756\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1788\\\" data-start=\\\"1759\\\">Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1791\\\" data-start=\\\"1788\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1804\\\" data-start=\\\"1795\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Gardens by the Bay & Sands SkyPark\",\"date\":\"19-10-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p>After breakfast, proceed for Gardens by the Bay &amp; Sands SkyPark on SIC basis. Explore the Cloud Forest featuring Jurassic World: The Experience and Flower Dome, followed by the Sands SkyPark Observation Deck. The SkyPark visit should be before 4:00 PM.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p>\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong>Overnight Stay: Singapore<\\/strong><br \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong>Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"Singapore Departure\",\"date\":\"20-10-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2446\\\" data-start=\\\"2303\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel. At the scheduled time, proceed by <strong data-end=\\\"2421\\\" data-start=\\\"2380\\\">private transfer to Singapore Airport<\\/strong> for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2471\\\" data-start=\\\"2448\\\">\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2461\\\" data-start=\\\"2452\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> <strong>Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2519\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2473\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2519\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2476\\\">Tour Concludes with Wonderful Memories.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"to\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"fno\":\"6E-209\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"dep_date\":\"14 Oct 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"14 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"07:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"09:50 PM\",\"fare\":\"63600\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"from\":\"Chennai (MAA)\",\"to\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"fno\":\"6E-1025\",\"dep_date\":\"15 Oct 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"15 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"03:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"10:10 AM\",\"fare\":\"00\"},{\"id\":3,\"arv_date\":\"20 Oct 2026\",\"dep_date\":\"20 Oct 2026\",\"from\":\"Singapore (SIN)\",\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fare\":\"71900\",\"fno\":\"6E-1014\",\"dep_time\":\"07:45 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:05 PM\"},{\"id\":4,\"fare\":\"00\",\"arv_date\":\"21 Oct 2026\",\"dep_date\":\"21 Oct 2026\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"from\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"6E-2614\",\"dep_time\":\"02:40 PM\",\"arv_time\":\"04:35 PM\"}]', '[]'