-end=\\\"2439\\\" data-start=\\\"2403\\\">Delhi sightseeing \\/ leisure time<\\/strong> or directly to the airport\\/railway station for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2575\\\" data-start=\\\"2509\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2549\\\" data-start=\\\"2512\\\">Tour Ends with Wonderful Memories<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2552\\\" data-start=\\\"2549\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2565\\\" data-start=\\\"2556\\\">Meal:<\\/strong> Breakfast<\\/p>\"}]', '[{\"id\":1,\"to\":\"Delhi (DEL)\",\"from\":\"Ranchi (IXR)\",\"fare\":\"36100\",\"name\":\"IndiGo\",\"fno\":\"2370\",\"dep_date\":\"17 Oct 2026\",\"arv_date\":\"17 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"09:10 AM\",\"arv_time\":\"11:10 AM\"},{\"id\":2,\"from\":\"Delhi (NDLS)\",\"to\":\"Ranchi (RNC)\",\"name\":\"Rnc Rajdhani\",\"fno\":\"12454\",\"dep_date\":\"24 Oct 2026\",\"dep_time\":\"04:10 PM\",\"arv_date\":\"25 Oct 2026\",\"arv_time\":\"09:45 AM\",\"fare\":\"12000\"}]', '[]', '[]', '<li>Airline seats/fare and hotel rooms are subject to availability at the time of confirmation.</li><li>In case of unavailability in the listed hotels, arrangement for an alternate accommodation will be made in a hotel of similar standard.</li><li>There will be no refund for unused nights or early check-out (In case of Medical condition it completely depends on hotel policy).</li><li>Check-in and check-out times at hotels would be as per hotel policies. Early check-in or late check-out is subject to availability and may be chargeable by the hotel.</li><li>The price does not include expenses of personal nature, such as laundry, telephone calls, room service, alcoholic beverages, mini bar charges, tips, portage, camera fees etc.</li><li>Multi Zone Travels reserves the right to modify the itinerary at any point, due to reasons including but not limited to: Force Majeure events, strikes, fairs, festivals, weather conditions, traffic problems, overbooking of hotels / flights, cancellation / re-routing of flig