(884, 'Mr Uttam Goldar', 'BNI C', '8210840187', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Thailand', '2026-09-22', 7, 0, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ARRIVAL PHUKET\",\"date\":\"22-09-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"154\\\" data-start=\\\"42\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"91\\\" data-start=\\\"53\\\">Phuket International Airport (HKT)<\\/strong> and transfer to the hotel. Check-in and relax for the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"211\\\" data-start=\\\"156\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"185\\\" data-start=\\\"159\\\">Overnight Stay: Phuket<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"188\\\" data-start=\\\"185\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"211\\\" data-start=\\\"192\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHI PHI & KHAI ISLAND TOUR\",\"date\":\"23-09-2026 Wednesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"429\\\" data-start=\\\"272\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"349\\\" data-start=\\\"305\\\">Phi Phi &amp; Khai Island Tour by Speed Boat<\\/strong> with lunch. Enjoy the beautiful islands and beaches before returning to Phuket.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"494\\\" data-start=\\\"431\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"460\\\" data-start=\\\"434\\\">Overnight Stay: Phuket<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"463\\\" data-start=\\\"460\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"494\\\" data-start=\\\"467\\\">Meal: Breakfast + Lunch<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PHUKET \\u2192 KRABI | CITY TOUR EN ROUTE\",\"date\":\"24-09-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"734\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">After breakfast, check out and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"620\\\" data-start=\\\"611\\\">Krabi<\\/strong>. En route, enjoy <strong data-end=\\\"688\\\" data-start=\\\"638\\\">Wat Chalong, Karon View Point and Gems Gallery<\\/strong>. Continue to Krabi and check in at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"790\\\" data-start=\\\"736\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"764\\\" data-start=\\\"739\\\">Overnight Stay: Krabi<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"767\\\" data-start=\\\"764\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"790\\\" data-start=\\\"771\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":4,\"index\":3,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KRABI 4 ISLAND TOUR\",\"date\":\"25-09-2026 Friday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1018\\\" data-start=\\\"844\\\">After breakfast, proceed for the <strong data-end=\\\"914\\\" data-start=\\\"877\\\">Krabi 4 Island Tour by Speed Boat<\\/strong> with lunch. Enjoy the beautiful islands, beaches and surrounding scenery before returning to the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1082\\\" data-start=\\\"1020\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1048\\\" data-start=\\\"1023\\\">Overnight Stay: Krabi<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1051\\\" data-start=\\\"1048\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1082\\\" data-start=\\\"1055\\\">Meal: Breakfast + Lunch<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":5,\"index\":4,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"KRABI \\u2192 BANGKOK \\u2192 PATTAYA\",\"date\":\"26-09-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1338\\\" data-start=\\\"1142\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to the airport for your flight to <strong data-end=\\\"1241\\\" data-start=\\\"1230\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. On arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"1287\\\" data-start=\\\"1257\\\">Suvarnabhumi Airport (BKK)<\\/strong>, proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1311\\\" data-start=\\\"1300\\\">Pattaya<\\/strong> and check in at the hotel.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1340\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1370\\\" data-start=\\\"1343\\\">Overnight Stay: Pattaya<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1373\\\" data-start=\\\"1370\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1396\\\" data-start=\\\"1377\\\">Meal: Breakfast<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"PATTAYA \\u2013 CORAL ISLAND \\u2192 BANGKOK & DINNER CRUISE\",\"date\":\"27-09-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1685\\\" data-start=\\\"1479\\\">After breakfast, proceed for <strong data-end=\\\"1543\\\" data-start=\\\"1508\\\">Coral Island Tour by Speed Boat<\\/strong> with lunch. Later, return to Pattaya, check out and proceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1618\\\" data-start=\\\"1607\\\">Bangkok<\\/strong>. In the evening, enjoy the <strong data-end=\\\"1684\\\" data-start=\\\"1646\\\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1760\\\" data-start=\\\"1687\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1717\\\" data-start=\\\"1690\\\">Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1720\\\" data-start=\\\"1717\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1760\\\" data-start=\\\"1724\\\">Meal: Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":7,\"index\":6,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANGKOK \\u2013 SAFARI WORLD\",\"date\":\"28-09-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"1989\\\" data-start=\\\"1817\\\">After breakfast, proceed for a full-day visit to <strong data-end=\\\"1896\\\" data-start=\\\"1866\\\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park<\\/strong>. Enjoy the wildlife attractions and live shows before returning to the hotel in the evening.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2055\\\" data-start=\\\"1991\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"2021\\\" data-start=\\\"1994\\\">Overnight Stay: Bangkok<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2024\\\" data-start=\\\"2021\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2055\\\" data-start=\\\"2028\\\">Meal: Breakfast + Lunch<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":8,\"index\":7,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"BANGKOK DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"29-09-2026 Tuesday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2218\\\" data-start=\\\"2107\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed to <strong data-end=