data-end=\"72\" data-start=\"25\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"39\" data-start=\"28\">Airfare</strong><br data-end=\"42\" data-start=\"39\" />\n• Return Airfare <strong data-end=\"72\" data-start=\"59\">Ex-Ranchi</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"74\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"94\" data-start=\"77\">Accommodation</strong><br data-end=\"97\" data-start=\"94\" />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in <strong data-end=\"136\" data-start=\"126\">Phuket</strong><br data-end=\"139\" data-start=\"136\" />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in <strong data-end=\"177\" data-start=\"168\">Krabi</strong><br data-end=\"180\" data-start=\"177\" />\n• 01 Night Accommodation in <strong data-end=\"219\" data-start=\"208\">Pattaya</strong><br data-end=\"222\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"219\" />\n• 02 Nights Accommodation in <strong data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"251\">Bangkok</strong><br data-end=\"265\" data-start=\"262\" />\n• Accommodation in selected room categories as per the package</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"329\">🍽️ <strong data-end=\"342\" data-start=\"333\">Meals</strong><br data-end=\"345\" data-start=\"342\" />\n• Daily Breakfast at all hotels<br data-end=\"379\" data-start=\"376\" />\n• Lunch during <strong data-end=\"424\" data-start=\"394\">Phi Phi &amp; Khai Island Tour</strong><br data-end=\"427\" data-start=\"424\" />\n• Lunch during <strong data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"442\">Krabi 4 Island Tour</strong><br data-end=\"468\" data-start=\"465\" />\n• Lunch during <strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"483\">Coral Island Tour</strong><br data-end=\"507\" data-start=\"504\" />\n• Lunch during <strong data-end=\"552\" data-start=\"522\">Safari World &amp; Marine Park</strong><br data-end=\"555\" data-start=\"552\" />\n• Dinner during <strong data-end=\"609\" data-start=\"571\">Chao Phraya Princess Dinner Cruise</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1023\" data-start=\"611\">🚐 <strong data-end=\"635\" data-start=\"614\">Private Transfers</strong><br data-end=\"638\" data