(886, 'Mr Ravi Ranjan Kumar', 'Indian Post', '8210154767', 'info@multizonetravels.com', 'Kerala', '2026-10-17', 5, 3, 6, '[{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":1,\"index\":0,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COCHIN ARRIVAL & LOCAL SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"17-10-2026 Saturday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"288\\\" data-start=\\\"62\\\">Arrival at <strong data-end=\\\"119\\\" data-start=\\\"73\\\">Cochin Airport \\/ Ernakulam Railway Station<\\/strong> and transfer to the hotel. Later, proceed for local sightseeing covering <strong data-end=\\\"287\\\" data-start=\\\"193\\\">Dutch Palace, Jewish Synagogue, Jewish Street, St. Francis Church and Chinese Fishing Nets<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"345\\\" data-start=\\\"290\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"319\\\" data-start=\\\"293\\\">Overnight Stay: Cochin<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"322\\\" data-start=\\\"319\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"345\\\" data-start=\\\"326\\\">Meal: <\\/strong><strong>Breakfast + Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":2,\"index\":1,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"COCHIN \\u2192 MUNNAR\",\"date\":\"18-10-2026 Sunday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"562\\\" data-start=\\\"390\\\">After breakfast, check out from the hotel and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"462\\\" data-start=\\\"452\\\">Munnar<\\/strong>. Enjoy the scenic journey through the beautiful Kerala countryside. On arrival, check in and relax.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"619\\\" data-start=\\\"564\\\">\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"593\\\" data-start=\\\"567\\\">Overnight Stay: Munnar<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"596\\\" data-start=\\\"593\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"619\\\" data-start=\\\"600\\\">Meal: <\\/strong><strong>Breakfast + Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":3,\"index\":2,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"MUNNAR FULL-DAY SIGHTSEEING\",\"date\":\"19-10-2026 Monday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"899\\\" data-start=\\\"676\\\">After breakfast, proceed for