ceed to <strong data-end=\\\"1547\\\" data-start=\\\"1535\\\">Alleppey<\\/strong>. Board the houseboat at <strong data-end=\\\"1585\\\" data-start=\\\"1572\\\">13:00 hrs<\\/strong> and enjoy a scenic backwater cruise through paddy fields, coconut groves, villages and waterways.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1808\\\" data-start=\\\"1685\\\">\\ud83d\\udef6 <strong data-end=\\\"1711\\\" data-start=\\\"1688\\\">Houseboat Check-in:<\\/strong> 01:00 PM<br data-end=\\\"1723\\\" data-start=\\\"1720\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udfe8 <strong data-end=\\\"1764\\\" data-start=\\\"1726\\\">Overnight Stay: Alleppey Houseboat<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"1767\\\" data-start=\\\"1764\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"1808\\\" data-start=\\\"1771\\\">Meals: Breakfast + Lunch + Dinner<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"1902\\\" data-start=\\\"1810\\\"><em data-end=\\\"1902\\\" data-start=\\\"1810\\\">Houseboat sails from 13:00\\u201317:00 hrs and again from 08:00\\u201309:00 hrs the following morning.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},{\"title\":\"Day\",\"day\":6,\"index\":5,\"image\":null,\"caption\":\"ALLEPPEY \\u2192 COCHIN DEPARTURE\",\"date\":\"22-10-2026 Thursday\",\"todo\":\"<p data-end=\\\"2116\\\" data-start=\\\"1959\\\">After breakfast, check out from the houseboat and proceed towards <strong data-end=\\\"2061\\\" data-start=\\\"2025\\\">Cochin Airport \\/ Railway Station<\\/strong> as per the departure schedule for your onward journey.<\\/p>\\n\\n<p data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-is-only-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2118\\\">\\u2708\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2168\\\" data-start=\\\"2121\\\">Tour Ends with Wonderful Memories of Kerala<\\/strong><br data-end=\\\"2171\\\" data-start=\\\"2168\\\" \\/>\\n\\ud83c\\udf7d\\ufe0f <strong data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2175\\\">Me<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"2175\\\">al<\\/strong><strong data-end=\\\"2194\\\" data-is-last-node=\\\