start=\"548\" />\n• Parking charges</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"678\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"572\">📋 <strong data-end=\"584\" data-start=\"575\">Taxes</strong><br data-end=\"587\" data-start=\"584\" />\n• All presently applicable <strong data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"614\">Government Taxes</strong>, unless specifically mentioned as excluded.</p>', '<p data-end=\"161\" data-start=\"30\">✈️ <strong data-end=\"59\" data-start=\"33\">Travel &amp; Entry Charges</strong><br data-end=\"62\" data-start=\"59\" />\n• Any <strong data-end=\"92\" data-start=\"68\">Airfare / Train Fare</strong><br data-end=\"95\" data-start=\"92\" />\n• Entrance fees and monument charges<br data-end=\"134\" data-start=\"131\" />\n• Tips and porter charges</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"343\" data-start=\"163\">💰 <strong data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"166\">Personal Expenses</strong><br data-end=\"190\" data-start=\"187\" />\n• Personal expenses such as drinks, telephone calls, Ayurveda massage, laundry bills, etc.<br data-end=\"283\" data-start=\"280\" />\n• Any <strong data-end=\"308\" data-start=\"289\">boating charges</strong>, including motor boat / pedal boat</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"345\">⚠️ <strong data-end=\"384\" data-start=\"348\">Unforeseen / Additional Expenses</strong><br data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"384\" />\n• Any additional expenses arising due to <strong data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"428\">flight delays or cancellations</strong><br data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"462\" />\n• Expenses due to adverse <strong data-end=\"573\" data-start=\"491\">weather conditions, political closures, technical faults or natural calamities</strong><br data-end=\"576\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"573\" />\n• Any other expenses arising from circumstances beyond the service provider’s control</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"726\" data-start=\"663\">🏨 <strong data-end=\"682\" data-start=\"666\">Hotel Policy</strong><br data-end=\"685\" data-start=\"682\" />\n• Early check-in / Late check-out charges</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"811\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"728\">📌 <strong data-end=\"740\" data-start=\"731\">NOTE:</strong> Anything <strong data-end=\"798\" data-start=\"750\">not specifically mentioned in the inclusions</strong> is excluded.</p>', NULL, NULL, '{\"profit_percent\":\"18\",\"package\":{\"flight_cost\":0,\"land_cost\":\"0\",\"hotel_cost\":128950,\"transport_cost\":\"52000\"},\"extra\":[],\"cost_price\":180950,\"amount_of_percent\":\"Rs 32571\",\"selling_price\":213521}', 'MZQ/0871/082026', 213780, 25565, 20130, '2026-08-28 11:00:14', '2026-09-01 11:10:15', 0, 1, NULL, 0, 0);
